अंहस्पतिः
;p{0001}<BR>aMhaspatiH — kzayamAsaH. yasminmAse na saMkrAntiH saMkrAntidvayameva vA. saMsapahaspatI mAsAvaDimAsaSca ninditAH.. (pu0 ci0 pf0 16)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकर्मकः
akarmakaH — (DAtuH) [ka] vyApArasamAnADikaraRaPalavAcakaH[^1] (la0 ma0). yaTA vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO[^2] pat-DAturakarmakaH. [Ka] vyApAravyaDikaraRaPalavAcakatvABAvavAn. [ga] vyAkaraRaSAstrIyakarmasaMjYakArTAnanvayyarTaka iti SAbdikA vadanti. (la0 ma0 DA0 5) [Ga] PalAvacCinnavyApAravAcako[^3] DAturakarmaka ityapi kaScidvati. (la0va0) [Na] vyApArADikaraRamAtravfttiPalavAcakEH[^4][^5]. (vAca0)<BR>vyApArADikaraRetarAvftti yatPalaM tadvAcaka ityarTaH. tena gamyAdO Palasya (dvizWatvena) vyApArADikaraRakartfnizwatve'pi nAtivyAptiH. (vE0 sA0 da0 89)<BR>atra aDodeSasaMyogAnukUlavyApArasya pat-DAtvarTatvenADodeSasaMyogarUpaM PalaM tadanukUlavyApAraScEtadvayamekasmin parRe tizWatIti PalavyApArayoH sAmAnADikaraRyaM saMgacCata ityavaDeyam.<BR>atrAvacCinnatvaM ca pUrvoktasAmAnADikaraRyAtmakameveti BAti.<BR>tena gamyAdervyApArADikaraRa- (kartf) vfttiPalavAcitve'pi nAkarmakatvam. (vAca0)<BR>atroktaM hariRA - PalavyApArayorekanizWatAyAmakarmaka iti. ekanizWatAyAmekamAtravfttitAyAmityarTaH. (vAca0)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

