अकारणगुणोत्पन्नगुणत्वम्
akAraRaguRotpannaguRatvam[^1] — kAraRaguRotpannAvfttirguRatvasAkzAdvyApyA[^2][^3] ca yA jAtistAdfSajAtimattvam (di0 gu0). tAdfSajAtistu budDitvasuKatva- SabdatvAdiH.<BR>akAraRaguRotpannaguRAstu budDyAdyazwakaM BAvanA SabdaSceti. ete ca viBuviSezaguRA ityapyucyante. (pa0 mA0) (BA0 pa0 gu0)<BR>kAraRaguRotpannatvaM cAtra svASrayasamavAyisamavetaguRajanyatvam. tadyaTA - svaM pawasya rUpaM tadASrayaH pawaH tasya samavAyI tantuH tatra samaveto guRastanto rUpaM tena janyata iti pawasya rUpaM kAraRaguRotpannaM BavatIti boDyam.<BR>guRatvasAkzAdyApyatvaM[^*] ca saMskAratvAnyaguRatvavyApyAvyApyatve[^+] sati guRatvavyApyatvam. (di0 gu0)<BR>paramamahattvatvAdikamAdAyAtivyAptivAraRAya sAkzAditi padam. (di0 gu0)<BR>anvayastusaMskAratvAnyo yo guRatvavyApyastasyAvyApyatvaM tasminniti. atra saMskAratvAnyeti viSezaRABAve tu BAvanAtvasyaguRatvasAkzAdvyApyatvABAvena BAvanAyA asaMgrahaH syAdatastadviSezaRam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

