अक्षपादः
akzapAdaH[^4] — nyAyasUtrakartA gOtamarziH. sa hi pramARaprameyAdizoqaSapadArTavAdI padArTatattvajYAnAnmokzaM manyate.<BR>atra SrUyate. gOtamo hi svamatadUzakasya vyAsasya muKadarSanaM cakzuzA na kartavyamiti pratijYAya paScAt vyAsena prasAditaH pAde netra prakASya taM dfzwavAn-iti pOrARikI kaTA. atrAnyaducyate - akzapAdapraRIte ca kARAde sAMKyayogayoH. tyAjyaH SrutivirudDorTa iti padmapurARam. (vAca0) atra<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

