अजहत्स्वार्था
ajahatsvArTA[^2] — 1 (lakzaRA) [ka] lakzyatAvacCedakarUpeRa lakzyaSakyoBayaboDikA. yaTA kAkeByo[^3] daDi rakzyatAmityatra kAkapadasya daDyupaGAta ke lakzaRA. (nyA0 vA0) [Ka] yatra vAcyasyApyanvayastatrAjahatI lakzaRA. yaTA CatriRo[^4] gacCantItyAdO. (ta0 dI0 4) [ga] SakyalakzyoBayavfttinA SakyavfttinEva vA rUpeRAnuBAvakatvAdajahasvArTA. yaTA dravyatvAdinA nIlaGawatvAdinA ca Gawapadasya lakzaRA. (Sa0 pra0)<BR>;p{0005}<BR>[Ga] svArTA parityAgena parArTa lakzaRA. [Na] yatra svArTasya viSezyatayA kriyAnvaye praveSaH sA. (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 44). 2 (SaktiH) avayavArTasaMvalita samudAyArTaboDakatvamajahatsvArTatvam. udAharaRaM rAjapuruza iti (la0 ma0 pf0 37) iti vEyAkaraRAH. atredaM boDyam. vEyAkaraRamate vfttirdviDA SaktirvyaYjanA ca. SaktiSca dviDA prasidDAprasidDA ca. prasidDA ca triDA rUQiH yogo yogarUQiSca. AdyodAharaRAni - GawaH pawaH maRiH raTaMtaram (sAma) SuSrUzA (sevA). iyameva jahatsvArTetyucyate. dvitIyodAharaRAni pAcakaH pAWaka ityAdIni. tftIyodAharaRAni paNkajam rAjapuruza ityAdIni. iyamevAjahatsvArTetyucyate. kvacicca tAtparyagrAhakavaSAtkevalarUQyarTasya kevalayogArTasya boDaH. yaTA-aSvaganDAdipadamozaDiviSeze rUQam aSvasaMbanDiganDavattayA vAjiSAlAboDe yOgikam. ata eva yOgikarUQamityucyate. aprasidDA Saktireva nEyAyikAdiBirlakzaReti vyavahriyate. evaM ca vEyAkaraRamate SaktyapekzayA lakzaRAvfttiH pfTaNnAstyeva. vyaYjanA ca dviDA gUQavyaNgayAgUQavyaNgayA ca.<BR>atra vyutpattiH-na jahAti padAni svArTaM yasyAM sA ajahatsvArTA-iti drazwavyA. (vE0 sA0)<BR>atra kAkapadena daDyupaGAtakatvAtmaka lakzyatAvacCedakarUpeRa kAkastaditaramAjIrAdayaSca boDyante. tatra daDyupaGAtakeByo daDirakzaRe tAtparyAt.<BR>pratipAdyasaMbanDa eva lakzaRA-iti mImAMsaka matABiprAyeRedamudAharaRam. tena Catrinnityasya matuvarTakenpratyayAntatayA padasamUharUpatvena[^*] vAkyatvAt tacCakyAprasidDayA SakyasaMbanDarUpalakzaRAyA aBAvepi nEtadudAharaRAsaMgatiH. taTA cAtrEkasArTavAhitvena rUpeRa CatryacCatrizu gamanakartftvAnvayaH. kecittuCatrapada- syEkasArTe lakzaRA. tadDitArTaH saMbanDI. taTA cEkasArTasaMbanDino gacCantItyanvayaboDa ityAhuH. AdinA yazwIH praveSayetyudAharaRaM boDyam. (nIla0)<BR>nEyAyikamate padaSaktyEva nirvAhe vAkyaSaktistalakzaRA ca na svIkriyata iti tAtparyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0004" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

