अनुमानम्
anumAnam — (pramARam) 1 anumitikaraRam (ta0 sa0). anumitikaraRaM dviviDam. tatra praTamaM vyAptijYAnam (gO0 vf0 1. 115). yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdo DUmo vahnivyApyaH iti vyAptijYAnamanumitikaraRaM Bavati (ta0 kO0 10). anumAnaM ca liNgaliNginoH saMbanDadarSanam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 9). tacca sahacArapratyakzeRa janyate (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 5). etasya karaRatvABiDAnaM ca vyApAravadasADAraRaM kAraRaM karaRamiti prAcInamatAnusAreRa. asmin matenumitikaraRapadasya janakatayAnumititvAvacCinnajanakavattve satyanumititvAvacCinnajanakam ityarTaH (vAkya0). atra vyApArastftIyaliNgaparAmarSo jYeyaH (ta0 kO0) dvitIyamanumitikaraRaM tu liNgaparAmarSaH. yaTA vahnivyApyaDUmavAnayam iti jYAnamanumiteH karaRaM Bavati (ciM0 2) (ta0 BA0) (ta0 saM0). atra ca PalAyogavyavacCinnaM kAraRaM karaRamiti navInamatAnusAreREtasya karaRatvABiDAnam. anumAnaM dviviDam. svArTam parArTam. svasyEvArTaH prayojanaM (anumitiH) yasmAttat svArTam. parasya prativAdino maDyasTasya vA arTonumityAtmakaM prayojanaM saMSayanivfttirvA yasmAttat parArTam. AdyaM svAnumitihetuH. dvitIyaM parAnumitihetuH. taTA<BR>;p{0031}<BR>hi. yatra svayameva BUyodarSanena yatra DUmastatrAgniriti mahAnasAdO vyApti gfhItvA parvatasamIpaM gatastadgate cAgnO saMdihAnaH parvate DUmaM paSyan yatra DUmastatrAgniH iti vyAptiM smarati. tadanantaraM vahnivyApyaDUmavAnparvataH iti jYAnamutpadyate. ayaM liNgaparAmarSa ityucyate. tasmAt parvato vahnimAn iti jYAnam anumitirutpadyate. tadetatsvArTAnumAnam. yattu svayameva DUmAdagnimanumAya parapratipattyarTaM paYcAvayavopetaM vAkyaM prayuNkte tatparArTAnumAnam (ta0 saM0). prakArAntareRAnumAnaM triviDam. pUrvavat Sezavat sAmAnyato dfzwam. atra vyutpattiH pUrvaM kAraRaM tadvat iti. tadarTastu [ka] kAraRaliNgakam. yaTA meGonnativiSezeRa vfzwyanumAnam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 5). [Ka] yatra kAraRena kAryamanumIyate yaTA meGonnatyA Bavizyati vfzwiH iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 5). SezavacCandavyutpattistu SezaH kAryaM tadvat iti. tadarTastu [ka] kAryaliNgakam. yaTA nadIvfdDyA vfzwyanumAnam (gO0 vf0 1. 115). [Ka] yatra kAryeRa