anumitiH — (anuBavaH) [ka] vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnajanyaM jYAnam (ci0 2). atra vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnena janyamiti vigrahaH. tadarTaSca vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatvavipayatASAli niScayatvAvacCinnakAraRatAnirUpitakAryatve sati jYAnam (vAkya 0). vyAptinizWaprakAratA nirUpitA yA hetunizWA prakAratA tannirUpitA yA pakzatAvacCedakAvacCinnaviSezyatA tacCAlijYAnajanyaM jYAnamiti nirgalitorTaH (di0 2. 138). vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnaM ca parAmarSaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare nirUpayizyAmaH. atredaM boDyam - jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzasattvepi tasya durbalatvena parAmarSAnantaraM parvate vahnanumitireva na tu pratyakzamiti (ma0pra0 73). anumitelakzaRaM ca anumititvameva. tacca anuminomi ityanuBavasidDo jAtiviSezaH. janyaSabdaDI janyatvavyaBicAriRI yA janyajYAnajanyatvAvyaBicAriRI ca jAtiH (anumititvaM) tadvadanuBavatvam (nyA0 ma0 2. 14) (ta0 pra0). padaprayojanAdikaM tu tata eva jYeyam. [Ka] parAmarSajanyaM jYAnam (ta0 saM0). [ga] liNgajYAnajanyaM liNgijYAnam (ta0 kO0). [Ga] vyAptijYAnakaraRakaM jYAnam (mu0). yaTA parvate DUmena vahnisADane parvate DUmajYAnAnantaraM parvato vahnimAn iti jYAnam (ta0 kO0) (ta0 saM0). anumitirdvaDA. pakzatAtracCedakasADyayoH sAmAnADikaraRyamAtrAvagAhinI tayoravacCedyAvacCedakaBAvAvagAhinI ca (ga0 pakza0). atredamavaDeyam. parvato vahnimAn ityAdyanumitO yadA vahniparvatatvayoH sAmAnADikaraRyamAtraM vivakzitaM tadA sAnumitiH sAmAnADikaraRyamAtrAvagAhinI. yadA tu tayo - vrvyApyavyApakaBAvo vivakzitastadAvacCedyAvacCedakaBAvAvagAhinI BavatIti<BR>;p{0033}<BR>. prakArAntareRAnumitirdviviDA. lAGavajYAna sahakftAnumitiH itarabADagrahasahakftAnumitiSceti. atredaM voDyam - anvayavyatirekavyAptyoranyataraniScayenApyanumitirjanyate ityanuBavo na tu yugapaduBayavyApyupasTityEva janyata iti niyamaH (ci0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0032" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

