अनैकान्तिकः
anEkAntikaH — (hetvABAsaH) atra vyutpattiH. ekasya sADyasya tadaBAvasya<BR>;p{0037}<BR>vA yontaH sahacAraH avyaBicaritasahacAra ekAntaH. tadvAnEkAntikaH (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 46). anEkAntikaH savyaBicAraSabdena vyavahriyate. vESezikamate tu saMdigDa ityucyate ca iti boDyam. anEkAntikalakzaRaM ca sADAraRAdyanyatamatvam (mu0) (vAkya 0). aTavA savyaBicAratvAtmakadozavattvam. SizwaM sarvaM tu savyaBicAralakzaRavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAdayizyate. ekamAtravyAptigrAhaka sahacAravAnEkAntikaH. tadanyonEkAntikaH (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 46) nidarSanam. [ka] nityaH SabdaH asparSatvAdityatrAsparSatvAdityanEkAntiko heturyoDyaH. taTA hi - yatra nityatvABAvo nAmAnityatvaM tatrAsparSatvABAvo nAma sparSavattvam. yaTA kumBaH. tatra hi sparSavattvamanityatvaM ca. taTA yatrAsparSatvaM tatra nityatvaM yaTA AtmA. evaM dviviDadfzwAntasaMBavepi uBayorapi budDO vyaBicAraH. taTA hi - budDAvani- tyatvepi sparSavattvaM nAsti taTA asparSatvepi nityatvaM nAstIti savyaBicAratvAdanEkAntikaH. evaM cAtra nityatvamapyekontaH. anityatvamapyekontaH. ekasminnante vidyata ityEkAntikaH. viparyayAda nEkAntikaH. uBayAntavyApakatvAditi vAtsyAyana BAzye (1. 2. 46) spazwam. [Ka] yasmAdvizARI tasmAdgOriti cAnEkAntikasyodAharaRam (vE0 3. 1. 17). [ga] yaTA vA DUmavAnvahnerityatra vahniranEkAntikaH (ta0 saM0). sADyasaMdehajanakapakzaDarmatAjYAnavizayonEkAntikaH (vE0 vi0 3. 1. 15) (ta0 va0). idaM lakzaRaM pUrvaM ca prAcInamatAnusAreRoktamiti jYeyam. navInamatAnusAreRa lakzaRaM tu savyaBicAratvaSabda vyAKyAnAvasare saMpAdayizyate. sADyasaMdehaSca triviDaH. pakze sahacaratvAdvA sADyatadrahitatvayoH. sAmAnyAdvA viSezAdvA saMSayo Bavati triDA. tadarTaScasADyatadaBAvayoH pakza eva hetusAhacarya darSanAt saMSayo Bavati. yaTA sarvamanityaM prameyatvAdityAdO. (ayamanupasaMhArI). sAmAnyaDarmadarSanAdapi saMSayo Bavati. yaTA GawaH kzititvavAn dravyatvAdityAdO. dravyatvaM hi kzititvavati GawAdO tadaBAvavati jalAdO ca vartata iti sADAraRaDarmadarSanAdevAtra saMSaya iti (ayaM sADAraRAnEkAntikaH). viSezaDarmadarSanAdapi saMSayo Bavati.<BR>;p{0038}<BR>: yaTA SabdaH anityaH SabdatvAdityAdO. (ayamasADAraRo hetuH) (ta0va0 1 2. 3. 49) (vE0 u0 3. 1. 15). sADyasaMSaya heturanEkAntikaH. sa dviviDaH. sADAraRaH asADAraRaH (ta0 BA0 48). prakArAntare - RAnEkAntikastriviDaH sADAraRaH asADAraRaH anupasaMhArI (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 5) (BA0 pa0 73) (ta0 saM0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0036" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

