anyaTAnupapattiH — svABAvaprayojyAsaMBavaH. yaTA pIno devadatto divA<BR>;p{0041}<BR>na BuNga ityAdO rAtriBojanAnaNgIkAre rAtriBojanABAvaprayojyapInatvAsaMBavAtmikA pInatvAnyaTAnupapattiH. atra divA aBokturdevadattasya pInatvaM rAtriBojanaM vinAnupapannam (asaMBavi) iti jYAnAddivA BojanAkartfvfttipInatvena rAtriBojanaM kalpyate. taTA ca Bojanasya (sADyasya) pInatvavyApakatayA vyApakABAvasya ca vyApyABAvavyApyatayA sADyABAva- (rAtriBojanABAva -) vyApakIBUtABAva - (divA BojanAkartfvfttipInatvABAva -) pratiyogitvarUpavyatirekavyAptijYAnAt devadatto rAtriBojI ityanumitirUpArTApattirudeti (vAca0). idaM cArTApattipramARamanumAna evAntarBavatIti vijYeyam. atrAnumAnaM ca devadatto rAtriBojI divA aBuYjAnatve sati pInatvAt iti boDyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0040" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

