anyaTAsidDaH — avaSyaptaniyatapUrvavartina eva kAryasaMBave tatsahaBUtaH. yaTA avaSyaklfptaniyatapUrvavartiBirdaRqAdiBireva GawarUpakArya saMBave tatsahaBUtaM daRqatvaM GawaM prati anyaTAsidDam (si0 ca0 20) (pra0 pra0). anyaTAsidDastriviDaH. tatra praTamaHyena sahEva yasya yaM prati pUrvavfttitvamavagamyate tena taM prati sonyaTAsidDaH. yaTA tantunA tanturUpaM tantutvaM ca pawaM prati anyaTAsidDam. yaTA vA GawaM prati daRqena daRqarUpaM daRqatvaM cAnyaTAsidDam. daRqena sahEva daRqarUpasya daRqatvasya ca GawaM prati pUrvaBAvagrahAt. atra sahitatvamekajYAnavizayatvamiti boDyam. kiM ca yenetyasya svatantrAnvayavyatirekaSAlinA iti yasyetyasya tu svatantrAnvayavyatirekaSUnyasya iti ca viSezaRaM boDyam. tena nAtaTABUtena tantutvena tantoranyaTAsidDiH. na vA tantusaMyogasya tantunA sahAnyaTAsidDiriti. pare tu itarAnvayavyatirekaprayuktAnvayavyatirekaSAli yattadanyaTAsidDamityAhuH (nIla0 16). dvitIyaH-anyaM prati pUrvavfttitve jYAta eva yasya yaM prati pUrvavfttitvamavagamyate taM prati sonyaTAsidDaH. yaTA SabdaM prati pUrvavfttitve jYAta eva GawaM pratyAkASasya pUrvavfttitvagrahAt . GawaM pratyAkASonyaTAsidDaH. evaM kulAlapitApi putrakftaGawaM pratyanyaTAsidDaH. atrAdyodAharaRe AkASasyAkASatvena GawaM prati pUrvavfttitvaM 06<BR>;p{0042}<BR>kO 0<BR>grAhyam. AkASatvaM ca SabdasamavAyikAraRatvam. tacca SabdaniyatapUrvavfttitvaGawitamiti BAvaH. dvitIyodAharaRe kulAlaM (putraM) prati pUrvavfttitve jYAte eva GawaM prati kulAlapituH pUrvavfttitvagrahAdGawaM prati kulAlapitAnyaTAsidDa iti BAvaH (ta 0 kO0 7). tftIyaH anyatra klfptaniyatapUrvavfttinEva kAryasaMBave tatsahaBUtonyaTAsidDaH. yaTA pAkajasTale ganDaM prati rUpaprAgaBAvaH. yaTA vA GawaviSezaM prati dEvAdAgato rAsaBaH (ta0 07) (ta0 dI0 16). Adye apAkajasTale ganDaM prati klfptaniyatapUrvavartinA ganDaprAgaBAvenEva pAkajasTalepi ganDAtmakakAryasaMBave rUpaprAgaBAvonyaTAsidDaH (nIla0 16). dvitIye GawaviSezAdanyatra GawAntare klfptaniyatapUrvavfttidaRqacakrAdereva GawaviSezasyApi saMBave daRqacakrAdisahaBUto dEvAdAgato rAsaBonyaTAsidDaH (ta0 kO0 7). prakArAntareRAnyaTAsidDaM paYcaviDam. yatkAryaM prati kAraRasya pUrvavfttitvaM yena rUpeRa gfhyate tatkAryaM prati tadrUpamanyaTAsidDam. yaTA GawaM prati daRqatvam. atra GawaM prati daRqasya kAraRatvaM daRqatvenEva gfhyata iti daRqatvamanyaTAsidDamiti boDyam (1). yasya svAtantryeRAnvayavyatirekO na staH kiM tu svakAraRamAdAyAnvayavyatireko gfhyete tadanyaTAsidDam. yaTA GawaM prati daRqarUpam. atra daRqarUpasya svAtantryeRAnvayavyatirekO daRqarUpasattve GawasattvaM daRqarUpABAve GawABAva iti na staH. kiMtu daRqarUpasya kAraRaM daRqamAdAyEvAnvayavyatirekO daRqasattve GawasattvaM daRqABAve GawABAva iti gfhyete iti GawaM prati daRqarUpamanyaTAsidDamiti boDyam (2). anyaM prati pUrvavfttitvaM gfhItvEva yasya yatkAryaM prati pUrvavfttitvaM gfhyate tasya tatkAryaM pratyanyaTAsidDatvam. yaTA GawAdikaM pratyAkASasya (3). yatkAryajanakaM prati pUrvavfttitvaM gfhItvEva yasya yatkAryaM prati pUrvavfttitvaM gfhyate tasya tatkAryaM pratyanyaTAsidDatvam. yaTA GawaM prati kulAlapituH (4). [ka] avaSya klfptaniyatapUrvavfttina eva kAryasaMBave tadBinnamanyaTAsidDam. yaTA GawAdikaM prati rAsaBAdIti (BA0 pa0 Slo0 1922) (mu0 1. 54). [Ka] yasyAnukUlatarkABAvaH sonyaTAsidDaH<BR>;p{0043}<BR>(tA0 ra0 Slo0 88). yaTA GawaM prati rAsaBonyaTAsidDaH (5). pare tu atra avaSyalaptavaM laGuniyatapUrvavartitvaM boDyam. tena pAkaja ganDotpatti prati avaSya kupta pUrvavartinaH pAkajarUpaprAgaBAvasya kAraRatvanirAsaH ganDatrAgaBAvasyAnyaTAsidDatvanirAsaScetyAhuH (di0 1. 54). etezu paYcasvanyaTAsidDezu paYcamamAvaSyakam. anyezAM caturRAM daRqatvadaRqarUpa-AkASa kulAlapitFRAm) anena paScamAnyaTAsidDenEva saMgrahAditi boDyam (BA0 pa0 Slo0 22) (mu0 54) (di0) (rAma 0 1. 54). anyaTAsidDastriviDa iti maRikAramatam. navInAstu laGuniyatapUrvavartina eva kAryasaMBave tadBinnamanyaTAsidDam. evamanugatEkalakzaRenEkaviDamevAnyaTAsidDam. evaM ca triDA paYcaDeti prakArO SizyabudDivESadyAyetyAhuH. atra laGutvaM ca triviDam. SarIrakftam upasTitikftaM saMbanDakftaM ceti. tatra praTamamapratyakzaM pratyanekadravyatvApekzayA mahattvasya kAraRatve laGutvamasti. dvitIyam - ganDaM prati rUpaprAgaBAvApekzayA ganDaprAgaBAvasya kAraRatve laGutvam. ganDasya pratiyogina upasTitatvena SIGraM tadupasTiteH. tftIyam - GawaM prati daRqatvadaRqarUpAdyapekzayA daRqAdeH kAraRatve laGutvam. svASrayadaRqasaMyogAdirUpaparaMparAyA gurutvAt (nIla0 17).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0041" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथासिद्धिः
anyaTAsidDiH — pUrvoktezvanyaTAsidDezu vartamAnastattadDarmaviSezaH. iyaM ca kAraRatvasaMpAdikA na Bavati api tu kAraRatvaviGawikA BavatIti jYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्योन्यम्
anyonyam — kriyAvyatihAravizayatvam. vyatihAraSca vinimayaH. parasparakaraRamiti yAvat (la0 ma0). yaTA anyonyezAM puzkarErAmfSanta iti mAGaH (si0 kO0 ta0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्योन्याभावः
anyonyABAvaH — (aBAvaH) [ka] nityatve satyatyantABAvaBinnatve satyaBAvaH (ga0 si0). [Ka] atyantABAvavyatiriktatve satyanavaDi-. raBAvaH (sarva0 Olu0 pf0 232). [ga] aDikaraRe pratiyogitAvacCedakAro pahetukanizeDaDIvizayaH (pa0 ca0). sa ca tAdAtmyABAvaH<BR>;p{0044}<BR>. yaTA asannaSvo gavAtmanA. aGawaH pawa iti (paM0 ca0) (vE0 u0 9. 1. 4). yaTA vA GawaH pawAtmA na BavatIti (sarva0 Olu0 pf0 233). [Ga] tAdAtmyasaMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogitAkaH aBAvaH (ta0 saM0) (ga0 si0) (ta0 kO0 21). GawaH pawo na BavatItyAdito GawAtmA pawo na Bavati ityarTo boDyate. evaM ca GawatAdAtmyasyABAvaH GawatAdAtmyenAvacCinnA yA GawanizWA pratiyogitA tannirUpako Bedo vA pawe vartate ityavaDeyam. [Na] idamidaM na Bavati idametadBinnam iti pratItisAkzikaH aBAvaH (nyA0 ma0 1. 11). yaTA GawaH pawo na Bavati iti pratItisAkziko BedaH (ga0 si0) (pra0pra0). anyonyABAvo DarmisvarUpa eva na tu pfTagiti maDvAcAryAnuyAyina AhuH. anyonyABAvaSabde vyutpattistu anyonyasmin tAdAtmyenABAvaH aBavanam iti (vE0 sA0 da0 344). sa ca (anyonyABAvaH) BedaH. Bedo hi Gawe pawasya paQe Gawasya ca sadAstIti nityaH. pratiyogisamAnADikaraRaScAyamaBAvo Bavati. Gawo na BUtalam iti pratItyA GawADikaraRepi BUtale GawaBedasya vidyamAnatvAt. atredamavaDeyam- na hi kaMcidaBAvaM prati yena kenApi saMbanDena pratiyogino viroDitA. kiMtu pratiyogitAvacCedakasaMbanDenEva pratiyogI aBAvasya viroDI. taTA ca anyonyABAvasya pratiyogitAvacCedakaH saMbanDastAdAtmyAKya eva. ata evAyamaBAvaH tAdAtmyasaMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogitAkaH ityucyate. tena saMbanDena ca Gawasya svasminneva sattvena BUtalAdAvasattvAttatra GawAnyonyABAvo vartata iti (vE0 vi0 9. 1. 4). anyonyABAvagraheDikaraRayogyatAmAtraM tatram (vE0 u0 9. 1. 4) (9. 1. 18). yaTA piSAcaBedADikaraRe stamBe yogyatAyAH sattvena stamBaH piSAco na iti grahaH (cAkzuzagrahaH) upapadyate (mu0 1. 127). navyAstu DvaMsaprAgaBAvayorivAnyonyABAvasyApi pratiyogitAvacCedakasaMbanDe mAnABAvaH. atyantABAvasya tu pratiyogitAvacCedakasaMbanDaH svIkriyate. saMyogena<BR>;p{0045}<BR>samavAyena vA Gawo nAsti iti pratIteH. itTaM cAnyonyABAvatvamaKaRqopADirityAhuH (ma0pra0 12) (la0 ba0) (ga0 si0 2. 55).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्योन्याश्रयः
anyonyASrayaH — tarkaviSezaH. ayamitaretarASrayaSabdena sarvadarSanasaMgrahe akzapAdadarSane uktaH (sarvada 0 pf0 239). atra anyonyapadasya tajjYAne tadutpattO tatsTitO ca lakzaRA. tadASrayonyonyASraya iti tritayasADAraRo vigrahaH. evaM cAnyonyasaMbanDino jYAnotpattisTityetadanyatamasyASraya ityarTaH (vAca 0). sa ca svApekzApekzitatvanimittakonizwaprasaNgaH. apekzA ca jYaptO utpattO sTitO ca grAhyA. tatra jYaptO yaTA GawoyaM yadyetadBawajYAnajanyajYAnavizayaH syAt tadEtadBawa BinnaH syAditi. ta trasvajYAnasya svajYAnajanyatvenAnizwaM prasajyeta. svApekzApekzitajYAnatvAt KApekzitaGawajYAnavizayasya tajjanakajYAnavizayAdBedarUpamanizwaM ca prasajyeta. ato Gawasya GawaBedaprasaNgonizwaH. utpattO yaTA GawoyaM yadyetadBawajanyaH syAt tadEtadBUwAnaDikaraRakzaRottaravartI na syAdityAdi. etadBawasyotpattO etadBawasApekzatve kAraRasya kAryAdBedaniyatatayA etadBawasya etadGawaBedarUponizwaH prasaNgaH. sTitO yaTA GawoyaM yadyetadBawavfttiH syAttadA taTAtvenopalaByeta. na ca taTopalaByate. taTAtve ca Gawasya GawavfttitvApattiranizwA prasajyeteti. etezu jYaptivizayatayEva prAyaSonizwaprasaNgaH sarvatra dfSyate. tanmUlakameva svagrahasApekzagrahakatvamanyonyASrayatvaM tatra tatra vyavahriyate. ata eva parasparajYAnasApekzajYAnASrayonyonyASraya iti smArtEruktam (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वयः
anvayaH — 1 sADyam. yaTA anvayena vyatirekeRa ca vyAptimadanvayavyatireki ityAdO (ta0 saM0). 2 anvayavyAptiH (vAkya 0). yaTA yatra yatra DUmastatrAgniH iti sAhacaryaniyamaH (ta0 saM0). yaTA vA hetuvyApakasADya sAmAnADikaraRyam (nyA0 bo0 15). 3 kowidvaya sahacaritatvajYAnama (ga0 satpra0 21). yaTA DUmavAnvahnerityAdO ayaM DUmABAvasamAnADikaraRavahnimAn iti (BramAtmakaM) jYAnam. idaM jYAnaM<BR>;p{0046}<BR>ca sADAraRaDarmavattAjYAnaviDayA saMSaye prayojakamiti prAcInamate sADAraRAnEkAntikalakzaRe hyupayujyate iti ca vijYeyam (ci0 satpra02. 10). 4 [ka] kAraRADikaraRe kAryasya sattvam (rAma 052). yaTA yatsattve (kAraRasattve) yatsattvam (kAryasattvam) ityanvayaH. [Ka] kAryakAraRayoH sADyasADanayorvA sAhacaryam (si0 ca0 2. 26). tatra kAryakAraRayoH sAhacaryaM ca svasvavyApyetarayAvatkAraRasattve yatsattvevaSyaM yatsattvamiti (ta0 pra0). yaTA cakrAdiGawita sAmagrIsamavahitadaRqAdisattve Gawasattvamiti. sADyasADanayoryaTA parvato vahnimAnDUmAt ityAdO DUmavahnayoH sAhacaryam yatra DUmastatrAgniH iti. [ga] kecit kArye kAraRasyAnusaraRam. [Ga] kAryasattApAdakasvasattAkasya kAraRasya kArye sTitiH. [Na] svasattAniyatasattAvatkAryasaMbanDa ityAhuH. 5 hetvaBAvavati kAryAnvayajYAnam. vyaBicArajYAnamiti yAvat iti navyA AhuH (mU0 ma0 1). 6 SAbdaboDIya saMsargatAKya vizayatAvAn. yaTA GawamAnaya iti vAkyajanyaSAbdaboDe GawAnayanAdInAM padArTAnAM parasparaM saMbanDaH. ayaM cAnvayo dviviDaH. BedAnvayaH aBedAnvayaH. Adyo rAjYaH puruzaH ityAdO rAjapadArTa puruzapadArTayoH. dvitIyo nIlo GawaH ityAdO nIlapadArTaGawapadArTayoH (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 1). 7 vfttiH. 8 AnukUlyam. 9 saMtatiriti kAvyajYA vadanti (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वयदृष्टान्तः
