अन्वयबोधः
anvayaboDaH — SAbdaboDa - SabdavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. atreyaM vyutpattiH. avyayanipAtAtiriktanAmArTayoH kriyAprAtipadikArTayoSca sAkzAdBedenAnvayaboDaH avyutpannaH iti. yaTA - nEyAyikamate rAjapuruzaH ityAdO rAjapadArTasya puruzapadArTe svasvAmiBAva saMbanDenAnvayo vAcyaH. taTAviDAnvayasya pUrvoktavyutpattivirudDatvena taM parityajya rAjapadasya rAjasaMbanDini lakzaRAM svIkftya tAdfSarAjapadArTasyABedena puruzapadArTenvayaH. vEyAkaraRamate<BR>;p{0047}<BR>tu rAjapuruzaH ityAdO luptazazWyAdiviBaktyA smftayA pratipAdyenEva Bavana (na tu sAkzAt) rAjapadArTasya puruzAdAvanvayaH svIkfta iti (mu0 4 pf0 182). uktavyutpattAvavyayanipAtAtiriktetipadaprayojanamucyate. Gawo na pawaH ityAdO GawapawAByAM namaH sAkzAdevAnvayAt nipAtAtirikta iti padaM dattam. candra iva muKam ityAdO ivArTasAdfSye candrasya pratiyogitayA BedenAnvayAt avyayAtirikta-iti ca padaM dattam. nIlo GawaH ityAdO nAmArTayoH stokaM pacati ityAdO kriyAprAtipadikArTayoScABedenAnvayAt Bedena ityuktam. BUtale GawaH ityAdO ADeyatAsaMsargeRApi GawaBUtalayoranvayAt sAkzAt iti padam. pratyayArTamadvArIkftya iti sAkzAt ityasyArTaH (mu0 4 pf0 182) (di0). Bedena ityasya tu tAdAtmyAtiriktena ityarTo boDyaH. rAjA puruzaH ityAdO svatvarUpaBeda saMbanDena rAjapadArTasya puruzAdAvanvayamAdAya rAjasaMbanDI puruzaH iti boDavAraRAyAsyA vyutpatterAvaSyakatvam. karmatAnirUpakatva saMbanDenApi (Beda saMbanDena) taRqulAdipadArTasya pacanakriyAyAmanvayamAdAya taRqulakarmakaH pAkaH ityAkArakaboDamAdAya taRqulaH pacati iti prayogavAraRAya ceyaM vyutpattiravaSyaM svIkAryA iti (mu0 14 pf0 182) (ga0 avaya 0 hetu0). atredamavaDeyam - pacikriyAyAM taRqulAdikarmakatvaprakArakaSAbdabudDitvAvacCinnaM prati dvitIyAntataRqulapadasamaBivyAhftapacatipadasamaBivyAhArarUpAkANkzAjYAnaM kAraRam ityAvaSyakakAryakAraRaBAvenEva taRqulaH pacati ityAdiprayogavAraRopapattAvalametAdfSyA vyutpattyeti (ga0 avaya 0 hetupra0) (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0046" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्वयव्यतिरेकि
anvayavyatireki — (liNgam) [ka] gfhItAnvayavyatireki sADyakam (dIDi0 2. 156). anvayavyatireki tu paYcarUpopapannaM Bavati. paYca rUpARi ca pakzaDarmatvam sapakze sattvam vipakzAdvyAvfttiH abADitavizayatvam asatpratipakzatvaM ceti (si0 ca0 2. 26) (ta0 kO0 2. 12). etAni paSrca rUpARi ca vahnisADyakaDUmAdAvanvayavyatirekiRyeva<BR>;p{0048}<BR>vidyante. kevalAnvayini vipakzAdvyAvfttirnAsti. vipakzAprasidDeH. kevalavyatirekiRi tu sapakzasattvaM nAsti. sapakzAprasidDeH (ta0 kO012). abADitavizayatvamityatra vyutpattiH abADito vizayaH sADyaM yasyetyabADitavizayaH. tasya BAvaH abADitavizayatvam iti. atrAbADitavizayatvaM ca pramARAntareRApramitasADyABAvakatvaM boDyam (ta0 kO0 12) (si0 ca0 2. 26). asatpratipakzatvaM ca sADyABAvasADaka hetvantaraSUnyatvaM voDyam (ta0 kO0 12) (si0 ca0 2. 27). [Ka] satsapakzavipakzo hetuH. yaTA vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO (mu0219). atra sapakzasya mahAnasAdeH vipakzasya jalahadAdeSca sattvAt iti (mu0 219). [ga] anvayena vyatirekeRa ca vyAptimat (ta0 saM0). anvayasahacAragrahagrAhyatryAptimattve sati vyatireka sahacAragrahagrAhyavyAptimadityarTaH (nIla02. 23). [Ga] yatrAnvayavyAptirvyatirekavyAptiSca vidyate tat. yaTA vahnimAnDUmAdityAdO niruktapaYcarUpopapanno DUmaH (pra0 pra0) (ta0 kO0 12). atra parvataH pakzaH. tasya vahnimattvaM sADyam. DUmAt iti hetuH. tasmin hetO yatra yatra DUmastatra tatra vahniryaTA mahAnasAdO ityanvayavyAptiH. yatra yatra vahnayaBAvastatra tatra DUmABAvaH yaTA jalahfdAdO iti vyatirekavyAptiScAstIti jYeyam (ta0 kO0 12).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0047" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

