apaSabdaH — SaktivEkalyapramAdAdinA sADuSabdasyAnyaToccAraRa sADyopaBraMSaSabdaH. yaTA mlecCo ha vA nAma yadapaSabdaH (pA0 ma0 BA0 1. 1. 1). hariRApyuktam-ta eva SaktivEkalyapramAdAlasatAdiBiH. anyaToccAritAH SabdA apaSabdA itIritAH.. iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसिद्धान्तः
apasidDAntaH — (nigrahasTAnam) [] sidDAntamaByupetyAniyamAtkaTAprasaNgaH (gO0 5. 2. 24). kasyacidarTasya taTABAvaM pratijYAya pratijYAtArTaviparyayAdaniyamAtkaTAM prasaYjayatopasidDAnto veditavyaH. yaTA na sadAtmAnaM jahAti na sato vinASo nAsadAtmAnaM laBate nAsadutpadyata iti sidDAntamaByupetya svapakzaM vyavasTApayati-ekaprakftIdaM vyaktam. vikArARAmanvayadarSanAt. mfdanvitAnAM SarAvAdInAM dfzwamekaprakftitvam. taTA cAyaM vyaktaBedaH suKaduHKamohAnvito dfSyate. tasmAtsamanvayadarSanAtsuKAdiBirekaprakftIdaM SarIramiti. evamuktavAnanuyujyate. aTa prakftirvikAra iti kaTaM lakzitavyamiti. yasyAvasTitasya DarmAntaranivfttO DarmAntaraM pravartate sA prakftiH. yacca DarmAntaraM pravartate sa vikAra iti. soyaM pratijYAtArTaviparyAsAdaniyamAtkaTAM prasaYjayati. pratijYAtaM Kalvanena nAsadAvirBavati na sattiroBavatIti. sadasatoSca tiroBAvAvirBAvamantareRa na kasyacitpravfttiH pravfttyuparamaSca Bavati. mfdi KalvavasTitAyAM Bavizyati SarAvAdilakzaRaM DarmAntaramiti pravfttirBavati. aBUditi ca pravfttyuparamaH. tadetanmfdDarmARAmapi na syAt. evaM pratyavasTito yadi sataScAtmahAnam asataYcAtmalABamaByupEti tadasyApasidDAnto nigrahasTAnaM Bavati. aTa nAByupEti pakzasya na siDyati. (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 24). [Ka] kaTAyAM svIkftasidDAntapracyavaH. taTA ca sAMKyamatena ahaM vadizyAmItyaByupetyArabDAyAM kaTAyAmAvirBAvasyAvirBAvAByupagame navasTeti dUzaRodDArAyAvirBAvasyAsata utpatti yadyaByupEti tadApasidDAntaH (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 24) (di0 1). [ga] ekasidDAntamatamASritya kaTApravfttO tadvirudDasidDAntamatamAlambyottaradAnam (nIla0 46). sidDAntAdapaDvaMsopasidDAnta ityarTaH<BR>;p{0057}<BR>(ta0 BA0 51). (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 23).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नवः
apahnavaH — [ka] abADita paroktaviparItaboDanAya tadupapAdakABAvapratipAdanecCA. yaTA kaliNgezu dfzwosi. nAhaM kaliNgAYjagAmetyAdAvatyantApahnavaH (ga0 vyu0 la0). atra ca kaliNgADikaraRakadarSanAderupapAdakaM kaliNgagamanAdikam. tena vinA tadasaMBavAt. atyantApahnavaH svarUpasanneva (na tu jYAtaH) liwsADutA niyAmakaH (ga0 vyu0 la0). [Ka] sattvena jYAtasyApi vastunaH asattvena kaTanam. sa dviviDaH SabdatorTataSceti. tatra miTyEva tat iti SabdataH. arTatastu nABijAnAmyaham. tatra tadA na mama sTitiH iti (vA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपादानत्वम्
apAdAnatvam — (kArakam) yadDAtUpasTApyayAdfSArTe vigrahavAkyapaYcamyA yaH svArTonuBAvayituM SakyaH tasya tadDAtUpasTApyatAdfSa kriyAyAmapAdAnatvamucyate. yaTA vfkzAtpatita ityAdO vfkzAderapAdAnatvam (Sa0 pra0 79). apagamAya AdIyate avaDitveneti vyutpattiH (vAca0). apAdAnaSabdastu tattatkarmAnaDikaraRIBUte tattatkarmajanyaviBAgASraye Sakta ityavaDeyam. vfkzAtpatita ityasmAdvAkyAt vfkzAvaDikaviBAgAnukUlapatanakartA ityanvayabudDO DAtUpasTApyapatane paYcamyupasTApyo viBAgaH svAnukUlatvasaMbanDena prakAra iti sa viBAga eva tatrApAdAnatvamiti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 79). atrAvaDitvaM ca svarUpasaMbanDapraBedaH padArTAntaraM vetyanyadetat. apAdAnatvaM ca [ka] kriyAnASrayatve sati tajjanyaviBAgASrayatvam (ga0 ava0). parasamavetakriyAjanyaviBAgASrayatvamityarTaH. yaTA BUBfto gaNgAvataratItyAdO BUBfto gaNgAsamavetakriyAjanyaviBAgASrayatvAdapAdAnatvam. gaNgAyAmativyAptivAraRAya parasamaveteti kriyAyAM viSezaRam (Sa0 pra0 6). vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO parRakriyayA vfkzaparRayorviBAgo jAyate. tatra kriyA parRamAtranizWA viBAgastUBayanizWa iti vfkzasya kriyAnASrayatvaM viBAgASrayatvaM ca saMgacCata ityavaDeyam. [Ka] svanizWaBedapratiyogitAvacCedako BUtakriyAjanyaviBAgASrayatvam sOgatAstva sidDAntaM dUzaRaM na manyante<BR>;p{0058}<BR>(ga0 vyu0 5. 21). atra svaM viBAgASrayo vfkzaH. tannizWaH kriyAvataH parRAtsakASAt BedaH. tatpratiyogitAyAH parRanizwAyA avacCedikA patanakriyA. tajjanyaviBAgASrayatvaM vfkzasyeti. atra kriyAyAM svanizWa BedapratiyogitAvacCedakatvaviSezaRena parRAdeH svanizWavfkzAdi viBAgajanakapatanApAdAnatvanirAsa iti jYeyam (ga0 vyu0 5. 21). [ga] parakIya kriyAjanyaviBAgASrayatvam (kA0 vyA0 9). yaTA vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO vfkzAderapAdAnatA. atra paYcamyA anyonyABAvapratiyogitAvacCedakatvaM viBAgajanakatvaM cArTaH. viBAge anyonyABAve ca vfkzonveti (kA0 vyA0 9). taTA ca vfkzanizwaBedapratiyogitAvacCedakaM tannizWaviBAgajanakaM ca yat patanaM tadASrayaH parRamityAkArako boDaH (ga0 vyu0 5. 21). [Ga] avaDitvam. yaTA vfkzAdviBajata ityAdO vfkzAderapAdAnatA (ga0 vyu0 5. 21). atra vfkzAdyavaDikatvaviSizwaviBAganirUpitamevASrayatvamAKyAtena voDyate. ato vfkzaH svasmAdviBajate iti na prayogaH (ga0 vyu0 5. 21). viSezastu paYcamISabdavyAKyAne vyaktIBatrizyati. SAbdikamate apAdAnaM ca [Na] DruvamapAyepAdAnam (pARinisUtram 1. 4. 24). apAye viBAge DruvaM niScalam prakftapaYcamyarTaviBAgajanakatvAnvayikriyASUnyamityarTaH (kA0 vyA0 9). tatroktaM hariRA-apAye yadudAsInaM calaM vA yadi vAcalam. DruvamevAtadAveSAttadapAdAnamucyate.. patato Druva evASvo yasmAdaSvAtpatatyasO. tasyApyaSvasya patane kuqyAdi Druvamucyate.. uBAvapyaDruvO mezO yadyapyuBayakarmaje. viBAge praviBakte tu kriye tatra vyavasTite.. mezAntarakriyApekzamavaDitvaM pfTak pfTak. mezayoH svakriyApekzaM kartftvaM ca pfTak pfTak.. iti. apAye gativiSeze sati yadDruvam avaDiBAvopagamASrayatve sati tadatiriktasyAvaDitvopayogivyApArasyAnASrayaM tadapAdAnamiti sUtrArTaH. asya padakftyaM SabdenduSeKare spazwam. [ca] viSlezASrayatve sati viSlezajanakaDAtvarTatattatkriyAnASrayaH (vE0 sA0). [Ca] avaDiBAvopagamavyApAram (la0 ma0). apAdAnaM triviDam. nirdizwavizayam<BR>;p{0059}<BR>upAttavizayam apekzitakriyaM ceti. tatrAdyam - yatra sAkzAt. (muKyavfttyA) DAtunA gatiH (viBAgajanakakriyA) nirdiSyate tannirdizwavizayam. yaTA aSvAtpatati. dvitIyam - yatra DAtvantarArTANgaM svArTaM DAturAha tadupAttavizayam. samaBivyAhftaDAtunopAtto lakzito gatirUpo vizayo yatreti vyutpattiH (vE0 sA0 da0 192). svavizayakriyAGawitaSrUyamARakriyAntaramityarTaH. yaTA balAhakAdvidyotate vidyudityAdO. atra niHsftya ityaDyAhAryam. taTA ca niHsaraRANge vidyotane dyutiH (dyut-DAtuH) vartate. dyutiSca lakzaRayA niHsaraRapUrvakavidyotanavoDaka iti yAvat (vE0 sA0). evaM ca balAhakAdvidyotate vidyut ityAdivAkyAt balAhakAvaDikaniHsaraRottarakAlikaM vidyutkartfkaM vidyotanam iti boDaH (vE0 sA0 da0 192) (la0 ma0 108). tftIyam-apekzitA kriyA yatra tadapekzitakriyam. anupAttaDAtvarTakriyAsAkANkzamityarTaH. (vE0 sA0 da0 192). yaTA kuto BavAn pAwaliputrAdityAdO. atrAgamanamarTamaDyAhftya AgataH iti padaM vADyAhftyAnvayaH kAryaH (vE0 sA0 da0 192). nEyAyikAstvitTaM vyAcakzate - yatra viBAgastajjanakakriyA coBayaM DAtunABiDIyate tadAdyam. yatra viBAgoDyAhftaDAtunABiDIyate tadvitIyam. yatra tUBayamaDyAhftaDAtvaBiDeyam tattftIyam iti (vE0 sA0 da0 192193).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपानः
