अपार्थकम्
apArTakam — (nigrahasTAnam) [ka] pOrvAparyAyogAdapratisaMbadDArTam. (gO0 5. 2. 10). yatrAnekasya padasya vAkyasya vA pOrvAparyeRAnvayayogo nAstItya saMbanDArTatvaM gfhyate tatsamudAyorTasyApAyAdapArTakam. yaTA daSa dAqimAni zaqapUpAH kuRqamajAjinaM palalapiRqaH aDarorukametatkumAryAH sPEyyakftasya pitA pratiSIna iti (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 10). [Ka] aBimatavAkyArTaboDAnukUlAkANkzAdiSUnyaboDajanakapadam. udAharaRaM tu ayogyAnAsannAnAkANkzavAkyam (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 10)<BR>;p{0060}<BR>(di0 1). [ga] parasparAnanvitArTakapadasamUhaH. yaTA Sabdo GawaH pawo nityamanityaM ca prameyatvAt ityAdi (nIla0 pf0 45). [Ga] yAdfSaSAbdaboDatvAvacCedenApArTatvaM tAdfSabudDyarTaM prayuktaH padasamUhaH (Sa0 pra0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
api — (avyayam) 1 saMBAvanA. 2 saMdehaH. 3 nindA. 4 praSnaH. 5 samuccayaH. 6 alpapadArTaH. 7 kAmacArAnujYA. 8 avaDAraRam. 9 punararTaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0060" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्वम्
apUrvam — [ka] yAgAdikarmaRaH kAciduttarAvasTA PalEkanASyA (la0 ma0). [Ka] yAgAdijanyaH svargAdijanakaH kaScana guRaviSezaH. taM guRaviSezamapUrvamiti mImAMsakA vadanti. prArabDakarmeti vedAntinaH. DarmADarmAviti nEyAyikAH. adfzwamiti vESezikAH. puRyapApe iti pOrARikAH. apUrvaM darSapUrRamAsayordviviDam. paramApUrvaM kalikApUrvaM ceti (di0 gu0 235). prakArAntareRApyapUrvaM mImAMsakamate triviDam. praDAnApUrvam aNgApUrvaM kalikApUrvaM ceti. tatra darSapUrRamAsAdyapUrvaM praDAnApUrvam. tadeva paramApUrvam. prayAjAdyaNgajanyApUrvamaNgApUrvam. tadavAntara kriyAkUwajanyamapUrvaM kalikA pUrvaM. tacca brIhiprokzaRAByukzaRAdijanyaM dravyanizWamiti mImAMsakAH. tajjanyasaMskAraviSeza eva kalikApUrvatayA vyavahriyate sa cAtmanizWa iti nEyAyikAH. kalikApUrvaM ca paramApUrva janayitvA naSyati. aNgApUrvEstu paramApUrve viSeza ADIyata iti BedaH. taTA cANgApUrvasahitaM paramApUrvaM viSizwaPalaM janayati. tadvihInaM tu svalpaM Palam. atredamavaDeyamparamApUrvaM ca nityakarmaRi paRqApUrvatvena mIsAMsakErvyavahniyate. saMDyAvandanasya kiYcitPalAjanakatvAt. nEyAyikAstu arTavAdopasTApitabrahmalokAdiprAptirUpaPalajananAnna tatrApUrvasya PalAjanakatvena paRqatvamityAhuH (vAca0). vistarastu cintAmaRiSabdaKaRqe kusumAYjalipraTamastavake cAvalokanIyaH. atredaM boDyamparamApUrvaM vAcyam. kalikA pUrvARi tu kalpyAnIti mImAMsakasidDAnta iti (ta0pra0 Ka04 pf0 114).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0060" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्वविधिः
apUrvaviDiH — (viDiH) [ka] aprAptaprApako viDiH. sa ca yAgAdInAmizwasADanatvasya kftisADyatvasya vA boDako liNAdiSabdaH. yaTA svargakAmo yajetetyAdO (si0 ca0 33) (vAca0). aprAptaprApakatvaM ca prATamikapravfttijanakapratItijanakatvam pramARAntarajanyapratItyavizayavizayakapratItijanakatvaM vA. idaM yajanaM tu kenApi pramARAntareRa na voDitam (si0 ca0 33). atredaM voDyamliNA yAgAdAvizwasADanatvaM boDyata iti nEyAyikAH. kAryatvenApUrvaM boDyata iti prABAkarA manyante (vAca0). [Ka] pramARAntareRAprAptaprApako liqAdipadavedanIyaH SabdaviSezaH. yaTA svargakAmo yajeteti liNAdiyuktaM vAkyam. apUrvaviDiScaturviDaH. karmaviDiH guRaviDiH viniyogaviDiH prayogaviDiSceti. tatrAgnihotraM juhotItyAdO yAgarUpe karmaRi izwasADanatAyAH kftisADyatAyAH BAvanAyA vA mataBedena boDanAt karmaviDitvam. dravyadevatAdiviDAyakaviDirguRaviDiH. yaTA daDnA juhotItyAdivAkyam. prAptasyAgnihotrasyAnuvAdenAprAptaguRarUpadravyAdeH (daDyAdeH) viDAnAt. viniyojanAdviniyogaviDiH. yaTA EndryA gArhapatyamupatizWate ityAdi. atra EnyA fcaH gArhapatyopasTAne viniyojanAt viniyogaviDiH. evaM kftvA evaM kuryAt ityAdiprayogajYApako viDiH prayogaviDiH. yaTA aDItya snAyAdityAdi upasadBiScaritvA mAsamekamagnihotraM juhotItyAdi ca. ayaM ca viSizwaviDiriti BedaH (vA0). [ga] yasya yadarTatvaM pramARAntareRAprAptaM tasya tadarTatvena yo viDiH sopUrvaviDiH. yadAhuHviDi- ratyantamaprApte niyamaH pAkzike sati. tatra cAnyatra ca prAptO parisaMKyeti gIyate.. (mI0 nyA0 pf0 46). vistarastu viDiSabde dfSyaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0061" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षा
apekzA — 1 AkANkzA. sA ca SAbdaboDaprayojanikA. 2 asAmarTyam. asyAmapekzAyAM ca prAyaSo vfttineMzyate. yaTA pravIraM putrakAmyati fdDasya rAjamAtaNga ityAdO pratyayasamAsO na staH. tatroktam - sApekze pratyayo na syAtsamAso vA kaTaMcana. sApekzaM tadvijAnIyAdasamastaviSezaRam.. iti. 3 prayojakatvam. tacca jYAne sTitO utpattO vA itarasyAnuroDitvam<BR>;p{0062}<BR>. jYAnAdikArye ca yasya yatpadArTAntarajYAnAdyanuroDastasya tadapekzA. ata eva tarkagranTe jagadISena svApekzApAdakaH prasaNga AtmASrayaH. apekzA ca jYaptO utpattO sTitO ca grAhyA ityAdyuktam. aDikaM tu anyonyASraya Sabda vyAKyAne drazwavyam. 4 apekzA budDivadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. 5 anuroDaH. yaTA satyAmapi tapaHsidDO niyamApekzayA munirityAdO iti DarmajYAH. 6 spfhA. yaTA samupoQezu kAmezu nirapekzaH parivrajedityAdO (manu0 6. 41) iti kAvyajYAH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0061" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षाबुद्धिः
apekzAbudDiH — (budDiH) [ka] nAnEkatvasamUhAlambanarUpA budDiH (vE0 u0 4. 1. 11). apekzAbudDiH kzaRatrayAvasTAyinI iti sidDAntaH. dvitvAdikaM tvapekzAbudDijanyam (vE0 u0 4. 1. 11). apekzAbudDericCAdijanakatvaM nAstItyavaSyaM mantavyam. anyaTA tenEva tasyA nASAtkzaRatrayAvasTAyitvameva na syAditi kecit (BavA0 290). vistarastu anyatra (vE0 u0 7. 28) drazwavyaH. atredaM boDyamdvitvAdikaM parArDAntamapekzAtmakabudDyA janyate tannASena naSyati ca. apekzAbudverdvityAdeScotlattinASAdiprapaYcastu dvitvaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare vyaktIBavizyati. atredaM vicAryate - yadyapi dvitvAdisamavAyaH pratyekaM GawAdAvasti taTApi eko dvO iti jYAnABAvAt eko na dvO iti jYAnAcca dvitvAdInAM paryAptisvarUpaH kaScitsaMbanDonekASrayoNgIkriyate. paryAptisaMbanDena ca pratyekaM GawAdo na dvitvAdi. tAdfSasaMbanDaScApekzAbudDisApekzaH. tena tatsattve taTA jYAnaM tadasattve na taTA jYAnam iti (vAca0) vastutastu dvitvAdikaM tu na saMKyA kiM tvapekzA budDiviSezavizayatvameva. taccApekzAbudDyaDInamiti na kopi doza iti tu vayam. [Ka] anekEkatvabudDiH (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 110). anekAni yAnyekatvAni tezAM budDiH. sA ca ayamekaH ayamekaH ityAkArikA budDiH (mu0 gu0 204). yaTA senAvanAdibudDiH (ta 0 va0). atrASvAdisamUhaH senA. vfkzasamUho vanam. taTA ca senA vanam ityAdibudDi viSezavizayatvaM senAtyavanatvAdi (ma0pra0 4. 46). [ga] apekzAbudDirnAma vinASakavinASapratiyoginI budDiH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 224 OlU0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0062" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोहः
apohaH — 1 atadvayAvfttiH. yaTA vijYAnavAdivOdDamate nIlatvAdirDarmaH anIlavyAvfttirUpaH (di 0 1). tanmateyaM DarmopAramArTika eveti sarvasyApi vijYAnarUpatvaM kzaRikatvaM ceti ca jYeyam. 2 aparatarkanirAsAya kfto viparItatarkaH. yaTA SuSrUzA SravaRaM cEva grahaRaM DAraRA taTA. UhopohorTavijYAnaM tattvajYAnaM ca DIguRAH.. iti hemacandrokto budDiguRaBedaH. yaTA vA svayamUhApohasamarTaH ityAdO. 3 tyAga iti kAvyajYA vadanti (vAca0). asvam - (jAtiH) saritsAgarasamavetatve sati jvalanAsamavetaM sAmAnyam (sarvada0 saM0 pf0 218 Olu0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0063" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

