arTavAdaH — (SabdaH) arTasya prayojanasya vAdo vAdanam. viDyarTapraSaMsAparaM vacanamityarTaH. arTavAdo hi stutyAdidvArA viDyarTaM SIGraM pravfttaye praSaMsati (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 63). nizidDArTaM SIGraM nivfttaye nindati ca. sa cAyaM arTavAdaH loke vede ca samAnaH (ta0 kO0 4. 17). lOkikaH-odanakAmastaRqulaM paceta tfptikAmastaRqulOdanaM BuYjItetyAdO viDyarTasya taRqulapAkakaraRasya taRqulOdanaBojanarUpasya ca stAvakaM taRqulapAka fziBiH pUrvaM svargAdyarTaM kftaH odanamamftam ityAdi vAkyam. evaM kaPajvarapIqito dugDaM na pibedityAdinizeDaviDisTalepi dugDapAnasya nindakaM paSuBirBakzitenApaTyatfRAdinA dugDaM janyate tacca vizarUpamityAdikaM vAkyam. vEdikodAharaRAni tvanupadaM pradaSyante. arTavAdaSca viDinizeDaBinnaH SabdaH. yaTA-Adityo yUpaH agnirhimasya Bezajam vajrahastaH puraMdara ityAdi (ta0 kO0 4 pf0 17). atrAdyaM guRavAdodAharaRam. dvitIyamanuvAdodAharaRam. tftIyaM BUtArTavAdodAharaRam. prASastyanindAnyataraparaM vAkyaM cArTavAdaH (lO0 BA0). yaTA vAyurvE kzepizWA devatetyAdiH. sorodIdityAdirvA. atra ca vAyavya‍ SvetamAlaBeta BUtikAmo vAyurvE kzepizWA devatA tatra<BR>;p{0078}<BR>vAyumeva svena BAgaDeyenopaDAvati sa evEnaM BUtiM gamayati. (kfzRayajuHsaMhitA 2. 1. 1) ityAdO vAyurvE kzepizWetyAdyarTavAdo hi vAyavya SvetamAlaBetetyAdiviDivihitaM SvetapaSvAlamBanaM SvetapaSukaraRako yAgaH praSastaH iti praSaMsatIti vijYeyam. sorodIdyadarodIttadrudrasya rudratvam (kfzRayajuH 0 1. 5. 1) iti vAkyaM tu ftAvftvigByo rajataM na deyam iti nizidDaM rajatadakziRAdAnaM nindatIti boDyam. arTavAdaScaturviDaH. stutiH nindA parakftiH purAkalpaH (gO0 2. 1. 64). prakArAntareRa sa triviDaH. guRavAdaH anuvAdaH BUtArTavAdaSceti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 30). taduktamviroDe guRavAdaH syAdanuvAdovaDArite. BUtArTavAdastadDAnAdarTavAdatriDA mataH.. iti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31). mImAMsakAstu viDiSezaH nizeDaSezaScetyarTavAdaM dvEviDyena viBejire (lO0 BA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थान्तरम्
arTAntaram — (nigrahasTAnam) [ka] prakftAdarTAdapratisaMbadDArTamarTAntaram (gO0 5. 2. 7). yaToktalakzaRe pakzapratipakzaparigrahe hetutaH sADyasidDO prakftAyAM brUyAt. nityaH SabdaH asparSatvAditi hetuH. heturnAma hinoterDAtostuni pratyaye kfdantapadam. padaM ca nAmAKyAtopasarganipAtAH aBiDeyasya kriyAntarayogAdviSizyamARarUpaH Sabdo nAma. kriyAkArakasamudAyaH. kArakasaMKyAviSizwakriyAkAlayogABiDAyyAKyAtam. DAtvarTamAtraM ca kAlABiDAnaviSizwam. prayogezvarTAdaBidyamAnarUpA nipAtAH. upasfjyamAnAH kriyAvadyotakA upasargAH ityevamAdi. tadarTAntaraM veditavyam (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 7) (nIla0 pf0 45). [Ka] prakftopayuktamarTamupekzyAsaMbadDArTABiDAnam. prakftAnAkANkzitABiDAnamiti PalitArTaH. yaTA anityaH SabdaH kftakatvAdityuktvA Sabdo guRaH sa cAkASasyetyAdi (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 7) (ta0 BA0 pf0 51) (di0 1 pf0 22).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0078" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्थापत्तिः
arTApattiH — (anumAnam) [ka] vAkyArTasaMpratyayenAnaBihitasyArTasya pratyanIkaBAvAgrahaRamarTApattiH (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 2). [Ka] anupapadyamAnenArTenopapAdakakalpanam<BR>;p{0079}<BR>. yaTA vfzwyA meGajYAnam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 1). [ga] yatrABiDIyamAnerTe yonyorTaH prasajyate sorTApattiH. yaTA meGezvasatsu vfzwirna BavatIti. kimatra prasajyate. satsu BavatIti (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 1). [Ga] punaranusaMDIyamAnaSabdA sahakftamanupapattijYAnamiti gadADaraBawwAcAryAH. [Na] upapAdyajYAnenopapAdakakalpanamarTApattiH. tatra upapAdyajYAnaM karaRam. upapAdakajYAnaM Palam. yena vinA yadanupapannaM tattatropapAdyam. yasyABAve yasyAnupapattistattatropapAdakam. yaTA rAtriBojanena vinA divA aBuYjAnasya pInatvamanupapannamiti tAdfSapInatvamupapAdyam. yaTA vA rAtriBojanasyABAve tAdfSapInatvasyAnupapattiriti rAtriBojanamupapAdakam. atra arTasya ApattirnAma kalpaneti zazWIsamAsena rAtriBojanakalpanArUpAyAM pramitAvarTApattiSabdo vartate. arTasya ApattirnAma kalpanA yasmAditi bahuvrIhisamAsena kalpanAyAH karaRaBUte pInatvAdijYAnepi vartate. evaM ca PalakaraRayoruBayorarTApattipadaprayogo Bavati. sA cArTApattirdviviDA - dfzwArTApattiH SrutArTApattiSceti. tatra dfzwArTApattiryaTA idaM rajatamiti purovartini pratipannasya rajatasya nedaM rajatamiti tatrEva niziDyamAnatvaM satyatve satiM anupapannamiti rajatasya miDyAtvaM kalpayati. SrutArTApattiryaTA yatra SrUyamARavAkyasya svArTAnupapattimuKenArTAntarakalpanaM sA. yaTA tarati SokamAtmavidityatra Srutasya SokaSabdavAcyabanDajAtasya jYAnanivartyasyAnupapattyA banDasya miDyAtvaM kalpyate. SrutArTApattiSca dviviDA-aBiDAnAnupapattiraBihitAnupapattiSca. tatra yatra vAkyEkadeSaSravaRe anvayABiDAnAnupapattyA anvayABiDAnopayoga padAntaraM kalpyate tatrABiDAnAnupapattiH. yaTA dvAramityatra piDehItyaDyAhAraH. aBihitAnupapattistuyatra vAkyAvagatorTonupapannatvena jYAtaH sannarTAntaraM kalpayati tatra drazwavyA. yaTA svargakAmo jyotizwomena yajetetyatra kzaRikatayA avagatajyotizwomasya svargasADanatvAnupapattyA maDyavartya pUrvaM kalpyate. atra nEyAyikAH-arTApattirna