arTApattisamaH — (jAtiH) [ka] arTApattitaH pratipakzasidDerarTApattisamaH (gO0 5. 1. 21). anityaH SabdaH prayatnAnantarIyakatvAdGawavaditi sTApite pakze arTApattyA pratipakzaM sADayatorTApattisamaH. yadi prayatnAnantarIyakatvAdanityasADarmyAdanityaH Sabda iti arTAdApadyate nityasADarmyAnnityaH iti. asti tvasya nityena sADarmyamasparSatvamiti (vAtsyA05. 1. 21). [Ka] arTApattyABAsena pratipakzasADanAya pratyavasTAnam. ayamASayaH - arTApatti kenAnuktamAkzipati. yaTA-anityaH Sabda ityuktarTAdApadyatenyannityam. taTA ca dfzwAntAsidDirviroDaSca. kftakatvAdanitya ityukterTAdApannam anyasmAdDetorvADaH satpratipakzo vA. anumAnAdanitya ityukte pratyakzAnnitya iti ca bADaH (gO0 pf0 5. 1. 21). [ga] arTApattipuraskAreRa sADyABAvodBAvanam. yaTA anityaH SabdaH kAryatvAdityAdO SabdasyAnityasADarmyAdanityatvaM yadi tadA arTApattyA sidDaM nityasADarmyAnnityatvamapi. ekatarAvaDAraRe niyAmakABAvAditi (nIla0 pf0 44). [Ga] vyAptiM vinA vAdivAkyAdarTApekzABimAnataH. viparItasamAropamarTApattisamaM viduH.. (tA0 ra0 2 Slo0 120)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0080" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

