आकाङ्क्षा
AkANkzA — [ka] aBiDAnAparyavasAnam. iyaM ca jYAtA satI SAbdaboDe Sabdasya sahakAriRI. ata eva gOravaH puruzo hastItyAdO nAnvayaboDaH<BR>;p{0112}<BR>AkANkzAvirahAt (ta0 kO0 4 pf0 17) (ta0 saM0). tadarTastu yasya yena vinA svArTAnvayAnanuBAvakatvam tasya tatpadasaMniDAnam iti (ci0). [Ka] svarUpayogyatve satyajanitAntrayaboDajanakatvam (tarkA 0 4 pf0 10). tena GawaH karmatvam Anayanam kftiH ityatra nAnvayaboDaH. svarUpAyogyatvAt. taTA ayameti putro rAjYaH. puruzopasAryatAm. ityatra rAjYaH puruzaH iti nAnvayaboDaH. putreRa janitAnvayaboDakatvAt (tarkA 0 4 pf0 10). [ga] yatpadaM yatpadena saha yAdfSAnuBavajanakaM Bavet tatpadasya tatpadasamaBivyAhArastAdfSAnvayaboDa AkANkzA. Bavati hi nAmapadam uttaravartiviBaktipadenEva sahAnvayaboDakam. atastatsamaBivyAhArastAdfSAnvayaboDa AkANkzA. ata eva GawaH karmatvam Anayanam kftiH iti vAkyAt GawamAnaya itivat na Gawakarma kAnayanAnukUlakftimAn iti boDaH. AkANkzAvirahAt (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 21). [Ga] padasya padAntaravyatirekaprayuktAnvayAnanuBAvakatvam (ta0saM0 4) (ku0) (mu0 4 pf0 188). tadarTaSca yatpadasya yatpadABAvaprayuktamanvayaboDAjanakatvaM tatpadasamaBivyAhftatatpadatvam (nIla0 4 pf0 32) (mu0). [Na] yasya padasya yena padena vinAnvayaboDajanakatvaM nAsti tasya padasya tena padena samaBivyAhAra AkANkzA (ta0 kO0 2 pf016) (pra0 pra0). yaTA GawamAnayetyAdO kriyApadakArakapadayorAkANkzA. atra kArakapadasya kriyApadena vinA GawakarmakamAnayanam ityanvayaboDajanakatvABAvAtkArakapadasya kriyApadena sahAkANkzA. evaM kriyApadasya kArakapadenApi saha boDyA (pra0 pra0) (ta0 kO0 pf0 1617). vastutastu pratyaye prakftyuttaratvamevAkANkzA (mu0 4 pf0 188). evaM vEyAkaraRamate viBaktiDAtvAKyAtakriyAkArakapadAnAM parasparaM vinA parasparasya na svArTAnvayAnuBAvakatvam (vAca0). [ca] prakftAnvayavoDasamAnAkArasvajanyAnvayaboDavirahaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 22). ato GawamAnayati iti padaM ekadA<BR>;p{0113}<BR>anvayaboDe janite nAnvayaboDAntaraM janayati. svajanyAnvayaboDavEDuryavirahAt. itaH sarve svarUpasantaH SAbdaboDe hetavaH na tu jYAtA iti jYeyam (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 22). [Ca] padArTasaMsargAvagamaprAgaBAvaH (ku0 3). [ja] samaBivyAhfta padasmAritapadArTa jijYAsA. yaTA Gawamityukta Anaya paSya iti Anayetyukte GawaM pawaM vA iti jijYAsA (ku0 wI0 13). [Ja] ekapadArTajYAne tadarTAnvayayogyArTasya yajjYAnaM tadvizayecCeti SAbdikA vadanti. [Ya] padArTAnAM parasparajijYAsAvizayatvayogyatvamAkANketi mAyAvAdinaH (vedA0 pa0). AkANkzA dviviDA. utTApyAkANkzA utTitAkANkzA ceti. atredaM jYeyam AkANkzA ca SAbdaboDagocarecCA SabdenEva vizayasidDidvArA nivartyate atrAyaM nyAyaH. SAbdI hyAkANkzA SabdenEva prapUryate iti. anena SabdakalpanA AvaSyakI iti vijYeyam. (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकारः
AkAraH — 1 vizayatA nirUpyanirUpakaBAvApannatattadvizayatA. vA yaTA ayaM GawaH ityAkArakaM jYAnamityAdO tAdfSavizayatA (vAkyArTa0 2 pf0 20). 2 aBedaH (tAdAtmyam). yaTA ityAkArakaM jYAnamityAdO (vAkyArTa 0). yaTA vA taTA cAyam ityAkAra upanaya ityAdO (dIDi0 pf0 170). 3 aBinayaH. udAharaRaM tu pUrvoktameva ityAkAra upanaya iti. 4 avayavasaMsTAnaviSeza iti kAvyajYA vadanti. 5 sAMKyAstu aBedasTAnIyaH padArTaviSezaH vizayitAviSezo vA. yaTA yatsaMbadDaM sat tadAkArolleKi vijYAnaM tatpratyakzamityAdO ityAhuH (sAM0 sU0). 6 varRaviSeza AkAra iti SAbdikAH. 7 ataTABUtasya taTABUtena sAmAnyam. tadyaTA sTARvAkAraH pumAn ityatra puruzasya sTARorAkAraH puruzeRa yat sAmAnyam saH (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 13—14 pf0 76).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

