आकाशम्
AkASam — (dravyam) [ka] saMyogAjanyajanyaviSezaguRasamAnADikaraRaviSezADikaraRam (sarva0 OlU0 pf0 218). tadyaTA saMyogAjanyo yo janyaviSezaguRaH viBAgajaH SabdaH tatsamAnADikaraRo viSezaH padArTa praBedaH tadaDikaraRatvamAkASestIti. atra janyaviSezaguRaH pAkajarUpAdiH tatsamAnADikaraRaviSezADikaraRe pArTivaparamARAvativyAptivAraRAya saMyogAjanyeti. paramAtmanyativyAptivAraRAya janyeti. uBayaM ca viSezaguRaviSezaRam iti boDyam. AkASatvaM ca SabdasamavAyikAraRatvam (ta0 kO0 1 0 7) (mu0 1 pf0 52). AkASasattve pramARamanumAnam. tacca SabdaH pfTivyAdyazwadravyAtiriktadravyASritaH azwadravyAnASritatve sati samavAyikAraRavattvAt yannEvaM tannEvaM yaTA rUpamiti (si0 ca0 1 pf0 9). yadyapyAkASotIndriyastaTApi vilakzaRaSabdAtmakakAryAnyaTAnupapattyA sa svIkaraRIyaH (pra0 pra0). aTavA Sabdo guRaH cakzurgrahaRAyogya bahirindriyagrAhyajAtimattvAtsparSavat Sabdo dravyasamaveto guRatvAtsaMyogavat ityanumAnAByAM Sabdasya dravyasamavetatve sidDe pfTivyAdyazwasu dravyezu SabdADikaraRatvasya bADAt SabdADikaraRaM navamaM dravyaM gagananAmakaM siDyati (mu0 1 pf0 8687) (vE0 sU0 2. 1. 27) (vE0 u0 2. 1127). SAbdikAstu idaM nakzatracakramatra tizWati atrEtadaBAvaH iti nirdizwavastuvizaye pfTivyAderADAratvAsaMBavena tadADArasyEvAkASasaMjYakatvam ityAhuH (la0 ma0). tatroktaM hariRA. ADAraSaktiH praTamA sarvasaMyoginAmayam. idamatreti BAvAnAmaBAvAnAM ca kalpyate.. 1.. vyapadeSastamAkASanimittaM tu pracakzate. kAlAtkriyA viBajyante AkASAtsarvamUrtayaH.. 2.. etAvAneva BedoyamaBedopanibanDanaH iti (vAkyapa0). sAMKyAstu nizkramaRAdikaM karma AkASAnumApakam iti AhuH (vE0 sU0 2. 1. 20) (ta0 va0 pf0 128). ayaM BAvaH. nizkramaRapraveSanAdyutkzepaRaDarmavattvAdAkASasidDiriti sAMKyAdayo manyante. etadaBiprAyeRa suSrute uktam, antarikzAtu SabdaH SabdendriyaM sarvacCidrasamUho viviktatA<BR>;p{0115}<BR>ceti. vedAntinopi SabdaH SrotrendriyaM cApi CidrARi ca viviktatA. viyato darSitA ete guRA guRavicAriBiH.. ityAhuH (vAca). atredaM (boDyam. pradeSavadravyasaMyogAt ayamAkASasya pradeSaH iti vyavahAro Bavati iti (ta0 va0 pf0 128). kAraRadravyaM pradeSaSabdenABiDIyate (gO0 2. 2. 18). [Ka] SabdasamavAyikAraRam. ga] SabdaguRakam. taccEkaM viBu nityaM ca. tacca lAGavAdekam. sarvatra kAryopalamBAdviBu. viButvAcca nityam. taTApi karRaSazkulyavacCinnaM sat SabdagrAhakaSrotrendriyAtmakam (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 3) (BA0 pa0 lo0 4546) (vE0 sU0 2. 1. 2830). atra viButvaM ca paramamahatparimARayogaH (vE0 u0 7. 1. 22) (mu0 1 pf0 17). aTavA sarvamUrtadravyasaMyogitvam. idameva sarvagatatvamityucyate (mu0 1 pf0 57). AkASe zaqguRAstizWanti. saMKyA paramamahatparimARam ekapfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH SabdaSceti (vE0 sU0 2. 1. 31) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 33) (ta0 BA0 pf0 30) (ta0 kO0 pf0 3) (ta0 saM0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकुञ्चनम्
AkuYcanam — (karma) [ka] SarIrasaMnikfzwasaMyogahetuH karma (ta0 saM0) (ta0 kO0 pf0 20). lakzaRaM ca svasaMnikfzwadeSasaMyogajanakakriyAnukUlakriyAtvam (la0va0 pf0 38). vakranAsaMpAdakaM karmetyarTaH (ta0 dI0 pf0 39). [Ka] satyAramBakasaMyogepyanyasaMyogakAraRam. aNgakOwilyajanakaM karmAkuYcanamucyate.. (ta0 va0 pf0 241). [ga] fjuno dravyasyAprAvayavAnAM taddeSErviBAgaH saMyogaSca mUlapradeSEH yena karmaRA Bavati avayavI ca kuwilaH saMjAyate tadAkuYcanam (praSasta0 pf0 56).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकृतिः
AkftiH — [ka] AkftirjAtiliNgAKyA (gO0 2. 2. 67). tadarTaSca jAtiliNgamityAKyA yasyAH. jAtergotvAderhi sAsnAdisaMsTAnaviSezo liNgam. tasya ca paraMparayA dravyavfttitvam (go0 vf0 2. 2. 67). yayA jAtirjAtiliNgAni ca praKyAyante tAmAkftiM vidyAt. sA ca<BR>;p{0116}<BR>nAnyA sattvAnAM tadavayavAnAM ca niyatAdvayUhAditi. niyatAvayavavyUhAH Kalu sattvAvayatrA jAtiliNgam. SirasA pAdena gAmanuminvanti. niyate ca sattvAvayavAnAM vyUhe sati gotvaM praKyAyata iti (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 67). [Ka] avayavasaMsTAnaviSezaH. yaTA Gawasya kambugrIvAdirAkftiH (di0 4 pf0 178). [ga] rUpakriyAdiviSizwamavayavasaMsTAnaM jAtiliNgamevAkftiriti SAbdikA vadanti. AkftiSca SakyArTa eveti kecit (pataYjalipraBftayaH) manyante (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्षेपः
AkzepaH — 1 arTApattiH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 6) (nIla0 pf0 28). arTApattirityasyAnumitirityarTaH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 39). 2 samAnavittivedyatvamAkzepa iti guravaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 6). 3 AkzepacAnumAnamarTApattirveti BawwAH (ga0 Sakti0). atra bahUnAM vipratipattirudAhriyate. gavAdipadAnAM gotva eva SaktiH vyaktilABastvAkzepAditi mImAMsakAH. tatra gotvaM hi svASrayaM vinAnupapannamiti tamAkzipatIti BawwAH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 6) (mu0 4 pf0 170) (ta0 dI0 4 pf0 28) (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 41). jAtivAcakapadAjAtiboDaH SAbdaH. vyaktiboDastvOpAdAnika eveti SrIkaramatam. atrO pAdAnikatvaM ca upAdAnamarTApattistatprayojyatvam jAtikAraRatvaM vA (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 46). vyakterapi boDaH SabdAdeva na tvAkzepAditaH. vyaktiSAbdaboDe Saktiviraho nAnupapatti prayojayati. lakzaRAta eva tadupapattiriti maRqanAcAryamatam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 46).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

