आख्यातम्
AKyAtam — tiNpratyayAnAm AKyAtam iti saMjYA. atotrAKyAtapadena tip tas Ji ityAdayozwAdaSa pratyayA vEyAkaraRasaMmatA gfhyante. tiNpratyayArTastu [ka] kftiH. yaTA cEtrastaRqulaM pacatItyAdO tibarTaH<BR>;p{0117}<BR>[Ka] kriyAjanakavyApAramAtramiti BawwamImAMsakAH (ma0pra0). [ga] utpAdanA. sA cotpAdakateti ratnakoSakft (ci0 4). [Ga] kartA karma cAKyAtArTa iti SAbdikA vadanti (ma0pra0 pf0 55). AKyAtapadaM vEyAkaraRamatepi tiNparamiti matvedamuktam. vastuto vEyAkaraRamata AKyAtaM nAma tiNantam (Sabde0 Se0 samA0 pf0 236) iti boDyam. vartamAnAdikAlaSca tiNarTaH (ma0pra0 pf0 55). ekatvAdisaMKyA ca tiNarTaH (ci0 4). AKyAtatvaM daSalakArasADAraRam (lO0 BA0). sarvatra AKyAtArTo BAvaneti mImAMsakAH. maRikftastu (gaNgeSopADyAyAH) jAnAtItyAdO yatno nAKyAtasyArTaH kiM tu kAlasaMKye uBe evetyAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 19).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

