उत्पत्तिः
utpattiH — atra bahavo vipratipadyante. asataH sadutpadyate iti bOdDAH. prAgutpatterasat kAraRavyApArAdutpadyate iti nEyAyikAH. sata eva kAraRAt asataH kAryasya kAraRavyApArAt utpattirityarTaH. utpatteH prAgasat utpattikAle ca saditi tadBAvaH. prAgutpatteH sadapi kAraRavyApArAdaBivyajyate iti sAMKyAH mAyAvAdi vedAntinaSca pratipedire. yaTA pIqanena tilezu tElasya avaGAtena DAnyezu taRqulAnAm dohanena sOrameyIzu payasaH aBivyaktiH tadvat. tatra sato vivarta iti mAyAvAdinAM matam. pariRAma iti sAMKyAnAM matam (vAca0). utpattiSabdArTastu AdyakzaRasaMbanDaH. sa ca [ka] svADikaraRakzaRAvfttiprAgaBAvapratiyogikzaRasaMbanDaH (Atmata0 vyA0 Siroma 0) (vAca0 (vAca0) (ma0 pra0 1 pf0 12) (ta0 pra0 1). [Ka] svADikaraRaDvaMsAnaDikaraRakzaRasaMbanDo vA (ma0pra0 1 pf0 12) (ta0 pra0 1). yaTA utpattimAnaBAvo DvaMsa ityAdAvutpattiH. yaTA vA GawapawAde - rutpattiH. svam utpadyamAnatvenABimataM GawAdi (ma0pra0 1 pf0 12). kzaRaSca svajanyaviBAgaprAgaBAvAvacCinnaM karma. atra svam utpadyamAnaM karma (ma0 pra0 pf0 12). [ga] yo yatkAlavfttiDvaMsayogyavfttistasya tadvfttitvamutpattirityapi kecit (dIDi0 2). [Ga] svavfttiDvaMsapratiyogikAlAvfttitvaviSizwasvavfttitvam<BR>;p{0152}<BR>. idaM ca mahApralaye kzaRavyavahArAnaNgIkArepi mahApralayasyotpattiH saMpadyata ityaBiprAyeRoktamiti vijYeyam (di0 1 pf0 13). [Na] tadaDikaraRakzaRAvfttitvavyApyastvavfttiDvaMsa pratiyogitAka samaya vfttitvam. tatpadamutpatsyamAna padArTaparam. taTA ca yadaDikaraRa gAvfttitvasya vyApyA yatsamayavfttiDvaMsapratiyogitA tasya tatsamayavfttitvam iti (rAma 0 1. 1. 92). idaM ca mahApralayasyApi kzaRatvaM vartate ityaBiprAyeRoktamiti vijYeyam (dina0 1 pf0 92). [ca] yatsamayavfttiDvaMsapratiyogitAvyApakaM tatkAryADikaraRakzaRavfttitvaM tatsamayavfttitvamiti kecit (di0). sA dviviDA. svata utpattiH parata utpattiSca. tatrAdyA yaTA mImAMsakanaye svataH pramAtvasyotpattiH. dvitIyA yaTA GawAdInAmutpattiH. sakalakAraRayogapadyamutpattiriti kecit. Atmana utpattistu dehasaMgatiH (tA0 ra0 Slo0 21).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

