कर्तृत्वम्
kartftvam — (kArakam). kartfSabdovayavavfttilaBye kftyASraye yOgikaH. [ka] savikaraRena yadvAtunopasTApyo yAdfSArTastaduttaratiNA svopasTApyayAdfSArTenuBAvayituM SakyaH tadDAtUpasTApyasya tasya tadeva kartftvam. yaTA pacati jAnAtItyAdO. atra svopasTApyakftyASrayatvAdO DAtUpasTApyasya pAkabudDyAderanvayaH pacAdyuttaratiNA voDyata iti pAkasya yatnavattvaM jYAnasyASrayatvaM ca kartftvam. evaM naSyatItyatra nASasya pratiyogitvam. prativimbata ityatra BramAtmanaH pratibimbasya prakAratvameva kartftvam. karmatvAdA DAtunopasTApyorTastiNAnuBAvyopi na vikaraRAktena iti na prasaNgaH. idaM kartftvaM ca atti juhotItyadAvapyadAdyuttaraM luptasyEva vikaraRasya pratisaMDAne BojanakartftvAdevagama iti matABiprAyeRa boDyam (Sa0 pra0 pf0 103). [Ka] yagantaBinnaDAtUpasTApyayAdfSArTa prakArakayadarTa DarmikAnvayaboDaM prati lawaH sAmarTyam. sa evArTo DAtUpasTApyatadarTasya kartftvam. idaM kartftvaM cAtti juhotItyAdO luptasya vikaraRasyApratisaMDAnepi Bavati iti matABiprAyeRa boDyam. pacyate taRqulaH ityAdO DAtorarTavattayA svArTakarmatvaM lawAnuBAvyamapi na yagantaBinnasya. pakzyate taRqula ityAdO tu tAdfSasya DAtorarTavattayA tiNeva svArTaH karmatvamanuBAvyate na tadviSezeRa lawA iti tadvyudAsaH (Sa0pra0 pf0 104). [ga] kriyAyAH kftervA samavAyitvam (ci0 1,4). idaM nEyAyikamatAnusAri muKyaM kartftvam. tanmate acetane kAzWAdO - kartfpadaprayogastu gORaH. kriyASrayatvaM kartftvamiti vEyAkaraRAH (kA0 ;p{0204}.<BR>vyA0 pf0 2). tanmate acetana kAzWAdInAmapi muKyaM kartftvamizwameva iti vijYeyam. idamatrAvaDeyam. kArakakarmAdipadavatkartfpadepi kfDAtuH kriyArTaka eva acetanasADAraRyAya grAhyaH. ASrayatvamiha tattadAKyAtArTadvArA. taTA ca yagAdyasamaBivyAhftAKyAtena yadDAtvarTAnvitayadDarmavattvaM boDyate tadDAtvarTanirUpitaDarmavattvaM tadDAtvarTakartftvam. yaTA pacatItyAdO pAkAdyanukUlavyApAravattvam jAnAtItyAdO jYAnAdyASrayatvam naSyatItyAdO nASapratiyogitvam iti. cEtreRa pacyata ityAdO pAkajanya PalASrayatvavAraRAya yagAdyasamaBivyAhfteti. atra cEtrAdeH kartftvaM pacatItyAKyAtaboDyaM DarmamAdAyEveti jYeyam (kA0 vyA0 pf0 2). [Ga] upAdAnagocarAparokzajYAnacikIrzAM kftimattvam. yaTA ISvarasya dvyaRukAdikartftvam (ta0 dI0 1 Atma0 pf0 11). yaTA vA kulAlasya Gawakartftvam. idaM ca prAcInanEyAyikamatAnusAri muKyaM kartftvam. [Na] itarakArakAprayojyatve sati sakalakArakaprayoktftvam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 254 akza0). yaTA cEtro grAmaM gacCatItyAdO cEtrasya kartftvam. 1. kvacit vyApArASrayatvam. yaTA raTo gacCatItyAdO raTAdeH kartftvam. kvacit pratiyogitvam. yaTA Gawo naSyatItyAdO Gawasya kartftvam. kacit kfvacCedakatvam. yaTA SarIrasya kartftvam (gO0 vf0 3. 1. 6). kvacidityevamuktAnImAni trIRi sarvezAM mate gORAni kartftvAni iti vijYeyam. SAbdikAstu<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्तृप्रत्यय
kartfpratyaya — (SapaSyanAdipratyaya -) samaBivyAhftaDAtUpAttapraDAnIBUtavyApArASrayatvam. aTavA kartfsaMjYAboDitakartftvaSaktimattvam. yaTA cEtrastaRqulaM pacatItyAdo cEtrasya kartftvam (la0 ma0subarTa0 pf0 95) iti vadanti. sA SaktiSca kartfpratyayasamaBivyAhAre vyApAratAvacCedakasaMbanDena tadDAtvarTanizWaviSezyatAnirUpitaprakAratAnASrayatadDAtvarTASrayaScam (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 95). atredaM boDyam. karaRADikaraRakarmaRAmeva vivakzayA kartftvamiti nApAdAnasaMpradAnayoH kartftvamiti mahABAzyakArAH. utpattimAtre kartftvaM sarvatrEvAsti kArake. vyApAraBedApekzAyAM karaRatvAdisaMBavaH. ityanayA kArikayA vivakzAvaSAtsarvezAM<BR>;p{0205}<BR>kartftvaM hariRoktam iti (vAca0) (la0 ma0 suba 0 pf0 84). anukUlakfti madantaHkaraRaprakftitvaM kartftvamiti sAMKyA AhuH. nyAyanaye kartftvaM dviviDam muKyaM gORaM ceti. tatrAdyaM kftimattvam. dvitIyam ASrayatvapratiyogitvAdi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्म
karma — 1 (padArTaH) [ka] ekadravyamaguRaM saMyogaviBAgezvanapekzakAraRamiti karmalakzaRam (vE0 1. 1. 17). atra ekadravyatvaM ca ekamAtramUrtasamavAyikAraRakatvam (vE0 u0 2. 1. 21). mUrtamAtrasamavetatvaM vA (vE0 vi0 2. 1. 21). saMyogetyAdeH saMyogaviBAgayornirapekza kAraRamityarTaH. saMyogaviBAgayoH pratyekameva kAraRatvam na militayoH (ta0 va0 pf0 240). karma ca saMyogaviBAgayoH svAnantarotpannaBAvanErapekzyeRa kAraRam (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 17) (mu0 gu0 pf0 198). atra nirapekzatvaM ca svotpattyanantarotpattikAnapekzatvam. pUrvasaMyogaDvaMsastu svotpattyanantarAnutpattika eva. aBAvatvena tasyAdyakzaRasaMbanDABAvAt (vE0 u0 1. 1. 17). tacca karma mUrtadravyamAtrasamavetam anityameva. uttarasaMyogAt kadAcidASrayanASAcca naSyati iti jYeyam (ta0 kO0 pf0 20). taTAhi praTamaM dravye karmotpadyate. tato viBAgaH. tataH pUrvasaMyoganASaH. tata uttaradeSasaMyogaH dravyanASaSca. tataH karmanASaH iti. karma paYcaviDam. UDvaM cADaScABimuKaM tiryagvizvagiti kramAt. tAni paYcApi karmARi daSa saMyogaBedataH.. iti (tA0 ra0 Slo0 52). [Ka] calanAtmakam (ta0 saM0). saMyogaviBAgAnukUlamityarTaH (vAkya0 pf0 22). [ga] saMyogaBinnatve sati saMyogAsamavAyikAraRam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 6). [Ga] karmatvajAtimat (ta0 dI0 1 0 6) (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 1). tallakzaRaM tu viBAgAsamavAyikAraRatve sati saMyogahetutvam (di0 gu0 pf0 198). nityAvfttisattAsAkzAdvayApyajAtirUpaM karmatvam (vE0 u0 1. 1. 17). nityAvfttipadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (la0 va0). anekASritAvfttisattAsAkzAdvayApyajAti<BR>;p{0206}<BR>matttram (ta0 va0 pari0 16 pf0 240) (vE0 u0 2. 1. 17) ityAdi boDyam. saMyoga eva karmeti BUzaRamatam (pra0 pra0). BUzaRamate saMyogApekzayA karmaRotiriktatvaM nAstIti vijYeyam (di0 1 pf0 19). nyAyavESezikanaye karma paYcaviDam. utkzepaRam apakzepaRam AkuYcanam prasAraRam gamanaM ceti (cE0 1. 1. 7) (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 1 (ta0 saM0) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 6). gamanalakzaRaM cotkzepaRAdicatuzwayaBinnatve sati karmatvavyApyajAtimattvam (vE0 u0 1. 17). tacca gaganaM bahuviDam BramaRam recanam spandanam UrDvajvalanam tiryaggamanam iti. (BA0 pa0 1 0 7). BramaRAdiprakAraH SikzitASvagatyAdO prasidDa iti SrUyate. BramaRAdizu gamanatvajAtestvaniyata digdeSasaMyogaviBAgAsamavAyikAraRatvameva vyaYjakam iti jYeyam (vE0 u0 1. 1. 7) (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 7). utkzepaRAdInAM paYcAnAmapi karmatva saMbanDaH ekadravyavfttittram kzaRikatvam mUrtadravyavfttitvam aguRavattvam gurutvadravatvaprayatna saMyogajanyattram svakArya saMyogaviroDittram saMyogaviBAganirapekza kAraRatvam asamavAyikAraRatvam svaparASrayasamavetakAryAramBakatvaM ca. vastutaH karmEkaviDameva nizkramaRatvapraveSanatyAdivadutkzepaRatvAderjAtitvABAvena BedakatvABAvAt iti vijYeyam (pa0 mA0). 2 kriyate PalArTiBiriti karma DarmADarmAtmakaM vI jANkuravatpravAharUpeRAnAdi (sarva 0 saM0 pf0 188 SEtra0). yaTA karmaREva hi saMsidDimAsTitA janakAdayaH (gItA0 3. 20) ityAdI. karmARi zaw SAntikaraRam vaSIkaraRam stamBanam vidvezaH uccAwanam mAraRaM ceti. ete zaw prayogAstatrAdyuktAH. yajanam yAjanam aDyayanam aDyApanam dAnam pratigrahaSceti etAni brAhmaRasya zaw karmARi. DOtirbastistaTA netinalikI trAwakastaTA. kapAlaBAtiScEtAni zaw karmARi samAcaret.. ityanenoktAni SudDikarARi zaw karmARi haWayogANgAni (vAca0). kecittu karma triviDam nityaM kAmyaM nityakAmyaM ceti. tatra kevalaM nityaM saMDyAvandanAdi. kevalaM kAmyaM yAgAdi. nityakAmyaM tu ekAdaSItratAdItyAhuH. etadvatasyAkaraRe<BR>;p{0207}<BR>pratyavAyaSravaRAnnityatvam. putrAdikAmanASravaRAtkAmyatvamapi saMgacCate (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 103). mImAMsakanaye nityam nEmittikam kAmyaM ceti triviDaM karma (vyAsasmf0). tatra yadakaraRe pratyavAyastannityam. yaTA saMDyopAsanAdi. aniyatanimittakaM nEmittikam. yaTA grahaRaSrAdDAdi. tatra rAhUparAgasyAniyatasyEva nimittatvAt. atra nityatvaM ca pratyavAyasADanIBUtABAvapratiyogitvam. niyatanimittakatvamiti yAvat. saMDyopAsanAdO prAtarAdisamayasya niyatasyEva nimittatvAt (ma0 pra0 4 paM0 60). aTavA PalakAmanAnaDInakartfkatvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 103). nEmittikatvaM ca nimittaniScayADInakartavyatAkatvam. yaTA vA jAtezwyAdO (vAca0). kAmyaM tu PalakAmanADIna kartavyatAkaM karma. yaTA svargoddeSena kftaM aSvameDayAgAdi (ma0pra0 4 pf0 60) (vA0) sAttvikarAjasatAmasaBedena triviDaM karmeti vedAntinaH (gItA 18. 2325). vedAntinAM mate karma puRyapApajanakam. tacca dviviDam saMcitam prArabDaM ceti. tatra anArabDa-, vipAkaH karmASayaH saMcitam. tacca jYAnAgninA dahyate. ArabDavipAkaSca karmASayaH prArabDam. taccopaBogenEva naSyati iti boDyam. idaM ca SuklakfzRakfzRa SuklaBedenApi triviDam. tatrAdyam hiMsAdyanapekzaM puRyajanakaM svADyAyAdi. dvitIyam SAstranizidDaM pApajanakaM brahmahatyAdi. tftIyam hiMsAdisahitaM vedavihitaM puRyApuRyajanakaM paSuyAgAdi (vAca 0). 3 [ka] karturIpsitatamaM karma (1. 4. 49 pARi0) ityAdiBiH sUtrEryasya karmasaMjYA viDIyate tat. [Ka] parasamaveta kriyAPalaSAli (ci0 1). yaTA devadatto grAmaM gacCatItyAdO grAmaH karma. yaTA vA BUmiM prayAti vihago vijahAti mahIruhamityAdO BUmimahIruhO karmaRI (kA0 vyA0 pf0 3). yaTA vA annavadvizaM BuNka ityAdO vizam. atredaM boDyam. grAmaM gacCati devadattaH BUmiM prayAti vihaga ityAdO saMyogAnukUlaspandAtmakavyApAro gamDAtoryADAtoScArTaH. taTA ca saMyogAtmakaPalasya dvizWatvena devadattavihagAtmakakartrAdAvapi vfttitvAt<BR>;p{0208}<BR>devadatto vihagaSca svAtmAnaM gacCati prayAti ca iti prayogApattiH. tadvAraRAya parasamavetakriyAjanyatvam kriyAjanyaPale (mataBedena DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPale vA) viSezaRatvena niveSyam. itTaM ca dvitIyAdeH. kriyAnvayi parasamavetatvamapyarTaH. paratvaM ca svaprakftyarTApekzayA. svapadena dvitIyA gfhyate. idaM ca karmasAmAnyalakzaRam iti jYeyam. atra prAco nEyAyikAH kriyAjanyaPalaSAli karmetyAhuH. navyAstu DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAli karmepi prAhuH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 3638, kA0 4 pf0 93). PalaSAlitvaM ca PalAnuyogitvam. [ga] PalASrayatayezwam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 93). [Ga] SaSaDarAdayastu kAraRavyApAravizayaH karmetyAhuH (ci0 1) (kA0 vyA0 pf0 3). yaTA vrIhInprokzatItyAdO vrIhiH karma (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 19). yaTA vA cakzuzA GawaM jAnAtItyAdO GawaH karma. kacit vizayaH karma (ta0 pra0). yaTA BAvinaM GawaM jAnAtItyAdO GawaH karma (gORam). yaTA vA mAtuH smaratItyAdO mAtA karma (ma0 pra0 pf0 4, 6). atredaM boDyam. nEyAyikamate savizayArTakaDAtusamaBivyAhAre vizayatvAtmakaM gORaM karmatvam karturIpsitatamaM karma (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 49) ityanena boDyate. taTA ca GawavizayatASAlijYAnASrayatAvAn mAtfvizayakrasmaraRavAn iti boDaH. vEyAkaraRamate tu atrApi jYAnAnukUlavyApArasya smaraRAnukUlavyApArasya ca DAtvarTatvena muKyameva karmatvaM boDyate natu gORam. taTA ca vyApAramuKya viSezyaka eva sarvatra boDaH iti. divAkarastu saMskArAvacCinnameva jYAnaM jAnAtyarTa iti uktasTale muKyameva karmatvam ityAha (Sa0 pra0 pf0 101). kvacit pratiyogi karma. yaTA GawaM nASayatItyAdO GawaH karmeti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 3). karma dviviDam. praDAnakarma apraDAnakarma ceti. tatrAdyam gAM dogDi paya ityAdO payaH. dvitIyaM tu tatrEva gOH iti (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 91). atra gorapAdAnatvAvivakzAyAM akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 51) ityanena karmatvam.<BR>;p{0209}<BR>atra gORakarmaRi gavAdO lAdayaH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 91). SabdaSaktiprakASikAkftastu gAM dogDi paya ityAdO praDAnakarma gOH payastvapraDAnakarma ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 pf098). etattu pUrvaM (64 pfzWe) prapaYcitam tatra drazwavyam. prakArAntareRa IpsitatamaM karma triviDaM Bavati. prApyam prakfti vikftI ca. tatrAdyam kriyAjanyaPalaSAli. yaTA grAmaM gacCatItyAdO gamyAdi. GawaM jAnAtItyAdO jYAnAdervizayaSca. dvitIyaM ca kriyayA vastvantaranizpattaye pUrvaBAvaviSizwasya yasyAsattvarUpo vikAro nirvAhyate tat. yaTA taRqulAnodanaM pacatItyAdO pAkAstaRqulAdi. puzpARi mAlyaM karoti kASAnkawaM karoti ityAdO kfteSca puzpakASAdi. tftIyaM ca kriyayA nizpAdyaM yat tat. yaTA pAkAderodanAdi. yaTA vA kfteH mAlyAdi kawAdi ceti. tatra vikftirUpaM karma prakfterasamaBivyAhArasTale odanaM pacatItyAdO nirvartyamityucyate. tatroktam satI vAvidyamAnA[^1] vA prakftiH pariRAminI. yasya nASrIyate tasya nirvartyatvaM pracakzate.. iti. tadarTaSca yasya vikftikarmaRaH nASrIyate na prayujyate iti. taRqulAnodanamityatra taRqulAdirUpaDarminASAdeva pUrvaBAvaviSizwatadasattvam odanAdirUpakarmAntaranizpAdakaM kriyAto nirvahati iti voDyam. atretTamanvayaH. taRqulAnodanaM pacatItyAdO prakftikarmottaradvitIyAyAH taRqulAn ityatratyAyAH nASakatvamarTaH. taRqulAdyanvitaM nASakatvaM ca pAkenveti. vikftikarmottaradvitIyAyASca odanam ityatratyAyAH utpAdakatvamarTaH. odanAdyanvitasya tasya nASakatva viSizwe pAkenvayaH. nASe cotpatteH prayojakatvam uddeSyatAvacCedakaviDeyaBAvamahimnA niyamato BAsate. taTA ca odanotpAdako yastaRqulanASakaH pAkaH tadanukUlakftimAn iti taRqulAnodanaM pacatIti vAkyAdboDaH. evaM taRqulamodanaM karoti kAzWaM Basma karoti dugDaM daDi karoti ityAdAvapi prakftikarmottaradvitIyayA tannASakatvaM kftO pratyAyyate. vikftikarmottaradvitIyayA ca vizayatAviSeza utpAdakatvaM vA militaM vA kftO boDyate. atra taRqula<BR>;p{0210}<BR>nASikA yA odanotpAdikA odanavizayikA ca kftiH tadASrayaH iti SAbdaboDaH. evamanyatrApyUhyam. kASAnkawaM karoti puzpARi mAlyaM karotItyAdO DarmiRaH kASakusumAdeH sattvepi kawasaMdarBaviraharUpapUrvaBAvAsattvena tadviSizwasyAsattvaM kawasaMdarBAdinizpAdakaM kriyAto nirvahati iti jYeyam. atretTamanvayaH. kASAn kawaM karoti kusumAni mOktikAni vA srajaM karotItyAdO kASAdipadottaradvitIyA kftO vizayatAviSezameva boDayati. kASAdyucCedakatAyAstatra bADAt. kawamityAdO dvitIyArTaH pUrvavat. srajamityAdidvitIyAntasya viSizwasattvanirvAhakatvamarTaH. vinyAsAtmaka viSezotpAdakasyApi svarUpa saMbanDaviSezarUpaviSizwasattvanirvAhakatvamakzatameva. odanaM pacatItyatra taRqulAdirUpapUrvadravyaM vinASyOdanAdernirvartanaM kriyayA. puzpARi mAlyamityatra puzpAdirUpa pUrva dravyamavinASya tatrEva saMdarBAdirUpaviSeza nizpAdanena tadviSizwasya mAlyAdernirvartanaM kriyayA. kASAn kawaM karotItyAdO kASAdirUpapUrva DarmiRamavinASya tatrEva kawAdirUpaDarminizpAdanaM kriyayA (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 2 pf0 65). atra kASAdinizWavilakzaRavizayatAnirUpitavizayitAvatI yA kawAdivizayikA tadutpAdikA ca kftiH tadASrayaH iti boDaH. evamanyatrApi boDa UhyaH. prakArAntareRa vyAkaraRaSAstroktarItyA karma saptaviDaM Bavati. taTAhi nirvartyam vikAryam prApyam udAsInam dvezyam saMjYAntarEranAKyAtam anyapUrvakaM ceti. tatrAdyatrayam IpsitatamaM karma kartuH kriyayepsitatamavyApAraM Bavati (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 84). tadanyadavaSizwacatuzwayam iti vivekaH. tezAM saptAnAM maDye AdyaM yaTA GawaM karotItyAdO GawaH karma. dvitIyam somaM sunotItyAdO somaH. kAzwaM Basma karotItyAdO kAzWAdi vikAryaM BasmAdi ca nirvatyaM karma. tftIyam grAmaM gacCati GawaM jAnAtItyAdO grAmaGawAdi. caturTa yaTA grAmaM gacCan GawaM paSyatItyAdO GawaH. paYcamaM yaTA vizaM BuNka ityAdO vizam. atredaM voDyam. tAqanAdinA parADInatayA vizaBojanAdikaM Bavati. tatra vizAdi tAdfSaPalASrayatvenoddeSyameva. ata<BR>;p{0211}<BR>evArtasya vizamIpsitaM yattadBakzayatIti BAzyaM saMgacCate. tasmAccorAnpaSyatIti dvezyodAharaRam. vizayendriyasaMbanDAddfSyamAnA api na darSanoddeSya iti. zazWaM yaTA gAM dogDItyAdO gOH. saptamaM yaTA krUramaBikruDyatItyAdO krUraH karma iti. tatroktaM hariRA nirvatyaM ca vikAryaM ca prApyaM ceti triDA matam. taccepsitatamaM karma caturDAnyattu kalpitam.. OdAsInyena yatprApyaM yacca karturanIpsitam. saMjYAntarEranAKyAtaM yadyaccApyanyapUrvakam.. iti. tatra vikAryamapi dviviDam. kvacit prakftyucCedaH kacittu guRAntarotpattimAtram iti. tatrAdyam kAzWaM Basma karoti iti. dvitIyaM tu suvaRaM kuRqalaM karoti iti (vE0 sA0 pf0 169). taccoktaM hariRA vikAryaM tu karma dveDA vyavasTitam. prakftyucCedasaMBUtaM kiMcitkAzWAdi Basmavat. kiMcidguRAntarotpattyA suvarRAdi vikAravat.. . iti (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 2 pf0 65). atra prApyatvaM ca kriyAkftaviSezAnupalaByamAnatvam. nirvartya vikAryayostu kriyAjanyotpattyAdiPalasya karmamAtranizWatayA asADAraRyena tadvattvAnnAtiprasaNga iti boDyam (vAca0). aTavA kriyAprayojyAsADAraRaDarma prakArakapratItivizayatAnASrayatve sati PalASrayatvam. nirvartyAdAvativyAptivAraRAya satyantam (vE0 sA0 da0 suba0 pf0 168). OdAsInyatvaM ca karturanuddeSyatve sati kriyAjanyaPalavattvam. yaTA grAmaM gacCan tfRaM spfSatItyAdO tfRAderanuddeSyatvepi kriyAjanyasaMyogarUpaPalavattvenodAsInakarmatA (vAca0). dvezyatvaM ca dvizwasADanatve sati kriyAjanyaPalavattvam. saMjYAntarEranAKyAtaM tu apAdAnatvAditattadrUpaviSezEravivakzitam (vE0 sA0 da0 suba0 pf0 169). aTavA kArakaviSezasaMjYAntareRAvivakzitatve sati karmopakArakam. yaTA gAM payo dogDItyAdO gavAdeH kArakAntarasaMjYAyA apAdAnatvAdeH avivakzayA payorUpakarmopayogitayA karmatvam (vAca0) atredaM boDyam pUrva viDiprasaktipUrvakaM tadavivakzAyAM sarvaTA pUrvaviDeraprasaktO ca akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 114. 51) ityasya pravfttiH iti (vE0 sA0 pf0 169). anyapUrvakaM ca anyasaMjYAbADanapUrvaM<BR>;p{0212}<BR>SAstraboDitam. yaTA krUramaBikruDyatItyatra kruDaduherzyAsUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 37) ityanena prasaktAyAH saMpradAnasaMjYAyAH kruDadruhorupasfzwayoH karma (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 38) ityanena bADanAt karmasaMjYAviDAnAcca krUrasya karmatvam. evam vEkuRWamaDiSeta ityAdAvapi.. AUM boDyam (vE0 sA0 da0 suba0 pf0 170). aTavA kArakAntara- -saMjYApUrvakam. yaTA jalaDimaDiSeta ityAdO jalaDerADAratvenADikaraRasaMjYAyAH prAptatvepi aDiSINsTAsAM karma (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 46) ityAdinA karmasaMjYayA karmatvam (vAca0). atra nirvartyavikAryaprApyARAM karmatvaM ca kartfgataprakftaDAtvarTavyApAraprayojyavyApAravyaDikaraRaPalASrayatvena karturuddeSyatvam. yaTA taRqulaM pacatItyAdO viklittyASrayatvAttaRqulasya karmatvam. cEtraM grAmaM gamayatItyAdO grAmasya karmatvAya prayojyatvaniveSaH. atra prayojyAntena PalaviSezaRIBUtena agnermARavakaM vArayati ityAdAvayAdeH karmatvaM nivAritam iti jYeyam (la0 ma0 su0 pf0 8586).<BR>avidyamAnA iti padacCedaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मजन्यगुणत्वम्
karmajanyaguRatvam — karmajanyavfttiguRatvasAkzAdvyApyajAtimattvam (mu0 gu0 pf0 194). yaTA saMyogaH viBAgaH vegaSca etatrayasya karmajanyaguRatvam (BA0 pa0 gu0 lo0 87).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मत्वम्
karmatvam — 1 padArTaviBAjako jAtiviSezaH (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 7). yaTA utkzepaRatvAdikAH karmatvasAkzAdvayApyAH paYca jAtayaH (vE0 u0 1. 1. 7) ityAdO karmatvaM jAtiH. karmatvaM nAma nityAsamavetatvasahitasattAsAkzAdvayApyajAtiH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 216 O0). 2 (kArakam) [ka] parasamavetakriyAjanya PalaSAlitvam. yaTA cEtrastaRqulaM pacatItyAdO pAkajanyaviklittimattvAttaRqulasya karmatvam. GawaM jAnAtItyAdO tu GawAderjYAnavizayatvaM karmatvaM gORam (ma0pra0 pf0 6). [Ka] parasamavetakriyAjanyaDAtvarTaPalASrayatvam. yaTA grAmaM gacCatItyAdO grAmasya saMyogarUpaPalASrayatvaM karmatvam. atra parasamaveteti viSezaRAcEtraScEtraM gacCatIti na prayogaH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 90). kiMca grAmaM gacCati cEtra ityAdO cEtrAdAvativyAptivAraRAya parasamaveteti<BR>;p{0213}<BR>kriyAviSezaRam (ma0 pra0 pf0 6). grAmaM gacCatItivat svaM gacCatIti prayogavAraRAya parasamavetatvamapi dvitIyArTa izyate (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 49). gamipatyoH pUrvadeSe tyajeruttaradeSe spandeSca pUrvottarayoH karmatvavAraRAya DAtvarTeti (la0 ma0 su0 pf0 90). [ga] SAbdikAstu kartfgataprakftaDAtvarTavyApAraprayojyatadanaDikaraRavfttiprakftaDAtvarTaPalASrayatvam (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 153). [Ga] vyAkaraRaSAstravoDita karmasaMjYakatvaM karmatvam (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 85). tena aDiSayyate prAsAdaH ityAdO karmaRi lakAropapattiH. aDiSeteH karmasaMjYA viSizwAnvitasvArTaboDakatvAdityAhuH (vAca0). [Na] prakftaDAtvarTapraDAnIBUtavyApAra prayojyaprakftaDAtvarTaPalASrayatvenoddeSyatvam. idameva karturIpsitatamaM karma (pARi0 1. 4. 49) ityatra IpsitatamatvaM boDyam. gAM payo dogDItyAdO payovfttiryo viBAgastadanukUlo vyApAro govfttiH. tadanukUlaSca gopavfttiH. atra payasaH karmatvasidDaye prayojyatvaniveSaH. janyatvaniveSe tu tanna syAt. janyatvaM hi sAkzAdeva. prayojyatvaM tu sAkzAtparaMparAsADAraRam. prayAgAtkASIM gacCatItyatra prayAgasya karmatvavAraRAya prakftaDAtvarTaPaleti. na hi viBAgaH prakftaDAtvarTaH. kiMtu nAntarIyakatayA gamane sati utpadyate. prayAgasya PalASrayatvenAnuddeSyatvAcca. nanu prakftaDAtvarTasya grahaRenEvAtra vAraRAduddeSyatvaniveSaH kimarTa iti cenna. tasyAsADAraRaM prayojanaM kASIM gacCanpaTi mfta iti. atra hi kASyAH PalASrayatvABAvepi PalASrayatvenoddeSyatvAtkarmatvam. nanu kASIM gacCati cEtra cEtraH kASIM gacCati na prayAgam iti prayogAnupapattiH. prayAgasya PalASrayatvenoddeSyatvABAvAditi cet ucyate. karmalakzaRa Ipsitatamapadasya svArTaviSizwayogyatAviSeze lakzaRA. taTA ca prakftaDAtvarTapraDAnIBUtavyApAraprayojyaprakftaDAtvarTaPalASrayatvenoddeSyatvayogyatA viSezaSAlitvaM karmatvam. tacca prayAgasyApyastIti karmatvaM sulaBam. [ca] nyAyasidDAntadIpikAyAM tu karaRavyApAravizayakAraRatvaM karmatvam. yaTA<BR>;p{0214}<BR>. vrIhIn prokzatItyAdo vrIheH karmatvam. tena vrIhIna prokzatItyAdO vrIheH prokzaRaPalIBUtAtiSayAnASrayatvepi na karmatvAnupapattiH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 19). evamAtmanAtmAnaM jAnAtItyAdAvapyUhyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मधारयः
karmaDArayaH — (samAsaH) [ka] tatpuruzaH samAnADikaraRaH karmaDArayaH (pARi0 1. 2. 42). atredaM boDyam. karmaDAraye viSizwArTe na 0 Saktirna vA lakzaRA. tAByAM vinApi vivakzitAnvayaboDopapatteH iti (ci04). SAbdikAstu samAsamAtre viSizwArTetiriktAM Sakti kalpayanti. [Ka] kramikam avyavahitam yannAmadvayam ekasya nAmnorTe DarmiRi tAdAtmyenAparanAmnorTasyAnvayaboDaM prati samarTam tAdfSanAmadvayaM karmaDArayaH. yaTA nIlotpalamityAdAvutpalAdipadasyArTe nIlAdipadArTasya tAdAtmyenAnvayaH. taTA puruzasiMha ityAdAvapi puruzAdAvuttarapadalakzyasya siMhAdisadfSasya tAdAtmyenAnvayaH. kumBasya samIpam ityarTakastu upakumBAdiH na tAdAtmyenAnvayaboDakaH iti tatra nAtiprasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 pf0 41). puruzasiMha ityAdO puruzaH siMha iva ityAdivigrahe prAyeRopameyasyopamAnEH upamAnAni sAmAnyavacanEH (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 55) ityanena karmaDArayonuSizyate (Sa0 pra0 pf0 41). [ga] samAsaprayuktalakzaRASUnyatulyArTako BayanAmakasamAsaH. yaTA nIlotpalamityAdO karmaDArayaH. atra paYcamUlItyAdAvapi tulyArTa ko BayanAmakatvasattvAttadvAraRAya samAsaprayuktalakzaRASUnyeti nAmaviSezaRam. DavaKadirAviti dvaMdvavAraRAya tulyArTaketi nAmaviSezaRam. nIlotpalamityatra yadyapi nIlapade nIlaguRASraye nirUQalakzaRA taTApi tasyAH samAsaprayuktatvABAvAt nAvyAptiH. nAmadvayasya tulyArTatvAcca lakzRasamanvayaH saMBavati iti jYeyam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 44). stokapaktA ityAdO kriyAviSezaREH karmaDAraya eva. mahAkavirmahAvijYaH ityAdO kavitvAdAviva prakftepyanekanAmArTEkadeSe pacanAdAvaparanAmArTasyABedAnvayaboDakatayA karmaDArayatvasya saMBavAt. stokaM paktA ityAdO amastAdAtmyatrAcitve tu tatpuruzaH saMBavatyeva.. kriyAviSezaREH samAsa evAvyutpannaH iti tu na deSyam.<BR>;p{0215}<BR>stokanamrA stanAByAm ityAdeH kAlidAsAdyEH prayuktatvAt (Sa0 pra0 lo0 39 wI0 pf0 55). karmaDAraye samAse nIlotpalam ityAdO na Saktirna vA lakzaRA. nIlapadArTasyotpalapadArTe aBedasaMbanDenEvAnvayopapattO SaktilakzaRAnaNgIkArAt. ata eva tatpuruzAtkarmaDArayo laGIyAn Bavati (nyA0 pra0 4 pf0 13). taTAhi nizAdasTapatiM yAjayet iti SrutO bahuvrIhitatpuruza samAsAvapekzya karmaDAraya eva lakzaRAdyaBAvAllaGIyAn iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 5354). atredaM boDyam. nipAdasya saMkarajAtiviSezasya SUdrAntargatatayA strISUdrO nATIyAtAm ityanena nizidDatvAdvedasAmAnyA- -naDikArepi nizAdasTapatiM yAjayet iti viSezaSrutiboDitayAjanAnyaTAnupapattyEva yAgamAtropayuktamaDyayanaM nizAdasya kalpyate. taTA ca strISUdrAviti sAmAnyaSAstraGawakADyayanapadasya viSezataH prAptADyayanetarADyayaparatvaM vAcyam. tena nizAdasya yAgopayuktADyayanetarADyayananizeDaH SUdrAntarasya tvaDyayanamAtranizeDaH siDyati iti (mu0 4) (di0 4 pf0 184).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मप्रवचनीयः
karmapravacanIyaH — (avyayam) [ka] kriyAnuyogikasaMbanDaviSezadyotakatve satyanvAdyanyatamaH. yaTA anu upa ityAdiH. taduktaM hariRA kriyAyA dyotako nAyaM saMbanDasya na vAcakaH. nApi kriyApadAkzepI saMbanDasya tu BedakaH.. iti. karmapravacanIyA ekAdaSa santi anu upa apa pari AN prati aBi aDi su ati api. [Ka] kriyAviSezopajanitasaMbanDAvacCedahetavaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 299 pARi0). ekAdaSAnAM maDye kezAMcidarTaH sodAharaRaM kaTyate. taTAhi. yajYamanuprAvarzadityatrAyamarTaH. kArakatvarUpa hetutvaM anuSabdArTaH. anulakzaRe (pARi0 1. 4. 84) iti karmapravacanIyasaMjYAviDAyakasUtre lakzaRapadasya kArakahetuparatvAt. taTA ca yajYamanu prAvarzat ityAdO ADeyatvaM dvitIyArTaH. tatra yajYasyAntrayaH. ADeyatvasya ca anupadArTe hetutvenvayaH. hetutAyASca nirUpakatvasaMbanDena vfzwAvanvayaH. aTavA janyatvam anuSabdArTaH.<BR>;p{0216}<BR>1. 4. 90 dvitIyArTo nirUpitatvam. tasya yajYAnvitatvasyAnuSabdArTe janyatvEnvayaH. janyatAyAScASrayatvasaMbanDena vfzwAvantrayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 76). anvarjunaM yodDAraH. atra anuSabdArTopakarzaH (hInatvam). dvitIyArTovaDikatvam. tatrArjunasyAnvayaH. dvitIyAntArTasya arjunAvaDikatvasya cApakarzenvayaH iti. avaDitvasyApAdAnatArUpatvepi kriyAnvayABAvAnna paYcamIprasaktiH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka 0 2 pf0 76). vfkzaM prati vidyotate vidyut. atra lakzaRetTaMBUtAKyAnaBAgavIpsAsu pratiparyanavaH (pARi0 114. 90) ityanena sUtreRa prati pari anu ezAM karmapravacanIyasaMjYA anuSizyate. tatra pratiSabdasya lakzaRa itTaMBUtAKyAna BAga vIpsA etadAtmakAnAM caturRAmarTAnayaTAkramamudAharaRAni kaTyante. tatra praTame lakzaRerTe vfkzaM prati vidyotate vidyut ityudAharaRam. atra paricAyakatvarUpaM lakzaRatvaM 1. pariceyatvarUpaM lakzyatvaM vA pratiSabdArTaH. vfkzaprakASena vidyudvidyotanAM jYAnAdvfkzasya paricAyakatA. dvitIyArTaScADeyatvaM nirUpitatvaM vA (ga0 vyu0 Ka0 2 kAra0 2 0 76). mAtaraM prati sADuH. atra dvitIye itTaMBUtAKyAnerTe saMbanDaH pratiSabdArTaH. sADutvaM ca priyakAritvam. dvitIyArTaSca pratiyogitvaM pratiyogityanirUpakatvaM vA. tasya pUrvoktasaMbanDenvayaH. tAdfSasaMbanDasya ca sADutvaGawakakriyAyAmanvayaH. itTaM ca mAtfsaMbanDipriyakArI iti boDaH. yo mAM prati syAt. atra tftIye BAgerTe pratiSabdasyArTo BAgaH. BAgaSca svatvASrayaH. dvitIyArTaSca saMbanDaH. tasya pUrvoktaBAgenvayaH. itTaM ca matsaMbanDI yo BAgaH syAt iti boDaH. vfkzaM prati sivati. atra caturTe vIpsArTe vfkzaM prati siYcati ityAdO dvitIyArTaH karmatvam. atra caturTerTe karmaRyevadvitIyA patvabADa eva saMjYAPalam pratiSca girarTaka iti jYeyam (ga0. vyu0 kA 0 2 Ka 0 2 pf0 76). evaM pari anu etayorarTa UhyaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्मयोगः
karmayogaH — rasaSca pavanaSceti karmayogo dviDA smftaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 204 raseSva0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0216" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्षणम्
karzaRam — 1 [ka] gatyavacCinnavikarzaRam. yaTA SAKA grAmaM kfzyata ityAdO kfperarTaH. atra grAmakarmakagatyavacCinnavikarzaRakarmatASrayaH SAKA ityAkArako boDaH (Sa0 pra0 pf0 105). [Ka] deSAntarasaMyogAnukUlavyApArAnukUlavyApAraH. yaTA grAmamajAM karzatItyAdO karzaRam (vAca0). atra asya kfzaDAtoH vyApAradvayaboDakatayA karturIpsitatamaM karma (pA0 sU0 1 4. 49) ityanena dvikarmakatvam. ekavyApAraboDakatve tu akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 51) ityanena grAmAdeH karmatvam. atra praDAne karmaRyeva vAcye lakArAdayaH. yaTA ajA grAmaM kfzyate iti. tatroktaM hariRA gORe karmaRi duhyAdeH praDAne nIhfkfzvahAm iti. 2 vileKanam. tadarTaSca vidAraRam. atrArTe kfzaDAtorna dvikarmakateti BedaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0217" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कला
kalA — (kAryam) cetanaparatatratve satyacetanA kalA (sarva0 saM0 pf0 168 nakulI 0). kalikA pUrvam - (apUrvam) paramApUrvajanakaH aNgajanyaH apUrvaviSezaH. yaTA. utpattyapUrvARi (di0 gu0 pf0 235) (ci0 4) (mU0 ma0). atra kalikayA aMSena janyam apUrvam iti vyutpattirdrazwavyA (vAca0). utpattyapUrvARi ca paYcaBirvAkyErvihiteByaH zaqBya AgneyAdiBya utpannAni zaw santi. tatra paYca vAkyAni tu yadAgneyozwAkapAlomAvAsyAyAM ca pOrRamAsyAM cAcyuto Bavati (tE0 saM0 2. 6. 3. 3) upAMSu yAjamantarA yajati (tE0 saM0 2. 6. 6. 4) tAByAmetamagnIzomIyamekAdaSakapAlaM pUrRamAse prAyacCat (tE0 saM0 225. 2. 3) EndraM daDyamAvAsyAyAm (tE0 saM0 2. 5. 4. 1) EndraM payomAvAsyAyAm iti (di0 gu0 pf0 235). atra AgneyAzwAkapAlayAga EndradaDiyAga EndrapayoyAga etatrayaM darSasya. AgneyAzwAkapAlayAga upAMSuyAga agnIzomIyEkAdaSakapAlayAga etatrayaM pOrRamAsasya iti boDyam. (mU0 ma0 4) (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0217" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

