काणः
kARaH — [ka] cakzuH SUnya golakavattve sati sacakzurgolakavAn. yaTA akzRA kARa ityAdO. atra golakArTakAkzipadottaratftIyAyA vikftatvaM vfttimattvaM cArTaH. tatrAdyaM vikftatvaM saMboDyatvamitra prakftyarTe viSezaRaviDayAnveti. caramaM vfttimattvaM tu prakftyarTanirUpitaM sat kARatvEkadeSe cakzuHSUnyatvenvetiM. taTA ca vikftagolakavfttitvaviSizwaM yaccakzuH SUnyatvaM tadvadgolakavAn sacakzuzkaH ityAkArastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 pf0 118). [Ka] svADizWAnavfttitvasaMbanDena cakzuH SUnyo yaScakzurvinASaH tadvAn sacakzuzkaH. akzRA kARa ityAdO tAdfSe vinASe akzipadasyArTasya golakasya vikAraprayuktatvaM tftIyayA boDyate. taTA ca golakavikAraprayuktasya niruktasaMbanDena cakzuH SUnyasya cakzurnASasyASrayaH sacakzuzkaH ityAkAro voDaH (Sa0 pra0 pf0 118). [ga] SAbdikAstu cakzurnASavAn sacakzuzkaH. yaTA akzRA kARa ityAdI ityAhuH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 100). atra yenANgavikAraH (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 20) ityanena tftIyA. vikArastu kanInikAdyapagamaH ayaTAsaMsTAnavattvaM vA. taTAca akzipadArTo golakam. golaka vikAraprayuktacakzurnASavAn sacakzuzkaH iti boDaH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 100). [Ga] leSatopi darSanasAmarTyahInaH kARaH (Sa0 Se0 kA0 pf0 189).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0218" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कादाचित्कत्वम्
kAdAcitkatvam — [ka] sattve sati kiMcitkAlavfttyaBAvapratiyogitvam. (Atmata 0 Siro0). yaTA anAdiScetkAryakAraRapravAhaH kAdAcitkavAnyaTAnupapattyA kalpyaH (ku0 wI0 hari0) ityAdO. [Ka] - prAgaBAvapratiyogitva DvaMsapratiyogitva etadanyataravattvam (cO0 Si0) (vAca0). yaTA GawapawAderanityajAtasya kAdAcitkatvam. atra [anyataraniveSena ca DvaMse prAgaBAvapratiyogitvasya prAgaBAve ca DvaMsapratiyogitvasya sattvAnnAvyAptiH. nitye tu taduBayAsattvAnna prasaNgaH (bOdDa0 Si0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0219" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

