काम्यत्वम्
kAmyatvam — [ka] aBilAzavizayatvam (mu0 gu0 pf0 220). yaTA suKaM tu jagatAmekaM kAmyaM DarmeRa janyate (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 146) ityAdO suKasya kAmyatvam. [Ka] PalecCADInecCAvizayattram. [ga] PalakAmanADIna kartavyatAkatvaM vA. yaTA BojanAderjyotizwomAdeSca kAmyatvam (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 103). [Ga] ArabDakarmotpattikAmanADInakAmanAvizayatvam iti kecit (mU0 ma0 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0219" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

