कारकम्
kArakam — [ka] yadDAtUpasTApyayAdfSArTe anvayaprakArIBUya BAsate yaH subarTaH sa tadDAtUpasTApyatAdfSakriyAyAM kArakam. yaTA vfkzAtpatati vyAGrAdviBetItyAdO brAhmaRAya dadAti putrAya kruDyatItyAdO dAtreRa Cinatti Gawatvena jAnAtItyAdo sTAlyAM pacati SuktO BAsata ityAdO<BR>;p{0220}<BR>grAmaM gacCati GawaM paSyatItyAdO cEtreRa pacyate Gawena BUyaMta ityAdO ca patapraBftiDAtvarTe patanAdO paYcamyAdyupasTApito viBAgAdiH prakArIBUya BAsata iti tattadDAtUpasTApitatattatkriyAyAM viBAgAdikaM prakfte kArakam. [Ka] yAdfSena nAmArTenAvacCinnasya subarTasya yAdfSaDAtvarTenvayaH sa tAdfSaDAtvarTe kArakatayA vyapadiSyate. tena vfkzAtpatatItyAdO vfkzAderapi patanAdikriyAyAmapAdAnatvAdikArakavyavahAraH. [ga] kriyAprakArIBUtorTaH kArakam iti SAbdikAH smaranti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 66 pf0 77). [Ga] kArakatvaM ca kriyAnvitaviBaktyarTAntritatvam. asti ca karmAdO kriyAnvitasuviBaktyarTAnvaya iti lakzaRasamanvayaH. cEtrasya taRqulaM pacatItyAdO tu saMbanDini cEtrAdO zazWyarTasaMbanDasya taRqulAdinAmArTAnvitatayA kriyAnanvitatvAnnAtivyAptiH. cEtrasya pacatItyAdAvapi taRqulAdipadADyAhAreREva boDaH. zazWayarTasaMbanDasya nAmArTenEva taTA kriyAyAH karmatyAdinEva sAkANkzatayA parasparAkANkzAvirahAt. odanasya paktA mEtrasya pAkaH ityAdO karmatvakartftvArTikA zazWI kArakaviBaktireva. kartfkarmaRoH kfti (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 65) ityanena tadviDAnAt. ata eva saMbanDasya na kArakatvam. kriyAyogABAvAt. [Na] kriyAprakArIBUtorTaH kArakaM tacca zaqviDam. kartfkarmAdiBedena SezaH saMbanDaH izyate.. iti SAbdikAH vadanti. ata eva guruvipratapasvidurgatAnAM pratikurvIta Bizak svaBezajEH ityAdO sA lakzmI rupakurute yaTA parezAma ityAdO ca roge vipattO ityAdinAmnoH yaTAkramam aDyAhAreREva boDaH. ayaM BAvaH. atra pazWayarTasaMbanDasyADyAhftanAmArTenEvAnvayaH na tu kriyayA iti nAtra kArakazazwI iti (kA0 vyA0 pu0 1). atra gadADara BawwAcAryAstu roge iti padasya nADyAhAraH kartavyaH. zazWyarTasaMbanDasya DAtvarTenvayepi neyaM kArakaviBaktiH kiMtUpapadaviBaktirevetyAhuH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 56). yadi aDyAhAramantarA kriyAyAM zazWayarTa saMbanDAnvayaH prAmARikaH tadA [ca] kriyAnvita kartftvakarmatvAdipaNkAnyatamAnvayitvam kArakatvaM boDyam. ata<BR>;p{0221}<BR>eva ca carmaRi dvIpinaM hantItyAdO nimittAderapi na kArakatvam iti. etA upapadaviBaktayaH na tu kArakaviBaktayaH iti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 1) (Sa0 pra0 pf0 7778). SAbdikAstu [Ca] kriyAjanakatvayogyatAbudDivizayatvam kArakatvamityAhuH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 79). [ja] kriyAhetuH (ga0 pra0 pf0 6). yaTA cEtro grAmaM gacCatItyAdO cEtraH kArakam. atra kriyAM kurvadDi kArakam iti yogo drazwavyaH (ma0pra0 pf0 5). [Ja] kArakatvaM kriyAjanakatvam. BAzye karoti kriyAM nirvartayatIti vyutpattipradarSanAt. brAhmaRasya putraM panTAnaM pfcCatItyAdO brAhmaRasya na kArakatvam. putreRAnyaTAsidDyA tattvABAvAt. ata evEzAM kriyAyAmevAnvayaH. kriyAjanakamiti jYAte kA sA kriyetyAkANkzodayena kriyAyA janakAkANkzayA ca tatrEvAntrayasyEOcityAt. sarvezAM ca kArakARAM svasvAvAntarakriyAdvArA praDAnakriyAnizpAdakatvaM boDyam. asaMnihitasaMpradAnasyApi dAtfbudDisTatvAvaSyakatvena svajYAnasya pUrvakAlatvenEva janakatvam. evaM stokaM pacatItyAdO PalasyApi. GawaM karoti smaratItyAdO bOdDaGawAdeH pUrvakAlatvena smftyAdinizpAdakatvaM boDyam (Sa0 SeKa0 kA0 pf0 174). atra svajYAnasyetyatra svapade nAsaMnihitaM saMpradAnaM boDyam. stokaM pacatItyatra ca Palasya kaTaM karmatvaM taducyate. pacaDAtvarTo viklittyanukUlo vyApAraH. tatra triklittirUpaPalasya vyapadeSitradBAvena PalASrayatvAtkarmatvam. tadvAcakO ca dvO pacaDAtuH stokapadaM ceti. tatra DAtoH prAtipadikasaMjYAyA aBAvAttasmAdvitIyA na Bavati. stokaSabdasya ca tatsattvAdvitIyA Bavati. kArakaM zaqviDam. apAdAnattram saMpradAnatvam karaRatvam aDikaraRatvam karmattram kartftvam iti (Sa0 pra0 pf0 78). taduktam kartA karma ca karaRaM saMpradAnaM taTEva ca. apAdAnADikaraRamityAhuH kArakARi zaw.. iti. kArakaM prakArAntareRApi dviviDam. uktam anuktaM ceti. tatra DAtvarTasya viSezyatayA tiNAdyanuBAvyatvameva kArakasyoktatvam. tadviSezaRatayA tadanuBAvyatvameva cAnuktatvam. tatra uktaM kArakaM yaTA pacati<BR>;p{0222}<BR>pacyate ityAdO tiNA pAcakaH pacyamAna ityAdO ca kftA kartftvaM karmatvaM ca DAtvarTaviSezyatvenAnuBAvyate. taTA pacanaM kAzWam dAnIyo dvijaH BImo gajaH SayanaM gfhamityAdO yaTAkramaM karaRatvAdi DAtvarTaviSezyatvenAnuBAvyate. vyutpattivEcitryeRa padArTEkadeSepi pacati pacyate ityAdO kartftvAdI DAtvarTasya pAkAderanvayAt. vizavfkzopi saMvarDya svayaM CettumasAMpratam (kumArasaM0 2. 55) sevituM sAMprataM vijYErguruH paruzatrAgapi ityAdO tu nipAtena kvacit karmatva kArakasyoktatvam (Sa0 pra0 pf0 105). anuktaM tu kArakaM yaTA rAmeRa hato vAlItyAdO rAmanizWaM kartftvam. grAmaM gacCatItyAdO grAmanizWaM karmatvam. SarEH SAtitapatra ityAdO SaranizWam kAzWEH pacatItyAdO ca kAzWanizWa karaRatvam. viprAya dadAtItyAdO vipranizWaM saMpradAnatvam. etAdfSamanuktaM kArakaM Bavati. [Ya] kartftvAdivyapadeSakAriRI kriyA kArakam. yaTA kArake (1. 4. 23) iti pARinisUtre BAzyaM yAvaqUyAtkriyAyAmiti tAvatkArake iti. aDikaM tu (Sa0 pra0 pf0 114) tatra drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0219" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारकविभक्तिः
kArakaviBaktiH — (sup) DAtvarTe prakArIBUtArTaboDikA viBaktiH. yaTA grAmaM gacCati GawaM paSyati vfkzAtpatati ityAdO dvitIyApaYcamyAdiH kArakaviBaktirucyate. atra gacCatipaSyatyAdyarTe gamanadarSanAdO dvitIyA- qa grupasTApitakarmatvAdi prakArIBUya BAsata iti dvitIyAdiH kArakaviBaktirBavati iti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 pf0 77). kArakaviBaktitvaM ca kriyAjanakatvasamAnADikaraRakartrA dizaNkAnyatamArTatvam (la0 Sa0 Se0 0 pf0 193).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0222" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारकार्था
kArakArTA — vfttyA kArakasya boDikA suvviBaktiH. yaTA vfkzAtpatati grAmaM gacCatItyAdO kArakArTI paYcamyAdiviBaktiH (Sa0 pra0 pf0 77).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0222" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारकार्थान्यार्था
kArakArTAnyArTA — [ka] vfttyA kArakArTaboDakAnyA suvtriBaktiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 66 pf0 77). yaTA nIlo Gawa ityAdO mataviSeze aBedArTavoDikA ekatvavoDikA vA praTamA viBaktiH. [Ka] yatsupo yAdfSArTo na prakArIBUya BAsate. DAtvarTe yAdfgarTe sA kArakAnyArTasub<BR>;p{0223}<BR>Bavet.. taTA hi. praTamAdInAM saptAnAM viBaktInAmekatvAdayorTA na DAtvarTe prakArIBUya BAsante. kiMtu prakftyarTe. pAka ityAdAvapi subarTasaMsTA na DAtvarTe prakAraH. kiMtu pacanAdisvarUpe nAmArTe iti. aTavA [ga] samAsanivizwasya DAtorarTe iti vaktavyam. na hi grAmagata ityAdI DAtvarTe karmatvAdirivEkatvAdirapi suvarTaH prakAraH. ata eva prAsAdAtprekzata ityAdO tyatrarTasya DAtvarTe prakAratvepi tadarTakapaYcamyAM nAvyAptiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 114). atredamavaDeyam. kArakaviBaktiBinnaviBaktyarTasya kriyAyAmananvayaH iti na niyamaH. taTA hi maRikAramate tasmAjjAnAti ityAdO jYAnAdirUpaDAtvarTe hetuviBaktyarTasyAntrayo dfzwaH. tasmAt sTIyate ityAdO ca sarvamata eva DAtvarTasTityAdO hetuviBaktyarTasyAnvayo dfzwaH. guruvipratapasvidurgatAnAM pratikurtrIta Bizak svaBezajEH ityAdO zazWayarTasaMbanDasyApi DAtvarTenvayo dfzwaSca iti na tAhaSaniyamoNgIkartavyaH (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 56). atra roge iti padamaDyAhArya tadarTe zazWyarTasyAnvayaH kAryaH ityapi kecidvadanti iti prAguktameva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0222" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारणगुणपूर्वकत्वम्
