कारणगुणोत्पन्नगुणत्वम्
kAraRaguRotpannaguRatvam — svASrayasamavAyimAtrasamaveta svasajAtIyaguRajanyavfttiH pfTaktvasaMKyAtvAtiriktA BAvanAvfttyanyA ca yA jAtiH tAdfSajAtimattve satyapAkajattram (di0 gu0 pf0 194). Bavati hi GawAdInAM rUpAdikaM svASrayaGawAdisamavAyikapAlAdirUpAdimAtrAsamavAyikAraRakam (pa0 mA0). svam GawAdInAM rUpAdikam. tasyASrayaH GawAdiH. tasya samavAyi kapAlam. tanmAtre tasminneva samavetaH svasajAtIyo guRaH kapAlAdigatarUpAdiH. tena janyam GawAdigatamapAkajaM rUpAdi. tatra vartamAnA jAtiH apAkajarUpatvAdiH. tadvattve sati ityarTaH. svasajAtIyaguRetyatra sAjAtyaM ca guRatvavyApyavyApyajAtyA<BR>;p{0224}<BR>vivakzaRIyam. tena avayavAvayavinorekatvayoH saMKyAtvenApi sAjAtyamaByupagamya tAdfSEkatvAByAM janitevayavAvayavidvitvAdO nAtivyAptiH (di0 gu0 pf0 194). kAraRaguRotpannaguRASca apAkajA rUparasaganDAnuzRasparSAH apAkajaM dravatvam snehavegagurutva ekatvAni ekapfTaktvam parimARam sTitisTApakaSceti (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 9697). atra pfTivImAtravfttInAM kezAMcit pAkajarUparasaganDasparSAnAm kAraRaguRapUrvakatvABAvAt apAkajAH ityuktam (mu0 gu0 pf0 194). vegotra karmAjanyo vegajanyaH grAhyaH (pa0 mA0). karaRaguRotpannatvaM ca [ka] svASrayasamavAyisamavetaguRajanyattram (di0 gu0 pf0 194). atra svam avayavijalasya rUpAdi. tasyASrayaH samavAyi vA samatrAyena saMbanDenASrayaH avayaviBUtaM jalam. tasya samavAyi avayavaBUtaM jalam. tatra samaveto guRaH avayavaBUtajalavfttI rUpAdiH. tena janyaH tasya BAva iti vigrahAdikaM jYeyam. [Ka] svasamavAyisamavAyisamavetaguRajanyatvam (la0va0 pf0 36). yaTA kAryajalasamavetarUpasya kAraRaguRotpannatvameva. atra tAdfSaguRajanyatvaM ca tAdfSaguRanizWAsamavAyikAraRatAnirUpitakAryatASAlitvam (la0 ba0 pf0 36).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0223" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारणम्
kAraRam — 1 [ka] kAraRaM hi tadBavati yasmin sati yadBavati yasmiSvAsati yanna Bavati (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 24). atredaM boDyam. kAraRattraM dviviDam. vEdikam lOkikaM ca. tatra vEdikam anvayamAtrAvagamyam. lOkikaM tu anvayavyatireko Bayagamyam iti (ta0 va0 pari0 2 Slo0 50 pf0 40). punarapi nyAyamate kAraRatvaM dviviDam. PalopahitatvaM svarUpayogyatvaM ceti. tatrAdyaM yaTA anumitiM prati parAmarSasya kAraRatvam. PalopahitatyaM ca upaDAyakatvaSabdenApi vyavahriyate. dvitIyaM yaTA araRyasTadaRqAdisADAraRam janakatAvacCedakalakzaRaM daRqatvAdisvarUpaM GawakAraRatvam. [Ka] yasya kAryAtpUrvaBAvo niyatonanyaTAsidDaSca tat (ta0 BA0 pf0 2). [ga] ananyaTAsidDakAryaniyatapUrvavftti. yaTA tantuvemAdikaM pawasya kAraRam (ta.<BR>;p{0225}<BR>BA0 pf0 2) (ta0 saM0). yaTA vA navInAnAM maRikArAdInAM mate pratibanDakasaMsargABAvopi kAryamAtraM prati kAraRam. sa ca pratibanDakAtyantABAvaH. ananyaTAsidDetyasyArTaSca anyaTAsidDaBinnaM anyaTA - sidDiSUnyam yat kAryaniyatapUrvavftti taditi. atra vyApAreRa vyApAriRo nAnyaTAsidDiH iti niyamoNgIkartavyaH. tena kuWAreRa vfkzaM CinattItyAdO kuWArAdInAM paraMparayA CedanakriyAjanakakuWAradArusaMyogajanakaviDayA kAraRatvepi nAnyaTAsidDiH iti. kAryaniyatetyasyArTaSca kAryAnniyatA avaSyaMBAvinI pUrvavfttiH pUrvakzaRavfttiH yasya tattaTA iti (si0 ca0 1 pf0 50). atra GawaM prati rAsaBAdeH kAraRatvanirAsAya niyatapadam. yadyapi aniyatarAsaBAdestftIyAnyaTAsidDatvena (tarka dIpikAdyuktatftIyAnyaTAsidDalakzaRAkrAntatvena) kAraRalakzaRaGawakenEva ananyaTAsidDeti viSezaRena rAsaBAdeH kAraRatvanirAsAnniyatapadaM vyarTameva taTApi GawasAmAnyaM prati rAsaBasAmAnyasya kAraRatvanirAsAya niyatapadamAvaSyakam. yadi niyatapadaM lakzaRe na niveSyate tadA tatra pUrvoktatftIyAnyaTAsidDerasaMBavenAtivyAptiH syAt iti. niyatapUrvavfttitvaM cAvyavahitapUrvakAlAvacCedena kAryadeSe sattvam. na cedaM rAsaBasAmAnyesti ato nAtivyAptiH (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 8) (nIla0 1 pf0 16). atra prABAkArAstu kAraRamAtraM kArya sahaBAvanirUpakameva sat kAryakAri iti pratibanDakABAvopi kAryasahaBAvena kAraRam iti ca vadanti. kAryasahaBAvanirUpakatvaM cAtra kAryotpattikzaRAvacCinnA yADikaraRatA tannirUpakatvam. svotpatti svAvyavahitapUrvatva etadanyatarasaMbanDena yadA kAryaM tadA pratibanDakABAvAdiH iti pratyAsattyA kAraRam iti (mU0 ma0 1). yaTA dAhotpattikAle maRyAdyaBAvaH. [Ga] kAryotpAdakam. atreyaM vyAptiranusaMDeyA yadviSezayoH kAryakAraRaBAvaH asati bADake tatsAmAnyayorapi iti. yaTA Gawa viSezadaRqaviSezayoH kAryakAraRaBAve GawasAmAnyadaRqasAmAnyayorapi kAryakAraRaBAvo nirAbADa eva iti. atra GawaviSezaM prati dEvAdAgatarAsaBasya kAraRatve GawasAmAnya29<BR>;p{0226}<BR>rAsaBasAmAnyayorapi kAryakAraRaBAvApattiH. tadvAraRAya asati bADake ityuktam. taTA ca tatrAnyaTAsidDatvarUpabADakasattvena na tayoH kAryakAraRaBAvaH iti. kAraRaM tAvat dviviDam. muKyam amuKyaM ca. tatra GawAdikaM prati mfdAdikaM kapAlAdikaM vA muKyam. yaTA vA aBAvapratyakze indriyam anumitO ca parAmarSaH ityAdi muKyaM kAraRaM Bavati. muKyaBinnaM tvamuKyaM kAraRam. tacca sahakArikAraRamucyate. yaTA aBAvapratyakze yogyAnupalabDiH anumitO ca sahacArajYAnaM kAraRam amuKyaM Bavati. muKyamapi nyAyamate triviDam. samavAyi asamavAyi nimittaM ceti. tatra GawAdikaM prati kapAlAdikaM samavAyikAraRam. kapAladvayasaMyogAdi asamavAyikAraRam. daRqAdayo nimittakAraRAni iti. atredaM boDyam. etat triviDaM kAraRam BAvakAryARAmevAsti. na svaBAvasya. DvaMsasya tu nimittakAraRamAtram. DvaMsasya samavAyABAvena samavAyyasamavAyinoraBAvAt iti (pra0 pra0 1 pf0 2). idaM ca kAraRatrayam BAvakAryasyEva. aBAvasya tu nimittamAtram iti tarkadIpikAyAmapyuktam. atrAyaM niyamaH. samavAyikAraRaM dravyameva Bavati. asamavAyikAraRaM tu guRaH karma ca Bavati. asamavAyikAraRaM guRakarmAtiriktaM na BavatItyarTaH (vE0 10. 2. 1 - 6) (mu0 1 pf0 56). idaM ca boDyam. samavAyikAraRAsamavAyikAraRe asADAraRe eva kAraRe BavataH. nimittakAraRaM tu sADAraRAsADAraRaBedena dviviDamapyasti. tatra sADAraRanimittakAraRAni cAzwaviDAni. ISvaraH tajjYAnecCAkftayaH dikkAlO adfzwam (DarmADarmO) prAgaBAvaSceti. pratibanDakasaMsargABAvastu kAryamAtraM prati sA