kAryasamaH — (jAtiH) [ka] prayatnakAryAnekatvAtkAryasamaH[^1] (gO05. 1. 37). prayatnAnantarIyakatvAdanityaH Sabda iti. yasya prayatnAnantara-<BR>;p{0229}<BR>mAtmalABaH tat KalvaBUtvA Bavati. yaTA GawAdikAryamanityamiti ca BUtvA na BavatItyetadvijYAyate. evamavasTite prayatnakAryAnekatvAditi pratizeDa ucyate. prayatnAnantaramAtmalABaSca dfzwo GawAdInAm vyavaDAnApohAccABivyaktirvyavahitAnAm. tatkiM prayatnAnantaramAtmalABaH SabdasyAho aBivyaktiriti viSezo nAsti. kAryAviSezeRa pratyavasTAnaM kAryasamaH (vAtsyA0 5. 1. 37). [Ka] sAmAnyata ukte hetoranaBimataviSezanirAkaraRena pratyavasTAnam. yaTA SabdaH anityaH prayatnAnantarIyakatvAdityukte prayatnAnantarIyakatvaM prayatnakArye GawAdO taTA vyavaDAnApohena prayatnAnantaropalaByamAne kIlakAdAvapi dfzwam. tatra dvitIyaM na janyatvasADakam. Adye tvasidDam (gO0 vf0 5 1. 37). [ga] kAryeRApi saMBavABiDAnam. yaTA SabdaH anityaH prayatnAnuviDAyitvAdityatra prayatnAnuviDAyitvamuBayaTApi saMBavati. GawAdivacCabdasvarUpotpattO jalAdivadAvarakanivfttO ca. uBayatrApi prayatnAnuviDAyitvadarSanAt. taTA ca tasyAvarakanivfttirUpakAryAntarasya saMBavAnnAnityatvaniyatatvamiti (nIla0 pf0 45). [Ga] asidDatAM vAdihetoruktvA taM sADayetsvayam. taddUzaRAnmUlahetuBaNgaH kAryasamo mataH.. iti (tA0 ra0 pari0 2 Slo0 127). asidDadeSanABAsoyam. asyAkftigaRatvAtsUtrAnupadarSitAnAmapi parigrahaH. yaTA SAWIsamA anupakArasametyAdi (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 37).<BR>atra kvacit kAraRasameti pAWaH. tasyApyayamevArTaH (nIla0 pf0 45).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0228" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

