kAryAnvitatvam — kAryatAboDakapadapratipAdyArTAtmakakAryayuktatvam. yaTA prABAkaramImAMsakanaye GawamAnayetyAdO GawAdipadAnAmAnayanAdirUpakriyAviSizwa eva GawAdO SaktiH ityatra kriyAnvitatvam. anvite Saktiriti tezAM matam. ayamaBiprAyaH. kaTaMcidupasTitapadArTAnAM SAbdaboDa vAraRAya tattadvizayakaSAbdaboDaM prati vfttijYAnajanyatadupasTititvena hetutAyAH kalpanIyatayA anvayAMSepi SaktirapekzitA. anyaTA tAdfSasAmAnyakAryakAraRaBAvaBaNgApatteH. evaM ca anvito GawapadavAcyaH ityAkArakaSaktijYAnameva SAbdaboDaprayojakam iti (nIla0 4 pf0 32).<BR>;p{0230}<BR>prABAkaramate SaktigrahaprakArastvitTam. prayojakavfdDena GawamAnaya ityuktam. tacCrutvA prayojyavfdDena Gawa AnItaH. tadvaDArya pArSvasTa bAlaH GawAnayanarUpaM kAryaM GawamAnayeti Sabdaprayojyam ityavaDArayati. tataSca GawaM naya gAmAnaya ityAvApodvApAByAM GawAdipadAnAM kAryAnvitaGawAdO Sakti gfhRAti iti (muktA0 4 pf0 176) (ci0 4). atra nEyAyikAstu cEtra putraste jAtaH kanyA te garBiRI ityAdO sidDArTavizayakasyApi SAbdaboDasyotpatterna kAryAnvite SaktiH. ata eva yanna duHKena saMBinnaM na ca grastamanantaram. aBilAzopapannaM ca tat suKaM svaHpadAspadam.. ityarTavAdopasTite suKe vedAdeva svargapadasya SaktigrahaH iti (ci0 4). anvayasya vAkyArTatayA BAnasaMBavAdanvayAMSepi Saktirna kalpanIyA iti prAhuH (ta0 dI0 4 pf0 32). atrAyaM nizkarzaH. padArTa saMsargasya padasamaBivyAhArabalAdeva SAbdaboDe BAnasaMBavAt tAdfSasaMsargAMSepi Saktirna kalpanIyA iti (nIla0 4 pf0 32).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0229" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

