ktvA — (pratyayaH) pUrvakAlInatvam kartA ca (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). yaTA BuktvA vrajatItyAdO Bojane vrajanapUrvakAlInatvaM ktvApratyayArTaH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 7072). atra pUrvatvaM ca saMnihitakriyApekzayA boDyam. kriyApUrvakAlInatvaM ca kriyAprAgaBAvakAlavfttitvam kriyotpattikAlInaDvaMsapratiyogikAlavfttitvaM vA. tena BuktvA vrajatItyatra gamanaprAgaBAvAvacCinna kAlavfttiBojanakartraBinno vrajati ityarTaH. atra kAlastAtparyavaSAt vyavahitAnyavahitasADAraRo codDavyaH. tena pUrvasminnabde gatvAsminnande samAgataH ityatra tAdfSaprayogAvagamaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). kecittu avyavahitapUrvakAlInatvamityAhuH. atra avyavaDAnaM ca kriyAntarAnukUlavilambABAvavattvam. kecittu tadutpattikzaRotpattikaDvaMsapratiyogikAlatvameva tadavyavahitapUrvakAlatvam. kAlaScAtra yAvatA kAlena BojanAnantaraM vrajanaM tAvAn sTUlakAlopADirviSizya niveSanIyaH. tena nAsaMBavaH ityAhuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 70). prABAkarAstu samAkartfkatvameva ktvApratyayArTa ityAhuH. maRikftastu Anantaryameva tadarTa ityAhuH. anye tu kvacit sAmAnADikaraRyaviSizwavyApyatvamapi ktvArTa ityAhuH. aDItya tizWatItyatra nirantarADyayanaSAlinyeva taTA prayogAt ayamarTa AvaSyakaH. atra vyAptiSca kAlikI. taTA ca aDyayanasAmAnADikaraRya viSizwADyayanavyApyasTitimAn ityanvayaDIH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 72). apare tu ASraya eva ktvApratyayArTa ityAhuH. ayaM BAvaH. kftpratyayAntargatatvAt sAmAnyaSaktyA ASrayopasTiteH kftpratyayena saMBavAt muKaM vyAdAya svapiti ityAdO svApapUrvakAlInatvasya muKavyAdAne asattvepi vyAdAnASraye svApASrayatvasya viSizwe vESizwyam iti nyAyenEva boDaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 72). anye tvAhuH. svakartfkatva svottaratva etaduBayasaMbanDena yatkiMcidviSizwaM ktvApratyayArTaH. yaTA odanaM ktvApratyayasya242<BR>;p{0246}<BR>paktvA Bujyata ityAdiBAvArTa kaktvApratyayasTale pAkakriyAviSizwAM BujikriyA (kfzRa0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0245" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्यच्
kyac — (DAtvaMSaH pratyayaH) icCA. yaTA cEtraH putrIyatItyAdO putrIyati mARavakamityAdO ca. evam SyenAyate kAka ityAdO kyaNarTopi boDyaH. ayaM ca pratyayo nAmaprakftiko boDyaH. atra kyajarTecCAyAM tatprakftyarTatAvacCeda kI BUtaputratvAdyavacCinnavizayatayA prakftyarTasya putrAderanvayaH. tasyASca tiNarTe ASrayatve nirUpakatvenAnvayaH. taTA ca putratvena putragocarecCAyA ASrayatvavAMScEtraH ityevamantrayaDIH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 107 pf0 165). atra kyajantasyA karmakatvameva vijYeyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 65). putrIyati mARavakamityatra ca AcArasahaSAcAraH kyajarTaH. tatra viSezaRIBUta AcAre karmatvena prakftyarTasyAnvayaH. viSezyIBUte ca mARavakAdeH karmatvenAnvayaH. tena putrakarmakAcaraRasadfSaM yanmARavakakarmakAcaraRaM tadanukUlakftimAn ityAkArakastatra voDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 107 pf0 165). putrakarmakAcaraRaM ceha annapAnAdinA saMvarDanatozaRAdi jYeyam. atrArTe kyajantasya sakarmakatvaM boDyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 65). aDikaM tu dvitIyASabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAdayizyate. SyenAyate kAka ityatrApi AcArasadfSAcAraH kyaNarTaH. tatra ca prakftyarTasya SyenAdeH kartftvenEva anvayaH. SyenakartfkA cArasadfSAcAravAnkAkaH ityevaM tatra boDaH. atra SyenakartfkAcAraSca mAMsaharaRAdirbrAhyaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 107 pf0 166).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0246" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

