krayaH — mUlyadAnajanyasvatvasya janakaH svIkAraH. svatvajanakaM mUlyadAnaM.. vA. yaTA grAmaM krIRAtItyatra DAtvarTaH. atra fyaPale svatve grAmasyADeyatvenAnvayaH. tena grAmanizWasya mUlyadAnajanyasvatvasyAnukUlasvIkAravAn grAmanizWaM yat svatvam tadanukUlamUlyadAtA vA iti tatra krameRa boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 72 pf0 96). krayasya svatvahetutvamuktaM manunA sapta vittAgamA DarmyA dAyo lABaH krayo jayaH. prayogaH karmayogaSca satpratigraha eva ca.. (manu0 10 Slo0 115) iti. gOtamenApyuktam svAmI rikTakraya saMviBAgaparigrahADigamezu iti. krayAdirUpAgamasahitaBogasyEva svatve prAmARyam (vIramitro0). atredaM boDyam. vEdikakarmANga parikrayAdO prAyeRa yajamAnasyEvADikArosti ityAha jEminiH (jEmi0 sU0 3. 8. 1). aTavA krayo nAma mUlyadAnaprayuktasvasaMbanDisvatvotpAdakasvIkAraH. yaTA gAM krIRAtItyAdO. atra govfttimUlyadAnaprayuktasvasvatvAnukUlasvIkArAnukUlakftimAn ityanvayaboDaH iti saMpradAyaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 5). SAbdikAH mUlyadAnapUrvakasvIkAra ityAhuH (la0 ma0). kecittu paRapUraRAdimUlyadAnena vikretuH svatvApanayanena svatvopAdanavyApAraH kraya ityAhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0247" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

