क्रियाविशेषणम्
kriyAviSezaRam — DAtvarTasADyAtmakakriyAyAM SAbdaboDe viSezaRatvena BAsamAnaH padArTaH. yaTA stokaM pacati mfdu pacatItyAdO stokamfdvAdi viklittyAdirUpaDAtvarTaviSezaRam. atra viSezyateneneti viSezaRam iti vyutpattyA viSezaRapadaM BedABedAnyatarasaMbanDenAnvayiviSezaRaparam. taTA ca AKyAtaM sakArakaviSezaRam iti mahABAzyeRa cEtrAByAM supyate devadatta jAnIhi ityAdO kArakAdInAM cEtradevadattAdInAM BedasaMbanDena kriyAviSezaRatvam. stokaM pacatItyAdO tu viklittirUpe DAtvarTaPale drutaM gacCati ityAdO DAtvarTavyApAre aBedena stokadrutAdInAM viSezaRatvam iti jYeyam. atredaM boDyam. BedasaMbanDena kriyAyAmanvayi viSezaRe pOnaHpunyena gacCati atiSayena pacati samenEti vizameREti ityAdizu prakftyAditvena tftIyeti kecidAhuH. anye tu nAmnA SivaH ityAdivadaBede tftIyetyAhuH. atrAyaM vivekaH. kriyAyAmaBeda saMbanDenAntrayavivakzAyAm kriyAviSezaRAnAM karmatvam ityanuSAsanena dvitIyA. BedaprakAreRAnvayavivakzAyAM tu tftIyA 32<BR>;p{0250}<BR>iti. atra sADyAtmakakriyAyA liNgasaMKyAnvayitvABAvena tadviSezaRastokAdivAcakapadasyotsargata ekavacanaklIbatA. ata eva stokaM pacyata ityAdi sADu saMgacCate. GaYAdyante sADyasidDoBayakriyayorDAtupratyayAByAM boDanasTale tu kAtantrapariSizwAyukte sokaM pAkaH ityAdO DAtuvoDyasADyarUpakriyAviSezaRattravivakzAyAmekavacanaklIvatA. GanvAcyasidDakriyAnvayavivakzAyAM tu viSezaRasya liNgasaMKyAntrayitvena tadviSezaRapadasya dvivacanapuMstvAdi. ata eva saMcAro ratimandirAvaDi saKIkarRAvaDi vyAhftam iti Agamo nizPalastatra BuktiH stokApi yatra no iti ca prayogaH saMgacCate iti SAbdikamatam. atra kecinnEyAyikAstu SudDaDAtvarTaviSezaRatvavitrakzAyAM dvitIyEva. GanAdyantasamudAya viSezaRatve tu na dvitIyAlI tAniyamaH. ata eva stokaM pAkaH iti prayogo na sADuH ityAhuH. vastutastu kriyAviSezaRAnAM karmatvam ityatra kriyeti padasya sArTakapratyayAntaDAtUpasTApyArTaH ityarTaparatvena na kutrApyanupapattiH iti vijYeyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 1 pf0 6). atrAyaM viSezaH. stokapaktetyAdO kriyAviSezaREH karmaDAraya eva. mahAkavirmahAvijYa ityAdO kavitvAdAviva prakftepyekanAmArTEkadeSe pacanAdAvaparanAmArTasyABedAnvayaboDakatayA karmaDArayasya saMBavAt. stokaM paktetyAdAvamastAdAtmyavAcitve tatpuruzaH saMBavatyeva. ayamASayaH. yatrABedenAnvayaboDastatra karmaDArayaH. yatra ca BedenAnvayaboDastatra tatpuruzaH iti maryAdA. evaM ca prakfte tAdAtmyasyAmvAcyatvena padopasTApitatvAt padAdupasTApitasya prakAratayApi BAnaM saMBavati iti niyamenAmvAcyastokatAdAtmyasyASrayatAsaMbanDenaM pacanakriyAyAmanvayo vAcyaH. taTA ca tAdfSasaMbanDasya BedasaMbanDatvAtatpuruzaH iti. kriyAviSezaREH samAsa evAvyutpannaH iti tu na deSyam. stokanamrA stanAByAm (meGadU0 2. 19) ityAdeH kAlidAsAdyEH prayuktatvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 38 pf0 48).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0249" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

