kroDaH — 1 (dozaH) netra lOhityAdiheturdozaviSezaH (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3). jYAnaviSezo vA. yaTA putrAya krudDyatItyAdO DAtvarTaH. atra kruDadruherzyAsUyArTAMnAM yaM prati kopaH (pA0 1 4 37) iti sUtreRa karmaRaH saMpradAnasaMjYA. taTA ca atra vizayitvaM caturTyarTaH. tasya kopenvayaH. evam puzpeByaH spfhayatItyAdAvapyanvayo voDyaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96). SAbdikAstu vaDAdyanukUlavyApArajanakaScittavfttiviSezaH. - yaTA haraye kruDyatItyAdO kruDerarTaH. kroDaca kopamUlakaH. atra hari saMpradAnakaH kroDaH iti boDaH (la0 ma0 sutra0 4 pf0 103. kecittu parAnizwABilAzeRAnizwavizayakadveza hetukaScittavfttiviSezaH. yaTA kzamEva kroDavijaye samarTeti vivekinaH. kroDaH kAryaviBaNgAya tasmAttaM kzamayA jayet (SakunaSA 0) ityAdO. yaTA vA kroDaM viBo saMhara saMhara (kumAra0 073. 72) ityAdI ityAhuH. duHKe tatsADane ca idaM me mA BUt iti spfhAviroDinI cittavfttiH kroDaH iti pAtaYjalaBAzye uktam. kroDomarza iti mitAkzarA (a0 2 Slo0 1). rOdrarasasya sTAyiBAvaH kroDa ityAlaMkArikA AhuH. sAMKyAstu kAma eva kutaScitparAhataH kroDarUpeRa pariRamate. sa ca rajoguRakAryaH. yaTA saNgAtsaMjAyate kAmaH kAmAtkroDoBijAyate (gItA 2. 62) ityAdO iti manyante. 2 zazwivarzAntargatozwatriMSattamo varza viSezaH. yaTA vizamasTaM jagatsarvaM vyAkulaM samudAhftam. janAnAM jAyate Badre. kroDe kroDaH parasparam.. iti pOrARikA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0251" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

