guRaH — 1 pramAyA asADAraRakAraRam. yaTA pramAyA guRajanyatvam utpattO paratastvam ityAdO. pratyakze viSezaRaviSezyasaMnikarzo guRaH (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 132135). anumitO ca vyApakavati vyApyajYAnaM yaTArTaparAmarSaH guRaH (ta0 dI0 prAmA0 pa0 37) (ci0 1 prAmA0). pramAyA asADAraRakAraRamityasya pramAtvADikadeSavfttiDarmAnavacCinnapramAnizWakAryatAnirUpita kAraRatASAlItyarTaH. tena jYAnamAtra hetu BUtAtmamanaH saMyogAdeH BramajanakapittAdidozARAM ca vyudAsaH (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 3435). 2 apraDAnam. yaTA zazWIM kuryA - tadA guRe tadguRasaMvijYAnabahuvrIhiH ityAdO iti. 3 vastuDarmo guRa iti vEyAkaraRAdaya AhuH. 4 aNgam. yaTA guRavAda ityAdO. yaTA vA daDnA juhotItyAdO praDAne yAgAdO ADeyaviSezo daDyAdiH guRa iti mImAMsakAH. 5 sattve niviSatepEti pfTagjAtizu dfSyate. ADeyaScAkriyAjaSca sosattvaprakftirguRaH.. iti SAbdikA AhuH. asyArTastu sidDAntakOmudIvyAKyAyAM tattvaboDinyAM strIpratyayaprakaraRe voto guRavacanAt (pARinisU0 4. 1. 44) iti sUtre uktaH tata eva drazwavyaH. 6 akAraH ekAraH okAraScEte trayo guRA ityapi SAbdikAH saMgirante. 7 sattvam rajaH tamaScEte dravyAtmakAH trayo guRA iti sAMKyAH. 8 jYAnAnandAdayopi guRA iti vedAntinaH. 9 SamadamatitikzAdayo guRA iti yoginaH. 10 SOryAdayo guRA iti vyavahArajYAH. 11 saMDivigrahAdayaH zaqguRA iti nItiSAstrajYAH. 12 SlezAdayo daSa mADuryOjaHprasAdA itiM trayo guRA ityAlaMkArikAH. 13 akArpaRyAspfhatvAdaya iti DarmajYAH. 14 deSakAlajYatAdayaScaturdaSa guRA iti pOrARikAH. 15 uzRAdyazwaviDaM vIryaM guRa iti BizajaH. 16 viSezaRamiti BartfhariH. 17 utkarzaH. 18 indriyam ityapare. 19 Avfttiriti tAntrikAH. 20 rajjuH. 21 sUpakAraH. 22 tyAga iti kAvyajYAH. 23 dozAnyaDarmo guRa ityanye AhuH (vAca0). 24 kAryasya jYApyasya vA ASraye ya ASritaH sa guRaH. ayaM ca viBAzA. ;p{0262}.<BR>guRestriyAm (pARinisU0 2. 3. 25) iti tftIyApaYcamIviDAyakasUtrasTaguRaSabdasyArTaH. yaTA vahnimAn DUmAt ityatra DUmo guRaH. jAqyAt jAqayena vA badDaH ityAdo jAqyAdirguRaH. atra DUmasya svajYApyavahfyASraye ASritatvAdguRatvam. jAqyasya ca svaprayojyabanDanASraye ASritatvAdguRatvam (vyutpa0 kA0 3). 25 rUpAdayaScatuviMSatirguRA iti vESezikA nEyAyikAcAhuH. tallakzaRaM ca [ka] dravyASrayyaguRavAn saMyogaviBAgezva kAraRamanapekza iti guRalakzaRam (vE0 1. 1. 16). [Ka] sAmAnyavAnasamavAyikAraRamaspandAtmA (ta0 BA0 arTani0 pf0 32). [ga] dravyakarmaBinnatve sati sAmAnyavAn. [Ga] guRatvarUpajAtimAn (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 6) (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 1). guRatvaM ca samavAyikAraRAvfttinityavfttisattAsAkzAdvyApyajAtimattvam. kAryAsamAnADikaraRakarmAvfttijAtimattvaM vA ityAdi (vE0 u0 7. 1. 1 pf0 281). aTavA samavAyikAraRAsamavetAsamavAyikAraRaBinnasamavetasattAsAkzAdvyApyajAtiH (sarva 0 pf0 215 OlU0). asamavAyikAraRaBinnASca AtmaviSezaguRAH budDisuKaduHKecCAdvezaprayatnaDarmADarmaBAvanAH BavantIti vijYeyam. etezAmasamavAyikAraRatvaM nEyAyikA na svIkurvanti. yadvA dravyetaravfttitAnavacCedakadravyasAmAnyavfttitAvacCedakapadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (vAkya 0 1 pf0 2). aTavA dravyAvfttinityavfttijAtimattvam (la0va0 pf0 4). aTavA dravyatvavyApakatAvacCedakasattAnyajAtimattvam (mu0 gu0 pf0 191). nyAyanaye guRAScaturviMSatiH. rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam gurutvam dravatvam snehaH SabdaH budDiH suKam duHKam icCA dvezaH prayatnaH DarmaH aDarmaH saMskAraH iti. rUpAdyaparatvAntAH ekAdaSa budDyAdiprayatnAntAH zaw ceti saptadaSa guRA iti kaRAdasUtre (vE0 1. 1. 6) uktam. sUtrasTacakAro gurutvAdInavaSizwAn sapta samuccinotItyevaM caturviMSatirguRA BavantIti praSastapAdAcAryAdaya AhuH. atredaM boDyam.<BR>;p{0263}<BR>rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH paratvam aparatvam gurutvam dravatvam snehaH vegaH sTitisTApakaH ete mUrtaguRA ityucyante. budDiH suKam duHKam icCA dvezaH prayatnaH DarmaH aDarmaH BAvanA SabdaH ete amUrtaguRAH. saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH ete guRAH mUrtImUrtaguRAH. saMyogaH viBAgaH dvitvAdikAH saMKyAH dvipfTaktvAdayaH ete anekASritA guRAH. tadBinnAH SizwAstvekEkavfttayaH. budDiH suKam duHKam icCA dvezaH prayatnaH DarmaH aDarmaH rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH snehaH sAMsidDikadravatvam BAvanA SabdaH ete viSezaguRAH. saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam nEmittikadravatvam gurutvam vegaH ete sAmAnyaguRAH. saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam dravatvam snehaH ete dvIndriyagrAhyaguRAH. rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH SabdaH ete bAyEkEkendriyagrAhyaguRAH. gurutvam adfzwam (DarmADarmO) BAvanA ete atIndriyaguRAH. budDyAdyazwakam BAvanA SabdaSca ete akAraRaguRotpannAH. apAkajA rUparasaganDAH anuzRaH sparSaH apAkajaM dravatvam snehavegagurutvEkatvAni pfTaktvam parimARam sTitisTApakaH ete kAraRaguRotpannAH. saMyogaH viBAgaH vegaH ete karmajA guRAH. rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH ekatvam parimARam ekapfTaktvam snehaH SabdaH sTitisTApakaSca ete asamavAyikAraRAnyeva Bavanti. budDyAdayozwO BAvanA ete AtmamAtravfttiviSezaguRAH nimittakAraRAnyeva. na tu asamavAyikAraRAni Bavanti. uzRasparSaH gurutvam vegaH dravatvam saMyogaviBAgO ete guRA asamavAyikAraRAni nimittakAraRAni ca Bavanti. budDyAdayozwO SabdaH BAvanA saMyogaH viBAgaH ete avyApya- vfttiguRA ucyante (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 87100). savikalpakajYAnam icCA prayatnaH suKam duHKam dvezaH jIvAtmagatamekatvam parimARam ete AtmayogyaguRA Bavanti. rUpAdInAmekEkendriyagrAhyatvam saMKyAdInAM dvIndriyagrAhyatvam suKAdInAM mAnasatvam sattAguRatvayoH<BR>;p{0264}<BR>sAmAnyayoH sarvendriyatvagrAhyatvam (vE0 u0 4. 1. 13). paratvAparatvadvitvapfTaktvAdayo budDyapekzaguRAH. rUparasaganDasparSaSabdaparimAREkatyEkapfTaktvasnehAH sajAtIyAramBakaguRAH. suKaduHKecCAdvezaprayatnAH svAsamAnajAtIyAramBakA guRA Bavanti. saMyogaviBAgasaMKyAH gurutvadravatvozRasparSajYAnaDarmADarmasaMskArAH samAnAsamAnajAtIyAramBakA guRAH. budDisuKaduHKecCAdvepaBAvanASabdAH svASrayasamavetaviSezaguRAramBakAH. rUparasaganDasparSaparimARasneha prayatnAH paratrAramBakAH. saMyogaviBAgasaMKyEkapfTaktvagurutvadravatva vegasnehaprayatnaDarmADarmAstUBayatrAramBakAH. gurutvadravatvavegasTitisTApakaprayatnaDarmADarmasaMyogaviSezAH kriyAhetavaH. paratvAparatvadvitvadvipfTaktvAdayo guRA akAraRAni Bavanti. svaDvaMsa pratyakzAtiriktaM prat