guRavAdaH — (arTavAdaH) [ka] viroDe guRavAdaH. viSezyatAvacCedakaviSezaRa SabdArTayorviroDe iti viroDe ityasyArTaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 124). [Ka] pramARAntaraviroDe satyarTavAdaH. yaTA Adityo yUpo Bavati. atra ca yUpa AdityABedasya pratyakzabADitatvAt AdityavadujjvalatvarUpaguRonena lakzaRayA pratipAdyate (lO0 BA0 pf0 55). yUpa AdityABedasya pratyakzAdivirudDatvAt tadgato guRaviSeza ujvalatvAdirlakzyate. Adityavadujjvalo yUpaH iti boDaH (ma0pra0 pf0 64). yaTA vA yajamAnaH prastaraH ityAdiH (si0 ca0 pf0 33) (lO0 BA0 pf0 55) (ma0pra0 pf0 64) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 124). atra prastaro darBamuzwiH. tasya yajamAne aBedAnvayabAMDAt<BR>;p{0267}<BR>yajamAnasya kuSamuzwiDAraRarUpANgavAdarUpatvAt guRavAdaH iti voDyam. guRavAdaSabdavyutpattistu guRasya aNgasya vAdaH iti drazwavyA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0266" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणविधिः
guRaviDiH — (viDiH) prAptasyAprAptasya vA karmaRoNgadravyaviDAnam. tatra prAptasya yaTA daDnA juhoti ityAdO daDidravyaviDAnam. guRaviDO ca DAtvarTasya sADyatvenEvAnvayaH. na tu sADanatvenApyanvayaH. atra homasya agnihotraM juhuyAt ityanena prAptatvAdDomoddeSena daDimAtraviDAnam. daDnA. homaM BAvayet iti vAkyArTaH (lO0 BA0). agnihotraM juhoti svargakAmaH iti viDinA svargasADanatvena prAptasyAgnihotrAderaNgam daDnA. juhoti iti vAkyena daDidravyaM vidaDadguRaviDiH (vAca0). aprAptasya yaTA somena yajeta ityAdO somaviSizwayAgaviDAnam. atra karma aNgaM ca mAnAntareRAprAptam iti uBayaviDAnam. yaTA hi tasya aNgarUpaguRaviDAnena guRaviDitvam taTA karmasvarUpa prApakatvena utpattiviDitvaM cetyuBayarUpatvam (vAca0). atra somadravyaM yAgaScetyuBayam aprAptam iti somaviSizwayAgaM viDatte. somapade matvarTalakzaRayA somavatA yAgena izwaM BAvayet iti vAkyArTaboDaH (lO0 BA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0267" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

