gurutvam — (guRaH) AdyapatanAsamavAyikAraRam (BA0 pa0 Slo0 155) (ta0 saM0) (ta0 va0 pf0 250). yaTA raktikamAzakatolakatvAdi (di0 1). Adyatvamiha svasamAnADikaraRapatanapratiyogikaDvaMsAsamAnakAlikatvam. dvitIyapatanAdInAM prATamikapatanaDvaMsasamAnakAlikatvAnnirAsa iti BAvaH (nIla0 1 pf0 14). patanaM nAma aDodeSasaMyogAnukUlo vyApAraH. tacca patanaM yaTA vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO vfkzaviBAgajanakatryApAramAraBya BUmisaMyogajanakavyApAraparyantaM sarvAH kriyAH. tatra prATamikavyApAro gurutvajanyaH. dvitIyAdistu vegajanyaH iti (vAkya 0 1 pf0 9) (vE0 5. 1. 718). idaM guruttram pfTivIjalavftti atIndriyaM ca. nityagataM nityam anityagatamanityam (BA0 pa0 Slo0 154155). gurutvaM patanAnumeyam. aDovacCedena saMyuktasamavAyAt. anumAnaprayogastu saMyogAsamavaDAnakAlInA kriyA guRAsamavAyikAraRikA kriyAtvAt saMyogajanya kriyAvat ityanumAnena<BR>;p{0269}<BR>gurutvasidDiH (di0 gu0 pf0 232). vallaBAcAryAMstu gurutvaM pratyakzam (spArSana vizayaH) ityAhuH (pa0 mA0) (vE0. u0 4. 1. 10). spArSanavizayaH lIlAvatIkArastu BasmIBAvadaSAyAM gurutvApakarzadarSanAttadanyaTAnupapattyA gurutvamapi pAkajaM mene. AcAryastu kAraRaguRapUrvakamaDye gurutve pAkajatvaviSezaRamapraveSayanto gurutvaM pAkajaM netyAviScakruH (pa0 mA0). sAMKyAstu gurutvaM tamoguRasya Darma ityAhuH (vAca0). arvAcInA hURavidyAviSAradAstu pfTivyAdigatAkarzaRaSaktiviSezeREva patanasyopapattAvalaM gurutvena iti menire. gurutvaM jalaBUmyoH patanakAraRam apratyakzam patanakarmAnumeyam saMyogaprayatnasaMskAraviroDi. tasya cAbAdiparamARurUpAdivannityAnityatvanizpattayaH iti (praSasta 02 pf0 52). atredaM vijYeyam. janyagurutvameva patanaM prati kAraRam iti kAryakAraRaBAvakalpanAt AkASAdInAM gurutvABAvo nEva. paramARvAdInAM tu janyagurutvABAvena patanAsaMBavaH. pArTivajalaparamARvorgurutvavattayA tasya mAlAdideSa saMyoge patanapratibanDakatvA kalpanepi na paramARupatanApattiSca iti (rAma0 1. 1 pf0 56). gurutvaM sparSaviSezaH pratyakzasidDa iti vallaBAcAryAH (nEyAyikaviSezAH) AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0268" t