jAtiH — 1 (sAmAnyam) [ka] samAnaprasavAtmikA jAtiH (gO0 2. 2. 68). samAnaH samAnAkArakaH prasavo budDijananamAtmA svarUpaM yasyAH sA. taTA ca samAnAkAra budDijananayogyatvamarTaH (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 68). tallakzaRaM ca prakAratayA SabdaSaktigraha vizayatvam. SaktisaMbanDena jAtipadavattvam iti nEyAyikasidDAntaH. atra jAtO vyaktO vA viSizwe vA samudAye vA Saktirityatra prABAkarAdInAM vipratipattayastAvat SaktiSabdavyAKyAnAvasare pradarSayizyanta iti tAstatrEvAvalokanIyAH. jAtibADakAni zaw santi. taTA coktamudayanAcAryeRa vyakteraBedastulyatvaM saMkaroTAnavasTitiH. rUpahAnirasaMbanDo jAtibADakasaMgrahaH.. iti (dravyakira0). tadarTaSca vyaktyaBedAdiSabdezu drazwavyaH. [Ka] yacca kezAMcidBedaM kutaScidBedaM karoti tat sAmAnyaviSezo jAtiriti (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 68) (vE0 1. 2. 3) (vE0 u0 1. 2. 3). [ga] samAnAkAra budDijananayogyaDarmaviSezaH nityAnekasamavetaH ityapi vadanti (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 68) (ta0 pra0 1). yaTA sAmAnyaparihInAstu sarve jAtyAdayo matAH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 15) ityAdO. yaTA vA saMketo gfhyate jAtO guRadravyakriyAsu ca. saMketitaScaturBedo jAtyAdirjAtireva vA (kAvyapra0 u0 2) asaMpAdayataH kaMcidarTaM jAtikriyAguREH (mAGa 0 sa0 2 Slo047) ityAdO dravyatvaguRatva karmatvAditiH. [Ga] SAbdikAstu anugatE kAkAbudDijananasamarTaH<BR>;p{0292}<BR>avayavavyaNgyaH sakfdupadeSavyaNgayaSca DarmaviSezaH ityAhuH. atrocyate. AkftigrahaRA jAtirliNgAnAM ca na sarvaBAk. sakfdAKyAtanirgrAhyA gotraM ca caraREH saha.. iti (mahABA0). AkftigrahaRe - tyasya anugata saMsTAnavyaNgyetyarTaH. yaTA manuzyatva paSutvaGawatvAdijAtiH. liNgAnAM ca na sarvaBAk sakfdAKyAtanirgrAhyetyasya asarvaliNgatve sati ekasyAM vyaktO kaTanAvyaktayantare kaTanaM vinApi sugrahetyarTaH. yaTA brAhmaRatvakzatriyatvAdijAtiH. tatra brAhmaRA dviviDAH gOqadrAviqaBedAt. sArasvatAH kAnyakubjAH gOqA utkalA mETilASceti paYca gOQAH. gurjarA mahArAzwrIyAH karnAwakAstElaMgAH kevaladrAviqASceti paYca drAviqAH. gotraM ca caraREH sahetyasya apatyapratyayArTaH SAKADyetfrUpaScEtAvarTO jAtirityarTaH. yaTA OpagavI kaWI bahucI iti. [Na] saMbanDiBedAtsattEva BidyamAnA gavAdizu. jAtirityucyate tasyAM sarve SabdA vyavasTitAH.. tAM prAtipadikArTaM ca DAtvarTaM ca pracakzate. sA nityA sA mahAnAtmA tAmAhustvatalAdayaH.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 304 pARi0). SudDasaMkIrRaBedena pratyekaM dviviDA brAhmaRatvAdirjAtiriti manvAdayaH. AkftivyaNgyameva sAmAnyaM jAtiriti prABAkarAH. tanmate guRakarmaRorjAtirnAsti iti boDyam (vE0 vi0 1. 2. 3). 2 svaBAva iti kAvyajYAH. 3 mAtrAkftaM Cando jAtiriti vfttaSAstrajYAH. 4 dfzwajAtiSezajAtiviSlezajAtipraBftayaH prAcInAnAmizwakarmasaMjYABedAH iti lIlAvatIkArAH (vAca0). 5 janmeti DarmajYAH. tatroktam AcAryastvasya yAM jAtiM viDivadvedapAragaH. utpAdayati sAvitryA sA satyA sAjarAmarA.. iti (manu0 a0 2 0 148). 6 jAtivAcakaH Sabdo jAtiriti SAbdikAH. 7 [ka] sADarmyavEDarmyAByAM pratyavasTAnaM jAtiH (gO0 112. 18). tadarTaSca vyAptinirapekzAByAM sADarmyavEDarmyAByAM pratyavasTAnaM dUzaRABiDAnaM jAtiH iti. vyAptinirapekzatayA dUzaRABiDAnamityeva vAcyam. tena ca saMdarBeRa dUzaRAsamarTatvaM svavyAGAtakatvaM vA darSitam (gO0 vf0 112. 18). atra cintyate. iyaM ca jAtirhetvABAsadozadeSanABAsA iti pratiBAti. iyaM jAtirniranuyojyAnuyogarUpe<BR>;p{0293}<BR>hetvABAsentarBavati ityanye. prayukte hi hetO yaH prasaNgo jAyate sA jAtiH. sa ca prasaNgaH sADarmyavEDamrmyAByAM pratyavasTAnamupAlamBaH pratizeDa iti. udAharaRasADarmyAtsADyasADanaM heturityasyodAharaRasADarmyeRa pratyavasTAnam. udAharaRavE DarmyAtsADyasADanaM heturityasyodAharaRavEDarmyeRa pratyavasTAnam. pratyanIkaBAvAjjAyamAnorTo jAti (vAtsyA0 1. 2. 18). [Ka] CalAdiBinnadUzaRAsamarTamuttaram. [ga] svavyAGAtakamuttaram (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 18) (sarva0 saM0 pf0 240 akza0) (nIla0 pf0 43). [Ga] asaduttaram (ta0 dI0 pf0 43) (ta0 BA0 pf0 50). uttarasyAsattvaM tu svAsADakatAsADAraRyena parAsADakatAsADakatayA svavyAGAtakatvam (nIla0 pf0 43). yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAnmahAnasavadityatra yadyayaM parvato mahAnasa sADarmyAdDUmavattvAdvahnimAn tarhi hfdasADarmyAt dravyatvavattvAdvahnayaBAvavAneva kiM na syAt iti (pra0 pra0 pf0 24). [Na] prayukte sTApanAhetO dUzaRA