जीवः
jIvaH — 1 (AtmA) [ka] yo prARAdInAM karaRAnAM prayoktA sa AtmA (vE0 u0 3. 1. 2). jIvAtmEvAyaM kzetrajYAdipadavedanIyaH (si0 ca0 1 Atma0 pf0 12). jIvalakzaRaM ca icCAdvezaprayatnasuKaduHKajYAnAnyAtmano liNgam (gO0 1. 1. 10) iti. suKaduHKAdikam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 11) iti vA. janyajYAnADikaraRatvam (si0 ca0 1 pf0 12) iti vA. jIvasadBAve pramARaM pratyakzameva. jIvasya ahaM suKI ahaM duHKI ityAdimAnasapratyakzavizayatvAt iti nEyAyikAH (pra0 pra0 pra0 pf0 10) (mu0 1). jIvo na mAnasapratyakzavizayaH iti vESezikA AhuH. ayamASayaH ahaM suKI ityAdyAkArakam<BR>;p{0295}<BR>yogyaviSezaguRayogenEvAtmanaH (jIvasya) pratyakzam na tu kevalam aham ityAkArakam iti (ta0 va0 pramARapari0 3 Slo0 51) (mu0 1 Atma0 pf0 107) (vE0 3. 2. 18) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 50). jIvasya pratyakzatve vipratipattO tu anumAnameva indriyArTaBinnasya jIvasya sadBAve pramARam. tatra liNgamucyate. prARApAnanimezonmezajIvanamanogatIndriyAntaravikArAH suKaduHKecCAdveza prayatnAScAtmano liNgAni (vE0 3. 2. 4). suzuptidaSAyAmapi prARApAnayorUrDvADogatyoranukUlaM prayatnAntaram jIvanayonirUpam astyeva iti. evam nimezonmezAvapi SarIrADizWAtAramanumApayataH ityAdi (vE0 u0 3. 2. 4). AtmendriyArTasaMnikarzAdyannizpadyate tadanyat (vE0 3. 1. 18). icCA praRiDAnam prARApAnO nimezAdiH kzatasaMrohaRam ityAdIni liNgAni AtmAnam (jIvAtmAnam) gamayanti (ta0 va0 Slo0 2 - 14 pf0 138) (BA0 pa0 lo0 4851.). indriyArTa prasidDirindriyArTeByorTAntarasya hetuH (vE0 3. 1. 2). anumAnaprayogastu rUpAdisAkzAtkAro dravyASritaH guRatvAdrUpavat ityanumAnenetarabADasahakftenAtmanaH sidDiH (vE0 vi0 3. 112). prasidDiH kvacidASritA kAryatvAt Gawavat guRatvAdvA kriyAtvAdvA. sA ca prasidDiH karaRajanyA kriyAtvAt CidikriyAvat. yacca prasidDeH karaRaM tadindriyam. tacca kartfprayojyam karaRatvAt vAsyAdivat. taTA yatreyaM prasidDirASritA yo GrARAdInAM karaRAnAM prayoktA sa AtmA (vE0 u0 3. 1. 2). budDyAdayaH pfTivyAdyazwadravyAtiriktadravyASritAH pfTivyAdyazwadravyAnASritatve sati guRatvAt yastu pfTivyAdyazwadravyAtiriktadravyASrito na Bavati nAsO pfTivyAdyazwadravyAnASrito guRo Bavati yaTA rUpAdi iti kevalavyatirekyanumAnam (ta0 BA0 prameya0 pf0 25). [Ka] indriyAdyaDizWAtA. indriyARAM SarIrasya ca paraMparayA cEtanyasaMpAdaka ityarTaH (mu0 1 Atma0 pf0 96). tatrAntare tu indriyARAmaDizWAtryo devatA uktAH. tA yaTA digvAtArkapracetoSvivahondropendramitrakAH iti (SAradAti 0). vEkArikA digAdyASca<BR>;p{0296}<BR>candreREkAdaSa smftAH. indriyARAmaDizWAtfdevAste sAttvikA matAH.. iti padArTAdarSe (vAca0). [ga] banDamokzayogyaH (si0 ca01 pf0 12). [Ga] SarIrasApekzajYAnavAn (pra0 pra0 prameya0 pf0 10). [Na] anityajYAnavAn (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 3). yaTA hantAhamimAstisro devatA anenEva jIvenAtmanAnupraviSya nAmarUpe vyAkaravARi (CA0 6. 3. 2 ityAdO). [ca] bAdarAyaRAcAryAstu evaM paYcaviDaM liNgaM trivft zoqaSavistftam. eza cetanayA yukto jIva ityaBiDIyate.. (BAga 0) ityAhuH. [Ca] mAyAvAdimate trayo hi jIvasyopADayaH. tatra suzuptO budDayAdisaMskAravAsitamajYAnamAtram svapne jAgradvAsanAmayaM liNgaSarIram jAgradavasTAyAM sUkzmaSarIrasaMsfzwaM sTUlaSarIram upADiriti tattadupADyupalakzitajAgratsvapnasuzuptayopyupADiSabdena vyavahriyante (vAca0). taTA ca tezAM mAyAvAdinAM mate [1] upADipravizwaM vANmanaH prARakaraRagrAmAnupravizwaM brahma jIvaH 2] GawAvacCinnA kASavacCarIratritayAvaMcCinnaM cEtanyam [3] darpaRamuKapratibimbavat budDisTaM cEtanyaprativimbam [4] sABAsAhaMkAraScitprativimbam [5] antaHkaraRopahitaM cEtanyam [6] ajYAnasya vyazwiSaktiBedo jIvaH sa ca paramAtmanaH aBinnaSca iti boDyam. atrocyate kAryopADirayaM jIvaH kAraRopADirISvaraH iti (vedA0 pa0). [ja] anekAntavAdinastu jIvAstikAyasaMjYayA pariBAzitaH padArTaviSeza ityAhuH. [Ja] boDAtmako jIvaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 67 AI0). nyAyavESezikanaye jIvo dehendriyArTAdivyatiriktaH. atra sUtram indriyArTaprasidDirindriyArTeByorTAntarasya hetuH (vE0 3. 1. 2) iti. taTA sa jIvaH paramAtmanaH sakASAdatiriktaH. atra sUtram SAstrasAmarTyAcca (vE0 3. 2. 21). SAstraM ca SrutiH dve brahmaRI veditavye ityAdi. taTA dvA suparRA sayujA saKAyA samAnaM vfkzaM parizasvajAte. tayoranyaH pippalaM svAdvattyanaSnannanyoBicAkaSIti iti (vE0 u0 3. 2. 21). na ca M tattvamasi Svetaketo brahmavidbrahmEva Bavati ityAdiSrutInAM kA gatiriti vAcyam. tattvamasi iti SrutestadaBedena tadIyatvapratipAdanenABedaBAvanAparatvAt.<BR>;p{0297}<BR>iti brahmavidrava iti SrutiSca nirduHKatvAdineSvarasAmyaM jIvasyABiDatte na tu tadaBedam ityAdi (vE0 vi0 3. 2. 21). sa ca jIvaH suKaduHKavEcitryAnnAnABUta eva. tadyaTA kaScidraNkaH kaScidAQyaH kaScidanyaviDaH punaH. anayEvAtmanAnAtvaM sidDayatyatra vyavasTayA.. (ta0 va0 A0 0 90 pf0 153) (vE0 32. 20). taTA sa jIvaH pratiSarIraM BinnaH. atra Bogavanve sati anavacCinnaBogavadBinno BinnaSabdArTaH. dvitIyArTovacCevalaM vyutpattivEcitryAdBoge anavacCedyatve cAnveti. SarIrapadaM tu prayojyatAsaMvanDena tattanmanoviSizwaparam. tena ekEkAtmano janmaBedenAvasTABedena kAyavyUhasTale ca nAnASarIrasattvepi na kzatiH. ekasyEtra manasaH pUrvapUrvajanmArjitaDarmADarmadvArA sakalaSarIraprayojakatvAt. taTA ca ekEkAtmA yatkicinmanoviSizwaSarIrAvacCinnaBogavattve sati tAdfSaSarIrAnavacCinnaBogavadBinnaH vAkyArTaH (vAkya 0 1 pf0 5-6). aTavA etacCarIrAvacCinnaBogavAn samAnakAlikayogajaDarmAdyajanyaSarIrAvacCinna BogavadBinnaH iti (nIla0 1 pf0 11). taTA sa jIvAtmA sarvatra sarvaSarIrAvayavezu kAryasya jYAnAdeH upalamBAdviBuH. jIvasyARutvANgIkAre kAyavyUhasTale yoginaH suKAdisAkzAtkArAnupapattirato viSumaNgIkartavyam (nIla0 1 pf0 11). viButvAnnityosO vyomavat (pa0 BA0 prame0 pf0 25) (vE0 31215). jIvasyAnityatvANgIkAre kftasya karmaRo hAneH akftasyAByAgamasya ca prasaNgaH. atastasya nityatvamaNgIkartavyam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 11). taTAca tarkasaMgrahAdAvuktam jIvaH suKaduHKavEcitryAnnAnABUta eva pratiSarIraM BinnaH viBurnityaSceti (ta0 saM0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 24) (si0 ca0 1 pf0 12) (vE0 3. 225) (pra0 pra0 pra0 pf0 10). jIvo viBuH iti sAMKyanEyAyikavESezikapAtaYjala mAyAvAdivedAntina AhuH. aRuparimARo nAnAviDaSca jIva iti rAmAnujIyamADvAdayo vEzRavAH. atra SrutiH bAlAgraSataBAgasya SataDA kalpitasya ca. BAgo jIvaH sa vijYeyaH sa cAnantyAya kalpate.. iti. SaNKasmftirapi bAlApraSataSo BAgaH 38<BR>;p{0298}<BR>nyAMyakOSaH. kalpitastu sahasraDA. tasyApi SataSo BAgo jIvaH sUkzma udAhftaH.. iti (vAca0). maDyamaparimARarUpo jIva iti mADyamikavOdDAH. taTApi dehaparimARarUpo jIva ityAItAH. atra jIvasya viButvaM manyamAnA nEyAyikAH samuttizWante. taTA hi jIvasya paramARurUpatvANgIkAre jIvagatajYAnAdipratyakzAnupapattiH. sarvaSarIravyApi suKAdyanupalabDiprasaNgaSca. yogino nAnASarIrAvacCedena suKAdyanupalabDiprasaNgaSca. maDyamaparimARarUpatvANgIkAre ca anityatvApattyA kftahAnAkftAByAgamayoH prasaNga iti jIvasya viButvamavaSyamaNgIkartavyamiti nyAyagranTatAtparyam (si0 ca0 1 pf0 12) (vAkya 0 1 pf0 5) (nIla0 1 pf0 11). jIva eka eva na tu nAnA iti mAyAvAdivedAntyekadeSina AhuH. etanmate avidyApratibimbo jIva iti mantavyam. anekajIvavAdimAyAvAdimate tu antaHkaraRaprativimvaH sa ca jAgratsvapna suzuptirUpAvasTAtrayavAn iti vivekaH (vAca0). vESezika sidDAnte jIvAtmani caturdaSa guRA vartante. te ca saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH budDiH suKam duHKam icCA dvezaH prayatnaH DarmaH aDarmaH BAvanAKyasaMskAraSceti (ta0 BA0 prame 0 pf0 31) (BA0 pa0 lo0 3233). tatra budDisuKaduHKecCAdvezaprayatnA dvikzaRAvasTAyinastftIyakzaRe naSyanti. atrAyaM niyamaH yogyaviBuviSezaguRAnAM svadvitIyakzaRotpannaguRanASyatvam iti (ta0 kO0 gu0 pf0 19) (mu0). tatra saMKyAdipaYcakaM tu Atmano dravyatvena sidDam. AtmEkatvaparimARe budDyAdayaH prayatnAntASca pratyakzasidDAH. tatrAtmEkatvaparimARe na pratyakzayogye iti wIkAkfta AhuH (pa0 mA0) (mu0). 2 jIvikAKyA vfttirjIva iti. kAvyajYA vadanti (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0294" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

