जीवनम्
jIvanam — 1 sadehasyAtmano manasA saMyogo vipacyamAnakarmASayasahitaH (vAtsyA0 3. 227). yaTA SataM jIvantu SaradaH (f0 18. 1) ityAdO saMSayaM punarAruhya yadi jIvati paSyati (hito0 ityAdO ca (vAca0). 2 praRavAntaritAnkftvA mantravarRAYjapetsuDIH. 10.<BR>;p{0299}<BR>mantrArRasaMKyayA tadDi jIvanaM saMpracakzate (sarva0 saM0 pf0 369 pAtaYja0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0298" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवनयोनियत्नः
jIvanayoniyatnaH — (prayatnaH) [ka] sAhajikaprARasaMcAravizayakayatnaH (di0 gu0). sa ca prARasaMcArakAraRam yAvajjIvamanuvartate. sa cAtIndriyaH SarIre prARasaMcArAnumeyaSca iti boDyam (vE0 u0 5. 2. 16) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 153). taTAhi SarIre aDikaSvAsAdiH prARasaMcAro yatnasADyatayA dfzwaH. itTaM ca prARasaMcArasya sarvasya suzupyavasTAyAM jAyamAnasyApi yatnasADyatvAnumAnAt pratyakzaprayatnabADAccAtIndriyayatnasidDiH. sa ca prARasaMcArahetutvenAnumIyamAna eva jIvanayoniyatnaH iti jYeyam (mu0 gu0 pf0 231). ayaM BAvaH. dfzwo hi DAvataH puruzasya pratyakza prayatnotkarzeRADikaSvAsAdirUpaprARasaMcArotkarzaH. itTaM ca ekatra yatnasADyatvasyAnuBavikatvena taddfzwAntena prARasaMcAratvAvacCedena sarvatra BoktfyatnajanyatvAnumAnam iti (di0gu0 pf0 232). etaduktaM Bavati. DAvataH prayatnotkarzeRa SvAsakriyotkarzadarSanAt SvAsakriyAtvAvacCinne eva yatnajanyatvaniScayaH. yadviSezayoH kAryakAraRaBAvaH asati bADake tatsAmAnyayorapi iti nyAyAjjIvanayoniyatnasidDiH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 97). navyanEyAyikAstu jIvanayoniyatnaM nANgIcakruH. ayaM BAvaH. prARakriyAyA adfzwa viSezaprayojyAtmamanoyogarUpAjjIvanAt tatprayojakAdfzwAdvA saMBavAt uktAnumAnasyAprayojakatvam. anyaTA ekatra yatne jYAnajanyatvadfzwAntena janyayatnatvAvacCedena jYAnajanyatvakalpanApattyA suzuptO jYAnAderapyatIndriyasya kalpanApattiH. evaM ca jIvanayoniyatnasvIkAre mAnABAvaH iti (di0 gu0 pf0 232) [Ka] jIvanAdfzwajanyo guRaH (si0 ca0 pf0 35). [ga] SvAsapraSvAsaheturyatnaH (ta0 kO0 gu0 pf0 19) (si0 ca0 pf0 35). suzuptidaSAyAmapi Atmano yena prayatnena prARApAnayorUrDvADogatI BavataH sa prayatno jIvanayonisaMjYako BavatItyarTaH (vE0 u0 3. 2. 4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0299" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जीवन्मुक्तिः
jIvanmuktiH — (niHSreyasam) [ka] yogajAdfzwajanyaMtattvasAkzAtkAraH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 29). iyaM cAparaniHSreyasamityucyate. jIvanmukterupAyAstu SravaRamanananidiDyAsanatattvajYAnAni yogAByAsAdayaSca. tatroktakulAcArA api tadupAyAH. yaToktam jIvanmuktAbupAyastu kulamArgo hi nAparaH iti (tantram) (vAca0). yaTA SukajanakAdInAM jIvanmuktiH. atra mAyAvAdina AhuH. jIvanmukto nAma svasvarUpAKaRqabrahmajYAnena tadajYAnabADanadvArA svasvarUpAKaRqabrahmaRi sAkzAtkfte ajYAnakAryasaMcitakarma saMSaya viparyayAdInAmapi bADitatvAdaKilabanDarahito brahmanizWaH iti (vedAntasA0). [Ka] avaDAritAtmatattvasya nErantaryAByAsApahftamiTyAjYAnasya prArabDaM karmopaBuYjAnasya jIvataH sata eva jAyamAnaScaramaduH KaDvaMsaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0300" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

