jEminiH — sAmavedADyayanena vedavyAsaSizya fziviSezaH. atra SrUyate sAmnAM jEminaye prAha taTA CandogasaMhitAm (BAga0 ska0 a0 6 0 18) iti. sa ca jEminiH aTAto DarmajijYAsA (jE0 0 sU0 1. 1. 1) ityAraBya anvAhArye ca darSanAt (jE0 sU0 12. 4 46) etatparyantaM dvAdaSADyAyAtmakaM sUtrabadDaM karmakARqAKyaM DarmamImAMsAdarSanaM praRinAya. 12<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0300" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

