ज्ञा
jYA — (DAtuH) [ka] jYAnam. yaTA cEtro GawaM jAnAti cEtreRa Gawo vijYAyate ityAdO DAtvarTaH (vE0 sA0 DAtva0 pf0 57). cEtro GawaM jAnAtItyatra prAcInamate dvitIyArTo vizayatvam. tatra prakftyarTasya GawAdeH ADeyatAsaMbanDenAnvayaH. tasya dvitIyArTasya vizayatvasya DAtvarTe jYAne nirUpakatva saMbanDenAnvayaH. navInamate tu vizayitvaM dvitIyArTaH. aya- -mASayaH. vfttyaniyAmaka saMbanDasyABAvapratiyogitAnavacCedakatayA GawaM jAnAti pawaM na ityAdO anvayasya anupapattiH. atoyamarTaH svIkAryaH iti. tasya ca DAtvarTajYAna ASrayatA - (svarUpAKya -) saMbanDenAnvayaH<BR>;p{0301}<BR>(ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka 0 1 50 51). evaM ca GawanizWavizayatAnirUpita vipayitASrayIBUtaM yajjYAnaM tadASrayaScEtraH iti SAbdaboDaH. GawAdinizWaM jYAnAdikarmatvaM ca jYAnAdivizayatvameva. vizayatvAdO ca dvitIyAyA lakzaREva na tu SaktiH iti sAMpradAyikA AhuH. cEtreRa Gawo jYAyate ityatra karmAKyAtena GawAdO DAtvarTajYAnanirUpitaM vizayatvaM boDyate (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 51). taTA ca cEtreReti tftIyAyA arTaH cEtrAnvitaM samavetatvam. tasya ca DAtvarTe jYAnenvayaH. tasya jYAnasya cAtmanepadArTavizayatvenvayaH. tasya tAdfSavizayatvasya GawenvayaH. evaM ca cEtrasamavetajYAnavizayo vawaH iti SAbdaboDaH. [Ka] SAbdikA pataYjalipraBftayaH jYAnAnukUlavyApAraH jYADAtvarTaH. la0 ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 6) (vE0 sA0 da0 DAtva0 pf0 63). yaTA devadatto GawaM jAnAtItyAdA jAnAtyarTaH ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 DAtva0 pf0 46). atra vizayatayA jYAnaM Palam. AtmamanaH saMyogo vyApAraH. ata eva mano jAnAti ityupapadyate (la0 ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 6). AtmamanaH saMyoga ityatrAtmAntaHkaraRam. manopi tadvfttiviSezarUpam (la0 ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 6). atra devadattABinnASrayako jYAnAdyanukUlo vartamAno vyApAraH iti boDaH (vE0 sA0 DAtva0 pf0 46). [ga] anye tu SAbdikAH vizayAvacCinnAvaraRaBaNgAdiPalAnukUlavyApAraH. yaTA GawaM jAnAtItyAdO DAtvarTaH ityASaSaNkire (vE0 sA0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 62). atItAnAgatAdiparokzasTalepi. jYAnajanyasya tAdfSaPalasyAvaSyakatvam. ata eva jYAdiDAtoH sakarmakatvamupapadyate. jYAnasyEva PalatvANgIkAre tadanASrayatvAdGawAdeH karmatvAnupapattiH iti BAvaH. (cE0 sA0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 62). sa ca vyApArorTaprakASarUpaH. atredaM jYeyam. jYAkfYAdiDAtuzu sakarmakatvavyavahAro BAkta iti nEyAyikasidDAntaH (vE0 sA0 DAtva0 pf0 60).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0300" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञातता
jYAtatA — 1 jYAnavizayatA (ta0 BA0 pramARa 0 pf0 22). atredamavaDeyam. jYAtatA jYAnavizayatvam. tacca svarUpasaMbanDameva. yaTA jYAto<BR>;p{0302}<BR>GawaH iti pratItivizayo jYAtateti nEyAyikAH prAhuH. BawwAstu GawAdO samavAyena vartamAnA jYAnajanyA jYAtatetyAhuH. atredaM boDyam. Bawwamate jYAto GawaH iti pratItiM prati GawajYAnaM nimittakAraRam. GawAdikaM samavAyikAraRam. asamavAyikAraRaM tu nApekzitam. BAvakAryaM sAsamavAyikAraRam iti niyamasya tu BawwEranaNgIkArAt iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 129). yaTA jYAtasAropi KalvekaH saMdigDe kAryavastuni (mAGa 0 sa0 2 0 12) ityAdO sArasya tattvArTasya jYAtatA. 2 BawwamImAMsakAstu jYAtaH iti pratItisidDo jYAnajanyo vizayasamavetaH prAkawyAparanAmA atiriktapadArTaviSezaH (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 126). aTavA savizayako jYAnajanyotiriktapadArTaH ityAhuH (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 35). jYAtatAyA jYAnajanyalaM cetTam. GawAdivizaye jYAne jAte mayA jYAtoyaM GawaH iti Gawasya jYAtatvaM pratisaMDIyate. tena jYAne jAte sati jYAtatA nAma kacidDarmo jAtaH ityanumIyate. sA ca jYAtatA jYAnAtpUrvamajAtatvAt jYAne jAte ca jAtatvAdanvayavyatirekAByAM jYAnena janyate ityavaDAryate iti (ta0 BA0 prAmA0 pf0 22). 3 yA SakyamanuBAvayati sA SaktirjYAtateti kecidAhuH (ci0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0301" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानम्
