ज्ञानलक्षणः
jYAnalakzaRaH — (saMnikarzaH) svavizayavizayakapratyakzajanako jYAnaviSezaH (smaraRam). yaTA suraBitvajYAnam (BA0 pa0 1 0 66) (mu0 1 pf0 131) (ta0 va0). atredamavaDeyam. ayaM. saMnikarzaH smftyAtmakaH alOkikapratyakze kAraRaM Bavati. jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzeRa tadvizayIBUtatattatpadArTAnAM pratyakzaM manasA janyate. kaTamanyaTA (jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzA svIkAre) kavikAvya mUlaBUta tattatpadArTasaMsargajYAnam (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 9). kiMca jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzAsvIkAre yatra sOraBatvajAtyupasTityanantaraM suraBirganDaH itivat suraBi candanam ityAkArakaM sOraBatvaprakAreRa candanasya BramAtmakaM cAkzuzam tatra sOraBatvajAterBAnaM na syAt. nahi tatra suraBiganDasya BAnasaMBavaH. yena suraBiganDaBAsanena sAmAnyalakzaRAyAstadDarmaprakArakatadASrayapratyakzaM pratyeva hetutayA sOraBattrapratyAsatteH kAryatAvacCedakatayEva sOraBatvajAterBAnaM Bavizyati iti saMBAvanIyam (jaga0) (vAca0). tAdfSaM smaraRaM ca yadvizayakam tadvizayakasAkzAtkArajanikA pratyAsattiH. suraBi candanam iti cAkzuze sOraBasya sOraBatvasya vA BAnaM jYAnapratyAsattyEva (ma0pra0 150 22). ayaM ca yadvizayakaM jYAnaM jananIyam tasyEva saMnikarzaH. ata eva suraBi candanamityAdO sOraBatvAderapi BAnamiti (dIDi0). jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzeRa (smaraRena) pUrvajYAtavastunaH alOkikapratyakzaM janyate. yaTA suraBi candanam iti cAkzuze candanasya cakzurbrAhyatvepi sOraBasya tadgrAhyatvAt pUrvajYAtasya sOraBasyA.<BR>;p{0304}<BR>lOkikaM pratyakzaM janyate. taTA ca suraBi candanamityatra sOraBAMSe alOkikatvam candanAMSe lOkikatvam iti (vAca0). atra ca suraBitvajYAnaM (smaraRam) tu suraBi candanam iti cAkzuzopanItaBAnaM janayatIti vijYeyam. yatra sOraBajYAnalakzaRayA cAkzuzasAmagryA ca suraBi candanaKaRqam iti sOraBAMSe alOkikam candanaKaRqAMSe lOkikaM cAkzuzaM jAyate tatra sOraBajYAne sOraBapratyakze jananIye sOraBasmaraRameva pratyAsattiH. sOraBAMSe cakzuH saMnikarzAsaMBavAt (si0 ca0 1 pf0 23). sOraBasya cakzurayogyatvena cakzuH saMyuktacandanasamavAyasya tatra sattvepyaprayojakatvAt iti (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 9). evam rajjusarpAdiboDepi sarpatvAdyupasTitirjYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzAdeva Bavati. yataH sarpatvAdO cakzuHsaMnikarzABAvAditi (ta va0). evaM yatra DUmatvena DUlIpawalaM jYAtaM tatra DUlIpawalasyAnuvyavasAye BAnaM jYAnalakzagayA Bavati. ayaM ca jYAnalakzaRaH saMnikarzaH zaqindriya sahakArI iti saMpradAyavida AhuH. manasa eva sahakArI iti SUlapARimiSrA amanyanta (ta0 kO0 1 pf09).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0303" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

