तत्
tat — 1 [ka] vaktfbudDivizayaH tatpadArTaH. yaTA tO gururgurupatnI ca (raGu0 sa0 1 Slo0 57) te himAlayamAmatrya (kumAra0 sa0 6 lo0 94) ityAdO. [Ka] kecittu parokzabudDivizayaH tacCabdArTa iti vadanti (di0 4 pf0 179). idamastu saMnikfzwaM samIpataravarti cEtado rUpam. adasastu viprakfzwaM taditi parokzaM vijAnIyAt.. ityaBiyuktokteH (mano0). [ga] kvacit yatpadapratipAdyatayA vaktfbudDivizayatAvacCedakatvopalakzitaDarmAvacCinnaH. iyaM ca vyutpattiH prakramyamARaparAmarSakatacCabdasya drazwavyA. yataH prakramyamARaparAmarSakatacCabdena niyamato yatpadamapekzyate. yaTA tamAnaya ya ihAsti ityAdO (ga0 Sakti0 wI0 pf0 115). yaTA vA sa kiMsaKA sADu na SAsti yoDipam (kirA0 sa0 1 Slo0 5) ityAdO. [Ga] SAbdikAstu yatpadpratipAdyatayA vaktfbudDivizayo viDeyaBUtaH tatpadArTa iti vadanti. [Na] kacit svoccArakapuruzaprayuktapUrvapadajanyopasTitivizayatAvacCedakatyopalakzitasvaprayojakabudDivizayatAvacCedakaDarmAvacCinnaH. atropasTitiSca svaviSezyakavfttijYAnADInA grAhyA. ataH paSurasti taM paSyetyAdO paSvAdipadopasTApitalomAdInAM tadAdiSabdena na parAmarSaH. iyaM vyutpattiH prakrAntaparAmarSakatacCabdasya drazwavyA. yataH tatra yatpadApekzAniyamo nAsti. yaTA tadanvaye SudDimati prasUtaH SudDimattaraH. dilIpa iti rAjendurinduH kzIraniDAviva.. (raGu0 sa0 1 0 12) ityAdO. atra vEvasvatAdipadopasTApyasyApi tacCabdena parAmarSAnna yatpadApekzeti jYeyam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 115). 2 prasidDam. prasidDatvaM cAnekajYAnavizayatvam (ga0 Sakti0 wI0 pf0 116). yaTA dvayaM gataM saMprati SocanIyatAM samAgamaprArTanayA kapAlinaH. kalA ca sA kAntimatI kalAvatastvamasya lokasya ca netrakOmudI.. (kumAra0 saM0 5. 71) taM<BR>;p{0309}<BR>1. keSapASaM prasamIkzya kuryuH (kumAra0 saM0 1148) ityAdO. atra seti prasidDArTatvAnna yacCabdApekzA. taduktaM kAvyaprakASe prakrAntanA prasidDAnuBUtArTavizayastacCabdo yacCandopAdAnaM nApekzate iti (kumAra0 0571). yaTA vA tat satyam sa AtmA tattvamasi Svetaketo (CA0 u0) ityAdO. taduktam AUM tatsaditi nirdeSo brahmaRastriviDaH (smftaH (gItA0 17,23) iti. 3 anuBUtam. yaTA te locane pratidiSaM viDure kzipantI (ratnAvalI) ityatra. 4 hetuH. yaTA saMtaptAnAM tvamasi SaraRaM tat payoda priyAyAH (meGa0 pUrva0 Slo0 7) tadaNgamagryaM maGavan mahAkratoH (raGu0 sa0 3 Slo0 46) ityAdO. 5 tadA ityetadarTaH. yaTA jyAyasI cetkarmaRaste matA budDirjanArdana. tat kiM karmaRi Gore mAm (gItA a0 3 Slo0 1) ityAdO. tatvajYAnam - [ka] yaTArTajYAnam. atroktam. tattvajYAnaM tu Kalu miTyAjYAnaviparyayeRa vyAKyAtam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 2). tacca ISvaranodanABivyaktAdDarmAdeva (praSasta0 BA0 1. 1. 1 pf0 11). ISvaranodanA upadeSaH. veda iti yAvat. tenABivyaktAtpratipAditAdDarmAdeva Bavizyati ir ityarTaH (kira0 1. 1. 1 pf0 11). [Ka] yaTAvasTitapadArTADigatiH. tacca pramARam (nyA0 vA0 pf0 4). yaTA sati GawAdivastuni sat iti jYAnam. asati ca SaSaSfNgAdO asat iti jYAnam. [ga] niKilalokavimokzamuKyopAyaM mananopAyamAtmanastattvajYAnamAmananti (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 1). yaTA AtmA SarIrAdiByo BinnaH ityAkArakaM jYAnam (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 5). yaTA vA AtmAdeH Kalu prameyasya tattvajYAnAnniHSreyasADigama ityAdO (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1). idaM tattvajYAnaM ca paramAtmavizayakam niHSreyasasADanaM ceti boDyam. [Ga] itaranivfttipUrvako brahmAtmAtragama iti mAyAvAdino vadanti. [Na] BagavadvizayakamaparokzajYAnamiti dvEtavAdino vedAntina AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0308" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तत्त्वम्
tattvam — [ka] sataSca sadBAvaH asataScAsadBAvaH. sat sat iti gfhyamARaM yaTABUtamaviparItam tattvaM Bavati. asacca asat iti gfhyamARaM yaTABUtamaviparItam<BR>;p{0310}<BR>tattvaM Bavati (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA). yaTAM pramARaprameya tattvajYAnAnniHSreyasADigamaH (gO0 1. 1. 1) ityAdO prameyAdikaM tattvam. [Ka] yo yaTAvasTitaH padArTaH sa taTA - BUtapratyayotpattinimittaM yattat (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 12). [ga] anAropitaM tattvam. pramitivizaya iti yAvat. iti vedAntinaH SrI pUrRaprajYAcAryamatAnuyAyinaH prAhuH (tattvasaMKyA 0 wI0). [Ga] yATAtaTyam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 40). yaTA avijYAtatattve (gO0 1. 1. 40) ityAdO. yaTA vA kAryaM sovekzya Sakti ca deSakAlO ca tattvataH (manuH 7. 10) ityAdO. [Na] vArtikakArAstu padArTAnAM yaTAvasTitAtmapratyayotpattinimittatvam ityAhuH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 12). [ca] kAvyajYAstu svaBAvaH. yaTA nistattvAH ityAdO ityAhuH (vAca0). mataBedena tattvAni pradaSyante.). [1] svatantrAsvatantraBedena dviviDaM tattvam iti dvEtavAdinaH SrIpUrRaprajYAcAryA vedAntinaH prAhuH (tattvasaM0 wI0). [2] sadsaduBayAnuBayAtmakacatuzkoRavinirmuktaM SUnyameva tattvam iti SUnyavAdino bOdDAH (sarva0 pf0 29 bOdDa0). [3] pfTivyAdIni catvAri BUtAni tattvAni iti cArvAkA AhuH (sarva0 pf0 2 cArvA0). [4] jIvA - jIvAKye dve tattve ityArhatAH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 67 AI0). [5] jIvAkASaDarmADarmapudgalAstikAyAH paYca tattvAni ityArhatEkadeSinaH (sarva 0 saM0 pf0 69 AI0). [6] jIvAjIvAsravabanDasaMvaranirjaramokzAH sapta tattvAni ityapara ArhatEkadeSinaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 73 AI0). [7] dravyAdravyaBedena dviviDaM tattvam iti rAmAnujIyAH (sarva0 pf0 112 rAmA0). [8] patipaSupASezu trizu padArTezu pfTivyAdIni paYca tattvAni iti pASupataSAstrakovidA nakulISAcAryAH (sarva0 pf0 135 nakku0). [9] pfTivyAdikalAparyantAni triMSattattvAni puryazwakapadavAcyAni kalAkAlaniyatividyArAgaprakftiguRAKyAni sapta tattvAni iti ca SEvA AhuH (sarva0 pf0 185 SEva0). [10] maha<BR>;p{0311}<BR>dAdIni paYcaviMSatistattvAni iti nirISvarasAMKyAH kapilAdayaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 311 sAM0). [11] ISvarADikAni tAni (25) iti - viSat