तत्पुरुषः
tatpuruzaH — (samAsaH) [ka] yadarTagatena subarTena viSizwasya yadarTasyAnvayaboDaM prati yaH samAsaH svarUpayogyaH sa tadarTasya tadarTe tatpuruzaH. yaTA grAmagataH ityAdiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 38 pf0 48). [Ka] samAsaprayuktalakzaRASUnyottaranAmakatve sati lupta dvitIyAdiviBaktikapUrvanAmakasamAsaH. yaTA rAjapuruzaH iti. atra lakzaRe paYcapUlItyAdivAraRAya satyantam. nIlotpalamityAdivAraRAya luptadvitIyAdiviBaktiketi AbrAhmaRamityAdyavyayIBAvavAraRAya pUrveti ca nAmaviSezaRam. rAjapuruza ityatra samAsaprayuktalakzaRAyAH pUrvapada eva svIkArAt satyantaviSizwaviSezyasattvAt lakzaRasamanvayaH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 43). [ga] SAbdikASca tatpuruzADikAravihitaH samAsastatpuruzaH ityAhuH. tanmate sa ca tatpuruzaH prakArAntareRa triviDaH. vyaDikaraRapadaGawitaH samAnADikaraRapadaGawitaH saMjYAnavavoDakasaMKyAvAcakapadaGawitaSceti. tatra saMjYAnavaboDakasaMKyApUrvakasamAnADikaraRapadGawitastatpuruzo dvigurityucyate. dviguvizayaparihAreRa<BR>;p{0312}<BR>samAnADikaraRapadaGawitatatpuruzaH karmaDAraya ityucyate. tadBinno vyaDikaraRapadaGawitaH tatpuruza ityucyate. yaTA rAjapuruza ityAdiH (vAca0). uttarapadArTapraDAnastatpuruzaH iti kecidAhuH. tanna. arDapippalI ityAditatpuruze avyApteH. sUpaprati ityAdyavyayIBAvetivyApteSca (vAca0). yaToktaM vAkyapadIye samAsastu caturDeti prAyovAdastaTAparaH. yoyaM pUrvapadArTAdiprADAnyavizayaH sa ca.. iti. sa ca tatpuruzo dvitIyAdiBedena zaqviDaH. dvitIyAdisubarTasya karmatvakartftvAderyoDaBedAdetasya tatpuruzasya dvitIyAtftIyAditatpuruzatvena zaNgedAH. taTA hi grAmagata ityatra dvitIyAtatpuruzaH. cEtranIta ityatra tftIyAtatpuruzaH. brAhmaRadatta ityatra caturTItatpuruzaH. vfkzapatita ityatra paYcamItatpuruzaH. cEtraDanam mEtragatirityatra zazWItatpuruzaH. gfhapaka ityatra saptamItatpuruzaH iti. atredaM boDyam. yadetezu DAtvarTAnvayyeva dvitIyAderarTaH prAyo GawakaH. pIWaM paritaH puRyena suKam SamAya vidyA daRqAdGawaH gavAM kfzRA saMpannakzIrA tilezu tElam ityAdivigrahe tatpuruzasyAsADutvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 39 pf0 48). varza suKI lowakaRaH kuRqalahiraRyam GawAnyaH kuverabaliH karmakuSalaH ityAdO tu tattadviSeza viDerdvitIyAditatpuruzaH iti (Sa0 pra0 49). atra mataBedAH. rAjapuruza ityAdO rAjapadasya rAjasaMbanDini lakzaRA. tena puruzapadArTasyABedenAnvayaH iti nEyAyikA AhuH. anye tu luptazazwyevAnvayaboDaM janayati pazWIlopamajAnatastu puruzasya tatrAnvayapratyayaH SaktiBramAt rAjapadalakzaRayA vA iti svIcakruH. pUrvakalpe rAjapadasya rAjasaMbanDini nirUQalakzaRA. etanmate tu zazWIlopasmaraRAsaMBavasTale rAjapade svArasikI lakzaRA iti BedaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 43). vEyAkaraRAstu samAsasTaSabdasamudAye viSizwArTe SaktirevetyAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 11).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0311" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तथा च
