तदन्यबाधितार्थप्रसङ्गः
tadanyabADitArTaprasaNgaH — (tarkaH) AtmASraya anyonyASraya cakraka anavasTA ityuktacatuzkAnyaH pramARabADitArTasya prasaNgaH. sa dviviDaH vyAptigrAhakaH vizayapariSoDakaSca. vizayasya vyaBicAraSaNkAnivfttidvArA niScAyakatvena pariSoDakatvaM boDyam. tatrAdyo yaTA DUmo yadi vahnivyaBikacArI syAttadA vahnijanyo na syAt iti. dvitIyastu parvato yadi nirvahniH syAt nirDUmaH syAt ityAdiH (jaga0) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 40).<BR>;p{0314}<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0313" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

