तदीयत्वम्
tadIyatvam — 1 saMbanDAntaraM vinApi tatsaMbadDasvaBAvattram (ci0 1). yaTA devadattasvaBAvasya ADyAtmikAdiDarmasya devadattIyatvam. 2 tatsvAmikattram. yaTA tadIyamAtaNgaGawA viGawwitEH (mAGa0 sa0 1 Slo0 64) ityAdO mAtaNgAnAM tadIyatvam. atra tadIyatvaM nAma rAvaRasvAmikatvam. tatsaMbanDitvamiti sArvatrikorTaH. nAgaka<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0314" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्गणसंविज्ञानः
tadgaRasaMvijYAnaH — (bahuvrIhisamAsaH) [ka] yo bahuvrIhiH svIyavigrahavAkyasya viSezyaviDayA pratyAyyo yorTastadviSezyakaboDakfdBavati sa bahuvrIhistadguRasaMvijYAnaH iti navInAH prAhuH. yaTA GawasvarUpaH padArTaH kuwAdirgaRaH ityAdO. navInanEyAyikamate vyutpattiH tasya svArTaguRIBUtasya samyak viSezyaviDayA vijYAnaM yasmAt iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 44 pf0 5960). aTavA tasya samasyamAnapadArTasya guRIBUtasyApi samyak viSezyaviDayA jYAnaM yasmAt iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 49). GawasvarUpaH padArTa ityatra GawaH svarUpaM yasya iti vigrahasTale svasvarUpABinnaGawa saMbanDitvena GawABinnasvasvarUpasaMbanDitvena vA vigrahaviSezyaM kalaSameva viSezyaviDayA anena bahuvrIhiRA boDyate iti. taTA 1. kuwAdirgaRa ityatra kuwa Adiryasya iti vyutpattyA kuwABinnasya svaDarmikavyavasTA DarmiRaH saMbanDitvena DAtvantaramiva kuwamapi boDayaMstadguRasaMvijYAna eva bahuvrIhiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 44 pf0 59). [Ka] yaMtra viSezaRasyApi kriyAyAM viSezyaviDayAnvayaH saH. yaTA BUvAdayo DAtavaH cEtrAdInBojaya lambakarRamAnaya ityAdO. atra kriyAvAcitvena nimantritatvena lambakarRAvayavinoryaH saMbanDastadavacCinnatvena ca anvayaboDaH<BR>;p{0315}<BR>. lakzakasaMbanDasyEva lakzyatAvacCedakatvAt tena rUpeREva boDAt. viSezaRasyApi BUvAdeH kriyAnvayAdajahatsvArTAtra lakzaRA (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 49). [ga] yo bahuvrIhiH svArTasyAnvayini svArTaGawakasyApyarTasyAnvayaboDane samarTaH sa tadguRasaMvijYAnaH iti prAcInA AhuH. yaTA lambakarRamAnaya hAragrIvaM paSyetyAdO. atra hi bahuvrIhilambakarRasaMbanDinaH svagrIvAvfttihArasaMbanDinaSca svArTasyAnvayini karmatvAdO svArTaGawakIBUtasya tAdfSakarRahArAderapi vyutpattivEcitryeRa anvayaboDane samarTaH iti (Sa0 pra0 lo0 45 pf0 59). [Ga] pare tu yatra viSezaRatayA svArTasya viDeyenvayaH sa tadguRasaMvijYAnabahuvrIhiH ityAhuH. yaTA lambakarRamAnayetyAdO (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 49). etatkalpe vyutpattiH tatra bahuvrIhO guRasya guRIBUtasya viSezaRasya saMvijYAnam viSezyapAratantryeRa boDanam yatra iti vadanti. atra parezAM mate lambakarRAdeH viSezyAnvayinAnvayAt viSezaRatayA viDeyAnvayaH. viSezaRatvaM ca viSezyAnvayinAnvayitvameva. navInamatAnuroDena lambakarRasyApi viSezyatvenEvAnvayenuBavabADaH. tasmAt atrApi jahatsvArTEva lakzaRA (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 49). Bavati ca guRIBUtasya karRAderapyAnayane DarmipAratantryeRa DarmidvArA anvayaboDaH iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0314" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तद्धितः
tadDitaH — (pratyayaH) [] viBaktiDAtvaMSakfdBayonyaH pratyayaH. yaTA mArIca ityAdO aR dAkzirityAdO in pratyayastadDitaH. atra nAmaprakftikapratyayatvaM na tadDitasya lakzaRam. viBaktO kyajAdO cAtivyApteH. pacatitarAmityAdO tarabAdizvavyApteSca (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 108 pf0 172). ato viBaktiDAttraMSetyAdyeva lakzaRaM yuktam iti. atredamavaDAtavyam. vfkzaka ityAdO hrasvAdyarTakaH kAdirapi tadDita eva iti. anye tvevamAhuH. vfkzaka ityAdO kAdistu na tadDitaH. ataH tadanyatvenApi lakzaRe pratyayo viSezaRIyaH iti. atra zazWyantAnnAmnaH sAkzAtparaMparAsADAraRApatyasAmAnye boDye aR ityutsargaH. tena marIcerapatyaM mArIca iti rUpaM sidDayati (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 108111). [Ka] tadDitADikAra vihitaH pratyayaviSeza iti SAbdikA vadanti. atredaM boDyam.<BR>;p{0316}<BR>tadDitAH (pA0 sU0 4. 1. 76) ityaDikftya yUnastiH (pAM0 sU0 4. 1. 77) ityAraByApaYcamADyAyasamApteryAvantaH pratyayA vihitAste tadDitasaMjYakA Bavanti iti. tatra sAmAnyatastadvito dviviDaH. prakftyarTaBinnArTakaH KArTikaSceti. tadDitapratyayaSca apatyAditattadarTa BedaboDanena aR iY Rya ityAdyanekaviDaH. tatroktam tasyApatyaM tadviSezastadfkzeRa yutendumAn. kAlastaTA tena raktaM tasya vyUhoTa vetti tat.. aDIte vA devatAsya sEvamAdIn yaTAyaTam. boDayadviviDAnarTAstadvitaM syAdanekaDA.. iti. tatra kecittadDitapratyayAstattadarTezu sodAharaRAH pradarSyante. yaTA apatyArTe aR marIcerapatyaM mArIcaH. vettItyarTe nimittaM vetti nEmittaH. aDIte ityarTe CAndasaH vEyAkaraRaH trEvidyaSca. saMbanDyarTe vfkzasya saMbanDi vAkzam. jAtArTe amAvAsyAyAM jAta AmAvAsyobAlakaH. goSAlAyAM jAtaM goSAlam. anurADAyAM jAtaH anurADaH. atrARo lukU. apatyArTe IRU dakzasyApatyaM dAkziH vEyAsakiH. RyaH gargasyApatyaM gArgyaH jAmadagnyaH. apatyasAmAnye AyanaR[^1] taduttaraM RyaSca kOYjAyanyaH brAGnAyanyaH. apatyArTe eyaRa vEnateyaH AtreyaH jAhnaveyaH drOpadeyaH. eraR dAsasyApatyaM dAseraH dAseyopi. kARAyA apatyaM kAReraH kAReyopi. cawakAyAH pumapatyaM cAwakEraH. AyaniR tikasyApatyaM tEkAyaniH. tasya (sarvanAmnaH) apatyaM tAdAyaniH tAdopi. apatyArTe IyaH svasurapatyaM svasrIyaH. samUhArTe aSvIyam. BavArTe kavargIyaH aNgulIyaH mitravargIyaH. apatyArTe vyaH BrAturapatyaM BrAtfvyaH. apatyArTe yaH SvaSurasyApatyaM SvaSuryaH. samUhArTe DUmyA vanyA. apatyArTe eyakaR kulasyApatyaM kOleyakaH. InaR kulInaH. quraR zARmAturaH. tadrAgayuktamityarTe ikaR lAkzayA raktaM lAkzikam. samUhArTe kEdArikam. tadveda tadaDIte vA ityarTe nEyAyikaH lOkAyatikaH. BavArTe Antardehikam samAnadESikam. saMjYArTe SaradikA muddraBedAH. raktamityarTe aH nIlena rakto nIlaH pawaH. kaH pItena raktaH pItakaH pawaH. samUhArTe akaR<BR>;p{0317}<BR>gArgakam kEdArakam. kaR DEnukam. samUhArTe yaR keSAnAM samUhaH kESyam gARikyam brAhmaRyam. BavArTe caturmAsezu BavaM cAturmAsyaM vratam. samUhArTe iniH padminI. kawyaH raTakawyA. tal banDutA janatA. yat pfzWyam. vettItyarTe wikaH SatapaTikaH. kaH SikzakaH mImAMsakaH. jAtamityarTe pUrvAhnakam. tasyedamityarTe ka IyaSca svakIyam. kasyAnityatvena svIyaM vA. InaR yOzmAkIRam. hastItyAdyarTe kaR AraRyakaH karI. tasyAyamityarTe tu RaH. araRyasyAyamAraRyaH paSuH. tatra Bava ityarTe maH AdimaH. qimaH agrimaH paScimaH. tyaH Svatyam. tanaw Svastanam sAyaMtanam. eRyaH prAvfzi BavaM prAvfzeRyaM tfRam. tnaH parutnam parAritnam. naH purARam. IyaR parvate BavaH pArvatIyaH. yat diSi BavaM diSyam dantyam mitravargyaH. eyaRa kOkzeyam. InaH mitravargIRaH. naR striyAM BavaH strERaH. snaR puMsi BavaH pOnaH. jAtamityarTe ikaH prAvfzi jAtaM prAvfzikaM patram. akaH AmAvAsyako vAlakaH ityAdi iti saMkzepaH.<BR>iR AyanaR ityAdayaH kecitpratyayAH pARinivihitapratyayApekzayA BinnA eva jagadISena kalpitA iti boDyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0315" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

