tamaH — 1 (aBAvaH) [ka] tejasaH aBAvaH (mu0 1) (gO0 vf05. 2. 20) (ta0 dI 0 pf0 3). prOQaprakASakatejaH sAmAnyABAva ityarTaH. tena tamasvatyapi deSe tejaHparamARvAdisattvena tejaH sAmAnyABAvAsattvepi na kzatiH (nIla0 1 pf0 4). atra vipratipattiH anDakAratvaM BAvavftti<BR>;p{0320}<BR>iti tOtAtitAH. neti vESezikAdayaH iti (nyA0 dI0 pf0 4). [Ka] dravyaguRakarmanizpattivEDarmyAdaBAvastamaH (vE0 5. 2. 19). udBUtarUpavadyAvattejaHsaMsargABAva ityarTaH (vE0 ta0 5. 2. 20). [ga] svaparaprakASakatejaH sAmAnyABAvaH. yaTA adastvayA nunnamanuttamaM tamaH. AsAditasya tamasA niyaterniyogAt (mAGa 0 sa0 4 Slo034) ityAdO. [Ga] nIlarUpAropaviSizwatejaH saMsargABAva iti kecit (nyA0 dI0 pf0 8). [Na] BABAvaH[^1]. dravyaguRakarmanizpattivEDarmyAt (nyA0 ka0 pf0 10). atredaM boDyam. yatrEva deSe tejoBAvastatrEva deSe tama ityaBilapyate. evaM ca sati gacCatA dravyeRa tejasa AvaraRAt Avarakasya dravyasya ca gamanAt sutarAmeva tamasopi gatiBrama upapadyata iti (ta0 va0). tejaso dravyAntareRAvaraRAcca (vE0 5. 2. 20). tadarTaSca gacCatA dravyAntareRAvfte tejasi pUrvadeSAnupalamBAdagrimadeSe copalamBAttejoBAvasya gacCaddravyasADarmyAdgatiBramaH. na tu vAstavI tatra gatiH. kiM ca nIlaM naBaH iti pratItivat tamasi nIla- 1 rUpavattApratItirapi Brama eva iti. atrAyaM tarka tamo yadi gatimatsyAt tejoBAvavizayakacAkzuzasAkzAtkAravizayo na syAt iti. yadvA tamo yadi gatimatsyAt tejoBavAvizayakacAkzupasAkzAtkArAvizayoM na syAt iti. aTavA tamo yadi tejoBinnatve sati gatimatsyAt tejoBAvavizayaka sAkzAtkAravizayagatimanna syAt iti (nyA0 dI0 pf0 8). rUpavadravyAntaraM iti BawwA vedAntinaH sAMKyAH kandalIkArAcAhuH (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 5). atredamavaDeyam. AlokasyAnyatra cAkzuzapratyakze sahakarivepi tamaH pratyakze na tatsahakArasyAvaSyakatA vastusvABAvyAt iti BawwamImAMsakAnAmASayaH iti. tamaso BAvatvamaNgIkurvARAnAM mate tamasaH pfTivyAmantarBAvaH. aTavA daSamaM dravyamatiriktameva taditi (boDyam. AropitaM nIlarUpamiti SrIDarAcAryAH. rUpadarSanABAvastama iti prABAkarAH. AlokajYAnABAva iti prABAkarEkadeSinaH (sarva0