तिङ्
tiN — (viBaktiH) tiptasUJisip0 (pARi0 3. 4. 78) ityanena vihitAH pratyayAstiNkzajYakA boDyAH. etadvicArastu kOmudyAdO drazwavyaH. tiN SAbdikErAKyAtamityucyate (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 137). DAtvarTAvacCinna svArTa yatnaviDeyatA kAnvayaboDasamarTaH SabdastiN ucyate (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 137). yaTA cEtraH pacatItyAdO tibAKyAtam. raTo gacCatItyAdO tibAKyAtena vyApAro nirUQalakzaRayA boDyate. atra raTAdInAmacetanatayA gamanAnukUla prayatna SUnyatvAdvyApAra eva lakzyate iti BAvaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 18) (mu0 4). jAnAti icCati yatnaM karoti ityAdAvAKyAtasyASrayatve lakzaRA. kecittu sTIyate ityatrAKyAtena kftirboDyate ityAhuH. etanmate cEtreRa sTIyate ityatra cEtrakartfkA sTityanukUlA kftiH iti boDaH. kftO saMKyAyA nAnvayaH iti BAvaH. anye tu cEtrakartfkA vartamAnasTitiH iti DAtvarTaviSezyaka eva SAbdaboDaH. pratyayasya nirarTakatvam ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 20). atredamavaDeyam. uBayapadiDAtUnAM yatra kriyAPalaM kartfnizWam tatrAtmanepadam yatra ca kartfBinnanizWaM tatra parasmEpadaM sADu. cintAmaRikftastu yatra kriyAPale karturaBiprAyaH (icCA) tatrEvAtmanepadam ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 97 pf0 144145). atrADikaM tu AtmanepadaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditam (pf0 120). tiNarTaSca yatnaH. yaTA cEtraH pacatItyAdO yatnaH (kftiH) tibAKyAtasya vAcyaH (ci0 4). kvacit samavAyitvam ASrayatvaM vA tiNarTaH. yaTA ISvaro jAnAti icCati raTo gacCatItyAdO ca. atra jYAnAdimattvamAtrapratIteH samavAyitve tiNo nirUQalakzaReti BAvaH. atredamavaDeyam. ASrayatvAdO tiNo nirUQa<BR>;p{0331}<BR>lakzaRA. kftitvavadASrayatAtvAderaKaRqale tadavacCinnapi tiNaH Saktireva iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 138). kacit avacCedakatvam. yaTA cEtro jAnAtItyAdO. kvacit dESikASrayatvam. yaTA budDiravagA- 1 hate Gawo BAsata ityAdO. kacit pratiyogitvam. yaTA Gawo naSyatItyAdO tibarTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 138) (ci0 4) (ta0 dI 0) (di0 4). evam tasAdipratyayAnAmapyarTA yaTAyogyaM svayamUhyAH. atredaM tattvam. jIvanayonyAdiniKilayatnagataM yatnatvameva tiNaH SakyatAvacCedakam na tu pravfttitvam. cEtro niHSvasiti ityAditopi SvAsAdyanukUla prayatnasya pratIteH. pacatItyAditaH pAkakftimAn iti pratIteSrca (Sa0 pra0 0 95 pf0 137138). pacati ityasya pAkaM karoti ityAdiyatnArTakakarotinA sarvAKyAta vivaraRAt vfdDavyavahArAdiva bADakaM vinA vitraraRAdapi vyutpatterityanye. kiM karoti iti yatnapraSne pacati ityuttarasya yatnArTakatvaM vinAnupapatteH ityAcAryAH (ci0) (vAca0). atrAyamarTaH. cEtraH pacatItyAdO tiNarTakftO DAtvarTasya taM karomi iti pratItiniyAmakaH sADyatvAKyaviSezyatApraBedaH tadviSizwaM PalopaDAyakatvalakzaRamanukUlatvaM vA saMsargamaryAdayA BAsate. tAdfSakfteSva cEtrAdinAmArTe ISvaraH pacati ityAdiprayogApattivAraRArTamavacCedakatvenEva saMsargeRAnvayaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 137138). atreyaM mataprakriyA jYeyA. SAbdikAH BAvapraDAnamAKyAtam sattvapraDAnAni nAmAni iti yAskamunipaWitaM niruktamanuruDya cEtrastaRqulaM pacati ityAdO cEtrABinnakartfkastaRqulanizWa viklittyanukUlo vyApAraH ityAdyAkArakaM sarvatra DAtvarTa muKya viSezyakameva SAbdaboDaM svIkurvanti. nEyAyikAstu BAvo BAvanA kftiH praDAnaM DAtvarTaM prati iti vigrahalaByasya pUrvoktayAskaniruktArTasya svIkAreRa taRqulanizWaviklittyanukUlavyApArAnukUlakftimAn.. ityAdyAkArakaM sarvatrAKyAtArTaviSezyakaM praTamAntArTamuKyaviSezyakameva SAbdaboDamurarIcakruH. aDikaM tu SAbdaboDaH ityatra drazwavyam. atra dIDitikftaH. pacatItyAdAvAKyAtasya kftyarTa katvepi cEtreRa pakkam ityAdAviva<BR>;p{0332}<BR>cEtreRa pacyate ityatrApi tftIyayEva kartftvamanuBAvyate na tvAKyAtena tiNarTa kfterDAtvarTaviSezyatvaniyamAt ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 140). SAbdikAstu kartA karma ca BAvaSca AKyAtArTaH ityAhuH. anukUlavyApAramAtramAKyAtArTaH iti BawwamImAMsakA maRqanamiSrA cAhuH. etanmate kevalaM PalaM DAtorarTaH iti jYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 140). kAlaH saMKyAmAtraM sarvatrAKyAtArTaH. pacatItyAdO DAtupratipAdyo viklittyanukUlavyApAro yatnaM vinAnupapannaH iti tena yatna Akzipyate iti prABAkarAH. ratnakoSakftastu AKyAtArTa utpAdanA. sA cotpAdakatA sEva BAvanA. yaTA pacatItyAdAvAKyAtasya pAkamutpAdayati iti vivaraRAttaTAtvam ityAhuH (ci0 4) (Sa0 pra0 pf0 139). etanmate vyApAramAtraM DAtorvAcyArTaH iti jYeyam. ekatvAdisaMKyA vartamAnAdikAlaca tiNarTaH. yaTA cEtrastaRqulaM pacatItyAdO tibarTakftAvekatvarUpasaMKyA vartamAnakAlaScAKyAtena pratIyate (ci0 4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0330" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

