tumun — (pratyayaH) 1 [ka] prakftakriyAsamAnakartfkattrasahitatadvizayakecCADInecCAvizayatvam. yaTA paktuM vrajatItyatra tumarTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 98) (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 127). atra samanvayaH paktuM vrajatItyAdO prakftakriyA pacanam tatsamAnakartfkatvam yaH pAkakartA sa eva vrajanakartA iti brajanesti. pAkecCADInecCA vrajanecCA. tadvizayatvaM ca vrajanestIti sarvaM susTam. atra tumunnantena brajane pAkAdisamAnakartfkatvasahitaM pAkavizayakecCADInecCAvizayatvaM voDyate. tumunRvulO kriyAyAM kriyArTAyAm (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 10) iti sUtreRa samaBivyAhftakriyAyAM prakftakriyAsamAnakartfkatva sahitatadicCADInecCAvizayatvarUpatadarTakatvena vivakzitAyAM tumunRvulorviDAnAt (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 98). [Ka] tatprAgaBAvakAlInatadvizayakecCA. yaTA BoktumAgacCatItyAdO. atra BojanaprAgaBAvakAlInaBojanavizayakecCAvAnAgacCati iti boDaH (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32). 2 icCAvAn. yaTA BoktuM vrajatItyasya BojanecCAvAn vrajati ityarTaH. 3 kartA. yaTA BoktumicCatItyatra tumunorTaH. atra lakzaRayA kartA boDyate. kartfviSezaRIBUtAyAM kftAvicCAyA anvayaH. tena BojanakartAramAtmAnamicCati ityarTaH (tarkA0 4 pf0 12).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

