तुल्यत्वम्
tulyatvam — 1 [ka] sAdfSyavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. yaTA sakAmAM dUzayaMstulyo<BR>;p{0334}<BR>na vaDaM prApnuyAnnaraH. sakAmAM dUzayaMstulyo nANgulicCedamApnuyAt (manuH) kumBakarRaH kapIndreRa tulyavasTaH svasuH kftaH (raGu0 sa0 12 Slo0 80) ityAdO. [Ka] Binnatve sati Darmavattvam. yaTA cEtreRa cEtrasya vA tulya ityAdO. atra tulyaSabdArTanivizwe ca Bede tftIyAdyarTasya pratiyogitvasya Darme cADeyatvasya anvayAt cEtratvAvacCinnAnyatve sati cEtravfttiDarmavAn ityarTaH. evam cEtreRa cEtrasya vA sAdfSyamityAdAvapi drazwavyam. atra viSezo jYeyaH pARinIyAH tulyopamayoryoge tftIyAM necCanti iti (Sa0 pra0 Sra0 92 pf0 124). 2 [ka anyUnAnatiriktatryaktikatvam. yaTA nyAyamate budDitvajYAnatvayoH GawatvakalaSatvayorvA tulyatvam (ta0 pra0 1) (vE0 u0 1. 1). idaM tu GawatvakalAtyAdInAM Bede BinnajAtitve vA bADakam iti boDyam (di0 1. 1 pf0 34) (nIla0). [Ka] tulyavyaktivfttitvam. svaBinnajAtisamaniyatatvamiti PalitArTaH (di0 1. 1 pf0 34). yaTA GawatvakalaSatvayostulyatvam (ta0 pra0 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यवित्तिवेद्यत्वम्
tulyavittivedyatvam — ekajYAnavizayatvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 21). yaTA sADanavadvfttiH sADyABAvo vA hetudozaH (dIDi0 2 hetvA0) ityatra prAcInamate vahnimadvfttiDUmABAvaH iti jYAne DUmABAve vahnimadvfttisvasya BAsane vahA DUmABAvavadvfttitvamapi tulyavittivedyatayA niyamato BAsate (ga0 sAmA0 lakza0 2 pf0 17). yaTA vA gurumate AkzepAjjAtiviSizwavyaktipratItiH. atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. tanmate jAtO vyaktO ca SaktiH. paraMtu jAtivizayakaSaktijYAnameva jAtiviSizwavyaktivizayakaSAbdaboDe kAraRam. vyaktiSaktistu svarUpasatI (na tu jYAtA) upayujyate iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 21). idaM ca kubjaSaktivAdigurumatEkadeSinAM matam iti jYeyam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 22).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0334" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीया
tftIyA — (kArakaviBaktiH) tattadDAtvarTe karaRatvAdivoDikA viBaktiH. kArakatftIyAlakzaRaM ca pacyarTa DarmikakaraRatvAnvayaboDAnukUla supsajAtIyatvam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 65 pf0 75). yaTA kAzwena taRqulaM<BR>;p{0335}<BR>pacatItyAdO kAzWeneti tftIyA. tftIyArTaSca 1 kartftvam. yaTA cEtreRa grAmo gamyate putreRa sahAgataH pitetyAdO tftIyArTaH. cEtreRetyatra kartfkaraRayostftIyA (pA0 sU0 23. 18) ityanena kartari vihitA kArakatftIyA iti jYeyam. putreRetyatra sahayuktepraDAne (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 19) ityanena vihitA kArakArTAnyA tftIyA. atra kartftvaM tftIyArTaH. sahaSabdasamaBivyAhftapadopasTApyakriyA (Agamanam) sahaSabdArTaH. ekadeSAvacCedEkakAlInatvasaMbanDena tasyAH samaBivyAhftakriyAyAm AgatapadopasTApyAyAm anvayaH. taTA ca putrakartfkAgamanaviSizwAgamanakartA pitA ityarTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 8). SabdaSaktiprakASikAkftastu putreRa sahAgataH sUpena sArDaM BuktaH cakreRa sAkaM daRqena janitaH putreRa samaM mitrAya dAnam ityAdO sahAyatryayArTEkadeSe kartftvAdikArake svaprakftyarTasyADeyatvaM tftIyayA boDyate. tena putravfttikartftAkagatikAlInagati kartftAvAn sUpanizWakarmatAkaBojanakAlInaBojana - karmatAvAn cakranizwakaraRa tAkotpattikAlI nadaRqanizWakaraRatAkotpattimAn saMpradAnatAkadAnakAlInaM mitrasaMpradAnatAkaM dAnam ityAkArastatra boDaH ityAhuH. atra sahAdyavyayArTastu svAnvayitattatkartftvAdikArakAvacCinnAyAH samaBivyAhftakriyAyAH samAnakAlInatvarUpaM sAhityam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 119). kacit hetukartftvamapi tftIyArTaH. tatsvarUpaM prAguktam (pf0 306). 2 karaRatvam. yaTA kuWAreRa vfkzaMCinattItyAdo tftIyArTaH. sADakatamaM karaRam (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 42) iti pARinisUtreRa karaRasaMjYA. sADakatamatvaM ca asADAraRakaraRatvam vyApAravadasADAraRakAraRatvaM vA (ma0pra0 1 pf0 6). taTA ca kartfkaraRayostftIyA (pA0 sU0 23. 18) ityanena tftIyA. aDikaM tu karaRaSabda vyAKyAne saMpAditam (pf0 199). atra SAbdikAH. iyaM tftIyA dviviDA. kartftftIyA karaRatftIyA ca. tatrAdyAyA ASrayorTaH. karaRatftIyAyAstu ASrayavyApArAvarTI ityAhuH (vE0 sA0). 3 vfttitvam. yaTA akzRA kARaH pAdena KaYja ityAdO tftIyArTaH.<BR>;p{0336}<BR>atra yenANgavikAraH (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 20) iti sUtreRa tftIyA. tadarTaSca yenANgavikAro hAnirADikyaM vA tadaNgavoDakAt tftIyA iti. evaM ca atra tftIyAyA vfttitvamarTaH. tacca kARAdipadArTEkadeSe vikArenveti. kARatvaM ca bahiravacCedena cakzuH SUnyagolakavattvam. prasannAnDasya kARatve tu cakzuzmadgolakavattve satIti vAcyam. yadi bahiravacCedena cakzuHsattvepi upaGAtAderna cAkzuzaM tadopahatagolakattvameva kARatvam. akzipadaM cakzuzmadgolakaparam. taTA ca tAdfSagolakavftti yaccakzuHSUnyatvam upaGAto vA tadviSizwagolakavAn iti akzRA kARaH ityasyArTaH. pare tu akzRA kARa ityAdO aBede tftIyA. taTA ca tAdfSagolakABinnaM yaccakzuH SUnyamupahataM vA tadvAn iti vAkyArTaH ityAhuH. KaYjatvaM ca saMsTAna viSezaSUnyapAdavattvam. taTA ca pAdavftti yat taTAviDasaMsTAnaSUnyatvam tadviSizwapAdavAn iti pAdena KaYjaH ityasyArTaH. evam muKena trilocana ityasyApi muKavfttilocanatrayavAn ityarTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 8). 4 viSezaRam. yaTA jYAyamAnatvena liNgaM karaRamityAdO tftIyArTaH. atra itTaMBUtalakzaRe (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 21) ityanena lakzaRavAcipadAttftIyAnuSizyata iti jYeyam. ayaM BAvaH. atra lakzaRaM ca vyAvartakam. tacca viSezaRopalakzaRaBedena dviviDam. tatra viSezaRavAcipadAt jYAyamAnatva ityasmAt tftIyA iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 9192). 5 upalakzaRam. yaTA jawABistApasa ityAdO tftIyArTaH. atropalakzaRatvaM ca atadvyAvfttyanavacCedakatve satyatadvyAvfttisamAnADikaraRatvam. asti ca jawAyAmatApasavyAvfttyanavacCedakatvam. SamadamAdimattvasyEva tadanyUnAnatiriktavfttitayA tadavacCedakatvAt. yadi SamAdinA tApasaH iti prayoga izwastadA viSezaRopalakzaREtaduBayasADAraRavESizwyameva tftIyArTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 7). atra jawAviSizwastApasaH ityAdyanuBavena viSezaRenuSizwAyAH itTaMBUtalakzaRe (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 21) ityanena vihitAyAstftIyAyAH vESizwyam arTaH. vESizwyaM cAtadvyAvfttatvam. taTA ca ajawavyAvfttimAMstApasaH ityAkArastatra<BR>;p{0337}<BR>PalitArTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 119) (ma0pra0 1 pf0 6). idaM tu boDyam. prakftyarTasya niruktavESizwyaM yadi vartamAnatayA pratyAyyate tadedaM viSezaRatvena vyapadiSyate. yadi cAvartamAnatvena tadopalakzaRatvena vyapadiSyate. yaTA SiKayA parivrAjako vartate ityAdO. yaTA vA guruRA wIkA kuruRA kzetramityAdO (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 119). idaM ca boDyam. itTaMBUtalakzaRe (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 21) ityatra lakzaRaM ca vyAvartakam. tacca viSezaRopalakzaRaBedena dviviDam. tatropalakzaRaM cAvidyamAnaM sadvyAvartakam. jawABistApasa ityAdAvavidyamAnajawAdeH kAlAntarasaMbanDavivakzayA matubAdyanavakASAdupalakzaRavAcakajawAdipadAt tftIyEva (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 92). kecittu (SAbdikAH) jYAnajYApyatvaM tftIyArTaH. yaTA jawABistApasa ityAdO ityAhuH. atra tftIyATEkadeSe jYAne jawAnAmanvayaH. jYAnajYApyatvasya ca tApasapadArTEkadeSe tApasatvenvayaH. evaM ca jawAjYApyatApasatvavAn ityarTaH (ma0pra0 1 pf0 6). atredaM cintyam. jawABistApasa ityAdO jYAnajYApyatvasya tftIyArTatve DUmena vahnimAnityatreva prakftasTalepi hetO (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 23) ityanenEva tftIyAyA upapattO itTaMBUtalakzaRe (pA0su0 2. 3. 21) iti sUtrasya vEyarTyaM syAt iti. 6 hetutvam. yaTA Danena kulam daRqena GawaH. atra kriyAyogABAvAt kriyAnvayiniruktakaraRatvArTikA kartfkaraRayostftIyA (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 18) ityanena na tftIyA. kiMtu hetO (pA0 2. 3. 23) iti sUtreRAnumAnArTepyanvitahetutvArTikA tftIyAnuSizyate iti viSezaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 8). atra hetutvaM ca janakajYApakoBayasADAraRaM boDyam. tena Danena kulamityAdO hetutvaM janakatvam. taTA ca DananizWahetutAkakulam ityAkAro boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 121). parvato DUmena vahnimAnityAdO tu jYApakatvameva hetutvam (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 3 pf0 87). DUmena vahniH aRutvena dravyatvam ityAdO jYApakatvalakzaRaM gORameva hetutvaM tftIyArTaH. (navInamate jYApyatvaM tftIyArTaH). tena DUmanizWaM 43<BR>;p{0338}<BR>yajYApakatvam nirUpakatvasaMbanDena tadvAnvahniH ityAkArastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Sra0 92 pf0 122) (ga0 vyu0 kA 3 pf0 87). Gawena SUnyaH viDuraH rahitaH atrApi hetO (pA0 sU0 ityAdO ca hetutvameva tftIyArTaH. 2. 3. 23) ityanenEva tftIyA. tatra hetutvaM ca pratiyogisADAraRamapi iti BAti. taTA ca GawatvAdyavacCinnaM pratiyogitvameva tftIyArTaH. tasya SUnyatvenvayaH. evam cEtreRa cEtrasya vA tulya ityAdAvapi pratiyogitvameva tftIyArTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 123124). 7 Palam (prayojanam). yaTA Danena kuSalam aDyayanena vasati ityAdO tftIyArTaH. atrApi hetO (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 23) ityanena PalArTakAttftIyA iti jYeyam. tatra hetuSabdena kAraRamiva Palamapi gfhyate. 8 aBedaH. yaTA DAnyena DanI gotreRa gArgyaH prakftyA aBirUpaH prakftyA kfpaRaH svaBAvena saralaH Gawatvena sAjAtyam vAjapeyena yajanam jAtyA brAhmaRaH ityAdO tftIyArTaH. atra prakftyAdiBya upasaMKyAnam ityanena vArtikena aBedArTe tftIyA. aBedasya DAnyAdAvanvayaH. taTA ca DAnyABinnaDanavAn gotrABinnagargakulotpannaH sAhajikaramaRIyatAvAn ityAdayaH krameRa boDA Bavanti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 8). kecittu DUmena vahniH ityAdAviva DAnyena Danam ityAdAvapi jYApakatvameva tftIyArTaH iti vadanti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 124). prakftyA kfpaRa ityatra prakftyAdipadaM yAvadASrayaBAviDarmaparam. tftIyArTaScABedaH tAdAtmyaM vA. evaM ca svASrayADikaraRayAvatkAlavfttikArpaRyavAn ityAkArastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 124). jAtyA brAhmaRa ityatra brAhmaRapadasyAdfzwaviSeza prayojyaDarmavatparatayA tAdfSaDarma eva jAtyaBedasyAnvayaH. svarUpata upasTite brAhmaRye tadanvayAyogAt iti vijYeyam (Sa0pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 124). 9 avacCedakatvam avacCedyatvaM vA. yaTA Gawatvena janyatvam prakAratvaM vA ityAdO tftIyArTaH. 10 aDikaraRatvam (vizayatvam). yaTA BogEH prasitaH utsukaH ityAdO tftIyArTaH.<BR>;p{0339}<BR>atra vizayatvalakzaRaM gORamaDikaraRatvaM tftIyayA boDyate. tena BogezvanuraktaH ityevaM tatra voDaH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 92 pf0 118125) (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 9198) (kA0 vyA0 pf0 7–8). 11 vESizwyam. yaTA vahnimattvena parvatamanusinomi ityAdO vahniviDeyakatvarUpaM vESizwyaM tftIyAntArTaH. yaTA vA rajatatvena Sukti jAnAtItyAdO jYAne rajatatvAdiprakArakatvarUpaM vESizwyam. Gawatvena vahnirnAstItyAdO ca (sOndaqamate) aBAve GawatvAvacCinna pratiyogitAkatvarUpaM vESizwayam tftIyAntArTaH iti saMkzepaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 56).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0334" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

