तृष्णा
tfzRA — (dozaH) 1 idaM me na kzIyatAm itIcCA (gO0 vf0 4. 3). 2 aprAptABilAzaH. loBajanyA manovfttiH. yaTA loBo janayate tfzRAM tfzArto duHKamApnuyAt (hitopa0) ityAdO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजः
tejaH — 1 (dravyam) [ka] tejo rUpasparSavat (vE0 2. 1. 3). tadarTaSca rUpaM BAsvaram sparSaSva uzRaH tadvattejaH. BAsvaraSuklarUpavattvam uzRasparSavattvaM ca - tejolakzaRam iti. UzmaRi BarjanakapAlasTe tejasi taptavArisTatejasi ca tejastvena BAsvararUpamanumIyate. tatra tejastvaM tu uzRasparSavattvenAnumIyate (vE0 u0 2. 1. 3) (vE0 di0 2. 1. 3). [Ka] uzRasparSavat (ta0 saM0). atra sUtram tejasa uzRatA iti. (vE0 2. 2. 4). [ga] tejastvasAmAnyavat (praSasta0) (ta kO0 1 pf0 2). tatra cakzu SarIrasavitfsuvarRavahni vidyudAdipraBedam (ta 0 BA0 arTa 0 pf0 27). yaTA sAmAnADikaraRyaM hi tejastimirayoH<BR>;p{0340}<BR>kutaH (mAGa0 sa0 2 Slo0 62) ityAdO sUryAdInAM prOQaprakASaH. tejolakzaRaM ca tejastvameva. tacca candracAmIkarasamavetatve sati jvalanasamavetaM sAmAnyam (sarva0 OlU0 pf0 218). janyozRasparSasamavAyikAraRatAvacCedakatayA sidDo jAtiviSezaH. janyatejastvAvacCinnasamavAyikAraRatAvacCedakatayA sidDo jAtiviSezaH (mu0 1 tejo 0 0 pf0 78) (di0 1 pf0 78). SuklaBAsvararUpasamAnADikaraRadravyatvavyApyajAtimattvam. sAMKyAstu SabdasparSatanmAtrasahitAdrUpatanmAtrAdutpannaM SabdasparSarUpaguRaM tftIyaM mahABUtaM teja ityAhuH. atrocyate. tftIyaM jyotirityAhuScakzuraDyAtmamucyate. aDiBUtaM tato rUpaM sUryastatrADidEvatam.. iti (BA0 ASva0). 2 sAttriko DikzepApamAnAderasahanarUpo nAyakaguRaviSezasteja iti sAhityaSAstrajYAH. atrocyate. aDikzepApamAnAdeH prayuktasya pareRa yat. prARAtyayepyasahanaM tattejaH samudAhftam.. iti (sA0 da0). 3 hayavega ityaSvaSAstrajYAH. atrocyate. tejo nAma darpAparanAmA sattvaguRavikAraH prakASakontaH sAraviSezaH. yaTAha BojarAjaH. tejo nisargajaM sattvaM vAjinAM sPuraRaM rajaH. kroDastama iti jYeyAstrayopi sahajA guRAH.. iti. 4 retaH. atrocyate. rasAdInAM SukrAntAnAM DAtUnAM yat paraM tejastat KalvojaH. tadeva balamityucyate iti (suSru0). 5 sAraH iti BizajaH. 6 dIptiH. 7 praBAvaH. 8 parAkramaH. 9 navanItaM ceti kAvyajYAH. 10 cEtanyAtmakaM jyotiriti vedAntina AhuH (vAca0). nyAyamatasidDaM tejo dviviDam. nityam anityaM ca. tatra nityaM paramARulakzaRam. anityaM kAryalakzaRam. anityaM triviDam. SarIram indriyam vizayaSca. tatra SarIramayonijameva. taccAdityaloke prasidDam. tacca pArTivaBAgopazwamBAccopaBogasamarTa Bavati (pa0 mA0) (praSasta 0). indriyaM rUpagrAhakaM cakzuH kfzRatArApravarti. vizayarUpaM caturviDam. BOmam divyam Odaryam AkarajaM ca. tatra BOmam pArTivamAtrenDanaM vahnayAdikam KadyotatejaAdi ca. divyam abinDanaM sOracAndra vidyudvaqavA<BR>;p{0341}<BR>nalAdi. adBiriDyate prakASyata iti vigraho drazwavyaH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 7). OdaryaM pArTivajalo BayenDanaM tejaH. tacca Buktasya pariRAmahetuH (jAWarAnalaH). Akarajam anuBayenDanaM tejaH. tacca suvarRatrapusIsarajata kAMsyAdyazwakam (praSasta 0) (tarkasaM0) (mu0 1 pf0 79) (tarkakO0 1 pf0 2). atra kecidAhuH. suvarRaM pArTivam tEjasaM ceti miSritaM vastu. tatra tEjasam agnisaMyogAnucCidyamAna dravatvADikaraRam. pArTivaM tu adButaM pItarUpavat iti. vastutaH drutaM pArTivameva suvarRam na tu tEjasam iti (pa0 mA0). nyAyavESezikanaye suvarRa tEjasameva. tasya tEjasatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca suvarRamapArTivam asati pratibanDaketyantAnalasaMyoge satyapyanucCidyamAnadravatvADikaraRatvAt yannEvaM tannEvaM yaTA pfTivI (GftAdiH) iti. jalamaDyasTaGftAdO vyaBicAravAraRAya asati pratibanDake iti. agnisaMyogAsamAnADikaraRadravatvavati GftAdO vyaBicAravAraRAya atyantAnalasaMyoge sati iti ca viSezaRaM dattam (nIla0 1 pf0 8) (di0 1 pf0 81). anenAnumAnenApArTivatvasidDO atyantAnalasaMyogI pItimASrayaH (pfTivI pakzaH) dravatvanASapratibanDakadravadravyAntareRa (tejastvABimatena suvarRena) saMyuktaH (sADyaH) atyantAnalasaMyoge satyapyanucCidyamAnadravatvADikaraRatve sati gurutvAt (hetuH) jalamaDyasTaGftavat ityanumAnena tEjasatvasidDirdrazwavyA (nIla0 1 pf0 8-9) (mu0 1 pf0 81). aTavA suvarRa tEjasam asati pratibanDa ke atyantAgnisaMyogepyanucCidyamAnajanyadravatvADikaraRatvAt yannEvaM tannEvaM yaTA pfTivI iti vyatirekiRA tEjasatvasidDiH (mu0 1 pf0 81). yadvA pItimagurutvASrayaH pItarUpaBinnarUpapratibanDakadravadravyasaMyuktaH praharaparyantamanalasaMyogepi pItarUpaBinnarUpAnASrayatvAt analasaMyuktajalamaDyasTitapItapawavat iti (vE0 u0 2. 1. 7). suvarRasya tEjasatve agnerapatyaM praTamaM hiraRyam ityAgamasaMvAdopi jYeyaH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 40) (di0 1 pf0 81). prakArAntareRa tejaScaturviDam. kiMcit udBUtarUpasparSam. yaTA sOrAdi tejaH piRqitaM<BR>;p{0342}<BR>tejo vahnayAdikaM ca. kiMcit anudBUtarUpasparSam. yaTA nAyanaM tejaH. kiMcit udBUtarUpamanudBUtasparSam. yaTA cAndraM tejaH pradIpa praBAmaRqalaM ca. aTavA cAndrapraBAyAM sparSopyudBUta eva. kiM tu jalIyasparSenABiBavAduzRasparSo na gfhyate (vE0 vi0 2. 1. 3) (mu0 1) (si0 ca0). kiMcit anudBUtarUpamudBUtasparSam. yaTA nEdAGaM tejaH taptavAriBarjanakapAlAdigataM ca tejaH (vahnayAdi) (vE0 u0 2. 1. 3) ((ta0 BA0 pf0 27) (vE0 vi0 2. 1. 3). atredaM boDyam. suvarRaM tejastUdBUtABiBUtarUpasparSam nAnudBUtarUpasparSam. anudBUtarUpatve acAkzuzaM syAt. anudBUtasparSatve tvacA gfhyeta. aBiBavastu balavatsajAtIyena pArTivena rUpeRa sparSena ca kftaH iti (ta0 BA0 arTa0 pf0 28). tejasyekAdaSa guRA vartante. BAsvaraSuklarUpam uzRasparSaH saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam nEmittikadravatvam vegAKyasaMskAraSca (ta0 BA0 arTa0 pf0 27) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 30) (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 2) (praSasta 0). dravatvavizaye sUtram trapusI saloharajatasuvarRAnAmagnisaMyogAdravatvamadBiH sAmAnyam (vE0 2. 17). upalakzaRaM cEtat. tena kAMsyatAmrArakUwapAradapittalaraNgAdInAmapyupasaMgrahaH (vE0 u0 2. 1. 7) (vE0 vi0 2. 1. 7) (ta0 kO0 pf0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0339" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजसम्
tEjasam — 1 tejastvavyApyaDarmavat. yaTA cakzustEjasam suvarRa tEjasam ityAdO (mu0 1) (vE0 u0 2. 1. 7). 2 rajoguRotpannaH padArTa iti sAMKyA AhuH. atrocyate. vEkftaH sAttviko nAma tEjaso rAjasaH smftaH. BUtAdistAmasastepi pfTak tattvAnyavAsfjan.. iti padArTAdarSaDftaM vAkyam). sAttvika ekAdaSakaH pravartate vEkftAdahaMkArAt. BUtAdestanmAtraH sa tAmasastEjasAduBayam.. iti (sAM0 kA0 25). 3 daSendriyajanakohaMkAratattvapraBedaH iti maDvamatAnuyAyinaH (maRimaYjarI 1. 3). 4 antaHkaraRaM tEjasamiti mAyAvAdinaH. 5 tIrTaviSeza iti pOrARikAH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0342" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यज्
