dAnam — 1 [ka] svasvatvaDvaMsa viSizwa parasvatvAnukUlecCA. yaTA brAhmaRAya DanaM dadAtItyAdO dadAtyarTaH. atra tAdfSasvatvarUpaDAtvarTatAvacCedakaPala eva dvitIyArTAnvayaH. upekzAyAmativyAptivAraRAya parasvatvaniveSaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 1 pf0 43). [Ka] svasvatvaDvaMsAnukUla parasvatvaprakArikecCA. dAnaM ca na saMpradAnasvatvajanakam api tu tatsvIkAra eva iti matABiprAyeRedaM nirvacanam. etanmate brAhmaRAya DanaM dadAtItyAdO svasvatvaDvaMsarUpaPalASrayatvAdDanasya karmatA iti boDyam (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 2 pf0 43). [ga] mUlyagrahaRaM vinA svasvatvaDvaMsa parasvatvajanakatyAga iti saMpradAyaH (di0 gu0). yaTA viprAya gAM dadAtItyAdO dadAtyarTaH. atra mUlyagrahaRaM vinA viproddeSyakagovfttisvasvatvaDvaMsa para svatvajanakatyAgAnukUlakftimAn ityanvayaboDaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 5). [Ga] SAstroktasaMpradAnasvatvAvacCinnadravyatyAga iti ratnAkarapraBftayaH. atroddeSyapAtraviSezo yadi na tadravyaM svIkaroti tadA sopADityAgaviSezasyAnirvAhAnna dAtuH svatvaM nivartata iti tanmatABiprAyo jYeyaH. [Na] SAstroktasaMpradAnasvatvApAdakadravyatyAga iti kecicCAstrajYA AhuH. atrAyamASayaH. pradAnaM svAmyakaraRam iti manUkteH dAnamAtrAt saMpradAnasya tadvizayajYAnABAvadaSAyAmapi svatvamutpadyate pituH svatvoparamAttadDane garBasTasyeva iti. taTA ca dattasya pratigrahaH na tu pratigrahaGawitaM dAnam<BR>;p{0352}<BR>iti (vAca0). 2 parAyattIkaraRam. tadAyattIkaraRaM ca tatkartfkanirRejanecCAprakASako vyApAraH. yaTA rajakasya vastraM dadAtItyAdO dadAtyarTaH. nirRejanaM ca malApakarzaH. atra dadAtyaTEkadeSe kartftve rajakasya saMbanDavivakzAyAM SEzikI zazWI iti jYeyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96). SEzikI zazWI ca zazWI Sepe (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 50) ityanena sUtreRa viDIyate. tadarTaSca kArakaprAtipadikArTAtiriktaH saMbanDarUporTaH SezaH tadvivakzAyAM pazWI iti. 3 tatkartfkatAqanAnumatiprakASakavyApAraH. yaTA hantuH pfzWaM dadAtItyAdO dadAtyarTaH. atrApi dadAtyarTEkadeSe kartftve hantuH saMbanDavivakzAyAM pazWI iti jYeyam. evam saMvAhakasya caraRaM dadAtItyAdAvfhanIyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96) (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 101)