dozaH — 1 apramAyA asADAraRakAraRam (ta0 dI0 gu0 pf0 36). apramAtvADikadeSavfttiDarmAnavacCinnApramAnizWa kAryatAnirUpita kAraRatASAlItyarTaH (nIla0 gu0 pf0 3637). yaTA dozopramAyA janakaH pramAyAstu guRo Bavet. pittadUratvAdirUpo dozo nAnAviDaH smftaH.. (BA0 pa0 lo0 132) ityAdO kAcakAmalapittamaRqUkavasAYjanAdirBramotpAdako dozaH (mu0 gu0 pf0 211). taTAhi SaNKe pItaBrame pittaM dozaH. kvacit candrAdeH svalpaparimARaBrame dUratvaM dozaH. kacicca vaMSoragaBrame maRqUkavasAYjanam. ityevaMrUpadozA ananugatA eva BrAntijanakA ityarTaH (mu0 gu0 pf0 211). 2 pravartanAlakzaRA dozAH (gO0 1. 1. 18). pravartanA pravfttihetutvam. atra vigrahaH. pravartanA pravfttijanakatvam. tadeva lakzaRaM yezAm iti (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 18). dozAstu budDisamAnASrayatvAdAtmaguRAH (vAtsyA0 4. 1. 2). kA punariyaM pravartanA. yaTA avaSaH pravartate taM pravartamAnaM rAgAdayaH pravartayantIti. seyaM pravfttihetutvAtpravartanetyucyate (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 18 pf0 85). jYAtAraM hi rAgAdayaH pravartayanti puRye pApe vA. yatra miTyAjYAnaM tatra rAgadvezAviti. pratyAtmavedanIyA hIme dozAH kasmAt lakzaRato nirdiSyanta iti. karmalakzaRAH Kalu raktadvizwamUQAH. rakto hi tatkarma kurute yena karmaRA suKaM duHKaM vA Bajate. taTA dvizwaH taTA mUQaH iti. dozA rAgadvezamohA ityucyamAne bahu noktaM BavatIti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 18) (ta0 dI0 pf0 42). atratyam dozalakzaRaM ca lOkikapratyakzavizayatve sati pramAnyatve sati pravfttijanakatvam. lOkikapratyakzavizayatve<BR>;p{0363}<BR>satItyuktayA SarIrAdfzweSvarecCAdO nAtivyAptiH. yAgAdigocarapramAvAraRAya pramAnyatve satItyuktam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 18). aTavA dozatvaM pramAkAraRIBUtABAvapratiyogitvam (mU0 ma0 prAmA0 utpa0 pf0 324). dozARAM trayaH pakzAH rAgapakzaH dvezapakzaH mohapakzaSca. tatrAdyaH pakzaH kAmaH matsaraH spfhA tfzRA loBaH mAyA damBaH iti. dvitIyaH pakzaH kroDaH IrzyA asUyA drohaH amarzaH aBimAnaH iti. tftIyaH pakzaH viparyayaH saMSayaH tarkaH mAnaH pramAdaH Bayam SokaH iti (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3) (vAtsyA0 4. 1. 3). 3 vyAvfttivyavahArEtadanyatara prayojanaviGawako DarmaH. sa ca lakzaRadozaH iti vyavahniyate. yaTA ekaSaPatvasya gorlakzaRasyAsaMBavaH. sa ca dozastriviDaH. avyAptiH ativyAptiH asaMBavaSca (nIla0 1 pf0 1). 4 anumititatkaraRaparAmaSEtadanyatarapratibanDakayaTArTajYAnavizayaH (ta0 dI0 pf0 24). aTavA yadvizayakatvena jYAnasyAnumititatkAraRIBUtaparAmarSEtadanyatarapratibanDakatvaM saH. sa ca dozaH paYcaviDaH savyaBicAratvam (vyaBicAraH) viroDaH satpratipakzaH asidDiH bADaSca iti (ci02 pf0 8384) (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 17). sa ca hetudozaH hetvABAsaSca ityapi vyavahniyata iti vijYeyam. tallakzaRAdikaM ca hetvABAsaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare savistaraM saMpAdayizyata ityatrEva viramyate. 5 viDyulaNGanajanyaH adfzwaviSezo dozaH (pratyavAyaH) iti mImAMsakA AhuH. gurutalpagamanABakzyaBakzaRAdijanyapApaviSezaH iti DarmajYAH pOrARikASca saMjagadire. 6 kAvyajYAstu apakarzaprayojako vastunizWo DarmaviSezaH (vAca0). atrocyate. syAcceto viSatA yena sakzatAramaRIyatA. SabderTe ca kftonmezaM dozamudGozayanti tam.. (candrAlo0) iti. aTavA muKyArTahatiH (kAvya0 pra0 u0 7 Slo0 48). yaTA yatiBaNgaSrutikawutvAdayaH padAdigatadozAH saMBavanti iti vadanti. atrocyate duzwaM padaM Srutikawu cyuta saMskftya prayuktamasamarTam. nihatArTamanucitArTaM nirarTakamavAcakaM triDASlIlam.. saMdigDamapratItaM grAmyaM neyArTamaTa.<BR>;p{0364}<BR>Bavetklizwam. avimfzwaviDeyAMSaM virudDamatikft samAsagatameva.. iti (dozAH 18) (kAvya0 pra0 u0 7 Slo0 5051). evam vAkyamAtragatadozAH rasadozAH sAkzAtparaMparayA vA tata eva vijYeyAH. 7 vAtapittakaPajAH iti trayo BramadozAH iti BizajaH pravadanti. atrocyate. vAyuH pittaM kaPaSceti trayo dozAH samAsataH. vikftAvikftA dehaM Gnanti te varDayanti ca.. iti (vAgBawa 0). atra viSezaH. cirajvare vAtakaPolbaRe vA tridozaje vA daSamUlamiSraH. kirAtatiktAdigaRaH prayojyaH SudDyarTine vA trivftAvimiSraH.. iti (cakradatta 0). atrArTe dozaSabde dupa vEkftye iti duzaDAtoH karaRe GaY. taTA cIktam DAtavaSca malAScApi duzyantyeBiryatastataH. vAtapittakaPA ete trayo dozA iti smftAH.. iti (vAgBawa0). atra dvizazwirdozaBedAH iti suSrutakArA AhuH. 8 anudyogadeSAntarAparyawanadarSanIyavastvAdyanavalokanAdayo dozAH itIdAnIMtanA vidvanmanyAH pAScAtyASca kecinmanyante.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0362" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहनम्
dohanam — [ka] kzaraRAnukUlavyApAraH. yaTA gAM payo dogDi mEtra ityAdO duherarTaH. atra gopadottara dvitIyAyA arTo viBAgaH. tasya janakatvasaMvanDena kzaraRenvayaH. viBAge cADeyatAsaMbanDena prakftyarTagavAderanvayaH. praDAnakarmakzIravAcakapayaHpadottara dvitIyArTo vfttitvam. tasya DAtvarTatAvacCedake kzaraRarUpe PalenvayaH. evaM ca gonizWaviBAgAnukUla payonizWakzaraRAnukUlavyApArakartA mEtraH iti boDaH. [Ka] vastu- : tastu viBAgAvacCinnakzaraRAnukUlo vyApAraH. atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. yatra ca kzaraRAnukUlavyApAramAtraM DAtvarTatayA vivakzitam kzaraRAnvayiviBAgaSca viBaktyarTatayA tatrApAdAnatvaboDikA paYcamI iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 44). gAM dogDi payaH duhyate gOH kzIramityAdO akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 51) ityanena sUtreRa gorapAdAnatvAdyavivakzayA karmatvaM boDyam. tatra DAtvarTatAvacCedakI BUtakzaraRasya payo- 11 vfttitvAtpayaso muKyaM karmatvam. gostu tAdfSakzaraRajanyaviBAgASrayatvAdvEORaM<BR>;p{0365}<BR>karmatvam iti vivekaH. gAM dogDi paya ityAdO dvikarmakaDAtusamaBivyAhftagavAdipadottaradvitIyA kriyAjanyaPalaSAlitvAdanyadeva karmatvaM boDayati. kArakADikArIyeRa akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 114. 51). ityanenApAdAnatvAdiBinnaDAtupratipAdyAnvaviDarmAntarAvacCinnasyApi karmasaMjYAviDAnAt iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 43). anye tu gAM dogDi paya ityAdO gopadottaradvitIyAyA vfttitvamarTaH. tasya DAtvarTaGawakaviBAgenvayaH. SAbdaboDastu pUrvavadeva jYeyaH ityAhuH. atredaM boDyam. asya duheH gORe karmaRi lakArAdi. tatroktam praDAnakarmaRyAKyeye lAdInAhurdvikarmaRAm. apraDAne duhAdInAM Ryante kartuSca karmaRaH.. iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 44) (vAca0). idaM cAtrAvaDeyam. DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAlitvaM karmatvam ityatra DAtvarTatAvacCedakatvasya DAtuvfttigrahaviSezyAMSe sAkzAdviSezaRatvarUpatvam ityato na tAdfSaM karmatvam atra pravartate iti. duhyate gOH kzIramityAdO kzaraRajanyaviBAgASrayatvaM gavAdinizwamapraDAnakarmatvamAKyAtArTaH. apraDAne duhAdInAm ityanuSAsanAt. kzIravfttitvasya DAtvarTakzaraRa evAnvayaH. AKyAtArTakzaraRe DAtvarTavyApArAnvayaH. taTA ca viBAgAvacCinna kzIranizWakzaraRAnukUlavyaH pArajanyakzaraRajanya viBAgASrayo gOH ityAkArako boDaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 44). yaTA vA tezu tezu tu pAtrezu duhyamAnA vasuMDarA (harivaM0 lo0 81) ityAdO duherarTaH (vAca0). atrAdiSabdaprAhyepUdAharaRAntarezu dvikarmakatvAdiviSezo jYeyaH. yaM sarvaSElAH parikalpya vatsaM merO sTite dogDari dohadakze. BAsvanti ratnAni mahOzaDISca pfTUpadizwAM duduhurDaritrIm.. (kumAra0 sa0 1 Slo0 2) ityAdO. yaH payo dogDi pAzARam payo GawonnIrapi gA duhanti (BawwiH) ityAdO ca duherdvikarmakatvam. duheranya karmakatvAvivakzAyAmekakarmakatvamapi. yaTA dudoha yajYasidDyarTamfgyajuH sAmalakzaRam (manuH) isyAdO. yaTA vA dugDvA payaH patrapuwe madIyam (raGu0 sa0 2 0 65) ityAdO ca. [ga] dravadravyaviBAgAnukUla kriyAnukUlavyApAraviSezaH. sa ca.<BR>;p{0366}<BR>kartfnizWaH. yaTA gAM dogDi paya ityAdO. atra vAyurvfkzaM gAM dogDi iti prayogavAraRAya dravadravyeti padam. meGo jalaM dogDi iti vAraRAya viSezaH iti padaM dattam. atra viSezo duhaDAtugamyaH. itTaM ca dravadravyeti na deyamityapi vadanti. atra DAtvarTaGawake viBAge gAm ityasya kriyAyAM payaH ityasya cAnvayAt govfttiviBAgAnukUlapayovfttikriyAnukUlakftimAn iti vAkyArTaH (kA0 vA0 pf0 2). [Ga mocanAnukUlavyApAraH. yaTA gAM payo dogDi gopa ityAdO duherarTaH. atra duhyarTaGawakamocane gorADeyatvena payasaH karmatvena (karmatAnirUpakatvena) anvayAt payaH karmatAkaM yadgovfttimocanaM tadanukUlavyApAravAn ityAkArako boDaH. atredaM boDyam. mocanaM ca bahiH kzaraRAvacCinnavyApAraH. tadanukUlavyApAro dohanam. ataH DAtvarTatAvacCedako BUtaM (DAtvarTatAvacCedakatAyAmavacCedakam) bahiHkzaraRarUpaM PalamAdAya payasaH gORaM karmatvam. mocanAtmakaM ca PalamAdAya goH muKyaM karmatvam iti. evaM ca duhAdayaH PalAvacCinna kriyA hetuvyApAravAcitvAdeva dvikarmakA Bavanti iti (Sa0 pra0 lo0 73 pf0 98). [Na] niHsaraRamAtram. yaTA dugDesmE sarvaM kAmaM yo vAco dohaH (CAndo0 u0) ityAdO. yaTAM vA na karmaPalamApnoti yo DarmaM dogDumicCati (mahABA0 va0 Slo0 1965) ityAdO. yatra DarmaduGA BUmiH sarvakAmaduGA mahI. dogDi smABIpsitAnarTAn yajamAnasya BArata.. (BAga0 4. 19. 7) ityAdO ca duherarTaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0364" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतम्
dyUtam — aprARiBiryatkriyate talloke dyUtamucyate (mitAkzarA 2 199).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0366" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतकत्वम्
dyotakatvam — [ka] arTaviSeze tAtparyagrAhakatvam (ci0 4) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 18) (nIla0). yaTA prajayatItyAdO praSabdasya dyotakatvam. jayatiratra prakfzwajayalakzakaH. praSabdastu tAtparyagrAhakaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 18). yaTA vA citragumAnayetyAdO citrapadasya dyotakatvam. atra ca gopadenEva lakzaRayA citragosvAmiboDanAccitrapadasya dyotakatvameva iti jYeyam (mu0 4 pf0 182). [Ka] SAbdikAnAM<BR>;p{0367}<BR>mate kvacit samaBivyAhftapadIyaSaktivyaYjakatvam. yaTA prahAra ityAdO prAdinipAtAnAM praharaRAdyarTadyotakatvam (la0 ma0). atra ca DAtoreva SaktyA prahAravihArAdyarTaboDakatvasaMBavenopasargARAM dyotakatvameva iti boDyam. atra vEyAkaraRAnAM gATA SrUyate DAtUnAmanekArTatvam iti (la0ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 8). taduktam upasargeRa DAtvarTo balAdanyatra nIyate. prahArAhArasaMhAravihAraparihAravat.. iti (si0 kO0). ga] kacit samaBivyAhftagatavfttyudboDakatvam. [Ga] kacittu kriyAviSezAkzepakatvam. yaTA prAdeSaM viliKatItyAdO. atra virvimAnakriyAkzepakaH. taTA ca prAdeSaM vimAya liKati ityarTovagamyate. yaTA vA aTa SabdAnuSAsanam ityatrATaSabdasya prAramBakriyAkzepakatvaM kEyawAdAvuktam (la0 ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 7). [Na] kvacittu saMbanDaparicCedakatvam. yaTA sarpizopi syAt ityAdO karmapravacanIyAnAM dyotakatvam (la0 ma0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 7). atra vindvaDyAhAreRApeH padArTadyotakatA. apiH kriyAyA svadyotyavindudOrlaBya prayuktadOrlaByasyApi dyotakaH. evaM ca sarpiravayava vindukartfkA tadvindudOrlaByaprayuktadOrlaByavatI saMBAvanAvizayIBUtA sattA iti boDaH (la0 ma0 suba0 pf0 9495).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0366" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवत्वम्
dravatvam — 1 (guRaH) [ka] syandanakarmakAraRam (praSasta 0 pf0 33). dravatvaM pfTivyaptejovftti dvIndriyagrAhyam asamavAyi nimittaM ca kAraRam. tatra kriyAyAmasamavAyi saMgrahe tu nimittaM kAraRam. [Ka] AdyasyandanAsamavAyikAraRam tatra dvitIyAdivyApArajanakavegavAraRAya Adya iti syandanasya viSezaRam (vAkya 0 1 pf0 9) (di0 gu0 pf0 232). dravatvaM dviviDam. sAMsidDikam nEmittikaM ca. tatra sAMsidDikam agnyAdisaMyogAjanyam. svABAvikam ityarTaH (vAkya 0 1 pf0 9) himakarakAdO cAdfzwaviSezeRa GanIBAvena sAMsidDikadravatvapratibanDaH kalpyate (si0 ca0 1 pf0 7). evaM ca himakarakAdAvapi sAMsidDikaM dravatvamastyeva. na ca tatra nEmittikaM dravatvaM yuktam. drute Gfte GftatvAdivat karakAtvopalamBApatteH. nEmittikadravatvasya nimittanASanASyatvena<BR>;p{0368}<BR>GftAdivatpunaH piRqIBAvApatteSca iti (pa0 mA0). tElakzIrAdAvapi jalasyEva dravatvam. snehaprakarzeRa ca dahanAnukUlyam iti boDyam (mu0 1 pf0 77). atredamAkUtam. himakarakayorOpADikadravatvaniroDAt sUryakiraRaBUmisaMyogAdinopADinivfttimAtram na tu dravatvotpattiH iti (vAkya 0 1 0 9). taTA ca adfzwaviSezeRa dravatvapratiroDaH. karakAyAM kAWinyapratyayo BrAntireva (mu0 1 jala0 pf0 77). divyena tejasA saMyuktAnAmApyAnAM paramARUnAM parasparasaMyogo dravyAramBakaH saMGAtAKyaH. tena paramARudravatvapratibanDAt kArye himakarakAdo dravatvAnutpattiH iti (praSasta 0 pf0 34). nEmittikaM ca amyAdisaMyogajanyamityarTaH (vAkya 0 1 0 9). tatra sAMsidDikaM jala eva. nEmittikaM pfTivItejasoreva vartate (praSasta0 pf0 33) (ta0 saM0) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 155158). sAMsidDikadravatvatvaM jAtiviSezaH pratyakzasidDaH (mu0 1 jala0 pf0 76). GftalAkzAdipfTivIzu suvarRAditejassu cAgnisaMyogajanyaM dravatvaM vartate iti jYeyam (mu0 1 pf0 232) (ta0 saM0). ayaM BAvaH. sarpirjatvAkarajezu paramARuzvagnisaMyogAdvegApekzAtkarmotpattO tajjYeByo viBAgeByo dravyAramBakasaMyogavinASAtkAryadravyanivfttO agnisaMyogAdOzRyApekzAt svatantrezu paramARuzu dravatvamutpadyate iti (praSasta0 pf0 34). taTA ca dravatvaM nityAnityaBedenApi dviviDam. tatra nityadravyagatam nityam. anityadravyagatamanityam (mu0 gu0 pf0 232) (pra0 pra0) (ta0 kO0) (la0 ma0). atrAyaM vivekaH. sAMsidDikaM dravatvameva nityAnityaBedena dviviDam. tacca nityagataM nityam. anityagatamanityam. nEmittikadravatvaM tvanityameva iti (vAkya 0 1 pf0 9). tasya pAkajanyatvena vinASasaMBavAnna nityatvamiti BAvaH. dravadravyARi tu dugDadaDyAjyatakrAsavajalatElAdIni dEhikamUtrAdIni ca vijYeyAni. 2 kAvyajYAstu gatiH. yaTA samudramevABimuKA dravanti (gItA a0 11 Slo028) ityAdO. yaTA vA tataH kirIwI sahasA pAYcAlAn samaredravat<BR>;p{0369}<BR>(BA0 A0 54. 78) taM dudrAvAdriRA kapiH (Bawwi0) ityAdO ityAhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0367" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यत्वम्
dravyatvam — 1 (sAmAnyam) gaganAravindasamavetatve sati nityatve sati ganDAsamavetatvam (sarva 0 pf0 215 OlU0). tacca nityamanekadravyamAtrasamavetam (vE0 u0 1. 2. 11). yaTA kzityAdInAM navAnAM tu dravyatvam (BA0 pa0 Slo0 24). atra dravyatvatvaM tu dravyetarAsamavetatve sati sakaladravyasamavetatvam. evam pfTivItvatva GawatvatvAdikamapi nirvAcyam. 2 liNgasaMKyAnvayitvaM dravyatvam iti SAbdikA vadanti. liNgasaMKyAkArakaSUnyatvam sattvatvam. tadeva dravyatvam iti BAvaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यम्
dravyam — (padArTaH) 1 [ka] guRASrayaH (ta0 dI0 pf0 4). atrAyaM niyamaH. praTamaM dravyaM nirguRaM nizkriyaM cEvotpadyate paScAttatsamavetA guRakriyA utpadyante iti. guRASrayatvaM cAtra guRayogyatvam. tacca guRAtyantABAvAnaDikaraRatvam (ta0 BA0). idaM dravyalakzaRam dravyatvajAtimattvaM vA dravyalakzaRam iti boDyam (ta0 dI0 14) (ta0 kO0). itTaM ca tatra sUtram kriyAguRavat samavAyikAraRamiti dravyalakzaRam (vE0 111. 15) iti. aTavA guRasamAnADikaraRA sattABinnA ca yA jAtiH (dravyatvam) tadvattvam. tena AdyakzaRAvacCinne utpannavinazwe ca dravye nAvyAptiH (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 5). [Ka] samavAyikAraRam (ta0 BA0 arTa0 pf0 27) (BA0 pa0 sADarmya0 Slo0 23). [ga] dravatvarUpajAtimat (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 4) (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 1). dravyatvajAtistu kAryasAmAnyasya saMyogasya viBAgasya vA samavAyikAraRatAvacCedakatayA sidDyati (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 5) (mu0 1 pf0 30) (nIla0 1 pf0 4). taTAhi kAryasamavAyikAraRatA kiMcidDarmeRa (arTAt dravyatvena) avacCinnA kAraRatAtvAddaRqanizWaGawakAraRatAvat ityanumAnena dravyatvaM jAtiH siDyati. anugataH anyUnaH anatiprasaktaSca yo DarmastasyEvAvacCedakatvena tAdfSayatkiMcidDarmasya jAtityAvaSyakatvAt iti BAvaH. evam guRatvA47<BR>;p{0370}<BR>dInAmapi jAtitvamUhyam. dravyaM navaviDam pfTivI ApaH tejaH vAyuH AkASaH kAlaH dik AtmA manaH iti dravyARi (vE0 2. 1. 5) kI (praSasta0 pf0 1) (ta0 BA0 arTa0 pf0 27) (ta0 saM0) - (BA0 pa0 Slo0 3). AkASakAladiSAmekEkatvAdaparajAtyaBAve. pAriBAzikyastisraH saMjYA Bavanti AkASaH kAlaH dik iti (praSasta 0 ko pf0 7). tatra dikkAlO paramAtmano nAtiricyate iti dIDitikfdvakti (di0 1) (pa0 mA0). AkASa ISvarAnnAtiricyate ityekadeSina AhuH (pa0 mA0). atra BAzyam. AkASaM guRavattvAt AnASritatvAcca dravyam. Sabdo guRo BUtvA AkASasyADigame liNgam. samAnAsamAnajAtIyakAraRAsaMBavAnnityam. sarvaprARinAM ca SabdopalabDinimittaM SrotraBAvena (praSasta0 pf0 7). dravyam prakArAntareRa dviviDam bahirdravyam antardravyaM ca. bahirdravyARi pfTivI ApaH tejaH vAyuSca. tadanyAnyantardravyARi iti. tatrApi pfTivyatejAMsi dvIndriyagrAhyARi ((nyA0 vA0 111. 13 pf0 76). atredaM boDyam. vAyoranumeyatvakI vAdinAM prAcAM mate bahirdravyapratyakzaM prati udBUtarUpavattve sati mahattvaM kAraRam. tena pratyakza sAmagryABAvAnna vAyostvAca pratyakzam. vAyoH pratyakzatvavAdinAM navyAnAM mate tu udBUtasparSavattve sati mahattvamapi kAraRam iti (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 32) (mu0 1 pf0). tena pratyakza sAmagrIsaMpattyA vAyostvAcapratyakzaM Bavati iti BAvaH. dravyaM 9 nityAnityaBedenApi dviviDam. tatra navasu dravyezu maDye pfTivyAdicatuzwayasya paramARavaH AkASam kAlaH dik AtmA (jIvaH paramAtmA ca) manaSca etAni nityadravyARi. pfTivyAdicatuzwayasya dvyaRukamAraBya mahatparyantaM sarvARyanityadravyARi Bavanti (mu0 1). tatra anityadravyaM kAryarUpatvAdavayavasamavetam. nityadravyaM tvasamavetameva. 2 SAbdikAstu vastUpalakzaRaM yatra sarvanAma prayujyate. dravyamityucyate sorTo Bedyatvena vyavasTitaH.. (BartfhariH) iti vadanti. 3 Bizajastu raso guRastaTA vIryaM vipAkaH Saktireva ca. paScAnAM yaH samAhArastaddravyamiti kIrtyate..<BR>;p{0371}<BR>iti. tanmate dravyarasaguRavIryavipAkAnAM prADAnyAprADAnyaBedena dvEviDyam suSrutamanTe uktam. tattu tasmAdeva vijYeyam. prakArAntareRa dravyaM paYcaviDam atyantakaWinakaWinAIkolbaRadravadravyaBedAt ityAhuH (vA0). 4 AItAstu guRaparyAyavadravyam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 72 AI0) ityAhuH. 5 rAmAnujIyAstu itTaM vadanti. tatra dravyaM daSAvatprakftiriha guREH sattvapUrvErupetA kAlobdAdyAkftiH syAdaRuravagatimAYjIva ISonya AtmA. saMproktA nityaBUtistriguRasamaDikA sattvayuktA taTEva jYAturjYeyAvaBAsA matiriti kaTitaM saMgrahAdravyalakzma.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 112 rAmAnu0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोणः
droRaH — droRatvaviSizwaH parimARaviSezaH. yaTA dvidroRena DAnyaM krIRAti droRo vrIhirityAdO. droRatvaM cAtra iyattAviSezAvacCinnapalAdiparicCinnaDAnyAdiparicCedakatva samAnADikaraRajAtiviSezaH. evam prasTatvAdayo boDyAH (la0 ma0). droRo vrIhirityatra droRarUpaM yat parimARaM tatparicCinno vrIhiH iti SAbdaboDaH (si0 kO0 kA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहः
drohaH — (dozaH) [ka] ahitecCA. yaTA Satrave druhyatItyAdO DAtvarTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96). atra BAzyam prayatnasmftiDarmADarmahetudrohaH. sa ca dvezaBedaH (praSasta0 pra0 33). atra ahitaBAgitayecCAvizayatA. tannirUpakatvaM caturTyarTaH. tAdfSanirUpakatvasya DAtvarTecCAyAmantrayaH. aTavA ADeyatvaM caturTyarTaH. ataH karmaRetyAdisUtrasya (pA0 sU0 1 4. 32) na vizayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96). tasya cADeyatvasya DAtvarTaGawakAhite anvayaH. atra kruDadrudderzyAsUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH (pA0 sU0 1 4 37) ityanena karmaRaH saMpradAnasaMjYA (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 96). [Ka] nASAya dvezaH (gO0 vf0 4. 1 3). [ga] dvizwAcaraRam. yaTA. mitrAya druhyatItyatra. atra mitrasya dvizwamAcaratItyarTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo069 pf0 87). [Ga] SAbdikAstu duHKajanakakriyArUpApakArajanakaScittavfttiviSezaH. yaTA haraye druhyatItyAdO drudderarTaH ityAhuH. atra<BR>;p{0372}<BR>harisaMpradAnako drohaH iti boDaH (la0 ma0 subarTa 0 pf0 103). atrAyaM vivekaH. kopapUrvakasya drohAtedruhaDAtuvAcyatve tatkarmaRaH saMpradAnatvam. drohAdimAtrasya taTAtve tu karmatvameva iti punaH kOmArAH. sopasargayostu kruDadruhoH karmaRaH karmatEva na tu saMpradAnatA. ata eva SizyasyABikrodDA mitrasyABidroQA ityAdO kudyoge karmaRi zazWayeva pramARam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 69 pf0 87). atredamavaDeyam. mitraM druhyati SizyamIti putramasUyati ityapi prayogAt druhAdikarmaRaH saMpradAnatvaM vEkalpikam ityunnIyate. [Na] hiMsA iti pare manyante (gO0 0 vf0 4. 1. 3)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वः
dvandvaH — (samAsaH) [ka] yadyadarTopasTApakasya kramikayAdfSanAmastomasya niScayastattadarTa prakArakAnvayaboDaM prati tattvena samarTaH tAdfSanAmanivaha eva tAvadarTako dvandvasamAsaH. GawaGawetyAdikasya GawakalaSetyAdikasya GawatawetyAdikasya ca kramikanAmastomasya niScayatvena GawAderanvayavoDaM pratyayahetutvam. ato na tAdfNgrAmanivaho GawAdyarTe dvandvaH. ata eva samasyamAnapadArTayoH tattvAvacCedakayorvA yatra miTo BedastatrEva dvandvasya sADutvasUcanAya cArTe dvandvaH (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 29) iti pARinirAha. ata eva BedagarBasamuccayArTakaM caSabdamantarBAvya DavaSca KadiraSca ityAdikaM vigrahamasya prayuYjate vfdDAH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 47 pf0 62). padajanyapratItivizayaBeda eva dvandvaH (BavAnandI). yaTA pARipAdaM vAdaya DavaKadirO CinDItyAdO dvandvaH. atra hi karmatvAdyaMSe karacaraRAdiprakArakAnvayaboDaM prati amAdiDarmikaH karacaraRAdyupasTApakasya pARipAdAdikramikanAmastomasyAvyavahitottaratvasaMbanDena niScayaH kAraRam. ataH pARipAdAdisamudAyaH karacaraRAditattadarTe dvandvaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 47 pf0 61). dvandvo dviviDaH. samAhAraH itaretaraSceti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 4748 pf0 6061). atra vEyAkaraRAnAM vivekaH. saMhatiprADAnye samAhAradvandvaH saMhanyamAnaprADAnya itaretarayogaH iti (vAca0). SAbdikAstu DavaKadirA vityAdA vitaretarayogadvandve udBUtAvayavaBedasamUhaH samAsArya<BR>;p{0373}<BR>ityAhuH (la0 ma0 vfttivi0 pf0 30). atrAyaM viSezaH. samuccayAnvAcayayoH sAmarTyABAvAnna tatra dvandvasamAsaH. yatra yugapatkriyAnvayatAtparyam tatra samAsaH. samuccaye ca krameRa kriyAnvayaH na tu yugapat iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 52). [Ka] parasparAnanvita samasyamAnaniKilapadArTaboDakasamAsaH. yaTA DavaKadirAvityAdO. avyayIBAvAdAvativyAptivAraRAya parasparAnviteti padArTaviSezaRam. avyayIBAvAdO yaTAyaTaM BedenABedena vA parasparAnvitapadArTaboDakatvasattvAnnAtivyAptiH. pARipAdamityAdisamAhAradvandve tu pARipAdamAtraM pratIyate sAhityamapi (samAhAraH) na pratIyate iti tatra nAvyAptiH. ekavacanaM tu dvandvaSca prARitUryasenANgAnAm (pA0 sU0 2. 4. 2) iti sUtreRa vihitaM na virudDam. DavaKadirAvityatra ca parasparAnantritasamasyamAnapadArTaDavaKadirAdiboDaka sattvAsamantrayaH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 44). [ga] sarvapadArTapraDAnaH samAsaH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 11).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वम्
dvandvam — rahasyAdayaH paYca dvandvaSabdArTAH pARininoktAH. taTAca sUtram dvandvaM rahasyamaryAdAvacanavyutkramaRayajYapAtra prayogABivyaktizu (pA0sU08. 1. 15) iti. tatra rahasyaM dvandvaSabdavAcyam. itare prayogopADayaH. taTAhi 1 rahasyam. yaTA dvandvaM mantrayate ityAdO. 2 maryAdA sTityanatikramaH. yaTA AcaturaM hI me paSavo dvandvaM miTunIyanti. mAtA putreRa miTunaM gacCati pOtreRa prapOtreRApi iti maryAdArTaH. 3 vyutkramaRam pfTagavasTAnam. yaTA dvandvaM vyutkrAntAH iti. dvivargasaMbanDena pfTagavasTitA ityarTaH (vAca0). 4 yajYapAtraprayogaH. yaTA dvandvaM nyaSci yajYapAtrARi prayunakti iti. 5 aBivyaktiH. yaTA dvandvaM saMkarzaRavAsudevO iti (SabdenduSe0). aBivyaktO sAhacaryeRetyarTaH (vAca0). 6 kAvyajYASca yugalam. yaTA dvandvAni BAvaM kriyayA vivavruH (kumAra0 3. 35) ityAdI ityAhuH. 7 parasparavirudDasvaBAvaH SItozRAdiH. yaTA dvandvAtIto vimatsaraH (gItA0 4. 22) nirdvandvo hi mahAbAho (gItA0 4. 3) na dvandvaduHKamiha kiMcidakiMcanopi (mAGaH) ityAdO iti yogino vedAntinacAhuH<BR>;p{0374}<BR>atrocyate kzutpipAse SokamohO rAgadvezO taTEva ca. lABAlABO ca SItozRe taTA mAnApamAnako.. kAmakroDapraBftayo dvandvaSabdena varRitA iti. 8 durgam iti vyavahArajYA AhuH. 9 rogaviSeza iti Bizaja AhuH (vAca 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयोरेकम् इति रीत्या जायमानं ज्ञानम्
dvayorekam iti rItyA jAyamAnaM jYAnam — ekaprakAratAnirUpitoBayaviSezyatASAli jYAnam (la0va0 pf0 9). yaTA GawapawO raktarUpavantO iti jYAnam. atra GawapawoBayanizWaviSezyatAyA raktarUpanizWEkaprakAratAnirUpitatvena taTAtvaM saMpadyate iti vijYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

