द्विकर्मकः
dvikarmakaH — (DAtuH) PalAvacCinnakriyA hetuvyApAravAcako DAtuviSezaH. yaTA duha pfcCa ityAdiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 73 pf0 98). atra dvikarmakatvaM ca karmadvayasAkANkzakriyAboDakatvam iti jYeyam (kA0 vyA0 02). dvikarmakA DAtavastUktA yaTA duhyAcpacdaRqruDipracCicibrUSAsujimaTmuzAm. karmayuk syAdakaTitaM taTA syAnnIhfkfztrahAm.. iti (si0 kO0 kA0 pf0 56).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विगुः
dviguH — 1 (samAsaH) saMKyAvacCinna SaktayatpadottaratvaviSizwaM yannAma svArTaDarmikaM tAdAtmyasaMbanDena tadalakzyArTasyAnvayaboDaM prati samarTam tannAmottaratApannaM tannAmEva tadalakzyArTABinnasvArTe dvigurucyate. yaTA paYcamUlItyAdO (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 34 pf0 45). trikawutriBuvanacaturyugacaturvargapaYcagavyapaYa;p{0375} cAmftapaqUsazawpadArTasaptarvyazWanAgAzwavasunavarasa - navagrahadaSamUlEkAdaSa rudrEkAdaSendriyadvAdaSAdityetyAdikaH karmaDArayaH SuRWyAdiparyAptantritvAvacCinnaboDakatayA na pUrvapadAlakzyArTasya boDakaH. trikawupraBftiByaH kawutrayAdisAmAnyasyApratIteH. ato noktakarmaDArayetivyAptiH iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 34 pf. 45). kawutrayaM ca SuRWI pippalI marIca etatrayam. aTavA saMjYA vizayAnyatve sati saMKyAvAcakapUrvanAmatulyArTakottaranAmakaH samAsaH. yaTA paYcagavam paYcASvam paScAmram ityAdO iti prAYcaH. paYcAmrAH paYcakanyAH ityAdikarmaDArayavAraRAya satyantam. paYcAnAmAtrARAM samAhAraH paYcAmramityarTe tu dvigureva. nIlotpalamityAdikarmaDArayavAraRAya saMKyAvAcaketi pUrvanAma viSezaRam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 44). paYcagavamityAdO satyantasya saMKyAvAcakapacetipUrvapadatulyArTa kagavAdipadasya ca sattvAllakzaRasaMgatiH. taTA ca paYcABinnagavAdisamAhAraH iti paYcABinnAH samAhftagavAdayaH iti vA vAkyArTaboDaH (ma0 pra0 4 pf0 44). ayaM dvigustriviDaH. tadDitArTaH uttarapadaparakaH samAhArArTakaSceti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 34 pf0 4546). taTAca pARineH sUtram saMKyApUrvI dviguH (pA0 sU0 2. 1152) iti. asyArTaH tadDitArTottarapadasamAhAre ca (pA0 sU0 2. 1. 51) ityatroktaH saMKyApUrvI dviguH syAt (si0 kO0 sa0 pf0 74). 2 kAvyajYAstu dvigavasvAmikaH puruzo dviguH. yaTA dvandvo dvigurapi cAhaM satatamasmadgfhevyayIBAvaH (udBawaH) ityAdI ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

