द्वितीया
dvitIyA — (viBaktiH) tattadDAtvarTAdO karmatvAdiboDikA viBaktiH. yaTA cEtrastaRqulaM pacatItyAdO taRqulapadottaraM dvitIyA. dvitIyAdayopi dviviDAH. kArakaviBaktayaH upapadaviBaktayaSca. atra kArakatvaM ca kriyAjanakatvaSaktiH (la0 ma0). dvitIyAyA arTaSca 1 karmatvam. tacca PalaviSezo dvitIyArTaH. yaTA grAmaM gacCatItyAdO saMyogAtmaka<BR>;p{0376}<BR>- Palam parasamavetatvaM ca dvitIyArTaH iti prAco nEyAyikA AhuH. atrAyaM BAvaH. karmatvaM ca kriyAjanyaPalaSAlitvam. tatra kriyA. vyApAramAtram DAtuta eva laByate. PalAnvayi vfttitvam janyajanaka- - BAvasaMbanDaSca (padArTatvaM vinA) saMbanDamaryAdayA BAsate iti PalamAtraM saMyogaviBAgAdi karmapratyayArTaH iti prAcyAM nEyAyikAnAM matam. etanmate DAtorvyApAramAtrArTakatvam iti boDyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 36) (kA0 vyA0). atra parasamavetatvamapi dvitIyArTo vaktavyaH. prAcInamate SAbdaboDastu vfttitvasaMbanDena grAmaviSizwo yaH. saMyogaH janakatAsaMbanDena tAdfSasaMyogaviSizwo yo vyApAraH (DAtulaByaH) tadvizayiRI yA kftiH (AKyAtalaByA) tadvAn ityutpadyate. navyAstu vfttireva dvitIyArTaH. yaTA grAmaM gacCatItyAdO DAtvarTaPalAnvayi vfttitvaM dvitIyArTaH. ayaM BAvaH. navyamate DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAlitvameva karmatvam. tatra PalAvacCinnavyApAro DAtuta eva laByate. tadekadeSe Pale dvitIyArTavfttitvamanveti. evaM ca spandyAderna sakarmakatvam. tatra Palasya DAtvarTatAnavacCedakatvAt iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 38). navyamate yatra samaBivyAhftaDAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalASrayatvaboDaH tatra dvitIyA () iti vyutpattiH. tena BUmO patatItyAdO pataDAtorakarmakatayA DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalABAvena (saptamyA ASrayatvaboDepi) na dvitIyA (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 84). atredamavaDeyam. navyamate ca yatrASrayatvaM kartftvam tatrADeyatvaM dvitIyArTaH. yatrAnukUlakftimattvam kartftvam tatra kftijanyatvam dvitIyArTaH. yatra pratiyogitvam tatrAnuyogitvam. tezAM. cASrayatAsaMbanDenEvAnvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 47). navyAnAM matetrAyaM boDaH nirUpitasaMbanDena grAmaviSizwaM yadvfttitvam (ADeyatvam) tadvAn yaH saMyogastadavacCinnavyApArAnukUlakftimAn ityutpadyate. atra karturIpsitatamaM karma (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 49) ityanena karmasaMjYA karmaRi dvitIyA (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 2) ityanena dvitIyA ca jYeyA. yaTA vA gAM payo dogDi mEtra ityAdO payaHpadottaradvitIyArTo vfttitvam<BR>;p{0377}<BR>iti prAhuH. atra viBAgAvacCinna kzaraRAnukUlavyApAro duherarTaH. tatra viBAge gopadottaradvitIyArTavfttitvasya kzaraRe ca payaHpadottaradvitIyArTavfttitvasyAnvayo boDyaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 44). ada boDyam. gAmityatra akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 51) ityanena karmasaMjYA. paya ityatra tu karturIpsitatamaM karma (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 49) ityanena karmasaMjYA. taTA ca karmaRi dvitIyA (232) ityanenoBayatra dvitIyA iti. aDikaM tu dohanaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditam iti tatra dfzwavyam. atra ASrayo dvitIyArTaH iti SAbdikA AhuH (vE0 sA0). kvacitkarmatvaM vizayarUpatvam. yaTA BAvinaM GawaM jAnAti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 6) pOravaM gAM yAcate ityAdO dvitIyArTaH. atra vidyamAnaGawasTale jYAnena jYAtatotpAdanamaNgIkftya kriyAjanyaPalaSAlitvarUpakarmatvamapi kadAcitsaMBavati ityataH BAvinam ityuktam. tatra pUrvaM GawasyABAvena jYAtatAyA jananAsaMBavAt iti BAvaH. evaM ca karturIpsitatamaM karma ityanena sUtreRa lakzaRayA vizayatvAtmakaM gORameva karmatvaM boDyate iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 76). pOrava mityatrApi pUrvoktameva gORaM karmatvam. pOravasya gAM dogDi ityatreva karmatvaM boDyam. tacca vizayatvarUpaM karmatvaM kvacidviDeyatvam viDeyatvaM vA. yaTA parvate vahnimanumitomItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. atredaM boDyam. jYAnAdirUpasa vizayakavastvaBiDAyakaDAtusamaBivyAhftadvitIyAyAH prAcInamate vizayatvamarTaH. tasya ca nirUpakatAsaMbanDena DAtvarTenvayaH. vizayatve prakftyarTasyADeyatAsaMbanDenAnvayaH iti. navyAstu vfttyaniyAmaka saMbanDasyABAvapratiyogitAnavacCedakatayA GawaM jAnAti pawaM na ityAdO prAcInamate SAbdaboDasya anupapattestatra dvitIyAyA vizayitvameva SakyArTamupavarRayanti. tanmate tatra vizayitve prakftyarTasya nirUpitatyasaMbanDena vizayitvasya ca DAtvarTa ASrayatAsaMbanDenAnvayaH iti. GawAdinizWaM jYAnAdikarmatvaM ca jYAnAdivizayatvameva. vizayitvAdO ca dvitIyAyA lakzaREva na tu SaktiH iti sAMpradAyikA AhuH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 51). . kvacittu 40<BR>;p{0378}<BR>uddeSyatvam uddeSyitvaM vA. yaTA vahnimattvena parvatamanuminomItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. ayaM dvitIyArTastu (uddeSyatvam uddeSyitvaM vA) yadi vahnisADyakaparvatapakzakAnumitiparasya vahnimattvena parvatamanuminomi ityAdivAkyasyApi prAmARyaM manyate tadANgIkartavyaH. taTA ca tAdfSadvitIyArTIddeSyatvAdeSca tftIyAntopasTApya sADyaviDeyakatvena viSizwenvayaH kartavyaH. vahnimattvenetyatra tftIyArTo vESizwyam. taccAtra viDeyatvameveti na tftIyArTAnupapattiH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 0 5556). yaTA vA vizRuM yajate ityAdO dvitIyArTaH. kacicca samavAyasaMbanDAvacCinnAGegratyasaMsargAvacCinnavizayatAnirUpitaprakAritA. yaTA puzpaM jiGratItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. atra tAdfSaprakAritAyASca ganDanirUpita lOkika vizayitASAlipratyakzAtmakaDAtvarTEkadeSe vizayitAyAM nirUpitatva saMbanDenAnvayaH. tena idAnIMtanapuzpe ganDaH ityAdipratyayasyADeyatAsaMsargeRa kAlAdiprakArakatvepi tAdfSapratyakzadaSAyAM na kAlaM jivrati ityAdiprayogaH (ga0vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 1 pf0 52). kacicca lOkikavizayitvam. yaTA GawaM paSyatItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. kvacit tAdAtmyasaMbanDAvacCinna prakAratA. yaTA raNge aBedena rajatAropasTale raNgaM rajataM jAnAti ityAdO dvitIyArTaH. kvacit viSezyatA. yaTA pAkaM cikIrzatItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. atra pAkAdeSca kftikarmatvameva dvitIyayA pratyAyyate. na tvicCAyA vizayatvarUpaM karmatvam. gfhasTitIcCAmAdAya gfhaM tizWAsati ityAdiprayogApatteH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 59). atredaM jYeyam. kyajAdyantAderakarmakasya sannantasamAnArTakatvepi putrIyati putrakAmyatItyAdEA sAkANkzatvAnupagamena na dvitIyA. BftyaM putrIyatItyAdO tu AcArArTavihitakyajantasya sakarmakatvaM yujyata eveti tatra dvitIyA (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 63). kvacit muKyaviSezyatvam. yaTA vfzwisADyaM suKaM Bavatu ityatra suKasyEva na tu vfzweH karmatvaM dvitIyArTaH. atastatra tAdfSavivakzAyAM suKamicCati ityAdivat vfzwimicCati ityAdayo na prayogAH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 59). kacit<BR>;p{0379}<BR>sADyatAKyavizayatAviSezaH. yaTA GawaM karotItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. kASAn kawaM karoti kAzWaM Basma karotItyAdO kASakAzWapadottaradvitIyayorupAdAnIya vilakzaRavizayatEvArTaH iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 0 65). 2 kartftvam. yaTA ajAM grAmaM prApayati SizyaM SAstra jYApayati brAhmaRamannaM Bojayati yajamAnaM mantraM pAWayati GawaM janayati GawaM nASayati cEtraH ityAdO ajAdipadottaradvitIyArTaH kartftvam. ajAM grAmaM prApayati ityAdO gatinirUpitamajAnizWaM kartftvam cASrayatvameva dvitIyArTaH. atra gatibudDipratyavasAnArTaSabdakarmAkarmakARAmaRi kartA sa RO (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 52) ityanena kartuH karmasaMjYA viDIyate iti boDyam. taTA ca ajAM grAmaM prApayati ityasya ajA grAmaM gacCati cEtrojAM grAmaM gamayati ityarTaH. evamuttaratrApyarTa UhyaH. SizyaM SAstraM jYApayatItyAdO jYAnanirUpitaM SizyanizWaM kartftvaM cASrayatvameva dvitIyArTaH. GawaM janayatItyAdAvutpattinirUpitaM GawanizWaM kartftvaM cASrayatvameva dvitIyArTaH. brAhmaRamannaM BojayatItyAdO BojananirUpitaM brAhmaRanizWaM kartftvaM ca BojanAnukUlakftimattvameva dvitIyArTaH yajamAnaM mantraM pAWayatItyAdO pAWanirUpitaM yajamAnanizWaM kartftvaM ca pAWAnukUlakftimattvameva dvitIyArTaH. GawaM nASayatItyAdO nASanirUpitaM GawanizWaM kartftvaM ca pratiyogitvameva dvitIyArTaH. tasya ca kartftvasya pUrvoktASrayatvakftimattvapratiyogitvAtmakasya nirUpakatAsaMbanDena DAtvarTenvayaH iti prAcInA AhuH. navyAstu yatrASrayatvaM kartftvam tatrAGeyatvaM dvitIyArTaH. yatrAnukUlakftimattvaM kartftvaM tatra kftijanyatvaM dvitIyArTaH. yatra pratiyogitvaM kartftvaM tatrAnuyogitvaM dvitIyArTaH. tezAM pUrvoktakartftvAnAm ASrayatAsaMbanDenEva tattadDAtvarTezvanvayaH iti prAhuH. 3 viBAgaH. yaTA gAM payo dogDi mEtra ityAdO gopadottaradvitIyAyA arTaH. atratyo vizayastu dohanaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditaH. tatrAvalokanIyaH. 4 aBedaH. yaTA stokaM pacatItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. atra nAmArTaDAtvarTayoraBedAtmakasaMbanDena padAdanupasTitenApyanvayo BavatItyasyAsvIkAra evABedo<BR>;p{0380}<BR>dvitIyayA boDyate. tatsvIkAre tu kriyAviSezaRapadottaradvitIyA viSezaRaviBaktivatprayogasADutvAyEveti jYeyam (kA0 vyA0 pf0 7). 5 aDikaraRatvam. yaTA mAsamaDIte cEtra ityAdO dvitIyArTaH. atra kAlADvanoratyantasaMyoge (pA0 sU0 2. 115) ityanena dvitIyA jYeyA. 6 anye tu vyApakatvam. yaTA mAsaM ramaRIyA kroSaM kuwilA nadItyAdO dvitIyArTaH ityAhuH. atra atyantasaMyogoBivyAptiH. aBivyAptyantarBAvena mAsasya karmatvam. dvitIyAyAH sADutvanirvAhakatvameveti. atroktam kAlaBAvADvadeSAnAmantarBUta kriyAntarEH. sarvErakarmakEryoge karmatvamupajAyate. iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 68). 7 kecittu aBivyAptiH. yaTA mAsaM supyate kroSaM gamyate ityAdO dvitIyArTa ityAhuH. 8 pratiyogitvam anuyogitvaM vA. yaTA daRqaM vinA na Gawa utpadyate rAsaBaM vinApi Gawa utpadyate ityAdO dvitIyArTaH yaTA vA AraBya tasyAM daSamIM tu yAvat prapUjayetparvatarAjaputrIm ityAdO pratiyogitvam anuyogitvaM vA dvitIyArTaH. 9 avaDitvam avaDimattvaM vA. yaTA kASItaH kOSikIM yAvadyAtItyAdO dvitIyArTaH. 10 ADeyatvam. yaTA yajYamanu prAvarpadityAdO dvitIyArTaH. atrArTe kArakatvarUpaM hetutvam anuSabdArTaH. anurlakzaRe (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 84) ityatra karmapravacanIyasaMjYAviDAyakasUtre lakzaRapadasya kArakahetuparatvAt. tatra ca yajYAnvitasyADeyatvarUpadvitIyArTasyAnvayaH. hetutAyASca nirUpakatva saMbanDena vfzwAvanvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 76). 11 nirUpitatvam. yaTA uktodAharaRe eva yajYamanuprAvarzadityatra. atrArTe janyatvamanuSabdArTaH. tatra nirUpitatvarUpa dvitIyArTasya yajYAdyanvitasyAnvayaH. janyatAyAScASrayatvasaMbanDena vfzwAvanvayaH. yaTA vA tvAM ca mAM cAntareRetyAdO dvitIyArTo nirUpitatvam. atra antarAntareRa yukte (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 4) ityanena dvitIyA. taTA ca dvitIyArTanirUpitatvasyAntarApadArTatAvacCedakamaDyatvenvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka02 pf0 77). evamanyatrApi dvitIyArTa uktadiSA svayaM paricCedyaH (ga0 vyu0 kAraka0 2 KaRqa 0 1—2 pf0 3677)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वित्वम्
dvitvam — [ka] saMKyAviSezaH. idaM dvitvaM ca samavAyena dravyadvaye pratyekaM tizWati iti jYeyam. yaTA dvO GawAvAnayetyAdO dvitvam. [Ka] apekzAbudDijanyo guRaviSezaH. yaTA ayamekaH ayamekaH iti budDyanantaram imO iti vyavahAravizayo dvitvam. idaM dvitvaM tu vyAsajyavftti paryAptisaMbanDena dvayoreva dravyayostizWati na pratyekam. idameva dvitvam imO dvO iti vyavahAravizayaH iti ca vijYeyam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 221 OlU0). evam tritvacatuvAdyAraBya parArGatvaparyantaM jYeyam. mImAMsakAstu dvitvAdInAmapekzAbudDijanyatvaM na svIkurvanti ityanyat. vastutastu dvittramapekzAbudDyA janyate tannASena ca naSyati. kvacidASrayanASAdapi naSyati (praSasta0 pf0 13) (mu0 gu0). dvitvAderapekzAbudDijanyatve pramARamAhurAcAryAH apekzAbudDirdvitvAderutpAdikA Bavitumarhati vyaYjakatvAnupapattO tenAnuviDIyamAnatvAt SabdaM prati saMyogavat iti. dvitvAdikamekatvadvayavizayAnityabudDivyaNgayaM na Bavati anekASritaguRatvAt pfTaktvAdivat iti sAyaRAcAryAH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 222 OlU0). idAnIM dvitvotpattiprakArAH pradaSyante. (1) yadA vodDuScakzuzA samAnAsamAnajAtIyayordravyayoH saMnikarze sati tatsaMyuktasamavetasamavetEkatvasAmAnyajYAnotpattAve kattrasAmAnyatatsaMbanDajYAneBya ekaguRayoranekavizayiye budDirutpadyate tadA tAmapekzyEkatvAByAM svASrayayodvitvamAraByate. tataH punastasmin dvitvasAmAnye jYAnamutpadyate. tasmAdditva sAmAnyajYAnAdapekzAbudDirvinaSyati. dvitvasAmAnya tatsaMbanDajYAneByo dvitvaguRabudDerutpadyamAnatA ityekaH kAlaH (praSasta 0 pf0 13). (2) praTama mindriyArTasaMnikarzaH. tasmAdekatvasAmAnyajYAnam. tatopekzAbudDiH. tato dvitvotpattiH. tato dvitvasAmAnyajYAnam. nasmAdvitvaguRajYAnam. tataH saMskAraH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 221 OlU0). (3) utpatsyamAnadvitvADAraRendriyasaMnikarzaH. tata ekatvaguRagata sAmAnyajYAnam. tata ekatva sAmAnya viSizwEkatvaguRasamUhAlambanarUpApecAbudDiH. tato dvitvaguRotpattiH. tatastadgatasAmAnyasya jYAnam. tatastatsAmAnyaviSizwadvitva guRajYAnam. tato dvitvaguRaviSizwa-..<BR>;p{0382}<BR>dravyajYAnam. tataH saMskAraH. itIndriyasaMnikarzamAraBya saMskAraparyantamazwO kzaRAH (vE0 u0 7. 2. 8). atra muktAvalI. praTamamapekzAbudDiH. tato dvitvotpattiH. tato viSezaRajYAnaM dvitvatvanirvikalpakAtmakam. tato dvitvatvaviSizwapratyakzamapekzAbudDinASaSca. tato dvitvanASaH iti (mu0 gu0). dvitvAderapekzAbudDinASanASyatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca dvitvamapekzA budDinASanASyam ASrayanASa viroDi guRAntarABAve guRasya svataH avinASitvAt caramajYAnavat. caramajYAnasyAdfwanASanASyatvAt iti (vE030 712. 8). idAnIM dvitvavinASaprakArAH pradaSyante. (1) ekatvatva sAmAnyajYAnasyA pekzAbudDito vinASaH. dvitvatva sAmAnyajYAnAdapekzAbudDervinASaH. dvitvatvasAmAnyajYAnasya ca dvitvaguRabudDito vinASaH. dvitvaguRabudDeSca dvitvaviSizwadravyajYAnAt. tasya ca saMskArAt vizayAntarajYAnAdvA vinASaH. iti. evam dvitvolattivinASavat tritvotpattivinASAvapyUhanIyO (vE0 u0 7. 2. 8). (2) apekzAbudDita ekatvasAmAnyajYAnasya dvitvotpattisamakAlaM nivfttiH. apekzA budDerdvityasAmAnyajYAnAdditvaguRabudDisamasamayaM nivfttiH. dvitvasyApekzA budDinivftterdravyabudDisamakAlaM nivfttiH. guRabudDerdavyabudDitaH saMskArotpattisamakAlaM nivfttiH. dravyabudDestadanantaraM saMskArAt iti (praSasta 0 pf0 13). ASrayanASAttannASo yaTA. (3) yatra dvitvADArAvayavakarma samakAlamekatvasAmAnyajYAnam. tadyaTA avayavakarmasAmAnyajYAne viBAgApekzAbudDI saMyoganASaguRotpattI dravyanASadvitvasAmAnyajYAne tatra dravyanASAdvitvanASaH sAmAnyajYAnAdapekzAbudDinASaH apekzAbudDinASasya dvitvanASasamAnakAlatvAt kAryakAraRasamAnaBAvABAvAt (vE0 u0 772. 8). (4) yadEkatvADArAvayavEH karmotpadyate tadEkattrasAmAnye jYAnamutpadyate. karmaRA cAvayavAntarAdviBAgaH kriyate. apekzAbudDeSvotpattiH. tato yasminneva kAle viBAgAt saMyogavinASastasminneva kAle dvitvamutpadyate. saMyogaviSAddravyavinASaH sAmAnyabudDeSvotpattiH. tatastasminnetra kAla ASraya vinASA dvitvavinASaH iti SoBanametadviDAnam (praSasta 0 pf0 14). apekzAbudDiviSezavizayatvaM<BR>;p{0383}<BR>dvitvamiti kecidAhuH (di0 1). yaTA samavAyABAvO dvO iti pratItivizayo dvitvam. idaM ca dvitvaM svarUpasaMbanDena padArTamAtre tizWati iti jYeyam. dvitvAdikaM svarUpaBeda eva nAtiriktam iti BUzaRamatam (vE0 u0 7. 2. 1)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

