DAtuH — 1 vAtapittakaPAstrayo DAtavaH ityAyurvedavidaH. 2 retaH ityapIti BizajaH. 3 rasAsfqyAMsamedo sTimajjASukrARi sapta DAtavaH tvakcarmAdayopi ca iti SArIrakaSAstrajYA AhuH. 4 hiraRyaM rajataM kAMsyaM tAmraM sIsakameva ca. raNgamAyasarEtyaM ca DAtavozwO prakIrtitAH.. iti vEdyaSAstrajYAH<BR>;p{0389}<BR>tAnikAScAhuH. 5 AkASAdimahABUtAni iti pOrARikAH. 6 indriyARi rUparasaganDasparSaSabdASca DAtuSabdavAcyA BavantIti SAstrAntaravida AhuH (vAca0). 7 SabdaprakftiH. [ka] yaH SabdaH svottaratfcaH SakyerTe svopasTApyasya yAdfSArTasyAnyayavoDaM prati samarTaH sa tAdfSArTe DAturucyate. yaTA vaca pipakza ityAdayo DAtavaH. atra DAtUnAm anekArTakatvam iti sarve sarvArTavAcakAH iti ca SAbdikAdInAM rAdDAntonusaMDeyaH. atra anekArTakatvaM ca vyAkaraRakoSa ityAdyaBiyukta kftatattadarTakatvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 70). sarvArTavAcakatvaM ca svapravfttinimittasamAnADikaraRa kftsnaDarmASrayavAcakatvam. DAtulakzaRaM ca kriyAvAcitve sati BvAdigaRapaWitatvam (la0 va0). pacapipakzAdayo hi SabdAH pakta pipakzitf ityAdinAmanivizwAH svottaratfjarTe kartrAdO svopasTApyAnAM pacanapAkecCAdInAmanvayaDiyaM prati praBavo BavantIti lakzaRasamanvayotra boDyaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 55 pf070). [Ka] yaH SabdaH svAnte kfccintanaM vinA subarTe yAdfSasya nijArTasyAnvayaDiyaM pratyasamarTaH sa eva tAdfSArTako DAtuH. yaTA pAkaM kuru saMpadaM paSyetyAdO. subarTepi DAtvarTasyAnvayavAdinAM prAcAM mate nedaM DAtulakzaRam. iti jYeyam. atra hi pacAdiko DAtuH svottarasya BAvakftaH GaY kvip ityAdipratyayasya pratisaMDAnadaSAyAmeva subarTakarmatyAdO svArTasya pacanAderanvayaboDamADatte na tvanyaTeti lakzaRasamanvayaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 55 pf0 70). DAtvarTaprakArakaboDaM prati DAtuprakftikapratyayajanyopasTiterhetutvAt. [ga] SAbdikAstu kriyAvAcako BvAdigaRapaWitaH SabdaviSezaH ityAhuH. atra vA ityAdyavyayAnAmapi gaRapaWitatvena DAtutvApattiH. tadvAraRAya kriyAvAcitvaviSezaRam. hirugAdyavyayAnAM kriyAvAcitvena DAtutvApattiH. tadvAraRAya gaRapaWitatvaM viSezaRaM dattam (vAca0). [Ga] BAvavacano DAtuH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 305 pARi0). DAtustriviDaH. mUlaDAtuH sOtraH pratyayAntaSceti. tatra (1) gaRapaWito DAturmUlaDAturucyate. yaTA BUpacapraBftiH. atra sUtram BUvAdayo DAtavaH (pA0<BR>;p{0390}<BR>sU0 113. 1) iti. BvAdayo dvAtriMSatiSata viDA DAtavaH (2200) iti SAbdikA vadanti. (2) sUtramAtropAtto DAtuH sOtra ityucyate. yaTA skamBujupraBftikaH. (3) svAvayavalaByArTasya boDako DAtuH pratyayAnta ityucyate. yaTA pAci pipakzA titikzA ityAdiH iti. AndolapreNKolAde lOkikasyApi sattvAccaturviDa eva DAturiti bopadeva Aha. lOkikasyApi sOtrentarBAva iti nADikyam ityanya AhuH. parasmEpaditvAtmanepadityoBayapaditvaBedenApi DAtustriviDaH. tattalakzaRaM ca yo DAtuH svopasTApyasya yAdfSArTasya yatpadopasTApye kartftvenvayaboDaM prati samarTaH sa DAtustatpadI. yaTA (1) gamaBUpraBftayaH svArTasya gatyutpattipraBftermuKye gORe vA parasmEpadArTa eva kartftvenvayaM prati praBavaH iti parasmEpadinaH. (2) saMgacCate Bavate ityAditaH saMgatiprAptyAdikartftvAvagamAt tAdfSArTe Atmanepadina eva te. (3) yajati karoti ityAdita iva yajate kurute ityAditopi yAgAdikartftvasyAvagateryAgAdyarTe yaji kfY ityAdiruBayapadI (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 5758 pf0 71). prakArAntareRApi DAturdviviDaH. sakarmakaH akarmakaSca iti. tatra sakarmako dviviDaH. ekakarmakaH dvikarmakaSca. tatrEkakarmakaSva ekakarmAnvitasvArTaboDakaH. yaTA gamyAdi rekakarmakaH. dvikarmakopi dviviDaH. dvikarmAnvitEkavyApArArTakaH dvikarmAnvitadvivyArArTakaSca. tatrAdyo duhyAdiH. dvitIyastu RijantaH iti. tatra dvikarmakatvaM tu karmadvayasAkANkzakriyAboDakatvam (kA0 vA0 pf0 2). Rijante ca DAtunEkavyApAroBiDIyate. dvitIyastu vyApAraH RicA. vyApAradvaye ca IpsitakarmaRaH prayojyakartfrUpakarmaRaSca yaTAkramamanvayaH. taTAtvaM ca gamyAdInAm iti boDyam. pacyAdInAM tu nEvam. tadyoge prayojyakartuH karmasaMjYAyA aBAvena vyApAradvaye karmadvayAnvayABAvAt iti vivekaH (vAca0). atredaM boDyam. sakarmakatva akarmakatva etaduBayaDarmaviSizwopi DAturBavati. yaTA sakarmakARAM gamyAdInAM karmaRaH kartftvavivakzayA akarmakatvamapi iti triviDopi DAturasti ityapi siDyati. akarmakastu karmAnanvita kriyArTakaH.<BR>;p{0391}<BR>PalAnavacCinnavyApAravAcakatvamakarmakatvam iti akarmakatvasya lakzaRaM boDyam. akarmakakriyAtve catvAro hetavaH hariRA darSitAH. yaTA DAtorarTAntare vftterDAtvarTenopasaMgrahAt. prasidDeravivakzAtaH karmaRokarmikA kriyA.. iti. evaM ca akarmakopi DAturhetucatuzwayADInAkarmakakriyArTatvAccaturviDaH ityalaM vistareRa (vAca0). DAtorarTaSca mataviSezezu yaTA (1) Palameva DAtorarTaH. tadanukUlakriyA tvAKyAtena kartrAdAvanuBAvyata iti maRqanamiSra Aha (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 140). (2) kriyAmAtraM (kevalaM vyApAramAtram) DAtvarTaH. PalaM tu karmapratyayena boDyate iti prAYcaH ratnakoSakftpraBftayaH AhuH (ci0 4). etanmate dvitIyAsAkANkzatumantaDAtutvaprayukta eva ca DAtUnAM sakarmakatvavyapadeSaH. na tu PalAvacCinnakriyAvAcitvaprayuktaH. jYApraBftAvavyAptatvAt iti jYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 72 pf0 93). (3) PalaM vyApAraScEtaduBayaM DAtvarTaH iti SAbdikA AhuH. atra PalatvaM ca tadDAtvarTajanyatvaprakArakapratItivizayatve sati tadDAtujanyopasTitivizayatvam tadDAtvarTatvaM vA. atra DAtvarTavyApAretiprasaNganirAsAya satyantam. gamyAdyarTavyApArajanya viBAgAdAvatiprasaNgavAraRAya viSezyadalam (vE0 sA0 da0 DAtva0 pf0 8). maYjUzAkftastu kartfpratyayasamaBivyAhAre tadDAtvarTajanyatve sati tadDAtvarTanizWaviSezyatAnirUpita prakAratAvattvam. atra janyatA cAropitA anAropitA cetyanyat. viBAgajanyasaMyogAdirUpe patatyAdyarTe viBAgasaMyogayoH PalatvavAraRAyoBayadalam. karmapratyayasamaBivyAhAre tu Palasya viSezyatvam ityAhuH (vE0 0 sA0 da0 DAtva0 pf0 8). taTAhi cEtro grAmaM gacCatItyAdO grAmanizWasaMyogAnukUlavyApArakartA cEtraH iti voDAt saMyogAtmakaPalasya vyApAranirUpitaprakAratvam. cEtreRa grAmo gamyata ityAdO tu cEtrasamavetavyApArajanyasaMyogASrayo grAmaH iti boDAt saMyogasya vyApAranirUpitaviSezyatvam iti. atra vyApAratvaM ca padAntara samaBivyAhArAprayojyasADvatvaprakArakapratItivizayatvam (vE0 sA0 da0 DAtvarTa0 pf0 8).<BR>;p{0392}<BR>PalavyApAroBayaM DAtvarTa ityatroktam PalavyApArayorDAturASraye tu tiNaH smftAH. Pale praDAnaM vyApArastiNarTastu viSezaRam.. it