karmAnvitaM tadA dvikarmakatvam. yaTA cEtroSvaM grAmaM nayatItyAdO nayatyAdeH. aSvamAmoBayanizWasaMyogajanakanayanakartA iti boDAt. atra grAmo muKyaM karma. aSvastu gORam. akaTitaM ca ityanuSAsanAt (ma0pra0 4 pf0 56) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 21) ityeke. atra vEyAkaraRA apyAhuH. avacCinnapadasya saMbanDaparatvena karmIBUtaPalasaMbanDivyApArArTakatvasya susTatvAt akarmakARAM PalArTatvAnaNgIkAreRAtitryAtyavyAsyoranavakASaH iti (vE0 sA0 da0). PalAvacCinnavilakzaRavyApAraSca. [ka] DAtUpanItaPalAnukUla sajAtIyavijAtIyavyApArapracayaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 50). [Ka] PalAnukUlatvo palakzitavilakzaRavyApAraH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 20). itTaM ca upalakzitatva vivakzaRena kfzRalaM (yavatrayamitaM suvarRam) SrapayedityatrozRIkaraRamAtre DAtorna lakzaRA. rUpAdiparAvfttyavacCinnADaHsaMtApanasya SrapaRasya bADepi tadupalakzitADaH saMtApanasya tatrAbADAt ityavaDeyam (ma0 pra0 4 pf0 56). [ga] SAbdikAstu Pala 1- nukUlo yatnasahitaH vyApAraH ityAhuH (la0 ma0). ata eva gamyAdInAM sakarmakatvamupapadyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धात्वंशः
DAtvaMSaH — (pratyayaH) [ka] sutrarTAnanvitayAdfSasvArTako yastiNanyaH pratyayaH sa tAdfSArTe DAtvaMSapratyayaH. yaTA putrIyatItyAdO kyac. pacatItyAdO subarTAnanvita kftyarTakopi tibAdirna tiNanyaH iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH. putrIyatItyatra kyajAdyarTasyecCAderna subarTenvayaH. kiMtu tiNarTe iti tatra lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 106 pf0 164). [Ka] DAtvantAvayavarUpaH pratyayaH. yaTA sanAdipratyayaH pipakzAdiDAtvantaBAgatvAdDAtvaMSapratyayo Bavati (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 106 pf0 164). DAtvaMSapratyayo dviviDaH. nAmaprakftikaH DAtuprakftika50<BR>;p{0394}<BR>ceti. tatra nAmaprakftikaH kyac kyaN ityAdiH. DAtuprakftikastusan yaN ityAdiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 107 pf0 164).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धारणम्
DAraRam — 1 [ka] dravyAntaradAnAByupagamapUrvaka paradattadravyAdAnajanyAdfzwaviSezavattvam. yaTA viprAya SataM DArayatItyAdO DAtvarTaH. atrAyaM BAvaH. fRagrahaRenADamarRanizWaH pariSoDananASyodfzwaviSepo janyate. tenEvAdfzwena fRamapariSoDya mftasya narakAdikam iti. atra DArerutta- (marRaH (pA0 sU0 1 4. 35) ityanena DanikaviprAdeH saMpradAnatA. taTA kartftvaM caturTyarTaH. tasya DAtvarTaGawakAdAnenvayaH (ga0 vyu0kA0 4 pf0 9697). [Ka] kecittu punardAnamaNgIkftya dravyagrahaRam ityAhuH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9). [ga] pARinIyAstu fRagrahaRam. yaTA gurave gAM DArayate ityAdO DArerarTaH ityAhuH. atra dattatvaM caturTyarTaH. taTA ca gurudattAM gAmfRatvena gfhRAti ityAkArastatra vAkyArTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 69 pf0 86). 2 gfhAvasTitiH. yaTA gurave gAM DArayate ityAdO iti kAlApAH. atra DfNA gfhAvasTitiH dvitIyayA tadanvitaM kartftvam caturTyAM ca tannivizwagfhAnvitaM saMbanDitvam upasTApyate. tena gokartfkAyA gurusaMbanDigfhAvasTiteranukUlavyApAravAn ityAkArako boDaH. DAtUttaraRicA vyApAraboDanAt iti BAvaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 69 pf0 86). SAbdikA api avasTitiH BaktAya DArayati mokzaM harirityAdO DArerarTaH ityAhuH. atra DfN avasTAne iti DAtorRicAvasTAnAnukUlavyApAro DArerarTaH. tadarTAvasTityASrayasaMbanDI saMpradAnam. DAreruttamarRaH iti sutrAt. taTA ca harikartfko BaktasaMpradAnako mokzakarmakAvasTityanukUlo vyApAraH iti boDaH (la0 ma0 suba0 kAra0 4 3 pf0 103). 3 prARasya pUrakarecakakumBakErniroDarUpaScittavaSIkaraRaMprARAyAmaviSezaH (sAMKyapra0 BA0 a0 3 sU0 33). yaTAH DArayettatra cAtmAnaM DAraRAM DArayanbuDaH (yAjYa0) ityAdO iti sAMKyA AhuH. deSabanDaScittasya DAraRA (pAta0 sU0 pAda 3 sU0 1) iti - yogino vadanti (gO0 vf0 4. 2. 44). nABicakrahfdayapuRqarIkanAsAgrAdAvADyAtmike<BR>;p{0395}<BR>hiraRyagarBavAsavaprajApatipraBftike bAhye vA deSe cittasya vizayAntaraparihAreRa sTirIkaraRaM DAraRA (sarva0 saM0 pf0 382 pAtaYja0). 4 DAraRA manaso Dyeye saMsTitirDyAnavadviDA (agnipu0 a0 374) iti pOrARikA AhuH. 5 jalasUcako vAyuviSezaDAraRAdyAtmako yogaBedaH iti jyotizajYA AhuH (bf0 saM0 a0 22).<BR>