धूमः
DUmaH — 1 sArdrenDanavahnijAtaH meGAYjanayojanako dravyaviSezaH. yaTA parvatatvena pakzatve vahnitvena sADyatve viSizwaDUmatvena ca hetutve parvato vahnimAn viSizwaDUmAt ityAdO parvatAdeH kAYcanamayatvaviraho na dozaH (dIDi0 2 pf0 179) ityatra. atra viSizwaDUmaSca vahniSUnyadeSAntaravfttiDUmavyaktitryAvartaka viSezaRAvacCinno DUmaH. tAdfSaviSezaRaM tu vahnimadvfttitvAdi jYeyam. yaTA vA aBraMlihAM DUmaleKAM paSyati (mu0 2) saDUmadIptAgnirucIni rejuH (BawwiH) ityAdO ca DUmaH. 2] agnimAndyasUcako vAyuviSezaH (Qekara) iti Bizajo vadanti. 3 jyotirvidastu DUmaketuH ityAhuH. 4 ulkApAtaSceti kAvyajYA vadanti (vA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

