ध्यानम्
DyAnam — [ka] cintanam. yaTA iti vijYApito rAjYA DyAnastimitalocanaH (raGu0 1. 73) ityAdI. [Ka] yogaSAstrajYAstu tatra pratyayEkatAnatA DyAnam (pAta0 pAda 3 sU0 2) (gO0 vf04. 2. 44). yaTA DyeyaH sadA sUryamaRqalamaDyavartI paramAtmA ityAdI. yaTA vA lakzmIkAntaM kamalanayanaM yogiBirDyAnagamyam ityAdO. [ga] tasmindeSe DyeyAvalambanasya pratyayasya visadfSapratyayaprahARena pravAho DyAnam. taduktam tadrUpapratyayEkAgryA saMtatiScAnyanispfhA. tadDyAnaM praTamEraNgEH zaNgirnizpAdyate taTA.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 383 pAtaYja 0). [Ga] nidiDyAsanam. yaTA AgamenAnumAnena DyAnAByAsarasena ca. triDA prakalpayetprajYAM laBate yogamuttamam.. (SrutiH) ityAdO. [Na] rAgopatirDyAnam (sAM0 sU0 3. 30) iti sAMKyA AhuH. [ca] brahmAtmacintA DyAnaM syAt iti vedAntinaH. [Ca] mAyAvAdivedAntinastu brahmavAsmIti sadvfttyA nirAlambatayA sTitiH. DyAnaSabdena. viKyAtA paramAnandadAyinI.. iti manyante.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0396" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वंसः
DvaMsaH — (aBAvaH) [ka] vinazwaH iti pratItisAkzika utpattimAnaBAvaH (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 11) (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 40) (vAkya 0 pf0 23). sa ca pratiyogijanyaH pratiyogisamavAyini deSe vartate ((ta0 dI0 1 pf0 40). sa ca kAryasyotpattyanantaramutpadyate nityaSca iti jYeyam. atra gamakam. DvaMso na vinASI vinASakalpanAyAM mAnABAvAt. nahi vinASo vinazwaH iti kaScitpratyeti iti 1. (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 11) (nIla0 1 pf0 10). tallakzaRaM - ca DvaMsatvameva. tacca janyABAvatvam (mu0 1). aTavA utpattimattve satyaBAvatvam (vAkya 0 pf0 23). DvaMsatvaM ca aBAvatvavyApyoKaRqopADiH (ma0pra0 pf0 12) iti navyanEyAyikAH prAhuH (vAca0). ayaM BAvaH. janyatvasya prAyeRa durjYAnatvAt tasyAKaRqopADirUpatvamaNgIkartavyam iti. [Ka] sAdiranantaH (ta0 saM0). utpattimattve sati nASaSUnya ityarTaH. yaTA Gawo naSyatItyAdO DAtvarTaH.<BR>;p{0397}<BR>[ga] utpatteranantaraM samavAyikAraRe kAryasya saMsargABAvaH (ta0 kO0 pf0 21). tadarTaSca yaTA iha kapAle Gawo DvastaH ityAdI utpatteranantaram (pratiyogiBUtasya GawAderutpatteranantaram) janyaH samavAyikAraRe (Gawasya samavAyikAraRe kapAle) vartamAnaH kAryasya (GawAdeH) saMsargABAvaH (tadAKyaH aBAvaH) iti. atrAyaM niyamaH DvaMsaprAgaBAvO svapratiyogisamavAyideSe vartete iti. yaTA iha kapAle Gawo DvastaH iti pratItisAkzikaH aBAvaH (pra0 pra0 pf0 23). yaTA vA tadapyaDvaMsadAsAdya mAhendraM lakzmaReritam ityatra prARA daDvaMsire gAtraM tastamBe ca priye hate (BawwiH) ityAdO ca. atra vEyAkaraRAH DvaMsasyAtItatvABAvepi PalavyApArayorDAtvarTatvena tadutpattyanukUlavyApArasya kAraRa viSezasaMyogasyAtItatvAt DvastaH iti vyavahAra upapadyate ityAhuH. nEyAyikamate nASamAtrasyEva DAtvarTatvepi tadutpattO lakzaRA. tasyAScAtItatvAdinEva DvastaH DvaMsate ityAdiprayogaH. atra kartftvaM pratiyogitvam. tacca nASAntrayi iti. taTA ca vartamAnAdyutpattikanASapratiyogI GawaH ityanvayaboDaH (vAca0). atItAvasTA DvaMsaH iti sAMKyA AhuH. tiroBAvAvasTA iti SAbdikAH sAMKyAScAhuH (la0 sa0). atra sUtram nASaH kAraRAlayaH iti (sAMKya0 a0 1 sU0 121). kAraRe laya ityarTaH. AtyantikanASaSca kAraRena saha nASa iti BedaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0396" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वनिः
DvaniH — (SabdaH) 1 tAratvAdiDIhetuH SabdaviSezaH. yaTA unmadaDvaniBftA niBftAkzaramujjage (mAGa 0 sa0 6 Slo0 20) ityAdO. atrocyate. DvanirnAma yo dUrAdAkarRayato varRaviSezamanaDigacCataH karRapaTamavatarati pratyAsIdataSca tAratvAdiviSezamavagamayati iti (SArIra0) (vAca0). sa ca DvanirvEyAkaraRamate dviviDaH. prAkftaH vEkftaSceti. atroktam BartfhariRA sPowasya grahaRe hetuH prAkfto Dvanirizyate. sTitiBede nimittattraM vEkftaH pratipadyate.. (vAkyapa0) iti. atra vivekaH. sPowasyABivyaktO prAkftasya DvaneH kAraRatvam. ciraciratarakAlasTitO tu prAkftaDvanijAtavEkftaDvaneH kAraRatvam iti (SabdArTaratne) (vAca0).<BR>;p{0398}<BR>SAradAtilake ca tasya DvanerutpattyAdiprakArAdikamuktam. yaTA sAM - prasUte kuRqalinI SabdabrahmamayI viBuH. Sakti tato DvanistasmAnnAdastasmAnniroDikA. tatorDendustato bindustasmAdAsItparA tataH. paSyantI - maDyamA vAcAM vEKarI jYAnajanmaBUH.. (SAradAti 0) iti. atrAyaM viSezaH. anekavarRAtmakasya kalaSAdipadasya SrAvaRapratyakzaM na saMBavati. ASuvinASinAM kramikARAM varRAnAM melakABAvena tanmelanAtmanaH padasya grahItumaSakyatvAt. pUrvapUrvavarRAnuBavajanita saMskAra sa hitenAnuBUyamAna- . caramavarRena Srotre vyaYjanAKyo vyApAraH (SAbdikAdimatena) janyate. tenEva vyApAreRa nazwavarRaGawitamapi padaM (vEyAkaraRamate sPowapariBAzitaM padam) SrotreRa sAkzAtkriyate iti. caramavarRAtmani Sabde DvanivyavahAraH. iti maheSvaraH (bAca0). 2 uttamaM kAvyaM DvaniH. ityAlaMkArikA AhuH (pratAparudre0 pra0 2). atroktaM mammawaBawwena idamuttamamatiSayini. vyaNgaTe vAcyAd DvanirbuDEH kaTitaH (kAvyapra0 u0 1 0 5) iti. na<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

न
na — 1 aBAvaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 14). sa ca saMsargABAva anyonyABAva etadanyatarAtmakaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 12). yaTA 1 (BUtale Gawo nAsti (dIDi0) GawaH pawo na Bavati ityAdO. yaTA vA nEkaH sutezu jAgfyAt ityAdO nizeDaH. BUtala ityatra saptamyA vfttitvamarTaH. tasya ca naYarTAtyantABAvenvayaH. evaM ca BUtalavfttirGawatvAvacCinnapratiyogitAkotyantABAvaH iti boDaH. kecittu BUtala- [(vfttiryotyantABAvaH tatpratiyogI GawaH iti boDaH ityAhuH. anye tu saptamyA nirUpitatvam asaDAtorvidyamAnatvam AKyAtasyASrayatvam arTaH. AUM taTA ca BUtalanirUpita vidyamAnatvASrayo GawABAvaH iti boDaH ityAhuH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 61) (ga0 vyu0 1) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 15). GawaH pawo netyatra GawaH pawaBedavAn Bavati iti boDaH.. nanarTo dviviDaH prasajyapratizeDaH paryudAsaSceti (ma0pra0 pf0 48).<BR>;p{0399}<BR>2 upamA. yaTA tizWA devo na savitA (SrutiH) vayo na vasatIrupa (f0 saM0 125) ityAdO. 3 nakArasvarUpo varRaH. yaTA do Da sOKyaM mudaM naH (bf0 va0 wI0) ityAdO (vAca0). atra kecita atyantABAva eva naYaH SaktiH. anyonyABAvAdO tu lakzaRA ityAhuH (SA0 BA0) (vAca0). atredamavaDeyam. na GawaH pawa ityAdO nAmArTayorBedenAnvayaboDaH avyutpannaH iti vyutpattiviroDApattivAraRAya aGawaH pawa ityAdO samAnaviBaktikatvenABedAnvayaboDopapattaye ca noBAvavati lakzaRA Gawapadasya ca Gawapratiyogike lakzaRA svIkAryA iti kecit. pare tu nAmArTayoH iti vyutpattO avyaya nipAta etadatirikteti nAmni viSezaRAnnaYaH aBAvavati Gawapadasya Gawapratiyogike ca na lakzaRANgIkAryA. kiMtu naYaH saMsargABAvamAtre anyonyABAvamAtre ca Saktireva iti prAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 1415) (ta0 pra0 Ka04 pf0 6061). anye tu nAmArTayoH iti vyutpattirnAByupagantavyA. BUtalaM GawaH rAjA puruzaH ityatra ADeyatA saMbanDena svatvasaMbanDena ca GawapuruzapadArTayorBUtalarAjapadArTAnvayaboDatAtparyeRa tAdfSaprayogApattivAraRAya yaTAkramaM saptamyanta BUtalAdisamaBivyAhArazazWyantarAjAdipadasamaBivyAhArayoH pUrvoktAnvayaboDaM prati kAraRatvamaNgIkartavyam. evaM ca pUrvoktasTalayoH na GawaH pawaH, aGawaH pawaH ityAdyoH nanpadAdO na lakzaRA ityAhuH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 1). anyatra ca nanarTAH zaquktAH. sAdfSyaM tadaBAvaSca tadanyatvaM tadalpatA. aprASastyaM viroDaSca nanarTAH zaw prakIrtitAH.. iti. atra yaTAkramamudAharaRAni. yaTA anikzuH Sara ityAdO sAdfSyaM namarTaH. BUtale Gawo nAstItyAdAvatyantABAvaH. aGawaH pawa ityAdAvanyatvam. anudaramudaraM taruRyA ityAdO svalpatvam. abrAhmaRo vArDuzika ityAdAvapakfzwatvam (aprASastyam). asuro dEtya ityAdI viroDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 39 pf0 50). anyatra coktam naYaBAve nizeDena svarUpArTepyatikrame. IzadarTe ca sAdfSye tadvirudDatadanyayoH.. iti. nizevena kAkA svarUpArTe prakftArTe ityarTaH. etA-.<BR>;p{0400}<BR>dfSArTasvIkAreRa ca aBAvena na pOnaruktyam iti Dyeyam (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

