naYtatpuruzaH — (tatpuruzaH) naYarTavoDakatayA naYpadaGawitaH samAsaH. yaTA aGawaH pawa ityAdI. atra GawapadaM lakzaRayA GawasaMvanDyarTakam. Gawapratiyogikam ityarTakam iti yAvat. naYpadaM ca anyonyABAve Saktameva (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 14). evaM ca GawapratiyogikaBedavAn pawaH iti vAkyArTavoDaH. aGawaM BUtalamityAdO naYo GawaBinne lakzaRA. na kalaYjaM BakzayedityAdO balavadanizwajanake lakzaRA (tarkA 0 4 pf012).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

