नपुंसकलिङ्गम्
napuMsakaliNgam — (nAma) napuMsakatvena pariBAzitaM padam. yaTA tawamityAdi. pariBAzAyAH prayojanaM ceha padasaMskAraH. sotra tawamityAdO klIbatvena subAderamAdeSAdiH iti. vEyAkaraRAstu tawAdivastugataM napuMsakatvaM padArTAntarameva. tacca tawAdirUpaprakftyEva boDyate. pratyayAnAM tu vyaYjakatvamAtram ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 53 pf0 68). kacit vilakzaRasaMsTAnarUpaviSizwavAcakam. yaTA na prARi prApnuyAddAyam ityAdO. atra luptasupEva (na tu prakftyA) upasTitaM vilakzaRasaMsTAnarUpaM napuMsakatvaM prARinyanuBUyate iti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 53 pf0 69).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमः
namaH — 1 tyAgaH. yaTA ezorDyaH SivAya namaH ityAdO namaH SabdArTastyAgaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 99). SAbdikAstu svasvatvanivfttyanukUlo vyApAraH. yaTA ezorGyaH SivAya namaH ityAdO tyAgo namaH SabdArTaH ityAhuH. SAbdikamatetra uddeSyatvaM caturTyarTaH. taTA ca SivoddeSyakatyAgavizayorDyaH iti SAbdaboDaH (la0 ma0 kA0 4 pf0 105). anye tu mantrakaraRakastyAgorTaH. yaTA puzpamidaM vizRave namaH ityAdO. atra prItyuddeSyakatvam tadicCADInatvarUpaM namaHpadArTe matrakaraRakatyAge 4 (caturTyAM boDyate. prakftyarTasya vizRvAdeH prItO tadicCAyAM vAnvayaH. 5 evaM ca vizRUddeSyamantrakaraRakatyAgasya karmedaM puzpam iti boDaH. brAhmaRoddeSyakasya ca gavAdityAgasya mantrakaraRakatve pramARABAvAt - gOrbrAhmaRAya namaH ityAdiko na prayogaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 51<BR>;p{0402}<BR>pf0 126). 2 namaskAraH. yaTA haraye nama ityAdO (la0 ma0 kA0 4 pf0 105) (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 4 pf0 99). 3 antam. 4 vajram. 5 yajYaH. yaTA yajYo vE namaH (SrutiH) ityAdO (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नमस्कारः
namaskAraH — [ka] yamuddiSya yasya svApakarzaboDanAnukUlavyApAraviSezaH tasya sa namaskAraH (ci0 maNga0 1 pf0 103) (ma0 pra0 2). svApakarzaboDAnukUlaH vilakzaRaH svIyavyApAraH iti paramArTaH. atra svamuccArayitA (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 4 pf0 101) (rAma0). yaTA devatAstutinamaskArAdizu maNgalavyavahAraH SizwAnAm ityAdO (mU0 ma0 maNga0 1 pf0 101). yaTA vA haraye namaH ityAdO namaskAraH. atra namaH svastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 16) ityanena caturTI jYeyA (la0 ma0 suba0 kAra0 4 pf0 105). namaskAratvaM ca svApakarzaboDajanakatAvacCedakajAtimattvam (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 104). aTavA mAnasatvavyApyajAtiviSezaH (ma0 vA0 pf0 10). jYAnaviSezo vA. sa ca viSezo vyavahArasAkziko jAtiBeda eva. kAyikAdyanyatamatvaM vA (nyA0 dI0 pf0 3). namaskAraBedASca kAlIpurARe uktAH. yaTA trikoRamaTa zawkoRamarDacandraM pradakziRam. daRqamazwANgamugraM ca saptaDA natilakzaRam.. iti (vAca0). [Ka] svApakarzaboDanAnukUlaH svIyavyApAraH. yaTA haraye nama ityAdO namaH padArTaH. atra svamuccArayitA. avaDitvam avaDimattvaM vA caturTyarTaH. tasya namaskArapadArTaGawakepakarzenvayaH. taTA ca cEtrAdyuccAritAt namo haraye ityAdiSabdAt haryavaDikacEtrApakarzaboDAnukUlaScEtrIyavyApAraH ityAkArako boDaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 101). svApakarzaboDAnukUlavyApAre ca kAyikavAcikamAnasarUpe viSezo jAtiviSeza evAnuBavasAkzikaH (ci0 1 pf0 103). yaTA vA brAhmaReByo namo nityamityAdO. atra vizayatvaM caturTyAM boDyate (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 126). yaTA vA namaskaroti namaskftya 7. ityAdO. atra SAbdikA AhuH. atra kfDAtoreva namanArTakatA.<BR>;p{0403}<BR>ma0 kAra0 4 namaH Sabdastu tadarTadyotakaH. tena nArAyaRaM namaskftyetyAdO dvitIyA. upapadaviBakteH kArakaviBaktirbalIyasI iti nyAyAt. namaso vAcakatve namaskftya brAhmaReByaH ityevaM namaH Sabdaprayoge caturTI syAt. namaH svastisvAhA svaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 16) ityatra tyAgArTakanamanArTakayoruBayorgrahaRam (Sabdendu0) (la0 pf0 105106). [ga] apakfzwatvavoDanAnukUlo vyApAraH. yaTA haraye nama ityAdO. atrApakarzaH prayoktfrUpaviSezanizWo namaskAryAvaDika eva pratIyate. vyApAraSca prayoktfnizWaH. sa ca vyApAraH karaSiraHsaMyogAdiH IdfSaSabdaprayogaSca. caturTyarTa uddeSyatvam. evaM ca haryuddeSyaka uktavyApAraH iti boDaH (la0 ma0 kA 0 4 pf0 105). Ga] ayaM matta utkfzwaH ahamasmAdapakfzwaH iti jYAnaviSezaH iti pare vadanti (0 0 1 pf0 3) (ma0 vA0 pf0 10). namaskArastriviDaH. kAyikaH vAcikaH mAnasikaSca (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 103). kAyakAdilakzaRAni ca yoginI0 ganDarvata uktAni. yaTA - jAnuByAmavanIM gatvA saMspfSya SirasA kzitim. kriyate yo namaskAraH procyate kAyikastu saH.. yA svayaM gadyapadyAByAM GawitAByAM namaskftiH. kriyate Baktiyuktena vAcikastUttamaH smftaH.. izwamaDyAnizwagatErmanoBistriviDaM Bavet. namanaM mAnasaM proktamuttamADamamaDyamam.. ityAdi (ganDarvatantra 0) (vAca0). namaskAraH prakArAntareRa dviviDaH. kvacit EhikaH kvacit kAryAdO AmuzmikaH (nyA0 dI0 pf0 4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नयः
