नाम
nAma — (avyayam) 1 saMjYA. yaTA suraTo nAma rAjetyatra nAmaSabdArTaH saMjYA. suraTo nAma rAjA ityatra suraTaH suraTaSabdavAcyaH. tadekadeSe ca Sabde saMjYArTakanAmetyavyayena prAptasaMjYAtAdAtmyAnvayaH. tena saMjYAtAdAtmyavatsuraTaSabdavAcyo rAjA ityarTaH. evam nAmnA candramuKItyAdAvanavyayenApi nAmapadenoktadiSEvAnvayo drazwavyaH. atra kaScidAha suraTo nAma rAjetyatra saMBAvyatvaM nAmaSabdArTaH. tacca suraTenvitam iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 92 pf0 124). 2 kopaH. yaTA mamApi nAma daSAnanasya parEraBiBavaH ityAdO. 3 upagamaH. sAsUyoNgIkAraH. yaTA evaM nAmAstu ityAdO. 4 prAkASyam. yaTA himAlayo nAma nagADirAjaH ityAdO. atra himAlayaH prAkASyenAtiprasidDaH ityarTaH (vAca0). 5 saMBAvanA. yaTA iha nAma sItA Bavizyati ityAdO. 6 kutsanam. yaTA ko nAmAyaM saviturudaye svApamevaM viDatte ityAdO. 7 vismayaH. yaTA anDo nAma girimArohati ityAdO. 8 alIkam. yaTA ahaM ca BIto nAmAvalutaH (SAkunta 0) ityAdO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाम
nAma — (ayaM nAman iti nakArAnto napuMsakaliNgaH SabdaH) 1 [ka] yAdfSaSabdena svopasTApyayadarTamuKyaviSezyakAnvayaboDArTaM svottarapraTamAviBaktirapekzyate tAdfSaH Sabda eva tadarTakaM nAma. yaTA GawAdayo hi SabdAH praTamAntatvena niScitA eva svArTamuKyaviSezyakaM boDamutpAdayanti na tvanyaTA (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 14 pf0 15). atrArTe nAmaSabdasya vyutpattilakzaRe ucyete. tatra vyutpattiH namati AKyAtATaM prati svArTaviSezaRatvena iti nAma. lakzaRaM tu sattvapraDAnAni nAmAni iti (nirukta0). tadarTaSca liNgasaMKyayoratra sadBAva iti sattvaM dravyam. taTA lakzaRopapatteH. tadyezu praDAnaM guRaBUtA kriyA nAmAnyeva tAni.<BR>;p{0407}<BR>namantyAKyAtaSabde guRaBAvena namanti vA svamarTamAKyAtaSabdavAcye guRaBAveneti nAmAni. taTA coktam SabdenoccAriteneha yena dravyaM pratIyate. tadakzaraviDO yuktaM nAmetyAhurmanIziRaH.. iti (nirukte nEGaRwuka0 pUrvazaNke a0 1 pA0 1 0 1 durgAcAryakftawIkA). [Ka] prAtipadikarUpaH SabdaviSezaH. yaTA GawostItyatra GawaSabdaH iti pARinIyA AhuH. [ga] pOrARikAstu vAcakaSabdaH. yaTA harernAma harernAma harernAmEva kevalam. kalO nAstyeva nAstyeva nAstyeva gatiranyaTA.. ityAdI ityAhuH. nAma caturviDam. rUQam lakzakam yogarUQam yOgikaM ceti. kecittu rUQayOgikamapyaDikaM paYcamaM nAma svIkurvanti. yaTA maRqapamahArajatAdi. tadDi kadAcidavayavavfttyA yogArTameva kadAcicca samudAyaSaktyA rUQyarTamevABiDatte ityaparezAM matam (Sa0 pra0 Slo015 pf0 16). pataYjalistu paYcaviDaM nAma ityAha. tatra praTamam supAM maDya ekavacanamAtra sAkANkzam. yaTA ekaviMSati ityAdipadam. dvitIyam dvivacanamAtrasAkANkzam. yaTA uBa dvi puzpavat puzpavanta ityAdipadam. tftIyam bahuvacanamAtrasAkANkzam. yaTA prARa tricatur ityAdi padam katipadaM ca. caturTam dvivacanamAtranirAkANkzam. yaTA uBaya iti padam. pacamam vacanatrayasAkANkzam. yaTA Gawa pawa ityAdipadam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 54 pf0 6970). prakArAntareRa nAma paYcaviDam uRAdyantaM kfdantaM ca tadDitAntaM samAsajam. SabdAnukaraRaM cEva nAma pacaviDaM smftam.. iti (vAca0). nAma SabdasaMskArasidDyarTaM triDA Bidyate strIliNgam puMliNga