niHSreyasam — 1 [ka] janmamaraRaprabanDocCedaH sarvaduHKaprahARam. niHSreyasaM ca SAstraSravaRAnantaraM padArTatattvajYAnenAtmasAkzAtkArAnantaramaprArabDakarmaRAM jYAnAtprArabDakarmaRAM BogAcca kzaye utpadyata iti boDyam. (sUtrakAreRApyetadeva pradarSitam duHKajanmapravfttidozamiTyAjYAnAnAmuttarotta- (rApAye tadanantarApAyAdapavargaH (gO0 1. 1. 2) iti. ayamASayaH. yadA tu tattvajYAnAnmiTyAjYAnamapEti tadA miTyAjYAnApAye dozA apayAnti. dozApAye pravfttirapEti. pravfttyapAye janmApEti. janmApAye duHKamapEti. duHKA52<BR>;p{0410}<BR>pAye cAtyantikopavargo niHSreyasam iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 2). idamaMtrAkUtam. yogabalenAtmatattvasAkzAtkAre sati tena ca savAsanamiTyAjYAne Dvaste tannibanDanAnAM rAgadvezamohAnAM dozARAmapAyAtpravftterapAye tannibanDanasya janmanaH apAye tannibanDanasya duHKasyApAya iti tAvadvastugatiH (vE0 u0 5. 2. 18). dravyAdizaRRAM padArTAnAM sADarmyavEDarmyAByAM tattvajYAnaM niHSreyasahetuH (praSasta0 pf0 1). [Ka] SAntaH KalvayaM sarvaviprayogaH sarvoparamopatrargaH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 2). [ga] tadaBAve saMyogABAvoprAdurBAvaSca mokzaH (vE05. 2. 18). asyAyamarTaH. tadaBAve tasyAdfzwasyABAve sati. prArabDetarAdfzwAnAmAtmasAkzAtkAreRa prArabDAnAM ca Bogena kzaye satIti yAvat. saMyogABAvaH dehapravAhasaMbanDasya vicCedaH. tadanantaraM cAprAdurBAvaH arTAdduHKasyAnutpattiH. deharUpasyAdfzwasya ca kAraRasya virahAt. ataH tadAnImeva mokzopavargaH saMBavatIti nApavargasya SaSa- 1 vizARasamAnatA iti BAvaH (vE0 vi0 5. 2. 18). [Ga] aSezaviSezaguRaDvaMsAvaDikaduHKaprAgaBAvaH (vE0qa0 1. 1. 4). [Na] AtyantikI duHKanivfttiH (vE0 u0 1. 1. 4) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 2) (sarva0 pf0 246 akza0) (di0 1) (ta0 dI 0) (ta0 kO0). atrAtyantikatvaM ca svasamAnADikaraRaduHKaprAgaBAvAsamAnakAlInatvam. yugapadutpannasamAnADikaraRasarvAtmaviSezaguRaDvaMsa samAnakAlInatvaM vA (vE0 u0 1. 1. 4). aTavA svasamAnADikaraRaduHKAsamAnakAlInatvam (di0 1) (ta0 dI 0). atra saMsArakAlInasya duHKaDvaMsasya mokzatvavAraRAyaH kAlInAntatvaM duHKa nivfttiviSezaRam. asmadIyaduHKasamAnakAlInaSukamokze avyAptivAraRAya svasamAnADikaraReti duHKaviSezaRaM boDyam (ta0 kO0 pf0 22) (ma0pra0 1 pf0 4). yadvA nirvartyasajAtIyasya duHKasya punastatrAnutpAdaH (sarva0 pf0 246 akza0). [ca] svasamAnADikaraRaduHKAsamAnakAlInaduHKaDvaMsaH (ta0 pra0) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 22) (ma0pra0 14) (ta0 kO0 pf0 22). atra duHKaDvaMso duHKAnutpattiH ityarTaH iti vESezikAH (ta0 va0).<BR>;p{0411}<BR>[Ca] ekaviMSatiBedaBinnasya duHKasyAtyantikI nivfttiH (ta0 BA0 prameya0 pf0 41). ekaviMSatiBedAstu SarIram zaqindriyARi zaqvizayAH zaqviDAni pratyakzajYAnAni suKaM duHKaM ceti. SarIrAdInAM duHKasADanatvAduHKatvam. suKasya ca duHKasaMbanDAdduHKatvam. atra vArtikakArA AhuH. SreyaH punaH suKam ahitanivfttiSca. tacCreyo BidyamAnaM dveDA vyavatizWate dfzwAdfzwaBedena. dfzwaM suKam. adfzwamahitanivfttiH. ahita- . nivfttirapyAtyantikI anAtyantikI ca. anAtyantikI kaRwakAderduHKasADanasya parihAreRa. AtyantikI punarekaviMSatiBedaBinnaduHKahAnyA. tasya hAnirDarmADarmasADanaparityAgena. anutpannayorDarmADarmayoranutpAdena utpannayoScopaBogAtprakzayeRa iti (nyA0 vA0 pf0 2) (ta0 BA0 prameya0 pf0 41). [ja] Atyantiko duHKABAvaH (nyA0 vA0 pf0 4). [Ja] ahitanivfttirAtyantikI (nyA0 ka0 pf0 4). tasyAH sadBAve pramARam duHKasaMtatirDarmiRyatyantamucCidyate saMtatitvAddIpasaMtativat ityanumAnam iti tArkikA AhuH (nyA0 ka0 pf0 4). [Ya] nityaniratiSayasuKABivyaktiH iti dIDitikfdAha (la0 ma0). [wa] caramaduHKaDvaMsaH (ta0 dI0). yaTA tattvajYAnAnniHSreyasADigamaH (gO0 1. 1. 1) ityAdO hiraRyagarBarudrAdiyogyajIvAnAM mokzaH. dravyaguRakarmasAmAnyaviSezasamavAyAnAM padArTAnAM sADarmyavEDamrmyAByAM tattvajYAnaM niHSreyasahetuH (praSasta 0 1. 1 pf0 5). atra padArTatattvajYAnasyAtmatattvajYAnadvArA niHSreyasaM prati sADanatvamucyate (ta0 kO0 pf0 21). atra vipratipattiH. karmajYAnayostulyavatsamuccayenApavargakAraRatvamityeke. tattvajYAnadvArA karmaRAM tatra kAraRatvam. taTA ca na tulyavatsamuccaya ityAcAryAH. tatra samuccayapratipAdikA SrutiH vidyAM cAvidyAM (karma) ca yastadvedoBayaM saha. avidyayA mftyuM tIrtvA vidyayAmftamaSrute (ISA0) iti. AcAryamate tu SrutiH tamevaM viditvAti mftyumeti nAnyaH panTA vidyateyanAya iti (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 24). tadidaM tattvajYAnaM niHSreyasADigamaSca yaTAvidyaM veditavyamiti. sarvAsu vidyAsu catasfzu tattvajYAnamasti<BR>;p{0412}<BR>niHSreyasADigamaSca. taTA hi (1) trayyAM tAvat tattvajYAnam agnihotrAdisADanAnAM yATArTyena parijYAnam. niHSreyasADigamopi svargaprAptiH. (2) vArtAyAM tu BUmyAdiparijYAnaM tattvajYAnam. kfzyAdyaDigamaSca niHSreyasam. (3) daRqanItyAm sAmadAnadaRqaBedAnAM yaTA - kAlaM yaTAdeSaM yaTASakti viniyogastattvajYAnam. niHSreyasaM pfTivIjayaH iti. (4) iha tu aDyAtmavidyAyAm (AnvIkzikyAm) AtmajYAnaM tattvajYAnam. niHSreyasADigamopavargaprAptiH iti (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 23). niHSreyasaM tAvahniviDam. param aparaM ca. tatrAparam jIvanmuktilakzaRaM tattvajYAnAnantarameva. tadapyavaDAritAtmatattvasya nErantaryA ByAsApahftamiTyAjYAnasya prArabDaM karmopaBuYjAnasya. paraM niHSreyasaM tu krameRa Bavati (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1). uBayaviDiniHSreyasa sADAraRalakzaRaM tu savAsanamiTyAjYAnaDvaMsatvam. tattvasAkzAtkAraprAgaBAvavirahatvaM vA. aTavA yogajaDarmaprAgaBAvavirahatvam (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 29). jIvanmuktO coktam jIvanneva hi vidvAn saMharzAyA- -: sAByAM vimucyate iti (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 24). paraniHSreyasa - 1 prAptO kramastAvat tattvajYAnena miTyAjYAnanASaH. miTyAjYAnanASe dozanASaH. dozanASe pravfttinASaH. pravfttinASe janmanASaH. janmanASe duHKanASaH iti (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 2). vArtikakArAstu niHSreyasaM punardfzwAdfzwaBedAt dveDA Bavati. tatra pramARAdipadArTatattvajYAnAnniHSreyasaM dfzwam. nahi kaScitpadArTo jYAyamAno hAnopAdAnopekzAbudDinimittaM na BavatIti. evaM ca kftvA sarve padArTA jYeyatayA apekzyanta iti. paraMtu niHSreyasamadfzwam AtmAdestattvajYAnAdBavati. dfzwam pramARAdiparijYAnAt adfzwaM punarAtmAdeH prameyasya parijYAnAditi ityAhuH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 12). idAnIM mataBedena niHSreyasaBedA ucyante. * svAtatryaM mftyurvA mokzaH iti cArvAkA AhuH. AtmocCedo mokzaH iti mADyamikAH. DarminivfttO nirmalajYAnodayo mahodayaH iti vijYAna- - vAdinaH. AvaraRamuktirmuktiH ityArhatAH. brahmAMSikajIvasyAvidyApraBavamiTyAjYAnanivfttO svasvarUpADigamaH iti mAyAvAdinaH advEtinaH<BR>;p{0413}<BR>SAMkaramatAnuyAyinaH. AnandamayaparamAtmani jIvAtmalayo muktiH iti : tridaRqinaH. tatra layaSca liNgaSarIrApagamaH. liNgaSarIraM ca ekAdaSendriyARi paYca mahABUtAni sUkzmamAtrayAvasTitAni jIvAtmasuKaduHKAvacCedakAni (ki0 va0 pf0 9). ekAdaSendriyapaYcaBUtarUpasya liNgaSarIrasya jIvAtmanyapagamo viSlezaH. sa eva pare brahmaRi jIvasya laya ityucyate (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 26). jIvasya liNgaSarIrApagamo mokzaH iti BAskarIyAH. sarvakartftvamekaM vihAya vAsudevasya sarvajYatvAdInAM kalyARaguRAnAmAptimattve sati BagavadyATAtmyAnuBavo mokzaH iti viSizwAdvEtavAdino rAmAnujIyAH. jagatkartftvalakzmIpatitvaSrIvatsavaje BagavajjYAnAyatta nirduHKapUrRasuKaM mokzaH iti dvEtavAdino mADvAH. atra SrutiH AnandaM brahmaRo rUpaM tacca mokze pratizWitam iti (ma0pra0 4). sa ca mokzastanmate sArUpyasAlokyasAmIpyasAyujya BedAccaturviDaH.. dviBujakfzRena saha svAMSaBUtAnAM jIvAnAM goloke lIlAnuBavaH iti SudDAdvEtavAdino vallaBIyAH. pAramESvaryaprAptiH iti pASupataSAstrajYA nakulISAcAryAdayo mAheSvarAH. candracUqavapuzaH sataH pArvatyAliNganam iti kApAlikAH. pUrRAtmatAlABaH iti pratyaBijYAvAdinoBinavaguptAcAryAH. pAradarasapAnena dehasTErye jIvanmuktireva mokzaH iti raseSvaravAdino govindaBagavatpAdAcAryAdayaH. AtyantikI duHKanivfttiH iti gOtamIyA nEyAyikAH. AtyantikaduritanivfttiH iti nyAyEkadeSinaH. duHKAtyantABAva eva muktiH iti prAYcaH. duHKanivfttiH (duHKAnutpAdaH) iti kaRAdAdayo vESezikAH. svargAdiH iti mImAMsakAH. tatra duHKasADanaSarIranASe nityaniratiSayasuKABivyaktirmuktiH iti tadekadeSino BawwasarvajYAdayastOtAtikAH. tatrApi nityasuKasAkzAtkAraH iti BawwAH. AtyantikaduHKaprAgaBAvaparipAlanaM mokzaH iti prABAkarAH. parA paSyantI maDyamA vEKarI iti vARIcatuzwaye praTamAyAH parAKyAya. brahmarUpAyA vARyA darSanam iti pARinIyAH. prakftyuparame (prakfti- :: tadvikAropaDAnAdvilaye) puruzasya svarUpeRAvasTAnam ahaMkAranivfttAbOdAsInyam AtyantikaduHKatrayavigamo vA muktiH iti sAMKyAH.<BR>;p{0414}<BR>pu