निगमनम्
nigamanam — (nyAyAvayavaH) [ka] hetvapadeSAtpratijYAyAH punarvacanaM nigamanam (gO0 1. 1. 39). tadarTaSca hetoH vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmasya<BR>;p{0415}<BR>apadeSaH kaTanam. pratijYAyAH pratijYArTasya sADyaviSizwapakzasya vacanam iti (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 39). sADarmyakte vEDarmyakte vA yaTodAharaRamupasaMhriyate tasmAdutpattiDarmakatvAdanityaH SabdaH iti nigamanam. nigamyanteneneti pratijYAhetUdAharaRopanayA ekatra iti nigamanam. nigamyante samarTyante saMbaDyante. tatra sADarmyakte tAvadDetO vAkyam anityaH SabdaH iti pratijYA. utpattiDarmakatvAt iti hetuH. utpattiDarmakaM sTAlyAdi dravyamanityaM dfzwam ityudAharaRam. taTA cotpattiDarmakaH SabdaH ityupanayaH. tasmAdutpattiDarmakatvAdanityaH SabdaH iti nigamanam. vEDarmyaktepi anityaH SabdaH utpattiDarmakatvAt anutpattiDarmakamAtmAdi dravyaM nityaM dfzwam. na ca taTA anutpattiDarmakaH SabdaH. tasmAdutpattiDarmakatvAdanityaH SabdaH iti. sarvezAmekArTapratipattO sAmarTyapradarSanaM nigamanam iti (vAtsyA’ 1. 1. 39). [Ka] vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmahetukaTanapUrvakasADyaviSizwapakza pradarSakaH vyAptapakzaDarmahetujYApyasADyaviSizwapakzaboDakaH tAdfSasADyaboDako vA nyAyAvayavaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 39). [ga] anumiti hetuliNga parAmarSaprayojakaSAbdajYAnakAraRavyAptipakzaDarmatADIprayuktasADyaDIjanakaM vAkyam (ci0 ava0 2 pf0 82). [Ga] pakze sADyopasaMhAraH (ta0 BA0 pf0 43). [Na] hetusADyavattayA pakzapratipAdakaM vacanam (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 22). hetujYAnajYApyatvaviSizwasADyavadvizayakaboDajanakavAkyamityarTaH (nIla0 2 pf0 22). [ca] pakze sADyasyAbADitatvapratipAdakaM vacanam (si0 ca0 2 pf0 25). [Ca] abADitatvAsatpratipakzitatvatAtparyakaM vAkyam (ta0 kO0 2 pf0 13). [ja] liNgasaMbanDaprayuktaniScitasADyavatttravacanam. yaTA parvatapakzakavahnisADyakaDUma hetukasTale parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO tasmAdagnimAniti tasmAttaTeti vA vAkyaM nigamanam (ta0 BA0 pf0 43) (ta0 kO0 2 pf0 13) (ta0 saM0). atra vyAmipakzaDarmatAviSizwaDUmastatpadArTaH. jYAnajYApyatvaM pacamyarTaH. taTA ca vyAptipakzaDarmatAviSizwaDUmajYAnajYApya- . . . vahnimAnparvata iti boDa