nigrahaH — 1 [ka] parAjayaprAptiH (vAtsyA0 112. 19). yaTA sADye niScitamanvayena GawitaM biBratsapakze sTitiM vyAvfttaM ca vipakzato Bavati yattatsADanaM sidDaye. yatsADyaM svayameva tulyamuBayoH pakze virudDaM ca yattasyANgIkaraRena vAdina iva syAtsvAmino nigrahaH.. (mudrArA0 nAwa0 5 10) ityAdO. [Ka] KalIkAraH (gO0 vf0 112. 19). [ga] parAhaMkAranirAkaraRam iti kecidAhuH. 2 Bartsanam. 3 sImA. 4 banDanam. 5 anugrahABAvaH. 6 cikitsA. 7 nizidDe pravfttasya tiraskAraH. 8 mAraRe pravfttivAraRAya niroDaH. 9 niroDarUpayogenAByAsavErAgyAByAM manaso niroDaH. yaTAyogyamudAharaRe yaTA nigrahAnugrahe SaktaH praBurityaBiDIyate iti tasyAhaM nigrahaM manye vAyoriva suduzkaram (gItA0 a0 6 Slo0 34) iti ca (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

