nigrahasTAnam — [ka] vAdinopajayahetuH SabdaprayogaH (ta 0dI0 pf045). nigrahasya KalIkArasya sTAnaM jYApakamityarTaH. tallakzaRaM ca uddeSyAnuguRasamyagjYAnABAvaliNgatvam. pratijYAhAnyAdyanyatamatvaM vA ityapi vadanti (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 19). [Ka] kaTAyAM parAjayaheturvAkyam (ta0 pra0 pf0 24). [ga] izwArTaBaNgarUpo viroDopi nigrahasTAnam iti tarkaBAzAkfdAha (ta0 BA0 pf0 51). [Ga] hetvABAsaprayogaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1) (ta0 BA0 pf0 51) (sarva0 pf0 243 akza0). yaTA vipratipattirapratipattiSca nigrahasTAnam (gO0 1. 2. 60) ityAdO. tadarTaSca vipratipattirvirudDA pratipattiH. apratipattiH prakftAjYAnam. taTA ca vipratipatti apratipatti etadnyataronnAyakaDarmavattvam (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 19). yadvA viparItA vA kutsitA vA pratipattirvipratipattiH. vipratipadyamAnaH parAjayaM prApnoti.<BR>;p{0417}<BR>nigrahasTAnaM Kalu parAjayaprAptiH. apratipattistvAramBavizaye na prAramBaH. pareRa sTApitaM vA na pratizeDati pratizeDaM vA nodDarati - (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 19). nigrahasTAnAni Kalu parAjayavastUnyaparADADikaraRAni prAyeRa pratijYAdyavayavASrayARi tattvavAdinamatattvavAdinaM cABisaMplavante (vAtsyA05. 2. 1 avataraRam). nigrahasTAnAni dvAviMSatiDA. pratijYAhAniH pratijYAntaram pratijYAviroDaH pratijYAsaMnyAsaH hetvantaram arTAntaram nirarTakam avijYAtArTam apArTakam aprAptakAlam nyUnam aDikam punaruktam ananuBAzaRam ajYAnam apratiBA vikzepaH matAnujYA paryanuyojyopekzaRam niranuyojyAnuyogaH apasidDAntaH hetvABAsaSceti (gO0 5. 2. 1) (ta0 BA0 pf0 51) (ta0 dI0 pf0 45) (pra0 pra0 pf0 25).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यम्
nityam — utpattivinASaSUnyaM vastu. anavacCinnasadBAvaM vastu yaddeSakAlataH. tannityaM viBu cecCantItyAtmano viBunityatA. (sarva0 saM0 pf0181 SEva0). nityatvaM ca [1] prAgaBAvApratiyogitve sati DvaMsApratiyogitvam (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 18) (ta0 pra0 pf0 46) (vAkya 0 1 pf0 3). utpattinASaSUnyatvam iti samuditArTaH. atra DvaMsetivyAptivAraRAya satyantam. prAgaBAvetivyAptivAraRAya viSezyadalasya niveSaH (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 18). yaTA paramARvAkASAdInAM nityatvam. yaTA vA ISvarasya tatsAkzAtkArasya ca nityatvam. yaTA vA nityaH saMsargABAvotyantABAvaH (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 11) ityAdO. [2] DvaMsApratiyogitvam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 7). praDvaMsavattvaviraho vA. yaTA kezAMcinmate DvaMsasya nityattram. [3] avicCinnaparaMparAkatvam. yaTA SAbdikamate varRAnAM nityatvam (vAca0). [4] karmajYAstu yadakaraRe pratyavAyaH tattvaM nityatvam (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 26). pratyavAya sADanIBUtABAvapratiyogitvamityarTaH. niyatanimittakatvamiti yAvat. taTA coktaM manunA akurvan vihitaM karma prAyaScittIyate naraH iti. nityaM sadA yAvadAyurna kadAcidatikramet. upetyAtikrame dozaSruteratyAgadarSanAt.. PalASrutervIpsayA ca 53<BR>;p{0418}<BR>tannityamiha kIrtitam iti (ti0 ta0) (vAca0). idaM ca karmaRAM nityatvamiti jYeyam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 103) (ma0pra0) (la0 ma0). yadakaraRe pratyavAya ityatrAkaraRe ityasya vihitatatkAlInAkaraRa ityarTaH. tena anyadA saMDyAvandanAkaraRepi na kzatiH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 103). tAdfSanityatvasyodAharaRaM yaTA aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta ityAdO saMDyopAsanAyA nityatvam ityAhuH (la0 ma0). atrocyate nityaM nEmittikaM cEva nityanEmittikaM taTA. gfhasTasya triDA karma tanniSAmaya putraka. paYcayajYAdikaM nityaM yadetatkaTitaM tava. nEmittikaM taTA cAnyat putrajanmakriyAdikam.. nityanEmittikaM jYeyaM parvaSrAdDAdi paRqitEH iti (SrA0 ta0) (mArka 0 pu0) (vA0). [5] nErantaryamiti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यसमः
nityasamaH — (jAtiH) [ka] nityamanityaBAvAdanitye nityatvopapatternityasamaH (gO0 5. 1. 35). tadarTa [1] anityasya BAvaH anityatvam. tasya nityaM sarvakAlaM svIkAre anitye Sabde nityatvaM syAt ityApAdanaM nityasamaH. ayamASayaH. anityatvasya nityamasvIkAre anityatvABAvadaSAyAM tasyAnityatvaM na iti tasya nityatvApattiH. nahi daRqABAvadaSAyAM daRqI ityucyate. ataH anityatvasya nityameva svIkAra ityaByupagantavyam. taTA ca SabdasyApi nityatvApattiH ityAcAryAH. [2] vfttikArAstu anityasya BAvo Darmastasya nityamaByupagame anityatvenAByupagatasya nityatvaM syAt. yaTA kzitiH sakartfketyatrA nityakziterDarmaH sakartfkatvaM tvayA kzitO nityamupeyate na vA. na cet tadA sADyABAvAdaSato bADaH. aTa kzitO nityameva sakartfkatvamupeyate tadA kziternityatvaM syAt ityAhuH (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 35). nityasamasyodAharaRaM yaTA anityaH Sabda iti pratijYAyate. tadanityatvaM kiM Sabde nityamaTAnityam. yadi tAvatsadA Bavati Darmasya sadABAvAdDarmiRopi sadABAva iti nityaH Sabda iti. aTa na sarvadA Bavati anityatvasyABAvAnnAnityaH SabdaH. evaM nityatvena pratyavasTAnAnnityasamaH<BR>;p{0419}<BR>(vAtsyA0 5. 1. 35). ayaM nityasamaSca AcAryamate bADadeSanABAsaH satpratipakza deSanABAsaSca Bavati. vfttikAramate tu virudDadeSanABAso Bavati iti vijYeyam (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 35). [Ka] Darmasya nityatvAnityatvavikalpAdDarmiRi nityatvasADanam. yaTA Sabdasya yadanityatvaM BavadBirucyate tannityamanityaM vA. yadi nityaM tadA Sabdavfttereva tasya sadAtanasvAcCabdasyApi taTAtvamAgatam. aTAnityam tadA Sabde kadAcidanityatvABAvostIti nitya eva SabdaH ityuBayaTApi Sabdasya nityatvamiti (nIla0 pf0 45). [ga] Darmasya tadatadrUpavikalpAnupapatitaH. DarmiRastadviSizwatvaBaNgo nityasamo Bavet.. (tArkikarakzA). taddviviDam. sADAraRam asADAraRaM ca. tatrAdyaM svavyAGAtakam. dvitIyaM triviDam. yuktANgahInatvam ayuktANgADikatvam avizayavfttitvaM ceti (sarva0 pf0 153 pUrRa0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नित्यसमासः
