निदिध्यासनम्
nidiDyAsanam — [ka] SrutasyArTasya nErantaryeRa dIrGakAlamanusaMDAnam. (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 8). tallakzaRaM ca niraMntaraM vicAro yaH SrutArTasya gurormuKAt. tannidiDyAsanaM proktaM tacEkAgryeRa laByate.. iti. tAByAM nirvicikitserTe cetasaH sTApitasya yat. ekatAnatvametadDi nidiDyAsanamucyate.. (paYcada0 1. 54) iti ca. tAByAM SravaRamananAByAm (vAca 0). yaTA AtmA vAre drazwavyaH Srotavyo mantavyo nidiDyAsitavyaH (SrutiH) ityAdO (nIla0 pf0 50). [Ka] materTe sajAtIyajYAnaDArAkaraRam (pa0 ca0 pf0 20). [ga] vijAtIyapratyayatiraskAreRa sajAtIyapratyayapravAhIkaraRam iti kecidAhuH (nIla0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निद्रा
nidrA — 1 meDyAnAqIsaMyogaH. 2 yogajaDarmAnugfhItasya manaso nirindriyapradeSAvasTAnam. yogAcAryastu 3 aBAvapratyayAlambano vfttiviSezaH ityAhuH. atra sUtram aBAvapratyayAlambanA vfttirnidrA (pAta0 sU0 1. 10) iti. vivaraRaM ca jAgratsvapnavfttInAmaBAvastasya pratyayaH kAraRaM budDisattvAcCAdakaM tamaH. tadevAlambanaM vizayo yasyAH sA taToktA vfttirnidrA iti (vAca0). 4 suzuptiH iti vedAntinaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निन्दा
