निन्दार्थवादः
nindArTavAdaH — [ka] anizwaPalavAdaH. sa ca varjanArTaH. ninditaM na samAcaret iti (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 63). nindArTavAdavAkyaM lakzaRayA nizeDyasya ninditatvaboDakatayA arTavadBavati iti vijYeyam (lO0 BA0.<BR>;p{0421}<BR>pf0 54). [Ka] anizwaboDanadvArA viDyarTapravartakaM vAkyam. yaTA sa eza vA va praTamo yajYo yajYAnAM yajjyotizwomo ya etenAnizwvATAnyena yajate (saH) garte patatyayamevEtajjIryate vA pramIyate vA (SrutiH) ityevamAdi (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 64) (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 64). [ga] nizeDyanindAparaM vAkyam. yaTA barhizi rajataM na deyam ityAdinizeDasya SezaH sorodIt (tEtti0 saM0 1. 5. 1. 1) asfgDi rajatam (Sata0 brA0) ityAdi. atrAmnAyate sorodIdyadarodIttadrudrasya rudratvam (tEtti0 saM0 1. 5. 1. 1) iti. asminvizaye tEttirIyasaMhitAyAM (1. 5. 1) kaTA SrUyate. pUrvaM devadEtyasaMgrAmoBUt. tatra labDaM dravyaM devEH kanizWaBrAturagnernikawe nikziptam. tad dravyaM gfhItvA palAyamAnognirdevErnirudDaH sannarodIt. tannetrABruRo jAtasya rajatasyAmaNgalatvena rajatadakziRAdAnanindA iti. asfgDi rajataM yo barhizi dadAti purAsya saMvatsarAdgfhe rudanti iti (SatapaTanA0) (tE0 saM0 1. 5. 1. 2). asya vAkyasya nizeDyarajatanindAparatvamasti (ma0pra0 pf0 64). taTA hi rajatasyAsfgrUpatvenA yogyatvAt ftAvftvigByo rajatadakziRAdAturyajamAnasya gfhe saMvatsarAtprAgrodanarUpAnizwaboDanadvArA barhipi rajatadakziRAdAnaM nindatIti. yaTA vA asatraM vA etadyadacCandomam (tEtti0 saM0 7. 4. 2. 3) ityAdiSca. atrAyamaBiprAyaH. satraM CandomasUktayuktameva kartavyam. taTA akaraRe asatram iti nindeyam iti. [Ga] anizwasADanatvaboDanadvArA viDyarTapraSaMsAvacanam. yaTA tElaKImAMsasaMBogI parvasvetezu vE pumAn. viRmUtraBojanaM nAma prayAti narakaM Druvam.. ityAdi. atra nahi nindA nindyaM nindituM pravartate api tu viDeyaM stotum iti nyAyonusaMGeyaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातः
nipAtaH — 1 aDodeSasaMyogAnukUlavyApAraH. yaTA payoDarotseDanipAtacUrRitAH (kumAra0 5. 24) kva ca niSitanipAtA vajrasArAH SarAste (SAku0 a0 1) ityAdO. 2 (SabdaH) yaH SabdaH kevale yAdfSasvArTe SabdAntarArTasya tAdAtmyenAnvayaboDaM pratyasamarTaH subAdipratyayeByaH pratyekaM<BR>;p{0422}<BR>BinnaH sa tAdfSArTe BedenAnvayaboDaM prati yogye nipAtaH. nipatatyarTe pUccAvacezu iti nipAtaH (nirukte). kartari unalAdi0 RaH (pARi0 sU0 3. 1. 140). nAnAviDArTezu vfttyA svArTaboDakatayA patanaSIla ityarTaH (vAca0). yaTA cAdayo nipAtAH KArTe samuccayAdO nAmAdyarTasyABedenAnvayaboDaM pratyayogyAH. atra vipratipattiH cAdayo nipAtAH sArTakA vAcakatvAt. prAdaya upasargA eva dyotakAH iti nEyAyikA AhuH. prAdaya upasargA iva cAdayo nipAtA api dyotakA eva iti SAbdikA menire (vE0 sA0 nipA0 pf0 338). atra kecicCAbdikA nAgojIBawwAdayaH upasargAtiriktanipAtAnAM dyotakatvavAcakatvoBayasvIkAraH iti avyayaM viBaktisamIpa (pA0 sU0 2. 16) iti sUtrasTaBAzye spazwam ityAhuH (vAca0). sa cAyaM nipAtaH ca tu naY punaH iva eva mA sma ityAdiBedAdbahuviDaH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 10 wI0 pf0 12). atra nipAtatvaM ca asattvArTakatve sati cAdigaRapaWitatvam iti SAbdikA AhuH. nEyAyikAstu SaktisaMbanDena nipAtapadavattvam ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 nipA0 pf0 335).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपातनम्
nipAtanam — (SabdaH) [ka] anyaTA prAptasyAnyaToccAraRaM nipAtanam. [Ka] SAstrAntarAprAptakAryaGawitoccAraRavat Sabda svarUpam. [ga] varRAgamAdinA anyaTotpadyamAnaH sUtrAnizpAdyaH SabdaviSezo nipAtaH. yaTA haMsa siMha ityAdiSabdaH. taduktam BavedvarRAgamAsaH siMho varRaviparyayAt. gUQotmA varRavikftervarRanASAtpfzodaram.. iti (si0 kO0). varRAgamAdiprakAraSca smaryate. varRAgamo varzaviparyayaSca dvO cAparO varRavikAranASO. DAtostadarTAtiSayena yogastaducyate paYcaviDaM niruktam.. iti (sArasvata 0). atrArTe vyutpattiH nipatati svAvayavavarRavinASAdinAnyaTA nizpadyate iti nipAtaH (kartari jvalAdi 0 RaH) (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निबन्धः
