nimantraRam — AvaSyake karmaRi SrAdDaBojanAdO pravartakaM vAkyam. yaTA brAhmaRatrAtiveSyAnAmetadevAnimatraRe (yAjYa0 2. 263) iti. nimantrayet pUrvedyurbrAhmaRAnAtmavAcCuciH (yAjYa0 1. 225) iti ca. tacca nimantraRam BavatAtra Boktavyam ityAdi vAkyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 155). atrocyate yasyAkaraRe pratyavAyastat nimantraRam iti. etacca nityam. atra nityatvaM ca. pratyavAyasAGanIBUtABAvapratiyogitvam (vAca0). yaTA vA nimantraRArTaM dUtAMSca prezayAmAsa SIGragAn (BAra0 va0 a0 225) ityAdO (vA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमन्त्रितत्वम्
nimantritatvam — svakartavyatva prakAra kaDIjanakamapratyAKyeyaM yadvAkyam tatpratipAdyatvam. yaTA SrAdDe BuYjIta BavAn iha BuYjITAstvam ityAdO SrAdDe BojanAya nimantrito BavAn ityanuBavAnnimantritatvaM liNarTaH. atra svapadaM niruktapratipAdyatvABimataBavadAdiparam. apratyAKyeyatvaM ca pratyavAyajanakapratyAKyAnakatvam. tAdfSaDIjanakavAkyaM ca BavatAtra Boktavyam * ityAdikaM nimantraRarUpam. tatpratipAdyo BavadAdiH iti jYeyam. SrAdDa mupakramya aninditenAmantrito nApagacCet iti SruteH sattvena tatpratyAKyAne dozaH iti jYeyam. atra yasya pratyAKyAne pratyavAyaH tannimantraRam<BR>;p{0424}<BR>iti vfdDasmaraRaM jYeyam. SrAdDe BuYjIta BavAnityatra liNarTanimantritatvEkadeSe svakartavyatvaboDe DAtvarTo viSezyatvenAnveti. taTA ca SrAdDaBojanaDarmikA yA svakartavyatvaDIH tajjanakavAkyapratipAdyo BavAn ityAkAro boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 155156). nimittamAtraguRatvam-asamavAyikAraRaBinnatve sati nimittakAraRaguRatvam (la0 va0 pf0 37). yaTA AtmaviSezaguRAnAM jYAnAdInAm nimittaguRatvameva. nimittam - 1 (kAraRam) samavAyikAraRaBinnamasamavAyikAraRaBinnaM ca kAraRam. yaTA turIvemAdikaM pawasya daRqacakrAdikaM ca Gawasya nimittakAraRam (ta0 saM0) (ta0 kO0 pf0 8). yaTA vA Atmano viSezaguRA nimittakAraRAni (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 8889). samavAyikAraRatABinnA asamavAyikAraRatABinnA ca yA kAraRatA tadvadityarTaH (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 8). svagatarUpasya samavAyikAraRe daRqAdO yaTASrutalakzaRAsattvena nAtivyAptiH iti jYeyam. apariRAmitve sati yatkAraRaM tannimittakAraRam iti maDvamatAnuyAyina AhuH (pra0 ca0 pf0 14). 2 prayojakam. yaTA roDane banDane cApi yojane ca gavAM rujaH. utpAdya maraRaM vApi nimittI tatra lipyate.. (aNgira0) ityAdO. 3 jYApakam. yaTA SakunAdi kAryaviSeze nimittam. atrodAhriyante yaTA nimittaMzu ca sarvezu hyapramatto BavennaraH (smftiH) nimittAni ca paSyAmi viparItAni keSava (gItA 0 1 3 1) mayEvEte nihatAH pUrvameva nimittamAtraM Bava savyasAcin (gItA 0 11. 33) ataH kAlaM pravakzyAmi nimittaM karmaRAmiha (ti0 ta0 Bavizyapu0) ityAdIni (vAca0). yaTA vA aniyatanimittakaM nEmittikaM karma ityAdO putrajanmagrahaRAdi jAtezwisnAnAdO nimittam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 60). atrocyate nimittamAtramASritya yo DarmaH saMpravartate. nEmittikaH sa vijYeyaH prAyaScittaviDiryaTA.. iti (mala0 ta0) (vAca0). 4 SAbdikAstu uddeSyam PalaM vA. yaTA nimittAtkarmayoge iti<BR>;p{0425}<BR>vArtike nimittaM Palam ityAhuH (si0 kO0). 5 Saravyam iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तत्वम्
nimittatvam — 1 [ka] kriyAjanikA yA viniyojyatvenecCA tadvizayatvam. yaTA carmaRi dvIpinaM hantItyAdO carmAdInAM nimittatvam (gadA 0 vyu0 kAra0 7 pf0 116). atra viniyojyatvenecCA ca idaM carma hananena mama prApyatAm iti prApyatvaprakArakecCA. taTA ca carmaRi dvIpinaM hantItyAdO hananAdikriyAjanikA yA viniyojyatvenecCA tadvizayatvaM carmAdO nimittatvam iti vijYeyam. samuditaSlokastu carmaRi dvIpinaM hanti dantayorhanti kuYjaram. keSezu camarIM hanti sIni puzkalako hataH.. iti (si0 kO0). sImA aRqakoSaH. puzkalako ganDamfgaH. atra nimittAtkarmayoge (vArtikam) ityanena saptamI yatkiMcitkarmaprakArakavoDajanakaDAtuyoge prayujyate. tadarTaSca dvIpyAdirUpakarmayoge nimittAccarmAdirUpAtsaptamI.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तम्
nimittam — hi Palam. yogastu saMyogaH samavAyo veti. iyaM saptamI prakftyarTacarmA deInanAdikriyAnimittatvaM boDayati. taTA ca saptamyarTaH svavizayakatAdfSecCADInatvam. tasya kriyAyAmanvayaH. tadekadeSavizayitAyAM nirUpakatvena prakftyarTasyAnvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 116) (kA0 vyA0 pf011). svapadArTaScarma. evaM ca carmAdivizayakecCADInA yA vyAGrakarmikA hananakriyA tatkartA iti vAkyArTaboDaH. [Ka] Palatvene cCA vizayatvam. yaTA carmaRi dvIpinaM hantItyAdO saptamyarTaH. atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. carmAtmakaPalasya sidDatayA svarUpaPalavattvenEvecCA prayojyatvena DAtvarTenveti. taTA ca carmaprakArakecCAprayojya dvIpihananAnukUlakftimAn iti boDaH iti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 11). [ga] SAbdikAstu Palatvam uddeSyatvaM vA nimittatvam. yaTA nimittAtkarmayoge ityAdI ityAhuH. 2 PalatvenecCA. yaTA maSakanivfttO DUmaM karotItyAdO saptamyarTaH. atra maSakanivfttiH Palam. saptamyarTasya maSakanivfttIcCAyAH prayojyatvasaMbanDena karotItyarTenvayaH. taTA ca maSakanivfttIcCAprayojyaDUmakaraRASrayaH iti boDaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 11). 54<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

