नियतत्वम्
niyatatvam — 1 vyApakatvam. yaTA niyatasAmAnADikaraRyaM vyAptiH ityAdO vahnerDUmavyApakatvam (nyA0 vo0 2 pf0 14) (nIla0 2 pf0 20). yaTA vA anyaTAsidDiSUnyasya niyatA pUrvavartitA kAraRatvaM Bavet (BA0 pa0 Slo0 16) ityatra kAraRaBUtadaRqAdigatapUrvavfttitvasya GawAdikAryaniyatatvam. atra sAmAnADikaraRyasaMbanDena yatra. daRqAdEO kArya tatra svarUpasaMbanDena pUrvavfttitvam iti rItyA vyApteH sattvena pUrvavfttitvasya vyApakatvaM boDyam. 2 niyamayuktatvam iti yogina AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमः
niyamaH — 1 [ka] tadvadanyAvfttitvam. vyAptiriti yAvat (ga0 sidDA0). yaTA kArye kAraRaniyamaH ityatra kArye kAraRavadanyAvfttitvarUpo niyamaH. yaTA DUme vahnimadanyAvfttitvam. [Ka] vyApyatvam (ga0 satpra0 pf0 22). yaTA svasADyaviparItenAniyamAt (ci0 2 satpra0 pf0 97) ityAdO. [ga] tanmAtrasattvam. yaTA sAhacaryaniyamaH ityAdO (vAkya 0 2 pf0 13). atrAyamarTaH. sAhacaryaM sADyanizwahetusAmAnADikaraRyam. tanniyamaH tanmAtrasattvam. tadviroDyasattvamiti yAvat. viroDi ca hetusamAnADikaraRABAvapratiyogitvam. yAdfSavahneryAddaSaDUmasAhacaryaM tasminna tadavyApakatvam iti viroDaH. anugatEkavyaktO tu ekADikaraRAvacCedenAsattvam viroDaH iti (vAkya 02 pf0 13). 2 vyApakatvam. 3 DarmajYAstu pratyavAyajanakI BUtABAvapratiyogitvam. ayogavyavacCeda iti paryavasitorTaH. yaTA ftO svadArAnupeyAdityAdO liNarTaH ityAhuH. atra niyamArTEkadeSe aBAva ftvAdikAlasyAvacCedakatvenAnvayAt ftukAlAvacCedyatvaviSizwasya pratya- : vAyajanakIBUtABAvasya pratiyogi svadAragamanam ityAkArako boDaH. yadvA pratyavAyahetutvam aBAvaSca dvayaM tatra liNarTaH. tena pratiyogiviDayA DAtvarTasyAvacCedyatvena ca kAlasyAnvayinyaBAve liNA pratyavAyahetutvasya boDanAt ftukAlAvacCedyaH svadAragamanABAvaH pratyavAyahetuH ityAkAra eva tatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 158). 4 SOca<BR>;p{0427}<BR>: saMtozatapaHsvADyAyeSvarapraRiDAnAni niyamAH (pAta0 yogasU0 2. 32) iti yogANgaviSezAH iti yogina AhuH (gO0 vf0 4. 2. 44). 5 tattadvyApArezu BagavatpreraRam iti vedAntino maDvAcAryAnuyAyinaH prAhuH. 6 pratijYA. 7 svIkAraH. 8 AgantukasADanakarmarUpaM vratam. 9 niyantraRA. 10 niScayaH ityAdi (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नियमविधिः
niyamaviDiH — (viDiH) [ka] yatroBayoH prAptAveko niyamyate tatra niyamaviDiH. yaTA brIhI navahanti (SrutiH) ityAdO (si0 ca0 4 pf0 33). atra niyamaH ayogavyavacCedaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 178). atra vrIhizu naKavidalanamusalAvahananayoH prAptO musalA hananameva niyamyate (si0 ca0 4 pf0 33). niyamaviDeH prayojanaM ca etadviDyaBAve darSapUrRamAsAdikezu vrIhizUtpattivAkyAvagatapuroqASopayogitaRqulanizpattyanukUlavE tuzyakAryAMyAvahananavat kadAcinnaKavidalanamapi prApnuyAditi tasminpakze avahananasya prAptyaBAvAt kAryAnyaTopapatteravahananasya pAkzikI prAptiH syAt. satyasminviDO avahananenEva vEtuzyaM kAryam iti niyame sati vidalanaM sarvAtmanA nivartata iti niyamaviDirayam. na ca vEtuzyasya naKavidalanenApi saMBavAdavahanananiyamo vyarTaH. prayojanABAvAditi vAcyam. atraGAtenEva vEtuzyakaraRe kiMcidadfzwuM janyata ityadfzwANgIkArAt (mImAM0 pari0) (vAca0). [Ka] pakze aprAptasya niyAmako viDiH. yaTA vrIhIna vahanti iti ma0 pra0 4 pf0 62). [ga] nAnAsADanasADyakriyAyAmekasADanaprAptAvaprAptasyAparasADanasya prApako viDiH iti mImAMsakA AhuH (lO0 BA0 pf0 39). [Ga] yo viDiH pakze aprAptamarTaM niyamayati saH. yaTA vrIhInavahanti iti (mImAM0 pari0). [Na] anyanivfttiPalaka sidDavizayaka viDirniyamaviDiH iti SAbdikA vadanti. pare tu yatra kriyAyAM vikalpena kArakAnvayaH saH. yaTA yAjanADyApanapratigrahErbrAhmaRo Danamarjayet ityAdO niyamaviDiH ityAhuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 108).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

