nirRayaH — 1 [ka] tadaBAvAprakArakaM tatprakArakaM jYAnam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 41) (ta0 BA0 pf0 44). yaTA Gawe ayaM GawaH iti jYAnam. atrocyate. nirRayo viSezadarSanajamavaDAraRam saMSayaviroDi. tat dviviDam. pratyakzam anumAnaM ca. tatrAdyaM yaTA sTARupuruzayorUrDvatAmAtrasAddaSyAlocanAdviSezezu pratyakzezUBayaviSezAnusmaraRAt kimayaM sTARuH<BR>;p{0433}<BR>puruzo vA iti saMSayotpattO SiraH pARyAdidarSanAt puruza evAyam ityavaDAraRajYAnaM pratyakza nirRayaH. dvitIyaM yaTA vizARamAtradarSanAt gOrgavayo vA iti saMSayotpattO sAsnAmAtradarSanAt gOrevAyam ityavaDAraRajYAnam anumAnanirRayaH iti (praSasta0 2 pf0 32). [Ka] vimfSya pakzapratipakzAByAmarTAvaDAraRaM nirRayaH (gO0 1. 1. 41). tadarTaSca vimfSya saMdihya pakzapratipakzAByAM sADanopAlamBAByAmarTasyAvaDAraRam. tadaBAvAprakArakaM tatprakArakaM jYAnamityarTaH. yadyapyetAvadeva nirRaya sAmAnyalakzaRaM taTApi vimfSyetyAdikaM jalpavitaRqAsTalIya nirRayamaDikftya. taduktaM BAzye SAstre vAde ca vimarSavarjamiti. evaM pratyakzataH SabdAcca nirRaye na vimarSapakzapratipakzApekzeti (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 41) (vAtsyA 0 1. 1. 41). atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. nirRayastattvajYAnam pramARAnAM Palam (vAtsyA0 5. 1. 1 pf0 6) (ta0 BA0 pf0 44). nirRayastattvajYAnaM pramARAnAM Palam. tacca yadA vastvantaraparicCedahetutvena nopAdIyate tadA Palam. yadA tena paricCinatti tadA pramARam iti na vyavatizWate pramARaPalaBAvaH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 19). sTApanA sADanam. pratizeDa upAlamBaH. tO sADanopAlamBO pakzapratipakzASrayO vyatizaktAvanubanDena pravartamAnO pakzapratipakzAvityucyete. tayoranyatarasya nivfttirekatarasyAvasTAnamavaSyaMBAvi. yasyAvasTAnaM tasyAvaDAraRaM nirRayaH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 41). [ga] yaTArTAnuBavaparyAyA pramitirnirRayaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 239 akzapA0). 2 aDikaraRANgaviSezaH iti mImAMsakA AhuH. atrocyate. vizayo viSayaScEva pUrvapakzastaTottaram. nirRayaSceti paYcANgaM SAstraDikaraRaM smftam. iti. 3 sidDAntasidDavicAryavAkyatAtparyAvaDAraRamiti sAMKyA AhuH (sAMKya0 kO0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0432" target="_blank">PDF</a><B