nirDAraRam — [ka] viSezasya svetarasAmAnyavyAvfttaDarmavattvam. yaTA narARAM kzatriyaH SUratamaH narezu vA ityatra (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 93. wI0 pf0 128). [Ka] jAtyAdiviSezaRaviSizwayadDarmAvacCinnasya tAdfSaviSezaRaSUnyatadDarmAvacCinna vyAvfttatvaviSizwaviDeyavattayA pratipAdanam. jAtyAdayaH jAtiguRakriyAsaMjYAH. taTA ca narARAM kzatriyaH SUra ityAdO jAtiH kzatriyatvam tacca tadviSezaRaM ca tena viSizwo yadDarmAvacCinnaH naratvarUpasAmAnyaDarmAvacCinnaH tasya tAdfSaviSezaRam kzatriya- : tvam tena SUnyastadDarmAvacCinnaH naratvAvacCinnaH tasmAdvyAvfttatvam avfttitvam tena viSizwam sahitam viDeyam SOryam tadvattayA pratipAdanam iti. nareByo rAkzasAH SUratamAH ityAdO rAkzasatyAdiviSezaRaviSizwe tacCUnyanarAdivyAvfttaSUratamatvavivakzAyAmapi na niruktanirDAraRam. rAkzasatvAdiviSizwasya naratvAdisAmAnyaDarmAnavacCinnatvAt. ato nAtivyAptiH.. narARAM kzatriyaH SUratama ityAdO kzatriyAdinizWaSUratamatvAdO narAdisAmAnyatryAvfttatvabADAt asaMBavaH. ataH SUnyatvAntaM vyAvfttyavaDestadDarmAvacCinnetyasya viSezaRaM dattam. tAdfSakzatriyatvajAtirUpaviSezaRaSUnyAdbrAhmaRAdeSva<BR>;p{0435}<BR>vyAvfttaH kzatriyo Bavati. narARAM kzatriyaH SUraH narezu vA. aDvagAnAM raTagAminaH SIGratarAH aDvagezu vA. gavAM kfzRA saMpannakzIrA gozu vA ityAdO yataSca nirDAraRam (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 41) ityanena zazWIsaptamyO viDIyete. sUtrArTaSca jAtyAdiviSezaRaviSizwayadDarmAvacCinnasya tAdfSaviSezaRaSUnyatadDarmAvacCinnavyAvfttatvaviSizwaviDeyavattayA pratipAdanam tadDarmAvacCinnArTakapadAt zazWIsaptamyO iti. etaduktaM Bavati. jAtiguRakriyAsaMjYA viSizwasyEkadeSasya yataH svaGawitasamudAyAtsvetarasamudAyaGawakavyAvfttaDarmakaraRakaM pfTakkaraRaM tadvAcakAt zazwIsaptamyO sta iti. atra svetarArTasya samudAyaGawakArTe aBedenAnvayaH. udAharaRAni tu nfRAM nfzu vA brAhmaRaH SrezWaH. gavAM gozu vA kfzRA bahukzIrA. gacCatAM gacCatsu vA DAvaYCIGraH. CAtrARAM CAtrezu vA mEtraH pawuH. vistarastu SeKarAdO drazwavyaH. prakfte ca kzatriyatvAdiviSezaRaviSizwe narAdO tacCUnyanarAdivyAvfttatvena SOryaviSezAdirUpaviDeyasaMbanDoB