न्यायः
nyAyaH — [ka] pramARerarTaparIkzaRam. kimuktaM Bavati. samastapramARavyApArAdarTADigatiyayaH iti (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 14). atra vyutpattiH. nIyate prApyate vivakzitArTasidDiranena iti nyAyaH iti. [Ka] pratyakzAgamASritamanumAnam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1). pratyakzAgamASritamiti pratyakzAgamAviroDi. yadi hyanumAnADigatorTaH pratyakzA.<BR>;p{0447}<BR>a0 1 gamAByAmanusaMDIyate aTa sPuwatarapratyayo Bavati (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 14) [ga] parArTAnumAnam (sarva0 pf0 264 akza0). idaM ca SabdAtmakameveti yadyapi agre anupadameva vakzyamARe (pf0 447 pa0 23) nyAye antarBavati taTApyasyAnumAnatvenoktatvAtpArTakyenAnumAnaprakaraRe etatsTApitam iti jYeyam. 2 AnvIkzikI vidyA nyAyaSAstram (vAtsyA0 111. 1) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1). seyamAnvIkzikI nyAyatarkAdiSabdErapi vyavahiyate. taTA ca nyAyo mImAMsA DarmaSAstrARi iti SrutiH. purARanyAya mImAMsADarmaSAstrANgamiSritAH. vedAH sTAnAni vidyAnAM Darmasya ca caturdaSa.. ityAdismftiH (yAjYava 0 Slo0 3). mImAMsA nyAyatarkaSca upANgaH parikIrtitaH iti purARam. trEvidyeByastrayIM vidyAM daRqanItiM ca SASvatIm. AnvIkzikIM cAtmavidyAM vArtAramBAMSca lokataH.. iti (manu0 a0 7 Slo0 43). taTA ArzaM DarmopadeSaM ca vedaSAstrAviroDinA. yastarkeRAnusaMDatte sa DarmaM veda netaraH. ityAdi (manu0 a0 12 Slo0 106). mokzaDarme tatropanipadaM tAta pariSezaM tu pArTiva. manAmi manasA tAta dfzwvA cAnvIkzikIM parAm.. iti. upanizadarTaScAnvIkzikyanusArI grAhyaH ityuktamiti (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1). atroktaM pakzilasvAminA vAtsyAyanena imAstu catasro vidyAH pfTakprasTAnAH prARaBftAmanugrahA yopadiSyante yAsAM caturTIyamAnvIkzikI nyAyavidyA iti. seyamAnvIkzikI nyAyavidyA pramARAdiBiH padArTErviBajyamAnA pradIpavat sarvavidyAnAM Bavati prakASakatvAt. pradIpaH sarvavidyAnAmupAyaH sarvakarmaRAm. ASrayaH sarvaDarmARAM vidyoddeSe parIkzitA. iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1). 3 [ka] sADanIyasyArTasya yAvati SabdasamUhe sidDiH parisamApyate sa paYcAvayavopetavAkyAtmako nyAyaH. paYcAvayavAH pratijYAdayaH samUhamapekzyAvayavA ucyante. tezu pramARasamavAya AgamaH pratijYA. heturanumAnam. udAharaRaM pratyakzam. upanayanamupamAnam. sarvezAmekArTa- samavAye sAmarTya pradarSanaM nigamanam. soyaM paramo nyAyaH iti. atrAyaM<BR>;p{0448}<BR>niyamaH saMSayiterTe nyAyaH pravartate iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1).. nAnupalabDe na nirRIterTe nyAyaH pravartate api tu saMdigDe iti (ta0 BA0 pf0 10). atra gadADara Aha jalpasTale saMSayasyAvaSyakatvepi vAdasTale na taTA iti saMSayamantareRApi anumitsADInAnumitinirvAhAya nyAyaprayoga saMBavAt iti (ga0 2 avayava0 pf0 22). taTA ca saMdigDerTe nyAyaH pravartate iti niyamastu jalpe eva na tu vAde iti BAvaH. [Ka] samastarUpopeta liNgaboDakavAkyajAtaM nyAyaH (ku0 1 wI0 haridAsaH). vAkyajAtaM ca pratijYAdipaYcakam. samastarUpARi ca pakzasattvam sapakzasattvam vipakzAsattvam abADitavizayatvam asatpratipakzitatvaM ceti paYca (ma0pra0 2 pf0 31). [ga] anumiticaramakAraRaliNgaparAmarSaprayojakaSAbdajYAnajanakavAkyam (ci0 2 ava0 pf0 76). [Ga] kramikapratijYAdisamudAyaH. yaTA parvatapakzakavahnisADyakaDUmahetukasTale parvato vahnimAn ityAdipratijYAdiGawitavAkyapaYcakaM nyAyaH. pratijYAdIni paYca vAkyAni tu pratijYA hetuH udAharaRam upanayaH nigamanam iti. yaTA (1) parvato vahnimAn (2) DUmAt (3) yo yo DUmavAn sa sa vahnimAn (4) vahnivyApyaDUmavAnayam (5) tasmAdvahnimAn iti (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 23). atra udAharaRAnta eva prayogaH iti na vAcyam. tftIyaliNgaparAmarSasya vyAptapakzaDarmatAvagAhinovayavAntarAdalABAt. tadanaByupagamepi pakzaDarmatAyA alABAt iti. mImAMsakAnAmudAharaRAntaH pratijYA hetu udAharaRa etatrayAtmakaH nyAyaH. bOdDAnAmudAharaRopanayadvayAvayavako nyAyaH. atiprAcInanEyAyikAnAM daSAvayavako nyAyaH. daSAvayavASca pratijYAdipaYcakam saMSayaH jijYAsA SakyaprAptiH prayojanam saMSayavyudAsaScati. aTa pratijYAdInAM paYcAnAmavayavAnAM kramoBiDIyate. kaTAyAmAkANkzAkrameRABiDAnamiti praTamaM sADyABiDAnaM vinA kutaH ityAkArakahetvAdyAkANkzAyA aBAvAt prATamyena pratijYAprayogaH. taTAhi vipratipattya samayabanDAnantaraM SabdAnityatvaM sADaya iti maDyasTasya vAdino vA AkANkzAyAM SabdAnityatvaM sADyam. na ca sADyanirdeSaM binA<BR>;p{0449} hetuvAkyaM nizpratiyogikamanvayaM voDayitumIzwe. tasmAt sADyanirdeSAnantaraM kutaH ityAkANkzAyAM sADanatAvyaYjakaviBaktimalliNgavacanamevocitam iti pratijYAnantaraM hetUpanyAsaH. tAvukte kaTamasya gamakatvam ityAkANkzAyAM vyAptipakzaDarmatayoH pradarSanaprAptO vyApteH prATamyAt tatpradarSanAyodAharaRam. udAharaRAnantaraM Bavatu vyAptiH. taTApi vyAptaM kiM pakze vartate na vA ityAkANkzAyAM vyAptasya pakzaDarmatvapradarSanAyopanayaH. upanayAnantaraM nigamanam. na ca vyAptipakzaDarmatAyAScaturBirevAvayavEH paryApteH kiM tena iti vAcyam. abADitAsatpratipakzatvayoralABe caturRAmapyaparyavasAnAt iti (ci0 2 ava0 pf0 7782). aTavA parvato. hnamAn iti pratijYAte kutaH ityAkANkzAyAM DUmAt iti prayogaH. tataH kaTamasya gamakatvam ityAkANkzAyAM vyAptipakzaDarmatAByAm. tatra kAsO vyAptiH ityAkANkzAyAM yo yo DUmavAn sa sa vahnimAn yaTA mahAnasam iti prayogaH. tataH vyAptasya pakzaDarmatvamasti na vA ityAkANkzAyAM vahnivyApyaDUmavAMScAyam iti taTA cAyan iti vA prayogaH. tataH vyAptipakzaDarmatAvAnapyayaM hetubaMDita eva satpratipakza eva vA syAt ityAkANkzAyAmabADitatvAsatpratipakzatvaboDanAya tasmAdvahnimAn iti tasmAttaTA iti vA nigamanaprayogaH. na cAnenApyabADitatvAdivoDaH kaTaM janyata iti vAcyam. sADyapunarvacanasyAnuvAdatayA prayojanajijYAsAyAM pariSezAdvADAdiviDUnanameva tat ityavasIyate. taTEva vyutpatteH. tadAhuH upasaMhAra- - syAyaM mahimA yadviparItaSaNkAvilopanaM nAma iti. atredaM boDyam. dfzwAntaprayogastu sAmayikaH na niyataH iti (ma0pra0 2 pf0 3132). 4 pramARAnAmanugrAhakastarkaH (BA0). tadanugfhItapramARagamyo BagavAn vizRurapi nyAyaSabdena lakzitalakzaRayA pratipAdyate (AnandagiriH) yaTA nyAyaprasUnAYjaliH nyAyakusumAYjaliH ityAdO (vAca0). 5 vedArTanirRayasADanamaDikaraRAtmakaH padArTaH. sa ca nyAyaH pUrvottaravedasaMbanDo jEminivedavyAsAByAM bahuprakAro darSitaH. 6 lokaSAstraprasidDadfzwAntaviSezaH. tatra lokaprasidDo yaTA arke cenmaDu vindeta 57<BR>;p{0450}<BR>kimarTaM parvataM vrajet. izwasyArTasya saMsidDO ko vidvAn yatnamAcaret.. (sAMKya0 kO0 Slo0 1 wI0) iti. kadambamukulanyAyaH sUcIkawAhanyAyaH ityAdiSca. SAstraprasidDastu yaTA saviSezaRe hi vartamAnO viDinizeDO viSezaRamupasaMkrAmataH sati viSezye bADe iti nyAyaH aDyAropanyAyaH mAnADInA meyasidDiH itinyAyaH ityAdi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0446" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

न्यायशास्त्रम्
nyAyaSAstram — asADAraRyena vyapadeSA Bavanti iti nyAyena nyAyasya parArTAnumAnAparaparyAyasya sakalavidyAnugrAhakatayA sarvakarmAnuzWAnasADanatayA praDAnatvena gOtamamunipraRItaSAstrasya nyAyaSAstram iti vyapadeSo yujyate. taTA aBARi sarvajYena soyaM paramo nyAyaH. vipratipannapuruzaM prati pratipAdakatvAt taTA pravfttihetutvAcca iti (sarva0 pf0 244 akza0). yaTA gOtamamunipraRItaM pramARaprameyasaMSayaprayojana (gO0 1. 1. 1) ityAdyAraBya hetvABAsASca yaToktAH (gO0 5. 2. 25) ityetatparyantaM pacADyAyAtmakaM sUtropanibadDaM nyAyadarSanam. taduktam kaRAdena ca saMproktaM SAstraM vESezikaM mahat. gOtamena taTA nyAyaM ityAdi (padmapurARe uttaraKaRqe a0 207). sAMKyaM ca kapilena vE.. asya SAstrasya pravfttiSca triviDA uddeSaH lakzaRam parIkzA ceti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 2) (ta0 BA0 pf0 1). aDikaM tu nyAyaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditam. etacCAnAKasya prayojanaM ca niHSreyasaprAptiH. yadAha BAzyakAraH AtmAdeH Kalu - prameyasya tattvajYAnAnniHSreyasADigamaH. taccEtaduttarasUtreRAnUdyata iti. heyaM tasya nirvartakaM hAnamAtyantikam tasyopAyoDigantavya ityetAni catvArTarTapadAni samyagbuDvA niHSreyasamaDigacCati (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 pf0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

