paYcamI — (viBaktiH) tattadDAtvarTe (patyAdyarTe) apAdAnatvAdiboDikA viBaktiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 65). yaTA vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO vfkzapadottarapaYcamI. paYcamyarTaSca 1 [ka] apAdAnam. yaTA BUBfto gaNgAvataratItyAdO paYcamyarTaH. atra BUBfto gaNgAsamavetakriyAjanyaviBAgASrayatvAt apAdAnatvam. taTA ca sUtram DruvamapAyepAdAnam (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 24) iti. tadarTaSca apAye viBAge Druvam niScalam parasamavetakriyAjanyaviBAgASrayaH apAdAnaM syAt iti (ma0 pra0 pf0 6). atra gaNgAyAmativyAptivAraRAya parasamaveteti kriyA- (viSezaRaM dattam. ayaM viSezaH. spandajanyaviBAgASrayatvena vfkzAderapAdAnatve vfkzAtpa spandate ityapi prayogaH syAt. ataH kriyeti sakarmakaDAtvarTaparam iti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9). aTavA apAye hA viBAge yat avaDiBUtaM Druvam niScalam prakftapaYcamyarTaviBAgajanakatvAnvayikriyASUnyam tadapAdAnasaMjYaM syAt iti (kA0 vyA0 : pf0 9) (si0 kO0 kAraka 0). [Ka] BedapratiyogitAvacCedakatvam viBAgaSca. yaTA vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO paYcamyarTaH. vfkzAtparRa<BR>;p{0457}<BR>patatItyAdO BedapratiyogitAvacCedakatvaM viBAgaSca paYcamyarTaH. Bede viBAge ca vfkzAdeH prakftyarTasyAveyatAsaMbanDenAnvayaH. pratiyogitAvacCedakatvasyASrayatAsaMbanDena viBAgasya ca janakatAsaMbanDena patyarTakriyAyAmantrayaH. evaM ca vfkzanizwaBedapratiyogitAvacCedakaM yadvfkzanizWaviBAgajanakaM patanaM tadASrayaH parRam ityAkArako boDaH (ga0 vyu0 kAraka0 5 pf0 104) (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9). [ga] avaDitvam avaDitAnirUpakatvaM vA. yaTA vfkzAdviBajate PalamityAdO paYcamyarTaH. atredaM boDyam. atra nApAdAne paYcamI kiMtu avaDO. vfkzAvaDikaviBAgASrayaH Palam ityavaDitvasyEva boDAt iti (ma0 pra0 pf0 6). aTavA atra viBAgAvaDitvamapAdAnatvam. apAye viBAge DruvamavaDiBUtamapAdAnamiti sUtrArTaH. taTA ca vfkzanizWAvaDitAnirUpakaviBAgASrayaH Palam iti vAkyArTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9) (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0). 2 hetutvam. yaTA Gawo daRqAt vahnirDUmAt ityAdO paYcamyarTaH. atra hetutvaM dviviDam. kArakatvam jYApakatvaM ca. tatrAdyaM yaTA Gawo daRqAdityAdO. dvitIyaM yaTA vahnirDUmAdityAdO (ma0 pra0 pf0 6). yaTA vA vyAGrAdviBetItyAdO janyatvaM (prayojyatvaM) paYcamyarTaH. atra BItrArTAnAM BayahetuH (pA0 sU0 114. 25) ityanenApAdAnatvam. sUtrArTaSca BayArTakaDAtuyoge Bayahetutvena saMBAvitamapAdAnam iti. tena yasya vyAGrADInaM BayamaprasidDam aTa ca vyAGrahetukatvena maraRAdikaM saMBAvayati tatpuruzaparaH vyAGrAdayaM viBeti iti prayogaH saMgacCate (ga0 vyu kA0 5 pf0 106). atrAha vyAGrAdviBetItyAdO nApAdAnapaYcamI. kiMtu hetutvArTikA paYcamI. taTAhi. DAtoryaTAyaTaM BayaM BayABAvaScArTaH. paYcamyA hetutvamarTaH. tacca DAtvarTe Baye DAtvarTatAvacCedake ca Bayatvenveti. ASrayatvaM vyApAraSca yaTAyaTamAKyAtArTaH. itTaM ca hetupaYcamyEvopapattO mItrArTAnAM BavaddetuH iti sUtraM prapaYcArTam iti boDyam (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9-10). atrodAhriyante. paRqitAtpurARaM SfRoti upADyAyAdaDIte rAmAdaDIta58.<BR>;p{0458}<BR>saMdeSaH ityAdO prakftyarTapaRqitAdikartfkoccAraRADInatvaM paYcamyarTaH. tasya ca SravaRa uccAraRa arTaviSezajYAna ityAdikriyAyAmanvayaH. atrAKyAtuH paRqitAde AKyAtopayoge (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 29) ityanenApAdAnatA (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 107). 3 vfttitvam. yaTA kUpAdanDaM vArayatItyAdO paYcamyarTaH. evam aDarmAjjugupsata ityatrApi paYcamyA vfttitvamarTaH. DAtornindArTaH. taTA cAtra aDarmaM nindati ityarTo boDyate. evam upADyAyAdantarDatte Sizya ityAdO paYcamyA vfttitvamarTaH. DAtoH svavizayakapratyakzaviroDivyApArorTaH. paYcamyarTavfttitvasya DAtvarTatAvacCedakapratyakzenvayaH. AKyAtasya kftirarTaH. evaM ca. upADyAya saMvanDistvavizayakapratyakza viroDivyApArAnukUlakftimAn SizyaH iti boDaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 10). atra antarDO yenAdarSanamicCati (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 28) ityanenApAdAnatA. 4 saMyoganASAvyavahitottarakzaRavfttitvam saMbanDADInatvaM vA. yaTA himavato gaNgA praBavatItyAdO paYcamyarTaH. 5 karmatvam (vizayatvam). yaTA kfzRAtparAjayate SiSupAlaH aDyayanAtparAjayate bAlaH ityAdO paYcamyarTaH. aDarmAdviramatItyAdAvapi paYcamyAH karmatvamarTaH. DAtoH karaRamakaraRaM cArTaH paYcamyarTakarmatvasya karaRe akaraRe cAnvayaH. taTA ca aDamaM punarna karoti iMtyarTaH. evam DarmAtpramAdyatItyAdO paYcamyA vizayatvam DAtoranavaDAnam AKyAtasyASrayatvamarTaH. evaM ca DarmavizayakAnavaDAnASrayaH iti boDaH. SabdaSaktiprakASikAkftastvatrAhuH. pApAnnivartate aDarmAdviramatItyAdO paYcamyA dvezorTaH. tatra prakftyarTasya vizayatvena tasya ca nivfttirUpe DAtvarTe janyatvenAnvayaH. tena pApagocaradvezajanya nivfttimAn ityevaM boDaH iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0 pf0 80). 6 yaTezwaviniyogaH. yaTA viprAdDanamAdatta ityAdO paYcamyarTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 9-10) (ma0pra0 pf0 6) (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 5 pf0 106) (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0). atra DAtorapi yaTezwaviniyogaPalakasvIkArorTaH. paYcamyarTasya viniyogasyAvyavahitottaratva saMbanDena DAtvarTatAvacCedake viniyogenvayaH. itTaM ca viprIyayaTezwaviniyogAvyavahitottaraDanavfttiyaTezwaviniyogaPalakasvIkAravAn<BR>;p{0459}<BR>iti boDaH. atra avyavahitottaratvaM ca.. svasamAnavizayakapuruzAntarIyaviniyogavyavahitaBinnatvam. tena SUdrAt pratigrahItrA vipreRa dattaM DanamAdAtari SUdrAdAdatte iti na prayogaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 10). paYcapARqavapatikA drOpadI paYcamISabdenocyate iti pOrARikA AhuH. sUryakiraRaprativimbayogyatvayogyatvABAvayuktA candrasya paYcamI kalA iti jyotirvidaH. tAdfSakalopalakzitatiTiSca paYcamI iti mOhUrtikA vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0456" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

