paRqA — 1 (apUrvam) PalasADatvayogyaH adfzwaviSezaH. yaTA mImAMsakamate aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta ityAdO nityakarmaRaH saMDyAvandanAderaBAve. duradfzwaM jAyate saMDyAdevendane tu tasyAnutpattyA PalAnupahitaM duradfzwaM naSyati iti tatpaRqApUrvam. atra guravaH. kAryatvena apUrva eva viDeH SaktiH. taTA ca na kalaYjaM BakzayedityAdinizeDe kalaYjaBakzaRABAvavizayakaM kAryam ityanvayaboDaH. taccApUrvaM na kiMcitPalajanakam. api tu svataH prayojanaM nityakarmaRaH ityaNgIcakruH (vA0) (di0 gu0). nEyAyikAstu nityakarmaRAmapi pApaDvaMsAdirUpaPalasattvAtpaRqApUrvaM nANgIkurvanti<BR>;p{0460}<BR>. 2 vedojvalA budDiH. yaTA paWakAH pAWakAScEva ye cAnye SAstracintakAH. sarve vyasanino mUrKA yaH kriyAvAn sa paRqitaH.. (BA0 vA0) ityAdI. 3 AgamajanyaM jYAnam (gI0 BA0 wI0). yaTA vidyAvinayasaMpanne brAhmaRe gavi hastini. Suni cEva SvapAke ca paRqitAH samadarSinaH.. (gItA0 5. 18) ityAdO. 4 sarvavidyADikatvaM yatpARqityaM tadudAhftam iti sAhityaSAstrajYA AhuH (pratAparudre).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0459" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

