पदम्
padam — 1 [ka] te viBaktayantAH padam (gO0 222260). yaTA darSanaM vikftA varRA viBaktyantAH padasaMjYA Bavanti. viBaktirdvayI. nAmikI AKyAti kI ca. brAhmaRaH pacati ityudAharaRam. upasarganipAtAstarhi na padasaMjYAH. lakzaRAntaraM vAcyamiti. Sizyate ca Kalu nAmikyA viBakteravyayAllopaH tayoH padasaMjYArTamiti. padenArTasaMpratyaya iti prayojamam. nAmapadaM cADikftya parIkzA gOriti padaM KalvidamudAharaRam (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 60) (ta0 kO0). padatvaM ca vfttimattvam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 60). saMketavadvarRatvam (vE0 u0 2. 2. 21). padAnAM sADutvaM ca vyAkaraRavyaNgayorTaM viSizwaSabdanizWaH puRyajanakatAvacCedako jAtiviSezaH (la0 ma0). padajYAnaM ca SAbdaboDe kAraRam. sUtre viBaktyantatvaM ca SAbdaboDOpayikaviBaktiprakftitvam (ga0 ava0 hetu0). [Ka] varRasamUhaH. samUhaScAtrEkajYAna vizayaBAva eva. atrocyate. varRAH padaM prayogAha nanvitEkArTaboDakAH iti (sA0 da0 pari0 2 Slo0 2). evaM tatra varRAnAM kramavatAmASutaravinASitvenEkadAnekavarRAnuBavAsaMBavAt pUrvapUrvavarRAnanuBUyAntyavarRaSravaRakAle pUrvavarRAnuBavajanitasaMskArasaha kftenAntyavarRasaMbadDena padavyutpAdanasamayagrahaRAnugfhItena SrotreREkadEva sadasadanekavarRAvagAhinI padapratItirjanyate. sahakArisAmarTyAtpratyaBijYAvat. pratyaBijYApratyakze hi atItApi pUrvAvasTA Puratyeva iti (ta0 BA0 pramA0 4 pf0 1819). [ga] Saktam (ta0 saM0 4) (mu0 4 pf0 179). [Ga] arTaboDakam. [Na] suptiNantaM padam iti SAbdikA vadanti. [ca] vAkyEkadeSaH padam iti kecidAhuH. nyAyanaye padaM dviviDam. muKyam gORaM ca. yacCattivfttyA yamarTamupasTApayati tattasminnarTe muKyam. yaTA goGawAdivyaktyupasTApakaM goGawAdipadam (ta0 kO0). muKyamapi caturviDam. yOgikam rUQam yogarUQam yOgikarUQaM ceti. tatrAdyaM pAcakAdipadam. dvitIyaM brAhmaRavAcakaM viprapadam gomaRqapAdipadaM<BR>;p{0462}<BR>ca. tftIyaM paNkajAdipadam. caturTamudBidAdipadam iti (tarkA 04) (mu0 4 pf0 189) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 30). yalakzaRAvfttyA yamarTamupasTApayati tattasminnarTe gORam lAkzaRikam iti cocyate. yaTA gaNgAyAM Goza ityatra lakzaRAvfttyA tIropasTApakaM gaNgApadam (ta0 kO0