पदार्थः
padArTaH — padABiDeyaH (ta0 dI0) (ta0 kO0). sa ca jAtyAkftivyaktayaH padArTaH (gO0 2. 2. 68). yaTA GawamAnayetyAdO GawapadABiDeyaH GawatvAtmakajAtikambugrIvAdirUpAkftiviSizwo vyaktiviSezo GawapadArTaH. padArTatvaM ca [ka] padaSaktiH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 1). [Ka] vfttyA padopasTApyatvam. [ga] padatAtparyavizayatvam. [Ga] aBiDeyatvam (vAkya0) (ta dI0). atredaM boDyam. gavAdipadAnAmiyaM gatiH. guRakarmAdivAcakapadAnAM tu jAtivyaktI evArTaH iti (vE0 u0 7. 2. 20). AkASAdipadasya jAtyavAcakatvepi ca na kzatiH. jAtipadaM vA Darmaparam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 68). atra ca jAtyAkftivyaktizu tisfzu ekEva Saktiriti boDanArTaM padArTaH ityekavacanam iti sAMpradAyikAH. navyAstu jAtivyaktayoreva (jAtiviSizwavyaktO) ekaSaktiprAtyarTaM sOtramekavacanam. AkftirUpaM tu saMsTAnaM<BR>;p{0463}<BR>pfTageva Sakyam ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0) (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 68) (di0 4 pf0 178179). vastutaH AkftipadaM na saMsTAnaparam. kiMtu jAtivyaktyoH samavAyAtmakasaMsargaparameva. karaRavyutpattyA AkAranirUpakArTakatvAt (Sa0 pra0). aTa padArTaviBAgaH pradarSyate (ka) padArTo dviviDaH. BAvaH aBAvaSceti (ki0 va0 1 pf0 8). tatra BAvA dravyAdayaH zaw. aBAvastu prAgaBAvAdiBedena caturviDaH. (Ka) padArTAH sapta dravyam guRaH karma sAmAnyam viSezaH samavAyaH aBAvaH iti (ta0 saM0) (BA0 pa0) (nyA0 ma0) (ci0). ezu saptasu padArTezu gotamoktAnAM zoqaSAnAM (vakzyamARAnAm) padArTAnAmantarBAva itTam. pramARasyendriyAderdravyentarBAvaH. vyAptijYAnAderguRe. prameyasyAtmaSarIrendriyasvarUpasya dravye. arTasya ganDarasarUpasparSaSabdasvarUpasya guRe. budDerguRe. manaso dravye. pravftterguRe. dozARAmicCAdvezamiTyAjYAnasvarUpARAM rAgadvezamohapadapratipAdyAnAM guRe. pretyaBAvasya maraRAnantarajanmano guRe. suKaduHKasaMvedanasvarUpasya muKyaPalasya guRe. gORamuKyasADAraRajanyamAtra svarUpaPalasya dravyAdizu. pIqAlakzaRasya duHKasya guRe. apavargasyAtyantikaDvaMsarUpasyABAve. saMSayasya guRe. sADyatayecCAvizayAtmakasya prayojanasya yaTAyaTaM dravyAdizu. sADyasADanoBayavattAniScayavizayasya dfzwAntasya yaTAyaTaM dravyAdizu. tattacCAtrasidDArTarUpasya