alIlAvatIkArAH. aBAvaSca vaktavyaH niHSreyasopayogitvAdBAvaprapaYcavat. kAraRABAvena kAryABAvasya sarvasidDatvAdupayogitvasidDeH ityAhuH. nyAyAcAryAstu dravyakiraRAvalyAm ete ca padArTAH zaqBAvAH praDAnatayoddizwAH. aBAvastu svarUpavAnapi noddizwaH. pratiyoginirUpaRADInanirUpaRatvAt na tu tucCavat ityaBAvaH saptamaH padArTaH ityaNgIcakruH (vE0 vi0 1. 1. 4). pramARam prameyam saMSayaH prayojanam<BR>;p{0465}<BR>dfzwAntaH sidDAntaH avayavaH tarkaH nirRayaH vAdaH jalpaH vitaRqA hetvABAsaH Calam jAtiH nigrahasTAnam ityete poqaSa padArTAH iti gOtamapraDAnA nEyAyikA AhuH. prakftirvikftiruByamanuBayamiti Bedena catvAraH padArTAH saMkalanayA paYcaviMSatiH iti sAMKyAH pAtaYjalAScAhuH. tutAtaBawwamatAnuyAyinAM mate dravyaguRakarmasAmAnyarUpAScatvAra eva padArTAH. prABAkaramate dravyaguRakarmasAmAnyasaMKyAsamavAyasAdfSyaSaktayaH ityazwO padArTAH (vE0 vi0) (pa0 mA0)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0462" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

