परत्वम्
paratvam — 1 (guRaH) [] parABiDAnapratyayanimittam. tattu dviviDam. dikkftam kAlakftaM ca. tatra dikkatam digviSezapratyAyakam. kAlakftaM ca vayoBeda pratyAyakam (praSasta0 pf0 20). krameRodAharaRaM yaTA gaRqO kapolO tatpare hanU (amaraH 2. 6. 90) ityAdO paraSvastatparehani (amaraH 3. 4. 22) ityAdO ca. atra sUtram ekadikAByAmekakAlAByAM saMnikfzwaviprakfzwAByAM paramaparaM ca (vE0 7. 2. 21) iti. paratvasya lakzaRaM ca paravyavahArajanakatAvacCedakatAdfSaprakAratASrayatvam (vAkya 0 1 pf0 8). atra navyAH bahutara pradeSa saMyogAntaritatvarUpaviprakfzwatvabahutarasUrya parispandAntaritajanyatvarUpajyezWatvAByAM dESikakAli59<BR>;p{0466}<BR>kaparatvavyavahArasyotpatterna paratvasya guRAntaratvamityAhuH (di0 gu0 pf0 209). vastutastu viprakfzwatvajYAnAtparatvamutpadyata iti viprakfzwatvAtparatvaM Binnameveti vESezikasUtrAt (7. 2. 21) pratiBAti. [Ka] paratvatvajAtimat. paravyavahArAsADAraRakAraRam. paratvaM dviviDam. dikkftam kAlakftaM ca. taTA ca paravyavahAro dviviDaH. yaTA ayaM jyezWaH ayaM dUraH iti (vAkya 0 1 pf0 8). tatra dUrasTe dikkataM paratvam. jyezWe kAlakftaM paratvam (ta0 saM0). yo yadapekzayA dUrasTaH tatra tadavaDikaM paratvaM dikkftam. atra dipiRqasaMyogosamavAyikAraRam. dUratvajYAnaM nimittam. tannASaSca tannASanimittam. yo yadapekzayA jyezWaH tatra tadavaDikaM paratvaM kAlakftam. atra kAlapiRqasaMyogosamavAyikAraRam. jyezWatvajYAnaM nimittam. tannASaSca tannASanimittam iti (ta0 kO0 pf0 6). dikftaM paratvaM mUrtamAtravftti Bavati. kAlakftaM paratvaM tu janyadravyamAtravftti BavatIti jYeyam (si0 ca0 1 pf018) (ta0 kO0 ? pf0 6). atredaM boDyam. dikftatvaM ca jYAyamAnadigjanyatvam. taTAhi vErAjAdveRAsaMgamApekzayA karahAwakaM svasamavAyisaMyuktasaMyogena bahutaradeSasaMyogavat iti jYAnena dESikaparatvam utpadyate. tacca idamasmAdviprakfzwam ityapekzAbudDyA jAyate (di0 1). tatra ca saMbanDaGawakatayA diSaH praveSAttajjanyatvaM boDyam (vAkya0 1 pf08). evam pAwaliputrAt kASImapekzya prayAgaH paraH JaLakIgrAmAdvijayapuramapekzya kfzRAnadI parA ityatrApi jYeyam. kAlakftatvaM ca svasamavAyisaMyuktasaMyogasaMbanDena ravikriyA prakArakajYAnavizayakAlajanyatvAt tatsaMbanDaGawakakAlajanyatvarUpam svasaMyogajanyatvarUpaM vA (vAkya 0 1 pf0 8). tacca ayamasmAdbahutarakAlasaMbadDaH ityapekzAbudDyA janyate (di0 1). bahutara divAkara kriyAviSizwaSarIrajYAnAtkAlikaparatvotpattiriti (si0 ca0). yaTA rAmo lakzmaRApekzayA jyezWa ityAdO lakzmaRasya sUryaparispandApekzayA rAmasya sUryaparispandA aDikAH iti rAmo jyezWaH. viSezastu anyatra (vE0 u0 7. 2. 21) drazwavyaH. tatra dikkftasyotpattiraBiDIyate. ekasyAM diSyavasTitayoH piRqayoH saMyuktasaMyogabahvalpaBAve satyekasya aTavA<BR>;p{0467}<BR>drazwuH saMnikfzwamavaDiM kftvA tasmAdviprakfzwoyam iti paratvADAre viprakfzwA budDirutpadyate. tatastAmapekzya pareRa dikpradeSena saMyogAtparatvasyotpattiH. viprakfzwaM cAvaDiM kftvA parasmAt saMnikfzwoyam ityaparatvADAra itarasmin saMnikfzwA budDirutpadyate. tAmapekzyApareRa digdeSena saMyogAdaparatvasyotpattiH (praSasta0 pf0 2021). atra dviviDayoH paratvAparatvayornASakopekzA budDinASaH iti muktAvalIkAra Aha. upaskAre tu triviDakAraRanASasyEva paratvAparatvanASakatvamuktam (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 21). nASo dESikayorjYeyaH saptaDA SAMkare mate. nimittasya vinASAdvAsamavAyina[^1] eva vA.. samavAyivinASAdvA nimittAsamavAyinoH. nASAdvApi vinASAdvA nimittasamavAyinoH.. nimittaBinnayorvApi nASAtkAraRayoH kvacit. vinASAdapi sarvezAM hetUnAmekadEva vA.. iti (ta0 va0 210). aTa paratvAparatvayoH kAlakftayorutpattiraBiDIyate. vartamAnayoraniyatadigdeSa saMyuktayoryuvasTavirayo rUQaSmaSrukArkaSyavalIpalitAdisAMniDye satyekasya drazwuryuvAnamavaDiM kftvA sTavire viprakfzwA budDirutpadyate. tatastAmapekzya pareRa kAlapradeSena saMyogAtparatvasyotpattiH. sTaviramavaDiM kftvA yUni saMnikfzwA budDirutpadyate tadA tAmapekzyApareRa kAlapradeSena saMyogAdaparatvasyotpattiH (praSasta0 pf0 21). idaM ca boDyam. triDA kAlikayornASaH samavAyivinASataH. nimittanASato vAByAmuBAByAM vApi kutracit.. nimittamAtranASena tannASaH kasyacinmate iti (ta0 va0 211). vinASastvapekzAbudDisaMyogadravyanASAt iti praSastapAdAcAryAH (praSasta0 pf0 21). 1 apekzA budDivinASAt 2 saMyogavinASAt 3 dravyavinASAt 4 dravyApekzAbudDyoryugapadvinASAt 5 dravyasaMyogavinASAt 6 saMyogApekzAbudDyoryugapadvinASAt 7 trayARAM samavAyyasamavAyinimittAnAM vinASAcceti tadarTaH. taTAhi. 1 utpanne paratve yasminkAle sAmAnyabudDirutpannA Bavati tatopekzA budDirvinaSyattA sAmAnyajYAnatatsaMbanDeByaH paratvaguRabudDerutpadyamAnatetyekaH kAlaH. tatrApekzAbudDe<BR>;p{0468}<BR>vinASo guRabudDeSvotpattiH. tatopekzAbudDivinASAdguRasya vinaSyattA guRajYAnatatsaMbanDeByo dravyabudDerutpadyamAnatetyekaH kAlaH. tatra dravyabudDerutpattirguRasya vinASaH iti. 2 saMyogavinASAdyaTA. apekzAbudDisamakAlameva paratvADAre karmotpadyate. tatkarmaRA dikUpiRqaviBAgaH tadEva ca paratvasyotpattirityekaH kAlaH. tataH sAmAnyabudDerutpattiH dikpiRqasaMyogasya vinASaH. tato yasminkAle guRabudDirutpadyate tasminneva kAle dipiRqasaMyogavinASAdguRasya vinASaH. 3 dravyavinASAdapi yaTA paratvADArAvayave karmotpannaM yasminneva kAlevayavAntarAdviBAgaM karoti tasminneva kAlepekzA budDirutpadyate. tato viBAgAdyasminneva kAle saMyogavinASastasminneva kAle paratvamutpadyate. tataH saMyogavinASAddravyavinASaH. tadvinASAcca tadASritasya guRasya vinASaH. 4 dravyApekzAbudDyoryugapadvinASAdapi yaTA yadA paratvADArAvayave karmotpadyate tadEvApekzA budDirutpadyate. karmaRA tadavayavAntarAdviBAgaH tadEva ca paratvasyotpattirityekaH kAlaH. tato yasminneva kAle viBAgAtsaMyogavinASastasminneva kAle sAmAnyabudDirutpadyate. tadanantaraM saMyogavinASAdravyavinASaH sAmAnyabudDerapekzAbudDinASa ityekaH kAlaH. tato dravyApekzAbudDyorvinASAtparatvasya vinASaH. 5 dravyasaMyogavinASAdapi yaTA yadA paratvADArAvayave karmotpannamavayavAntarAdviBAgaM karoti tasminneva kAle piRqakarmApekzAbudDyoryugapadutpattiH. tato yasminneva kAle paratvasyotpattistasminneva kAle avayavaviBAgAddravyAramBakasaMyogavinASaH piRqakarmaRA dipiRqaviBAgaSca kriyate. tato yasminneva kAle sAmAnyabudDirutpadyate tatsamAnakAlamavayavasaMyogavinASAt piRqavinASaH dipiRqaviBAgAca piRqasaMyoganASaH. tato guRabudDisamAnakAlaM piRqadipiRqasaMyogayorvinASAt paratvasya vinASaH. 6 saMyogApekzAbudDyoryugapadvinASAdapi yaTA yadA paratvamutpadyate tadA paratvADArakarma. tato yasminneva kAle paratvasAmAnyabudDirutpadyate tasminneva kAle piRqakarmaRA dipiRqaviBAgaH kriyate. tataH sAmAnyabudDitopekzAbudDinASo viBAgAcca dipiRqasaMyogavinASa ityekaH kAlaH. tataH saMyogavinASAdapekzAbudDinASAtparatvasya vinASaH.<BR>;p{0469}<BR>7 trayARAM samavAyyasamavAyinimittAnAM vinASAdapi yaTA yadApekzAbudDirutpadyate tadEva piRqAvayave karma. tato yasminneva kAle karmaRAvayavAntarAdviBAgaH paratvasyotpattiH tasminneva kAle piRqepi karma. tato viBAgAt piRqAramBakasaMyogavinASaH piRqakarmaRA ca dikpiRqaviBAgaH tadEva sAmAnyabudDeSvotpattirityekaH kAlaH. tataH saMyogavinASAt piRqanASaH. viBAgAcca dipiRqasaMyogavinASaH. sAmAnyajYAnAdapekzAbudDervinASaH ityataH yugapatrayARAM samavAyyasamavAyinimittAnAM vinASAt paratvasya vinASaH iti (praSasta 0 pf0 2123). 2 [ka] pratipAdakecCAvizayatvam (ci0). tacca SAbdaboDaprayojakaM tAtparyAparaparyAyam. yaTA hariSabdaH siMhaparaH ityAdI. yaTA vA sEnDavamAnayetyAdO Bojanasamaye sEnDavapadasya lavaRaparatvam ityAdO. [Ka] tatpratItIcCayoccaritatvam (ci0 1) (mU0 ma0). yaTA yatparaH SabdaH sa SabdArTaH ityAdO. 3 aDikadeSavfttitvam vyApakatvaM vA. yaTA sAmAnyaM dviviDaM proktaM paraM cAparameva ca (BA0 pa0 Slo0 8) ityAdO sattAyA dravyatvamapekzya dravyatvAdeSca pfTivItvAdyapekzya vyApakatvAt paratvam (mu0 1 pf0 34). 4 sUkzmatvam. yaTA paraM vA truweH (gO0 4. 2. 15) ityAdO truwimapekzya paramARoH paratvam. 5 Binnatvam. 6 SrezWatvam. yaTA dve brahmaRI veditavye paraM cAparam (SrutiH) ityAdO. 7 brahmaRa AyuHkAlaviSezaH iti pOrARikA AhuH. atroktam. nijena tasya mAnena cAyurvarzaSataM smftam. tatparAKyaM tadarTaM ca parArDamaBiDIyate.. trIRi kalpaSatAni syustaTA zazwirdvijottamAH. brahmaRaH kaTitaM varzaM parAKyaM tacca yatpadam.. iti (kUrma0 a0 5) (vAca0). 8 Satrutvam iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR>asamavAyinaH iti padacCedaH.<BR><a href="ht