परमाणुः
paramARuH — 1 mUrtatve sati niravayavaH (ta0 kO0). sa ca janyadravyAvayavaH kriyAvAn atIndriyaH niravayavaH nityaSceti nEyAyikavESezikARAM sidDAntaH. atra sUtram na pralayoRusadBAvAt (gO0 4. 2. 14) iti. paramARUnAmutpattiM nASaM ca svIkurvanti kzaRaBaNguravAdino bOdDAH. (di0 1 pfTivI0 pf0 6768). BUtatvAdi paramARorlakzaRamiti sAMKyA AhuH (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 31). nyAyavESezikanaye paramARusadBAve pramARamucyate. jAlasUryamarIcisTaM sUkzmatamaM yadraja upalaByate tat sAvayavam cAkzuzadravyatvAt pawavat iti. tryaRukAvayavopi sAvayavaH mahadAramBakatvAt tantuvat iti. yo vyaRukAvayavaH sa eva paramARuH. sa ca nityaH. kAryatvenavasTAprasaNgAt. asamavetaBAvakAryotpattiprasaNgAcca. taTA ca merusarzapayorapi tulyatvaprasaNgaH iti (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 10) (mu0 1 pf0 6869). paramARuSca paraM vA truweH (gO0 4. 2. 15) iti jYeyaH. bruweH paraM yadatisUkzmaM tatparamARuH. vASabdovaDAraRe. aTavA truweravayavastadavayavo vA paramARuriti vikalpArTo vASabdaH. yadvA truweH paraM sUkzmaM paramARuH. truwAveva vA viSrAmaH iti vikalpoBimataH (gO0 vf0 4. 2. 15). idaM ca navInamatam (di 0 1 pf0 69). avayavaviBAgasyAnavasTAnAddravyARAmasaMKyeyatvAtru winivfttiriti (vAtsyA0 4. 2. 15). sa cAyamalpataraprasaNgo yasmAnnAlpataramasti yaH paramolpastatra nivartate yataSca nAlpIyosti taM paramARuM pracakzmahe iti (vAtsyA0 4. 2. 14). yaTA jAlasUryamarIciraTaM yatsUkzmaM dfSyate rajaH. tasya zazWatamo BAgaH paramARuH sa ucyate.. iti (vAkya 0). caramastu viSezARAmanekAsaMyutaH sadA. paramARuH sa vijYeyo nfRAmEkyaBramo yataH.. iti bAdarAyaRAcAryA AhuH (BAga0 3. 12. 1). 2 paramARvavacCinnakAlaviSezaH. yaTA sa kAlaH paramARurvE yo BuNkte paramARutAm (BAga 0 3. 11. 5) ityAdO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0470" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमात्मा
paramAtmA — (AtmA) [ka] sarvasya drazwA sarvasya BoktA sarvajYaH sarvAnuBAvI (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 9). paramatvaM cAtra prakfteH sfzwisTitilaya<BR>;p{0471}<BR>kartftvam (si0 ca0 1 pf0 10). aTavA nityajYAnAdimattvena. sarvotkfzwatvam (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 4). ISvarasya tajjYAnAdernityatvamitTam. sargAdyavasare paramARunA vyaRukaM karizyAmi iti jYAnasyAvaSyakatvena tadutpAdakaSarIrAdikAraRakalApasya tadAnIM vyatirekeRa tasya nityatvamurarIkurmaH. evam ISvarecCAkftyorapi nityatvam (si0 ca0 1 pf0 10). paramAtmalakzaRaM ceSvaratvam. tacca nityajYAnAdyaDikaraRatvam (ta0 dI0) (si0 ca0 1 pf0 10) (rAma 0).. atrAdiSabdenAnando gfhyate. kecittu SrutisTAnandapadaM duHKABAvaparam ityAhuH. paramAtmasattve pramARam anumAnam. tacca kzityaNkurAdikaM kartfjanyaM kAryatvAdBavat iti. kzityAdimahAkAryAnyaTAnupapattyA sa svIkriyate (pra0 pra0). taduktam. kAryAyojanaDftyAdeH padAt pratyayataH SruteH. vAkyAtsaMKyAviSezAcca sADyo viSvavidavyayaH.. iti (ku0 5. 1). saMjYAkarma tvasmadviSizwAnAM liNgam. pratyakzapravfttatvAt saMjYAkarmaRaH (vE0 sU0 2. 1. 1819). tadarTaM cAha. kzityaNkurAdikaM kAryaM svargA pUrvAdi nAma ca. liNgamISvarasadBAve kARAdAH saMpracakzate.. (ta0 va0 A0 Slo0 97 pf0 155). aDikaM tu nyAyakandalyAm anumAna cintAmaRyAdO ca drazwavyam. kiMca sargAdO vyavahArAnyaTAnupapattireveSvarasattve mAnam. yaH sarvajYaH ekaH sa eva na cAsmAkamISvaraH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 5) (si0 ca0 1 pf011). atra dyAvABUmI janayan deva ekaH viSvasya kartA Buvanasya goptA yaH sarvajYaH sa sarvavidyasya jYAnamayaM tapaH ityAdyA AgamA api pramARatvenAnusaMDeyAH. atra kAryotpAdane mataBedAH pradaSyante. SarIramantareREvevareRa mantrAdivatkAryotpAdanam iti kecinnEyAyikAH saMgirante. atra 1. sUtrARi ISvaraH kAraRaM puruzakarmAPalyadarSanAt. na puruzakarmABAve PalAnizpatteH. tatkAritatvAdahetuH (gO0 4. 1. 1921) ityAdIni. SarIrahetvadfzwABAvAtparamAtmA SarIrarahita evAsti. anye tu nEyAyikA itTamAhuH. paramAtmA SarIrI. puruzAdfzwena kAntASarIrasyevAsmadIyAdfzwena<BR>;p{0472}<BR>tacCarIrasya (icCAprayuktasya) jananasaMBavAt. ata eva caturBujatvAdiSravaRaM saMgacCate iti. paramARava eveSvarasya SarIramiti kecidAhuH. AkASameva SarIramityapare manyante. ISvaraH sargAdO SarIradvayam (prayojyaprayojakavfdDaSarIradvayam) parigfhya vyavaharati iti pare jAnanti. saMsAriRAmadfzwatraSAdISvarasya SarIram tacca brahmavizRuSivAtmam ityanye bruvanti. BUtAveSanyAyeneSvarasya SarIram ityapare menire. ISvaraH SarIrarahita eva. paraM tu saMsArapaNkanimagnAnajYA nina uddiDIrzurlIlAvigrahaM daDAti itItare prajalpanti. jIvA eveSvarasya SarIram iti rAmAnujIyAH. aprAkftaM saccidAnandAdyeva SarIram iti matapravartakEkaSiromaRayo maDvAcAryAH prAhuH. kleSakarmavipAkASayEraparAmfzwo nirmARakAyamaDizWAya saMpradAyapradyotakonugrAhakaSca iti pAtaYjalAH saMjagadire. [Ka] SarIranirapekzajYAnavAn (pra0 pra0). yaTA svargApavargayomargimAmananti manIziRaH. yadupAstimasAvatra paramAtmA nirUpyate.. (ku0 sta0 1 Slo0 2). paramAtmA paraM brahma nirguRaM prakfteH paraH. kAraRaM kAraRAnAM ca SrIkfzRo BagavAn svayam.. (brahmavE0 pu0 aDyAya 23). uttamaH puruzastvanyaH paramAtmetyudAhftaH (gItA 0 15. 17). brahmeti paramAtmeti BagavAniti Sabdyate. (BAga0 1. 2. 11) ityAdO paramAtmA. [ga] nityajYAnAdimAn (ta0 kO0). sa ca guRaviSizwamAtmAntaramISvaraH (vAtsyA0 4. 1. 21). ISvara eka eva (ta0 saM0). mAyAvAdivedAntinastu mAyAvacCinna cEtanyamISvaraH sa eva jIvAnAmupAsyatvena deSitaH ityAhuH. karmEva iti mImAMsakAH samupAsate. vedoktakarmaRaH PaladAteSvaraH iti mImAMsakEkadeSinaH. AdividvAn sidDaH iti kApilAH. lokavedavirudDErapi nirlepaH svatantraH iti mahApASupatAH. nirAvaraRaH iti digambarAH. yAvaduktopapannaH (kartA) iti nEyAyikAH. Siva iti SEvAH. puruzottamaH iti vEzRavAH. pitAmahaH iti pOrARikAH. yajYapuruzaH iti yAjYikAH. viSudDaM cEtanyam iti mAyAvAdinaH. brahmaSabdavAcyaH guRaparipUrRaH vizRuH iti mADvAH. dviBuja;<BR>;p{0473}<BR>kfzRaH iti vallaBIyAH. parameSvaraH iti pAtaYjalAH. budDaH sarvajYo vA iti bOdDAH. arhannityArhatAH. parAKyaH Sabda eva iti SAbdikAH. kAlaH eva iti jyotizajYAH. lokavyavahArasidDa eva paramAtmA iti cArvAkAH. viSvakarmA iti kArava upAsate. tatra nityeSvaraM na manyante sAMKyA AtAcAkASca (ku0 wI0 112). nyAyanaye paramAtmanyazwO guRA vartante. ekatvasaMKyA paramamahatparimARam ekapfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH budDiH icCA prayatnaSceti (BA0 pa0 lo0 34). aparimitA aprAkftA jYAnAnandAdayo guRAH paramAtmani santi iti mADvA jaguH. paramAtmA guRaSUnya eva iti mAyAvAdino manyante.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0470" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमापूर्वम्
paramApUrvam — (apUrvam) [ka] yatra svargAdiPalaM prati darSapUrRamAsAdijanyatvena janakatvam tatparamApUrvam. yaTA darSapUrRamAsAByAM yajeta svargakAmaH ityAdO praDAnaviDiboDitaM darSapUrRamAsAtmakayAgadvayajanyapUrvam (di0 gu0 pf0 235) (ci0) (mU0 ma0). [Ka] kalikApUrvajanyaH svargAdiPalasADanamapUrva viSezaH. atra paramApUrvaM vAcyam kalikA pUrvARi tu kalpyAni iti mImAMsakAnAM sidDAntaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 114). kalikApUrvaM pradarSitaM prAk (pf0 217).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0473" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परमेश्वरः
