परस्मैपदम्
parasmEpadam — (tiN) [ka] laH parasmEpadam (pA0 1. 4. 99). atra vyutpattiH. parasmE paroddeSArTaPalakaM padam iti (aluksamAsaH) (vAca0). parasmEpadaM ca tip tas Ji ityAdi navaviDam. [Ka] kyajantaDAtorarTasya svArTe kartftvenvayaboDanakzamaM yAdfSamAKyAtam tat parasmEpadam. yaTA putrIyatItyAdO parasmEpadam (tip). GAtitA GAtitArO ityAdO AtmanepadAnAM niruktAKyAtatvepi tadanyatvena viSezaRAnna tatrAtivyAptiH. atra putrIyatItyAdAveva putrAdIcCAkartftva<BR>;p{0474}<BR>mASrayatvalakzaRaM boDyate na tu putrIyate ityAdO. icCArTasya kyaco niveSAditi jYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 98 wI0). atra viSezastu AtmanepadavyAKyAnAvasara uktaH iti nAtra kaTyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0473" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराजयः
parAjayaH — 1 yudDanivfttiH. yaTA raRAt parAjayate ityatra DAtvarTaH. atra paYcamyarTo dvezaH. taTA ca raRagocaradvepajanyayudDanivfttimAn ityevaM tatra voDaH. kftyasADyatvaDIprayuktapravfttyaBAvavattvam iti kecidvadanti. atrArTe raRAtparAjayata ityatra paYcamyarTo viSezyatvam. tacca DAtvarTEkadeSe budDAvanveti. taTA ca raRaDarmikasvakftyasADyatvaDIprayuktapravfttyaBAvavAn ityAkAra ko voDaH iti. atredaM boDyam. SatruM parAjayate ityAdO tvaBiBavahetuvyApAraH parAjerarTaH iti DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAlitayA SatrupraBfteH karmatvameveti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0 pf0 81). 2 asahizRutA. yaTA kfzRAtparAjayate SiSupAlaH aDyayanAtparAjayate bAlaH ityAdO parAjerarTaH. asahizRutA ca dvezaviSezaH. aBiBavASakyatvajYAnaM vA. atra paYcamyAH karmatvamarTaH. SrIkfzRam aDyayanam na sahate iti vivaraRAt. AKyAtasyASrayatvamarTaH. taTA ca kfzRAtparAjayate SiSupAla ityAdO SrIkfzRavizayakABiBavASakyatvajYAnavAn SiSupAlaH iti aDyayanAtparAjayate bAla ityAdO tu aDyayanavizayakABiBavASakyatvajYAnavAnbAlaH iti krameRa boDaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0474" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराप्रकृतिः
parAprakftiH — vikArApagame satyaM subarga kuRqale yaTA. vikArApagamo yatra tAmAhuH prakftiM parAm.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 309 sAMKya0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0474" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परामर्शः
parAmarSaH — 1 [ka] vyApyasya pakzavfttitvaDIH (BA0 pa0 2 Slo069). vyAptiviSizwasya hetoH pakzeRa saha vESizwyAvagAhijYAnamityarTaH (mu0 2 pf0 136). ayaM ca parAmarSaH anumitikAraRam tftIyaM liNgajYAnamityucyate. atrAyaM kAryakAraRaBAvaH. tadvattAjYAnaM prati tadvyApyavattAjYAnaM kAraRam. tadDarmAvacCinnaviDeyakAnumitO tadDarmAvacCinnavyApyavattAjYAnaM kAraRam iti yAvat (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 33).<BR>;p{0475}<BR>atredamatraDeyam. vahnivyApyaDUmavAn parvataH iti SAbdaparAmarSAnuroDena vyAptiviSizwavESizwayAvagAhijYAnatvenEva (vyAptiprakArakapakzaDarmatAjYAnatvena) parAmarSasyAnumitikAraRatvamaNgIkAryam. na tu mImAMsakamatamanuruDya vyApyatAvacCedakaprakArakapakzaDarmatAjYAnatvena kAraRatvaM svIkAryam iti (ci02 pf0 34) (mu0 2 pf0 137138) (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 48). atredamaDikaM boDyam. parAmarSa evAnumitO kAraRam. na tu parAmfSyamAnaM liNgam. atItAnAgataDUmAdijYAnepyanumitidarSanAt. tadAnIM liNgABAvAdanumityanupapattiH iti (ci0 2 pf0 4344) (mu0 2 pf0 135136). [Ka] vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnam. yaTA parvate DUmena vahnisADane vahnivyApyaDUmavAnayaM parvataH iti jYAnam. (ta0 saM0). atra vigrahaH. vyAptiviSizwaM (vyAptiprakArakam) yat pakzaDarmatAjYAnam iti. tAvatpadArTAnAM taTAviDaparasparopaSlezAvagAhitvamAtraM vivakzitam (dIDi0 2 pf0 5) (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 13) (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 20). kecittu vyAptiviSizwaM ca pakzaDarmaSceti dvandvASrayaRAvyAptiviSizwatva pakzaDarmatvAvagAhijYAnatvaM laByate. padArTayoraBedepi padArTatAvacCedakaBedenEva pramARaprameyetyAdisUtrenyatra ca dvandvadarSanAt. viSizwapadasya DarmaparatayA vA vyAptivESizwayapakzaDarmatayorlABAt ityAhuH (dIDi0 2 pf0 4). karmaDArayaSca vyAptiviSizwaM ca tat pakzaDarmatAjYAnaM ca iti. atra viSizwapadasya prakAratAnirUpakaparatvAt pakzaDarmatAyA jYAnam ityatra zazWayA vizayatvaboDanAt pakzaDarmatApadasya saMbanDArTakatvAt karmaDArayasamAsena samasyamAnapadArTayoraBeda saMsargalABAcca vyAptiprakArakABinnaM yat pakzasaMbanDavizayakajYAnam tat parAmarSaH iti laByate (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 13). anye tu vESizwyaM vizayatA. pakzaDarmaH pakzasaMbanDI. tasya BAvaH pakzaDarmatA. pakzasaMbanDa iti yAvat. tasyA jYAnam. vyAptiviSizwaM ca tat pakzaDarmatAjYAnaM ceti karmaDArayaH. pakzaDarmatAvizayitAviSizwe vyAptivizayitABAne tannirUpitavizayatayorapi paraMparayA nirUpyanirUpakaBAvaH saMbanDo BAsata iti vyAptivizayatA<BR>;p{0476}<BR>nirUpita saMbanDavizayatAnirUpitapakzatAvacCedakAvacCinnavizayatAnirUpakajYAnaM laByate. jYAnapadaM niScayaparam. vyAptivizayatAnirUpita vizayatA ca vyAptiGawakapadArTavizayatAnirUpitA boDyA. tena BramapramAsADAraRyanirvAhaH iti (vAkya 0 2 pf0 13) ityAhuH. atra vyAptiviSizwe pakzaDarmatA vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatA tajjYAnam iti saptamItatpuruzANgIkAre vyaBicAriliNgakAnumitO DUmavAnvahnerityAdO vyAptiviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnajanyatvABAvenAvyAptiH. ataH vyAptiviSizwapadasya vyAptivizayaketyarTamavalambya jYAnAntapadena karmaDArayoNgIkAryaH (nIla0 2 pf0 20) (dIDi0 2 pf0 4). atredaM boDyam. anumitO vyAptijYAnaM karaRam. parAmarSo vyApAraH. taTAhi. yena puruzeRa mahAnasAdO DUme vahnervyAptigfhItA paScAt sa eva puruzaH kvacitparvatAdAvavicCinnamUlAmaBraMlihAM DUmaleKAM paSyati. tadanantaraM DUmo vahnivyApyaH ityevaMrUpaM vyAptismaraRaM tasya Bavati. tasmAcca vahnivyApyaDUmavAnayam iti jYAnaM Bavati. sa eva parAmarSaH ityucyate. tadanantaram parvatoyaM vahnimAn iti jYAnaM jAyate. tadevAnumitiH iti (mu0 2 pf0 135) (ta0 BA0 pramARa 0 pf0 11). parAmarSo dviviDaH pakze vyApyaH iti pakzaprakArako vyApyaviSezyakaH pakzo vyApyavAn iti pakzaviSezyako vyApyaprakArakaSca. tatrAdyo yaTA parvate vahnivyApyo DUmaH iti jYAnam. dvitIyo yaTA vahnivyApyaDUmavAn parvataH iti jYAnam. atredaM boDyam. pakze vyApyaH iti parAmarSAt pakze sADyam ityAkArikAnumitirutpadyate. pakzo vyApyavAn ityAkArakaparAmarSAttu pakzaH sADyavAn ityAkArikAnumitirutpadyate iti prAco nEyAyikA AhuH. navyanEyAyikAstu dviviDAdapi parAmarSAt pakzaH sADyavAn ityAkArikA pakzamuKyaviSezyikEvAnumitirutpadyate iti prAhuH (mu0 2 pf0 136). 2 vivecanam. tacca yuktyA SrutArTAvaDAraRam iti kecidAhuH. 3 gurutrAkyatAtparyanirRAyako vicAraH (sAM0 pra0 BA0 4. 17). yaTA nopadeSaSravaRepi kftakftyatA parAmarSAdfte virocanavat (sAM0 sU0 a0 4 sU0 17) ityAdO iti sAMKyA AhuH..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0474" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परार्थानुमानम्
parArTAnumAnam — (anumAnam) 1 [ka] nyAyaprayojyAnumAnam (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 15) (ci0 2 pf0 76). yaTA parasamavetAnumitikaraRaM liNgaparAmarSaH parArTAnumAnam. atra parasya maDyasTasyArTaH. prayojanaM sADyAnumitirUpaM maDyasTasaMSayanivfttirUpaM vA yasmAt iti vyutpattirdrazwavyA (nIla0 2 0 21). [Ka] yena paraM pratipAdayati tat parArTAnumAnam iti (nyA0 vi0 pari0 2 pf0 21). [ga] paYcAvayavenEva vAkyena saMSayitaviparyastAvyutpannAnAM parezAM niScitArTapratipAdanaM parArTAnumAnaM vijYeyam. aTAvayavAH punaH pratijYApadeSanidarSanAnusaMDAnapratyAnnAyAH iti (praSasta 0 2 50 28). 2 paYcAvayavavAkyam (nIla0 2 pf0 22). taTA coktam. parArTAnumAnaM SabdAtmakam. svArTAnumAnaM tu jYAnAtmakam (nyAyabindu0 wI0 pa0 2 0 21). ayaM BAvaH tasya SabdAtmakatvepi anumAnavizayatvena avinABAvopanAyakatvena vAnumAnatvam gORam iti vijYeyam. parArTAnumAnaprayojake paYcAvayavavAkye parArTAnumAnaSabdasyEOpacArikaH prayogaH iti (nIla0 2 pf0 22). anena pratipAditAliNgAtparopyagniM vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO pratipadyate (ta0 saM0). yaTA yattu kaScitsvayaM DUmAdagnimanumAya parapratipattyarTaM paYcAvayavopetamanumAnavAkyaM prayuNkte tat parArTAnumAnam (ta0 BA0 2 pramARa0 pf0 11) (ta0 saM0) ityAdO parvatognimAn DUmavattvAt yo yo DUmavAnsa sognimAnyaTA mahAnasaH taTA cAyam tasmAttaTA iti paYcAvayavavAkyaM (pratijYAdi (samudAyaH) parArTAnumAnam (ta0 saM0) (nIla0 2 pf0 22). atra - parasya prativAdinorTo nivfttiryasmAt iti vyutpattirdrazwavyeti kecit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0477" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परावरणम्
