pariRAmaH — 1 jIrRatA (pAkaH) (si0 ca0) (nIla0). yaTA Buktasya pariRAma heturOdaryam tejaH (ta0 saM0) ityAdO. 2 sAMKyAH pAtaYjalASca pariRAmo nAma atrasTitasya dravyasya pUrvaDarmanivfttO DarmAntarotpattiriti<BR>;p{0479}<BR>(vAtsyA0 3. 2. 16). pariRAmastriviDaH prasidDaH. DarmalakzaRAvasTABedAt (sarva 0 saM0 pf0 353 pAta 0). aTavA sato.. dravyasya pUrvaguRanivfttO guRAntarotpattiH (prAdurBAvaH). yaTA payasaH pariRAmo daDi iti (gO0 vf0 3. 2. 16) (vAtsyA0 3. 2. 16). vidyamAnasya kzIrasya pUrvarasatiroBAvomlarasAtmakaguRAntarasyAvirBAvAt iti (gO0 vf0 3. 2. 16). nEyAyikAstu atra pariRAmo vinASa eva BU ityAhuH. yadvA prakfteranyaTABAvo vikAraH. atra anyaTABAvaSca prakftyucCedena prakfterguRAntarADAnena vA. yaTA mfdAderGawAdirUpeRa kAzWAderBasmAdinA (vAca0). yaTA pariRAmatApasaMskAraduHKEH 0 (pAta0 pAda0 2 sU0 15) pariRAmataH salilavat (sAM0 kA0 16) ityAdO ityAhuH. yaTA hi vAridavimuktamudakamekarasamapi tattadBUmivikArAnAsAdya nArikelatAlI bilvacirabilva tindukAmalakakapitTaPalarasatayA pariRAmAt. maDurAmlatiktakawukazAyatayA vikalpate evam ekEkaguRasamudBavAt praDAnaM guRamASrityApraDAnaguRAH pariRAmaBedAn pravartayanti (sAMKya0 kO0 lo0 16). mAyAvAdino vedAntinastu pUrvarUpaparityAge sati nAnAkArapratiBAsaH. yaTA kzIrasya daDipratiBAsaH ityAhuH. mAyAvAdimatetrAyaM viveko jYeyaH. pariRAmo nAma upAdAnasamasattAkakAryApattiH. vivarto nAma upAdAnavizamasattAkakAryApattiH iti (vedA0 pa0 pari0 1 pf0 22). 3 SezaH (antyAvasTA). yaTA pariRAmemftopamam (gItA0 a0 18 Slo0 37) ityAdO. 4 arTAlaMkAraviSezaH ityAlaMkArikA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0478" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

