परिमाणम्
parimARam — (guRaH) [ka] parimARatvajAtimat. tacca navasu dravyezu vartate (ta0 saM0). tatrAkASAdizu caturzu paramamahattvam. paramARuzu paramARutvam. dvyaRuke aRutvam. atonyezu mahattvaM dIrGatvaM ca. hrasvatvaM cARutvasamAnADikaraRam. tatrARuparimARaM paramARO vyaRuke ca tizWati. tatrApi paramARAvaRuparimARaM paramam. viBucatuzwaye mahatparimARaM paramam. trasareRvAdimahAvayaviparyantadravyezu avAntarajanyamahatparimARam (vE0 vi0 7. 1. 8). parimARaM ca mAnavyavahArAsADAraRakAraRam (vE0 vi0 7 118). yaTA SatayojanaScandraH iti jyotiHSAstroktaM parimARam (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 29). mAnavyavahAraSca hastavitastyAdivyavahAraH na tu palasaMKyAdivyavahAraH (vE0 u0 7 118). kiM ca mAnaM parimitiH tasya yo vyavahAraH idaM mahat idamaRu ityAdyAtmakaSca (si0 ca0 1 pf0 17). kiMca mAnavyavahAraH aRutvAdirguRaH iti vyavahAraH (vAkya 0 1 pf0 7). [Ka] yavANgulaprasTAdiBiH guYjAdiBiSca dravyasya paricCedaH. atrocyate. jAlasTArkamarIcigataM rajastrasareRusaMjYam. tadazwakaM likzA. tatrayaM rAjasarzapaH. tatrayaM gOrasarzapaH. te zaw yavaH. tatrayaM kfzRalaH. tatpaYcakaM mAzaH. tadvAdaSakamakzArDam. sa caturmAzikaM suvarRaH. taccatuHsOvarRiko nizkaH iti. dve kfzRale rUpyamAzakaH. te zoq0aSa DaraRam iti. tAmrikaH kArzApaRaH paRaH iti (vizRusmftiH)<BR>;p{0481}<BR>(vAca0). manuyAjYavalkyAdayastu prakArAntareRa parimARagaRanaM cakrire. tatrANgulAdiparimARameva vESezikamate guRaviSezatvena caturviDatvena ca pratipAditam na tu guYjAdiparimARam iti tArAnATatarkavAcaspatirAha. parimARaM dviviDam. mahattvam aRutvaM ca (ta0 va0). prakArAntareRa. taccaturviDam. aRu mahat dIrGam hasvaM ca (praSasta0) (ta0 saM0) (mu0 gu0). tatra aRuhasvaparimARe paramARuvyaRukayoH. mahaddIrGaparimARe tryaRukacaturaRukAdO (pra0 pra0). caturviDamapi pratyekaM dviviDam paramaM maDyamaM ceti. tatra paramARutvaparamahasvatve paramARumanasostizWataH. maDyamARutvamaDyama hrasvatve dvyaRuke tizWataH. paramamahattva paramadIrGatve gaganAdO tizWataH. maDyamamahattvamaDyamadIrGatve GawAdO tizWataH iti (si0 ca01 pf0 17). punaSca caturviDamapi parimARaM dviviDam. nityam anityaM ca. tatra nityagataM nityam. anityagatamanityam. tacca anityam ASrayanASAnnaSyati (cE0 7. 1. 1819) (praSasta 0). anityaM triviDam. saMKyAjanyam parimARajanyam pracayajanyaM ca. tatrAdyam paramARudvitvajanyaM vyaRuke. dvyaRukavahutvajanyaM ca tryaRuke. dvitIyam kapAlaparimARajanyaM GawaparimARam. tftIyam tUlAvayavasaMyogajanyaM tUlapiRqaparimARam (vE0 7. 1. 825) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 110114) (praSasta 0) (si0 ca0 1 pf0 21) (ta0 kO 0). ayaM tUlAvayavasaMyogaSca SiTila ityucyate (BA0 pa0 Slo0 0 113). atrAyaM saMgrahaH. parimARaM caturviDam. aRu mahat dIrGam hraSvaM ca. tatra mahat dviviDam. nityam anityaM ca. nityam AkASakAladigAtmasu paramamahattvam. anityam tryaRukAdAveva. taTA aRvapi dviviDam. nityam anityaM ca. paramARumanaHsu pArimARqalyaM nityam. anityaM vyaRuka eva. kutralAmalakabilvAdizu mahatsvapi tatprakarzaBAvABAvamapekzya BAktoRuvyavahAraH. dIrGatvahasvatve tUtpAdyamahattvARutvEkArTasamavete. samidikzuvaMSAdisvaYjasA dIrGezvapi tatprakarzaBAvamapekzya BAkto hrasvavyavahAraH. anityaM caturviDamapi saMKyAparimARapracayayoni. tatreSvarabudDimapekzyotpannA vyaRukezu bahutvasaMKyA 61<BR>;p{0482}<BR>tErArabDe kAryadravye tryaRukAdilakzaRe rUpAdyutpattisamakAlaM mahattvaM dIrGatvaM ca karoti. bahuBirmahadBirArabDe kAryadravye kAraRamahattvAnyeva mahattvamAraBante na bahutvam. samAnasaMKyErArabDetiSayadarSanAt. pracayastu tUlapiRqayorvartamAnaH piRqAramBakapraSiTilasaMyogApekza itaretarapiRqAvayavasaMyogApekzo vA dvitUlake mahattvamAraBate na bahutvamahattvAni. samAnasaMKyAparimARErArabDetiSayadarSanAt. dvitvasaMKyA cARvorvartamAnA dvyaRuke aRutvamAraBate. mahattvavat tryaRukAdO kAraRa bahutvamahattvasamAnajAtIyapracayeByo dIrGasyotpattiH. aRutvavat dvyaRuke dvitvasaMKyAto hrasvatvasyotpattiH. etaccaturviDamapi parimARamutpadya svADAravinASAdeva vinaSyati iti (praSasta0 pf0 16). upaskArepyuktam. parimARaM caturviDam. mahattvam aRutvam dIrGatvam hrasvatvaM ca. tatra paramamahattva paramadIrGatve viBucatuzwayavartinI. paramARutvaparamahrasvatve paramARuvartinI. avAntarARutvAvAntarahasvatve dvyaRukavartinI trasareRumAraBya mahAvayaviparyantamavAntara mahattvAvAntaradIrGatve. evaM ca sarvARyapi dravyARi parimARadvayavanti. bilvAmalakAdAvaRutvavyavahAraH samidikzudaRqAdizu ca hrasvatvavyavahAro BAktaH. BaktiScAtra prakarzaBAvABAvaH. Amalake yaH prakarza BAvastasyABAvaH kutrale. vilve yaH prakarzaBAvastasyABAva Amalake. sa ca gORamuKyoBayaBAgitvAt BaktipadavAcyaH. atra dIrGatvahrasvatve nitye na vartete ityeke. parimARe eva te na BavataH ityapare. kiMtu aRutvamahattve dve eva parimARe na tu caturDA iti sAMKyA vedAntinacAhuH (vE0 u0 7718). idAnIM parimARakAraRAni parisaMcazwe kAraRabahutvAcca (vE0 7 19). tatra kAraRabahutvaM kevalaM tryaRuke mahattvadIrGatve janayati. mahattvapracayayostatkAraRe aBAvAt. atredaM jYeyam. tacca bahutvaM ISvarApekzA budDijanyam. tadbudDeranekavizayatvepyadfzwaviSezopagraho niyAmakaH iti (vE0 u0 7. 1. 9). evam paramARudvayagataM dvitvaM vyaRuke parimARotpAdakam. dvAByAM tantuByAmapracitAByAmArabDe pawe kevalaM mahattvamevAsamavAyikAraRam. bahutvapracayayostatrABAvAt. yatra ca dvAByAM tUlakapiRqAByAM tUlakapiRqAntarAramBastatra<BR>;p{0483}<BR>parimARotkarza darSanAt pracayaH kAraRam. bahutvasyABAvAt. mahattvasya sattvepi parimARotkarzaM pratyaprayojakatvAt. evaM ca sati yadi mahattvaM tatra kAraRam tadA na dozaH. taduktam dvAByAmekena sarvErvA iti (vE0 u0 7. 1. 9).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0480" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

