परिसंख्या
parisaMKyA — (viDiH) [ka] sarvatra prAptasya kvacidviDiH. taduktaM BawwapAdEH. tatra cAnyatra ca prAptO parisaMKyeti kIrtyate iti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 28). tadarTaSca yatroddeSye yasya viDAnam tadanyasminnapi tatsaMbanDasya tasminvA tadanyasaMbanDasya pravfttitaH prasaktO iti. yaTA paYca paYcanaKA BakzyAH iti. atra sarvezAM paYcanaKAnAM BakzaRe prApte paYcEva paYcanaKA BakzyAH na tvanye iti viDIyate (niyamyate) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 108) (si0 ca0 pf0 33). paYcapaYcanaKAtiriktABakzaRaM viDIyate iti tAtparyam. paYcanaKAstu SaSakaH SallakI goDA KaqgI kUrmaSca paYcamaH iti (si0 ca0 pf0 33) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 108). kecidatrEvamAhuH. ftO BAryAmupeyAdityatrApi parisaMKyEva. tatra ftukAla eva BAryAgamanaM viDIyate. ftvatiriktakAle BAryAgamanasya nizeDAt iti. vastutastu tatra ftukAle BAryAgamanaM kartavyameva iti boDAnniyamaviDireva iti. atrAyaM BAvaH. ftAvupeyAtsvAM BAryAmanyaTA BrURahA Bavet ityAdinindArTavAdabalAt ftO svadAragamanAdyaBAvasya duritahetutvavyavasTityEva tadviDerniyamaparatvaM kalpyate iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 159). [Ka] anyayogavyavacCedaH. yaTA paYca paYcanaKAn BuYjItetyAdO liNA parisaMKyA boDyate. atratyaliNA pratyavAyahetutvaM pratyAyyate. prATamikapaYcapadena lakzaRayA SaSAdipaYcaBinnorTo boDyate. sA parisaMKyA ca paScEva paYcanaKAn BuYjIta ityAkArEva. tena SaSAdipaYcaBinnAnAM paYcanaKAnAM BojanaM pratyavAyahetuH ityeva tatra vAkyArTaH. atra SaSAdipaYcaviDAn paYcanaKAneva BuYjIta ityAkArA parisaMKyA na Bavati paYcanaKaBinnasyOdanAderBojanasya nizidDatve pramARABAvAt iti. atrAyaM BAvaH. SvAviDaM SalyakaM goDAM KaqgakUrmaSaSAM1.<BR>;p{0486}<BR>staTA. BakzyAnpaYcanaKezvAhuranuzwrAMScEkatodataH.. iti manuvacane (a05 Slo0 18) paYcanaKezviti nirDAraRa saptamyA SallakA dipaYcaBinnapaYcanaKAnAM BakzaRasya pratyavAya hetutvam ityarTe lfptatvAt iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 159). evam yAjanADyApanapratigrahErbrAhmaRo DanamarjayedityAdAvapi liNaH parisaMKyEvArTaH. tenAtrApi yAjanAdiBinnErbrAhmaRasya DanArjanaM pratyavAyahetuH iti vAkyArTaH. na kfzyAdyEranApanno brAhmaRo Danamarjayet ityAdivacanErupAyAntareRa viprARAM DanArjanasya pratyavAya hetutvasya sPuwatvAt iti boDyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 159). atrAhuH. yAjanADyApanapratigrahErbrAhmaRo Danamarjayet ityatra niyamaviDireva. taTAhi yatra kriyAyAM vikalpena kArakAnvayaH sa niyamaH. yaTA DanArjane yAjanapratigrahAByAmekasyArjanasyAsaMBavAdekasyAM DanArjanakriyAyAM yAjanAdInAM militAnAmanvayasyAsaMBAvitatayA vikalpenEvAnvayaH. SaSakAdimAMsanirmitasyEkasya piRqasya saMBavAt BakzaRakriyAyAM militAnAmanvayasaMBavaH iti parisaMKyeti BedaH iti (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 108). SabdaSaktiprakASikAkftastu atra yAjanAdyErbrAhmaRo Danamarjayedeva iti na niyamaviDiH. yAjanAdInA DanAnarjane brAhmaRasya pratyavAyASruteH ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 160). [ga] uBayoryugapatprAptAvitaravyAvfttiparo viDiH. yaTA paYca paYcanaKA BakzyA brahmakzatreRa rAGava. SaSakaH SallakI goDA KaqgI kUrmATi paYcamaH.. (lO0 BA0 pf0 42) iti. parisaMKyA dviviDA SrOtI lAkzaRikI ca. tatrAdyA atra hyevAvayanti (SrutiH) iti. tadarTaSca atra prakfte avayanti avajAnanti gAyantIti yAvat (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 42). atrEvakAreRa patramAnAtiriktastotravyAvfttiraBiDIyate iti asyAH parisaMKyAyAH SrotItvam iti vijYeyam (lO0 BA0 pf0 41). dvitIyA paYca paYcanaKA BakzyAH iti (lO0 BA0 pf0 41) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 62). idaM hi vAkyaM paYcAnAM paYcanaKAnAM seDAgoDAdInAM ca na BakzaRaviDAyakam. tasya rAgataH prAptatvAt. nApi tezAM BakzaRaniyamaparam. tezAM ca taditarapaYcanaKAnAM ca BakzaRasya yugapadapi rAgataH.<BR>;p{0487}<BR>prAptatayA pakze aprAptyaBAvAt. kiMtu lakzaRayA pacetarapaYcanaKAnAM SvAviDAdInAM BakzaRanivfttiparam iti Bavati parisaMKyA (ma0pra0 pf0 6162) (lO0 BA0 4 pf0 41). ayaM BAvaH. dozatrayavatI parisaMKyA Bavati. dozatrayaM ca SrutahAniH aSrutakalpanA prAptabADaSceti. Srutasya paYcanaKaBakzaRasya hAnAt aSrutAyAH paSvetarapaYcanaKaBakzaRanivftteH kalpanAt rAgataH prAptasya paYcetarapaYcanaKaBakzaRasya bADanAcca (ma0pra0 4 pf0 62) (lO0 BA0 pf0 41). kecittu itaravyavacCedasya ArTatvaSAbdatvAByAM niyamaparisaMKyayorBedaH. taTAhi. yAjanADyApanapratigrahErbrAhmaRo DanamarjayedityAdO vittArjana upAyatrayasaMbanDasya SabdAtpratItO kfzyAdInAmananvayorTAtsidDayati. yezAmekAnvaye aparAnanvayaH tezAM samuccayAsaMBavAt tatretaropAyavyudAse SabdatAtparyaM kalpyate. paraMtu DUmostIti vAkye vahneriva tasyArTatvam. parisaMKyAyAM tu BakzaRakriyAyAM paYcAnAmapyanvaya saMBavAditarapaYcanaKavyudAso nArTaH. tatra paYcAnAmapi samuccayasaMBavAt. kiMtu SAbdaH. evaM ca BakzyapaYcanaKapadayorviroDilakzaRayA paYcetarapaYcanaKA na BakzyAH iti vAkyArTaH. taTA ca upasTita padArTaparityAgAt anupasTitapadArTakalpanAt aBAvaviDitvAcca niyamApekzayA dozatrayavatI parisaMKyA ityAhuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 109). [Ga] prasaYjakapravfttiviroDiviDiH. yaTA imAmagfBRan raSanAmftasyetyaSvABiDAnImAdatte (tE0 saM0 5. 1. 2). taTAhi. imAmityAdimatrasya raSanAmAtragrahaRaprakASakatayA aSvaraSanAdAna iva gardaBaraSanAyA AdAnepi matrasya viniyogo liNgAdgamyate. taTA ca tadAdAnakAlepi tanmantrapAWapravfttyA tatrApi tanmantra saMbanDaH syAt. etasmAcca viDitaH praTamamaSvaraSanAgrahaRe etanmantraviniyogalABe nirAkANkzatayA gardaBaraSanAgrahaRe na tadviniyogalABa iti etadviDerviDeyasyetaroddeSya saMbanDaprasaYjakapravfttiviroDitA iti (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0485" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षकः
parIkzakaH — [ka] nEsargikaM vEnayikaM budDayatiSayaM prAptaH. parIkzakastarkeRa pramARErarTaM parIkzitumarhatIti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 25). yaTA lOkikaparIkzakARAM<BR>;p{0488}<BR>yasminnarTe budDisAmyam sa dfzwAntaH (gO0 1. 1. 25) ityAdO gotamakaRAdO munI parIkzakO. [Ka] SAstrapariSIlanaprAptabudDiprakarzaH (pratipAdakaH) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 25). vyavahArAdO divyaBedaparIkzAkArakaH parIkzakaH iti vyavahAraSAstrajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0487" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षा
parIkzA — 1 [ka] lakzitasya yaTAlakzaRamupapadyate na vA iti pramAREravaDAraRam. iyaM ca SAstrasya pravfttiH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 2) (ta0 kO0).. pramARAdInAM zoqaSAnAM padArTAnAM tattvajYAnArTaM parIkzA kartavyA (ta0. BA0 pf0 1). [Ka] yaTAvallakzitasyEtalakzaRamupapadyate na vA iti vicAraH (ta0 BA0 pf0 1). [ga] uddeSalakzaRayorupapattyanupapattyanyataraPalako vicAraH (ta0 kO0 pf0 21). [Ga] lakzaRasya sadasadvicAraH (pra0 pra0). yaTA pfTivyA ganDavattvamupapadyate na vA iti vicAraH. 2 pramARatarkAByAM vastutattvAvaDAraRam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0488" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षत्वम्
parokzatvam — 1 sAkzAtkAraBinnajYAnatvam (ci0 1) (ma0pra0 1) (ga0 Sakti0 wI0 pf0 117). yaTA anumityAdInAM jYAnAnAM parokzatvam. pratyakzajYAnaBinnajYAnatvam iti tu vayaM brUmaH. atrAyaM AUM sidDAntaH parokzajYAnamanAhAryameva niScayaSca iti (ga0 hetvA0 sAmA0) (satpra0). atra akzRaH param iti vyutpattiH. parokze liqiti nipAtanAtsADutvam (si0 kO0 pf0 69). 2 parokzajYAnavizayatvam. yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO vahneH parokzatvam. 3 vaktuH sAkzAtkArAvizayatvam. (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 139). yaTA baBUva yogI kila kArtavIryaH (raGu0 sa0 6 Slo0 38) ityAdO liworTaH parokzatvam. vaktfBinnakartfkatvameva parokzatvam iti kecidAhuH (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 139). SAbdikAstu sAkzAtkaromi ityetAdfSavizayatASAlijYAnAvizayatvam ityAhuH. sAkzAtkaromi ityetatpratItisAkzikalOkikavizayatvABAvavattvam ityarTaH. tena papAcetyAdO pratyakzavizayatAsattvepi tAdfSavilakzaRavizayatvABAvavattvamakzuRRam iti na tadanupapattiH iti (vE0 sA0 da0 lakA0 pf0 123124).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0488" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

