पर्यनुयोज्योपेक्षणम्
paryanuyojyopekzaRam — (nigrahasTAnam) [ka] nigrahasTAnaprAptasyAnigrahaH paryanuyojyopekzaRam (gO 0 5. 2. 21). paryanuyojyo nAma nigrahopapattyA codanIyastasyopekzaRam nigrahasTAnaM prAptosi ityananuyogaH. etacca kasya parAjaya ityanuyuktayA parizadA vacanIyam. na Kalu nigrahaM prAptaH svakOpInaM vivfRuyAditi (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 21). [Ka] nigrahasTAnaM prAptavato nigrahasTAnAnudBAvanam. atredaM boDyam. yatra tvanekanigrahasTAnapAta ekatarodBAvanam tatra na paryanuyojyopekzaRam. avasare nigrahasTAnodBAvanatvAvacCinnABAvasyEva tattvAt. nanu vAdinA kaTamidamudBAvyam. svakOpIna vivaraRasyAyuktatvAt iti cet satyam. maDyasTenEvedamudBAvyam. vAde ca svayamudBAvanepyadozaH (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 21). [ga] udBAvanAIparakIyanigrahasTAnAnudBAvanam (nIla0 pf0 46).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0489" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

