पशुः
paSuH — 1 [ka] paSutvasaMbanDI paSuH. sopi dviviDaH sAYjano niraYjanaSveti. tatra sAYjanaH SarIrendriyasaMbanDI. niraYjanastu tadrahitaH (sarva0 pf0 168 naku0). [Ka] anaRukzetrajYAdipadavedanIyo jIvAtmA paSuH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 180 SEtra0). pASupataSAstrajYAstu sarvajIvAnAM paSutvaM manyante. 2 lomavallANgUlavAn (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0). yaTA paSunA rudraM yajate ityAdO mAyAvAdimate CAgAdInAM paSutvam. atra maDvAcAryamatAnuyAyino vEzRavAH samuttizWante. nAyaM sAkzAtpaSuryajYAdO vihitaH. api tu pizwAtmaka havirdravyameva tatra vihitam. pizwapaSoreva SrutismftipurARAdO nirvapaRapratipAdanAt. sAkzAtpaSvAlamBanaM tu kAmyameva. tatra SyenAdivannarakAdya nizwAntarasyApi SravaRAt iti. atra SrutiH pramARam. puruzaM vE devAH paSumAlaBanta ityAdinA puruzAdiByo meDotkramaRamuktvA ta eta utkrAntameDA ameDyAH paSavastasmAdetezAM nASnIyAttamasyAmanvagacCatsonugato vrIhiraBavattadyatpaSO puroqASamanunirvapanti sameDena naH paSunezwamasatkevalena naH paSunezwamasaditi sameDena hAsya paSunezwaM Bavati kevalena hAsya paSunezwaM Bavati ya evaM veda iti (f0 brAhma0 2 Ka0 8). tadAhuH yadeza havireva yatpaSuH (f0 brAhma0 2 Ka0 11) iti ca. smftirapi kuryAdDftapaSuM saNge kuryAtpizwapaSuM taTA. na tveva tu vfTA hantuM paSumicCetkadAcana.. iti (manu0 a0 5 Slo0 37). mahABAratamapi na hi yajYe paSugaRA viDidfzwAH puraMdara. DarmopaGAtakaratveza samAramBastava praBo.. nAyaM Darmakfto yajYo na hiMsA Darma ucyate. AgamenEva te yajYaM kurvantu yadi cecCasi. viDidfzwena yajYena Darmaste sumahAn Bavet. yaja bIjEH<BR>;p{0494}<BR>sahasrAkza trivarzaparamozitEH. eza Darmo mahAYcCaka mahAguRaPalodayaH iti (BAra0 ASva0 a0 91). aparaM ca pizwamAnIyatAmatra paSvarTamiti BAzate. fzaya UcuH. bIjEryajYezu yazwavyamiti vE vEdikI SrutiH. ajasaMjYAni bIjAni CAgaM no hantumarhaTa.. nEza DarmaH satAM devAH kaTaM baDyeta vE paSuH ityAdi (BAra0 SAnti0 mokzaDarme 0). anyatra cedamuktam. idamanyattu vakzyAmi pramARaM viDinirmitam. purARamfziBirjuzwaM vedezu parinizWitam.. pravfttilakzaRo DarmaH prajArTiBirudAhftaH ityAd