पाकः
pAkaH — 1 [ka] vijAtIyatejaH saMyogaH (ta0 BA0) (ta0 dI0) (nyA0 bo0). rUpAdiparAvfttiPalako vijAtIyatejaH saMyogaH ityarTaH (di0 gu0) (vE0 vi0 7. 1. 6 pf0 287). yaTA Atmanikzipte Gawe SyAmarUpAdiparAvfttiPalakognisaMyogaH. atrocyate. sa ca saMyogo nAnAjAtIyaH. taTAhi rUpajanako vijAtIyatejaH saMyogaH. tadapekzayA rasajanako vijAtIyaH. evaM ganDajanakopi. evaM sparSajanakopi taTA. evaMprakAreRa BinnaBinnajAtIyAH pAkAH kAryavElakzaRyena kalpanIyAH 1 (nyA0 bo0 1 pf0 5). gadADara BawwAcAryAScAhuH. rUparasaganDasparSAnAM nASaM prati tu ekajAtIya evAgnisaMyogaH kAraRam iti sparSanAkAle rUpanASa AvaSyakaH iti (ga0 caturda0 lakza0 1 pf0 12). idaM cAtra boDyam. kAraRaguRapUrvakAH pfTivyAM pAkajAH (vE0 7. 1. 6). pAkajA iti. rUparasaganDasparSA ityarTaH. idAnIM prasaNgAtpAkajaprakriyA cintyate. tatra kAryakAraRasamudAya eva pacyata iti piWarapAkavAdino nEyAyikAH AhuH. pIlavaH paramARava evaH svatantrAH pacyante. tatrEva pUrvarUpanASAgrimarUpAdyutpattiH. kAraRaguRa-.<BR>;p{0495}<BR>prakrameRa cAvayavini rUpAdyutpadyate iti pIlupAkavAdinA vESezikAH AhuH. atredaM tattvam. AmapAke nikziptasya GawAderAmadravyasya vahninA nodanAdaBiGAtAdvA tadAramBakezu paramARuzu dravyAramBakasaMyogaviroDiviBAgenAramBakasaMyoganASe dravyanASAvaSyaMBAvaH. dfSyate hi sTAlyAmAhitAnAM taRqulAdInAmapyaDaH saMtApanamAtreRa BarjanAttadAnImeva nASaH. kzIranIrAdInAM cAtyantamulbaRatA. taTA ca AmapAke vahnijvAlAjAlABihatAnAM dravyARAmavasTAnam iti mahatI pratyASA (vE0 u0 7. 1. 6) (ta0 kO0). pArTivaparamARurUpAdInAM pAkajotpattiviDAnamitTam. GawAderAmadravyasyAgninA saMbadDasyAmyaBiGAtAnnodanAdvA tadAramBakezvaRuzu karmARyutpadyante. teByo viBAgAH. viBAgeByo dravyAramBakasaMyogavinASAH. tadvinASeByaH kAryadravyaM vinaSyati. tasminvinazwe paramARuzvagnisaMyogAdOzRyApekzAcCyAmAdInAM vinASaH. punaranyasmAdagnisaMyogAdOzRyApekzAtpAkajAH rUpAdayo jAyante. tadanantaram BoginAmadfzwApekzAdAtmAnusaMyogAdutpannapAkajeztraRuzu karmotpattO tezAM parasparasaMyogAdvyaRukAdikrameRa kAryadravyamutpadyate. tatra ca kAraRaguRapUrvakrameRa rUpAdyutpattiH. na ca kAryadravye rUpAdivinASa utpattirvA saMBavati. api tu paramARuzveva. sarvAvayavezvantarbahiSca vartamAnasyAgninA vyAptyaBAvAt. anupraveSAdapi ca vyAptirna saMBavati. kAryadravyavinASAt iti (praSasta 0 pf0 13). pAkopi rUpAderasamavAyikAraRaM Bavati. tatra ca paramARAveva pAkrAdrUpAdiparAvfttiH nAvayavini iti pIlupAkavAdina AhuH. pIlupAkatrAdimate vijAtIyAgnisaMyogAdAramBakasaMyoganASena dvyaRukaparyantAvayavinASe sati paramARO raktAdyutpattiH. vijAtIyAgnisaMyogAdAramBakasaMyogAnuguRakriyAdyutpattyAramBakasaMyogAdiprakrameRa punarvyaRu kAdimahAvayaviparyantAnAmutpattirBavatIti. piWarapAkavAdimate tu avayavinAM sacCidratayA vijAtIyAgnisaMyogAttezAmapi rUpAdiparAvfttirBavati. na tu tatrAvayavinAM nASaH. pratyaBijYAviroDAt ityAhuH (vE0 vi0 771. 6 pf0 287289). tato.<BR>;p{0496}<BR>tejasA paramARUnAmaBiGAtepi tasya niyamata AramBakasaMyogapratidvandviviBAgajanaka kriyAjanakatve mAnABAvena avayavinyapi pAkasvIkAra ucitaH. ata eva soyaM GawaH iti pratyaBijYA saMgacCate. antyAvayavinASAdya kalpanena lAGavaM ca iti (nIla0 1 pf0 13). dravyAdeH pAkaprakAraBedAdikaM pAkarAjeSvare uktam. yaTA BarjanaM talanaM svedaH pacanaM kvaTanaM taTA. tAndUraM puwapAkaSca pAkaH saMptaviDo mataH.. tatra BarjanaM kevalapAtre. talanaM snehadravye. svedanamasyuttApe. pacanaM jale. kaTanaM sidDadravyarasagrahaRe. tAndUraM dvAravadDataptayatre. puwapAka UrDvADognitApe jYeya iti (vAca0). [Ka] rUpAdiparAvfttijanakatejaH saMyogaH. yaTA taRqulaM pacatItyAdO pacyarTaH pAkaH. atra avayavinyapi pAkANgIkartfnEyAyikamate taRqulaM pacatItyAdO pacaDAtvarTaGawake rUpAdiparAvfttyAtmakaPale taRqulAdivfttitvAnvayaH. odanaM pacatItyAdO tu odanAdipadasya tannizpAdakataRqulAdO lakzaRA. avayavini pAkAnaByupagame vESezikamate tu taRqulaM pacatItyAdO taRqulAdipadasya tadAramBakaparamARuzu lakzaRA (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 43). atra vEyAkaraRamate viSezaH. anena vikledanAyA utpattyanukUlavyApArasya ceti vyApAradvayasya vacanAddikarmakatvam. taRqulAnodanaM pacatItyasya taRqulAn vikledayan odanaM nizpAdayati ityarTaH. duhAditvena gORe karmaRi lakAre ca taRqulA odanaM pacyante iti (vAca0). aDikaM tu dohanaSabde drazwavyam. [ga] rUpAdiparAvfttiPalakatejaH saMyogAvacCinnakriyA. yaTA taRqulaM pacatItyatra pacerarTaH pAkaH. atra pacaDAtvarTanivizwe ca nirukte tejaHsaMyoge taRqulasyADeyatvenAnvayaH. odanaM pacatItyAdO tu taRqulAdAvodanAdipadasya lakzaRA. tatra kriyAyAmanvitamanukUlatvaM dvitIyArTaH ityapi kaScidAha. paramARuM pacati ityapi prayujyata eva. ata eva svatatrAH paramARatraH pacyante iti kiraRAvalyAmAcAryA AhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 72 wI0 pf0 94). atredamavaDeyam. cullIsTAlyAropaRAdikaM hi na pratyekaM pAkapadArTaH. kiM tu sTAlyAropaRAgniniveSanatuzaprakzepAdyanusPowanaparyantastattatkriyAkalApaH<BR>;p{0497}<BR>. yadAha durgaH. kriyata iti kriyA. sA ca pUrvAparIBUtAvayavEva iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 105 wI0 pf0 163). sa ca pAkaH sTAlImArjanADaH saMtApanAdyodanaparIkzAnto vyApArasamUhaH iti (vAca0) [Ga] viklittyanukUlavyApAraH. pAkaH iti SAbdikA AhuH. vilittiH iti maRqanAcArya Aha. 2 rasAsvAdapraBedaH pAkaH ityAlaMkArikA AhuH (pratAparu0). 3 vyaktI - karaRam. SizwaM tu paYcaDAtvarTe drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0494" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

