पाणिनिः
pARiniH — pARininAmakaH prasidDo muniviSezaH. sa ca vyAkaraRaSAstre azwADyAyIrUpasUtrapAWam gaRapAWam DAtupAWam liNgAnuSAsanam SikzAM ceti granTapaYcakaM cakAra. atrocyate. yenAkzarasamAmnAyamaDigamya maheSvarAt. kftsnaM vyAkaraRaM proktaM tasmE pARinaye namaH.. iti. vyAkaraRaSAstraprayojanaM tu niHSreyasam iti. pARinimataM ca sarvadarSanasaMgrahamahABAzyakEyawAdO pratipAditam iti. atra prayojanaM dviviDam. muKyam gORaM ca. tatra muKyaM niHSreyasam. gORaM tu rakzohAgamalaDvasaMdehAH prayojanam iti mahABAzyoktaM (pf0 1) drazwavyam. pAtaH— – 1 patanam. yaTA dfzwipAtaH bARapAtaH sUtrapAtaH ityAdi. 2 jyotirvidastu raviBinnagrahARAM dakziRottarAkarzakaH adfSyarUpaH kAlamUrtirUpaH BacakrasTito jIvaviSezaH ityAhuH (sU0 si0) (vAca0). 63<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0497" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

