पीलुपाकवादी
pIlupAkavAdI — (vESezikaH) pIlavaH paramARavaH. ta eva svatantrAH pacyante. tatrEva pUrvarUpanASAgrimarUpAdyutpattiH. kAraRaguRaprakrameRa cAvayavini. rUpAdyutpadyate iti yo manyate saH (vE0 u0 7. 1. 6). yaTA kaRAdapraDAnAH pIlupAkavAdinaH. aDikaM ca pAkaSabde dfSyam. etanmate ca paramARuzveva pAkaH na vyaRukAdO. Amanikzipte Gawe SyAmaGawanASe 1. paramARuzu rUpAntarotpattO punarvyaRukAdikrameRa raktaGawotpattiH. tatra<BR>;p{0501}<BR>paramARurUpe paramARavaH samavAyikAraRam. tejaHsaMyogaH asamavAyikAraRam. adfzwAdikaM nimittakAraRam iti. vyaRukAdirUpe tu kAraRarUpamasamavAyikAraRam iti ca jYeyam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 13).. ayamASayaH. ativegavatA tejasA paramARUnAmaBiGAtasaMyoge satyavaSyaM tezu kriyA jAyate. tato viBAgaH. tata AramBakasaMyoganASe satyavaSyaM yAvadavayavinASaH. tataH svatatrezu paramARuzu rUpAntarotpattO punaradfzwAdiGawitasAmagrIvaSAtparamARuzu kriyAviBAgAdikrameRa yaTAvasTitamahAvayaviparyantamutpattiH iti (nIla0 1 pf0 13). ayaM BAvaH. Amanikzipte Gawe hutASanasaMyogAtparamARvAdikapAlaparyantAvayavezu kriyA. tataH parasparaviBAgaH. tataH parasparasaMyoganASaH. tataH asamavAyikAraRanASAddravyanASaH iti niyamena SyAmaGawanASe SizwAH paramARavaH pacyante. tatra pAkena rUpAdicatuzwayotpattiH. tataH parameSvareRa sargAdAviva vyaRukAdikrameRa pUrvavadraktaGawo nirmIyate. paramARurUpeRa vyaRukarUpaM janyate ityevaM kramaH. anyaTA Gawasya dfQataratve hutASanapraveSAsaMBavAdrUpAdyutpattirna syAt iti (si0 ca0 1 pf0 16).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0500" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

