prakaraRasamaH — 1 (jAtiH) [ka] uBayasADarmyAtprakriyAsidDeH prakaraRasamaH (gO0 5. 1. 16). tadarTaSca uBayasADarmyAt anvayasahacArAt vyatirekasahacArAdvA. prakriyA prakarzeRa kriyA sADanam. viparItasADanamiti PalitArTaH. tatsidDeH tasya pUrvameva sidDeH iti. bADadeSanABAsoyam (gO0 0 vf0 5. 1. 16). atra BAzyam. uBayena nityena cAnityena sADarmyAt. pakzapratipakzayoH pravfttiH prakriyA. anityaH SabdaH prayatnA- .1 nantarIyakatvAdDawavadityekaH pakzaM pravartayati. dvitIyaSca nityasADarmyAt. evaM ca sati prayatnAnantarIyakatvAditi heturanityasADarmyeRocyamAno na prakaraRamativartate. anativfttestannirRayAnivartanam. samAnaM cEtannityasADarmyeRocyamAne hetO. tadidaM prakaraRAnativfttyA pratyavasTAnaM prakaraRasamaH. samAnaM cEtadvEDarmyepi. uBayavEDarmyAtprakriyAsidDeH prakaraRasama iti (vAtsyA 0 5. 1. 16). [Ka] aDikavalatvenAropitapramARAntareRa bAGena pratyavasTAnam. yaTA SabdaH anityaH kftakatvAdityukte nEtadevam SrAvaRatvena nityatvasADakena bADAt (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 16). [ga] vAdyuktahetoH sADyaviparItasADaka hetvantarodBAvanam. satpratipakzodAharaRamevAtrodAharaRaM boDyam (nIla0 pf0 44). 2 (hetvABAsaH) [ka] yasmAtprakaraRacintA sa nirRayArTamapadizwaH prakaraRasamaH (gO0 1. 2. 7). sUtrArTastu prakfzwaM karaRaM liNgaM parAmarSo vA. ko heturanayoH<BR>;p{0513}<BR>sADakaH etayoH kaH parAmarSaH pramA iti vA yatra jijYAsA BavatItyarTaH. yasmAdityAdi tu vastusTitimAtram (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 7). atra BAzyam. vimarSADizWAnO pakzapratipakzAvuBAvanavasitO prakaraRam. tasya cintA vimarSAtpraBfti prANgirRayAdyatsamIkzaRam. sA jijYAsA yatkftA sa nirRayArTaM prayukta uBayapakzasAmyAtprakaraRamanativartamAnaH prakaraRasamo nirRayAya na prakalpate. prajYApanaM tu anityaH Sabdo nityaDarmAnupalabDeriti. anupalaByamAnanityaDarmakamanityaM dfzwuM sTAlyAdi (vAtsyA0 112. 7). asminnaBiprAye sUtrArTaSca nirRayArTa prayukto heturyatra nirRayaM janayitumaSaktastulyabalena pareRa pratibanDAt kiMtu DarmiRaH sADyavattvam tadaBAvavattvaM veti cintAM jijYAsAM pravartayati sa prakaraRasamaH iti (gO0 vf0 112. 7). prakaraRasamasya lakzaRaM tu tulyabalaviroDiparAmarSakAlInaparAmarSavizayatvam. svasADyaparAmarSakAlIna tulyabalaviroDiparAmarSo vA (gO0 vf0 112. 7) iti. anyatsarvaM satpratipakzavajjYAtavyam. atredaM boDyam. viroDiparAmarSasya ca hetunizWatvam ekajYAnavizayatva saMbanDena jYeyam. anyaTA hetorduzwatvaM na syAt. ayaM ca daSAviSeze dozaH ityataH sadDetorapi viroDiparAmarSakAle duzwatvamizwameva iti (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 7). [Ka] nicanDe tu prakftasADyahetvoH kiM tattvam iti jijYAsAjanikA vyAptipakzaDarmatopasTitiH tadvizayaH (ci0 2 hetvA pf0 97) (ma0pra0 2. 27). atra jijYAsA ca prakftasADyahetvoH kaH samIcInaH ityAkArikA grAhyA (ga0 satpra0 pf0 23). taTA ca anayoH kiM tattvam iti jijYAsEva satpratipakzaPalam iti boDyam (ci0 2 hetvA0 pf0 97) (ga0 satpra0 pf0 22) (ma0pra0 2 pf0 27). tadarTaSca yAdfSaparAmarSasahakAreRa yAdfSaparAmarSasyoktajijYAsAjanakatvaM tAdfSaparAmarSa sahita tAdfSaparAmarSaH iti (ga0 satpra 0 pf0 23). atra ca parvate DUmena vahnisADane parvato vahnivyApyaDUmavAn vahnayaBAvavyApyajalavAn iti parAmarSadvaya saMvalanadaSAyAM prakfto DUmo hetuH satpratipakzitaH iti vyavahniyata ityanuBavamanusftyedaM vijYeyam. [ga] yasya pratipakzaBUtaM hetvantaramasti sa prakaraRasamaH. sa eva 65<BR>;p{0514}<BR>satpratipakza ucyate. yaTA Sabdo nityaH anityaDarmAnupalabDeH iti SabdaH anityaH nityaDarmAnupalabDeH iti ca (ta0 BA0 pf0 49). atra ca viparItArTasADakaM samAnabalamanumAnAntaraM pratipakza ityucyate. yaTA SabdaH anityaH nityaDarmAnupalabDeH iti. yatpunaratulyabalam na sa pratipakzaH. taTAhi. viparItArTasADakAnumAnaM triviDam. upajIvyam upajIvakam anuBayaM ceti. tatrAdyam bADakam. balavattvAt. yaTA anityaH paramARurmUrtatvAditi. asya hetoH paramARusADakAnumAnaM nityatvaM sADayadapi na pratipakzaH. kiMtu DarmigrAhakaM (paramARvAtmakasyAnityatvarUpasADyaDarmiRo grAhakam) pramARaM bADakam. upajIvyatvena balavattvAt. nahi pramARenAgfhyamARe DarmiRi paramARO paramARvanityatvAnumAnamidaM saMBavati. ASrayAsidDeH iti. taTA ca tAratamyapakzakAnumAnaM na samAnabalam. kiMtu aDikavalam iti tat paramARvanityatvAnumAnaM prati bAData eveti na tat pratipakzaH iti BAvaH. paramARusADakAnumAnaM ca aRuparimARatAratamyaM kvacidviSrAntam. parimARatAratamyatvAnmahatparimARatAratamyavat iti (ta0 BA0 pf0 49). dvitIyaM durbalatvAdvADyam. yaTA idamevAnityatvAnumAnaM syAt. tftIyaM tu satpatipakzaH. tulyabalavattvAt iti (ta0 BA0 pf0 49). [Ga] pratirudDaH prakaraRasamaH syAtpratisADanEH (tA0 ra0 Slo0 83). [Na] tulyatvamaByupetyEva parahetoH svahetunA. : bADena pratyavasTAnaM parasya prakriyAsamaH.. (tA0 202 Slo0117).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0512" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

