प्रकृतिः
prakftiH — (SabdaH) [ka] svetaraSabdArTA viSezitasya yAdfSasvArTasyAnvayaboDaM prati svAvyavahitottaratvasaMsargeRa yAdfSaSabdavattAyA niScaya eva. hetuH tAdfSastaTAviDArTe prakftiH. yaTA pawaBUpraBftayo hi SabdAH strottara viBaktyAdyaMSe niScitA eva svopasTApyasya vasanajananAderanvayaM pratyayArTe karmatvakartftvAdO voDayanti na tvanyaTA (aniScitA api). atredaM boDyam. cEtraH pacati yajeta ityAdO SabdAntaraDarmikasubAdiniScayasyAsattvepi<BR>;p{0517}<BR>tadarTasyEkattravartamAnatvAdeScEtrapAkAdAvanvayAt svAvyatrahitottaratvasaMsargeRa tAdfSaSabdavattAyA niScaya eva tadupasTApyayA dfSAnvayaboDaM prati hetuH tAdfSasyEva ca Sabdasya prakfte taTAviDaH svArTaH. sa ca pAketyAdeH SaktyAdivirahepi pacanAdirUpaH suvaca eva. pacanAdeH karmatvAdAvanvayaboDaM prati amAdiDarmikatAdfSaSabdavattAyA niScayasyEva hetutvAt lakzaRasamanvayaH. pratyayAstu padAntarArTAnavacCinnasya saMKyAkAla-izwasADanatva-ityAdisvArTasyAnvayaboDaM pratyaniScitA apyupayujyante iti tatra nAtivyAptiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 6 wI0 pf0 8). [Ka] svopasTApyayAdfSArTasyAnvayaboDaM prati svAvyavahitottaratvasaMsargeRa yAdfSaSabdavattAniScayatvena hetutvam tAdfSa eva SabdastaTAviDArTe prakftiH. bahuguqo drAkzetyAdO bahujAdyarTasyAnvayaboDaM prati na guqAdipadaDarmikabahujAdiniScayatvena hetutvam. api tu subAdiDarmikabahuguqAdipadaniScayatvena. anyaTA kevalAdapi bahuguqAdipadAdrAkzAdO vahujAdyarTasyAnvayaboDApatteH iti na tatra prasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 7 wI0 pf0 1-10). [ga] SAbdikAstu pARinipraBftayaH prAtipadikaM prakftiH ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 13 wI0 pf0 15). [Ga] navyaSAbdikAH nAgojIBawwAdayastu arTAvaboDahetuH pratyayaviDAnAvaDiBUtaH SabdaviSezaH ityAhuH. atrAvaDitvaM ca pUrvAparatvarUpaM grAhyam. tena bahuguqo drAkzetyatra bahujAde - rnimittaprakftO nAprasaNgaH. vastutastu bahuguqo drAkzetyatra prakftipratyayaviBAga eva nAsti iti BAzyakAramatamityanyat. atrArTe vyutpattiH. prakaroti pratyayaM boDaM ca iti prakftiSabdo yogarUQaH (vAca0). atra prakftitvaM ca pratyayaviDAvuddeSyatAvacCedakAkrAntatvam (SeKara0). pratyayaviDAnAvaDitvam vA (la0 ma0). aTavA tadarTAnvitasyArTaboDane tadapekzatve sati tadviDAnAvaDiBUtatvam. iyaM prakftirdviviDA. nAma DAtuSceti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 13). 2 kAraRam yaTA mftpiRqAdDawo jAyata ityAdO mftpiRqaH prakftiH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 108). atra janikartuH prakftiH (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 30) ityanenApAdAnatvam. na<BR>;p{0518}<BR>cAtra hetupaYcamI. guRAtiriktahetO paYcamyanuSAsanavirahAt (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 108). atra guRatvaM ca svaprayojyASrayavfttitvam. tena. vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO DUmasya guRatvaprAtyA viBAzA guRestriyAm[^1] (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 25) ityanena DUmapadAttftIyApaYcamyO saMgacCete (ga0 avaya 0 hetu0. atra samavAyi-asamavAyi-nimitta etatritayasADAraRaM kAraRatvam. na tu samavAyikAraRatvamAtraM vijYeyam. tena daRqAwo jAyata iti prayoga izyate. ata eva yato dravyaM guRAH karma ityAdO paYcamI (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 108). yataH ISvarAt. aTa vA kevalaM samavAyikAraRam (vE0 vi0) (cE0 u0 8. 2. 5). yaTA pfTivI ganDejYAne[^2] (GrARe) prakftiH (vE0 sU0 8. 2. 5) ityAdO. aTavA svajanakanASapratiyogi. yaTA dugDaM daDnaH prakftiH (rAma0 1 pfTivI0 pf0 68). yaTA vA mahApawaH KaRqapawasya prakftiH (mu0 1 pfTivI0). svajanaketyasyArTaSca svam daDi. tasya janako yo nASaH dugDanASaH tasya pratiyogi dugDam tattvaM dugDe iti. evam KaRqapawasya janakIBUto nASaH mahApawanASaH tatpratiyogitvaM mahApawAdO-iti drazwavyam. 3 yAvadASrayaBAviDarmaH. yaTA prakftyA kfpaRaH svaBAvena saralaH ityAdO. atra tftIyArTaScABedastAdAtmyaM vA. evaM ca svASrayADikaraRayAvatkAlavfttikArpaRyavAn ityAkArastatra boDaH. ana prakftyAdiBya upasaMKyAnam (vArtikam) ityanena tftIyA viDIyate (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 93 wI0 pf0 124). 4 svaBAvaH. 5 mImAMsakAstu yatra samagrANgopadeSaH sA prakftiH. yaTA darSapUrRamAsAdirUpapraDAnayAgaH prakftiH (izwyagnihotra somAH prakftayaH) (lO0 BA0 pf0 23) ityAhuH. atredaM boDyam. yatra kartavyaM sarva prakarzeRa karmAntaranErapekzyeRopadiSyate sA prakftiH. yatra viSezarUpameva kartavyaM SrutyopadiSyate itaratsarvaM karmAntarAdatidiSyate sA vikftiH (vAca0). tatrApi mUlaprakftiH avAntaraprakftiH