प्रचयः
pracayaH — 1 [ka] SiTilAKyaH saMyogaH. yaTA yatra dvAByAM tUlakapiRqAByAM pracayayuktAByAM tUlakapiRqAntaramArabDam tatra parimARotkarzadarSanAt SiTilAKyasaMyogarUpaH pracayastAdfSAvayaviparimARasyAsamavAyikAraRam (vE0 vi0 711. 9) (vE0 u0 7. 1. 9) (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 113). atra pracayaScAramBakaH saMyogaH. sa ca svABi14 muKakiMcidatrayavA saMyuktatve sati svABimuKakiMcidavayavasaMyogalakzaRaH. sa tvavayavasaMyogaH svAvayavapraSiTilasaMyogApekzaH parimARajanakaH. guRakarmAramBe sApekzaH iti vacanAt (vE0 u0 7. 1. 9) (ta0 va0). [Ka] kiMcidavayavAvacCedenAvayavAntarAsaMyogini mahatyavayave vartamAnaH saMyogaH ityeke vadanti. anya AhuH. atra mahatpadaM na deyam. paramARusaMyogasya pracayatve kzativirahAt iti. apare tu BUyovayavAvacCedenA<BR>;p{0521}<BR>vayavAntarAsaMyoginyavayave vartamAnaH saMyogaH pracayaH. tena paramARu saMyogo dvyaRukasaMyogo vA na pracayaH ityAhuH (di0 gu0 pf0 205). 2 sAhityam (ki0 0 5). 3 cayanam. yazwyAdinA vfkzAgrasTAnAM puzpARAM pracayaH ityeva (si0 kO0 kf0 pf0 342). atra vyAkaraRaniyamaH. hastAdAne cerasteye (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 40). hastAdAne tu Gan. hastena puzpapracAya ityeva. cOrye tu ac. pracaya ityeva. cOryeRa puzpAdeH pracayaH iti. 4 samUhaH. 5 upacaya iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 6 udAttAnudAttasvariteByo vyatiriktaScaturTaH svara ekaSrutiH. tAM cADyApakAH pracayaH ityAcakzate (jE0 nyA0 a0 9 pA0 2 aDi0 9). prajYAjyotiHBUtendriyajayI yogi viSezaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 384 pAta0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

