प्रतिग्रहः
pratigrahaH — [ka] svasvatva jana kecCArUpasvIkAra viSezaH. yaTA DanaM pratigfhRAtItyAdO DAtvarTaH. atra svasvasvarUpaPale dvitIyArTADeyatvAnvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 43). atra mataviSezo jYeyaH. dAnasyEva svasvatvaDvaMsamitra parasvatvotpatti prati janakatA. pratigrahasya tu na svatvajanakatA. api tu dAnenotpannamapi svatvaM saMpradAnavyApAreRa pratigraheRa yaTezwaviniyogAIM kriyate iti jImUtavAhanamatam (jImUtavA0 dAyaBAga0 vIramitro0 2 pf0 543). atra pramARam manasA pAtramuddiSya ityAdi SAstram. ayaM BAvaH. pratigrahasya svatvajanakatvaM yadi svIkriyeta tadA deSAntarasTaM pAtramuddiSya yadDanaM dadAti tatpAtramaraRAnantaraM tatputrARAM tadDane tatpitfsvatvAnutpattyA svatvABAvena pravfttirna syAt. ataH pratigrahasyApi svatvajanakatvaM nANgIkartavyam iti. videSasTaM pAtramuddiSya tyaktaDane svIkAramantareREva pAtrasya maraRasTale pitfdAyatvena tadDanaM putrAdiBirviBajya gfhyate. anyaTA tErivodAsInErapi tadDanasyAraRya<BR>;p{0523}<BR>1. (kuSAderivopAdAne yaTezwaviniyoge ca pratyavAyo na syAt iti (Sa0 pri0 Slo0 69 wI0 pf0 85). vIramitrodayakArAstu pratigrahAdeva.. svatvamutpadyate. anyaTA pAtraviSezoddeSena tyAge tenAsvIkftepi tatsvatvotpattO parasmE tasya pratipAdanAsaMBavaprasaNgaH ityAhuH (vIramitro0 2 dAya0 pf0 542). [Ka] puRyArTa kadAnajanyasvatvasya janakaH svIkAraH. mamedam iti jYAnamiti yAvat. yaTA GanaM pratigfhRAtItyatra. atra PalIBUta svatvavattayA Danasya karmatvaM saMgacCate. vikrayAderdAna viSezatvepi na.. tasya puRyajanakatvam. atastallabDasya svIkAro na pratigrahaH iti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 72 pf0 109). pratigrahasya svatvajanakatve pramARaM SrutiH yAjanADyApanapratigrahErbrAhmaRo Danamarjayet iti. smftirapi brAhmaRasyADikaM labDam (gOtamaH) iti. tadarTaSca mitAkzarAyAm (a0 2 vyava0 Slo0 114) brAhmaRasya pratigrahAdinA labDam tat aDikamasADAraRam (vIramitro0 2 pf0 543). [ga] dattadravyasvasvatvajanakasvIkAraH. yaTA gAM pratigfhRAtItyAdO (kA0 vyA0 pf0 5). [Ga] SAbdikAstu adfzwArTadattasvIkAraH (la0ma0) ityAhuH. ayAcitavizaye pratigrahe na dozaH. tadu