प्रतिज्ञा
pratijYA — 1 [ka] svakartavyatvena nirdeSaH (rAma 0). kartavyatvaprakArakaboDAnukUlavyApAraH iti paramArTaH. yaTA aTa hetvABAsAstattvanirRayaprayojakatvAnnirUpyante iti mayA tarkasaMgrahaH kriyate ityAdi ca pratijYA. [Ka] kartavyatvajYAnam (rAma0 pf0 2). yaTA kArikAvalIM viSadIkaravARi iti pratijYA. 2 vyavahArajYAstu pakzABiDAyakaH pUrvapakzaBAzAdyaparaparyAyo vAkyaviSezaH pratijYA. sa ca vAkyaviSezaH vyavahArapAdaviSezaH pUrvapAdaH arTipAdaScetyaBiDIyate (vIramitro0 2 vyava0 pf0 60). yaTA mamedaM dravyamanena gfhItaM na dadAti ityAdiH pratijYA ityAhuH.<BR>;p{0524}<BR>BAzA pratijYA pakza iti nArTAntaram (mitAkzarA a0 2 Slo0 6). BAzASabde dfSyam. atra pratijYAlakzaRamAha yAjYavalkyaH. pratyarTinograto leKyaM yaTAveditamarTinA. samAmAsatadardDAharnAmajAtyAdicihnitam.. iti (vIrami0 2 pf0 61). 3 aNgIkAraH iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 4 nyAyAvayavaH. yaTA parvato vahnimAn iti pratijYAvAkyam. pakzajYAnaM pratijYAyAH prayojanam (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 22). lakzaRaM ca pratijYAtvameva. taccAtra hetvaBiDAnaprayojakajijYAsAjanakavAkyatvam. liNgAvizayakaliNgivizayakajYAnajanakanyAyAvayavatvaM (ci0 2 ava0 pf0 77) vA. (itarAnvitasvArTaboDakatve sati svIyaM yadantyaBinnaM padaM tadarTaviSezyakAnvayaboDajanakatve sati nyAyAvayavatvaM vA. aTavA antyapadavattve sati svIyAnantya padArTa viSezya kAnvayaboDAjanakAnyatve sati nyAyAvayavatvam (dIDi0 2 pf0 177). yadvA etanyAyaGawakaH parvato vahnimAn iti yaH SabdaH tadvfttyavayavaviBAjakopADimattvam (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 23). 1 (pratijYAtvaM jAtiH iti kecidAhuH (ci0 2 ava0 pf0 77).. vastutastu pratijYAtvamaKaRqopADireva ityanye AhuH (ma0 pra0 2 pf0 33). pratijYAvAkyaM ca uddeSyAnumitihetuliNga parAmarSaprayojakaSAbdajYAnajanakatve satyuddeSyAnumityanyUnAnatiriktavizayakaSAbdajYAna - janakaM vAkyam. satyantasya prakftanyAyAvayavatvaM paryavasitArTaH. tena prakftanyAya bahirBUtavAkyavAraRam (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 167). evamagrepi boDyam. aTavA uddeSyAnumiti hetuliNgaparAmarSaprayojakaSAbdajYAnajanakatve satyuddeSyAnumitivizayaka liNgAvizayakaSAbdajYAnajanakaM vAkyam (ci0 2 avaya0 pf0 77). sA ca pratijYA [ka] sADyanirdeSaH pratijYA (gO0 1. 1. 33). prajYApanIyena DarmeRa DarmiRo viSizwasya parigrahavacanaM pratijYA. sADyanirdeSaH anityaH SabdaH iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 33). sADanIyasya arTasya yo nirdeSaH sa pratijYA. taTA ca pakzatAvacCedakaviSizwapakze sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwavESizwyaboDako nyAyAvayavaH ityarTaH. sADanIyaSca vahnimattvAdinA parvatAdiH (gO0<BR>;p{0525}<BR>Gf0 1. 1. 33) (dIDi0 2 ava0 pf0 167). [Ka] sADyaDarmaviSizwaDarmipratipAdakaM vacanam (ta0 BA0 pf0 43) (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 22). yaTA parvatapakzakavahnisADyakasTale parvato vahnimAn iti vAkyaM pratijYA. sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnasADya prakArakapakzatAvacCedakA - vacCinnapakza viSezyakaboDajanako nyAyAvayavaH ityarTaH (nIla0 2 pf0 22) (dIDi0). atra nigamanavAraRAya ca sADyAMSe sADyatAvacCedakAtiriktAprakArakatvaM vAcyam. tadarTaSca sADyatAvacCedakaprakAratA vilakzaRaprakAratASUnyatvam. tena prameyavataH sADyatve nAsidDiH. udAsInavAraRAya ca nyAyAntargatatve sati iti viSezaRIyam. nyAyAntargatatve sati prakftapakzatAvacCedakAvacCinna pakzakaprakftasADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnasADya vizayatA vilakzaRavizayatAkatroDAjanakatve sati prakftapakze prakftasADyavoDajanakatvaM tat. pratijYAtvAvayavatvAdikaM pariBAzAviSezavizayatvarUpam tattadvyaktitvarUpaM ca (gO0 pf0 1. 1. 33). udAharaRAcca na pakzatAvacCedakaviSizwe sADyavESizwyajYAnam. upanayAcca na pakzatAvacCedakaviSizwe sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwavESizwyajYAnam iti tayorvyudAsaH (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 167). [ga] anumeyoddeSaH aviroDI pratijYA. pratipipAdayizitaDarmaviSizwasya DarmiRopadeSavizayApAdanArTamuddeSamAtram. yaTA dravyaM vAyuH iti. aviroDigrahaRAt pratyakzAnumAnAgamasvaSAstra svavacanaviroDino nirastA Bavanti. yaTA anuzRogniH iti pratyakza viroDI. Ganamambaram ityanumAnaviroDI. brAhmaRena surA peyA ityAgamaviroDI. vESezikasya satkAryam iti bruvataH svaSAstraviroDI na SabdorTapratyAyakaH iti svavacanaviroDI (praSasta0 2 pf0 28).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0523" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/csl