प्रतिज्ञान्तरम्
pratijYAntaram — (nigrahasTAnam) [ka] pratijYAtArTapratizeDe DarmavikalpAtadarTanirdeSaH pratijYAntaram (gO 5. 2. 3). pratijYAtArTaH anityaH SabdaH EndriyakatvAdDawavadityukte yosya pratizeDaH pratidfzwAntena hetuvyaBicAraH sAmAnyamEndriyakaM nityam iti. tasmiMSca pratijYAtArTapratizeGe. DarmavikalpAditi. dfzwAntapratidfzwAntayoH sADarmyayoge DarmaBedAtsAmAnya<BR>;p{0526}<BR>mEndriyakaM sarvagatam. Endriyakastvasarvagato Gawa iti DarmavikalpAt. : tadarTa nirdeSa iti sADyasidDyarTam. kaTam. yaTA Gawosarvagata evaM Sabdopya sarvagato GawavadevAnitya iti. tatrAnityaH Sabda iti pUrvA pratijYA. asarvagata iti dvitIyA pratijYA pratijYAntaram (vAtsyA05. 2. 3). [Ka] pratijYAtasyArTasya pratizeDe kfte tadrUpaRoddiDIrzayA Darmasya DarmA - ntarasya viSizwaH kalpo vikalpaH tasmAt viSezaRAntaraviSizwatayA pratijYAtArTasya kaTanam (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 3) (tA0 ra0 pari0 3 . lo0 135). pratijYAtArTasyetyupalakzaRam hetvatiriktArTasya iti tattvam. tena udAharaRAntaramupanayAntaraM ca pratijYAntaratvena saMgfhItaM Bavati. atra pratizeDa ityanena Jawiti saMvaraRe trilamvenApi svayaM dUzaRaM viBAvya viSezaRe na dozaH ityuktam (gO vf0 5. 2. 3). [ga] paroktadozoddiDIrzatA pUrvAnuktaviSezaRaviSizwatayA pratijYAtArTakaTanam (di 0 1 pf0 22) (nIla0 pf0 45). yaTA kzityAdikaM guRajanyaM kAryatvAdityatrAdfzwajanyatvena sidDasADanodBAvane savizayaka iti guRaviSezaRadAnam (nIla0 pf0 45). idaM ca pakzasADyaviSezaRaBedAtpratyekaM dviviDam. yaTA SabdaH anitya ityukte DvanO bADena pareRa pratyukte varRAtmakaH SabdaH pakza iti pratijYAntaram. evam parvato vahnimAnsuraBimalinaDUmavattvAdityukte asamarTaviSezaRatvena ca pareRa pratyukte kfzRAgurupraBavavahnimAnityatra. evam tAdfSavahnO sADye yaH suraBimalinaDUmavAn sa vahnimAn ityudAharaRe nyUnatvena pratyukte sa tAdfSa- : vahnimAnityatra. evamanyadapyUhyam (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 3). pratijYAntaraM ca guRentarBavatIti vijYeyam (di0 1 pf0 22).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0525" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target=