pf0 11). taTA ca ISvarapratyakzasya nityatvena na kiMcidapi karaRamasti. jIvapratyakzasya cendriyameva karaRam na kiMcidapi jYAnaM karaRam. evaM coBayoH pratyakzayorjYAnAkaraRakatvamakzuRRameva iti lakzaRasamanvayaH. [ga] sAkzAtkAratvavyaYjakavizayatAviSezavajjYAnam (ga0 satpra0). atra sAkzAtkAratvaM ca sAkzAtkaromi ityanuvyavasAyasAkziko jAtiviSezaH. aTavA janyaDIjanyamAtravfttirmAnasAvfttiryA jAtiH tacCranyajYAnatvam (nyA0 ma0 1. 2 pf0 3) (ma0pra0 pf0 9). Bavati hi janyaM jYAnam (vyAptijYAnam atideSavAkyArTajYAnam padajYAnAdi). tajjanyam anumityupamitiSAbdaboDAdi. tanmAtravfttirmAnasAvfttiSca yA jAtiH anumititvopamititvaSAbda- boDattrAdiH tacCUnyatvaM sAkzAtkAre vartate iti lakzaRasaMgatiH (ta0 pra01 pf0 15). atra padaprayojanAdikaM ca tarkaprakASe savistaraM kaTitam. tacca vistaraBayAnnAtra saMgfhItam. [Ga] prativizayADyAsaH pratyakzam. iti sAMKyAH AhuH. [Na] sAkzAdDIH iti prABAkarA AhuH (ci0 1). sAkzAttraM ca sAkzAtkaromi ityanuvyavasAyagamyo jAtiviSezaH (ci0 1) (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 2). nyAyamate sAkzAttvaM 1 (ca jAtiviSezaH eva. prABAkaramate tu sAkzAttvaM na jAtiH. niyata-.. vyaYjakABAvAditi (ci0 1 pf0 556). [ca] yatkicidarTasya sAkzAtkArijYAnamiti bOdDA AhuH (nyA0 vi0 1 pf0 7). [Ca] vESizwyAnavagAhijYAnaM pratyakzam iti nAstikA AhuH. [ja] antaHkaraRa- vfttyavacCinna cEtanyena vizayasPuraRam pratyakzam iti mAyAvAdino manyante. atrocyate. budDitatsTa cidABAsO dvAvapi vyApnuto Gawam. tatrAjYAnaM DiyA - naSyedABAsena GawaH sPuret.. iti (paYcada0 7. 91). mAyAvAdimate pratyakzalakzaRaM ca tattadindriyayogyavartamAna vizayAvacCinna cEtanyABinnatvaM tattadAkAravfttyavacCinnajYAnasya tattadaMSe pratyakzatvam (vedA0 pari0<BR>;p{0541}<BR>pa0 1 pf0 12). nyAyamatasidDaM pratyakzaM dviviDam. nityam anityaM ca. tatra nityaM BagavataH. anityaM jIvasya. anityaM pratyakzaM dviviDam. lOkikam alOkikaM ca. tatra lOkikaM pratyakzaM dviviDam. savikalpakam nirvikalpakaM ca. atrocyate. aparokzapramAvyAptaM pratyakzaM dviviDaM matam. savikalpaka mityekamaparaM nirvikalpakam.. iti (tA0 ra0 