pratyaBijYA — (pratyakzam) [ka] atItAvasTAvacCinnavastugrahaRam. pratyaBijYApratyakze hi atItApi pUrvAvasTA sPuratyeva (ta0 BA0 pramARa0 Sabda0 pf0 19). pratyaBijYASabdasyetTaM vyutpattiH. pratigatA aBijYAm iti pratyaBijYA (vAca0). tallakzaRaM tu indriya sahakfta saMskArajanyajYAnatvam (la0 va0) (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 59). pratyaBijYAyAmupanItatattAdivizayakatvarUpamupanItaBAnamAnuBAvikam iti boDyam (dIDi0 bADa0). pratyaBijYAyAmAtmA vizayaH iti sidDAntaH. mAyAvAdinastu antaHkaraRaviSizwa evAtmA pratyaBijYAvizayaH na tu kevalaScidAtmA ityAhuH. atra prABAkarAH soham iti pratyaBijYAyAM vizayatvenASrayo nAtmA siDyati. kiM tarhi soyaM GawaH ityAdipratyaBijYASrayatvena ityamanyanta (vivaraRaprameyasaMgrahe) (vAca0). [Ka] atItAvasTAvacCinnasya vartamAnaBedAvagAhi pratyakzam (pa0 ca0). sA ca yaTA sa evAyaM GawaH yo mayA pUrvamupalabDaH ityAkArikA pUrvAvasTAnuBavajanita saMskAra sahakftendriyapraBavA pratyaBijYA (ta0 BA0 hetvABA 0 0 pf0 50). yaTA vA sa evAyaM nABimuKIBUte vastuni jYAnam (sarva0 pf0 193 pratyaBi0). atra taddeSakAlavfttitvarUpatattAsaMskArAt sa evAyaM GawaH iti pratyaBijYA jAyate iti boDyam (nIla0 1 pf0 14). [ga] tadanugfhItastadanusaMDAnavizayaH pratyayastadBAvavizayaH pratyaBijYAnam (nyA0 vA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0543" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

