प्रत्याम्नायः
pratyAmnAyaH — 1 [ka] nigama navadasyArTonusaMDeyaH (praSasta0 pf0 28). [Ka] pratijYAyAH punarvacanam. anumeyatvenoddizwe cAniScite ca parezAM hetvAdiBiravayavErA hitaSaktInAM parisamAptena vAkyena punarniScayApAdanArTaM pratijYAyAH punarvacanam. yaTA tasmAddravyameva iti punarniScayApAdanArTaM pratyAmnAyaH (praSasta0 2 pf0 2931). atrArTasyEva parisamAptiH. kaTam. anityaH SabdaH ityanenAniSvitAnityatvamAtraviSizwaH SabdaH kaTyate. prayatnAnantarIyakatvAt ityanena sADya samaDarmamAtramaBiDIyate. iha yat prayatnAnantarIyakam tat anityaM dfzwam yaTA GawaH ityanena sADyasAmAnyena sADanasAmAnyasyAnugamamAtramucyate. nityamaprayatnAnantarIyakaM dfzwam yaTA AkASam ityanena sADyABAvena sADanasyAsattvaM pradarSyate. taTA ca prayatnAnantarIyakaH SabdaH na ca taTA AkASavadaprayatnAnantarIyakaH SabdaH ityanvayavyatirekAByAM dfzwasAmarTyasya Sabdenu69<BR>;p{0546}<BR>saMDAnaM gamyate. tasmAdanityaH SabdaH ityanena anitya eva SabdaH iti pratipipAdayipitArTa parisamAptirgamyate. tasmAt paYcAvayavena vAkyena parezAM svaniScitArTapratipAdanaM kriyate iti cEtatparAmarSanamanumAnaM sidDam (praSasta 0 2 pf0 31) iti. aDikaM ca nigamanaSabdArTe dfSyam. 2 DarmaSAstrajYAstu pratiniDitvena viDIyamAnaH padArTaH pratyAnnAyaH. yaTA dAnArTaM sAkzAdvoralABe gopratyAnnAyaH suvarRam ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0545" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

