प्रथमा
praTamA — 1 (sup viBaktiH) [ka] yA viBaktistAdAtmyaBinnasvArTaDarmikaprakftyarTaboDaM prati na svarUpayogyA sA praTamA (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 36 wI0 pf0 74). yaTA nIlo Gawa ityAdO GawapadottarapraTamA. viSezyavAcakapadottara praTamA ca svArTEkatvAdiprakArakameva prakftyarTaboDaM prati samarTA iti tatra nAvyAptiH. dvitIyAdayaH svArTe karmatvAdO prakftyarTasyAnvayavoDaM prati samarTAH iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH. praTamA tu viSezaRapadottarasTA tAdfSi tAdAtmye taTAnvayaM boDayantyapi na tAdAtmyaBinne taTA iti nAvyAptiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 63 wI0 pf0 74). [Ka] DAtvarTAvacCinnatiNarTasyAnvayaboDaM prati yadantanAmopasTApyatvaM tantram tAdfSI sup praTamA. svargakAmo yajetetyAdO tirTasyezwasADanatvAderna prakftyarTAvacCinnasya yAgAdAvanvayaH. kiM tu kevalasya. ataH tasya praTamAntanAmAnupasTApyatvepi na kzatiH. cEtramEtrO sta ityAdO ca dvandvenEva praTamAntanAmnA cEtrasyopasTApanAnna vyaBicAraH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 64 wI0 pf0 74). praTamA triviDA su O jas iti. svAditrikAnyatamatvaM praTamAtvam. evam amAditrikAnyatamatvAdinA dvitIyAtvAdikaM nirvAcyam ityapyAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 65 wI0 pf0 76). atraM praTamAyA dvivacanam O dvitIyAyAH punarOw iti Bedo vEyAkaraREH kalpitaH. prayoge tvarTAnusAreRa jYeyaH. 2 AdyA. 3 praDAnam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0547" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

