प्रधानकर्मत्वम्
praDAnakarmatvam — (karmatvam) sAkzAdDAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAlitvam. yaTA gAM dogDi paya ityAdO payasaH praDAnakarmatvam. atra sAkzAdDAtvarTatAvacCedakatvaM ca DAtuvfttigrahaviSezyAMSe sAkzAdviSezaRatvam. gAM dogDi paya ityatra viBAgAvacCinnakzaraRAnukUlavyApArasya duhaDAtvarTatvena sAkzAdDAtvarTatAvacCedakI BUtakzaraRarUpaPalASrayatvAtpayasaH praDAnakarmatvam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 44). atra SabdaSaktiprakASikAkArAstu mocanAnukUlavyApAro duhaDAtvarTaH. mocanaM ca bahiH kzaraRAnukUlakriyA. tatra kzaraRaM payonizWam. tadanukUlakriyA tu gonizWA. taTA ca sAkzAdDAtvarTatAvacCeda kI BUtatAdfSamocanakriyASrayatvena goH praDAnakarmatvam. tAdfSakriyAyAM viSezaRIBUtasya paraMparayA DAtvarTatAvacCedakasya kzaraRasyASrayaH payaH iti payasaH apraDAnakarmatvam ityaNgIcakruH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 73, 77 wI0 pf0 98, 105). vEyAkaraRAstu kartfpratyayasamaBivyAhAre praDAnaBUtavyApAraviSezaRaPalASrayatvam. yaTA devadatto grAmamajAM nayatItyatra gAM dogDi paya ityatra ca ajAyA goSca karmatvam. atrAyaM viSezaH. Ryantavizaya IdfSaprADAnyasyEva grAhyatvam. taccoktodAharaRayoH spazwam. taRqulAnodanaM pacati kAzWaM Basma karotItyAdO nirvartyamAnOdanaBasmanoreva. tannizWaPalaviSezaRakavyApArasyEva tatsUtrasTaBAzyeRa SAbdaprADAnyapratIteH. taRqularUpe karmaRi lAdaya iti tu navyAnAM pramAda eva. duhAdizu BAzye gaRanABAvAcca. atra vikledanam nirvartanaM ca pacerarTaH. taRqulAn vikkedayan odanaM nirvartayati ityarTaH. karturIpsitatamaM karma (pA0 sU 2. 4. 49) iti sUtreREva dvayoH karmatvam (la0 ma0 subarTa0 kAra0 2 pf0 89). nIhfkfvahAM.<BR>;p{0549}<BR>DAtUnAmuttaradeSasaMyogAnukUlavyApArAnukUlavyApArArTakAnAM dvikarmakatvam. saMyogasya PalatAvacCedakaH saMbanDo grAmanizWaH. tadanukUlavyApAraScAjAnizWaH. praDAnavyApArajanyaPalASrayatvAdajA praDAnam. tatra lAdayo Bavanti. praDAnakarmaRyAKyeye lAdInAhurdvikarmaRAm iti BAzyokteH. gAM dogDi paya ityatra duherantaH sTitadravadravyanizWaviBAgAnukUlavyApArAnukUlavyApArArTakatve gopayasoruBayorapi karturIpsitatamaM karma iti sUtreRa karmatvam. tatra goH kartfvyApArajanyaPalASrayatvAt praDAnakarmatvam. payasaH kartftryApAraprayojyaviBAgaPalASrayatvAt gORakarmatvam. atra gorviBAgASrayatvena tu na karmatvam. payonizWaviBAgIyasaMbanDasyEva PalatAvacCedakatvAt. tattvenAnuddeSyatvAcca. uktaprADAnyaM ca goH iti tatra lAdayaH. evam anyezAmapi yAcidaRqyAdInAM dvikarmakatvaM boDyam. tatra nidarSanam. devadattena grAmamajA nIyate gOrdudyate paya ityAdO ca ajAyA goSca praDAnakarmatvena lAdinABihitatvAttadvAcakapadottaraM praTamEva Bavati na tu dvitIyA iti (la0 ma0 pf0 90). atrAyaM viSezaH. karturIpsitatamaM karma ityanena goH praDAnakarmatvam. tatra lAdayaH. akaTitaM ca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 51) iti sUtreRa tu gorapAdAnatvAdyavivakzAyAM pUrvoktaprADAnyAnASrayatvAdapraDAnakarmatvaM viDIyate. gORakarmaRi gavAdO lAdayo Bavanti. apraDAne duhAdInAM Ryante kartuSca karmaRaH iti prAmARyAt. atra pakze dravadravyaviBAgAnukUlavyApAramAtraM duherarTaH iti (la0 ma0 suba0 kAra0 2 pf0 91) (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 2 pf0 44). atrAyaM BAvaH. tAdfSaviBAgAnukUlavyApArasya kartfnizWatvena viBAgasya tu payonizWatvena ca goH karmatvAprAptO akaTitaM ca ityanena kriyAjanyaPalaSAlitvAdanyadeva gORaM karmatvaM viDIyate iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0548" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

