प्रभवः
praBavaH — 1 praTamaprakASaH. yaTA himavato gaNgA praBavatItyAdO praBavatyarTaH. atra ButraH praBavaH (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 31) ityanenApAdAnasaMjYA. tadarTaSca yatsaMbanDAtpraBavanaM praTamaprakASaH sa praBavaH iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 108). atra praBavatyasmin iti praBavaH iti vyutpattyA praTamaprakASasTAnam ityarTo laByate (vAca0). anyataH sidDasya praTamopalamBasTAnam iti hemacandra Aha. atra prakASaH AdyabahiH- (BUKaRqa -) saMyogaH DAtvarTaH. saMyoganASAvyavahitottarakzaRavfttitvaM paYcamyarTaH. AKyAtArTa ASrayatvam. taTA ca himAlaya saMyogaDvaMsAvyavahitottarakzaRavfttyAdyapfTivI saMyogASrayatvavatI gaNgA iti boDaH. yadvA paYcamyarTaH saMbanDADInatvam. tasya tAdfSakriyAyAM praBavatyarTe praTamaprakASe anvayaH. saMbanDe ca himavadAdeH prakftyarTasyAnvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 5 pf0 108). evam valmIkAgrAtpraBavati DanuHKaRqamAKaRqalasya (meGadU0 pU0 15) ityAdAvapyUhyam. atra UrDvadeSasaMyogaH praBavatyarTaH. anyatsamAnam (kA0 vyA0 pf010). 2 saMvatsara viSezaH iti mOhUrtikA vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0550" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

