प्रमा
pramA — (anuBavaH) [ka] yadarTavijYAnaM sAtramA (bAllyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA 0). sA ca dravyAdivizayaM jYAnam (yaTArTam) (praSasta 0 pf0 26). lakzaRaM ca vakzyamARaM pramAtvameva iti vijYeyam. pramAtvasya svato grAhyatvAdivicAraH pramAtvaSabde dfSyaH. [Ka] tattvAnuBavaH. [ga] yatra yadasti tatra tasyAnuBavaH. tadvati tatprakAra kAnuBavo vA (ci0 1 pf0 400) (sa0 saM0). PalitArTastu tadvadviSezyakatvAvacCinnatatprakArakatA SAlyanuBavaH iti. viSezyitAsaMbanDena tadavacCinnA yA tatprakAritA tacCAtyanuBavaH iti vA. tena rajataraNgayoH ime raNgarajate ityAdiviparItasamUhAlambanatra me nAtivyAptiH (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 403). nirvikalpakajYAnaM tu pramA apramA etadbahirBUtameva. vyavahArAnaNgatvAt (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 402). evaM ca nirvikalpakaM pramAlakzaRAlakzyameveti tasya prakAritA viSezyitASUnyatvepi na tatrAvyAptiSaNkA iti BAvaH. [va] yaTArTAnuBavaH (tA0 ra0.) (ta0 BA0) (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 1) (ta0 saM0) (ta0 kO0 pf0 7). yaTA rajate idaM rajatam iti pratyakzaM pramA (ta0 saM0). atra yATArTyaM ca tadvati tadavagAhitvam (nyA0 sa0 1) (ta0 saM0). tadvadviSezyakatve satItyarTaH. Bavati hi rajate idaM rajatam iti jYAnaM rajatatvavati rajatatvAvagAhi iti lakzaRasamanvayaH (nyA0 ma0) (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 10). atrAhurudayanAcAryAH yaTArTAnuBavo mAnamanapekzatayezyate (ku0 4. 1) iti. atra mAnaSabdasyArTaH pramA iti jYeyam. atra prayogaScetTam. yaTArTAnuBavaH pramApadavAcyaH anapekzatvAt iti. anapekzatvaM ca svasamAnADikaraRaM svasamAnavizayakaM ca<BR>;p{0552}<BR>yajjYAnaM tatpramAtvAnaDInapramAtvakatvam (ma0pra0 1 pf0 4). smftO. tu tAdfSapUrvAnuBavapramAtvADInapramAtvakatvena smftivyAvfttiH. atroBayatra svapadaM PalIBUtajYAnaparameva. atreyamaBisaMDiH. pramAtvasya smftisADAraRatve smftikAraRAnuBavasyApi pramARAntaratvApattyA SAstre pramARavyavahArOpayikaM rUpamanuBavatvaGawitamevAnumanyante tAntrikAH (di0 gu0 pf0 211). aTa vA yajjAtIyaviSizwajYAnatvAvacCedena samAnAkAraniScayottaratvaM tajjAtIyAnyayaTArTajYAnasyEvAgfhItagrAhitvena pramAtvam. ata eva DArAvAhipratyakzavyaktInAM samAnAkAragrahottaravartitvepi na tAsAM pramAtvahAniH. hAnistu samAnAkArAnuBavasamutTAnAM smftInAmiti. ayaM cAtra viSezaH. ajYAyamAnakaraRajanyatattvAnuBavaH pratyakzapramA. jYAyamAnakaraRajanyatattvAnuBavonumitipramA iti. [Na] vizayatASrayAvfttyaprakArakAnuBavaH. [ca] yatprakArikA yA vizayatA tatprakArasamAnADikaraRavizayatAkaH svaprakArasamAnADikaraRavizayatAko vA anuBavaH. atra prakArapadaM Darmaparam. tadDarmasamAnADikaraRatadvizayatAka ityarTaH. etallakzaRadvaye idaM rajataM raNgaM ca ityAdO prakAraBedena vizayatABedABAvepi na kzatiH iti Dyeyam. atirikta vizayatApakze (viSezyatAvacCedakatAtiriktA prakAratA vizayatApi ca savizayakA iti pakze) idaM lakzaRadvayaM (Na ca ityatra sTitam) svIkftam iti jYeyam (mU0ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 416419). [Ca] viSezyanizWAtyantABAvApratiyogiprakArakavizayatApratiyogI [ja] viSezyanizWAtyantABAvapratiyogiprakArAnavacCinnavizayatApratiyogI vA [Ja] vizayatAsamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvapratiyogiprakArakavizayatvApratiyogI [Ya] vizayatAsamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvapratiyogiprakArAnavacCinnavizayatApratiyogI vA anuBavaH (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 400420). ekaDarmAvacCinnatattadaBAvoBayavannizWaviSezyatAkaM dravyaM rajatam ityAdijYAnaM na lakzyam iti mate Ca ja ityAdIni lakzaRAni (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 420). vfttIdDo boDaH pramA iti mAyAvAdino vadanti. anaDigatArTasya vastunovaDAraRam iti sAMKyA AhuH. puruzanizWaboDaH vA<BR>;p{0553}<BR>pramA iti pAtaYjalA AhuH (pAta0 vyA0 BA0) (sAM0 BA0 1187). nyAyanaye pramA dviviDA. nityA anityA ca. tatra nityA BagavataH. anityA jIvasya (tA0 20 lo0 4).. pramARavADitArTakaprasaNgaH - varkaviSezaH. SizwaM tu tadanyabADitArTaprasaNgaSabdavyAKyAne saMpAditam tat tatra drazwavyam. atra vyutpattiH pramARena bADitorTo yasya iti (kap)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0551" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमाणम्
pramARam — 1 [ka] pramAtA yenArTaM pramiRoti tat (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA). atra pramIyatenena iti vyutpattirdrazwavyA. pramARasya svaBAvastu sataH prakASakaM pramARamasadapi prakASayati (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA) iti. tallakzaRaM tu pramARatvameva. tacca tadvati tatprakArakatvarUpaprakarzaviSizwajYAnakAraRatvam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 3). yadvA anuBavatvavyApyajAtyavacCinnapramAvfttikAryatA nirUpitAkAraRatASAlitve sati vyApAravattvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 1 pf0 14). aTavA anaDigatArTakAnuBavakAraRatvam. tacca gfhItagrAhItarAnuBavakAraRatvam iti mImAMsakA AhuH (ku0 wI0 3) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 9). svasamAnADikaraRasvAvyavahitapUrvavartisvasamAnAkAraniScayavizayavizayaketaratadvaMdviSe- zyakatatprakAra kAnuBava kAraRatvam iti yAvat (ku0 wI0 3). sAMKyAstu asaMdigDAviparItAnaDigatavizayavoDasADanatvam ityAhuH. atra dvayorekatarasya vApyasaMnikfzwArTa paricCittiH pramA tatsADakaM yat tat triviDaM pramARam (sAMKyasUtram 1187) iti. tadarTaSca asaMnikfzwaH pramAtaryanArUQaH anaDigata iti yAvat (sAM0 BAzya 0). [Ka] pramAyAH karaRam (nyA0 ma0 pf0 1) (ta0 saM0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 4) (ta0 kO0 pf0 8). yaTA cakzurAdi pratyakzAtmakapramAyAH pragnARam. anumitO ca liNgadarSanaM pramARam. upamitO ca sAdfSyajYAnaM pramARam. SAbde ca vedAH pramARamityAdO SabdaH pramARam. atredaM boDyam. indriyasaMyogAdireva pramAkaraRam. na tu pramAtfprameyAdIni. satyapi pramAtari prameye ca pramAnutpatteH. indriyasaMyogAdO tu satya 70<BR>;p{0554}<BR>[vilambena pramotpattiH. ataH indriyasaMyogAdireva karaRam na pramAtrAdi 1 (ta0 BA0 pf0 5). [ga] sADanASrayAvyatiriktatve sati pramAvyAptam. anena ca pratitantrasidDAntasidDaM parameSvaraprAmARyaM saMgfhItam (sarva0 pf0 235 akza0) (ku0 wI0 4. 5). atra sUtram mantrAyurvedaprAmARyavacca tatprAmARyamAptaprAmARyAt (gO0 2. 1. 68) iti.. [va] pramAyogavyavacCinnam. pramayA sahAyogavyavacCedena saMbanDi. [Na] anaDigatArTagantf pramARam iti BawwamImAMsakA AhuH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 20) (ku0 wI0 4. 5) (tattvasaMKyA 0). tadasat. 1. ekasminneva Gawe Gawoyam Gawoyam Gawoyam iti DArAvAhikapratyayasTale aDigatArTa gantfRAmaprAmARyApatteH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 20) (ta0 BA0 1 pf0 5). atra vivadante. avisaMvAdi vijYAnaM pramARamiti sOgatAH. anuBUtiH pramARaM sA smfteranyeti kecana.. ajYAtacaratattvArTaniScAyakamaTApare. prameyavyAptamapare pramARamiti manvate. pramAniyata II sAmagrIM pramARaM kecidUcire (tA0 ra0 Slo0 5-7) iti nyAyanaye pramARAni catvAri. pratyakzam anumAnam upamAnam SabdaSca (gO0 1. 1. 3) iti. yatpramARaM tavyatyakzAdicatuzwayAnyatamam iti vAkyArTaH.. tena nyUnADikasaMKyAvyavacCedalABaH (ma0pra0 1 pf0 7). atredaM. boDyam. nityapramAyA ASrayaH. (samavAyI) pramARaM ISvaraH. anityapramAyAstu karaRaM pratyakzAdicatuzwayam (tA0 ra0 Slo0 4) iti. [ca] pramIyate paricCidyate aneneti pramARam. tacca dviviDam mAnuzaM dEvikaM ca (mitAkzarA a0 2 0 22). prakArAntareRa pramARaM 10. dviviDam. SabdopajIvi SabdAnupajIvi ca (ku0 wI0). idAnIM .: mataBedena pramARasaMKyA kaTyate. pratyakzamekameva pramARam iti cArvAkA AhuH. pratyakzamanumAnaM ceti dve pramARe iti kaRAdapraDAnA vESezikAH. manyante. etanmate SabdopamAnayoranumAnaviDayEva prAmARyam na tu nAma svAtatrayeReti boDyam (ta0 kO0 pf0 8). atra BAzyam. SabdAdI- : nAmapyanumAnentarBAvaH. samAnaviDitvAt. yaTA prasidDasamayasyAsaMdigDaliNgadarSanaprasidDAnusmaraRAByAmatIndriyArTe<BR>;p{0555}<BR>BavatyanumAnam. evaM SabdAdiByopi iti. SrutismftilakzaRopyAnnAyo vaktfprAmARyApekzaH. tadvacanAdAmnAyasya prAmARyam (vE0 1. 1. 3) liNgAccAnityaH SabdaH (vE0 2. 2. 32) budDipUrvA vAkyakftirvede (vE0 6. 1. 1) budDipUrvo dadAtiH (vE0 6 113) ityuktatvAt. prasidDABinayasya cezwayA pratipattidarSanAttadapyanumAnameva. prasidDagavayasya gavayapratipAdanArTamupamAnamAptavacanameva darSanArTApattirviroDe vA SabdaSravaRAdanumitamanumAnam. saMBavopyavinABAvitvAdanumAnameva. aBAvopyanumAnameva. yaTA utpannaM kArya kAraRasaMBavaliNgam evam anutpannaM kArya kAraRAsadBAve liNgam. EtihyamapyavitaTamAptopadeSa eva (praSasta0 pf0 2 pf0 28) iti. Sabdasya svAtantryeRa prAmARyamanicCantonumAnAntarBAvamASritya prAmARyamicCanti vESezikAdayaH. tezAmayamASayaH. gAmAnaya ityAdivAkyaSravaRasamanantaraM tAvadantrayapratItiranuBUyate. vAkya AkANkzAdimattvapratisaMDAnaM tadarTa-.. pratipattyanukUlatayAvaDftam. taTA ca AkANkzAdimatpadakadambakatvapratisaMDAnasyAvaSyakatayA tasya ca smAritArTasaMsargavijYaptipUrvakatvaniyamenAnumAnAdeva tatPalasidDO kimiti Sabdasya pramARAntaratvAByupagamaH. taTAhi. etAni padAni smAritArTa saMsargajYAnapUrvakARi AkANkzAdimadAptoktapadatvAt gAmaByAjetipadakadambakavat iti jYAnAtracCedakatayA saMsargasidDiranumAnAdeva Bavati iti padapakzakAnumAnena Sabdo na pramARAntaram. arTa pakzakAnumAne sAkzAdeva saMsargasidDiH. evaM hi tat. ete padArTA miTaH saMsargavantaH AkANkzAdimatpadakadambakasmAritatvAt gAmaByAja iti smAritapadArTavat iti. evamupamAnamapi na pramARAntaram. taTAhi. gavayapadaM sapravfttinimittakam sADupadatvAt ityanumAnenEvAtrApi nirvAhaH (ta0 va0 pf0 98) (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 22). pratyakzamanumAnaM ceti pramARadvayameveti cOdDA AItAca. (manyante. lOkikam ArzaM ceti dviviDaM pramARamiti sAMKyA manyate. tatra lOkikam pratyakzAnumAnAptavacanAni. Arzam vijYAnam. pratyakzaM.<BR>;p{0556}<BR>SabdaSceti pramARe iti SrImadAnandatIrTaBagavatpAdAcAryAH prAhuH. etanmate tvanumAnaM SrutyanusAritvena pramARam na tu svAtantryeReti boDyam. mAnuzadevaBedena dviviDaM pramARam (yAjYa0 2. 116) iti vyavahAraSAstrajYA AhuH. pratyakzamanumAnaM SAbdaM ceti manvAdayaH AhuH. atra alOkike vizaye vedo brahmasUtraM BagavadgItA SrImadBAgavatamiti pramARacatuzwayamiti vAllaBA manyante. pratyakzamanumAnamAptavacanamiti trIRi pramARAni iti sAMKyA yogino mAyAvAdivedAntinaScAhuH. tatra sAMKyapAtaYjalamAyAvAdimate antaHkaraRavfttInAM pOruzeyacittavfttiprakASarUpaboDe kAraRatvam. antaHkaraRavfttizu ca jYAnatvAropeRa tatkaraRatvamindriyARAm iti vivekaH (sAM0 pra0 BA0) (pAta0 sU0). pratyakzAnumAnopamAnAni trIRi iti nEyAyikEkadeSina AhuH. pratyakzAnumAnopamAnaSabdAScatvAri pramARAni iti gOtamapraDAnA nEyAyikA AhuH. SabdAtpratyemi iti vilakzaRapratItervyAptinirapekzAdAkANkzA dijYAnAdutpatteH tatkaraRatayA SabdasyAtiriktaM prAmARyaM sidDyati iti nEyAyikasidDAntaH. tatra Sabdasya svatantraprAmARyamuktam AptopadeSasAmarTyAcCabdAdarTasaMpratyayaH (gO0 2. 1. 52) iti. pratyakzAnumAnopamAnaSabdA arTApattiSceti paYca pramARAni iti prABAkarA AhuH. pratyakzAnumAnopamAnaSabdA arTApattinupalabDiSceti zaw pramARAni ityapare BawwA vedAntiBedAcAhuH. saMBavEtihye apyatirikte pramARe iti pOrARikA AhuH. cezwApyatiriktaM pramARam iti tAtrikA amanyanta (tA0 ra0 Slo0 8-11) (si0 ca0 1 pf0 20). anuBUtirapi pramARam iti prABAkarA AhuH. kecittu SakunalipyAdikamapi pramARAntaramicCanti. upakramonumAnameva nAtiriktaM pramARam iti (pra0 pa0 pf0 5) (pra0 ca0 pf0 44). 2 pramA (yaTArTajYAnam). yaTA svataH prAmARyam parataH prAmARyam ityAdO pramARapadArTaH praBA. 3 satyavAdI. 4 iyattA. 5 paricCedaH. 6 hetuH. 7 pramAtA (medinI 0). 8 vizRuH (vizRusa 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0553" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमाणान्तरम्
pramARAntaram — (svatantraM pramARam) yadasADAraRaM sahakAri samAsAdya mano bahirgocarAM pramAM janayati tat. yaTA pratyakza indriyaM pramARAntaram. saMSayasvapnO tu na prame iti na nidrAdeH pramARAntaratvam (ci0 2 pf0 35) (ku0 wI0 4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0557" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमाता
pramAtA — 1 yasyepsAjihAsAprayuktasya pravfttiH saH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA0). sa ca pramAtA AtmA (praSasta0 pf0 26). yaTA cEtro GawaM praminotItyAdO cEtraH pramAtA. atra pramAtftvaM ca pramAsamavAyitvam. etaccAkAraRatvepi pramAyA ISvarasya sidDam (ku0 wI0 4. 5). atredaM boDyam. pramAtA svatantraH. svAtantryaM ca kArakaPalopaBoktftvam (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 9) iti. 2 SudDacetano vfttisAkzI pramAtA iti sAMKyA AhuH. mAyAvAdinastu antaHkaraRavfttiprativimbitam tadavacCinnaM vA cEtanyameva pramAtA ityAhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0557" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमात्वम्
pramAtvam — tadvati tatprakArakajYAnatvam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 4). tadvati tadvESizwyajYAnatvaM vA (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 170). AdyalakzaRe daladvayasyArTaSca tadvannizWaviSezyatAnirUpitatannizWaprakAratASAlyanuBavatvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 1 pf0 14) (vAkya 0). vastutastu tadvatItyatrAvacCinnatvameva saptamyarTaH. anvayaScAsya viSezyitA saMbanDena tatprakArakatve. taTA ca viSezyitAsaMbanDena tadavacCinnA yA tatprakAritA tacCAlyanuBavatvaM tatpramAtvam iti Palitam. idamatrEtatprakArakam iti pratItyA viSezyasyApi viSezyitAsaMbanDena tatprakAritAyAmavacCedakatvAt lakzaRasamanvayaH. raNgarajatayoH imO rajataraNgO iti viparItaBrame ca rajatAvacCinnaM na rajatatvaprakArakatvam api tu raNgAvacCinnam iti na tatrAtivyAptiH (mU0 ma0 prAmA0 sidDAnta0 pf0 403). aTavA viSezyatAvacCedena tadDarmAvacCinnaprakAritAsaMbanDena tadDarmavattvam. viSezyatAsaMbanDena tadviSizwatve sati tadvattvam. viSezyatAsaMbanDena tadvadavacCinnA yA prakAritA tacCAlyanuBavatvamiti vA (mU0 ma0 1). tAntrikAstu tadvadviSezyakatvAvacCedena tatprakArakatvam. tena vahniguYjayorguYjAvagAhiBrame<BR>;p{0558}<BR>nAtivyAptiH ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 Ka0 4 pf0 34) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 69). yadvA tatsaMbanDAnuyogiviSezyakatvAvacCinnatatpratiyogikasaMbanDAvacCinnaprakArakajYAnatvam. ayameva sidDAntalakzaRoktapramAtve gadADara BawwAcAryARAmASayaH iti pratiBAti. aTavA viSezyitAsaMbanDena tadDarmavadavacCinnatve sati prakAritAsaMbanDena tadDarmavantvam. viSezyitAprakAritayoriva viSezyitAprakAritAsaMbanDena viSezyaviSezaRayorapi parasparamavacCedyAvacCedakaBAvoByupagamyate ityaBiprAyeRedam (mU0 ma0 1 prAmARya0 pf0 175). yadyapi anyAnyapi viSezyAvfttyaprakArakatvam agfhItagrAhitvaM vA sarvaDIyaTArTatvapakze anuBavatvajAteraBAvena smaraRAnvajYAnatvam viSizwajYAnatvaM vA (ci0 prAmA0 pf0 126) ityAdIni pramAtvasvarUpARi santi. etanmate nirvikalpaka vyaDikaraRaprakArakajYAnayoranaByupagamAt. taTApi tAni mImAMsakAdimatoktarItyA na svato grAhyARi iti nAtrodAhftAni. viSezyAvfttyaprakArakatvAderviSezaRasya prAganupasTitO tadvESizwyasya jYAtumaSakyatvAt. atredaM boDyam. tadvati tatprakArakajYAnatyam tadvati tadvESizwyajYAnatvaM veti pramAtvadvayaM ca nizkampapravfttyupayogi mImAMsakamate svato grAhyaM ca Bavati (ci0 prAmA0 pf0 170) iti. anaDigatArTagrAhityaM pramAtvam iti mImAMsakA AhuH. tacca svasamAnADikaraRa svADyavahita pUrvavarti svasamAnAkArajYAnavizayavizayakatvam iti nizkarzaH (ku0 4 wI0) (mU0 ma0 prAmA0. pf0 170). yaTA satyarajate idaM rajatam iti jYAnasya pramAtvam. yaTA vA Gawe ayaM GawaH iti jYAnasya pramAtvam. prABAkaramate sarvajYAnAnAM yaTArTatvAt tatprakArakajYAnatvameva pramAtvam (ci0 1 prAmA0) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 133) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 35). aTAtra prasaNgAvprAmARyavAdaH pradarSyate. paramakAruRikamunipraRItAyAmazwAdaSavidyAsTAnezvaByarhitatamAyAM niHSreyasaprayojikAyAmAnvIkzikIvidyAyAM prakzAvatpravfttyarTaM pramARaprameyasaMSaya 0 tattvajYAnAnniHSreyasADigamaH (gOta0 sU0 1. 1. 1) iti sUtreRa pratipAditAnAM poqaSapadArTAnAM<BR>;p{0559}<BR>maDye praTamoddizwasya pramARasyADIna itarezAM niScaya iti pramARatattvaniScaya AvaSyakaH. sa ca pramAtvaniScayaM vinA na BavatIti pramAtvaniScayopAya idAnIM cintyate (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 114117). atra vipratipattiH pramAtvaM svato grAhyaM parato vA iti. anyatra tvevaM vipratipattayaH pradarSitAH. jYAnaprAmARyaM tadaprAmARyAgrAhakayAvajjYAnagrAhakasAmagrIgrAhyam na vA iti. tajjYAnavizayakajYAnAjanyajYAnagrAhyam na vA iti. svASrayagrAhakeRa gfhyata eva na vA iti. svASrayeRa gfhyata eva na vA iti. Gawoyam iti jYAnaprAmARyametajjYAnagrAhyam na vA iti. etajjYAnagrAhakamAtragrAhyam na vA iti (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 121126). jYAnapramAtvasya svato grAhyatvaM ca svata eva (svakIyeBya eva) svajanakasAmagrI svajanyapratyakzasAmagrI svajanyajYAtatAliNgakAnumitisAmagnI etadanyatamajYAnagrAhakasAmagrIgrAhyatvam. atra svajanya iti padadvayaM krameRa svapratyakzasya jYAtatAyASca viSezaRam. paYcamyA janyatvamarTaH (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 126). guruBawwamurArimiSrARAM matatrayasADAraRaM svatastvaM ca tadaprAmARyAgrAhakayAvajjYAnagrAhakasAmagrIgrAhyatvam (ta0 dI0 prAmA0 pf0 34) (ta0 kO0 pf0 18). tadarTastu jYAnanizWAprAmARyAgrAhikA yAvatI jYAnagrAhikA sAmagrI indriyasaMnikarza parAmarSAnuvyavasAyAdirUpA tajjanyagrahavizayatvam. sa ca grahaH (prATamikajYAnagrahaH) gurumate vyavasAyaH. Bawwamate jYAtatAliNgakAnumitiH. murArimiSramate anuvyavasAyaH (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 35). tattadDarmaprakArakajYAnagrAhakasAmagrIjanyagrahtvavyApakavizayitApratiyogitvam iti nizkarzaH. idameva jYaptO svatastvamityucyate (nIla0 pf0 34) (si0 ca0 pf0 33). yayA kAraRasAmagryA jYAnaM gfhyate tayEva tadgataM pramAtvamapi gfhyata iti spazwArTaH. atra trIRi matAni krameRoktAni. taTAhi. jYAnagrAhakaM ca sarvamate GawamahaM jAnAmi ityAkArakameva jYAnaM Bavati. jYAnasya svasyEva svanAmARyavizayakatayA svajanakasAmagryeva svanizWaprAmARyaniScAyikA Bavati iti gurava AhuH. svottaravartisva vizayakalOkikapratyakzasya<BR>;p{0560}<BR>svanizWaprAmARyavizayakatayA svajanyasvavizayakapratyakzasAmagrI svanizWaprAmARyaniScAyikA Bavati iti miSrA AhuH. jYAnasyAtIndriyatayA pratyakzAsaMBavena svajanyajYAtatA liNgakAnumitisAmagrI svanizWaprAmARyaniScAyikA Bavati iti BawwA AhuH (mU0 ma01 prAmA0 pf0 126). tadaprAmARyAgrAhaketyatra padaprayojana mitTam. nEyAyikamate pramAtvamanumAnena idaM jYAnaM pramA ityAptavAkyena ca gfhyate iti sidDasADanam. tadvAraRAya yAvat iti viSezaRam. anumAnaM tu idaM jYAnaM pramA samarTapravfttijanakatvAt iti. vastutastu yAvat iti grahasya viSezaRam. taTA ca jYAnagrAhakasAmagrIjanyayAvagrahavizayatvam iti Palitam. idaM jYAnamapramA iti jYAnena vyavasAyanizWaprAmARyAvizayIkaraRAt vADAKyo dozaH. tadvAraRAya aprAmARyAgrAhikA iti viSezaRaM dattam. taTA ca tAdfSajYAnasAmagryAH sADyakowyanivizwatvAt tayA prAmARyasyAgrahaRepi na bADaH iti BAvaH. jYAnanizWAprAmARyetyatra jYAnaM tu yAdfSaM prAmARyaM prakftAnumitAvuddeSyaM tAdfSaprAmARyASrayaH iti vijYeyam. tena idaM jYAnamapramA ityanuvyavasAyanizWaprAmARyagrAhakasyAprAmARyagrAhakatvABAvepi na svatastvahAniH (ta0 dI0) (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 35). prAmARye svatastvaM nAma yAvatsvASrayavizayakajYAnagrAhyatvam. prAmARyASrayavizayakajYAnaM ca svaprakASa