kiMtu visaMvAdipravfttyAdi liNgakAnumityAdivizayaH iti parata evAprAmARyamutpadyate jYAyate ceti (vedAntapa0 anupalabDiparicCedaH pf0 7172). tatra pramAtvaM svatogrAhyamiti vadatAM mImAMsakAnAmayamASayaH. yaTA dUrAtpratyakzeRa indriyeRa jalAdijYAne jAte tatra svata eva yaTArTajYAnatvarUpaprAmARyamavaDArya jalArTI pravartate. jYAnagrahe tadgataprAmARyasyApi grahAtpramAtvasya svatastvamupapadyate (ta0 kO0 prAmA0 pf0 18) iti. anyatra cetTamuktam. mImAMsakamate prAmARyasya svatastvaM dviviDam utpattO jYaptO ceti. tatra utpattO svatastvaM nAma jYAnakaraRamAtrajanyatvam. yena jYAnaM jAyate tenEva tadgataM 71.<BR>;p{0562}<BR>prAmARyamapi jAyata iti. jYaptO svatastvaM nAma jYAnagrAhakamAtragrAhyatvam. yena jYAnaM gfhyate tenEva tadgataM prAmARyamapi gfhyata iti. nEyAyikamate paratastvamapi dviviDam utpattO jYaptO ceti. tatra utpattO paratastvaM nAma jYAnakAraRAtiriktakAraRajanyatvam. jYaptO paratastvaM nAma jYAnagrAhakAtiriktagrAhyatvam iti vastusTiti (pra0 ca0 pari0 1 pf0 45). mImAMsakAca trayo miTo vipratipannAH. praBAkarAparanAmakA guravaH tutAtAKyA BawwAH murArinAmakA miSrASceti. tatra gurURAM matam jYAnasya svaprakASarUpatvAttajjYAnaprAmARyaM tenEva gfhyate iti. BawwAnAM mataM ca jYAnamatIndriyam. jYAnajanyA jYAtatA pratyakzA. tayA ca jYAnamanumIyate. atrAnumAnaM tu Gawo GawatvavadviSezyaka GawatvaprakArakajYAnavizayo GawatvaprakArakajYAtatAvattvAt yannEvaM tannEvam iti (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 35). murArimiSramataM tu anuvyavasAyena jYAnaM gfhyate iti. sarvezAmapi mate tajjYAnavizayakajYAnena tajjYAnaprAmARyaM gfhyate. vipayanirUpyaM hi jYAnam. ato jYAnavittivedyo vizayaH (mu0 gu0) iti. tadarTaSca vizayanirUpyaM vizayajYAnajanyasAkzAtkAravizayIBUtam iti (ma0pra0 pf0 69). idamatra tattvam. gurumate Gawatvena GawamahaM jAnAmi ityAdyAkArakaM vyavasAyAtmakameva sarvaM jYAnam. tacca svaprakASam. miti mAtfmeyEtatrayavizayatvAtripuwItyucyate. svaprakASasAmarTyAdeva svAtmAnamiva svavfttiprAmARyaM svata eva gfhRAti iti. Bawwamate ayaM GawaH iti jYAnAnantaraM Gawe jYAtatAnAmakaM PalaM