ugrahA ityuBayasyEkagraheRa gfhItaM prAmARyam ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 3334) (ma0pra0). nEyAyikAstu parataH anumAnAdinA jYAnasya prAmARyaM grAhyam utpAdyaM ceti vadanti. atrAyamarTaH. dvitIyAnuvyavasAyena prAmARyaM gfhyate. taTAhi praTamaM ayaM GawaH iti jYAnam. tataH jYAnajYAnatve iti nirvikalpakam..<BR>;p{0565}<BR>tataH GawamahaM jAnAmi ityanuvyavasAyaH. tato vyavasAyasya nazwatvAt punaH Gawoyam iti vyavasAyaH. tataSca GawamahaM jAnAmi ityanuvyavasAyaH. tena prAmARyaM gfhyate iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 131). nEyAyikAnAmayaM BAvaH. SrAmARyasya svato grahe anaByAsadaSotpannajYAne tatsaMSayo na syAt. jYAnagrahe prAmARyaniScayAt. aniScaye vA na svataH prAmARyagrahaH. jYAnAgrahe DarmijYAnABAvAt na saMSayaH. anaByAsadaSotpannam prAmARyavyApyavattAniScayakAlInam. tatsaMSayaH idaM pramA na vA iti prAmARyasaMSayaH (sU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 189). ayaM BAvaH. na ca saMSayasTale jYAnagrahopa (prAmARyASrayajYAnasya viSezyasya graha eva) nAsti iti vAcyam. jYAnAgrahe jYAnaDarmikaprAmARyatadaBAvakowikasaMSayAnupapatteH. saMSaye DarmijYAnasya hetutvAt (ci0 1 prA0 pf0 188189) (ta0 kO0 pf0 18) iti. yadi mImAMsakAH pramAtvasya svato grAhyatvaM svIkuryustadA anaByAsadaSAyAM (prATamikajalajYAnagrahottaradaSAyAm) tanmate prAmARyasaMSayAnupapattiH. taTAhi. jYAnagrahAnantaram kiMcijjAtaM me yajjalajYAnam tat pramA na vA iti prAmARyasaMSayo lokenuBavasidDaH. sa na syAt. tanmate jYAnagrahe pramAtvasyApi niScitatvena tatsaMSayAyogAt iti. ataH parata eva anumAnAdinA pramAtvamavaSyaM grAhyam (ta0 kO0 pf. 18) iti. paratastvaM ca jYAnasAmAnyagrAhakAtiriktagrAhyatvam. IdfSaparatastvaM jYaptO kvacit dvitIyAnuvyavasAyamAdAya. kacittu anumAnamAdAya boDyam. taTAhi. parato grahaRe pramARamanumAnam. tacca vimatA pramA jYAnahetvatiriktahetvaDInA kAryatve sati tadviSezatvAdapraBAvat (sarva0 pf0 282 jEmi0) iti. taTA ca dvitIyAnuvyavasAyena kvacilAmARyagrahe ca prAmARyarUpasADyaprasidDAvanumAnamapi prAmARyagrAhakam. tadyaTA idaM puruzajYAnam pramA karAdimapi puruzajYAnatvAt saMpratipannavan. yadvA yannEvaM tannEvam iti vyatirekI. tadarTaSca idam dvitIyAnumAnenAgfhItaprAmARyakam puruzajYAnaM pramA (puruzatvavadviSezyakatve sati puruzatyaprakArakatvavat)<BR>;p{0566}<BR>karAdimati karAdimadviSezyakatve sati puruzatvaprakArakajYAnatvAt saMprati-. pannavat dvitIyAnuvyavasAyena gfhItaprAmARyakapuruzajYAnavat iti. yadvA yanna puruzattravati puruzatvajYAnam tanna karAdimati puruzatvajYAnam. yaTA sTARO puruzatvaBramaH iti vyatirekI (nyA0 ma0 pf0 35) (ta0 pra0 Ka04 pf0 132) (pra0 pra0 4 0 71). atra ca paratastvaM dviviDam. jYaptO paratastvam utpattO paratastvam. atra prAmARyasya parata utpattikatvaM ca jYAnasAkzAdviBAjakopADyavacCinna kAryatA pratiyogikakAraRatAnirUpitakAryattAvattvam (sU0 sa0 prAmA0). AdyaM yaTA praTamajalajYAnAnantaraM pravfttO satyAM jalalABe sati pUrvotpannajYAnaM pramA samarTapravfttijanakatvAt. yatpramA na Bavati tatsamarTapravfttijanakaM na Bavati yaTA apramA (jalaBramaH) iti vyatirekiRAnumAnenAnaByAsadaSApaSajYAne pramAtvaM niScIyate iti. anaByAsadaSApannaprATamikajalAdijYAne jAte tatra prAmARyasaMSaye satyapi puruzaH pravartate iti viSepotra drazwavyaH (sa0 kO0 pf0 18). atredaM boDyam. praTamaM jalajalatvayornirvikalpakam. tataH idaM jalam iti viSizwajYAnam. tata icCA. tataH pravfttiH. tadanantaraM jalanABaH (si0 ca0) iti. aByAsadfSApannajYAnezu dvitIyatftIyAdijalAdijYAnezu tu pravftteH pUrvamapyanvayavyatirekiRApi pUrvajYAnadfzwAntena tatsajAtIyatva liNgena prAmARyamavaDAryate. tadyaTA dvitIyAdijalajYAnaM pramA samarTapravfttijanakajAtIyatvAdAyajalajYAnavat (sa0 kO0 pf0 18) (nIla0) iti. dvitIyaM utpattO paratastvaM tu pramAyA guRajanyatvarUpam. tadyaTA pratyakzapramAyAM viSezaRavadviSezyasaMnikarzAtmaka guRajanyatvam. aTavA BUyovayavAvacCedenendriyasaMnikarzAtmaka guRajanyatvam. evamanumitO vyApakavati vyApyavattAjYAnarUpaguRajanyatvam upamitO yaTArTa sAdfSyajYAnAtmakaguRajanyatvam SAbdaboDe ca yaTArTayogyatAjYAnarUpaguRajanyatvaM yaTArTavaktavAkyArTajYAnarUpaguRajanyatvaM vA utpattI paratastvam ityAdyUhanIyam (nIla0 pf0 37) (ma0pra0 4 0 73). atrAyaM saMgrahaH. pramARatvApramARatve svataH sAMKyAH samASritAH. nEyAyikArate parataH sOgatAcaramaM svataH. praTamaM parataH prAhuH prAmARyaM svataH prAhuH parataScApramARatAm.. (sarva0 pf0 evam nEyAyikamate apramAtvamapi parata eva<BR>;p{0567}<BR>vedavAdinaH. pramARatvaM 279 jEmi0) iti. anumAnAdinA gfhyate utpadyate ca (ci0 1 prAmAH) (ta0 dI0 pf0 37) (si0 ca0) iti. atrAnumAnAdinEvApramAttraM gfhyate (anumIyate). tatra hetuH purovartini prakArABAvasya vyavasAyenAvizayIkaraRAt. taTA ca pratyAsatteraBAvAdapramAtvasyAnuvyavasAyena grahaRaM na Bavati iti BAvaH. atrAnumAnaprayogastvitTam. idaM jYAnamapramA visaMvAdipravfttijanakatvAt yannEvaM tannEvaM yaTA pramA (nIla0 prAmA0 pf0 37) iti. evaM ca anumAnAdigrAhyatvAdapramAyA jYaptO paratastvam iti boDyam. taTA apramAyAH pittamaRqUkavasAYjanacAkacakya dUratvAdidozajanyatvAdutpattAvapi paratastvamiti boDyam (si0 ca0). atra pittadUratvAdidozonanugato'yanvayavyatirekAByAM heturBavati iti vijYeyam (ma0 pra0 prAmA0 pf0 73).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0557" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमादः
pramAdaH — (dozaH) 1 pUrva kartavyatayA niScitepyakartavyatADIH. evaM vEparItyepi (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3). sA ca pUrvamakartavyatayA niScitepi kartavyatADIH. yaTA pramAdAtkurvatAM karma ityAdO. 2 kartavye akartavyatvaDiyA tato nivfttiH akartavye kartavyatvaDiyA tatra pravfttirvA pramAdaH iti kecidAhuH (vAca0). 3 anavaDAnatA iti kAvyajYA AhuH (amaraH). 4 paYcasamitiguptizvanutsAhaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 76 AI0). samADisADanAnAmaBAvanaM pramAdaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 355 pAtaYja0).).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0567" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमितत्वम्
