प्रमेयम्
prameyam — 1 [ka] yorTaH tattvataH pramIyate tatprameyam (vAtsyA 0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA). yaTA GawapawAdi sarvaM jagatprameyam. atra prameyatvaM ca ISvarIyapramAvizayatvam (ta0 dI0 2). tacca kevalAnvayi. sarvasyApi jagata ISvarajYAnarUpapramAvizayatvAt (nyA0 ma0). sAmAnyataH pramAvipayatvaM vA prameyatvam. mAyAvAdimate viSudDaM cEtanyameva prameyam. [Ka] saMsArahetumiTyAjYAnavizayaH mokzahetuDIvizayo vA. yaTA AtmaSarIrAdi prameyam. nyAyanaye dvAdaSaviDaM prameyam. AtmA SarIram indriyam arTaH budDiH manaH pravfttiH dozaH pretyaBAvaH Palam duHKam apavargaSca (gO0 1. 1. 9) iti. atra prameyatvaM ca tattvajYAnaniyAmakatAvacCedakam iti jYeyam. 2 paricCedyam. 3 avaDAraRavizayaH (avaDAryam) iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0568" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयत्नः
prayatnaH — (guRaH) 1 [ka] prayatnaH saMramBaH utsAhaH iti paryAyaH (praSasta0 2 pf0 33). sa ca manogrAhyaH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 58) nirAkAraH savizayakaH AtmamAtraDarmaSca iti vijYeyam. prayatnalakzaRaM ca kftitvajAtimattvam (vAkya0 gu0 pf0 21). aTavA saMskArecCABinnatve sati saMbanDAnavacCinnaprakAratAkatvam (la0 ba0). [Ka] prayatnatvasAmAnyavAn utsAharUpaH (ta0 kO0). taTA coktam. prayatnastvAtmaDarmaH syAdutsAho BAvanA ca saH (tA0 ra0 pari01 Slo0 46) iti. sa ca kftirityucyate (ta0 saM0). [ga] prayatnavyavahArAsADAraRaM kAraRam (pra0 pra0 17). yaTA pacatItyAdO tibarTaH. prayatnavyavahAraSca ahaM yate sa yatate ityAdivyavahAraH. sa triviDaH pravfttiH nivfttiH jIvanayoniyatnaSceti (BA0 pa0 Slo0 150) (vAkya0 gu0 pf0 21). prakArAntareRa sa prayatnaH dviviDaH jIvanapUrvakaH icCAdvezapUrvakaSca. tatra jIvanapUrvakaH suptasya prARApAnasaMtAnaprerakaH praboDakAle cAntakaraRasyendriyAntaraprAptihetuH. asya jIvanasaMjYakasyAtmamanasoH saMyogAdDarmADarmApekzAdutpattiH (praSasta 0 2 pf0 33).<BR>;p{0569}<BR>SizwaM tu jIvanayoniSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditam. icCAdvezapUrvakastu hitAhitaprAptiparihArasamarTasya vyApArasya hetuH SarIraviDArakaSca AtmamanasoH saMyogAdicCApekzAdvezApekzAdvA utpadyate (praSasta 0 2 pf0 33). 2 PalArTiBiH prArabDasya karmaRovasTApaYcakAntargatovasTAviSezaH prayatnaH iti sAhityaSAstrajYA AhuH (vAca0). taduktam prayatnastu PalAvApyE vyApArotitvarAnvitaH (sA0 da0 pari0 6 Slo0 326) iti. 3 prayAsaH iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0568" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुक्तत्वम्
prayuktatvam — 1 prayojyatvam. tacca kAraRABAvAtkAryABAvaH iti pratItisAkzikaH svarUpasaMbanDaviSezaH. yaTA daRqABAvAdGawABAva ityAdO GawABAvAdyanvayi paYcamyarTaH prayuktatvam (mU0 ma0 1) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 2) (ga0 helA0 sADA0 pf0 24). yaTA vA padasya padAntaravyatirekaprayuktAnvayAnanuBAvakatvamAkANkzA (ta0 saM0) ityAdO prayuktatvam (nIla0 4 pf0 32). 2 kvacittu vyApakatvam. yaTA dIDitihetvABAsasAmAnyaniruktO atra vadanti iti kalpe yadvizayakaniScayasya viroDivizayitAprayuktaH taduttaramanumitO dvayorvyatirekaH iti hetvABAsa sAmAnyalakzaRasya nirvahnirvahnimAn ityAdO bADAdyavyAptyApattivAraRArTaM praTamayattukAreRa prayuktapadasya vyApakatvavAn ityarTaH svIkftaH. evaM ca praTamayattukAramate viroDivizayakayadvizayaka niScayAvyavahitottarAnumititvavyApakaH prakftapakze prakftasADyavESizwyAvagAhitva sADyavyApya hetu vESizwyA vagAhitva etaduBayABAvaH tattvam hetudozatvam iti paryavasitorTaH (ga0 2 hetvA0 sAmA0 pf0 27). 3 prayogakarmatvam. yaTA SabdaH prayuktaH vAkyaM prayuktam ityAdO SabdavAkyayoH prayuktatvam. 4 preritatvam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0569" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोगः
prayogaH — 1 anumAnam (vE0 u0 771. 7). 2 udAharaRam. 3 SabdoccAraRam. tatra nEyAyikAH anumAnANgapaYcAvayavavAkyoccAraRam yaTA atrAyaM prayogaH ityAdO parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdiprayogaH ityAhuH. SAbdikAstu SabdAnAM yaTAyogaM samaBivyAhftatvenoccAraRaM 72<BR>;p{0570}<BR>. prayogaH iti vadanti. 4 yajYAdikriyAkalApetikartavyatAboDakAnAM samuccayapratipAdakaH padDatyaparaparyAyo granTaH iti yAjYikA AhuH. 5 uttamarRena svadravyasya vfdDyarTamaDamarRAya dAnaM prayogaH iti vyavahArajYA vadanti. 6 BUtapretAccAwana sADana mantrocAraRAdyanuzWAnam iti tAntrikA AhuH. 7 nAyakayormelane kriyAviSezaH ityAlaMkArikA AhuH. 8 SastrAdimocanam iti yodDAro vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0569" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोगविधिः
prayogaviDiH — (viDiH) [] prayogAvilambavoDako viDiviSezaH. sa ca prayogaviDiH prayAjAdyaNgajAtavAkyEkavAkyatA mApanno darSapUrRamAsAByAM svargakAmo yajeta ityAdipraDAnaviDirevoktavakzyamARaviDitraya- (melanarUpaSvacaturTIyaM viDiH na tu viDyantaram (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 30). [Ka] aNgAnAM kramavoDako viDiH (lO0 BA0 pf0 3031). atra kramo nAma vitativiSezaH. pOrvAparyarUpo vA. tatra krame paw pramARAniSruti- arTapAWa-sTAnamuKya-pravftti ityAKyAni iti (lO0 BA0 pra0 31) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 62). atra uttarottaramapekzya pUrvapUrva balIyaH iti vijYeyam. wIkAyAM cetTamuktam. vitananaM vitAno vA vitatiH. tanu vistAre iti DAtorBAve ktiH. taTA ca bahuBiH kartfBiyugapat kftAnAmapi padArTAnAM vitAnaviSezo Bavatyeva na tu kramavyavahAraH. taTAca tatra praTamalakzaRasyAtivyAptiH ityarucyA lakzaRAntaramAha pOrvAparyeti (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 31). [ga] anuzWIyamAnapadArTAnAM kramaboDako viDiH. yaTA vedaM kftvA vediM karoti ityAdi. atra kramastu avyavahitottaratvam (BAwwadI 0). aTavA avyavahitapOrvAparyam. sa ca prayogaviDiH aNgaviDyekavAkyatApannaH praDAnaviDireva. tena krameRa (kevalakrameRa) padArTAnAmanuzWAnAt (ma0pra0 4 pf0 32) (lO0 BA0 3133). yaTA agnihotraM juhoti yavAgUM pacati ityAdi. atra pAWakramAdarTakramo balIyAn iti pAWakramaM parityajyArTakrama evASrIyate. itTaM ca pUrvaM yavAgUpAkaH tato yavAgvAgnihotrahomaH (ma0pra0 pf0 62) (lO0 BA0 33). [Ga] prayogaprASuBAvaboDako viDiH prayogaviDiH (mI0 nyA0 pf0 37)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0570" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोजकत्वम्
prayojakatvam — 1 [ka] paraMparayA (na tu sAkzAt) kAryajanakatvam. yaTA kAiyAM maraRAnmuktirityAdO mokzaM prati kASImaraRasya prayojakatvam. atra muktO tattvajYAnasyEva sAkzAtkAraRatvam. kASImaraRasya tu muktO paraMparayA kAraRatvam iti tasya prayojakatvaM jYeyam (ta0 pra0 1 maNgala0). atredaM tattvam. yasyAnukUlatarkAsti sa eva syAtprayojakaH hetuH iti. yasyAnukUlatarkABAvaH sonyaTAsidDaH (tA0 20 0 8788). atra vadanti kAraRasya yat kAraRam tasya prayojakatvam iti. atra gurucaraRAH prAhuH tannizwAnyaTAsidDiBinnAnyaTAsidDiSUnyatve sati kAryAvyavahitapUrvavfttitvam iti. [Ka] svarUpasaMbanDa viSezaH. yaTA duHKajanmapravfttidozamiTyAjYAnAnAM maDye yaduttarottaram tezAmapAye tatpUrvasvApAyAdapavargaH ityAdO paYcamyarTaH. yaTA vA daRqABAvAdBUwABAva ityAdO daR paYcamyarTaH prayojakasyam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 2). 2 hetutvam. tacca jYApakajYAnavizayatvam. yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO DUmasya prayojakatvam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 87). 3 vEyAkaraRAstu hetusaMjYakakartftvam. yaTA tatprayojako hetuSca (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 55) ityAdI ityAhuH. yaTA vA DarmaSAstre prayojapayitA mantA karteti svarganarakaPalezu karmasu BAginaH. yo BUya AraBate tasmin PalaviSezaH (Apasta0 sU0 2. 11. 29. 1 - 2) ityAdO prayojakatvam. atra prayojakasya hantftvam (prA0 vi0) nirRItaM yaTA nirantaravyApArAvyavaDAnena vaDanizpAdakaH kartA. yaH kartAraM kArayati sa prayojakaH. sopi dviviDaH. tatrEkaH svatopravfttaM padAtiM vetanAdinA vaDArTaM pravartayati. aparastu svataH pravfttameva mantropAyopadeSAdinA protsAhayati iti (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0571" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोजनम्
prayojanam — [ka] yamarTamaDikftya pravartate tat prayojanam (gO0 1. 1. 24). yamarTamAptavyaM hAtavyaM vADyavasAya tadAptihAnopAyamanutizWati prayojanaM tadveditavyam. pravfttihetutvAt. imamarTamApsyAmi hAsyAmi veti vyavasAyorTasyADikAraH. evaM vyavasIyamAnorToDikriyata<BR>;p{0572}<BR>iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 24). prayojanatvaM ca pravfttihetvicCAvizayatvam. vizayatvaM ca sADyatAKyavizayatAviSezaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 24). atra vArtikakArA AhuH. DarmArTakAmamokzEH prayujyata iti kecit. vayaM tu paSyAmaH. suKaduHKAptihAniByAM prayujyata iti. suKaduHKasADanaBAvAttu sarverTAScetanaM prayojayantIti. tadidaM prayojanaM nyAyasyASrayaH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 14). [Ka] yena prayuktaH pravartate tat prayojanam. yamarTamaBIpsajihAsanyA karmAraBate tenAnena sarve prARinaH sarvARi karmARi sarvASca vidyA vyAptAH. tadASrayaSca nyAyaH pravartate (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1) (ta0 BA0 pf0 42) (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 14). [ga] yaduddiSya pravartante puruzAstatprayojanam (tA0 20 Slo0 56). [Ga] sADyatayecCAvizayaH (di 0 1). yaTA suKaM duHKahAniSca prayojanam (ta0 dI0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 42). prayojanaM dviviDam. muKyam gORaM ca. tatrAdyam suKaM duHKahAniSca.. dvitIyam yAgaBojanAdikam. prayojanasya muKyatvaM ca nirupADIcCAvizayatvam (ci0 4) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 24). itarecCAnaDInecCAvizayatvaM vA. samAnADikaraRecCAjanyecCAvizayatvaM vA (atra ajanyeti padacCedaH). prayojanAjanakaprayojanatvaM vA (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 70). prayojanasya gORatvaM ca muKyaprayojanecCADInecCAvizayatvam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 24).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0571" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

