ralayAnantaraM na sfzwiH. sarvamuktO sarvotpattinimittasyAdfzwasyApAyAt<BR>;p{0574}<BR>kAlam iti (pa0 mA0 pf0 93). anyatra cetTamuktam. caturRAM mahABUtAnAM saMhAra viDirucyate. trAhmaRa mAnena varpaSAnte vartamAnasya brahmagopavargakAle saMsAre KinnAnAM sarvaprARinAM niSi viSrAntyarTaM sakalaBuvanADipatermaddeSvarasya saMjihIrzAsamakAlaM SarIrendriyaBUtopanibanDakAnAM sarvAtmagatAnAmadfzwAnAM vfttiniroDe sati maheSvarecCAmARu saMyogajakarmaByaH SarIrendriyakAraRARuviBAgeByaH tatsaMyoganivfttO tezAM paramARvanto vinASaH. taTA pfTivyudakajvalananayamAnAnAmapi mahABUtAnAmanenEva krameRottarasminnuttarasmin sati pUrvasya pUrvasya vinASaH. tataH praviBaktAH paravARavotratizWante. DarmADarma saMskArAnuvidDA AtmAnastAvantametra (praSasta 0 1 pf0 6). nyAyamate sa dviviDaH. KaRqapralayaH mahApralayaSca. tatrAdyaH sakalakAryadravyAnADArakAryADikaraRasamayaH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 76) (di0 4 pf0 189). sacAgamapratipAdyaH. Agamastu nAho na rAtrirna naBo na BUmirnAsIttamo jyotiraBUnnacAnyat iti (di0 4 pf0 189). dvitIyastu sakalaBAvakAryalayaH. [Ka] trElokyanASaH iti mAyAvAdina AhuH (vedA0 pari0 vizayapa0 pf0 81). [ga] pOrARikAstu BUtAdilayAcAraH kAlaviSezaH pralayaH. sa ca caturviDaH. nityaH nEmittikaH prAkftaH AtyantikaSca ityAhuH. mAyAvAdinAM matepi pralayaScaturviDaH. nityaH prAkftaH nEmittikaH AtyantikaSceti. tatra nityapralayaH suzuptiH. prAkftapralayastu kAryabrahmavinASanimittakaH sakalakArya vinASaH. nEmittika pralayastu kAryabrahmaRo divasAvasAnanimittaka trElokyamAtrapralayaH. caturTastu brahmasAkzAtkAranimittakaH sarvamokzaH. sa cekajIvavAde yugapadeva. nAnAjIvavAde tu krameRa. sarva ekIBavanti ityAdiSruteH (vedA0 pa0 vizayapa0 pf0 8384) iti. kiMca yugapralayaH manupralayaH dinapralayaH mahApralayaSceti Bedena caturviDaH pralayaH ityapi pOrARikA vadanti. [Ga] nazwacewanA (nEmittikapralayaH) iti kAvyajYA AhuH. [Na] tadetezu pralInezu nirupalatravivekaKyAti paripatra SAtkArya kAraRAtmakAnAM praDAne<BR>;p{0575}<BR>layaH pralayaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 386 pAtaYja0). kUrmapurARe cEtramuktam. nityo nEmittikacEva prAkftAtyantikO taTA. caturDAyaM purAResmin procyate pratisaMcaraH.. iti. tatra nityo yaTA yoyaM saMdfSyate nUnaM nityaM loke kzayastviha. nityaH saMkIrtyate nAnA muniBiH pratisaMcaraH.. atra mAyAtrAdina AhuH. nityapralayo nAma suzuptiH. tasyAH sakalakAryapravilayarUpatvAt. DarmADarma pUrvasaMskArARAM ca tadA kAraRAtmanA - vasTAnam. yadvA antaHkaraRasya dve SaktI jYAnaSaktiH kriyASaktiSca. tatra jYAnaSaktiviSizwAntaHkaraRasya suzuptO vinASaH. na kriyASaktiviSizwasya iti prARAdyavasTAnamavirudDam iti (vedA0 pa0 vizaya0 pa0 pf0 8182). nEmittiko yaTA brAhmo nEmittiko nAma kalpAnte yo Bavazyati. trElokyasyAsya kaTitaH pratisargA manIziBiH.. tatra nEmittikAlayakAlaca kalpatulyaH. yadA sa devo jAgarti tadedaM cezwate jagat. yadA svapiti SAntAtmA tadA sarvaM nimIlati.. iti (manu0 a0 1 Slo0 52) manunA hiraRyagarBasya nidrAsamaye tatpralayasyokteH (vAca0). prAkfto yaTA mahadAdyaM viSezAntaM yadA saMyAti saMkzayam prAkftaH pratisargAyaM procyate kAlacintakEH. ayameva pralayaH KaRqapralayaH iti avAntarapralayaH iti ca nEyAyikErvyavahniyate iti jYeyam. Atyantiko yaTA jYAnAdAtyantikaH prokto yoginaH paramAtmani. pralayaH pratisargoyaM kAlacintAparErdvijEH. AtyantikaSca kaTitaH pralayo layasADanaH iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0572" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

