प्रवर्तकम्
pravartakam — pravfttijanakam. yaTA navyanEyAyikamate balavadanizwAnanubanDIzwasADanatve sati kftisADyatAvizayakaM jYAnaM pravartakam. atra balavadanizwetyatra balavadveze izwasADanatyaGawakecCAyAM kftisADyatAGawaka kftO ca<BR>;p{0576}<BR>idAnIMtanatvaM viSezaRaM deyam. tena vakzyamARaM sarvaM saMgacCate nAnupapattiSca. taTAhi. dozadUzitacitto vizaBakzaRAdO pravartate. idAnIM balavadanizwAnanuvanDitvajYAnAt. tfptaSca Bojane na pravartate. idAnI- 11 mizwasADanatvAjYAnAt. BAviyOvarAjye vAlasya na pravfttiH. idAnIM kftisADyatvAjYAnAt (di0 gu0 pf0 225). yaTA vA jarannEyAvikramate izwasADanatAvizayakaM kftisADyatAjYAnameva pravartakam. yaTA vA prABAkaramate svaviSezaRavattApratisaMDAnajanyaM kAryatAjYAnaM pravartakam (ci0 4) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 2527) (di0 gu0 pf0 222224). svaviSezaRavattetyAderarTaSca svam pravartamAnaH puruzaH. tatra viSezaRam kAmye hi yAgAdO kAmanA. nitye saMDyAvandanAdO tu vihita kAlaSOcAdi. tadvattA pakze tatsaMbanDaH. tasya pratisaMDAnam tatsaMbanDAnam. tajjYAnameva vA parAmarSAtmakam. tena janyaM kAryatAjYAnam kftisADyatAjYAnam anumityAtmakam iti. tatra svargakAmo yajeta BojanakAmaH paceta ityAdi kAmyam. aharahaH saMDyAmupAsItetyAdi nityam. taTAca kAmyasTale kAmyasADanADanatAjYAnam nityasTale tu SOcAdijYAnam ityarTaH (di0 gu0 pf0 223). atrAnumAnaprayogaH kAmye pAko matkftisADyo matkfti vinA asattve sati madizwasADanatvAt iti (di0 gu0 pf0 223). nitye tu ahamidAnIMtana kftisADyasaMDyAvandanaH saMDyAsamaye SOcAdimattvAt pUrvasaMDyAyAmahamiva iti (ci0-4). atra tadAnIMtanaM svaviSezaRam iti vaktavyam. tena tfptaSca Bojane na pravartate. tadAnIM kAmanAyAH puruzaviSezaRatvABAvAt. pratisaMDAnaM ca balavadanizwAnanubanDityavizayakam iti vaktavyam. tena maDuvizasaMpfktAnnaBojane na pravfttyApattiH. evaM ca balavadanizwAnanubanDitvavizayakaM yat svaviSezaRavattAjYAnam tajjanyaM kftisADyatAjYAnaM pravartakaM Bavati iti nizkfzworTaH (di0 gu0 pf0 203). yaTA vA codaneti kriyAyAH (niyogasya) pravartakaM (jYAnadvArA pravartakama) vacanam ityAdO (SAvara BAzyam). aDikaM tu viDiSabde pravfttiSabde ca savistaraM saMpAdayizyate iti tat tatra drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0575" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

