pravartanA — lakzaRA dozAH (gO0 1. 1. 18) ityAdO. 2 [ka] yadvizayakatvena jYAnasya pravfttijanakatvaM tat. yaTA svargakAmo yajeta jalamAharetetyAdO liNarTo viDiH pravartanam (vE0 sA0) (ku0 5. 6). atra yatpadArTa izwasADanatvam. taTA ca izwasADanatvasya jYAnaM pravfttiM janayatItIzwasADanatvaM pravartanaM Bavati iti jYeyam (vE0 sA0 da0). maRqanamiSrARAmapIdameva matam iti vijYeyam (di0 gu0 prayatnani0 pf0 226). [Ka] BawwapAdAstu pravartayituH pravfttyanukUlavyApAraviSezaH ityAhuH. sa ca cetanasyABiprAya eva. acetanasya tu vedasyABiDAnAmA kaScicCandasamavetaH SAbdaBAvanAparaparyAyo liNtvAMSenocyate iti (di0 gu0 viDini0 pf0 226). [ga] pravfttyanukUlo vyApAraH pravartanA (mI0 nyA0 pf0 69). pravartanA ca pravfttijanakajYAnavizayitAvacCedikA iti vEyAkaraRAH (di0 gu0 pf0 226). pravartanA caturviDA viDinimantraRAmatragAvIzwaBedAt. tatra viDiH preraRam. BftyAdernikfzwasya pravartanam. nimantraRaM niyogakaraRam. AvaSyake SrAdDaBojanAdO dOhitrAdeH pravartanam. AmantraRaM kAmacArAnujYA. aDIzwaH satkArapUrvako vyApAraH (si0 kO0 pf0 189). atroktam asti pravartanArUpamanusyUtaM caturzvapi iti (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0577" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

