प्रवृत्तिः
pravfttiH — 1 (prayatnaH) [ka] utkawarAgajanyaH prayatnaviSezaH (vE0 vi0 3. 1. 19). lakzaRaM tu pravfttitvameva. tacca. rAgajanyatAvacCedakatayA sidDo jAtiviSezaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 17). cikIrzAjanyatAvacCedako jAtiviSezo vA (mU0 ma0 1) (la0va0 pf0 137). cezwAjanakatAvacCedakatayA sidDo jAtiviSezo vA (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 95 pf0 137). pravfttyutpattAvayaM kramaH. praTamataH PalajYAnam. tataH PalecCA. tata izwasADanatAjYAnam upAye. tata upAyecCA. tataH pravfttirutpadyate iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 103). 73<BR>;p{0578}<BR>pravftticCAmapekzate. icCA cezwasADanatAjYAnam. taccezwasajAtIyatve liNgAnuBavam. sopIndriyArTasaMnikarzam (ku0 5. 6). pravftti prati cikIrzA kftisADyatAjYAnaM izwasADanatvajYAnaM ca kAraRam (BA0 pa0 Slo0 151). kftiScAtra pravfttirUpA voDyA. tena jIvanayoniyatnasADye prARapaYcakasaMcAre na pravfttiH atra maDuvizasaMpfktAnnaBojanAdO pravfttyApattivAraRAya cikIrzeti (mu0 gu0 pf0 222225). BojananAntarIyake Srame pravfttivAraRAya cikIrzA kAraRam ityavaSyaM mantavyam. tena izwasADanatvajYAnasya kAraRatvaM vyarTam. vfzwyAdO pravfttyApattervAraRAya kftisADyatAjYAnam. anizwasADane pravfttyApattivAraRAyezwasADanatvajYAnaM ca kAraRamityuktam. kiMtvanizwasADane cikIzEva nAsti. pravftti prati cikIrzAmAtraM kAraRam iti prABAkarA AhuH. prABAkaramate SuktO rajatArTipravftti prati purovartinIzwatAvacCedakA saMsargAgraha eva hetuH. na tu nyAyamatasidDa izwatAvacCedakaprakArakaM jYAnaM hetuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 133). prABAkarARAmayamASayaH. kAryatvajYAnaM pravartakam. taTAhi. jYAnasya pravfttO janayitavyAyAM cikIrzAtiriktaM nApekzitamasti. tatsattve kftivilamba hetvantarABAvAt. cikIrzA ca kftisADyatAjYAnasADyA. icCAyAH svaprakArakaDI sADyatvam iti niyamAt. ata eva svakftisADye pAke pravartate. na tvizwasADanatAjYAnasADyA. svakftyasADye candramaRqalAnayanAdO cikIrzAyA adarSanAt (ci0 4) (mu0 gu0 pf0 222223). atredaM boDyam. prABAkaramate pravftterhi vizayatA triviDA. sADyatvAKyA upAdAnatvAparanAmnI sidDatvAKyA uddeSyatvAKyA ceti. tatrAdyA yannizWakftisADyatAjYAnacikIrzAdinA pravfttiH tannizWA. sA ca GawayAgapAkAdinizWEva. na tu tajjanakI BUtakapAlahavistaRqulA disidDanizWA. ata eva GawaM karomi yAgaM karomi ityAdyanuvyavasAyaH. na tu kapAlahavirAdeH sidDatAdaSAyAM kapAlaM karomi haviH karomi ityAdyanuvyavasAyaH vyavahAro vA. . dvitIyA tu vipatratA sidDakapAlaha vistaRqulAdyupAyanizWA. kapAlena GawaM<BR>;p{0579}<BR>karomi havizA yAgaM karomi ityAdyanuvyavasAyAt. tftIyA ca yatsADanatAjYAnADInA cikIrzA tannizWA. taca jalAharaRasvargOdanAdirUpam. jalAharaRamuddiSya GawaM karomi vargamuddiSya yAgaM karomi ityanuvyavasAyAt iti mu0 ma0) (vAca0). [Ka] cikIrpAjanyo yatnaH (ta0 kO0). yaTA vidyArTI vidyAyAM pravartate iti. [ga] tasye sAjihAsAprayuktasya samIhA (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 prastAvanA). tasyetyasya jYAturityarTaH. [Ga pravfttirvAgbudDiSarIrAramBaH (gO0 1. 1. 17) iti. tadarTaSca vAgAramBo vAcikI pravfttiH. satyaM priyaM hitamiti puRyA. asatyamapriyamahitamiti pApA. budDiH buDyate jYAyateneneti mana ucyate. tena mAnasI pravfttiBUtadayAdiH. SArIrI pravfttiH dAnaM paricaraRamityAdikA daSaviDA pApA daSaviDA puRyA ceti (bE0 u0 6. 1. 14). SarIreRa manasA vAcA ca pravfttirAraByate. seyaM pravfttiH dviviDA puRyA ca pApA ca. puRyA daSaviDA kAyena paritrARam paricaraRam dAnamiti. vAcA satyam hitam priyam svADyAyaH iti. manasA dayA spfhA SradDA ceti. viparyayeRa pApApi daSaviDEtra. pravfttiPale pravfttyupacAraH. tadyaTA annaM vE prARinaH prARAH iti. pravfttiPalaM DarmADarmO (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 17 pf0 85). atra BAzyam. manotra budDirityaBipretam. budDyateneneti budDiH. soyamAramBaH SarIreRa vAcA manasA ca puRyaH pApaSca daSaviDaH. tadetkftaBAzyaM dvitIyasUtra iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 17). pravfttistu dvayI. kAraRarUpA kAryarUpA ca. dve aDyAtmasamavete. tatrAdyA janyatvenAviSizwA viSizwA vA yatnatvajAtimatI pratyakzasidDA. dvitIyA tu DarmADarmarUpA yAgAderagamyAgamanAdeSca ciraDvastasya vyApAratayA karmanASAjalasparSAdeH prAyaScittAdeSva nASyatayA sidDyatIti (gO0 vf0 (4. 1. 1) (ku0 119). taduktam karmanASAjalasparSAtkaratoyAvilaNGanAt. gaRqakI bAhutaraRAdDarmaH kzarati kIrtanAt.. iti. atra karmanASA gayA nikawavfttirnadIviSezaH iti jYeyam. atra vArtikakArA AhuH. pravftterdvEviDyam. puruzaBedAnuviDAnAt. tezAM puruzARAM pravfttayastAH<BR>;p{0580}<BR>puruzaBedamanuviDIyamAnA uBayarUpA Bavanti. vItarAgapravfttirekaDA. tatra yA vItarAgARAM pravfttiH sA KalvekarUpA. anizwapratizeDArTI. anizwaM hAsyAma ityeva te pravartante. na punarezAM kvacidaBizaNgosti. rAgAdimatpravfttistu dvirUpA. ye tu rAgAdimantastezAM yAH pravfttayastA dviviDA Bavanti. izwAnizwavizayADigamapratizeDArTAH izwamApsyAmIti saktaH pravartate. anizwaM hAsyAmIti dvezAnnivartate. rAgAdimatpravftterapi dvEviDyaM Bavati. samarTAsamarTaBedAt. yA Kalu rAgAdimatpravfttiH sA samarTA asamarTA ca Bavati. izwamApsyAmIti pravartamAno yadA prApnoti tadA samarTA. taTA anizwaM hAsyAmIti pravartamAno yadA jahAti tadA samarTA. yadA viparyayastadA asamarTeti (nyA0 vA0 pf0 3). BawwapAdA AhuH. loke pravfttidveDA. svecCADInA parapreraRAjanyA ca. tatrAdyAyAM pravartanAyA anupayogepi dvitIyapravfttO sA prayojikA. AcAryapreraRayedaM karomi iti vyavahArAt (di0 gu0 prayatnani 0 pf0 226). 2 SabdAnAmarTaboDanaSaktiviSezaH pravfttiH. yaTA pravfttirAsIcCabdAnAM caritArTA catuzwayI (kumAra0 2. 17) ityAdO. 3 svavizaya indriyAdInAM saMcAraH. 4 pravAhaH. 5 vArtA iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0577" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

