tvarajastamoguRAtmikAyA anAdipariRAminityavyApiprakfterjaqAyA AdyaH pariRAmontaHkaraRarUpo mahattattvAparaparyAyo budDiH (ku0 1) (vE0 u0 8. 1. 1) (si0 ca0 pf0 19) aDyavasAyo vA budDiH ityAhuH (sAMKyasU0 a0 2 sU0. 13). yoyaM kartavyam iti niScayaH (vfttiH) citisaMniDAnAdApannacEtanyAyAH soDyavasAyaH iti tallakzaRam. mAyAvAdinastu niScayAtmakavfttiyutamantaHkaraRaM budDiH ityAhuH. atrocyate. niScayAtmA nirAkAro budDiratyaBiDIyate iti vASizWe (sAMKya0 BA0 1. 64). mano budDirahaMkAraScittaM karaRamAntaram. saMSayo niScayo garvaH smaraRaM vizayA amI.. iti (vedA0 sA0). nyAyamate budDi<BR>;p{0606}<BR>.. dviviDA nityA anityA ca. tatra nityA paramAtmanaH. sA ca sAkzAtkArABiDA pratyakzapramAtmikena. anityA tu jIvasya. anityA dviviDA. smftiH anuBavaSca. tO ca pratyekaM dviviDO. yaTArTO ayaTArTO ca. anuBavaSca caturviDaH. pratyakzam anumitiH upamitiH SAbdaboDaSca. tatra yaTArTAnuBavaH pramA ityucyate. ayaTArTAnuBavastu apramA iti BramaH iti cocyate. pratyakzamapi savikalpakanirvikalpakaBedena dviviDam. tatra nirvikalpakaM na pramA nApi BramaH. saMSayapratyaBijYA - upanItaBAna ityAdikaM tu savikalpaka pratyakza evAntarBavati. aTa prakArAntareRa viBAgaH pradarSyate. budDirdviviDA. smftiH anuBavaSca. uBayamapi pratyekaM yaTArTAyaTArTaBedena dviviDam. tatra sarvA smftiranityA jIvAtmamAtrasamatretA ca. anuBavastu pratyakzAnumityupamitiSAbdaboDaBedena caturviDaH. tatra yaTArTAnuBavaH SAtre pramA ityucyate. pratyakzaM nityAnityaBedena dviviDam. tatra nityaM pratyakzaM paramAtmasamavetam yaTArTameva. anityaM pratyakzaM tu jIvAtmasamavetam yaTArTamayaTArTa ca. anumiti-upamiti - SAbdaboDa etatrayaM cAnityameva jIvAtmamAtrasamavetaM ca iti. idaM ca yaTArTamayaTArTaM cetyuBayaviDamavyasti. pratyaBijYopanItaBAnAdikaM cAnityapratyakza evAntarBavati iti nADikyam. vESezikanaye budDirdviviDA vidyA cAvidyA ca. sA cAnekaprakArA. arTAnantyAt pratyarTaniyatatvAcca. tasyAH satyapyanekaviDatve samAsato dviDA. vidyA cAvidyA ca (praSasta0 pf0 23). tatra viSezaRavadviSezyasaMnikarza liNgaparAmarSa ityAd