बौद्धः
bOdDaH — (nAstikaH) vedo na pramARam iti yatkiMcidveda viSezyakAnAhAryaniScayavAn (mU0 ma0 1). yaTA sugatAdivadDaH. atra vyutpattiH. vOdDaM budDaproktaSAstram vettyaDIte vA bOdDaH iti. atra vyAkaraRam tadaDIte vetti vA (aRU) iti. tatra bOdDAScaturviDAH (1) mADyamikAH (2) yogAcArAH (3) sOtrAntikAH (4) vEBAzikASca iti. te ca vOdDAScaturviDayA BAvanayA paramapuruzArTaM kaTayanti. caturviDaBAvanA ca (1) sarva kzaRikaM kzaRikam iti (2) duHKaM duHKam iti (3) svalakzaRaM svalakzaRam iti (4) SUnyaM SUnyam iti ca. te ca bOdDA yaTAkramaM (1) sarvaSUnyattra (2) bAhyaSUnyattra (3) bAhyArTAnumeyatva (4) bAhyArTapratyakzatvavAdAnAtizWante (sarva0 saM0 pf0 19 bOdDa0). tatra mADyamikAdInAM saMkzepato matamupanyasyate. tattvacatuzwaye Bagavatopadizwe (1) mADyamikAH tAvadu-.<BR>;p{0609}<BR>ttamaprajYA itTamacIkaTan. BikzupAdaprasAraRanyAyena kzaRaBaNgAdyaBiDAnamuKena sTAyitvAnukUla vedanIyatvAnugata sarva satyatvaBramavyAvartanena sarvaSUnyatAyAmeva paryavasAnam. ataH tattvaM sadsaduBayAnuBayAtmakacatukoRa vinirmuktaM SUnyameva. dfzwArTavyavahAraSca svapnavyavahAravat saMvftyA saMgacCate. ata evoktam parivrAkAmukaSunAmekasyAM pramadAtanO. kuRapaH kAminI BakzyaH iti tisro vikalpanAH.. iti. tadevaM BAvanAcatuzwayavaSAnniKilavAsanAnivfttO paraM nirvARaM SUnyarUpaM setsyati iti vayaM kftArTAH nAsmAkamupadeSyaM kiMcidasti iti. SizyEstAvayogaScAcAraSca iti dvayaM karaRIyam. tatrAprAptasyArTasya prAptaye paryanuyogo yogaH. gurUktasyArTasyANgIkaraRamAcAraH. tatra gurUktasyANgIkaraRAduttamAH paryanuyogasyAkaraRAdaDamASca. ata etezAM mADyamikA iti prasidDiH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 2930). (2) kezAMcit bOdDa viSezARAM yogAcAra iti saMjYA. gurUktaBAvanAcatuzwayaM bAhyArTasya SUnyatvaM cANgIkftya Antarasya SUnyatvaM kaTamiti paryanuyogasya karaRAdetezAM yogAcArapraTA. ezA hi tezAM prakriyA. svayaMvednaM tAvadaNgIkAryam. anyaTA jagadAnDyaM prasajyeta.. svavyatiriktagrAhyagrAhaka virahAttadAtmikA budDiH svayameva svAtmarUpaprakASikA prakASavaditi. grAhyagrAhakayoraBedaSca mantavyaH. yadvedyate yena vedanena tattato na Bidyate. yaTA jYAnenAtmA. vedyante tESca nIlAdayaH. yaScAyaM grAhyagrAhakasaMvittInAM pfTagavaBAsaH sa ekasmiMScandramasi dvitvAvaBAsa iva BramaH. atrApyanAdiravicCinnapravAhABedavAsanEva nimittam. vastutaH vedyavedakAkAraviDurAyA api budDe rvyavahartf parijYAnAnuroDenaviBinnagrAhyagrAhakAkArarUpavattayA timirAdyupahatAkzRAM keSendranAqIjYAnABedavadanAdyupaplavavAsanAsAmarTyAdvyavasTopapatteH paryanuyogAyogAt. tasmAdbudDirevAnAdivAsanAvaSAdanekAkArAvaBAsata iti sidDam. tataSca prAguktaBAvanApracayabalAnniKilabAsanocCedavigalita viviDa vizaya. kAropaplava viSudDa vi jYAnodayo mahodayaH. ayameva mokzaH iti. (3) sOtrAntikA itTaM manyante. bAhyamarTajAtanastyeva. taccAnumIyate. yaTA puzwyA BojanamanumIyate yaTA 77 .<BR>;p{0610}<BR>ca BAzayA deSaH yaTA vA saMBrameRa snehaH taTA jYAnAkAreRa jYeyamanumeyam iti. taTA ca bAhyArTasadBAve prayogaH ye yasminsatyapi kAdAcitkAH te sarve tadatiriktasApekzAH. yaTA avivakzatyajigamipati mayi vacanagamanapratiBAsA vivakzujigamizupuruzAntarasaMtAnasApekzAH. taTA ca vivAdADyAsitAH pravfttipratyayAH satyapyAlayavijYAne kadAcideva nIlAdyuleKanAH iti. tatrAlayavijYAnaM nAmAhamAspadaM vijYAnam. ayamevAtmA. nIlAdyalleKi pravfttivijYAnam. tataSca kAdAcitkatvanirvAhAya SabdasparSarUparasaganDavizayAH suKAdivizayAH paqapi pratyayAScaturaH pratyayAnpratItyotpadyante. te catvAraH pratyayAH prasidDAH Alambanasamanantara sahakAryaDipatirUpAH. evam cittacettAtmakAnAM suKAdInAM catvAri kAraRAni drazwavyAni. evam cittacE ttAtmakaH skanDaH paYcaviDaH rUpavijYAnavedanAsaMjYAsaMskArasaMjYakaH. tadidaM sarvaM duHKam duHKAyatanam duHKasADanaM ca iti BAvayitvA tanniroDopAyaM tattvajYAnaM saMpAdayet. tacca prAcInaBAvanAbalAdBavati iti paramaM rahasyam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 3140). sUtrasyAntaM rahasyam pfcCatAM BavantaSca sUtrasyAntaM pfzwavantaH sOtrAntikA Bavantu iti BagavatA budDena aBiDAnAt sOtrAntikasaMjYA saMjAtA iti. (4) kecana bOdDAH (vEBAzikAH) bAhyezu ganDAdizu Antarezu ca rUpAdizu skanDezu satsvapi tatrAnAsTAmutpAdayayituM sarvaM SUnyam iti prATamikAn mADyamikAn vineyAnacIkaTadBagavAn. dvitIyAMstu yogAcArAn vijYAnamAtragrahAvizwAn vijYAnamevEkaM sat ityacIkaTat. tftIyAn sOtrAntikAn uBayaM satyam ityAsTitAn vijYeyamanumeyam ityacIkaTat. seyaM virudDA Bagavato BAzA iti varRayanto vEBAzikAKyayA KyAtAH iti (sarva0 pf0 43 bOdDa0). vEBAzikamate prAtyakzikaM vastu sat AnumAnikaM tvasat iti jYeyam. vEBAzikA itTaM manyante. arTo dviviDaH grAhyaH aDyavaseyaSca. tatra grahaRaM nirvikalpakarUpaM pratyakzam pramARam. kalpanApoQatvAt. aDyavasAyastu savikalpakarUpaH anumAnam apramARam. kalpanAjYAnatvAt. avaSizwaM sOtrAntikaprastAve prapacitam<BR>;p{0611}<BR>iti neha pratanyate (sarva0 pf0 4345 bOdDa0). yadyapi BagavAn (budDa eka eva boDayitA taTApi bodDavyAnAM budDiBedAccAturviDyam. yaTA gatostamarkaH ityukte jAracOrAnUcAnAdayaH svazwAnusAreRABisaraRaparasvaharaRasadAcaraRAdisamayaM budDyante iti (sarva0 pf0 19 bOdDa0). atra bOdDAnAmazwAdaSa BedAH prasidDAH. upaBedAstu bahavo vistaraBayAnnodAhftAH (si0 ca0 1112). vivekavilAse bOdDamatamitTamaByaDAyi. vOdDAnAM sugato devo viSvaM ca kzaRaBaNguram. AryasattvAKyayA tattvacatuzwayamidaM kramAt.. duHKamAyatanaM cEva tataH samudayo mataH. mArgaScetyasya ca vyAKyA krameRa SrUyatAmataH. duHKaM saMsAriRaH skanDAste ca paYca prakIrtitAH. vijYAnaM vedanA saMjYA saMskAro rUpameva ca.. paYcendriyARi SabdAdyA vizayAH paYca mAnasam. DarmAyatanametAni dvAdaSAyatanAni tu.. rAgAdInAM gaRoyaM syAtsamudeti nfRAM hfdi. AtmAtmIyasvaBAvAKyaH sa syAtsamudayaH punaH. kzaRikAH sarvasaMskArA iti yA vAsanA sTirA. sa mArga iti vijYeyaH sa ca mokzoBiDIyate.. pratyakzamanumAnaM ca pramARadvitayaM taTA. catuHprasTAnikA bOdDAH KyAtA vEBAzikAdayaH.. arTo jYAnAnvito vEBAzikeRa bahu manyate. sOtrAntikena pratyakzagrAhyorTo na bahirmataH.. AkArasahitA budDiryogAcArasya saMmatA. kevalAM saMvidaM svasTAM manyante maDyamAH punaH. rAgAdijYAnasaMtAnavAsanocCedasaMBavA. caturRAmapi vOdDAnAM muktirezA prakIrtitA.. kfttiH kamaRqalumaRqyaM cIraM pUrvAhna Bojanam. saMGo raktAmbaratvaM ca SiSriye bOdDaBikzuBiH.. iti (sarva0 saM0 pf0 4647 bOdDa0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0608" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बौद्धशास्त्रम्
bOdDaSAstram — praTamaM bfhaspatipraRItam tato budDAvatAre prapaYcitaM ca SAstram. tacca SAstraM bOdDaH iti SabdasyArTe tattanmatopanyAsavelAyAM saMkzepataH prAdarSi. bOdDaSabdasya vyutpattistu budDena proktaM vOdDam iti. atra kaTA SrUyate matsyapurARe. Ayuzo rAjYo nahuzavfdDaSarmara jidamBa vipApmasaMjYakAH paYca putrA Asan. tatra rajeH putraSataM jajYe. tE rajiputrErbalAcCinnayajYaBAgavEBavaH Sakro dInaH san svazwaprAptaye vAcaspatiM prArTayAmAsa.<BR>;p{0612}<BR>tato bfhaspatiH kiM kftavAn. tadAha gatvATa mohayAmAsa rajiputrAn bfhaspatiH. jinaDarmaM samAsTAya vedabAhyaM sa vedavit.. vedatrayIpariBrazwAMScakAra DizaRADipaH. vedavAhyAn parijYAya hetuvAdasamanvitAn.. jaGAna Sakro vajreRa sarvAn DarmavahizkftAn (matsyapu0 a0 24) (vAca0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0611" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्म
brahma — 1 vedaH. yaTA tasmAdetadbrahma nAma rUpamannaM ca jAyate (mu0 1. 1. 9). yaTA vA tene brahma hfdA ya Adikavaye (BAga0 1. 1. 1) ityAdO. 2 tapaH. 3 satyam. 4 tattvam. 5 hiraRyagarBAdayo jIvAH. 6 vipraH. 7 ftvigviSezaH. yaTA yajYasya hEza Bizak brahmA (SrutiH) ityAdO. 8 vizkamBAdizu paYcaviMSo yogaviSezaH iti mOhUrtikA AhuH. 9 vizayaBogatyAgaH. sa cAzwAdaSaviDaH. taduktam divyOdarikakAmAnAM kftAnumatakAritEH. manovAkkAyatastyAgo brahmAzwAdaSaDA matam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 65 AI0) iti. 10 parabrahma (paramAtmA) iti vedAntino vadanti. atrAmnAyate. yadvAcAnaByuditam yena vAgaByudyate. tadeva brahma tvaM vidDi nedaM yadidamupAsate (kena0 4). vadanti tattattvavidastattvaM yajjYAnamadvayam. brahmeti paramAtmeti BagavAniti Sabdyate.. (BAga0 1. 2. 11) iti. tasya navaDA rUpaM yaTA. tarkARAmeva zaRRAM yat zaqviDaM rUpamESvaram. vEzRavAnAmekarUpaM vedAnAmekameva ca. purARAnAmekarUpaM tasmAnnava viDaM smftam. nyAyo nirvarRanIyaM ca yanmataM SaMkarobravIt.. nityaM vESezikAstvanyaM vadanti ca vicakzaRAH. sAMKyo vadati taM devaM jyotIrUpaM sanAtanam.. mImAMsA sarvarUpaM ca vedAntaH sarvakAraRam. pAtaYjalopyanantaM ca vedAH satyasvarUpakam. svecCAmayaM purARaM ca BaktASca nityavigraham (brahmavE0 pu0 a0 108) iti. atrADikaM tu paramAtmaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditaM tatra dfSyam. atra maDvamate vizRureva parabrahma. sa cEka eva saccidAnandavigrahaH guRaparipUrRaH paramArTato jagadAdikAraRam sarvAntaryAmI svatantraSca iti vijYeyam. rAmAnujamate tu SezaSeziBAvANgIkAreRa viSezaH.<BR>;p{0613}<BR>paramAtmA SezI. jIvAstu paramAtmaSarIrarUpatvAcCezAH iti. mAyAvAdimate tu saguRanirguRaBedena dviviDaM brahma. tatra mAyASritaH jAgradAdyavasTAtrayasAkzI ca ISvaraH saguRaH. mAyAtItam avasTAtrayAtItaM ca nirguRam iti viSezo jYeyaH. brahmaRaH tawasTalakzaRaM ca jagajjanmasTitipralayAnAM pratyekamupAdAnapratyakzacikIrzAkftimattvam iti. tena navalakzaRavattvam. taduktaM brahmasUtrakArEH janmAdyasya yataH (bra0 sU0 1. 1. 2) iti. atra SrutiH pramARam yato vA imAni BUtAni jAyante yena jAtAni jIvanti yatprayantyaBisaMviSanti tadvijijYAsasva tadbrahma (tEtti 0 upa0 2. 1. 1) iti. brahmaRaH svarUpalakzaRaM ca saccidAnandAtmakatvam iti. atra SrutiH satyaM jYAnamanantaM brahma (tEtti0 u0 2. 1. 1) iti. nirguRaM nizkalaM SAntaM niravadyaM niraYjanam (Sve0 6. 19) ityAdiSca.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0612" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञानम्
brahmajYAnam — brahmavizayakatattvajYAnam. taccAropajYAnaM nyAyamatasidDam iti kecitpralapanti (vAca0). vayaM tu tacca nyAyamate yaTArTajYAnameva iti vadAmaH. mAyAvAdinastu tatttramasi brahmAhamasmi ityAdimahAvAkyArTajYAnAnantaraM manananidiDyAsanAdinA sarvAtmakoham brahmavAhamasmi iti pramArUpaM pratyakzam iti manyante. SrIpUrRa prajYAcAryAnuyAyinaH SravaRamananAdinA paYca BedajYAnam vizRusarvottamatvAdijYAnAnantaraM BagavatprasAdaPalaM (ahEtukam) BagavadaparokzajYAnam iti prAhuH. paYca BedAstu jIveSayorBedaH jaqajIvayorBedaH jaqeSvarayorBedaH jIvayorBedaH jaqayorBedaSca (paramA SrutiH) (sarva0 pf0 142 pUrRa0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0613" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

