ब्राह्मणः
brAhmaRaH — 1 adfzwaviSezaprayojya brAhmaRatvaDarmavAn. yaTA jAtyA brAhmaRa ityAdO. atra brAhmaRapadArTaGawakatAdfSaDarme tftIyAntArTasya jAtyaBedasyAnvayaH. atrArTe vyutpattiH brahma vedam parabrahma vA vettyaDIte vA iti.<BR>;p{0614}<BR>brAhmaRalakzaRaM ca viSudDamAtApitfjanyatvam. atra viSudDatvaM ca zawkarmADikAravattvam (ta0 kO0 pf0 21). tasya svarUpaM yaTA jAtyA kulena vfttena svADyAyena Srutena ca. eBiryukto hi yastizWennityaM sa dvija ucyate.. (vahnipurARe) (vAca0) iti. vasizWenoktaM brAhmaRasvarUpaM yaTA yogastapo daso dAnaM satyaM SOcaM dayA Srutam. vidyA vijYAnamAstikyametadbrAhmaRalakzaRam. iti. brAhmaRaguRaprayuktaM PalamAha sarvatra dAntAH SrutapUrRakarRA jitendriyAH prARitrave nivfttAH. pratigrahe saMkucitAgrahastAste brAhmaRAstArayituM samarTAH.. iti. tasya mAhAtmyAdi yaTA sarvezAmeva varRAnAM brAhmaRaH paramo guruH. tasmE dAnAni deyAni BaktiSradDAsamanvitEH.. (vAca0) iti. kiMca avidvAMScEva vidvAMSca brAhmaRo dEvataM mahat. praRItaScApraRItaSca yaTAgnirdevataM mahat.. (manu0 9. 317) iti. atra janmanA brAhmaRo guruH iti smftijYeyA. manunApyuktaM yaTA vESezyAtprakftitrEzWayAnniyamasya ca DAraRAt. saMskArasya viSezAcca varRAnAM brAhmaRaH praBuH.. (manu0 a0 10 Slo0 3) iti. 2 matretaravedaBAgo brAhmaRam (fgve0 BAzya0 upo0 pf0 20). atrApastambaH sUtrayAmAsa mantrabrAhmaRayorvedanAmaDeyam iti. jEminirapi taccodakezu mantrAKyA. Seze brAhmaRaSabdaH (jEmi0 a0 2 pA0 1 sU0 3233) iti. tallakzaRaM tu nEruktatyaM yasya matrasya viniyogaH prayojanam. pratizWAnaM viDiScEva brAhmaRaM tadihocyate.. (yAjYava0) iti (vAca0). atra vAtsyAyanaBAzyam. triDA Kalu brAhmaRavAkyAni viniyuktAni viDivacanAni arTavAdavacanAni anuvAdavacanAni (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 61) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0613" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

