भयम्
Bayam — 1 (dozaH) [ka] anizwahetUpanipAte tatparityAgAnarhatAjYAnam (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3). [Ka] anizwavizayasADanopanipAte tajjihAsohanASakyatA Bayam (nyA0 vA0). [ga] paratonizwasaMBAvanA. yaTA vyAGrAdviBetItyAdO viBetyarTaH. atra BItrArTAnAM BayahetuH (pA0 sU0 1. 4. 25) ityanenApAdAnasaMjYA. tadarTaSca BayArTakaDAtuyoge Bayahetutvena saMBAvitamapAdAnam iti. taTA ca vyAGrAdviBetItyAdO prayojyatvaprakArakatvaM paYcamyarTaH. tasyAnizwasaMBAvanAyAmanvayaH. saMBAvitam ityuktyA SatruBrameRa mitrAdapi biBeti iti vAkyasyApi prAmARya78<BR>;p{0618}<BR>nirvAhaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 106). atra SAbdikA vadanti. mItrArTAnAM BayahetuH iti sUtrasTasya BayahetuH ityasya BayapadArTEkadeSAnizwahetuH ityarTaH. yajjanyaM Bayameva na prasidDam tatra paYcamI na Bavatyeva. tatra paYcamyAH izwatve tu hetutvAropeRa sA paYcamI (la0 ma0 suba0 kAra0 5 pf0 109) iti. [Ga] BAvitvena svAnizwacintanam. yaTA vyAGrAdviBeti trasyatItyAdO DAtvarTaH. hetutvaM janyatvaM vA paYcamyarTaH. taSca DAtvarTEkadeSe anizwe cintana eva vAnvitam. taTA ca vyAGrahetukasya svAnizwasya BAvitvena cintanavAn iti vyAGrahetukatvena BAvyanizwaDarmikacintanavAn iti vA tatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0 pf0 80). [Na] SAbdikAstu anizwajYAnam. yaTA corAdviBetItyAdO DAtvarTo Bayam ityAhuH. atra corApAdAnakAnijYAnam iti boDaH (la0 ma0 suba0 kA 0 5 pf0 109). 2 BayasTAyiBAvako rasaviSezaH iti rasaSAstrajYA AhuH. atrocyate rOdraSaktyA tu janitaM cittavEklavyadaM Bayam (sA0 da0 pari0 3 Slo0 178) iti. vEklavyamasTiratvam. 3 nirftiputraviSezaH iti pOrARikA AhuH (BA0 A0 a0 66).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0617" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

