भविष्यत्
Bavizyat — 1 (kAlaH) yatprAgaBAvena yaH kAlovacCidyate sa tasya BavizyatkAlaH (vE0 u0 22238). yaTA Gawa utpatsyata ityAdO GawaprAgaBAvena yaH kAlovacCinnaH (viSizwaH) sa Gawasya BavizyatkAlaH. tarkakEOmudyAM tu tadvyaktiprAgaBAvaviSizwaH kAlastadvyakteranAgatakAlaH ityuktam. anyatra coktam vartamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogyavacCinnakAlaH iti. -1 atrAyaM viSezaH kAlasya saMbanDamAtratvamate avacCinna iti na deyam (pa0 mA0 kAlani0 pf0 92). BavizyatvaM ca [ka] vartamAnakAlavfttiprAgaBAvapratiyogitvam<BR>;p{0619}<BR>. yaTA anAgataH kAlaH ityAdO kAlasya Bavizyattvam (vAkya0 1 pf0 6) (nIla0 1 kAlaH pf0 10). [Ka] AdyakftiprAgaBAvaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 20). [ga] vartamAnaprAgaBAvaH. yaTA pakzyatItyAdO xqarTaH. atra xqarTasya tAdfSaprAgaBAvasya tadarTakftO pratiyogitAsaMbanDenAnvayaH. prAgaBAvAnaNgIkAre tu vartamAnaDvaMsa eva xqarTaH (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 136). [Ga] vartamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogitvam. yaTA Gawo BavizyatItyAdO DAtvarTotpatterBavizyattvam. pakzyatItyAdO cAKyAtArTakfterBavizyattvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 82) (la0 ma0 lakAra0). [Na] vidyamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogyutpattikatvam (tarkA 0 Ka0 4) (dIDi0 2). yaTA nayatItyAdO xqarTaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 83) (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 135). yaTA vA AgamizyatItyAdO xworTaH. atra vidyamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogyutpattikAgamanAnukUlakftimAn ityarTo boDyate (tarkA0 Ka0 4 pf0 11). [ca] vartamAnakAlottarakAlotpattikatvam (ta0 pra0 2) (dIDi0 2). yaTA te ca prApurudanvantaM bubuDe cAdipUruzaH. avyAkzepo BavizyantyAH kAryasidDerhi lakzaRam.. (raGu0 sa0 10 Slo0 6) ityAdO. [Ca] vartamAnaDvaMsaH. yaTA pakzyatItyAdO xqarTaH. ayaM ca prAgaBAvAnaNgIkArapakzepi saMgacCate iti vijYeyam (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 136). 2 pOrARikAstu mahApurARAntargatapurARaviSezaH. yaTA BavizyatpurARamityAdO ityAhuH (nAradIya0 pu0 pA0 4 a0 100).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0618" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

