भ्रमः
BramaH — 1 (apramA) [ka] yatra yannAsti tatra tasya jYAnam. samudAyArTaSca tadaBAvavannirUpitatannizwavizayatApratiyogi jYAnam iti. atra smfterapi BramatayA anuBavatvamapahAya jYAnatvapraveSaH (mu0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 405). BramaSca dozAjjanyate. BramalakzaRaM tu svAnuyoginizWaniSezyatAnirUpitatva - svapratiyoginizWatvasvAvacCinnatva - etatritayasaMbanDena saMbanDaviSizwAnyaprakAratASAlijYAnatvam (ga0 ava0 hetu0) iti. atra svapadArTastu viSezyaviSezaRayorBAsamAnaH saMbanDo jYeyaH. atredamavaDeyam. viparyayopi pratyakzAnumAnavizaya eva Bavati. pratyakzavizaye tAvat prasidDAnekaviSezasyApi pittakaPAnilopahatendriyasyAyaTArTalocanAt saMpratyasaMnihitavizayavijYAnaja saMskArApekzAdAtmamanasoH saMyogAdaDarmAccAtasmin tat iti pratyayo viparyayaH. yaTA gavyeva aSvaH iti. asatyapi pratyakze pratyakzABimAno Bavati. yaTA apagataGanapawalamacalajalaniDisadfSamambaram aYjanacUrRapuYjaSyAmaM SArvaraM tamaH iti. anumAnavizayepi vAzpAdiBirDUmABimatErvahnayanumAnam gavayavizARadarSanAcca gOH iti trayIdarSanaviparItezu SAkyAdidarSanezu idaM SreyaH iti miTyApratyayo viparyayaH (praSasta0 pf0 24). [Ka] tadaBAvavati tatprakArakajYAnam (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 401) (ta0 pra0 1) (ta0 dI0). [ga] atasmin tat iti pratyayaH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 26) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 128) (ta0 BA0 pf0 40). [Ga] viSezyatAvyaDikaraRaprakArakaM jYAnam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 73). yaTA purovartinyevArajate SuktyAdO rajatAropaH. idaM rajatam iti jYAnam (ta0 BA0 pf0 40) (ta0 pra0 1) (ta0 dI0). yaTAM vA<BR>;p{0635}<BR>pItaH SaNKaH lohitaH sPawikaH ityAdi jYAnam (ta0 kO0) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 129). yaTA vA kfSoham baDiraH sTUlaH iti jYAnam (ta0 0). Bramo dviviDaH viparyAsaH (viparyayaH) saMSayaSca. tatrAdyo yaTA SarIrAdO AtmatvaprakArakaM gOroham ityAkArakaM niScayarUpaM jYAnam (mu0 gu0). dvitIyo yaTA sTARurvA puruzo vA iti saMSayarUpaH (BA0 pa0 lo0 130). prakArAntareRa Bramo dviviDaH nirupADikaH sopADikaSca. tayoH svarUpaM cetTam. dozeRa karmaRA vApi kzoBitAjYAnasaMBavaH. tattvavidyAviroDI ca BramoyaM nirupADikaH.. upADisaMniDiprAptakzoBAvidyAvijfmBitam. upADyapagamApohyamAhuH sopADikaM Bramam.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 421 SAM0). [Na] miTyAjYAnAparaparyAyaH ayaTArTaniScayaH (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3) (ta0 saM0). ayaM ca mohapakzAntargato dozaviSeza iti vijYeyam. [ca] viparIta nirRayaH (ta0 kO0). ayaM tu apramApraBedaH. BramasaMSayaBedena dviviDA apramA iti viBajanAt. tena atratyaBramatvasya nirRayatvarUpasya saMSayAsADAraRatvepi na kzatiH. 2 [ka] atiriktavizayatApakze yatprakArikA yA vizayatA tatprakAravyaDikaraRavizayatAkaM jYAnam. vizayatApakze ityasya prakAratAviSezyatAvacCedakatAtiriktA savizayakA ca iti pakze ityarTaH. yatprakAriketyAderarTaSca prakAro DarmaH tadDarmADikaraRAvfttitadvizayatAkaM jYAnam iti. miSrAstu tatprakArakavyaDikaraRatvaM tatprakArAnaDikaraRavfttittram ityAhuH (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 419). [Ka] svaprakAravyaDikaraRavizayatAkaM jYAnam. atra svaprakAravyaDikaraRatvaM ca svaprakArADikaraRAvfttitvam. miSrAstu svaprakAravyaDikaraRatvaM ca svaprakArAnaDi- 1. karaRavfttitvam ityAhuH. tena granTakartfmate rajatArajatasADAraRaDarmadravyaviSezyakaM dravyaM rajatam ityAdijYAnasya na rajatatvAdiBramatvam. miSramate tu tasya tadBamatvamizwameva iti (mu0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 420). [ga] svavyaDikaraRaprakArAvacCinnavizayatApratiyogi jYAnam. svatryaDikaraReti svASrayAvfttiDarmaprakAraketyarTaH (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 422).<BR>;p{0636}<BR>idaM rajatam iti Brame vizayatAdvaye vyaDikaraRaprakArAvacCinnatvasya vizayatvapratiyogitvasyAviroDAt samUhAlambane ca vizayatABedAnnApramAlakzaRe avyAtyativyAptI (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 421422). sarvatra svapadena viSezyatA. [va] svasamAnADikaraRaprakArAnavacCinnavizayatApratiyogijYAnam (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 418420). svasamAnADikaraReti svasamAnADikaraRaDarmaprakAraketyarTaH. prakAratA ca viSezyatAvacCedakatAtiriktA grAhyA. tena idaM rajatam iti SuktimAtraviSezyakaBrame nAvyAptiH. viSezyatAvacCedakAMSe BramarUpam viDeyAMSe ca pramArUpaM jYAnaM na lakzyam iti na tatra doza iti BAvaH (mU0 ma0 1 prAmA0 pf0 422). 3 jalanirgamasTAnam. 4 BramaRam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0