मङ्गलम्
maNgalam — 1 [ka] vinnaDvaMsadvArakArTasamAptiPalakaM karma. tacca yaTA granTAramBe kartavyamASIrvAdAdyanyatamam niDAya hfdi viSvaSaM viDAya guruvandanam (ta0 saM0) ityAdi. maNgalatvaM ca pratibanDakAnyasya sataH prAripsita pratibanDaka duritanivfttya sADAraRakAraRatvam (ki0va0 pf0 6). aTavA viGnotsAraRAsADAraRakAraRatve sati sADyatvam (nyA0 si0 dIH pf0 3). yadvA maNgalavaM nirviGnamArabDaM parisamApyatAm iti kAmanayA vedavihitatvam (ci0 1 maNga0 pf0 101). ayaM kalpaH prAcInamatABiprAyeRa. tanmate samAptireva suKasADanatayA puruzArTatvAtPalam<BR>;p{0637}<BR>. SrOtAtsANgAtkarmaRaH PalAvaSyaMBAvaniyamAt. natu viGnaDvaMso maNgalasya Palam. tasyApuruzArTatvAt (vE0 u0 1. 1. 1) iti. atra SaNkA. kftamaNgalasyApi kAdambaryAdO PalAdarSanAt akftamaNgalasyApi kiraRyAvalyAdO samAptirUpaPaladarSanAcca granTAramBe maNgalaM nAnuzWeyam. nahi nizPale prekzAvAn pravartate iti. atrottaram. maNgalAkaraRasTale kiraRAvalyAdO janmAntarIyasya maNgalasya maNgalaSaraRasTale kAdambaryAdO cANgavEguRyasya kalpanayA saPalatvaM niScIyate iti. janmAntarIyamaNgalAnumAnaM tu idam maNgalam ArabDakarmANgam karmArTitayA SizwEstatpUrvaM kriyamARatvAt PalAntarABAve sati PalavatkarmArisamAnena niyamatastatpUrva kriyamARatvAcca darSe prayAjavat (ci0 1 maNgalavA0 pf0 19) iti. atra maNgalasya svABimatahetutve taTAviDaSizwAcArAnumitaSrutireva mAnam (ci0 1 maNgalavA0 pf0 15). anumitaSrutiSca samAptikAmo maNgalamAcaret iti. atra SrutyanumAnaM tu namaskArAdikam maNgalam vedaboDitasamAptisADanatAkam samApyuddeSyakA lOkikA vigItaSizwAcAravizayatvAt darSAdivat iti. atra yo yaduddeSyakAvigItaSizwAcAravizayaH sa vedaboDitatatsADanatAkaH yaTA darSaH iti sAmAnyato vyAptirdrazwavyA (mU0 ma0 1 maNgala0 pf0 16). aTavA maNgalaM vedaboDitakartavyatAkam alOkikAvigItaSizwAcAravizayatvAddarSaSrAdDavat (ta0 dI0 1 maNga0 pf0 2) iti. maNgalasya kartavyatve pramARamanumAnamapi. tacca maNgalaM saPalam alOkikAvigItaSizwAcAravizayatvAt agnihotratraditi. atra SizwaSca vedaprAmARyAByupagantA. vedaprAmARyAnaByupagamaviroDimattvamiti yAvat. viroDI tu sarve vedAH pramARamiti jYAnaM tu tAdfSasaMskAraSca (ma0pra0 1) (mU0 ma01 maNgala0 pf0 16). saPalatvaM ca balavadanizwAnanubanDIzwaPalakatvam. avigItatvaM tu balavadanizwAnanubanDitvam. tacca svajanyezwApekzayADikAnizwajanakatvaM yadyat tadBinnatvam (ma0 vA0 pf0 1). aTavA DarmaSAstrAnizidDatvam (nIla0 1 maNga0 pf0 2). SizwatvaM cezwasADanatvAMSe aBrAntatvam. AcAravizayatvaM<BR>;p{0638}<BR>tu sADyatvena PalAnyatvena vA viDeyatayA kftivizayatvam (ma0 vA0 pf0 1) (di0 1 maNga0 pf0 5). alOkikatvaM viDimantarA rAgAdiprAptaBinnatvam (nIla0 1 pf0 2). atra sAMKyasUtram maNgalAcaraRaM SizwAcArAt PaladarSanAt SrutitaSceti (sAM0 sU0 a0 5 sU0 1) iti. atredaM boDyam. maNgalaM saPalamityanenAnumAnena saPalatvaM sidDyatsamADyA dirUpamupasTitaPalamAdAyEva paryavasyati (ma0pra0 1) (ma0 vA0 1). taTA hyanumAnam maNgalaM samAptiPalakam samADyanyAPalakatve sati saPalatvAt (di0 1 maNgala0 pf0 4) iti. anenAnumAnena samAptiPalakatvaM sidDyatkartavyatvaM sADayituM kzamate. taTAhi maNgalaM kartavyam samAptiPalakatvAt iti (nIla0 1 maNga0 pf0 2). maNgalaM ca triviDam. taduktam ASIrvAdanamaskAravastunirdeSaBedataH. maNgalaM triviDaM proktaM SAstrAdInAM muKAdizu. (si0 ca0) iti. atra vastunirdeSaSca puRyajanakaSabda nibanDaH puRyakftstutipratipAdakaSabdo vA (ma0 vA0 pf0 10). [Ka] navyAH cintAmaRikftastu viGnotsAraRAsADAraRaM kAraRam (ma0pra0 1 pf0 2) ityAhuH. etanmate maNgalatvaM ca tadviGnopaSama hetutvena vedavihitatvam (ci0 1 maNga0 pf0 101). taTA cEtanmate maNgalasya PalaM viGnaDvaMsa eva. samAptistu budDipratiBAdivinnasaMsargABAvarUpa svakAraRakalApAdBavati iti vijYeyam (nIla0 1 maNgala0 pf0 2) (mu0 1 maNgala0) (di0 1 maNga0 8-9). viGnotsAraRetyAdilakzaRaM ca SaSaDarIye nyAyasidDAntadIpe uktam. tadarTaSca samAptipratibanDaka duritaviSezo viGnastasyotsAraRaM nASastadasADAraRaM kAraRaM maNgalapadavAcyam (ma0pra0 1 pf0 2) iti. atra kiraRAvalI. maNgalamAcareta iti na viDiH. kiM tu namaskArAdikamAcaret iti pratyekameva viDikalpanam ityasmadguravaH (kira0 pf0 6) iti. tattvacintAmaRO coktam. maNgalamAcaret iti na viDiH. kiMtu nirviGnasamAptikAmaH prAripsitaviGnopaSamanakAmo vA devatAstutimAcaret ityAdiH pratyekameva viDiH. maNgalAcArayuktAnAM nityaM ca prayatAtmanAm.<BR>;p{0639}<BR>japatAM juhvatAM cEva vinipAto na vidyate. ityanena boDitAdarSadarSanAdeH pfTageva maNgalatvam. na tu viGnanivartakatayA. tatra nAnArTatEva iti (ci0 1 maNga0 pf0 101102). [ga] anye tu viSezaRatAdisaMbanDAvacCinna pAripsita viGnaDvaMsatvAvacCinnakAraRatAvat ityAhuH (ma0 vA0 pf0 10). [Ga] agarhitABIzwAvAptirmaNgalam iti yogaSAstrajYA AhuH. aBIzwaM ca suKAvAptiduHKaparihArarUpatayezwam (sarva 0 pf0 341 pAta0). 2 praSastAcaraRaM maNgalam iti DarmajYA vadanti. 3 haridrA. 4 dUrvA ceti kAvyajYA AhuH. pOrARikamate maNgaladravyARyazwO lokesminmaNgalAnyazwO brAhmaRo gOrhutASanaH. hiraRyaM sarpirAditya Apo rAjA taTAzwamaH.. (matsyasUkte pa0 42) (vA0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0636" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

