matAnujYA — (nigrahasTAnam) [ka] svapakzadozAByupagamAt parapakzadozaprasaNgo matAnujYA (gO0 5. 2. 21). yaH pareRa coditaM dozaM svapakzeByupagamyAnudDftya vadati Bavatpakze samAno dozaH iti sa svapakze dozAByupagamAtparapakze dozaM prasaYjayanparamatamanujAnAtIti matAnujYA nAma nigrahasTAnamApadyate (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 21) iti. [Ka] svapakze dozamanudDftya parapakze dozABiDAnam (di0 1) (nIla0 pf0 46). yaTA Sabdo nityaH SrAvaRatvAdityukte DvanAvanEkAntikatvena hetvABAsoyam ityuktO SabdaH anityaH kftakatvAditi sADite Dvanerapi pakzatvAnna dozaH ityuktO asidDatvAt tavApi hetvABAsoyam ityuktO soyaM matAnujYayA nigfhItaH syAt. apratizidDamanumataM BavatIti svapakze dozAByupagamAt (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 21). [ga] svasidDAnte parApAditadozamanudDftya parasyAnizwabudDyezwaprasaYjanam. yaTA kenacidAtmanaH puruzatvAcco rastvamasi ityukte tata eva hetoH tvamapi coraH iti prasaYjanam. nityaH SabdaH kAryatvAdityukte tata eva hetostavApyanityaH syAt ityAdInyudAharaRAni drazwavyAni. atra anizwameva parasparaM brUyAt iti rahasyam (sArasaM0 pari0 3 Slo0 148 wI0 pf0 115). [Ga] parABimatasyArTasya svapratikUlasya svayamevAByanujYA (svIkAraH) (ta0 BA0 pf0 51.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0639" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

