मनः
manaH — (dravyam) 1 [ka] nisparSamaRu (nyA0 ma0 1. 14) (vE0 7. 1. 23) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 16). atra vyutpattiH manyate anena manaH iti. karaRArTe asun pratyayaH. tacca manaH sarvendriyapravartakam Antarendriyam svasaMyogena bAhyendriyAnugrAhakam ata eva sarvopalabDikAraRam (ta0 BA0 prameyani0 pf0 32). manaHsadBAve pramARamanumAnam. taccAnumAnam suKAdisAkzAtkAraH karaRasADyaH janyasAkzAtkAratvAccAkzuzasAkzAtkAravat iti. AtmendriyArTasaMnikarze jYAnasya BAvoBAvaSca manaso liNgam (vE0 3. 2. 1). BAvaH aBAvaH iti padacCedaH. yatsaMyogavyatirekAtsuzuptikAle kAryAnutpAdaH tadeva manaH iti 81<BR>;p{0642}<BR>(pa0 mA0). yugapajjYAnAnutpattiH manaso liNgam (go0 1. 1. 16). atra BAzyam. anindriyajanimittAH smftyAdayaH kAraRAntaranimittA Bavitumarhanti iti. yugapacca Kalu GrARAdInAM ganDAdInAM ca saMnikarzezu satsu yugapadBAnAni notpadyante. tenAnumIyate asti tattadindriyasaMyogi sahakAri nimittAntaram avyApi yasyAsaMniDernotpadyate jYAnam saMniDeSvotpadyate iti. manaH saMyogAnapekzasya hIndriyArTasaMnikarzasya jYAnahetutve yugapadutpadyeran jYAnAni (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 16) iti. etasyArTaM vfttikAra Aha. yugapat ekakAle. ekAtmani iti pUraRIyam. jYAnAnAmanutpattiryataH sa eva Darmo jYAnakAraRARutvam manaso liNgam lakzaRam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 16) iti. atra vipratipattiH. samaya sOkzmyAnAkalanAttatra dIrGaSazkulIBakzaRAdO nAnAvaDAnAdO ca yOgapadyABimAno Brama iti nEyAyikAH saMgirante (nyA0 dI0 pf0 21). vedAntinastu manasaH saMkocavikAsaSAlitvAt jYAnAnAM yOgapadyamayOgapadyaM copapadyate ityAhuH (ma0pra0 1 pf0 14). manaso lakzaRaM ca sparSarahitatve sati kriyAvattvam (ta0 dI0). vegavatprARapavanasaMyogAccalanakriyopapattiH iti kecidvadanti (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 41). aTavA mAnasatvAvacCinnakAryatAnirUpita kAraRatve satIndriyatvam (vAkya 0 pf0 6). yadvA dravyasamavAyikAraRatva rahitARusamaveta dravyatvA parajAtiH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 219 OlU0). mImAMsakAstu AtmAnyatve sati jYAnAsamavAyikAraRasaMyogASrayatvam ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 pf0 14). [Ka] manastvABisaMbanDavat (ta0 BA0) (praSasta 0 pf0 23) (nyA0 ma0). [ga] mayi suKam iti suKapratyakzasyA sADAraRaM suKapratyakzasyAsADAraRaM kAraRam (ta0 kO0) (tA0 ra0 Slo0 30). atra manasaH pratyakzakaraRatve AtmamanaHsaMyogo vyApAro boDyaH (ta0 kO0). [Ga] suKAdyupalabDisADanamindriyam (gO0 vf0 111116) (ta0 BA0 arTa0 pf0 31) (BA0 pa0) (ta0 saM0). yaTA sarvArTopalabDO nendriyARi praBavanti iti sarvavizayamantaH karaRaM manaH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 9). manasa indriyatvamAha. nEyAyikasya mana indriyam. tacca samAnata<BR>;p{0643}<BR>vESezike sidDam. evaM pratitantrasidDAntotra drazwavyaH (ta0 BA0 pf0 4243). suKAdipratyakzasADanatvenApi mana indriyaM sidDyati (nyA0 vA0 pf0 41). atredaM boDyam. manaH sarvavizayakajYAnajanakamapi bahirvizayakajYAnajanane paratantram. svetarabahirvizayakajYAnajanakasAmagrIsApekzam ityarTaH. abAhyavizayakajYAne tu manaH svatantram. avAhyA ni tu AtmA tadyogyaguRAH tadaBAvaH tadvfttijAtiSca iti (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 5) (ta0 pra0 1 pf0 30). tacca manaH pratyAtmaniyatatvAdanantam aRu nityam atIndriyaM ceti (ta0 saM0) (ta0 BA0 prame 0 pf0 32). atra samavetaBogakAraRatve sati asamavetaBogakAraRatvaM niyatatvaSabdArTaH. dvitIyArTo nirUpitatvam. tasya ca samavetatvadvayenvayaH. paYcamyarTaH prayuktatvam. tasya cAnantatvenvayaH. taTA ca tattadAtmasamavetaBogajanakatvaviSizwatattadAtmAsamavetaBogajanakatvaprayuktAnantatvavanmanaH iti vAkyArTaH (vAkya0 pf0 7). tacca pratijIvaM Binnam (ta0 kO0) pratiSarIramekEkameva (vE0 u0 3. 2. 3). atra pramARam prayatnAyOgapadyAjjYAnAyOgapadyAYcakam (vE0 3. 2. 3) iti. prayatnajYAnAyEOgapadyavacanAtpratiSarIramekatvaM sidDam. ata eva pfTaktvam (praSasta 0). manaso viButvANgIkAre Atmano manasA saMyogasya jYAnakAraRatvAnupapattiH iti dUzaRaM boDyam. idamatrAkUtam. AtmA viBuH iti sidDAntaH. taTA ca manasopi viButvANgIkAre viBudvayasyApi saMyogApattiH. na ca viBudvayasaMyogostu iti vAcyam. tAdfSasaMyogasya sarvadA sarvatra sattvaprAptO suzuptirevAnupapannA syAt. ato manoRveva ityaNgIkartavyam iti. taTA suKAdInAM pAde me suKam Sirasi me vedanA iti prAdeSikatvaniyamArTaM prAdeSikAsamavAyikAraRam AtmamanaH saMyogarUpamaNgIkartavyam. SabdAdO viBukArye taTEvAvaDAraRAt iti. yogaSAstraboDitapratyAhArAnyaTAnupapattyA ca manoRutvasidDiH iti kecidAhuH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 21). taTA mano nityam. tatra pramARaM sUtram tasya dravyatvanityatve vAyunA vyAKyAte (vE0 3. 2. 2) iti<BR>;p{0644}<BR>drazwavyam. taTA mano na pratyakzam. api tu anumeyameva. taTAhi. suKaduHKopalabDayaScakzurAdivyatiriktakaraRasADyAH asatsvapi cakzurAdizu jAyamAnatvAt Gawavat iti. yacca suKAdyupalavDikAraRam tanmanaH (ta0 BA0 prameyani0 pf0 32). aTavA satyapyAtmendriyArTasAMniDye jYAnasuKAdInAmaBUtvotpattidarSanAt kAraRAntaramanumIyate. SrotrAdyavyApAre smftyutpattidarSanAt bAhyendriyEragfhItasuKAdigrAhakAntarABAvAcceti praSasta0 manoni0 pf0 23). ArhatAstu BOtikA eva paramARavaH aRavo vA manAMsi ityAhuH. vAyureva manaH ityapi kecidAhuH (gO0 vf0 3. 140). navyAstu anudBUtaviSezaguRavadasamavetaBUtameva mana ityAhuH (rAma0 1 pf0 118). mano viBu iti mImAMsakA AhuH. tanmate manaso viButve pramARamanumAnam. tacca mano viBu nisparSadravyatvAt AkASavat iti. jAterniyatasaMsTAnavyaNgyatvAt manasi ca saMsTAnABAvAnmanastvaM na jAtiH. kiMtu manastvaM ca AtmAnyatve sati jYAnAsamavAyikAraRasaMyogASrayatvam (nyA0 ma0 2. 14). aTavA mano viBu viSezaguRaSUnyadravyatvAtkAlavata iti. yadvA mano viBu jYAnAsamavAyikAraRasaMyogADAratvAt Atmavat iti (vE0 u0 3. 2. 1). mano nendriyam iti mAyAvAdino vedAntino vadanti. nyAyanaye manasyazwO guRAstizWanti saMKyA aRuparimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam vegaSceti (vE0 3. 2. 2-3) (praSasta0 manoni0 pf0 23) (ta0 BA0) (nyA0 ma0) (BA0 pa0) (si0 ca0). taTA ca manasaH kriyAvattvAnmUrtatvam guRavattvAddravyatvam prayatnAdfzwaparigrahavaSAdASusaMcAritvam (praSasta0 pf0 2324) iti. mAyAvAdinastu saMkalpavikalpAtmakavfttimadantaHkaraRaM mana ityAhuH. tacca tanmate suKaduHKAdInAmADAraH. atra SrutiM pramARayanti mAyAvAdinaH kAmaH saMkalpo vicikitsA SradDA aSradDA DftiraDftihIMrDIrBIrityetatsarvaM mana eva (bf0 u0 1. 5. 3) iti. nyAyamate tu tadADAra AtmEva iti BedaH. 2 manaHSilAnAmako DAtuv