mantraH — atrApastambabODAyanasUtram mantrabrAhmaRayorvedanAmaDeyam iti. [Ka] prayogasamavetArTasmArako matraH iti mImAMsakA AhuH. fgyajuHsAmaBedAdete mantrAstriviDAH. atredaM boDyam. mantrARAmuccAraRasya prayojanaM ca prayogasamavetArTasmaraRameva na tvadfzwam (DarmADarmO). saMBavati dfzwaPale adfzwaPalakalpanamanyAyyam iti nyAyAt. atra niyamaH mantrErevArTonusmartavyaH nAnyena (lO0 BA0 pf0 39) iti. etAdfSaniyamasya PalaM tvadfzwameva. evaM ca mantrARAM prayogaviDinA sahEkavAkyatayA prAmARyam iti jYeyam. atra jEmininA mantralakzaRamuktam taccodakezu mantrAKyA. asyArTaH. tat karmasamavetArTasmaraRaM codakaM PalaM yezAM tezu mantrAKyA mantranAma (jE0 sU0 vf0 a0 2 pA0 1 sU0 30). prAyikamidam. vasantAya<BR>;p{0646}<BR>SrI kapiYjalAnAlaBeta ityAdizu viDyAdirUpezu matrezvavyApteH. kiMtu yAjYikasamAKyAtaM lakzaRaM mantrARAM dUzaRarahitaM boDyamiti (jE0 sU0 vf0 a0 2 pA0 1 sU0 30 wi0). te ca mantrA dviviDAH vEdikAstAnikASca. vEdikASca dviviDAH pragItA apragItASca. pragItAH sAmAni. apragItASca dviviDAH CandobadDAstadvilakzaRASca (sarva0 saM0 pf0 368 pAta0). tAtrikalakzaRaM strIpuMnapuMsakaBedena mantratrEviDyaM mantrARAM daSaviDaH saMskAraH sarvadarSanasaMgrahe (pf0 368370) dfSyaH. [ga] kvacit pratisUcitaH SabdaH. yaTA tadvizRoH paramaM padaM sadA paSyanti sUrayaH. divItra cakzurAtatam (f0 1. 126) iti. 2. rahasi kartavyAvaDAraRArTaM gumaBAzaRaM mantraH iti nItiSAstrajYA vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0645" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

