मर्यादा
maryAdA — 1 [ka] sImA. sA dviviDA kAlarUpA deSarUpA ca. tatra kAlarUpA yaTA AraBya tasyAM daSamIM tu yAvat prapUjayetparvatarAjaputrIm ityAdO yAvadarTo maryAdA. atra yAvacCabdena pUjArUpakriyAyAM SukladaSamInizWatAdfSasImAtvanirUpakatvaM pratyAyyate. tAvatEvArTataH SukladaSamyAM maryAdAtvaM laByate. atra ca prAgaBAva eva yAvatpadArTaH. dvitIyArTaH pratiyogitvam anuyogitvaM vA. tatra tatprakftyarTadaSamyA anvayaH. tAvatA daSamIpratiyogikaprAgaBAvalABaH. tasya svapratiyogyavfttitvaviSizwavyApakatAsaMbanDena pUjArUpasamaBivyAhftakriyAyAmanvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 75). deSarUpA maryAdA yaTA kASItaH kOSikIM yAvadyAti ityAdO yAvadarTo maryAdA. atra yAvatpadena ca kOSikyanaDikaraRakatve sati kASIpUrva kOSikI paScimadeSavyApakatvaM gamane pratyAyyate. tatra dvitIyArTAvaDitvam avaDimattvaM vA. tasya ca pratIcItvAdAncayaH. nizkarzaH pUrvavatsvayamUhanIyaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 76). [Ka] vEyAkaraRAstu sTityanatikramaH. maryAdA dviviDA kAlarUpA deSarUpA ca. tatrAdyA kAlarUpA yaTA AmukteH saMsAraH ityAdAvANorTaH. atra muktipadaM tatkAlaparam. maryAdAmaryAdiBAvasaMbanDa AyotyaH paYcamyarTaH. evaM ca muktimaryAdakaH saMsAraH iti<BR>;p{0648}<BR>boDaH. saMsAre muktikAlaprAgaBAvADikaraRa nirUpitatadBinna kAlAvfttitvaviSizwavyApakatAboDastvArTaH. kAlagata maryAdAtvaM ca svasvottara kAlo BayaprAgaBAvADikaraRakAlaBavo yaH samaBivyAhftapadArTaH tadanaDikaraRatvam (la0 ma0 suvarTa0 pf0 113). dvitIyA deSarUpA yaTA prayAgAtpraBftyA kASyA vfzwo devaH ityAdO deSe maryAdA. atra prayAgAdikASImaryAdakavfzwikartA devaH iti voDaH. vfzwO prayAgAdikASIpaScimadeSanirUpita svaBinnAvfttitvasamAnADikaraRavyApakatAboDastvArTaH. atra deSakI gatamaryAdAtvaM tu svasvottaradeSayoH prayAgatadAdyantarAladeSavfttisamaBivyAhftapadArTavfzwyAdyanaDikaraRatvam ityAhuH. 2 nyAyapaTasTitiH iti nItiSAstrajYA AhuH. 3 kUlam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0647" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

