mahattvam — 1 (parimARam) idaM mahat iti pratItisAkzikaH parimARaviSezaH. yaTA mahattvaM zaqviDe hetuH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 59) ityAdO tallakzaRaM ca mAnavyavahArAsADAraRakAraRatvam. dravyasAkzAtkArakAraRavizayanizWasAmAnyaguRalaM<BR>;p{0649}<BR>vA (vE0 u0 7. 1. 8). apakarzAnASrayaparimARatvaM vA. mahattvaM dviviDam avAntara mahattvam paramamahattvaM ca. tatrAdyam trasareRumAraBya mahAvayaviparyantadravyezu vartate. zaqviDe dravyapratyakze kAraRam anityaM ca. idaM tu nAtIndriyam. kiM tu pratyakzavizayo Bavati. taTA ca sUtram aRormahataScopalabDyanupalabDI nitye vyAKyAte (0 7 118) iti. tasya kAraRatvaM coktam dravyapratyakzatAyAM rUpavat parimARamapi kAraRam. na hi mahattvamantareRa dravyaM pratyakzaM Bavati (vE0 u0 7. 1. 8. dvitIyaM tu viBucatuzwaye vartate. atIndriyam nityaM ca. saMyogaviSeza eva mahattvam iti navyanAstikA AhuH (pa0 mA0). hiraRyagarBasya liNgaSarIraDarmaH iti vedAntina AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0648" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

