यत्
yat — 1 budDiviSezavizayaH. atrArTe yacCandaSca tacCabdArTanityApekzI. uttaravAkyasTastu na tadapekzI iti sAmAnyato vivekaH (kAvyapra0 u07). atra viSezaH yattacCabdArTayoranvaye ca na samAnaviBaktastatratA ityAkare drazwavyaH. budDiviSezavizayaSca kvacit tatpadapratipAdyatayA vaktabudDivizayatAvacCedakatvopalakzitaDarmAvacCinnaH. yaTA yo yo DUmavAn sa vahnimAn ityAdO yacCandArTaH. atra tatpadArTastu svaprayojakabudDivizayatAvacCedakatvopalakzitaDarmAvacCinnaH (ga0 Sa0 wI0 pf0 113). vastutastu svapUrvapadapratipAdyatayA budDivizayatAvacCedakaDarmAvacCinne yatpadasya SaktiH kalpyate. ato na yatpadaSaktigrahastatpadaSaktigrahADInaH ityanyonyASrayaH. iyaM ca vyutpattiH prakramyamARaparAmarSakayacCabdasya drazwavyA (ga0 Sakti0 wI0 pf0 113). yacCandasya strottara prayoktfpadopasTApitavAcItyarTaH ityapi tatrEvoktam. SAbdikAstu tacCabdapratipAdyatayA vaktfbudDivizaya uddeSyo yatpadArTa ityAhuH. kvacit svaprayojakabudDivizayatAva<BR>;p{0663}<BR>CedakavoccAra kapurupoccarita svapUrva padopasTApyatAvacCedakaDarmAvacCinnaH. yaTA cEtraH samAgato yastatrAvalokitaH ityAdO. atra cEtrAdipadenApyupasTitorTo yacCabdena boDyate. yaTA vA sADu candramasi puzkarEH kftaM mIlitaM yadaBirAmatADike. udyatA jayini kAminImuKe tena sAhasamanuzWitaM punaH.. ityAdO. atra tatpadAsattvepi na dozaH. pUrvaprakrAntasyEva kftaSabdopasTApitavyApArasyABedena mIlanAnvayitayA yacCabdena boDanAt. evam yaM sarvaSElAH parikalpya vatsaM merO sTite dogDari dohadakze. BAvanti ratnAni mahOzaDISca pfTUpadizwAM duduhurDaritrIm.. (kumAra0 sa0 1 0 2) ityAdAvapi (ga0 Sakti0 pf0114). 2 yasmAt ityarTaH. 3 SAbdikAstu kfttadDitasaMjYakaH pratyayaviSezaH. yaTA deyam diSyam ityAdI ityAhuH. 4 ga. 5 avaDftiSca iti kAvyajYA AhuH (medinI 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0662" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

