yadfcCASabdaH — jAtiguRakriyAdyavAcakaH saMjYASabdaH. yaTA qitTa ityAdiSabdaH. taduktaM kAvyaprakASe qitTAdiSabdAnAmantyabudDinirgrAhyaM saMhftakramaM svarUpaM vakrA yadfcCayA qitTAdizvarTezUpADitvena niveSyate iti saMjYArUpo yadfcCAtmakaH iti. gOH SuklaSvalo qitTa ityAdO catuzwayI SabdAnAM pravfttiH iti mahABAzyakArAH (kAvya0 pra0 u0 2 pf0 12). atrodAharati asaMpAdayataH kaMcidarTaM jAtikriyAguREH. yadfcCASabdavatpuMsaH saMjYAyE janma kevalam.. iti. jAtyAdipravfttinimittaSUnyaH icCAprakalpitaH ityarTaH (mAGa0 wI0 sa0 2 Slo0 47).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0664" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

