यागः
yAgaH — [ka] prItyavacCinnasa mantrakadravyatyAgaH. yaTA puzpeRa vizRuM yajate ityatra yajerarTaH. atra prItO vizRorADeyatvena dravye ca puzpAderaBedenAnvayaH. tena vizRu nizprItiheturyo mantrakaraRakaH puzpABinnadravyatyAgaH tadvAn ityAkArakastatra boDaH. aTavA svatvaDvaMsajana kecCA paryavasannasya tyAgasyEkadeSe svatva eva puzpAderADeyatvena tatrAnvayaH. tena dravyeRa vizRuM yajate ityAdO dravyasya dravyABinnatvena SAbdAnyayAsaMBavepi na kzatiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 72 wI0 pf0 108). aTavA vizRuM yajata ityAdI dvitIyArTa uddeSyatvam. tacca tasyedam ityAropajYAnavizayatvam. devatAyAH svatvopagame tu na dAnatvaM yAgatvavyApyam. homatvaM yAgatvavyApyam iti sarvajanasidDam. devapUjanamapi yAga eva iti (kA0 vyA0 kA0 4 pf0 5). [Ka] devatoddeSena havistyAgaH (ma0 pra0 4 pf0 53). [ga] devatoddeSyakadravyatyAgAtmakecCAviSezaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 81). yaTA darSapUrRamAsAByAM yajeta jyotizwomena svargakAmo yajeta ityAdO ca yajDAtvarTaH. atredamaDikaM jYeyam. darSapUrRamAsANgAni prayAjAdIni. tatra prayAjASca paSca samiDo yajati tanUnapAtaM yajati iqo yajati barhiryajati svAhAkAraM yajati ityevaMrUpAH SrutyuktAH (kAtyA0 Sra0 3. 2. 1. 17). aNgaM dviviDam ArAdupakArakam saMnipatyopakArakaM ca. tatrAdyam prayAjaH anuyAjaH sUktavAkaH SaMyuvAkaH patnIsaMyAjaH iti. dvitIyaM amyanvADAnam iDmAtrarhizoH saMBaraRam ityAdi. [Ga] devatoddeSya kasvasvatvasa PalakastyAgo yAgaH iti vAcaspatimiSrA AhuH. atra yAgatvaM ca devatoddeSyakasvasvatvaDvaMsavaddravyaviSezyakecCAtvam iti saMpradAyaH. atra devatoddeSyakatvaM ca devatAsvatvavadviSezyakatvam. SabdamayI devatA iti pakze tu tasyA idam 84<BR>;p{0666}<BR>ityAropajYAnavizayatvamuddeSyatvam iti voDyam. yAgatvaM mAnasapratyakzagamyo jAtiviSezaH ityanya AhuH. apare tu SrAdDasya pitrapekzayA yAgatvena brAhmaRApekzayA tu dAnatvena tatra sAMkaryAnna yAgatvaM jAtiviSezaH ityAhuH (di0 gu0 Darmani0 pf0 234) (kA0 vyA0 kA0 4 pf0 5). [Na] haviH prakzepAtmako vyApAraH. yaTA yAjakA yajantItyAdO DAtvarTaH. atra ca ftvijAmeva svAtantryam na tu yajamAnasya. evaM ca yAgapadasyAyaM lakzyArTa eva iti jYeyam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 81).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0665" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

