याचनम्
yAcanam — [ka] svodeSyakadAnecCA. yaTA pOraKaM gAM yAcate vipra ityAdO yAcDAtvarTaH. atra praDAnakarmagavAdyanvitadvitIyArTo vizayatvam. tasya DAtvarTatAvacCedakadAne nirUpakatva saMbanDena anvayaH. pOravapadottaradvitIyAyAstu vfttirevArTaH. tasyA dAnenvayaH. atredaM vijYeyam. savizayakajYAnAdirUpavizayopahitecCAboDakaDAtusTala icCAvizayavizayatvameva praDAnakarmatvam. ata eva Gawo jijYAsyate ityAdO GawAdeH sannantakarmatA. pOravasya tu tAdfSadAnASrayatvamevApraDAnakarmatvam iti. BikzyarTopyevameva voDyaH (ga0 vyuH kA0 2 pf0 45). atra vEyAkaraRAH samuttizWante. yattu svoddeSyakadAnecCA yAcanam iti tanna. putrArTaM kanyAM yAcate ityanApatteH. svasaMpradAnakadAnecCAvati PalAlABaSaNkayA dehi ityavadatyapi taTA prayogApatteSca iti (la0 ma0 subarTa0 kA0 2 pf0 92). [Ka] SAbdikAstu svAmisvatvanivftti svasvatvotpatti etaduBayAnukUlaH dIyatAm ityaBilAparUpo didApayizAvyaYjako vyApAraH. yaTA baliM yAcate vasuDAmityAdO yAcerarTaH ityAhuH. 2 svIkArAnukUlo vyApAraH. yaTA avinItaM vinayaM yAcate ityAdO yAcerarTaH. svIkAraSca idamavaSyaM karizyAmi ityaBilAzAdi janako jYAnaviSezaH (la0 ma0 subarTa0 kA0 2 pf0 92).<BR>;p{0667}<BR>3 vyApArajanyatvaprakArakecCA. yaTA yAcamAnaH SivaM surAnityAdO yAcyA. DAtvarTecCAyAM praDAnakarma kalyARAnvitadvitIyArTavizayitAyA anvayaH. vyApAre ca surAnvitavfttitvasya dvitIyAntArTasyAnvayaH. taTA ca suravfttivyApArajanyatvaprakAraka kalyARecCASrayaH ityanvayaboDaH (ga vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 45). SizwaM tu prArTanASabdavyAKyAne dfSyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 73 wI0 pf0 112).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0666" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

