यावत्
yAvat — 1 maryAdA. sA ca kAlarUpA deSarUpA ceti dviviDA. tatra kAlarUpA sImA yaTA AraBya tasyAM daSamIM tu yAvat prapUjayetparvatarAjaputrIm ityAdO yAvadarTo maryAdA. deSarUpA sImA yaTA kASItaH kOSikIM yAvadyAti ityAdO yAvadarTo maryAdA. 2 aBiviDiH. yaTA kArtikamAraBya cEtraM yAvacCItaM Bavati ityAdO kASItaH pAwaliputraM yAvadvfzwo devaH ityAdO ca yAvadarToBiviDiH. ANSabdopi yAvatSabdavadeva vyAKyeyaH. kiMtu tadyoge paYcamI sADuH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 7476). aDikaM ca maryAdA aBiviDi etacCabdavyAKyAne saMpAditam tattatra drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0667" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

