yAvattvam — 1 apekzAbudDiviSezavizayatvam (ta0 pra0 2). yaTA yatsamAnADikaraRA yAvantoBAvAH (dIDi0 2 catu0) ityAdO yAvattvam. 2 vyApakatvam (ga0 sidDA0). yaTA yAvanto GawA<BR>;p{0668}<BR>rUpavantaH ityAdO. yaTA vA yAvanto manuzyA maraRaSIlA ityAdO. atrAdye GawatvavyApakarUpavantaH ityanvayaboDo jAyate. antye manuzyatvavyApakatvaM maraRaSIlatve boDyate iti vijYeyam. 3 vyAsajyavfttirDarmaviSezaH. yaTA sarve GawA rUpavanta ityAdO sarvaSabdapravfttinimittaM GawanizWaM yAvattvam. idaM ca uddeSyatAvacCedakaGawatvavyApikA viDeyarUpavyApyA ca yA paryAptiH tAdfSaparyAptikaM Bavati iti vijYeyam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 93). 4 sAkalyam (aSezatvam). 5 avaDitvam. 6 mAnatvam (maryAdAtvam). 7 avaDAraRatvam (amaraH).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0667" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावद्रव्यभावित्वम्
yAvadravyaBAvitvam — svASrayanASajanyanASapratiyogitvam (di0 112 AkASani 0 pf0 88). yaTA GawAdivfttirUpAderyAvaddravyaBAvitvam. atra Gawasya nASe tadgatarUpasyApi nASaH ityanuBavo mantavyaH. svapadArTo rUpam. taTAca svam Gawasya rUpam. tasyASrayo GawaH. tasya nASaH. tAdfSanASajanyo nASaH rUpanASaH. tasya pratiyogitvaM rUpe iti lakzaRasamanvayaH. SabdajYAnAdInAM tu na tAdfSam yAvaddravyaBAvitvam iti ato nAtivyAptiH. taTA coktam ayAvaddravyaBAvitvenEva SabdAdInAM vAyuviSezaguRatvaM nAsti (mu0 1 AkASani0 pf0 88) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0668" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तः
yuktaH — 1 yatkicitpratiyogikasaMbanDAnuyogI. yaTA BUtalaM Gawena yuktamityAdO. 2 ucitam. yaTA yuktamucyate ityAdO. 3 yogaSAstrajYAstu yogAByAsavaSAtsarvadA sakalavizayakajYAnavAn yogI (BA0 pa0 Slo0 67). aTavA praTamapratyAsattyA nirantaramaKilapadArTajYAnavAn ityAhuH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 23) atredaM boDyam. yuktasya yogajaDarmasahAyena manasAkASaparamARvAdiniKilapadArTagocaraM jYAnaM sarvadEva DyAnAdyaBAvepi Bavitumarhati (mu0 1 pf0 133) (praSasta 0 budDini0 pf0 43) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0668" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिः
yuktiH — 1 sADakabADakapramARopanyAsaH (ta0 pra0 1) (ma0pra0 pf0 3). 2 anumAnam. tacca sADyasADakaliNgajYAnam. nyAyaH iti mImAMsakA AhuH. atrocyate SrutyorviroDe nyAyastu balavAnarTanirRaye.<BR>;p{0669}<BR>yuktihInavicAre tu DarmahAniH prajAyate.. iti. 3 liNgoddeSaH (liNganiScayaH) iti vyavahAraSAstrajYA AhuH (vIrami0 leKya0 pf0 222). vyavahAre kAnicilliNgAni nAradenoktAni yaTA ulkAhastonido jYeyaH SastrapARiSca GAtakaH. keSAkeSigfhItaSca yugapatpAradArikaH. kuddAlapARirvijYeyaH setuBettA samIpagaH. taTA kuWArahastaSca vanacCettA prakIrtitaH.. pratyakza cihnarvijYeyo daRqapAruzyakfnnaraH asAkzipratyayA hyete pAruzye tu parIkzaRam.. (vIramitro0 leKyani0 pf0 223) iti. 4 nAwakANgaviSezaH ityAlaMkArikA AhuH. taduktam saMpraDAraRamarTAnAM yuktiH prAptiH suKAgamaH (sA0 da0 pari0 6 Slo0 343 pf0 105) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0668" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

