yuYjAnaH — 1 [ka] cintAsahakAreRa sakalajYAnavAn yogI (BA0 pa0 Slo0 67). [Ka] cintAviSezasanATa dvitIyapratyAsattyA samayaviSeze jYAnavAn (si0 ca0 1 pf0 23). atra yuktapadArTaGawakapraTamapratyAsattimapekzya dvitIyaprattyAsattiH ityanusaMDeyam. 2 raTasAraTiH. 3 vipraH iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0). yuta sidDiH - [ka] dvayoranyatarasya vA pfTaggatimattvam yutASrayASrayitvaM vA (vE0 u0 7. 2. 9) (praSasta0 pf0 17). yaTA mezayoH GawaBUtalayorvA<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0669" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युतसिद्धिः
yutasidDiH — [Ka] asaMbanDayorvidyamAnatvam pfTagASrayASritatvaM vA (vE0 u0 72. 13). [ga] parasparasaMbanDaSUnyayoravasTAnam (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 23). yutasidDiSca saMyogaM prati prayojikAsti (vE0 u0 7. 2. 9-13) (praSasta0 pf0 17). atredaM boDyam. aRvAkASayorASrayAntarABAvepyanyatarasya pfTaggatimattvAtsaMyogaviBAgO sidDO. tantupawayora nityayoH pfTagASrayAntarABAvAtparasparataH.<BR>;p{0670}<BR>saMyogaviBAgABAvaH. digAdInAM tu pfTaggatimattvABAvAtparaspareRa saMyogaviBAgABAva iti. tvagindriyaSarIrayoH pfTaggatimattvaM nAsti. yutezvASrayezu samavAyo nAstIti paraspareRa saMyogaH sidDaH (praSasta0 gu0 pf0 19).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0669" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

