योगः
yogaH — 1 saMbanDaH. 2 [ka] samudAyaSabdasya avayavaSaktiH (ta0 dI0 4) (nIla0 4 pf0 31) (si0 ca0 4. 31). yaTA pAcakAdipadezu yogaH. atra ca pAcakAdipadAt pacati iti vyutpattyA pAkakartA budDyate iti voDyam. atra yogabalaM samAKyA iti mImAMsakA vadanti (vA0). [Ka] vEyAkaraRAstu SAstrakalpitAvayavArTamAtraboDaprayojako yogaH (SaktiH). yaTA pAcakAdO ityAhuH (la0 ma0 AkANkzAdivi0 pf0 12). 3 [ka] cittavfttiniroDaH iti yogina AhuH (pAta 0 pA0 1 sU0 2). [Ka] kleSakarmavipAkASayaparipanTicittavfttiniroDo yogaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 132 pAta0) atredaM boDyam. vizayezvalaMpratyayavata udAsInasya bahirindriyeByo vyAvftaM mano yadA AtmamAtranizWaM Bavati tadA tatkarmAnuguRaprayatnABAvAtkarma manasi notpadyate sTirataraM mano Bavati sa eva yogaH (vE0 u0 5. 2. 16). aTa vA AtmasTe manasi zaqaNgayogena indriyAdikaM parityajya mano yadA AtmamAtre tizWati tadA manaH karmaRonutpAdaH tadA mano niScalaM Bavati. tadavasTAyAM SarIrAvacCedena duHKaM na jAyate. sa AtmanA bAhyavyAvfttamanasaH saMyogo yoga ucyate. zaqaNgAni skandapurARe uktAni yaTA AsanaM prARasaMroDaH pratyAhAraSca DAraRA. DyAnaM samADiretAni yogANgAni Bavanti zaw.. (vE0 sU0 5. 2. 16) (vE0 vi0) iti. yadvA indriyARi vizayeByaH pratyAhftyendriyeByo manaH pratyAhftya sAkzAtkartavye vastuni manaHpraRiDAnaM yogaH (nIla0) iti. sa ca yogo dviviDaH. rAjayogaH haWayogaSca. tatra rAjayogaH pataYjalinoktaH. haWayoga.<BR>;p{0671}<BR>tantraSAstroktaH. prakArAntareRApi. yogo dviviDaH saMprajYAtaH asaMprajYAtaSceti. taTA yogastriviDaH jYAnayogaH karmayogaH BaktiyogaSca (BAga0 ska0 11 a0 20 0 6) iti. idaM ca boDyam. zazWaBagavadavatAro dattAtreyaH. sa ca AnvIkzikImalarkAya prahlAdAdiBya UcivAn (BAga0 1. 3. 12). tena ca svasaMhitAyAM yogonuSizwaH iti. 4 upAyaH. 5 yuktiH. 6 jIvAtmaparamAtmanoH saMbanDaH iti kecidvedAntina AhuH. taduktam yogaM saMyogamityAhurjIvAtmaparamAtmanoH iti (vAca0). 7 devatAnusaMGAnaM yogaH iti rAmAnujIyAH nAradapaYcarAtravidaH AhuH (sarva0 pf0 117 rAma. 0). 8 aprAptasyArTasya prAptaye paryanuyogo yogaH. yaTA yogAcAraH ityAdO iti vOdDA AhuH. 9 SabdAdInAM prayogaH iti vEyAkaraRA AhuH. 10 Bezajam iti Bizaja AhuH. 11 yogaH karmasu kOSalam iti karmakartAroNgIcakruH. 12 Calam (upaDiH) iti vyavahAraSAstrajYA AhuH. atra smftiH yogADamanavikrItaM yogadAnapratigraham. yasya vApyupaDiM paSyettatsarvaM vinivartayet.. (yAjYa0 a0 2 lo0 181 wI0 mitA0 pf0 94) iti. yogaH kapawam iti manuH (8. 165). 13 ravicandra yogADInA vizkamBAdayaH saptaviMSatiH padArTAH iti jyotizajYA AhuH. 14 tiTivAranakzatrARAM saMbanDaviSezaH. yaTA sidDiyogaH amftasidDiyogaH arDodayayogaH dagDayogaH ityAdiH iti mOhUrtikA AhuH. 15 lagnAdigfhaviSeze sTito grahaviSezaH. yaTA rAjayogaH nABasayogaH ityAdiH iti kArtAntikA AhuH. 16 yAtrAyAm AlagnAtkendratrikoRasTito buDajIvaSukrAdyanyatamaH iti jyotiHSAstrajYA AhuH. taduktam eko jYejyasitezu paYcamatapaH kendrezu yogastaTA dvO cettezvaDiyoga ezu sakalA yogADiyogaH smftaH. yoge kzemamaTADiyogagamane kzemaM ripURAM baDaH (mu0 ci0) iti. 17 kAmukakAminIsaMmelanaM yogaH ityAlaMkArikA vadanti. 18 cittadvAreRAtmeSvara saMbanDo yogaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 169 nakulI 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0670" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेमः
yogakzemaH — 1 anuBavamanuruDya vastusTitisaMgamanam. yaTA BUtale na GawaH ityAdO GawAMSe BUtalavfttitvABAvaH saMgamyate iti. atra ca BUtale<BR>;p{0672}<BR>GawaH iti vAkyajanyaSAbdaboDe GawAMSe BUtalavfttitvAvagAhitvasyAnuBavasidDatayA BUtale na GawaH iti vAkyajanyaSAbdaboDe GawAMSe BUtalavfttitvABAvovaSyamaByupagantavyaH iti. idasatrAkUtam. BUtale na GawaH iti vAkyajanyasyAprAmARyajYAnAnAskanditaboDasya BUtale GawaH ityAdivAkyajanyaGawAdiviSezyakaBUtalAdyADeyatvaprakAraka boDaviroDitayA nanpadaM vinA yatra DarmiRi yasya viSezaRatayA BAnaM yAdfSasamaBivyAhArAdBavati tAdfSasamaBivyAhArasTale naYsattve tatra DarmiRi tadaBAvaH pratIyate iti niyamoNgIkartavyaH. ayameva pratiyogya BAvAntrayO tulyayogakzemO iti nyAyasyArTaH iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 1). yaTA vA pravftti pratIzwasADanatAjYAnasya hetutAyAM pravizwA yogakzemasADAraRI sADanatA. nEyAyikamate saMDyAvandanAdinityakarmaRAmarTavAdopasTApitabrahmalokAvAptipratyavAyAnutpattirUpaPalakalpanena tAdfSaPalasya tu svataH puruzArTatvABAvena tatrecCAnutpattO kaTaM tAdfSakarmasu pravfttiH ityASaNkAyAH samADAnaprasaNgenetTamuktam. yaTA hi nitye kfte pratyavAyaprAgaBAvastizWati tadaBAve tadaBAvaH evam pratyavAyABAvasattve duHKaprAgaBAvasattvam tadaBAve tadaBAvaH (duHKarUpaH) iti yogakzemasADAraRakAraRatAyA duHKaprAgaBAvaM pratyapi suvacatvAt iti. atra yoge aprAptaprAptO kzemaH sidDasya rakzaRam ityarTonusaMDeyaH (di0 gu0 viDini0 pf0 228). 2 vedAntinastu alaByalABasahitaM labDaparirakzaRam. yaTA ananyAScintayanto mAM ye janAH paryupAsate. tezAM nityABiyuktAnAM yogakzemaM vahAmyaham.. (gItA0 a0 9 Slo0 22) ityAdI ityAhuH. atrArTe yogaSca kzemaM ca iti samAhAradvandvo jYeyaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0671" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगजः
yogajaH — (saMnikarzaH) yogAByAsajanito DarmaviSezaH. sa cAdfzwaviSezaH. ayaM cAlOkike yogipratyakze kAraRIBUtaH alOkikasaMnikarzaviSezaH. sa ca yuktayuYjAneti dviviDayogiBedato dviviDaH (BA0 pa0 Slo066) (si0 ca0). tatra yuktAKyayogino yogajaDarmasaMnikarzeRa vastumAtrasya anyAtmanAm atIndriyARAmapi AkASadikkAlaparamARutrAyumana sAm<BR>;p{0673}<BR>tatsamavetaguRakarmasAmAnyaviSezARAM samavAyasya ca sarvadA pratyakzaM janyate. yuYjAnAKyayoginastu cintayA pratyakzaM janyate (mu0 1) (ta0 kO0) iti. taTA ca ekatra DyAnApekzA anyatra tu DyAnApekzA nAsti (ta0 va0) (praSasta0 gu0 pf0 43).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0672" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरूढम्
yogarUQam — (nAma SaktapadaM vA) [ka] yatra pade avayavaSaktivizaye samudAyaSaktirapyasti tat (mu0 4 pf0 179). atra vyutpattiH yogo rUQiScEte ekasajAtIyArTaboDakatayA stosya (ac) iti. [Ka] avayavasamudAya etaduBayaSaktikamekajAtIyArTapratipAdakaM padam (si0 ca0 Ka0 4 pf0 31). [ga] yogarUQiByAM parasparasahakAreRArTapratipAdakaM padam. yaTA paNkajAdipadam (nIla0 4 pf0 31). evam DenupadaM ca (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 32). atra ca paNkAjjAyate ityavayavaSaktyA paNkajanikartftvena rUQiSaktyA ca kamalatvena kamalaM boDayatIti paNkajapadaM yogarUQam (si0 ca0 4 pf0 31). taTA ca samudAyaSaktyA (rUQiSaktyA) upasTite padme avayavArTapaNkajanikarturaBedenAnvayo Bavati iti maRikfnmatam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 27). tena paNkajAtepi kumudAdO sTalapadme ca na paNkajapadaprayogaprasaNgaH iti maRikfnmatABiprAyaH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 31). atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. yatra rUQyarTasya bADaH pratisaMDIyate kumudatvena boDe ca tAtparyam tatra lakzaRayA kumudAderyoDaH. yatra tu kumudatvena rUpeRa boDe na tAtparyajYAnam padmatvasya ca bADaH tatrAvayavaSaktimAtreRa kumudaboDanirvAhaH. yatra tu sTalapadmAdAvavayavArTabADaH tatra samudAyaSaktyA padmatvena rUpeRa boDaH. yadi tu sTalapadmaM vijAtIyameva tadA paNkajapadAllakzaRayEva sTalapadmaboDaH (mu0 4 pf0 180) iti. [Ga] yannAma svAvayavavfttilaByArTena samaM svArTasyAnvayaboDakft tannAma yogarUQam. yaTA paNkaja kfzRasarpa aDarma ityAdipadam. tadDi svAntarnivizwAnAM paNkAdiSabdAnAM vfttilaByena paNkajanikartrAdinA samaM svaSakyasya padmAderanvayAnuBAvakam. paNkajam ityAditaH paNkajanikartf padmam ityanuBavasya sarvasidDatvAt. rUQapadAttvayaM viSezaH. yadrUQamapi maRqaparaTakArAdipadam tat yogArTa85<BR>;p{0674}<BR>vinAkftasya rUQyarTasyeva rUQyarTavinAkftasyApi yogArTasya boDakaM Bavati. maRqape Seta ityAdO yogArTasya maRqapAnakadeKi maRqapaM BojayedityAdO samuditArTasya gfhAderayogyatvenAnvayAvoDAt. yogarUQaM tu paNkajAdipadamavayavavfttyA rUQyarTameva samudAyaSaktyA cAvayavalaByArTamevAnuBAvayati na tvanyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 25 wI0 pf0 32) iti. yogarUQaM dviviDam samAsAtmakam tadDitAktaM ceti. tatra samAsAtmakaM kfzRasarpAdi. tadDitAktaM tu vAsudevAdipadam. kfdantasya paNkajAdiyogarUQasya sAmAsika evAntarBAvaH iti nADikyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 28 wI0 pf0 37).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0673" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरूढिः
yogarUQiH — (padaSaktiH) [ka] Sabdasya vfttiviSezaH. yayA vfttyA paNkajanikartftvaviSizwapadmasya boDaH (hemacandraH). yaTA paNkajabrAhmaRAdipade yogarUQiH. atra vyutpattiH yogena sahitA rUQiH iti (nIla0 4 pf0 31). atra vipratipattiH. paNkajAdipadAnAM yoga eva ityeke vadanti. rUQiH ityapare vadanti. yogarUQiH iti gOtamIyAH AhuH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 42). ayaM BAvaH. paNkajapadAt padmatvaviSizwapratItaye padmatvaviSizwe paNkajasamudAyasya rUQirAvaSyakI. padAnniyatopasTitervfttisADyatvAt. paNkajapadAdyogena kumudasyApi boDaprasaNgAcca. manmate kadAcitkumudaboDastu lakzaRayEva iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 31). atrAyaM viSezaH. yatra yogArTAnvitarUQyarTAvaboDaH tatra sarvatra yogarUQiH. yOgikArTabudDirUpasahakArilABAviSizwArTopasTApakatvaM rUQeryogarUQitvam (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 48). [Ka] vEyAkaraRAstu yatra SAstrakalpitAvayavArTAnvitaviSezyaBUtArTanirUpitaM samudAye boDakatvam sA yogarUQiH. yaTA paNkajAdipade ityAhuH. atra paNkajanikartf padmam iti boDAt padmasyAnupapattipratisaMDAnaM saMbanDapratisaMDAnaM ca vinA boDAnna tatra lakzaRAyA avasaraH. kvacit tAtparyagrAhakavaSAt kevalarUQyarTasya kevalayogArTasya ca boDaH. yaTA BUmO paNkajamutpannaM kalhArakEravamuKezvapi paNkajezu ityAdO (la0 ma0 AkANkzAdivi0 pf0 12).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0674" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

