लक्षकम्
lakzakam — (nAva) yAdfSArTa saMbanDavati yannAma saMketitaM tadeva tAdfSArTe lakzakam yadi tAdfSArTe SaktiSUnyaM Bavet. yaTA gaNgAyAM GozaH pravasatItyAdO gaNgAdayaH SabdAH tIrAdAvasaMketitAstatsaMbanDinIrAdiSaktatvena gfhItA eva tIrAdyanvayaM boDayanti iti tatra lakzakA Bavanti. atra mImAMsakA vadanti. padamiva vAkyamapi lakzakam. yaTA gaBIrAyAM nadyAM GozaH iti padakadamvakaM gaBIranadItIrasya lakzakam iti. atrAyamASayaH. atra na kevalaM nadIpadaM tIralakzakam. gaBIrAyAm ityasyAnanvayApatteH. na hi tIraM gaBIram. nApi gaBIrapadaM tIralakzakam. nadyAm ityasyA<BR>;p{0695}<BR>yogyatApatteH. na hi tIraM nadI. tasmAdvAkyameva tatra gaBIranadItIrasya lakzakam iti. atra sidDAntavidaH nEyAyikAH samuttizWante. mImAMsakEryaduktaM tanna. nadIpadasyEva gaBIranadItIrAtmake viSizwe lakzaRA. gaBIrapadaM tu tAtparyagrAhakameva iti vAkye lakzaRA nAstyeva (mu0 4 pf0 101) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 12) iti. sEnDavAdayaSca SabdAH lavaRAdAviva turagAdAvapi SaktA eva iti na te lakzakA Bavanti. cawapawAdyanukaraRasya huMPaqAdistomasya ca svAnuBAvakatvamapaBraMSAnAmiva SaktiBramAdeva. ato na tezAM lakzakatvam iti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 23 wI0 pf0 3233). lakzakaM ca jahatsvArTAdiviviDa lakzaRAvattvenAnekaviDam. taTA hi jahatsvArTalakzaRayA tIratvAdinA tIrAdiboDakaM gaNgAdipadam. ajahatsvArTalakzaRayA dravyatvAdinA nIlaGawatvAdinA ca dravyanIlaGawAdiboDakaM GawAdipadam. nirUQalakzaRayA AruRyAdiprakAreRa tadASrayadravyaboDakamaruRAdipadam. ADunikalakzaRayA (svArasikalakzaRayA) GawatvAdinA GawAdiboDakaM pawapadam. gORyA lakzaRayA agnisadfSatvAdinA mARavakavoDakamayAdipadam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 24 wI0 pf0 35) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0694" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणम्
lakzaRam — 1 [ka] uddizwasyAtattvavyavacCedako DarmaH (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 3). yaTA indriyArTasaMnikarzotpannaM jYAnaM pratyakzam (vAtsyA0 1. 114). iti pratyakzalakzaRam. triviDA SAstrasya pravfttiH uddeSaH lakzaRam parIkzA ceti. tatra uddeSAnantaraM lakzaRam. tataH parIkzA. lakzaRasya prayojanaM ca sarvaM hi lakzaRamitarapadArTavyavacCedakam (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 14 pf0 82). padArTatattvajYAnaM lakzaRasya prayojanam iti tarkaBAzAyAmuktam (ta0 BA0 pf0 1). vyAvfttirvyavahAro vA lakzaRasya prayojanamiti dIpikAyAm (ta0 dI0 pf0 5) (si0 ca0). atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. lakzaRasya vyAvfttiprayojanakatve saptapadArTetaratvAprasidDyA padArTasAmAnyalakzaRasya aBiDeyatvasya prayojanaM Sabdaprayoga eva. vyAvftteratrAsaMBavAt. anyezAM lakzaRAnAM tUBayaM vyAvfttirvyavahAraSca prayojanam<BR>;p{0696}<BR>ityavaDeyam (la0va0). vyavahAraH SabdavyavahAraH SabdaSaktigrahaH. lakzaRajYAnasya prayojanaM yaTA sAnAdimAn gOH iti lakzaRajYAne sati yaM yaM sAnAdimantaM piRqaM paSyati taM taM goSabdavAcyaM pratyeti (pra0 pa0 pf0 2) iti. atredaM boDyam. sarva lakzaRaM aBiDeyatvAdivarjam vyatirekiheturBavati. yaTA pfTivIlakzaRaM ganDavattvam. taTA ca vivAdapadaM pfTivI ganDavattvAt yanna pfTivI tanna ganDavat yaTA ApaH ityAdi (ta0 BA0 anu0 pf0 13). lakzaRasya kevalavyatirekihetutve prayogaH. lakzaRaM kevalavyatirekihetuH viSezaDarmatvAt yat kevalavyatirekiheturna Bavati tanna viSezaDarmo Bavati yaTA aBiDeyatvam. na cedaM taTA. tasmAnna taTA iti. anyadapyudAhriyate. goH sAsnAdimattvaM lakzaRamityuktyA gOH pakzaH mahiRyAdyAtmaketaraBedaH sADyaH. sAsnAdimattvaM hetuH vyatirekadfzwAntaH. yaTA gOritareByo BinnA sAsnAdimattvAdyannEvaM tannEvaM mahizyAdivat ityanumAne gorlakzaRaM sAsnAdimattvaM vyatirekihetureva Bavati. nAnvayihetuH. goritaratra sAsnAdimattvABAvena dfzwAntABAvAt iti. atrAyaM viSezaH. lakzaRalakzyatAvacCedakayorEkye sidDasADanaM dozaH saMpadyate. yaTA anumiterlakzaRamanumititvam ityuktO lakzaRena lakzye anumitO itaraBedasADane sidDasADanam. pakzatAvacCedakasADyasAmAnADikaraRyasyAnumitivizayasyAnumiteH pUrvameva hetAvavyaBicaritasADya sAmAnADikaraRyAtmakavyAptijYAne AtatvAt (ma0pra0 2 pf0 15). vyAvftteH prayojanatve pfTivyAmitaraBede sADye ganDavattvarUpaM lakzaRaM heturBavati. lakzaRasya lakzaRaM tu lakzyatAvacCedakasama niyatatvam. yaTA gorlakzaRasya sAsnAdimattvasya lakzyatAvacCeda kI BUtagotvasamaniyatatvaM lakzaRaM Bavati iti vijYeyam (ta0 dI0) (la0va0). [Ka] dUzaRatrayarahito DarmaH (ta0 BA0) (ta0 pra0) (ta0 dI 0). yaTA gorlakzaRaM sAsnAdimattvam. yaTA vA viSudDamAtApitfjanyatvaM brAhmaRasya lakzaRam (ta0 kO0 pf0 21). dUzaRatrayaM ca avyAptiH ativyAptiH asaMBavaSca iti (ta0 dI 0) (ta0 kO0). ete trayo dozA lakzaRadozAH ityucyante (la0va0). etezA dUzakatAvIjaM tu<BR>;p{0697}<BR>lakzaRenetaraBedasADane ativyAptO vyaBicAraH. avyAptO BAgAsidDiH. asaMBave svarUpAsidDiSceti (nIla0 1 pf0 4). etaddUzaRatrayarahito Darma eva asADAraRaDarmaH ityucyate (ta0 BA0) (ta0 pra0) (ta0 dI 0). [ga] vedAntinastu yo Darmo lakzye vyAGyA vartate na vartate cAnyatra sa DarmaH. yaTA goH sAsnAdimattvam. tadDi gozu sarvatrAsti nAsti cAgozu ityAhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 1). [Ga] sajAtIyavijAtIyavyAvartako lakzyagataH kaScillokaprasidDaH AkAro lakzaRam (jE0 nyA0 a0 1 pA0 1 aDi0 1). idaM lakzaRaM dviviDam svarUpalakzaRam tawasTalakzaRaM ca iti. taduktam svarUpaM tawasTaM dviDA lakzaRaM syAt svarUpe pravizwaM svarUpAdviBinnam iti. tatra svarUpalakzaRaM yaTA AkASo bilam iti. yaTA vedAntamate saccidAnando brahma iti svarUpalakzaRam. yaTA mImAMsakamate codanAlakzaRorTo DarmaH ityAdO codanAvAcya viDivAkyameva DarmasvarUpajYApakamasti iti. tawasTalakzaRaM tu kAkavat devadattagfham iti. atrodAsInopi kAka idaM devadattagfhamiti voDayati. yaTA vA pfTivyA ganDo lakzaRam. sa hi tawasTalakzaRamapi pfTivIM parasmAdBinnatayAnumApayati. taTA hi pfTivI jalAdiByo Bidyate ganDavattvAt yannEvaM tannEvam yaTA jalam iti. mAyAvAdimate tu jagajjanmAdikAraRaM brahma iti tawasTalakzaRam. lakzaRena ca padArTajYAnaM sukaraM Bavati. taduktam fzayopi padArTAnAM nAntaM yAnti pfTaktvataH. lakzaRena tu sidDAnAmantaM yAnti vipaScitaH.. iti. 2 vyAvartakam. tacca dviviDam viSezaRam upalakzaRaM ca. tatropalakzaRaM yaTA jawABistApasa ityAdO tApasAdeH kAlAntarIRajawAdikaM lakzaRam (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 3 pf0 91). ayaM ca itTaMBUtalakzaRe (pA0 sU0 2. 3. 21) iti pARinisUtraGawakalakzaMRaSabdasyArTaH. viSezaRaM tu patAkAvaddevadattagfhamityAdO patAkA. taTAhi hi sajAtIyavijAtIyavyAvartakatayA lakzyAvaDAraRaM lakzaRasya prayojanam. asmin grAme devadattagfham iti vArtAM SrutavataH puruzasya tadrAmasTezu sarvezu gfhezvapi devadattagfhabudDiprasaktO yatra patAkA vartate taddevadatta88<BR>;p{0698}<BR>gfham iti lakzaRajYAne sati idameva devadattagfham nAnyat ityavaDAraRajYAnaM jAyate (pra0 pa0 pf0 2) iti. 3 svarUpam. yaTA vyApte- (lakzaRamAha yatreti (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 20) ityAdO. yaTA vA jIvalakzaRamAha (ta0 dI0) ityAdO (nIla0 1 0 11). yaTA vA zawalakzaRaM vastu GawalakzaRaM dravyam paramARulakzaRA nityapfTivI ityAdO ca lakzaRaSabdasyArTaH svarUpam. 4 pratipAdyo vizayaH. yaTA jEminidaSalakzaRIM praRinAya ityAdO. 5 Alocanam. yaTA vilakzaRamityAdO lakzaRaSabdasyArTaH. tadarTaSca hetuSUnyA sTitirvilakzaRam (amarawI 0 3. 2. 2). 6 anyadIyaDarmarAhityam. yaTA vilakzaRaM vastvidam ityAdO lakzaRaSabdasyArTaH. yaTA vA bOdDamate svalakzaRaM svalakzaRam iti BAvanAvizayo lakzaRapadArTaH. 7 SAbdikAstu SabdasADutA pratipAdakaM pramARam. yaTA vyAkaraRAdisUtraM lakzaRam ityAhuH. 8 vyavahArajYAstu vyavahAropayogi nAma ityAhuH. 9 cihnam iti kAvyajYA vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0695" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणा
lakzaRA — (vfttiH) [ka] nyAyamate svaSakyasaMbanDaH (BA0 pa0 Slo083) (ta0 dI0 Ka0 4) (nyA0 vo0 4) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 10) (vAkya 0). tadarTastu svaM lAkzaRikaM padam gaNgApadam. tasya SakyaH pravAhaH. tatsaMbanDaH saMyogaH iti (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 35). sa ca saMyogasamavAyAdiryaTAyaTaM grAhyaH. svaSakyasaMbanDaSca SabdanirUpitorTanizWaH SAbdaboDaprayojakaH SabdArTayoH saMbanDaH. mImAMsakAdayastu vAcyArTasaMtradDArTaboDakatvarUpaH SabdanizwaH ityAhuH. yaTA gaNgAyAM GozaH prativasati ityAdO gaNgApadasya pravAhasamIpe tIre lakzaRA (mu0 4) (vAkya 0 4). gaNgApadaSakyapravAhajalOGasya tIre saMyogasaMvanDo gaNgApadalakzaRA (ta0 kO0 4). asti hi gaNgApadaSakyaH pravAhaviSezaH tatsaMbanDastIre iti (nyA0 ma0 Ka0 4 pf0 10). atra anvayAnupapattirlakzaRAvIjam iti prAYca AhuH (mu0 4). tAtparyAnupapattireva (tAtparya nirvAhikA) sarvatra lakzaRAvIjam iti navyAH prAhuH (BA0 pa0 0 83). lakzaRAprayojakaM cAlaMkArikAdaya itTamamanyanta.<BR>;p{0699}<BR>muKyArTabADe tadyukto yaTAnyorTaH pratIyate. rUQeH prayojanAdvAsO lakzaRA SaktirarpitA.. (sA0 da0 pari0 2 Slo0 5) iti. kAvyaprakASe tu lakzaRAropitA kriyA iti caturTa caraRaH (ullA0 2). lakzaRA punardviviDA prayojananirapekzA prayojanasApekzA ceti. tatrAdyA yaTA mArgaScalanti iti. iyaM prayojanABAvepi pravartamAnatvAt rUQalakzaRA ityucyate. dvitIyA yaTA gaNgAyAM GopaH iti. iyaM ca pAvitryAdiprayojanApekzayA pravartamAnatvAt kevalaM lakzaRA ityucyate. muKyArTAnupapattilakzaRAvIjam (pra0 ca0 4 pf0 40) iti. lakzaRASabdaSca lakzaDAtoryacapratyaye striyAM wApi sidDyati. [Ka] prAYcastu SakyAdaSakyopasTitirlakzaRA ityAhuH. [ga] anye tu aSakye tAtparyavizayatvaM lakzaRA ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 10) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 35). [Ga] SAbdikAstu SakyatAvacCedakAropo lakzaRA ityaNgIcakruH. samAsasTaSabdasamudAye rAjapuruza ityAdO tu viSizwArTe samAsarUpavilakzaRaSaktyEvopapattO lakzaRArUpAtiriktavfttikalpanamanucitam iti SAbdikA vadanti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 11) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 43). AropanimittAni ca gOtamenoktAni yaTA sahacaraRasTAnatAdarTyavfttamAnaDAraRasAmIpyayogasADanADipatyAni (gO0 222261) iti vEyAkaraRasidDAntaH. vastutastu sahacaraRAdIni SakyasaMbanDagrAhakARyeva nAropanimittAni iti tu vayaM pratImaH. [Na] mImAMsakAstu pratipAdyasaMbanDo lakzaRA. yaTA CatriRo yAntItyAdAvajahallakzaRA. atra Catrin ityasya matubarTakenpratyayAntatayA padasamUharUpatvena tacCakyA prasidDyA SakyasaMbanDarUpA lakzaRA na saMBavati. ataH pratipAdyasaMbanDo hi lakzaRA ityetatparyantAnuDAvanam. atra kecidAhuH. CatrapadasyEkasArTe lakzaRA. tadDitArTaH saMbanDI. taTA ca ekasArTa saMbanDino gacCanti ityanvayaboDaH (nI0 4 pf0 30). evaM ca SakyasaMbanDarUpalakzaRayEvopapattO pratipAdyasaMbanDarUpalakzaRA nANgIkartavyA iti. [ca] anye ca svaboDyasaMbanDo lakzaRA. yaTA citraguriti bahuvrIhO lakzaRA ityAhuH. mImAMsakamate citraguH iti bahuvrIhO vAkyasyApi viSizwaM boDyamasti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 1).<BR>;p{0700}<BR>taTA hi ekadeSavikftamananyavadBavati iti nyAyena citragurityatra citrA gOH iti vAkyasya sattvAt tasya ca boDyam citrA gOH tatsaMbanDacitragoH svAminyasti iti (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 4546). etanmate vAkye lakzaRAyA AvaSyakatvaM tu lakzakaSabda vyAKyAne samavalokanIyam. [Ca] AlaMkArikASca SakyasaMbanDajYAnaM lakzaRA (kAvya0 pradI0). [ja] SakyatAvacCedakA ropavizayanizwasaMsargaH. etanmate gaNgAyAM Goza ityAdO gaNgAtvenEva lakzyArTapratItiH. ata eva tato vEyaYjanikI SEtyapAvanatvAdipratItiH (vE0 sA0 da0). [Ja] muKyArTabADatadyogAByAmarTAntarapratipAdanaM lakzaRA. sA ca dviviDA rUQimUlA prayojanamUlA ca. taduktaM kAvyaprakASe muKyArTabADe tadyoge rUQitoTa prayojanAt. anyorTo lakzyate yatsA lakzaRAropitA kriyA.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 373 pAta 0) iti. taTA ca lakzaRA dviviDA nirUQalakzaRA svArasikalakzaRA ca iti. prAcAM mate lakzaRA caturviDA jahatsvArTA ajahasvArTA jahadajahatsvArTA lakzitalakzaRA ceti (mu0 4). navyanEyAyikAnAM mate tu lakzaRA triviDA jahallakzaRA ajahallakzaRA jahadajahallakzaRA ca (ta0 dI0 4). yaccoktaM granTAntare Sakyena saha saMbanDAt sAdfSyAn samavAyataH. vEparItyAt kriyAyogAlakzaRA paYcaDA matA.. iti tasya gORI SudDA ceti Bedadvaya eva tAtparyam (ma0pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 41). SAbdikAnAmAlaMkArikARAM ca mate lakzaRA dviDA gORI SudDA ca. tatra gORyAM sAdfSyAtmakaH SakyasaMbanDaH. yaTA gOrvAhIka iti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 10) (nyA0 bo0). tadarTaSca vAhIko vAhIkadeSodBavaH. gOrbalIvardaH. vAhIke gavABedasya bADAt gopadena gosadfSo lakzyate. sAdfSyaM ca gogatajAqyamAnyAdikameva. taTA ca jaqo mandaSca vAhIkaH iti SAbdaboDaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 3536). atra BawwavArtikam aBiveyAvinA BUtapratItirlakzRocyate. lakzyamARaguREyogAdvftterizwA tu gORatA.. (kAvyapra0 u0 2) iti. SudDA ca dviviDA jahallakzaRA ajahallakzaRA ceti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 10) (nyA0 bo0). jagadISamate tu prakArAntareRa jahatsvArTA ajahatsvArTA<BR>;p{0701}<BR>nirUQA ADunikI gORI ceti lakzaRA paYcaviDA (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 24 pf0 35). vyaYjanA tu SaktilakzaRAntarBUtA SabdaSaktimUlA. arTaSaktimUlA tvanumAnAdinA anyaTAsidDA (ta0 dI0 pf0 30). atrADikaM tu vyaYjanASabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. atra vEyAkaraRA AhuH. lakzaRA dviviDA gORI SudDA ca. tatra svanirUpita sAdfSyADikaraRatvasaMbanDena SakyasaMbanDyarTapratipAdikA gORI. tadatiriktasaMbanDena tatpratipAdikA SudDA. sApi SudDA dviviDA ajahatsvArTA jahatsvArTA ca iti (la0 ma0 AkANkzAvi0 pf0 13). AlaMkArikAstu gORyAH SudDAyASca pratyekaM sAropA sADyavasAnA ceti dvO BedO. tatra gORyA BedadvayasyodAharaRe gohIkaH gOrayam iti. SudDAyAM BedadvayasyodAharaRe tu AyurDftam Ayurevedam ityAhuH (kAvyapra0 u0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणाभासः
lakzaRABAsaH — dozayuktaM lakzaRam. tacca triviDam asaMBavi avyApakam ativyApakaM ceti. tatrAdyaM yaTA gorekaSaPatvaM lakzaRam iti. dvitIyaM yaTAM goH SabalatvaM lakzaRam iti. tftIyaM yaTA gorvizARitvaM lakzaRam iti (pra0 pa0 pf0 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0701" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षितः
lakzitaH — 1 [ka] lakzaRayA boDitorTaH. yaTA gaNgAyAM GozaH ityatra tIraM lakzitorTaH. [Ka] jYAtaH. [ga] anumitaH. 2 lakzakaH SabdaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0701" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षितलक्षणा
lakzitalakzaRA — (lakzaRA) [] prAcAM mate svalakzitapadaSakyasaMbanDaH. yaTA dvirePapade lakzitalakzaRA. atrArTe lakzitasya padasya lakzaRA iti vigraho drazwavyaH. (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 39). atra dvirePapadena dvO rePO yatra iti bahuvrIhilakzaRayA BramarapadaM lakzyate. Bramarapadena ca svaSakyasaMbanDI BramararUporTo lakzyate iti dvirePapadasya Bramare lakzitalakzaRopapadyate iti. lakzita lakzaRApi vfttyantaram iti prAnna AhuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 38). [Ka] yatra lakzitapadena lakzyArTovagamyate (na tu SakyArTaH di 0) tatra lakzitalakzaRA. yaTA dvirePostItyatra dvirePapade (ma0pra0 4 pf0 41). [ga] navyanEyAyikAnAM<BR>;p{0702}<BR>mate tu yatra SakyArTasya paraMparAsaMbanDarUpA lakzaRA sA. yaTA dvirePamAnayetyAdO dvirePAdipade lakzitalakzaRA. dvirePamAnayetyAdO. paraMparAsaMbanDastu svavAcya rePadrayaGawitapadavAcyatvAdirUpaH (di0 4 pf0 181). atra svaM dvirePapadam. taTA vAcyaM rePadvayam. tadBUwitaM padaM Bramara iti padam. tasya vAcyo BramaraH. tasya BAvastattvaM BramararUpArTesti iti dvirePapadaSakyArTasya rePadvayasya paraMparAsaMbanDarUpA lakzaRa Bramare saMgacCate. atra dvirePAdipade rePadvayasaMbanDo Bramarapade jYAyate. Bramarapadasya ca saMbanDo Bramare jYAyate iti tatra lakzitalakzaRA jahallakzaREva iti natryanEyAyikAH prAhuH (mu0 4 pf0 181). lakzitalakzaRApi gORyAmevAntarBavati. yaTA dvirePostItyatra dvirePapadavAcyarePadvayasaMbanDiBramarapadena BramarasyopasTApanAn dvirePapadaSakya rePadvaya saMbanDiBramarapadavAcyatvarUpa paraMparAsaMbanDasyEva SakyasaMbanDatvAt iti boDyam (ma0pra0 4 0 41). atretTaM vipratipattiH. lakzitalakzaRApi vfttyantaram iti prAco manyante. tanna. paraMparAsaMbanDasyApi (na tu sAkzAcCakyasaMbanDasyEva) SakyasaMbanDAtmakalakzaRAtvena dvirePapadasya svalakzyaBramarapadaGawitaparaMparAsaMbanDena dvirePapadalakzaRayEvopapatternAtiriktavfttikalpanam iti navyanEyAyikA AhuH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 39). AlaMkArikAstu yatra lakzitAcCandAdarTABiDAnam tatrEva lakzitalakzaRA pariBAzitA. yaTA dvirePapade rUQiprayojanABAvepi lakzitalakzaRA ityAhuH (sA0 da0 wI0). atra vEyAkaraRAstu dvirePapadaM rUQiSaktatyA BramaraboDakam. avayavArTapratItistu nAstyeva raTantarAdivat. yadvA padanizWarePadvayasyArTa AropAtsaMbanDitvenEva BramaraboDaH. ata eva BramaraparyAyezu dvirePapadasya koSezu pAWaH. bADapratisaMDAnaM vinEva dvirePapadAdBamaraboDena lakzaRA ityayuktam ityAhuH (la0 ma0 AkANkzAvi0 pf0 17). BramararUpArTopasTApakatvasaMBavAt<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0701" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीः
lakzmIH — [ka] SrIvizRoH patnI. atra prasaNgato vizayAntaramucyate. pOze cEtre taTA BAdre pUjayeyuH striyaH Sriyam (skandapu0) iti. dIpAnvitAmAvAsyAyAM lakzmIpUjA sarvEstatkAmiBiH kAryA. kojAgaralakzmIpUjApi<BR>;p{0703}<BR>tatkAle kAryA. [Ka] AdimAyA SaktiH iti vAmamArgIyAH SAktA AhuH. [ga] BagavadicCA ityanye saMgirante. [Ga] citprakftirapi iti mADyAH saMvadante. etanmate lakzmIrISakowipravizwA na tu jIvakowipravizwA BagavadaDInA ca. taTA ca SrutO lakzmyA yaM kAmaye taM tamutraM kfRomi taM brahmARaM tamfzi taM sumeDAma ityuktvA mama yonirapsvantaH samudre (f0 saM0 8. 7. 1. 1112) ityuktam. [Na] BagavadaMSaviSezaH iti vallaBIyA manyante. 4 saMpattiH. 5 sTalapadmam. 6 haridrA. 2 SoBA. 3 kAntiH 7 SamI. 7 SamI. 8 vArayozit iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 9 pIqA. 10 OzaDam iti Bizajo vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0702" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यम्
lakzyam — 1 lakzaRayA boDyorTaH. talakzaRaM ca lakzaRAnirvAhakatAtparyavizayatvam (kfzRa 0). yaTA gaNgAyAM Goza ityAdO gaNgApadasya lakzaRayA boDyastIrarUporTo lakzyo Bavati. 2 [ka] yaduddiSya lakzaRamucyate tat. yaTA ganDavattvaM pfTivyA lakzaRam ityukte pfTivI lakzyA. yaTA vA lakzyatAvacCedakamAtreRa lakzyasaMkIrtanamuddeSaH (ta0 kO0) ityAdO ca lakzyaSabdArTaH. [Ka] vedAntinastu yAvadanyato vyAvartanIyam yAvati cEkaH Sabdo vyutpAdanIyaH tallakzyam ityAhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 2). 3 jYeyam. 4 anumeyam (tri0). 5 veDArTamuddiSyamAnaM Saravyam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0703" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

