laGutvam — 1 gurutvABAvaH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 3) (pa0 ca0 pf0 19) (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 6). yaTA mfdu laGu cedaM dravyam ityAdO laGutvam<BR>;p{0704}<BR>2 sparSaviSeza iti kecidAhuH (si0 ca0). 3 SIGrAlpopasTitikatvam. yaTA laGuniyatapUrvavartina eva kAryasaMBave tadBinnamanyaTAsidDam ityAdO laGutvam. idaM laGutvaM triviDam SarIrakftam upasTitikftam saMbanDakftaM ceti (di0 1) (si0 ca0). tatra praTamam dravyapratyakzotpatti prati mahattvasya kAraRatve anekadravyatvApekzayA mahattvasya laGutvam. dvitIyam ganDotpatti prati ganDaprAgaBAvasya kAraRatve rUpaprAgaBAvApekzayA ganDaprAgaBAvasya laGutvam. ganDAtmakapratiyogijYAnasya sattvena SIGraM tadupasTiteH. tftIyam GawaM prati daRqasya kAraRatve daRqatvadaRqarUpAdyapekzayA daRqasya laGutvam iti. daRqatvAdeH kAraRatve tu svASrayadaRqasaMyogAdirUpaparaMparAyA gurutvam iti BAvaH (di0 1 pf0 54) (nIla0 1 pf0 17). 4 dozaviSezaH (pa0 ca0). 5 tarkaviSezaH. yaTA laGutvakalpanaM tarkaviSezaH ityAdO iti prAYco nEyAyikA AhuH (sarva0 pf0 239 akza0) (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 39) 6 SAbdikAstu hrasvasaMjYakavarRavfttirDarmaviSeza ityAhuH. 7 puzyASvihastABijitsaMjYakezu nakzatrezu vartamAno DarmaviSezaH iti mOhUrtikA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0703" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्
laN — (tiN) smaSabdasya yogaM vinA Savantasya DAtorarTe atItatvasyAnvayaDIheturyAdfSI tiN tAdfSIM tiN laN ityucyate. yaTA apacadityAdO laN. yaTA vA asya putraH aBavadityAdO laN (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 131). tivAdiSca smaSabdopasaMDAnaM vinA DAtorarTe nAtItatvaM voDayati papAcetyAdO liqAdirboDayannapi na Savantasya iti tivAderliMqAdeSca vyudAsaH. apacadityAdO tu vinApi smaSabdayogaM laNastaTAtvam iti lakzaRasamanvayaH. prakftyarTe anumatatvAdyatanatvAdya nAkANkzitatvam iti viSezaRAcca pacatAM pacetAM pacantAm ityAdO apAktAm apakzAtAm ityAdO apakzyatAM apakzyetAm ityAdO ca lowo luNo laNastAmAtAmpraBftO nAtiprasaNgaH. atra laNotItaH kAla iva tannizWaM hyastanatvamapyarTaH. anadyatane laN (pA0 sU0 3. 2. 111) iti sUtre anadyatanaSabdamahinA hyastanatvaM boDyata iti BAvaH. tacca pUrvadinavfttitvam iti kOmArA<BR>;p{0705}<BR>vadanti. hyastanatvaM laNo nArTaH. kiM tu adyatanaBinnatvam ityapare darpaRakfdAdayaH vadanti (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 129130). anadyatane laN (pA0 sU0 3. 2. 111) iti pARininA anuSizwatvAt iti BAvaH. taTA ca apacadityAdO vartamAnaDvaMsapratiyogipUrvadinavfttipAkakftimAn iti tAdfSapratiyogyanadyatanakAlavfttipAkakftimAn iti vA matadvaye yaTAkramaM boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 101 wI0 pf0 160) aTa vA anadyatanAtItatvaM viSizwameva laqarTaH. tacca SabdaprayogADikaraRa- dinAdyakzaRavfttiDvaMsapratiyogitvam (ga0 vyu0 lakA0 pf0 138). yadvA anadyatanatvam atItatvaM ca pfTageva laNarTaH (tarkA 0 4 pf011) (si0 ca0). SabdaprayogADikaraRadiva sAvfttitve sati SabdaprayogakAlInaDvaMsapratiyogitvam iti kaScidvakti. atra putroBavat ityatra SAbdikamate SAbdaboDastu vartamAnaDvaMsapratiyogyanadyatanakAlavfttiretatsaMbanDiputrakartfkotpattyanukUlo vyApAraH iti (vE0 sA0 da0 la0 pf0 130).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0704" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्
law — (tiN) yAdfSatiNaH smaSabdopasaMGAnABAvaprayuktaH svArTAtItatvaboDakatvABAvaH tAdfSI tiN laqucyate. yaTA jAnAti jAnIte pacati pacate cEtraH ityAdO tivAKyAtam. atra dviruktaDAtvanAkANkzatvena prakftyarTaparokzatvanirAkANkzatvena vA viSezaRIyam. nAto buBuje buBujAte ityAdisTalIyaliwyatiprasaNgaH. jAnAti jAnIte pacati pacate ityAdO tibAdInAmazwAdaSAnAmapi smaSabdopasaMDAnABAvaprayukto jYAnAdiDarmikAtItatvaboDasyopaDAyakatvABAvaH smaSabdopasaMDAne tu jAnAti sma ityAditotItatvaboDAnuBavAt iti lakzaRasamanvayaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 97 wI0 pf0 142). law dviviDA parasmEpadam AtmanepadaM ceti. evam anyA loqAdyA api tiNaH parasmEpadAtmanepadaBedena dviviDA Bavanti iti vijYeyam. lawo vartamAnakAlaH vartamAnasAmIpyaM ceti dviviDorTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 97 wI0 pf0 143144). atra sUtram vartamAne law (pA0 sU0 3. 2. 123) iti. tadarTastu vartamAnArTavftterDAtolewpratyayo Bavati (kASikA0). vartamAnakAlastu tattacCabdaprayogA89<BR>;p{0706}<BR>DikaraRakAlaH. yaTA pacatItyAdO laqarTaH (ga0 vyu0 la0). atra laqarTavartamAnatvaM cAKyAtArTakftyAdyanvayi tattatkAlavfttitvameva (Sa0pra0 Slo0 97 wI0 pf0 142). SAbdikAstu prArabDAparisamApto BUtaBavizyadBinno vA kAlo vartamAnakAlaH iti vadanti (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 120) (kASikA 0 3. 2. 123). tadarTaSca vinazwAvayavaprAgaBAvakatve satyanutpannaDvaMsAntyAvayavakatvam. aTa vA SabdaprayogADikaraRavfttikAlatvavyApyaDarmatvenopalakzitatattatkAlatvAvacCinnatvam (vE0 sA0 da0 la0 pf0 120). vartamAnasAmIpyaM tu vartamAnakzaRottarakAlAvacCedyatvam. tena cEtraH kadA gamizyati iti jijYAsAyAm eza gacCati ityuttarasya vartamAnakzaRottarakAlAvacCedyagatimAMScEtraH ityarTaH iti na praSnottaraBAvA saMgatiH. aTavA vartamAnakzaRAvyavahitaprAkkAlA vacCedyatvam. tena cEtraH kadA samAgataH iti jijYAsAyAm epa AgacCati ityuttarasya vartamAnakzaRAvyavahitaprAkAlAvacCedyAgamanavAn ityarTa iti na praSnottaraBAvAsaMgatiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 97 wI0 pf0 144).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0705" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blan