लिङ्
liN — (tiN) viDyAdyanyatamasyAnvayaboDaM prati samarTA lawo lowaSca BinnA tiN liNucyate. pawamAnaya ityAdO saptamaM padaM gfhRAti ityAdO ca viDi boDayantyAvapi lowlawO na tAByAM Binne iti yazwavyam deyam ityAdO tu tavyAdikaM kAryatvAdikaM boDayadapi na tiN iti na lowlawostavyAdO cAtiprasaNgaH. BAvitvAdyapratyAyakatvena viSezaRAcca pacyAt ityAdAvASIliMNi na prasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 146147).<BR>;p{0708}<BR>liNa dviDiDA viDiliN ASIrliN ceti (tarkA0) (si0 ca0). tatra viDyAdyarTavoDikA liN viDiliN. ASIrmAtravoDikA liN ASIrliN. viDyAdayo liNarTAstu viDiH nimantritatvam Amantritatvam prArTanA ASrayatvam janyatvam aDIzwaH saMpraSnaH ityAdayo jYeyAH. atra sUtrARi viDinimantraRAmantrARADIzwasaMpraSnaprArTanezu liN (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 161) hetuhetumatorliN (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 156) ASizi liNlowO (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 173) ityAdIni viDyAdyarTaparatvena yojyAni. atra vEyAkaraRA AhuH. viDinimantraRA mantraRADIzwAnAM caturRAmanugatapravartanAtvena vAcyatA. uktaM ca BartfhariRA asti pravartanArUpamanusyUtaM caturDvapi. tatrEva liN viDAtavyaH kiM Bedasya vivakzayA.. (bE0 sA0 la0 pf0 132) iti. atredaM boDyam. pravartanAtvaM ca pravfttijanakajYAnavizayatAvacCedakatvam. tacezwasADanatvasyAstIti tadeva viDyarTaH (vE0 sA0 pf0 133) iti. atra yaTAkramamudAharaRAni pradarSyante. tatra (1) viDAvarTe liN yaTA yajeta paceta BavAn grAmaM gacCet ityAdi. atra navyanEyAyikamate izwasADanatvAdikaM viDyarTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100) iti. atrezwatvaM ca samaBivyAhftapadopasTApitakAmanA vizayatvam ga0 vyu0 la0) (bE0 sA0 da0 la0 pf0 133). atrADikaM tu viDiSabdavyAKyAnAvasare saMpAdayizyate. tattatra drazwavyam. dvezavizayatAvacCedakatvopalakzitanarakatvAdyavacCinna sADanatAtvAvacCinnapratiyogitAkABAvo viDyarTaH iti prAcInanEyAyikA AhuH. AcAryAstu AtmABiprAyo viDyarTaH. pAkaM kuryAH pAkaM kuryAm iti maDyamottamapuruzayorliN icCAviSezAtmakAjYADyezaRAnujYApraSnaprArTanArTakatayA praTamapuruzepIcCAyAsekaSakterucitatvAt ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 da0 la0 pf0 145). (2) nimantritatve liN yaTA SrAdDe BuYjIta BavAn iha BuYjITAratvam ityAdi. (3) Amantritatve (kAmacArakaraRe) liN yaTA BavAnihAsIta putrotsave BavAn BuYjIta ityAdi. (4) prArTanAyAM liN yaTA BojanaM laBeyaM DenuM dadyAstvamasmaByam Bavati me prArTanA vyAkaraRamaDIyIya ityAdi. (5) ASrayatve liN yaTA hfdo yadi DUmavAn syAt<BR>;p{0709}<BR>ityAdi. atra DAtoH yadi ityasya vA nirUQalakzaRayA BedorTaH. tena DUmavadBedASrayatAvAn hfdaH ityarTaH. evam guRatvaM yadi Gawe syAddravye syAt ityAdO tu DAtoratyantABAva evArTaH. taduttaraliNastu pUrvavat ASrayatvam arTaH. taTA ca GawavfttitvABAvavadguRatvaM GawavfttitvavyApakIBUtasya dravyavfttitvasyABAvavat ityevaM tatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0100 wI0 pf0 155). (6) janyatverTe liN yaTA yo brAhmaRAyAvagurettaM Satena yAtayAt ityAdi. atra hetuhetumatorliN (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 156) ityanuSAsanAt yaH SatayAtanA hetu brAhmaRAvagoraRavAn tadIyaSatayAtanaM brAhmaRAvagoraRajanyam ityAkArako voDaH. avagoraRaM hantumudyamaH. (atra SAbdikamate tu SAbdaboDaH yatkartfko brAhmaRoddeSyako vaDodyamaH tatkarmikA tAdfSavaDodyamajanyA SatasaMvatsarayAtanA ityAkArako dfzwavyaH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 146). prABAkarAstu atra janyajanakaBAvo na liqarTaH. api tu pOrvAparyamAtraM liNaTeH. paScAttasya kalpanAt. anyaTA duritApUrvasya vAcyatvApatteH ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 158). (7) aDIzwArTe liN yaTA mARavakamaDyApayedBavAn ityAdi. aDIzwaSca satkArapUrvako vyApAraH. taTA ca mARavakamaDyApayedBavAnityAdO aDyApanAdivyApAre saMmAnapUrvaka pravfttyanukUlo vyApAraH ityarTaH. ayameva aByarTanA ityucyate. atra saMmAnapUrvamaDyApanAdivyApAraH izwasADanam iti boDaH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 131132). (8) saMpraSne (saMpraDAraRe) liN yaTA kiM Bo vedamaDIyIya uta tarkamaDIyIya ityAdi (kASikA0 pA0 sU0 3. 3. 161 pf0 181). ASizi liN yaTA ciraM jIvyAdBavAn. yaTA vA avyAdajoNGrimaRimAMstava jAnvaTorU yajYocyutaH kawitawaM jaWaraM hayAsyaH (BAga0 ska0 10 a0 6 Slo0 22) ityAdi..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0707" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गपरामर्शः
liNgaparAmarSaH — parAmarSaSabdavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. atredaM boDyam. liNgaparAmarSonumAnam iti vArtikakAra sidDAntaH. eke tAvadvarRayanti liNgaliNgisaMbanDasmftiranumAnam iti (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 5 pf0 47).<BR>;p{0710}<BR>idameva tftIyaM liNgajYAnam. taTA hi liNgajYAnaM triviDam. tadyaTA parvate DUmena vahnisADane DUmArayorvyAptO gfhyamARAyAM mahAnasAdO yadBUmajYAnaM tadAdimam. pakze yadBUmajYAnaM tadvitIyam. tataH pUrvagfhItAM DUmAyorvyAptiM smftvA tatrEva parvate vahnivyApyatvena yadDUmajYAnaM tattftIyam. idameva liNgaparAmarSaH ityucyate (si0 ca0) (ta0 BA0). aTa vA mahAnasAdO dfzwAnte vahniDUmayorBUyaH sahacAradarSanAt vyApyatvena DUmajYAnaM praTamam. tataH parvatAdO DUmaM dfzwvA vyApyatvena tatsmaraRaM dvitIyam. tataH tatrEva vyApyatvena DUmasya parAmarSo vahnivyApyaDUmavAn ityevaMrUpastftIyaH (ta0 kO0 2). yadvA praTamaM dfzwAnte DUmadarSanam. tataH vyAptijYAnam. tataH tadviSizwapakzaDarmatAjYAnam (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 18)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0709" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गम्
liNgam — 1 (hetuH) [ka] vyApticalena yadyasya gamakam tat tasya liNgam. yaTA parvato vahnimAnDUmAdityAdO DUmo vahnerliNgam (pra0 pra0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 9). idaM liNgaM dviviDam salliNgam asalliNgaM ca. tatra vyAptipakzaDarmatAvalliNgaM salliNgam. tacca vyApakena sADyena vyApyaM Bavati. asalliNgaM tu vyAptipakzaDarmatAnyataraSUnyam. tasya vyApyatve na niyamaH. atra uBayaviDamapi liNgaM pratyekaM triviDam anvayavyatireki kevalAnvayi kevalavyatireki ceti (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 18) (gO0 vf0) (ta0 saM0). atrApi viBAgaH saMpadyate. anvayavyatireki dviviDam sapakzavftti tadekadeSavftti ceti. tatrAdyam SabdaH anityaH kftakatvAdBawavat iti sapakzavyApakam. sarvasminnanitye kftakatvasya vftteH. dvitIyaM yaTA parvatognimAn DUmavattvAt iti sapakzEkadeSavftti. agnimatyapi kacidavftteH (pra0 pa0 pf0 18) iti. atra SizwaM tu anumAnaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. liNgaM (anumAnam) dviviDam dfzwam sAmAnyato dfzwaM ca. tatra dfzwaM prasidDasADyayoratyantajAtyaBede anumAnam. yaTA gavyeva sAsnAmAtramupalaBya deSAntare sAsnAmAtradarSanAt gavi pratipattirBavati. prasidDasADyayoratyantajAtiBede liNgAnumeyaDarmasAmAnyAnuvfttitonumAnaM sAmAnyato dfzwam. yaTA karzakavaRigrAjapuruzARAM pravftteH<BR>;p{0711}<BR>PalavattvamupalaBya varRASramiRAmapi dfzwaM prayojanamanuddiSya pravartamAnAnAM PalAnumAnam iti. atredaM boDyam. yatra DUmastatrAgniH iti anyaBAve DUmo na Bavati ityevaM prasidDasamayasyAsaMdigDaDUmadarSanAt sAhacaryAnusmaraRAdanantaramanyaDyavasAyo Bavati iti tatra liNgadarSanaM pramARam. pramitiragnijYAnam. aTa vA agnijYAnameva pramARam. pramitira nO guRadozamADyasTapradarSanam. tatsvaniScitArTamanumAnam (praSasta0 pf0 4445). : liNgaSabde vyutpattistu vyAptibalena lInamarTaM gamayati iti liNgam (si0 ca0 2 pf0 25) (gO0 vf0). aTavA liNgayate gamyate anenArTaH iti liNgam (nyA0 vindu0 pa0 2 pf0 21). [Ka] yadanumeyena sahacaritaM tatsamAnajAtIye ca sarvatrAsarvatra vA sAmAnyena prasidDam tadviparIte ca sarvasminnasadeva tat liNgam. atroktam anumeyena saMbadDaM prasidDaM ca tadanvite. tadaBAve ca nAstyeva talliNgamanumApakam.. viparItamato yatsyAdekena dvitayena vA. virudDAsidDasaMdigDamaliNgaM kASyapobravIt.. iti kASyapaH kaRAdaH. tadarTaSca yadanumeyenArTena deSaviSeze kAlaviSeze ca sahacaritam anumeyaDarmAnvite cAnyatra sarvasminnekadeSe vA prasidDam anumeyaviparIte ca sarvasmin pramARatosadeva tadaprasidDasyArTasyAnumApakaM liNgaM Bavati iti. yattu yaToktAtrirUpAliNgAdekena DarmeRa dvAByAM vA viparItam tadanumeyasyADigame liNgaM na Bavati iti Aha sUtrakAraH aprasidDonapadeSosan saMdigDaSvAnapadeSaH (vE0 3. 1. 15) (praSasta0 2 pf0 27, 44, 46) iti. 2 sAMKyamate mahattattvAdikAryajAtaM liNgamucyate. asminnarTe vyutpattistu liyaM layaM gacCati praDAne iti liNgam. pfzodarAditvAtsADutvam. 3 lakzaRam. yaTA yugapajjYAnAnutpattirmanaso liNgam (gO0 1. 1. 16) ityAdO jYAnakAraRARutvaM manaso liNgam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 16) ityAdO. 4 vEyAkaraRAstu SabdasADutAprayojako DarmaH. sa ca prAkftaguRagatAvasTAtmako DarmaH. tadviSezaSca puMnapuMsakatvAdiH ityAhuH (SabdArTara0). taTA hi. sarvezAM triguRaprakftikAryatayA SabdAnAmapi<BR>;p{0712}<BR>taTAtvena guRagataviSezAcCandezu liNgaviSezaH iti kalpyate. sa ca viSezaH SAstre itTamaByaDAyi. vikftasattvAdInAM tulyarUpeRAvasTAnAnapuMsakatvam. sanvasyADikye puMstvam. rajasa ADikye strItvam iti.. evaM ca liNgasya SabdaDarmatvepi Sabdena sahArTABedAropAt asati bADake arTepi sAkzAt tatpAratantryeRa vA sarvatra tasya viSezaRatvam (vAca0).. aTavA sattvarajastamoguRAnAM sAmyAvasTA napuMsakatvam. ADikyaM puMstvam. apacayaH strItvam. tattacCabdanizWaM tattacCabdavAcyaM ca. tameva virudDaDarmamAdAya tawAdiSabdA Bidyante (vE0 sA0 nAmArTa0 pf0 224) iti. atredaM boDyam. puMliNgaH SabdaH iti vyavahArAt svamornapuMsakAt (pA0 sU0 7. 1. 23) ityatra SabdasyEva napuMsakatvavyapadeSAt dArAn ityAdO puMstvAnvayabAvAcca liNgasya SabdaDarmatvam iti. tawAdiSabdAnAmanekaliNgatvavyavahAraH samAnAnupUrvIkatvenEva SabdAnAmaBedAropAt. vastutaH tezAM BinnAnAmeva BinnaliNgatvamiti. atra mahABAzyam ekArTe SabdAnyatvAt dfzwaM liNgAnyatvam iti dik (vAca0). idaM SAbdikamatam. puMstvAdayatisro jAtayaH iti vESezikA AhuH. puMstvAdi SabdanizWam iti prAYca AhuH. puMstvA diliNgamarTanizWameveti navyavEyAkaraRA AhuH. puMstvAdiliNgasyArTanizWatve pramARaM ca iyaM vyaktiH idaM vastu ayaM padArTaH iti vyavahArA apratibadDaprasarAH iti. atredamAkUtam puzyaH tArakA nakzatram iti SabdanAnAtvadarSanAtstanakeSAdyatiriktameva liNgamarTanizWam iti (la0 ma0) (vE0 sA0 da0 nAmArTa0 pf0 225). atroktam strIliNgamapi pulliNgaM klIvaliNgamiti triDA. SabdasaMskArasidDyarTaM BAzayA nAma Bidyate.. (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 53) iti. aDikaM tu strIliNgam ityAditattacCabde drazwavyam. 5 mImAMsakAca arTaprakASanasAmarTyaM liNgam ityAhuH. sAmarTyaM dviviDam SabdagataM sAmarTyam arTagataM sAmarTyaM ca. tatrAdyam bahirdevasadanaM dAmi iti. dvitIyaM tu sruveRAvadyati iti. evam EndryA gArhapatyamupatizWate syonaM te sadanaM kfRomi ityAdikAni liNgasyodAharaRAni jYeyAni. atroktam sAmaTyaM sarvaSabdAnAM liNgamityaBiDIyate iti. kzamatA ca liNgam iti ca (vAca0).<BR>;p{0713}<BR>atra puroqASasadanaBUtaM barhiH KaRqayAmi iti SrutapadasAmarTyAt barhidevasadanaM dAmi iti mantrasya kuSakASAdirUpARAM muKyabarhizAM lavanANgatvam. na tu samAKyAto darBasadfSAnA mulapAdirUpatfRaviSezARAM gORabarhizAM lavanANgatvam ityarTaH (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 21). aTa vA dAmi iti padasya dA lavane ityasmAdDAtoH sidDasya CedanaprakASanasAmarTyAt barhiH ityasya cAstftadarBaprakASanasAmarTyAt darBacCedane samudAyamantrasya viniyogovagamyate (tattvavoDa 0) (vAca0). sruveRAvadyatItyatra avadAnasAmAnyaSezatvAvagamepi sruvasya liNgAtsAmarTyarUpAt AjyasAMnAyyAdidravadravyAvadAnaviSezANgatvam. sruveRa mAMsAdidravyAvadAnasya kartumaSakyatvAt iti. EndryA gArhapatyamityatra mantrasya prAptArTatvenAnuvAdakatvasaMBavAt mantrasTendrapadasyEva idi paramESvarye iti DAttranusArAdESvaryaguRayogAdagnO lakzaRA iti gArhapatyaprakASane samarTameva matraM EndryA iti tftIyASrutirgArhapatyopasTAne viniyukta (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf021) iti. mImAMsakABimatamidaM ca liNgaM viniyogaviDeH sahakAri Bavati iti vijYeyam (lO0 BA0 pf0 16). 6 svarUpam. yaTA saptadaSAvayavo liNgadehaH ityAdO saptadaSa sUkzmadehasya liNgam ityAhuH. atra sUtram saptadaSEkaM liNgam (sAMKya0 sU0 a0 3 sU0 9) iti. tadarTaSca sUkzmaSarIramapyADArADeyaBAvena dviviDaM Bavati. tatra saptadaSa militvA liNgaSarIram. tacca sargAdO samazwirUpamekameva BavatItyarTaH. ekAdaSendriyARi paYca tanmAtrARi budDiSca iti saptadaSa. ahaMkArasya budDAvevAntarBAvaH (sAMKya0 BA0 3. 9) iti. atroktam vAsanA BUtasUkzmaM (tanmAtrA) ca karmavidye taTEva ca. daSendriyaM mano budDiretaliNgaM vidurbuDAH.. (vASizwe0) iti. karmAtmA puruzo yosO banDamokzEH prayujyate. sa saptadaSakenApi rASinA yujyate ca saH.. (BAra0 mokzaDarme) (sAMKya0 BA0 3. 9) iti. atredaM boDyam. sAMKyamate liNgaSarIrasyEva suKaduHKakAryakatvam. kutaH. ekasya liNgadehasyEva suKaduHKAKyaBogAt. na tu sTUlaSarIrasya. mftaSarIre suKaduHKAdyaBAvasya sarvasaMmatatvAt (sAMKya0 BA0 a0 3 sU0 8) iti. 90 DarmaSAstrajYAdayastu<BR>;p{0714}<BR>puMsaH asADAraRamindriyam (upasTaH) ityAhuH. 8 cihnam SivaliNgaM ceti kAvyajYAH pOrARikAScAhuH. 9 upakramopasaMhArAvaByAsopUrvatA Palam. arTavAdopapattI ca liNgaM tAtparyanirRaye.. (vedAntasAraH) (sarva0 saM0 pf0 405 SAM0). idameva liNgazawkamityucyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0710" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गाभासत्वम्
liNgABAsatvam — 1 aNgavEkalyam. 2 duzwaliNgatvam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0714" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गि
liNgi — 1 sADyam (dIDi0 2). yaTA liNgAvizayakaliNgivizayakajYAnajanakanyAyAvayavatvam pratijYAlakzaRam (ci0 2 ava0 pf0 77) ityAdO liNgiSabdArTaH sADyam. yaTA vA talliNgaliNgipUrvakam. (sAMKyakA0 5) ityAdO. atra liNgi ityasya liNgajYAnajYeyam ityarTo jYeyaH. 2 pakzaH. 3 pakzaDarmatAjYAnam. atrArTe liNgamasyAsti iti vigrahopi jYeyaH (sAMKya0 kO0 Slo0 5 pf0 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0714" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गोपधानम्
liNgopaDAnam — liNgopahite pakze lENgikasya sADyasya BAnam. atra vigrahaH. liNgasya hetoH upaDAnam pakze vESizwyam iti. liNgopahite ityasya liNgena vyAptipakzaDarmatAviSizwena hetunA upahitaH viSizwaH tasmiMn iti vigrahaH. taTA ca sADyAnumAnANgahetuyukte pakza ityarTaH. yaTA SudDaparvatapakzakepi vahnisADyake DUmahetuke sTale parvato vahnimAn DUmAdi-. tyAdO vahnivyApyaDUmaviSizwe parvate vahnerBAnam vahnivyApyaDUmavAnparvato vahnimAn iti. taTA hi vahnivyApyo hi DUmo vahnerliNgam. tadvati pakze vahnerBAnam. vahnivyApyaDUmavAnparvataH iti parAmarSottaraM jAyamAnAnumitO jYAnalakzaRayA tAdfSapakzaBAnasyAvaSyakatvAt. taTA ca vahnivyApyaDUmavAn parvato vahnimAn ityeva tatrAnumiterAkAraH iti vijYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0714" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गोपधानमतम्
liNgopaDAnamatam — liNgopahitalENgikaBAnam ityaBimatam. atra vyutpattiH liNgasya vyAptipakzaDarmatAviSizwahetoH upaDAnam BAnam vESizwyaM vA arTAt pakze Bavati iti matam. liNgopahitetyasyArTaSca liNgopahite liNgaviSizwe pakze lENgikasya sADyasya BAnaM Bavati iti. yaTA SudDaparvatatvAvacCinnapakzakavahnisADyakasTale parvato vahnimAnDUmAdityAdAvapi<BR>;p{0715}<BR>vahnivyApyaDUmavAnparvato vahnimAn ityanumitirBavati na tu kevalaH parvato vahnimAn iti. idaM codayanAcAryARAM matam. tanmate sarvatra tAdfSahetuviSizwaH pakzaH sADyavAn ityAkArEvAnumitirBavati iti vijYeyam. ayaM BAvaH. AcAryARAM mate hetoH sarvatrEva DarmitAvacCedakatayA BAnAt parvatatvAdyavacCedena hetumattAjYAnasTalepi (vahnivyApyaDUmavAnparvataH iti parAmarSepi) vahnivyApyaDUmaviSizwaparvato vahnimAn ityAkArikEvAnumitiBavati iti (ga0 2 sAmAnyani0 pf0 4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0714" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिट्
liw — (tiN) [ka] dviruktaBinnaDAtvarTe svArTasyAnvayaboDane. yA na yogyA tAdfSI tiN liwpadenABiDIyate.. yaTA jaGAna jannaturityAdO liw. atra dviruktasyEva DAtorarTe svArTAnvayaM pratyayA boDayanti iti tatra lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. aSiSriyat adudruvat ityAdO dviruktasyeva apAkzIt ityAdO dviruktAnyasyApi DAtorarTe svArTAnvayaM luNAdayo boDayanti. ato na luNAdAvatiprasaNgaH. pipakzati pApacyate ityAdO ca sanAdayastAdfSA dviruktasyEva DAtorarTe svArTAnvayaboDakA api na tiNaH iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH. atra prakftyarTe vartamAnatvAdyanAkANkzatvaM iti viSezaRaM deyam. tena pace pacAvahe pacAvaH ityAdO na laqAdyatiprasaNgaH. [Ka] dviruktasya yajerarTe cakAsterAm yutasya vA. yA svArTasyAnvaye hetuH sA vA liw kaTyate buDEH. juhotItyAdO dviruktasya DAtorarTe svArTaboDakopi laqAdiH na yajerarTe iti na tatra laqAdAvatiprasaNgaH. yaTA kASAMcakre lolUyAmAsa ISSAMbaBUvetyAdO manaSca cAla suraBiBAga AjagAma ityAdO ca liw. atra atItaH kAla iva DAtvarTanizWaM parokzatvamapi liworTaH. tacca parokzatvam atIndriyattram. tena atItakAlavfttyatIndriyacalanavanmanaH ityAkArakastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 105 wI0 pf0 162). atra cEtraScAru papAca vyAtene kiraRAvalImudayanaH ityAdO liwi lakzaRasamanvayaScintyaH. cintAvIjaM tu kaliNge dfzwosi nAhaM kaliNgAn jagAma ityatreva pUrvoktasTalayorapi liwsADutvopapAdakaM sUtrAntarameva iti (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 139).<BR>;p{0716}<BR>atItatvamanadyatanatvaM parokzatvaM ca liqarTaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). yaTA jugopa gorUpaDarAmivorvIm (raGu0 2. 3) ityAdO liqarTaH. atra sUtram parokze liw (pA0 sU0 3. 2. 115) iti. tadarTastu anadyatane BUte parokzerTe liw Bavati iti. tena adyatane BUte anadyatane kI Bavizyati BUtepyaparokze ca na liwprayogaH syAt. atra parokzatvaM ca sAkzAtkaromi ityetatpratIti sAkzikalOkikavizayatvABAvavattvam. tena upanItakriyAyAM yaTASrutapratyakzAvizayatvarUpasya parokzatvasyABAvepi na papAca ityAdiprayogAnupapattiH (vE0 sA0 da0 la0 pf0 124). atra parokzatvAtItattrayorliMqarTayoranvayastu luNarTavadutpattO jYeyaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0715" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिः
lipiH — SabdasmArakaH SabdAnumApako vA reKAviSezaH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 66). yaTA ka iti reKA prajApati iti Sabdasya smArikA. kecittu lipi pramARAntaraM manyante. lipiBedAstu tattaddeSaBedena devanagarI granTAkzaralipyAdayo bahavaH. atra sidDAntavidastu lipistu SabdakI smArakatayA SabdAnumApakatayA vA pramAyAmupayoginI na tu pramARAntaram ityAhuH. anumAnaM ca ayaM puruzaH GawamAnaya iti SabdavizayakABiprAyavAn GawamAnaya iti SabdavyaYjakalipikartftvAt yaTA aham iti. asmAdanumAnAt GawamAnaya iti SabdasyAnumitirBavati. tatorTapratyayaH iti jYeyam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 66).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0716" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुङ्
luN — (tiN) kftavaDAdeSasya hanterarTe aTa vA sijantasya DAtorarTe yA atItatvasya voDikA tAdfSI tiN luNSabdenocyate. yaTA avaDIt avaDizwAm avaDizurityAdO apAkzIdityAdO ca luN (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 103 pf0 161). yaTA vA GawoBUdityAdO (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 147). jaGAna hanti sma ityAdO liqlaqAdiko hanterarTe atItatvasya boDakopi na kftavaDAdeSasya na vA sijantasya iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH. vaDyAt vaDyAstAm vaDyAsuH ityAdO kftavaDAdeSasya tasyArTe svArTAnuBAvikApi ASIH nAtItatvasya boDikA iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH.<BR>;p{0717}<BR>atra anumatatvahyastanatvAdyanAkANkzitatvam iti viSezaRaM deyam. tena pacyatAm apacat apacatAm ityAdO loqAdO nAtiprasaNgaH. atra atItaH kAla iva tannizwamadyatanatvamapi luNorTaH. tena vartamAnaDvaMsapratiyogyadyatanapAkakftimAn ityevaM voDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 103 wI0 0 pf0 161) (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 138). kiMca utpattiH BUtatvaM ca luNarTaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). aTa vA atItatvaM luNarTaH. tasyASrayatAsaMbanDenAKyAtArTakftyAdAvanvayaH. vastutaH vartamAnaDvaMsa eva luNarTaH. tasya pratiyogitAsaMbanDena kftyAdAvanvayaH (ga0 vyu0 lakA0 pf0 138). atra sUtram luN (pA0 sU0 3. 2. 110) iti. tadarTastu BUtasAmAnye luN iti (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 146) (kASikA 0). atra BUtatvaM cAtItatvam. taccotpattAvanveti. taTA ca vidyamAnaDvaMsapratiyogyutpattikatvaM labDam (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). vEyAkaraRAstu atra vidyamAnaDvaMsapratiyogitvaM BUtatvam. tacca GawoBUt ityatra kriyAyAM nirbADam iti vidyamAnepi Gawe GawoBUt iti prayogaH. vidyamAnaDvaMsapratiyogI GawABinnASrayaka utpattyAdyanukUlo vyApAraH iti voDaH ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 147).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0716" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
luw — (tiN) DAtvarTe Svastanatvasya BAvitvasya ca boDikA tiN luqucyate. yaTA BavitA BavitArO BavitAraH ityAdI paktA paktArO paktAraH ityAdO ca (tarkA 0 4). xqAdayastu DAtvarTe BAvitvameva voDayanti na Svastanatvamapi iti tatra nAtiprasaNgaH. SvaH pakzyati ityAdO DAtvarTe Svastanatvasya boDakamapi SvaH iti padaM na tiNa iti na SvaH iti padetiprasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 105 pf0 162). atra luqarTonadyatanaBavizyattvam. tacca SabdaprayogADikaraRadivasAvfttitve sati SabdaprayogakAlInaprAgaBAvapratiyogitvam. SabdaprayogADikaraRadivasaDvaMsotpattikatvaM vA. kecittu Bavizyattvameva luqarTaH ityAhuH (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 136). taRqulaM cetpacedodanamapi BuYjItetyAdO tu kriyAtipatanasya vartamAnatvameva liNA pratyAyyate na tvatItatvam iti tadvyudAsa;<BR>;p{0718}<BR>(Sa0 pra0 Slo0 106 pf0 164). atra sUtram anadyatane luw (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 15) iti. tadarTastu anadyatane BAvini luw (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 127) iti. atra anadyatana iti bahuvrIhi. te na vyAmiSre na Bavati adya Svo vA Bavizyati iti (kASikA 0). xN - (tiN) yA tiN kriyAyAH (DAtvarTasya) atipAte (vigame) atItakAlAvacCedyatvasya voDikA tAdfSI tiN xNacyate. yaTA eDaScet prApsyat odanamapyapakzyat ityAdO luN. atra syatipraBftayaScatrA - deratItakAlAvacCedyaminDana prAptyaBAvavattvamanuBAvayanti. taTA ca atItakAla iva kriyApratiyogiko BAvopi luNorTaH. vastutaH atItakAlAvacCedenenDanaprApyaBAvaprayukta odanapAkAdyaBAva evoktasTale laNA cEtrAdAvanuBAvyaH. kriyAviraha prayuktasya kriyAntaravirahasyEva kriyAtipAtaSabdArTatvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 106 wI0 pf0 164). luNarTastu vyApyakriyayA vyApakakriyAyA ApAdanam (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). yaTA BUtale GawaSvedaBavizyadBUtalamivAdrakzyat ityAdO luNarTaH. atrodAharaRAntaraM yaTA paraspareRa spfhaRIyaSoBaM na cedidaM dvandvamayojayizyat. asmindvaye rUpaviDAnayatnaH patyuH prajAnAM vitaToBavizyat.. (raGu0 sa0 7 lo0 14) iti. SAbdikamate kriyAyA anizpattO gamyamAnAyAM BUte BAvini vA hetuhetumadBAve sati<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0717" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लृङ्
lfN — atra jagadISa Aha kvacit BUtatvam kacittu BavizyattvaM luNarTaH iti (tarkA 0 4 pf011) (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32). atra sUtram linimitte lfN kriyAtipattO (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 139) iti. tadarTastu liNo nimittaM hetuhetumadBAvAdi (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 148). BavizyatItyanuvartate. hetuhetumatorliNa ityevamAdikaM liNo nimittam. tatra liNganimitte Bavizyati kAle lfN pratyayo Bavati kriyAtipattO satyAm (kASikA0) iti. tatra BAvini hetuhetumadBAve lfN yaTA suvfzwiSvedaBavizyat tadA suBikzamaBavizyat vahniScetprAjvalizyat odanamapakzyat ityAdO ityAhuH.<BR>;p{0719}<BR>atra vahnayaBinnASrayakaprajvalanAnukUlavyApArABAvaprayojya odanABinnA - SrayakaviklittyanukUlavyApArABAvaH iti vEyAkaraRamate SAbdaboDaH (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 148). vahnayaBinnASrayakaBAviprajvalanajanyOdanASrayakaviklittyanukUlavyApAraH iti SAbdaboDastUcitaH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 148).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0718" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लृट्
lfw — (tiN) yA tiN kriyAyAH (DAtvarTasya) atipAte (vigame) BAvikAlAvacCedyatvasya boDikA tAdfSI tiN xqucyate. yaTA taRqulaM cetprApsyatyodanamapi pakzyati cEtra ityAdO xw. atra syatiScEtrAderBAvikAlAvacCedena taRqulaprAtyaBAvavattvamanuBAvayati. taTA ca BAvikAla iva kriyApratiyogiko BAvopi laqarTaH. vastutaH BAvikAlAvacCedena. taRqulaprAtyaBAvaprayukta odanapAkAdyaBAva evoktasTale lawA cEtrAdAvanuBAvyaH. kriyAvirahaprayuktasya kriyAntaravirahasyEva kriyAnipAtaSabdArTatvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 106 wI0 pf0 163). BavizyattvaM xqarTaH. yaTA pakzyatItyAdO (ga0 vyu0 la0). yaTA vA Gawo BavizyatItyAdO. atra sUtram xw Seze ca (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 13) iti. tadarTastu Seze SudDe Bavizyati kAle cakArAt kriyAyAM copapade kriyArTAyAM DAtorlaw pratyayo Bavati (kASikA0) iti. atra BavizyattvaM ca vidyamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogyutpattikatvam. tena AgamizyatItyAdO vidyamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogyutpattikAgamanAnukUlakftimAn ityarTaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). vEyAkaraRASca BavizyattvaM vartamAnaprAgaBAvapratiyogisamayotpattimattvam ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 128).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0719" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

