लैङ्गिकम्
lENgikam — 1 liNgadarSanAjjAyamAnaM jYAnam (anumitiH) (praSasta0 gu0 pf0 26). yaTA parvate DUmena vahnisADane vahnivyApyaDUmavAn parvataH iti liNgadarSanAt parvato vahnimAn ityanumitiH. atrodAhriyate pakzI - kftya girISaM sidDyA rahitASca mAnahInASca. icCantyaDigantumime DanaMjayaM liNgadarSanenEva.. (viSvaguRAdarSa) iti. arTAntare DanaM jayaM ca. 2 [ka] liNgAdinA anumitaM sADyam. yaTA AcAryamate liNgopahitalENgikaBAnam ityAdI lENgikaM sADyam. [Ka] liNgAdiBiH kalpitam. yaTA mImAMsakamate arTaprakASana sAmarTyarUpaliNgena mantrAdInAM tattatkarmAdO viniyogaH kalpyata iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0720" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

