लोट्
low — (tiN) svavakranumatatvasya DAtvarTenvayayoDane. anukUlA yAdfSI tiN sEva low pariBAzyate. loqarTAstvanumatatvAdayo bahavaH santi. 1 anumatatvam. yaTA karotu kurutAm kurvantu ityAdO loworTaH. atra tuptAmpraBftayaScEtrAyuktatvaDI sahakftAH kftyAdO prakftyarTe cEtrAdyanumatatvaM boDayanti na tu tibAdyAH iti lakzaRasamanvayaH ticAdo nAtiprasaNgaSca (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 99 wI0 pf0 145) iti. atra sUtram low ca (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 162) iti. tadarTastu lowpratyayo Bavati DAtorviDyAdizvarTezu (kASikA 0) iti. 2 anujYA yaTA patnI pacatu ityAdO loworTaH. anujYA ca karturizwatve sati vakranumatatvam. cEtratraktfkatAdfSavAkyAt cEtrAnumatasvezwasya pAkasya kartrI patnI ityevaM boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 99 wI0 pf0 145). 3 AjYA. yaTA SUlaM viSa vizaM BuNga ityAdirAjavAkyasTalIyaloqarTaH. AjYA ca vakranumatatve sati karturanizwahetutvam. atra rAjAnumatasvAnizwahetuSUlapraveSakartftAvAMstvam ityAkAro boDaH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 99 wI0 pf0 145). 4 samarTanA. yaTA parvatamapyutpAwayAni samudramapi<BR>;p{0721}<BR>SozayARi ityAdO loqarTaH. samarTanA ca parASakyaDarmikasvaSakyatvADyavasAyaH. atra svetarASakyaM yat parvatotpAwanam tadDarmikasvaSakyatvADyavasAyavAn ityanvayaboDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 99 wI0 pf0 145). 5 viDiH. yaTA pawamAnaya ityAdO loqarTaH (Sa0 pa0 Slo0 99100 wI0 pf0 145148). viDiScAtra vakricCAvizayatvam. atra pawakarmakamadicCAvizayAnayanAnukUlakftimAMstvam ityanvayaH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11) (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32). yaTA vA kawaM tAvadBavAn karotu grAmaM BavAnAgacCatu ityAdO (kASikA0). 6 nimantraRam. yaTA amutra BavAnAstAm amutra BavAn BuNkAm ityAdO. 7 AmantraRam. yaTA iha BavAn BuNkAm ityAdO. 8 aDIzwaH. yaTA aDIcCAmo BavantaM mARavakaM BavAnaDyApayatu ityAdO. 9 saMpraSnaH. yaTA kiM na Kalu Bo vyAkaraRamaDyayE ityAdO (kASikA 0 3. 3. 162). 10 prArTanA. yaTA BikzAM dehi tvamarTiByaH ityAdO loqarTaH (Sa0 pra0) (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 139). yaTA vA Bavati me prArTanA vyAkaraRamaDyayE CandoDyayE ityAdO (kASikA0). 11 ASaMsanam. yaTA ciraM jIvatu BavAnityAdO loqarTaH. yaTA vA Bavatu te SivaprasAdaH ityAdO loqarTaH. ASaMsanaM ca vakrASaMsanam. aTa vA aprAptasyezwasyArTasya prAptumicCA. atrArTe sUtram ASizi liNlowO (pA0 sU0 3. 3. 173) iti. tadarTastu ASIrviSizwerTe vartamAnAdDAtorliNlowO prayayO BavataH (kASikA0) iti. atrADikaM tu ASIH iti SabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. cEtroktAta jIvatu BavAn iti vAkyAt cEtrASaMsAvizayavartamAnajIvanavAMstvam ityevaM boDaH. Gawo nIlo Bavatu BavAn suKI Bavatu ityAdO tu DAtunEva lakzaRayopasTApitAyAM nIlAdyutpattO tiNASaMsanIyatvaM pratIyate. evaM ca ASaMsA vizayavartamAnanIlotpattimAMnnIlo GawaH ityAdikastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 99 wI0 pf0 146).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0720" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

