vaDaH — prARaviyogaPalakavyApAraH. yaTA nAtatAyivaGe dozonyatra gobrAhmaRAt snAtaH prAyaScittaM kuryAt (vIramitro0 sumantusmftiH pf0 2228) ityAdO. vaDanizpAdakatvaM ca sAkzAtparaMparayA vA boDyam. vaDanizpAdakaH paYcaviDaH kartA prayojakaH anumantA anugrAhakaH nimittI ceti. yaTAhApastambaH prayojayitA mantA karteti svarganarakaPalezu karmasu BAginaH. yo BUya AraBate tasminPalaviSezaH (Apasta0 DarmasU0 2. 11. 29. 1-2) iti. ipukArastu na vaDanizpAdakaH. anyatra<BR>;p{0724}<BR>coktam. vahUnAmekakAryARAM sarvezAM SastraDAriRAm. yadyeko GAtakastatra sarve te GAtakAH smftAH. iti. anyacca anumantA viSasitA nihantA krayavikrayI. saMskartA copahartA ca KAdakaSceti GAtakAH.. (manu0 a0 5 0 51) iti. vaDavizaye aDikaprapaYcastu hiMsASabdavyAKyAnAvasare pradarSayizyata iti tatra drazwavyaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0723" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

