वर्णः
varRaH — 1 (guRaH) SuklAdirUpam. yaTA varRaH Suklo rasasparSI jale maDuraSItalO (BA0 pa0 lo0 40) ityAdO. 2 brAhmaRAdijAtiH. yaTA cAturvarRyaM mayA sfzwam (gItA0 a0 4 Slo0 13) ityAdO brAhmaRakzatriyavESyaSUdraBedena caturviDA iti pOrARikA AhuH. atra SrutiH brAhmaRosya muKamAsIdvAhU rAjanyaH kftaH. UrU tadasya yadvESyaH padByAM SUdro ajAyata iti (yajuH31. 11). tezAM pUrvaH pUrvo janmataH SreyAn (Apastamba DarmasU0 1. 1. 1. 4). brAhmaRasya SrezWaye kAraRamuktaM manunA yaTA UrDvaM nABermeDyataraH puruzaH parikIrtitaH. tasmAnmeDyatamaM tvasya muKamuktaM svayaMBuvA.. uttamANgodBavAjyEzWayAdbrahmaRaScEva DAraRAt. sarvasyEvAsya sargasya Darmato brAhmaRaH praBuH.. (manu0 a0 1 Slo0 9293) (10. 3) iti. varRaDarmaSca nityaM madyaM brAhmaRo varjayet ityAdiH (mitA0 1. 1 pf0 1). brAhmaRAdivarRAnAM karmARi tu SamadamatapojYAnAdi brAhmaRasya SOrya prajApAlanajYAnAdi kzatriyasya kfzigorakzavARijyaM vESyasya paricaryA SUdrasya (gItA0 a0 18<BR>;p{0725}<BR>lo0 0 4244) iti. gOtamenApyuktam brAhmaRasyADikaM labDam kzatriyasya vijitam nirvizwaM vESyaSUdrayoH (mitA0 2 pf0 61) (manu0 1. 8891) iti. 3 vEyAkaraRAstu akArAdyakzaram ityAhuH. etezAM varRAnAmutpattikramaH SikzAyAM kaTitaH pARininA AtmA budDyA sametyArTAn mano yuNkte vivakzayA. manaH kAyAgnimAhanti sa prerayati mArutam.. sodIrRo mUryaBihato vakramApadya mArutaH. varRAYjanayate tezAM viBAgaH paYcaDA mataH.. svarataH kAlataH sTAnAtprayatnAnupradAnataH iti. taTA prARApAnAntare devI vAgvE nityaM hi tizWati. sTAnezu vikfte vAyO kftavarRaparigrahA. vEKarI vAk prayoktfRAM prARavfttinibanDinI. kevalaM budDyupAdAnA kramarUpAnupAtinI.. prARavfttimanukramya maDyamA vAkpravartate. aviBAgA tu paSyantI sarvataH saMhftakramA.. svarUpajyotirevAtaH parA vAganapAyinI (mahABAra0) (vAca0) iti. varRASca mataBedena tripazwicatuHzazwiya SikzAyAmaBihitA veditavyAH. gAyakAstu 4 gItakramaH 5 tAlaviSezaSca ityAhuH. kAvyajYAstu 6 kuNkumam 7 svarRam 8 yaSaH 9 guRaH 10 stutiSca ityAhuH. 11 kArtAntikASca vivAhaprayojakanakzatraviSezakftaM varRakUwam ityAhuH (vAca0)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0724" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्यसमः
varRyasamaH — (jAtiH) [ka] sTApanIyo varRyo viparyayAdavarRyastAvetO sADyadfzwAntaDarmO viparyasyato varRyavarRyasamO BavataH (vAtsyA0 5. 1. 4). atra varRyatvaM varRanIyatvam. tacca saMdigDasADyakatvAdi. ayaM varRyasamastu asADAraRadeSanABAsaH sADanavikaladfzwAntadeSanABAso vA iti jYeyam (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 4). [Ka] dfzwAnte varRyatvasyApAdanam. atrAyaM BAvaH. sADyadfzwAntayorDarmavikalpAt iti. sADyaH sADyasidDyaBAvavAn saMdigDasADyakAdirvA. tasya DarmaH saMdigDasADyakAdivfttirhetuH. tasya vikalpAtsattvAddfzwAnte varRyatvasya saMdigDasADyakatvasyApAdanam varRyasamA. tadayamarTaH. pakzavfttiheturhi gamakaH. pakzaSca saMdigDasADyakaH. taTA ca saMdigDasADyakavfttirhetustvayA dfzwAntepi svIkAryaH. taTA ca dfzwAntasyApi<BR>;p{0726}<BR>saMdigDasADyakatvAtsapakzavfttitvAniScayAdasADAraRo hetuH. hetuH saMdigDasADyakavfttiryadi na dfzwAnte tadA gamaka hetvaBAvAtsADanavikalo dfzwAntaH syAt (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 4) iti. sapakzavartino hetoryAMdfgrUpaM vivakzitam. pakzopi tAdfgvetuH syAdanyaTAsidDihetutA.. sapakzatvAttadA sADya iti varRyasamA kzatiH (tA0 202 Slo0 106107) iti. [ga] varRyasya sTApanIyasya dfzwAntaDarmasya pakze sADanam. yaTA AtmA sakriyaH kriyAhetu guRavattvAllozwavadityAdO kriyAjanakanodanAKyasaMyogavattvAllozwAderBavatu kriyAvattvam. Atmanastu kriyAvattve tajjanakanodanAKyasaMyogavattvamapi syAditi (nIla0 pf0 43).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0725" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमानः
vartamAnaH — 1 (kAlaH) [ka] yena hi vastunA yaH kAlovacCidyate sa tasya vartamAnaH (vE0 u0 22228). yaTA idAnIM Gawosti ityAdO GawAvacCedakaH DAtvarTasattAvacCedako vA idaM SabdavAcyaH kAlo vartamAnaH. atra tadvyaktiDvaMsaprAgaBAvAnavacCinnaH kAlastadvyaktervartamAnakAlaH iti jYeyam (ta0 kO0 kAlani0 pf0 3). vartamAnatvaM ca sTitiH. tacca prAksaMbanDasvaBAvarahitasvarUpatvam svakArya prAgaBAvasaMbadDaM vA. [Ka] prAYcastu vartamAnaDvaMsaprAgaBAvApratiyogyavacCinnaH kAla ityAhuH. kAlasya saMbanDamAtratvamate avacCinna iti viSezaRaM na deyam (pa0 mA0 kAlani0 pf0 92) iti. DvaMse vartamAnatvaM tu tattacCabdaprayogADikaraRakAlavfttitvameva iti nirvAcyam. ato nAtmASrayaH. iti boDyam (nIla0 1 kAlani0 pf0 10). [ga] navyAstu tattacCabdaprayogADikaraRakAlaH. yaTA pacatItyatra laqarTaH ityAhuH (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 134) (vAkya0 kAla0 ni0) (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 120). laqarTavartamAnakAlaScaturviDaH pravfttoparataScEva vfttAvirata eva ca. nityapravfttaH sAmIpyo vartamAnaScaturviDaH.. iti. tatrAdyaH vfttoparataH yaTA mAMsaM na KAdatItyAdO. atra AdO pravfttaM mAMsaBojanaM nivartayati ityarTaH (vAca0). dvitIyo vfttAvirataH yaTA iha kumArAH krIqantItyAdO. atra tadAnIMtanakrIqanABAvepi pUrvakrIqAnAM<BR>;p{0727}<BR>budDO vartamAnatvAt taTA prayogaH iti BAvaH. tftIyo nityapravfttaH yaTA parvatAstizWantItyAdO. atra parvatAnAM sTitirnityapravfttA iti taTA prayogaH. evam parvatAnAM sTitatvena vartamAnatvepi BUtaBavizyatkAlAByAM saMbanDavivakzayA parvatAstasTuH sTAsyanti ityapi prayogaH syAt ityavaDeyam (vAca0). sAmIpyarUpaH caturTo dviviDaH BUtasAmIpyaH BavizyatsAmIpyaSceti. tatrAdyo BUtasAmIpyaH yaTA epohamAgacCAmItyAdO. atra kadA Agatosi iti praSne Agatopi aDvasvedAdervartamAnatvAt ezohamAgacCAmi iti vadati iti jYeyam. dvitIyo BavizyatsAmIpyaH yaTA ezohaM gacCAmItyAdO. atra kadA gamizyasi iti praSne gamane kriyamARodyamopi ezohaM gacCAmi iti vadati iti vijYeyam (durgAdAsaH) (vAca0). jagadISopyAha. laqarTavartamAnasAmIpyamapi dviviDam vartamAnakzaRottarakAlAvacCedyatvam vartamAnakzaRAvyavahitaprAkAlAvacCedyatvaM ceti. tena cEtraH kadA gamizyati iti jijYAsAyAM eza gacCati ityuttarasya vartamAnakzaRottarakAlAvacCedyagatimAMScEtraH ityarTaH. cEtraH kadA samAgataH iti jijYAsAyAM epa AgacCati ityuttarasya tu vartamAnakzaRAvyavahitaprAkkAlA vacCedyAgamanavAn ityarTaH iti na praSnottaraBAvAsaNgatiH iti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 97 wI0 pf0 143). atra prAco vEyAkaraRA AhuH. vartamAnatvaM ca prArabDAparisamAptatvam BUtaBavizyadBinnatvaM vA. yaTA pacatItyAdO aDiSrayaRAdyaDaHSrayaRAnte maDye pUrvAparIBUtakriyAsamudAye vartamAnatvamasti iti Bavati lawprayogaH (vE0 sA0 la0 pf0 120) (la0 ma0) iti. 2 SabdaprayogADikaraRakAlavfttiH. yaTA vartamAnaDvaMsapratiyogitvamatItatvam ityAdO (nIla0 1 kAlani0 pf0 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0726" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

