वह्निः
vahniH — 1 (tejaH) agniH. yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO sADyaBUto vahniH. ayaM vahnistu BOtikaH pArTivamAtrenDanaM BOmaM tejaH iti vijYeyam. atredaM jYeyam. vahnitvena DUmatvena ca sarvezAM vahniDUmAnAM sADyasADanaBAvaH. na tu tattadBUmatattadvahnayA divyaktInAm iti. sAmAnyapratyAsatyA tu sakalavahniDUmAnAM jYeyatA ceti. agniBedAdikamuktaM yaTA jfmBako dIpakaScEva viBramaBramaSoBanAH. AvasaTyAhavanIyO dakziRAgnistaTEva ca.. anvAhAryo gArhapatya ityete daSa vahnayaH iti. anyacca BrAjako raYjakacEva kledakaH snehakastaTA. DArako banDakaScEva drAvakAKyaSca saptamaH.. vyApakaH pAvakaScEva Slezmako daSamaH smftaH iti. SrOte karmaRi muKyAgnayo yaTA gArhapatyo dakziRAgnistaTEvAhavanIyakaH. ete<BR>;p{0729}<BR>mayaKayo muKyAH SezAScopasadAstrayaH.. (vahnipu0) iti. SarIrasTavahnernAmAni yaTA vahnayo dozaduzyezu saMlInA daSa dehinaH iti. dozadUzyASca yaTA vAtapittakaPA dozA dUzyAH syuH sapta DAtavaH (SA0 ti0) iti. 2 tAtrikAstu rakAraH. yaTA vargAdyaM vahnisaMsTam SyAmAstotram) ityAdI ityAhuH. 3 BallAtakaH. 4 nimbUkaca iti Bizaja AhuH (rAjani0). 5 vahnidevatAkaM kfttikAnakzatram iti jyotizajYA AhuH. 6 ADidEvikaH SARqilyagotro mezavAhano hutASanaH iti karmavAdimImAMsakA AhuH. 7 vESvAnarAdyaparanAmA paramAtmA iti vedAntina AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0728" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
vA — (avyayam) 1 vikalpaH. yaTA yatrErvA vrIhiBirvA yajeta ityAdO. 2 sAdfSyam. yaTA sinDO vADomaRqalaM gorvA rasaH ityAdO. yaTA vA maRI vozwrasya lambete priyO vatsatarO mama (si0 kO0) ityAdO. yaTA vA ASIvizo vA saMkrudDaH ityAdO. 3 avaDAraRam. yaTA sA vA SaMBostadIyA vA mUrtirjalamayI mama ityAdO. na tftIyA ityarTaH. 4 samuccayaH. yaTA vAyurvA dahano vA (gaRaratna0) ityAdO. 5 vitarkaH. yaTA jvaritena BavatA pItaM vA dugDam kftaM vA apaTyaM Bavet ityAdO. 6 praSnaH. yaTA tatra BavatA gamyate vA ityAdO. 7 kvacit vAkyAlaMkArArTaH. 8 cet ityarTaH. yaTA suptiNantacayo vAkyaM kriyA vA kArakAnvitA (amaraH) ityAdO iti nAgeSaBawwa Aha SabdenduSeKare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0729" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाक्छलम्
vAkCalam — (Calam) [ka] aviSezABihiterTe vakturaBiprAyAdarTAntarakalpanA vAkCalam (gO0 1. 2. 12). navakambaloyaM mARavaka iti prayogaH. atra navaH kambalosya iti vakturaBiprAyaH vigrahe tu viSezo na samAse. tatrAyaM CalavAdI vakturaBiprAyAdavivakzitamanyamarTam nava kambalA asyeti tAvadaBihitaM BavatA iti kalpayati. kalpayitvA cAsaMBavena pratizeDati ekosya kambalaH kuto nava kambalAH iti. tadidaM sAmAnyaSabde vAci cCalaM vAkCalamiti (vAtsyA0 1. 2. 12). yatra 92<BR>;p{0730}<BR>SakyArTadvaye saMBavati ekArTanirRayEkaviSezABAvAdanaBipretaSakyArTakalpanenaH dUzaRABiDAnam tadvAkCalam (gO0 vf0 112. 12) iti. [Ka] SattayEkArTaSAbdaboDatAtparya kaSabdasya SaktyA arTAntaratAtparyakatvakalpanayA dUzaRABiDAnam. atrocyate aBiDAtrEparItyena kalpitArTasya bADanam (tA0 ra0 1 0 95) iti. yaTA nepAlAdAgatoyaM navakambalavattvAdityukte kutosya navasaMKyAkAH kambalAH iti. evam gOrvizARItyukte kuno gajasya SfNgam Sveto DAvati iti SvetarUpavadaBiprAyeRokte Sveto (SvA itaH) na DAvati ityaBiDAnam ityAdikamUhyam (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 12).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0729" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

