वाक्यम्
vAkyam — [ka] padasamUhaH. vAkyatvaM ca viSizwArTaparaSabdatvam (ci04). vAkyaM dviviDam pramARavAkyam apramARavAkyaM ceti. tatra pramARavAkyam AkANkzA yogyatA saMniDimatAM padAnAM samUhaH. yaTA gAmAnaya ityAdi (ta0 BA0 4) (ta0 saM0) (sA0 da0). aTavA yAdfSaSabdAnAM yAdfSArTavizayitAkaboDaM prati anukUlA parasparAkANkzA tAdfSaSabdastoma eva taTAviDArTe vAkyam (Sa0 pra0 lo0 12 wI0 pf0 14). vEyAkaraRAstu ekatiN ityAhuH (mahABA0). ekatiNantArTamuKyaviSezyakaboDajanakapadasamUhaH ityarTaH. tena pacati Bavati paSya mfgo DAvati brUhi brUhi devadatta ityAdO ca kriyApadasyAnekatvepi nEkavAkyatA - vyAGAtaH iti. suptiNantacayo vAkyam ityamarasiMha Aha. kecittu svArTaboDasamAptaH padasamudAyaH ityAhuH. samaBivyAhAro vAkyam iti mImAMsakA AhuH. tadarTaSca sADyatvAdivAcakadvitIyAdyaBAvepi vastutaH SezaSezivAcakapadayoH sahoccAraRam. yaTA yasya parRamayI juhUrBavati na pApa Sloka SfRoti (tEtti0 saMhitA0 3. 5. 7) iti. liNAdipada-. GawitaM vAkyaM dviviDam viDiH nizeDaSca. tatra viDiH svargakAmo yajetaH ityAdi vAkyam. nizeDastu na kalaaM Bakzayet na surAM pivet ityAdi vAkyam (lO0 BA0). apramARavAkyaM tu AkANkzAdirahitaM vAkyam.<BR>;p{0731}<BR>yaTA vahninA siYcati hfdo vahnimAn ityAdi vAkyam. atra vAkyadopAScatvAraH BramaH pramAdaH vipralipsA karRApAwavaM ceti. tatra ekapadArTa aparapadArTasaMsargAropa BramaH. avAcye vAcyatvAropaH pramAdaH. anyaTA jYAtasyArTasyAnyaTA boDayitumicCA vipralipsA. SabdoccAraRAnukUlatAlvAdivyApAraSUnyatvaM karRApAwavam iti. AkANkzAyogyatAsattisattve BramAdidozARAmasaMBavaH iti ca boDyam (ma0pra0). nEyAyikamate vAkyaM triviDam subantasamUhaH tiNantasamUhaH suptiNantasamUhaSceti. tatrAdyaH trayaH kAlA iti. dvitIyaH pacati Bavati iti. tftIyastu cEtraH pacatItyAdi. trayaH kAlA ityatra vartamAnatvAsaMBavena santi ityetasya durjYAnatvena ca jYAyante ityetasya nADyAhArasaMBavaH. prakArAntareRa vAkyaM dviviDam vEdikaM lOkikaM ca. tatra vEdikamISvaroktatvAtsarvameva pramARam. lOkikaM tvAptoktaM pramARam. anyat (anAptoktam) apramARam (ta0 saM0). tatra vedaGawakaM vAkyaM vEdikam (vAkya 0 4 pf0 20). tasyeSvaroktatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca vedaH pOruzeyo vAkyatvAdBAratAdivat iti (ta0 dI0 4 pf0 32) (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32). atrADikaM tu vedaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam vEdikaM sarvameva pramARamityatra sarvamevetyasya abADyaM vAkyaM sarvamevetyarTaH. tena AtmA vE jAyate putraH iti vedasyAprAmARyepi na kzatiH. smftipurARetihAsasadAcArARAM vedamUlakatvena prAmARyam. tanmUlavedAnAmidAnImanupalaByatvena SAKAH kAciducCinnA eva iti kalpyate (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32) (ta0 dI 0 4 pf0 33). lOkikaM vAkyaM tu yadDarmabudDyA AptenoktaM tadeva pramARamityarTaH. tena bfhaspatipraRItanAstikasUtravyudAsaH (si0 ca0 4 pf0 32). prakArAntareRApi vAkyaM dviviDam mahAvAkyam avAntaravAkyaM (KaRqavAkyam) ceti. tatra mahAvAkyaM ca svaGawakAnekanAmalaByatAdfSArTaboDakaM vAkyam (Sa0 pra0 lo0 30 wI0 pf0 38).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0730" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाक्यार्थः
vAkyArTaH — [ka] ekapadArTavadaparapadArTaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 4 wI0 05). [Ka] dopasTitAnAM arTAnAm miTaH saMsargaH (ta0<BR>;p{0732}<BR>kO0 Ka0 4 pf0 16). atredamavaDeyam. vAkyArTarUpAnvayaviSizwe padAnAM SaktiH iti BAwwA AhuH. tanna sahante nEyAyikAH. taTA hi. ananyalaByaH SabdArTaH iti niyamenAnvayavizayakaSAbdaboDe tattadAnupUrvIjYAnatvena hetutayA tadbalAdevAnvayaBAnopapattAvanvayaviSizwe SaktikalpanaM vyarTameva. SakyasyEva SAbdavizayatvam iti niyamasvIkAre lakzaRocCedApattiH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 27) iti. [ga] vAkyaGawakapratyekapadopasTitAnAM padArTAnAmAkANkzAdijYAnavaSAtparasparAnvayiBAvApannorTaH. yaTA gAmAnaya ityatra gokarmatvAnayanakftInAM pratyekaM tattatpadopasTApitAnAmAkANkzAbalAtparasparamanvayI gonizWakarmatva nirUpakAnayanAnukUlakftimAn iti vAkyArTaH. [Da] SAbdikAstu padArTAnAM miTonvayarUpa uddeSyaviDeyaBAvasaMvanDa ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0731" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाक्यार्थज्ञानम्
