वाचकम्
vAcakam — 1 (padam) [ka] ISvarasaMketena (SaktyA) arTaboDakaM padam. yaTA gotvAdiviSizwaboDakaM gavAdipadam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 3). idaM muKyaM padam ityucyate. idaM ca prAcInamatABiprAyeRa. taTA hi. prAcInamate saMketo dviviDaH. SaktiH pariBAzA ca. tatreSvarasaMketa eva SaktiH ityucyate. tenEvArTaboDakaM padaM vAcakam ityucyate. pariBAzayA arTaboDakaM tu padaM pAriBAzikam ityucyate. navyamate tu icCAmAtrasya saMketarUpatvena SaktipariBAzayorEkyAt pariBAzayApyarTaboDakaM padaM vAcakam iti vyavahniyate iti viSezo jYeyaH. [Ka] SaktyArTaboDakaM padam. yaTA pravAhavAcakaM gaNgApadam. yaTA vA goGawAdivyaktyupasTApakaM goGawAdipadam (ta0 kO0 4 pf0 16). taduktam sAkzAtsaMketitaM yorTamaBiDatte sa vAcakaH (kAvyapra0 ullA0 2 0 7) iti. gORaM tu lAkzaRikaM padam (ta0 kO0 4 pf0 16). 2 kaTakaH.<BR>;p{0733}<BR>yaTA purARAdipAWako vAcako Bavati. atrocyate vAcakaH pUjito yena prasannAstasya devatAH (purA0) iti. anyacca brAhmaRaM vAcakaM vidyAnnAnyavarRajamAdarAt. SrutvAnyavarRajAdrAjan vAcakAnnarakaM vrajet.. (ti0 ta0) (vAca0) iti. vAcanikaH vAcikaH }—? 1 (namaskAraH) utkfzwatvAdibudDyA prayukto namaHpadAdiGawitaH SabdaH. yaTA vande govindamAnandajYAnadehaM patiM SriyaH (maRimaYja 0) iti. yaTA vA haraye nama ityAdO nottaramakAra viSezAdirvAcanikaH (mU0 ma0 saNga0 1 0 105). lakzaRaM ca vAcanikanamaskAratvam. tacca natvamatyAdivyApyA nAnA jAtayaH. navyAstu SAbdaboDavfttiSAbdatvavyApyajAtiviSezaH ityAhuH (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 105). 2 DarmajYAstu vacananizpAMditaM pApAdi ityAhuH. 3 vAkyAramBaH iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0732" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

