वाच्यः
vAcyaH — 1 [ka] vAcakaboDyorTaH. SaktyA boDyaH ityarTaH. sa eva muKyArTaH ityucyate. yaTA gavAdirgopadavAcyaH (ga0 Sa0 pf0 3). atrocyate na cAlpatvabahutvAByAM prayogARAM viSizyate. vAcyavAcakaBAvoyamakzapAdAdiSabdavat.. biBItakepyakzaSabdo yadyapyalpEH prayujyate. taTApi vAcakastasya jYAyate SakawANgavat.. (va0 ta0 BawwavA0) (vAca0) iti. [Ka] mImAMsakAstu yadyasmAcCandAnniyamataH pratIyate tattasya vAcyam. yaTA gAmAnaya ityasmintrAkye goSabdasya gotvaM vAcyam ityAhuH (lO0 BA0 pf0 6). 2 DarmajYAstu dUzyaH. yaTA parasparasparDiparArDyarUpAH pOrastriyo yatra viDAya veDAH. SrInirmitiprAptaGuRakzatEkavarRopamAvAcyamalaM mamArja.. (mAGa0 sa0 3 Slo0 58) ityAdI ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

