वादः
vAdaH — 1 (kaTA) [ka] pramARatarkasADanopAlamBaH sidDAntAvirudDaH paYcAvayavopapannaH pakzapratipakzaparigraho vAdaH (gO0 2. 2. 1). tadarTaSca pramARABAsattraprakArakajYAnavizayakaraRaka sADanopAlamBayogyAnyaH iti. tena jalpaviSeze nAtivyAptiH. nigrahasTAnaviSeza niyamArTaM sidDAntetyAdi viSezaRadvayam (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 1). ekADikaraRasTO virudDO DarmoM pakzapratipakzO pratyanIkaBAvAdastyAtmA nAsyAtmeti. nAnADikaraRO virudDO na pakzapratipakzO. yaTA nitya AtmA anityA budDiriti. parigrahoByupagamavyavasTA. soyaM pakzapratipakzaparigraho vAdaH. tasya viSezaRaM pramARatarkasADanopAlamBaH. pramAREstarkeRa ca sADanamupAlamBaSrAsminkriyata iti. sADanaM sTApanA. upAlamBaH pratizeDaH (vAtsyA0 1. 2. 1). sUtratAtparyaM tArkikarakzAyAmuktam tatra pramARatarkAByAM sADanAkzepasaMyutA. vItarAgakaTA vAdastatPalaM tattvanirRayaH.. (tA0 ra0 lo0 77) iti. vAdaSca azwanigrahARAmaDikaraRam. te ca nyUnADikApasidDAntAH hetvABAsapaYcakaM cetyazwO nigrahAH (ta BA0 pf0 44). [Ka] pramARABAsatva prakArakajYAnavizayakaraRakasADanopAlamBayogyAnyatve sati pakzapratipakzasADanoddeSyakoktipratyuktirUpavacanasaMdarBaH (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 1). [ga] nAnApravaktfkaH pratyaDikaraRasADanonyatarADikaraRanirRayAvasAno vAkyasamUhaH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1 pf0 8). [Da] tattvanirRayaPalaH kaTAviSezaH (sarva0 pf0 239 akza0). yaTA vAdaH pravadatAmaham (gItA0 10. 32) ityAdO. [Na] tattvabuButsoH kaTA (ta0 BA0 pf0 44). 2 svABimatArTakaTanam. ayaM vAdo dviviDaH satkAryavAdaH asatkAryavAdaSca. tatra satkAryavAdopi dviviDaH pariRAmavAdaH vivartavAdaSca. tatra pariRAmavAdaH sAMKyAnAm rAmAnujIyAnAM ca.<BR>;p{0735}<BR>tanmate kAraRameva kAryarUpeRa pariRamate iti kAryakAraRayorananyatvam satyatvaM ca. yaTA dugDaM sadeva daDirUpeRa pariRamate iti daDi kAryAntaraM dugDAdBinnaM ca na Bavati iti. vivartavAdo mAyAvAdivedAntinAm. tanmate kAraRameva kAryasvarUpeRa BAsate iti kAraRasyEva satyatvam na tu kAryasya satyatvam. yaTA SaMkaraBAratImate SuktO idaM rajatam iti jYAnAnantaramaDizWAnaBUtaSuktijYAne jAte bADajYAnena pUrvaM jYAtaM rajataM yaTA nivartate tadvat brahmajYAne jAte sati jagadAdiBedaprapaYco nivartate iti. asatkAryavAdastu AramBavAdaH ityucyate. sa ca nEyAyikAnAm mADvavedAntinAM ca. tanmate asadeva kAryamutpadyate. yaTA pUrvamasadeva tattadvawAdikAryaM daRqacakracIvarAdisAmagrIsamavahitAnmfdAdikAraRAdBinnaM sadutpadyate iti. atrAyaM BAvaH. svotpatteH pUrvaM tat kAryaM nAsIdeva. paScAtkAraRasAmagrIvaSAdutpadyate iti kAryakAraRayoranyatvam paramArTataH satyatvaM ca iti. evam vijYAnavAdo yogAcAravOdDAnAm SUnyavAdo mADyamikabOdDAnAm syAdvAda ArhatAnAm ityAdikaM ca tattacCAstrAjjYeyamityatrEva viramyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादनम्
vAdanam — aBiGAtAKyasaMyogAvacCinnakriyA. yaTA BerImfdaNgaM vAdayetyAdO RijantavadaDAtvarTaH (di0 4 pf0 183). vAdyaBedA ucyante. tAlena rAjate gItaM tAlo vAditrasaMBavaH. garIyastena vAditraM taccaturviDamucyate.. tataM suziramAnadDaM GanamitTaM caturviDam. tataM tatrIgataM vAdyaM vaMSAdyaM suziraM taTA.. carmAvanadDamAnadDaM GanaM tAlAdikaM matam iti. tatra alAvanIpraBfti tatam ityucyate. vaMSa pAri maDurI tittirI ityAdikaM suziram ityucyate. mardala muraja pawaha QakkA paRatra karawaka maWa BerI ityAdikam AnadDam ityucyate. GanaM tu anuraktaviraktaBedena dviviDam. karatAlakAMsyatAlaBedena dvAdaSaviDaM ceti. atrADikaM lakzaRaviBAgAdikaM tu saMgIta dAmodarAdO drazwavyam (vA0)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

