वायुः
vAyuH — 1 (dravyam) [ka] vAyutva sAmAnyavAn (ta0 kO0) (praSasta 0). vAyuSca paYcamahABUtAntargataH. [Ka] rUparahitaH sparSavAn. atra sUtram sparSavAn vAyuH (vE0 2. 1. 4) iti. tallakzaRaM ca sparSetaraviSezaguRAsamAnADikaraRaviSezaguRa samAnADikaraRajAtimattvam (vE0 u0 2. 1. 4). aTa vA rUpABAve sati sparSavattvam (vAkya0 14). samavAyena rUpavadavfttisparSavattvamityarTaH (la0va0). aTa vA pAkajasparSavadavfttyanuzRASItasparSavadvfttidravyatvasAkzAdvyApyajAtimattvam (di01 pf0 83). atra pfTivItvavAraRAyAvfttyantam. jalatvavAraRAya vfttyantam (rAma0 1 vAyuni0 pf0 83). aTa vA tvagindriyasamavetadravyatvasAkzAdvyApyajAtimattvam (sarva0 pf0 218 OlU0). tAdfSI jAtiSca vAyutvam. vAyorastitve pramARamAha yadyapi vAyuratIndriyastaTApi vilakzaRaSabdAtmakakAryAnyaTAnupapattyA sa svIkaraRIyaH iti (pra0 pra0). vAyorapratyakzatvavAdimate vAyusidDiryaTA grAhyajAtIyaviSezaguRatvena sparSavattvAddravyAntaraprasaktitvena vAyusidDiH (nyA0 lI0 pf0 9) iti. yoyaM vAyO vAti sati anuzRASItaH sparSaH pratIyate sa sparSaH kvacidASritaH guRatdrUpavat ityanumAnena kiMcidASritatve sADite yat kiMcitpadagrAhyaM tadeva vAyuH ityucyate (ta0 dI0) (si0 ca0 vAyuni0 pf0 8). sa cAyaM vAyurdviviDaH nityaH anityaSca. tatra nityaH paramARulakzaRaH. anityaH kAryalakzaRaH nAnA ca. tasya vAyoH apratyakza-.<BR>;p{0737}<BR>syApi nAnAtvaM saMmUrcCanenAnumIyate. atra sUtram vAyorvAyusaMmUrcCanaM nAnAtvaliNgam (cE0 2. 1. 14) iti. saMmUrCanaM punaH samAna javayorvAtrorvirudDadikkriyayoH saMnipAtaH. sopi saMnipAtaH sAvayavinorvAcorUrDvagamanenAnumIyate. tacca vAyavorUrDvagamanam pratyakzeRa tfRAdigamanena anumIyate (praSasta0 vAyuni0 pf0 5) (vE0 u0 2. 1. 14) iti. atra BAzyakArA AhuH. kAryalakzaRaH anityo vAyuH caturviDaH SarIram indriyam vizayaH prARaH iti. tatra (1) ayonijameva SarIraM marutAM loke. pArTivAvayavopazwamBA copaBogasamarTama. (2) indriyaM sarvaprARinAM sparSepalamBakaM pfTivyAdyanaBiBUtErvAyvavayavErArabDaM sarvaSarIravyApi tvak. (3) vizayastUpalaByamAnasparSADizWAnaBUtaH sparSaSabdaDftikampaliNgaH tiryaggamanasvaBAvakaH meGAdipreraRaDAraRAdisamarTaH. (4) prARontaH SarIre rasamalaDAtUnAM preraRAdihetuH ekaH san kriyABedAdiBirapAnAdisaMjYAM laBate (praSasta0 pf0 5) (pa0 mA0) iti. navyAstvaTaM vadanti. anityastriviDaH SarIram indriyam vizayaSca. tatra SarIram vAyuloke prasidDam. piSAcAdInAmapi vAyuSarIram ayonijaM ca (mu0 1 vAyuni0 pf0 84) (ta0 kO0). atredamavaDeyam. etacCarIrasya pArTivaBAgopazwamBAdupaBogakzamatvam. tena vAyostAlyAdivyApArABAvAt karacaraRAdyaBAvena cAharaRaviharaRAdyaBAvAt kaTaM tAdfSaSarIrasya BogAyatanatvam ityASaNkAnavakASaH (di0 1 pf0 84) (pa0 mA0) iti. indriyaM sparSagrAhakaM pfTivyAdyanaBiBUtErvAyvavayavErArabDaM tvak sarvaSarIravftti. vizayo vfkzAdikampanahetuH upalaByamAnasparSASrayo mahAvAyvAdiH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 45) (ta0 saM0). prARopi vizayo vAyuH. sontaHSarIre rasamalaDAtupittakaPAdInAM preraRaDAraRAdihetuH. sa cEkopi hfdAdisTAnarUpopADiBedAt muKanirgamAdikriyABedAcca paYca saMjYA laBate. tatra sTAnaBedAdyaTA prARopAno vyAna udAnaH samAnaH iti. taduktam hfdi prARo gudepAnaH samAno nABisaMsTitaH. udAnaH kaRWadeSasTo vyAnaH sarvaSarIragaH.. (amara 167 wI0) iti. taTA muKanAsikAByAM nizkramaRa praveSanAtprARaH. malAdInAmaDo nayanAdapAnaH. 93<BR>;p{0738}<BR>AhArezu pAkArTaM vahneH samunnayanAtsamAnaH. UrDvaM nayanAdudAnaH. nAqImuKezu vitananAvyAnaM: (paM0 mA0) (di0 1. 2 pf0 85) iti. kriyABedAccAnyA api paYca saMjYA yaTA nAgaH kUrmaH kfkalaH devadattaH DanaMjayaH iti (si0 ca0) (mu0 1 pf0 85). taduktam udgAre nAga AKyAtaH kUrma unmIlane smftaH. kfkaraH kzutkaro jYeyo devadatto vijfmBaRe. na jahAti mftaM cApi sarvavyApI DanaMjayaH iti. atra pustakAntare pozaRasya heturDanaMjayaH ityuktam (si0 ca0). kfkaraH ityatra ca kfkalaH ityapi pAWAntaram. vAyO natra guRAstizWanti sparSaH saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam saMskAraSceti (praSasta0) (BA0 pa0) (ta0 BA0). sparSastvatrApAkajonuzRASItasparSoBipretaH (mu0) (praSasta0 pf0 5). parimARaM paramamahattvAtiriktam. saMskArastu vegaH sTitisTApakopi iti kecidAhuH (ta0 kO0). vAyurna pratyakzaH kiM tu sparSAdinA anumeyaH iti prAca AhuH. tatra yuktiH. vAyuryadi pratyakzaH syAttadA GawAdivat tadIyasaMKyAdisAmAnyaguRopalamBopi tatra syAt. na cEvam. tasmAnna pratyakzaH iti (ta0 va0 1. 3. 45). vAyorapratyakzatvaM sUtrakArEruktam. taTA ca sUtram sparSaSca vAyoH (vE0 2. 1. 9) iti. tadarTaSca liNgam iti SezaH. cakArAcCabdaDftikampAH samuccIyante. taTA ca yoyaM sparSonuBUyate sa kacidASritaH sparSatvAt pfTivyAdisparSavat iti sAmAnyato dfzwena sparSASrayasidDO sparSASrayo na pfTivyAditrayAtmakaH nIrUpatvAt nAkASAdipaYcAtmakaH sparSavattvAt iti itarabADagrahasahakftena anumAnena azwadravyAtiriktadravyasidDiH. evam SabdaDftikampA api vAyO liNgAni jYeyAni (vE0 u0 2. 11910 pf0 8184) (ta0 dI0) (mu0 1). prAcAM mate ca vizayatAsaMbanDena bahirdravyapratyakzaM prati samavAyena mahattvaviSizwodBUtarUpamudBUtasparSaSca kAraRam iti kAryakAraRaBAvo jYeyaH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 8) (ta0 pra0). evaM ca kAraRABAvAnna pratyakzam iti boDyam (mu0 1 pf0 113). navyAstu vAyuH pratyakzaH ityaNgIcakuH (ta0 pra0). etanmate tu bahirdravyapratyakzaM<BR>;p{0739}<BR>prati mahattvaviSizwaviBuvyAvfttaviSezaguRaH mahattvaviSizwodBUtarUpodBUtasparSAnyataradvA kAraRam iti kAryakAraRaBAvo jYeyaH (si0 ca0 pf08). bahirdravyapratyakzaM prati AtmAvfttiSabda Binna viSezaguRavattvaM prayojakam iti vA kAryakAraRaBAvaH. tena vAyoH pratyakzatvamupapadyate. vAyuM spfSAmi ityanuBavAcca. atredamaDikaM jYeyam yaTA praBAgatamekatvaM gfhyate taTA vAyugatamekatvamapi gfhyata eva. kacit sajAtIyasaMvalanABAve dvitvaparimARAdIni gfhyante. tadbrahaSca BUyovayavAvacCedena tvagindriyasaMnikarzasTale boDyaH. kvacit saMKyAparimARAdyagrahaH sajAtIyasaMvalanAdirUpadozAt iti. sajAtIyasaMvalanadaSAyAm BUyovayavAvacCedena tvagindriyasaMnikarzABAve ca ityarTaH (di0 1 vAyuni0 pf0 114). PUtkArAdirUpe vAyO saMKyAdyupalaByata ityapyatra voDyam (vE0 u0 2. 1. 9 pf0 83) (ta0 va0 3. 46). mImAMsakA api vAyurbrAhyendriyapratyakza ityaNgIcakruH (pa0 mA0). tanmate mahadudBUtasparIvadravyameva tvaco yogyam na tu kevalamudBUtarUpavaddravya