वारणम्
vAraRam — [ka] kriyADarmika nivfttyanukUlavyApAraH. yaTA kUpAdanDaM vArayati vizAdvAlaM nivArayatItyAdO DAtvarTo vAraRam. kriyA ca patanaBojanAdirviSezato grAhyA. atra DAtvarTaGawakanivfttO paYcamyA kUpAdiprakArakatvam dvitIyayA cAnDAdinizWatvaM pratyAyyate. taTA ca anDanizWAyAH patanaDarBikakUpaprakArakanivftteH bAlanizWAyASca BojanaDarmikavizaprakArakanivftteH<BR>;p{0740}<BR>anukUlavyApAravAn ityAkArakastatra boDaH. atra taTAviDanivfttyanukUlavyApAraSca svArTaDIdvArA kUpe mA pata vizaM mA BuNKa ityAdyaBilAparUpaH sPuwa eva (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0 pf0 83). aTa vA aBAvAnukUlavyApAro DAtvarTaH. paYcamyA vfttitvamarTaH. tasyAnDenvayaH. dvitIyAyA anuyogitvaM pratiyogitvaM vArTaH. tasya ca DAtvarTatAvacCedakIBUtABAvenvayaH. aBAvaSca kUpAdisamaBivyAhArAt patanAdijanyADaH saMyogAdisaMbanDena. taTA ca kUpavfttyanDapratiyogikABAvAnukUlavyApAravizayaka yatnavAn iti vAkyArTaH. evam etasmAdvizAnnAdamuM mitraM vArayati ityAdAvapyUhyaH (kA0 vyA0 pf010). [Ka] kriyApratizeDaH. yaTA yaveByo gAM vArayati kUpAdanDaM vArayatItyAdO DAtvarTo vAraRam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 107). atra kriyA ca BakzaRagamanAdirUpA. tasyAH pratipeDastu kartftvABAvAnukUlavyApAraH. kartftvABAvarUpaDAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaSAlitayA gavAnDAdeH karmatA saMpadyate. atra vAraRArTAnAmIpsitaH (pA0 sU0 114. 27) ityanenApAdAnatvam. tadarTaSca vAraRaM kriyApratizeDaH. tadarTakaDAtuyoge tattatkriyAjanyaPalaBAgitayA tattatkriyAkarturaBipretaH apAdAnam iti. yadvA yavAdipadottarapaYcamyarTaH yavAdigatatvenecCAvizayaPalakatvam. tasya BakzaRAdAvanvayaH. icCA ca kriyAkartfnizwA. evaM ca yatrakUpAdinizWatvena gavAnDAdIcCAvizayo yo galADaH saMyogottara deSasaMyogAdiH gavAdinizWatattatPalakavyApAraviSezakartftvABAvAnukUlavyApArAnukUlakftimAn ityAkArako boDaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 5 pf0 107). maYjUzAyAM cEvamuktam. aBAvapratiyogivyApArajanyaPalASrayotrApAdAnam. vAraRArTInAm iti sUtrAt. vAraRArTaDAtvarTaPalASrayatvamatrepsitatvam. tena BakzaRasaMyogAdyASrayatvAdyavAdInAmapAdAnatvam. [ga] SAbdikASca pravfttiviGAto vAraRam. sa ca saMyogAdyanukUlavyApArABAvAnukUlo vyApAraH. yaTA yaveByo gAM vArayati agnermARavakaM vArayati kUpAdanDaM vArayati ityAdO BakzaRasaMyogAdijanakavyApArABAvAnukUlo vyApAro vArayatyarTaH ityAhuH (la0 ma0 suvarTa0 pf0 109). kacit AnayanaDarmika<BR>;p{0741}<BR>nivfttyanukUlavyApAro vAraRam. yaTA parasveByaH pARi nivArayatItyatra nivAraRam. atra DAtvarTaGawakanivfttO pARyAdevacCedakatvena parasvAdeSva prakAratvenAnvayaH. tAdfSavyApAraH karAkuYcanAdireva (Sa0 pra0 Slo068 pf0 83). kacicca saMyogABAvanizWasya prayojakavyApAraH. yaTA svANgAdvARaM vArayatItyAdO vArayatyarTo vAraRam. atra DAtvarTaGawake saMyoge dvitIyAntalaByasya bARapratiyogikatvasya saMyogABAvanizWe ca paYcamyantalaByasya svAmavfttitvasyAnvayaH. kAryABAva iva tannizWeDikaraRaviSezavfttitvepi pratibanDakasya prayojakatvAt. ata eva maRiH kAzWe dAhABAvasya prayojakaH na tu pATasi ityAdikaH sArvalOkikavyavahAraH iti. taTA ca vARasaMyogABAvanizWAyAH svANgavfttitAyAH prayojakavARApasaraRAdirUpavyApArAnukUlakftimAn ityAkArakastatra boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 68 wI0 pf0 8384).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0739" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

