vikalpasamaH — (jAtiH) [] sADanaDarmayukta dfzwAnte DarmAntaravikalpAtsADyaDarmavikalpaM prasajato vikalpasamaH. yaTA AtmA sakriyaH kriyAhetu guRavattvAllozwavat ityAdO. kriyAhetuguRayuktaM kiMcidguru. yaTA lozwaH. kiMcillaGu. yaTA vAyuH. evaM kriyAhetuguRayuktaM kiMcitkriyAvatsyAdyaTA lozwaH. kiMcidakriyaM yaTA AtmA. viSezo vA vAcya iti (vAtsyA0 5. 114). kriyAhetuguRaScAtra kriyAjanakavAyusaMyogAdireva (nIla0 pf0 43). viSezo vAcya ityasyAyamarTaH pUrvavikalpo Bavati ayaM tu na Bavati ityatra kiM niyAmakaM syAt (nIla0 pf0 43) iti. atra sUtraBAgaH sADyadfzwAntayorDarmavikalpAduBayasADyatvAcca vikalpasamaH (gO0 5. 1. 4) iti. tadarTastu pakze dfzwAnte ca yo Darmastasya vikalpo virudDaH kalpo vyaBicAritvam.<BR>;p{0744}<BR>upalakzaRaM cEtat anyavfttiDarmasyApi boDyam. vyaBicAropi hetoDarmAntaraM prati DarmAntarasya sADyaM prati DarmAntarasya DarmAntaraM prati vA (gO0 pf0 5. 1. 4). [Ka] kasyacidDarmasya kacivyaBicAradarSanena DarmatvAviSezAtprakftahetoH prakftasADyaM prati vyaBicArApAdanam. yaTA SabdaH anityaH kftakatvAdityatra kftakatvasya gurutvavyaBicAradarSanAt gurutvasyAnityatvavyaBicAradarSanAt nityatvasya mUrtatvavyaBicAradarSanAt DarmatvAviSezAtkftakatvamapyanityatvaM vyaBicarediti (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 4). taTA coktam DarmasyEkasya kenApi DarmeRa vyaBicArataH. hetoH sADyABicAroktO vikalpasamajAtitA. (tA0 ra0 pari0 2 Slo0 109) iti. [ga] dfzwAntavikalpaM pradarSya dAzwantikavikalpakaTanam (nIla0 pf0 43). atra SizwamudAharaRAdikaM tu BAzyatulyameva nIlakaRWyAM pratipAditam iti tannAtra saMgfhItam iti vijYeyam. anEkAntikadeSanABAsoyam (gO0 vf0 5. 114).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0743" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकारः
vikAraH — 1 [ka] svarUpasya vinASe avinASe vA dravyAntarAramBakatvam. yaTA dugDAderdaDyAramBakatvam bIjAdervfkzAdyAramBakatvaM ca. suvarRAderapi lohAGAtajanyAvayavasaMyoganASAdavayavino nASe satyeva kuRqalAramBaH. kapAlAdeSva svarUpAvinASena GawAdyAramBakatvam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 40). sAMKyESca paYcaviMSatitattvamaDye poqaSapadArTA vikAraSabdenoktAH. taduktam zoqaSakastu vikAra iti. asyArTaH poqaSasaMKyAvacCinno gaRaH zoqaSako vikAraH eveti (sarva0 saM0 pf0 318 sANKya0). [Ka] prakfteranyarUpaH pariRAmaH (vAca0). ayaM vikAraDarmo dravyasAmAnye. yadAtmakaM dravyaM mfdvA suvarRaM vA tasyAtmanonvaye pUrvo vyUho nivartate vyUhAntaraM copajAyate taM vikAramAcakzate (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 45). atrADikaM ca karmaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. [ga] anye tu svarUpaparityAgena rUpAntarApattiH (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 52) ityAhuH. 2 varRavikArastu guRAntarApattyupamardahAsavfdDileSaSlezeByaH 0 (gO0 2. 2. 56) iti sUtre uktaH. atra kecidAhuH iko yaRaci (pARi0 a0 6 pA0 1<BR>;p{0745}<BR>sU0 77) ityAdinA ikArAdervikAro yakArAdiH iti. pare tu ikAre prayoktavye yakAraH prayoktavyaH ityAdeSamAdiSanti (gO0 vf02. 2. 40). 3 yAskoktA BAvavikArA paw. jAyate asti vipariRamateH varDate apakzIyate vinaSyati iti zaq BAvavikArAH BavantIti vArzyAyaRiH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0744" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकार्यम्
vikAryam — (vikftirUpaM karma) [ka] kriyAnizpAdyaM yattat. yaTA taRqulAnodanaM pacati kusumAni trajaM karoti kASAnkawaM karotItyAdO prakftiBUtataRqulakusumakASAdipadasamaBivyAhAre odanasragAdi vikAryarUpaM karma Bavati. atra vikAryapadena ekavyutpattyA prakftivikftyuBayAboDanepi uBayasADAraRarUpAvacCinne pAriBAzikameva vikAryapadam. atredaM boDyam. odanasragAderyadA karmatvam tadA tatprakftiBUta taRqulakusumAdInAmapi karmatvaM voDyate. prakfti vikftiBAvasTale karmAKyAtena prakfteH karmatvameva pratyAyyate. ataH kAzWAni BasmarASiH kriyante iti prayoga upapadyate. atra BasmAdinirvartya karmatAyA lakAreRAnaBiDAnepi tatkarmatAyA DAtvarTe saMsargatayA BAnopagamena tAdfSakarmottaraM praTamAyAH sADutA. prAtipadikArTaviSezyatayA karmatvAdivivakzAyAmeva dvitIyAdiviBaktisADutvAt (ga0 vyu0 2 pf0 67) iti. [Ka] yallakzyaM tannASakamevAvasTAntaramApadyate tat. yaTA kAzWaM Basma karoti suvarRaM kuRqalaM karotItyAdO kAzWAdi. atra kAzWAdipadalakzyasya kAzWAvayavAdeH svanASakaBasmAdirUpAvasTAntaraprApterlakzaRasamanvayaH. odanaM pacatItyAdO odanapadalakzya odanAvayavaH. pacyarTo rUpAdiparAvfttyavacCinnastejaH saMyogaH. taTA ca DAtvarTajanyaPalaSAlitvAt satovasTAntaraprApteScoBayaviDakarmatvamodanAvayavasyezwam (kA0 vyA0 pf0 6). [ga] SAbdikAstu prakftivivakzAyAM nizpAdyam. kAzWaM Basma karotItyAdO asatyA eva kAzWAdirUpaprakfteH pariRAmitvena vivakzAsti ityAhuH. taduktamavikArya tu dveDA karma vyavasTitam. prakftyucCedasaMBUtaM kiMcitkAzWAdiBasmavat. kiMcidguRAntarotpattyA suvarRAdivikAravan. tallakzaRaM tu pratIyamAnaprakftivikftiBAvakatve sati kriyAnirvAhyaviSizwAsattva utpatti etadanyataraPala94<BR>;p{0746}<BR>vattvam. GawaM karotItyAdi nirvartye kriyAnirvAhyotpattimatyapi prakftivikftiBAvABAnAnnAtiprasaNgaH. kiMca prakftikarmaRaH kAzWAdeH tAdfSaviSizwAsattvavattvAt vikftikarmaRaSca BasmAdeH tAdfSotpattyASrayatvAllakzaRasaMgatiH. suvarRa kuRqalaM karotItyAdO suvarRasya pUrvarUpa viSizwAsattva PalavattvAt kuRqalasya cotpattimatvAduBayorapi vikAryatvam. taduktaM BartfhariRA yadasajjAyate sadvA janmanA yatprakASyate. prakftestu vivakzAyAM vikArya . kEScidanyaTA. iti. prakftikarmatvaM ca DAtvarTa vyApAra nirvAhyABAvapratiyogitAvacCedakaDarmavattvam. kASAt kawaM karoti kusumAni srajaM karoti suvarRaM kuRqalaM karoti mfdaM GawaM karoti kAzWaM Basma karoti taRqulAnodanaM pacatItyAdO DAtvarTavyApAranirvAhyo yaH pUrvaBAvaviSizwakAzwakASAdipratiyogikaH aBAvo viSizwAsattvarUpaH tatpratiyogitAvacCedakavESizwyavattvaM kASakAzWAdeH iti tatprakftO lakzaRasaMgatiH. atredaM boDyam. kAzWaM Basmetyatra karoternASa utpattiSca Paladvayam tadanukUlavyApAraScArTaH. nASe pratiyogitayA kAzwasya utpattO Basmana ADeyatayAntrayaH. kAzWapratiyogikanASAnukUlo BasmotpAdako vartamAno vyApAraH iti vEyAkaraRamate boDaH. nEyAyikamate taRqulAnodanaM pacatItyAdO prakftikarmaboDakataRqulapadottaradvitIyAyA nASakatvamarTaH. vikftikarmaboDakOdanapadottaradvitIyAyAScotpAdakatvamarTaH. taRqulAdyanvitaM nASakatvaM ca pAkenveti. odanAdyanvitotprAdakatvasya nASakatvaviSizwe pAkenvayaH. taTA ca taRqulanASaka odanotpAdako yo vyApAraH tadanukUlakftimAn iti boDaH. evam kAzWaM Basma karotItyAdAvapyUhyam (vE0 sA0 da0 suba0 kAra0 2). idaM ca boDyam. Basma karotItyAdO yadA BasmaprakftiBUtakAzWAdisamavaDAnaM nAsti tadA BasmAdirUpaM vikftikarma nirvartyam ityucyate. yadA ca tatsamavaDAnamasti tadA tadeva vikftirUpaM karma vikAryam ityucyate iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0745" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

