vidyA — (budDiH) 1 jYAnam. tacca kaRAdanaye yaTA viSezaRavadviSezyasaMnikarzaliNgaparAmarSA dirUpaguRajanyo budDiviSezaH (ta0 0 213). yaTArTajYAnamiti BAtraH. vidyAyA viBAgAdikaM tu budDiSabda vyAKyAne . dfSyam. 2 vijAtIyajYAnahetuH SAstram. yaTA AnvIkzikI nyAyavidyA. seyamAnvIkzikI pramARAdiBiH padArTErviBajyamAnA pradIpaH sarvavidyAnAmupAyaH sarvakarmaRAm. ASrayaH sarvaDarmARAM vidyoddeSye prakIrtitA.. (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 1) iti. nyAyanaye vidyASvatasaH AnvIkzikItrayIvArtA daRqanItirUpASrcatasro vidyA vidyAprasTAne kaTitAH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 1). tadarTaSca AnvIkzikI nyAyavidyA. trayI vedavidyA. vArtA nItiSAstram. daRqanItistvarTaSAstram iti. manunA coktam trEvidyeByastrayIM vidyAM daRqanItiM ca SASvatIm. AnvIkzikIM cAtmavidyAM<BR>;p{0753}<BR>vArtAramBAMSca lokataH.. (manu0 a0 7 Slo0 43) iti. vArtike coktam catasra imA vidyA Bavanti. tASca pfTakprasTAnAH agnihotrahavanAdiprasTAnA trayI. halaSakawAdiprasTAnA vArtA. svAmyamAtyaBedAnuviDAyinI daRqanItiH. saMSayAdiBedAnuviDAyinyAnvIkzikI (nyA0 vA0 pf0 13). 3 pOrARikanaye vidyAScaturdaSa azwAdaSa cApi. tA ucyante. vidyAScaturdaSa proktAH krameRa tu yaTAsTiti. zaqaNgamiSritA vedA DarmaSAstraM purARakam. mImAMsA tarkamapi ca etA vidyAScaturdaSa (nandipu0) iti. purARanyAyamImAMsA DarmaSAstrANgamiSritAH. vedAH sTAnAni vidyAnAM Darmasya ca caturdaSa.. (yAjYa0 1. 3). iti ca. azwAdaSa cAnyatroktAH. tA ucyante. aNgAni vedAScatvAro mImAMsA nyAyavistaraH. DarmaSAstraM purARaM ca vidyA hyetAScaturdaSa.. Ayurvedo Danurvedo gAnDarvaSceti te trayaH. arTaSAstraM caturTaM ca vidyA hyazwAdaSEva tAH (vizRupu0) (vAca0). SrutO tu vidyA dviviDoktA parA aparA ca. tatra parA yayA brahmAvagamaH sA. yayAkzarasaDigamyate sA parA iti SruteH. fgvedAdilakzaRA aparA. sA cADyayanADyApanarUpA (vAca0). vidyABedena devatABedAH (hemA0 bra0) vizRuDarmottare uktAH tAstatrEva dfSyAH. 4 paSuguRo vidyA (sarva0 saM0 pf0 167 nakulI 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0752" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">