विधवा
viDavA — mftaBartfkA strI. viDavADarmASca (Su0 ta0) vizRunA uktA yaTA mfte Bartari brahmacaryam tadanvArohaRaM vA. tatra brahmacaryaM mETunavarjanaM tAmbUlAdivarjanaM ca. yaTAha pracetAH tAmbUlAByaYjanaM cEva kAMsyapAtre ca Bojanam. yatiSca brahmacArI ca viDavA ca vivarjayet. anuyAti na BartAraM yadi dEvAtkadAcana. taTApi SIlaM saMrakzyaM SIlaBaNgAtpatatyaDaH.. viDavAkabarIbanDo BartfbanDAya jAyate. Siraso vapanaM tasmAt kAryaM. 95<BR>;p{0754}<BR>viDavayA sadA.. ekAhAraH sadA kAryo na dvitIyaH kadAcana. trirAtraM paYcarAtraM vA pakzavratamaTApi vA.. mAsopavAsaM kuryAdvA cAndrAyaRamaTApi vA. nADirohedanaqvAhaM prAREH kaRWagatErapi. kanukaM na parIdaDyAdvAso na vikftaM vaset (kASIKa0 a0 4) iti ca. manurapyAha kAmaM tu kzapayeddehaM puzpamUlaPalEH SuBEH. na tu nAmApi gfhRIyAt patyO prete parasya tu. mfte Bartari sADvI strI brahmacarye vyavasTitA. svargaM gacCatyaputrApi yaTA te brahmacAriRaH. na dvitIyaSca sADvInAM kvacidBartopadiSyate (manu0 a0 5 Slo0 157162) iti. atra DarmapravfttinibanDa SiromaRiSAstrapradIpAdO bABravya Aha ajYAnAttu dvijo yastu viDavAmudyadi. parityajya vidityEnAM prAyaScittaM samAcaret.. abdamekaM viDAyAdAvavakIrRivrataM caret. putraScejjAyate tasyAM raRqagolaka ucyate.. iti. kfte saptapade Barturviyogo yadi jAyate. na deyA punaranyasmE kalO kanyA manIziBiH.. iti ca. SizwaM tu niyogaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. SUdrAdivizaye tu na kuryAtkeSasaMskAraM gAtrasaMskArameva ca. keSAvalI jawArUpA na kzOraM tIrTakaM vinA.. tElAByaNgaM na kurvIta na hi paSyati darpaRam (brahma0 pu0 ja0 Ka0 a0 83) ityAdi. anvArohaRaM sahagamanam. atroktamaNgirasA hArItena ca sADvInAmeva nArIRAmagniprapatanAdfte. nAnyo Darmo hi vijYeyo mfte Bartari karhicit.. ityAdi. sADvIlakzaRaM tu Arte muditA hfzwe prozite malinA kfSA. mfte mriyeta yA patyO sADvI jYeyA pativratA.. iti. bfhannAradIye tu bAlApatyASca garBiRyo hyadfzwaftavastaTA. rajasvalA rAjasute nArohanti citAM SuBe.. (vAca0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0753" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://du