विधिः
viDiH — 1 (pramARaSabdaH) [ka] viDirviDAyakaH (gO0 2. 21. 63). ayaM viDirbrAhmaRaBAgaH (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 62). atrABiDEva liNarTaH. sEva ca pravfttihetuH iti vijYeyam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 94). atra viDiSabdasya viDirUpaSabde izwasADanatvAdirUpe viDyarTe ca prayogo dfSyate. tatra viDAyaka iti AdyorTaH. yadvAkyaM viDAyakaM codakaM sa viDiH. viDistu niyogonujYA vA. yaTA agnihotraM juhuyAtsvargakAmaH (SatapaTa0 2) ityAdi (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 63). [Ka] izwasADanatAboDakapratyayasamaBivyAhftavAkyam (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 63). [ga] viDyaBiDAyakapratyayaH tadGawitavAkyaM vA (nyA0 ma0 4). tadarTaSca viDIyate viDirUpaSabdena pratipAdyate sO viDirizwasADanatvAdiH. tasyABiDAyako vAcakaH iti. aTa vA arTaviSezABiDAyakaH pratyayaH. sa ca pratyayo liNlowlewtavya kftyapratyayarUpaH iti (si0 ca0) (ma0 pra0 4 pf0 58) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 93). tadGawitavAkyamiti dvitIyaM lakzaRaM tu tAtrikamate yajeta ityAdivAkyameva viDiH na tu kevalapratyayaH ityaBiprAyeRa. [Ga] pravfttiparaM vAkyam. yaTA jyotizwomena svargakAmo yajeta (SatapaTa0) odanakAmastaRqulaM paceta ityAdi. atra jyotizwomanAmako yAgaH svargarUpezwasADanam taRqulakarmakaH pAka odanarUpezwasADanam ityuBayavAkyArTaH. yajeta pacetetyAdiviDipratyayenezwasADanatyopasTApanAt (ta0 kO0). [Na] mImAMsakAstu ajYAtArTajYApako vedaBAgaH (apUrvaviDiH). sa ca tAdfSaprayojanavadarTaviDAnenArTavAn. tAdfSaM cArTaM pramARAntareRAprAptaM viDatte. yaTA.<BR>;p{0756}<BR>agnihotraM juhuyAt svargakAmaH ityAdi ityAhuH. ayaM viDirmAnAntareRAprAptaM svargaprayojanavadDomaM viDatte. agnihotrahomena svargaM BAvayet iti vAkyArTaboDaH (lO0 BA0 pf0 13). yatra karma mAnAntareRa prAptam tatra taduddeSena guRamAtraM viDatte. yaTA daDnA juhoti (tE0 prA0 2. 115) (Satapa0) iti. atra homasya agnihotraM juhuyAt ityanena prAptatvAdDomodeSena daDimAtraviDAnam. daDnA homaM BAvayet iti vAkyArTaH. yatra tUBayamaprAptam tatra viSizwaM viDatte. yaTA somena yajeta (SatapaTa 0) ityatra somayAgayoraprAptatvAt somaviSizwayAgaviDAnam. somapade matvarTalakzaRayA somavatA yAgenezwaM BAvayet iti vAkyArTaboDaH (lO0 BA0 pf0 13). [ca] DarmArTasADakavyApAro viDiH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 169 nakulI 0). [Ca] ajYAtasyAnuzWeyatvakaTanaM viDiH (jE0 nyA0 a0 1 pA0 4 aDi0 6). sAmAnyatoyaM viDirdviviDaH lOkikaH vEdikaSca. tatra lOkikaH odanakAmastaRqulaM pacet ityAdiH. vEdikaviDistu svargakAmo yajeta (SatapaTa 0) ityAdiH. viDiH prakArAntareRa triviDaH apUrvaviDiH niyamaviDiH parisaMKyAviDiSca (nyA0 ma0 4) (si0 ca0). taduktaM BawwapAdEH viDiratyantamaprAptO niyamaH pAkzike sati. tatra cAnyatra ca prAptO parisaMKyeti kIrtyate.. (nyA0 ma0) iti. tatrApUrvaviDiScaturviDaH utpattiviDiH viniyogaviDiH prayogaviDiH aDikAraviDiSceti (lO0 BA0 pf0 16). tatra prATamikapratItivizayapravfttisADanezwasADanatAboDakaM karmasvarUpajYApakaM viDivAkyam utpattiviDiH. yaTA svargakAmoSvameDena yajeta (SatapaTa 0) ityAdivAkyam (vAca0). atra SizwaM tu utpattiviDiSabda vyAKyAne dfSyam. aDikAraviDiSca karmaRaH PalasaMbanDaboDako viDiH. yaTA jyotizwomena yajeta svargakAmaH ityAdiH (ma0pra0 pra0 63). aTa vA karmajanya PalasvAmyaboDako viDiH. karmajanyaPalasvAmyaM ca karmajanyaPalaBoktftvam. yaTA yajeta svargakAmaH ityAdirUpoDikAraviDiH. atra svargamuddiSya yAgaM vidaDatAnena svargakAmasya yAgajanyaPalaBoktftvaM pratipAdyate (lO0 BA0 pf0 38). yaTA vA yasyAhitAgneragnigfhAn dahetsonaye kzAmavatezwAkapAlaM nirvapet<BR>;p{0757}<BR>(SatapaTa0) (tE0 saM0 2 2) iti. atra agnidAhAdO nimitte karma vidaDatA anena vAkyena nimittavataH karmajanyapApakzayarUpaPalasvAmyaM pratipAdyate (lO0 BA0 pf0 38). evam aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta (bODAyanasU0) ityAdInyaDikAraviDerudAharaRAni vijYeyAni. atra SucivihitakAlajIvinaH saMDyopAsanajanyapratyavAyaparihArarUpaPalasvAmyaM codyate (lO0 BA0 pf0 38). kusumAYjaliwIkAyAmitTamuktam. [ja] viDirnAma viDipratyayArTaH. atra vyutpattiH viDIyate viDirUpaSabdena pratipAdyatesO viDirizwasADanatvAdiH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 58) iti. sa ca pravartakajYAnavizayo DarmaH. ayaM ca Darmo jaranEyAyikAnAM naye kftisADyatve sati balavadanizwAjanakatvasahitamizwasADanatvam. atra kftisADye tfptirUpasuKAtmakezwasADane ca maDuvizasaMpfktAnnaBojane pravfttivAraRAya balavadanizwAjanakatvaM viSezaRamAvaSyakam. atra balavadanizwaM tu maraRam. yadA ca tAdfSaBojanaM balavadanizwAnanubanDitvena jYAyate tadA sa puruzaH pravartata eva iti vijYeyam (nyA0 ma0 Ka0 4 pf0 2627). atredaM boDyam. na kalaYjaM Bakzayet ityAdO natrA boDyamAno viSizwABAvaH (kftisADyatvaviSizwasya balavadanizwAjanakatvaviSizwasyezwasADanatvasyABAvaH) viSezyavati viSezaRABAve viSrAmyatIti (mu0 gu0 pf0 228). etanmate Syenasya hiMsArUpatyaM nAsti iti SyenenABicaran yajeta (aTarvabrAhma0) ityAdO balavadanizwAnanubanDitvarUpo viDyarTo boDyate iti hfdayam. yaTA odanakAmaH paceta svargakAmo yajetetyAdO odanasvargAdirUpaM yat Palam tatsADanatvaM pAkayAgAdikriyAyAM pratIyate (ku0 wI0 5) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 105) (tarkA0) (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 138) (ta0 dI0.) (mu0 gu0) (di0 pf0 226). navyanEyAyikamate tu pravartakacikIrzAyAM yatprakArakajYAnasya hetutvaM sa viDiH. kftisADyatvAdijYAnena cikIrzA tayA ca pravfttirutpadyate iti samuditArTaH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 27). tAdfSaM ca kftisADyatvam izwasADanatvam balavadanizwAnanubanDitvaM ca pratyekameva. yaTA yajeta pacetetyAdO liNarTaH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 102). kftisADyatvAdi75wa<BR>;p{0758}<BR>padAnAM prayojanaM kaTyate. paNguH samudraM na taret ityAdO natrAdinA samudrataraRAdeH paNgupraBftikfti sADyanizeDaboDAnuroDAdavaSyaM kftisADyatvaM liNarTaH svIkAryaH. tfptikAmo jalaM na tAqayet ityAdO jalatAqanAdestfptikAmezwasADanatvasya nizeDAnvayAnupapattyezwasADanatvaM liNaTevaSyaM svIkartavyaH. apare tu cEtyaM na vandeta iti vAkyaprAmARyAnuroDenezwasADanatvasya viDyarTatvamAvaSyakam iti vadanti (ga0 vyu0 la0). na kala BuYjIta ityAdO kalaYjaBakzaRAdervalavadanizwAjanakatvasya nizeDAnupapattyA balavadanizwAnanubanDitvaM liNarTovaSyaM svIkartavyaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 146). kalaYjo mAMsa viSezaH. taTA coktaM mADavAcAryErnyAyamAlAyAm vizAktaSarAgreRa vidDA ye paSupakzyAdayastezAM yanmAMsaM tadeva kalaYjam iti. raktalaSunaM kalaYjam iti haradatta Aha. balavadanizwAnanubanDitvaM cAtra narakAjanakatvam pApAjanakatvaM vA (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 151). etezAM balavadanizwAnanubanDitvAdizu trizu pfTageva liNaH SaktitrayaM vadatAM navyanEyAyikAnAM mate SyenaH svarUpata eva nizidDaH iti SyenenABicaran yajeta ityAdO viDipratyayena balavadanizwAnanubanDitvaM na boDyate. aDikaM tu aBicAraSabdavyAKyAne drazwavyam. taTA ca na kalaYjaM Bakzayet ityAdO balavadanizwAjanakatvaM viDyarTaH. tadaBAvo namAtra boDyate iti vijYeyam (mu0) (di0 gu0 pf0 225229). atra vadanti. dvezavizayatAvacCedakatvopalakzitanarakatvAdyASrayasADanatAtvAtracCinnapratiyogitAkA BAvakUwe tAdfSaBAvatvenAnugata ekEva viDipratyayasya SaktiH iti (ga0 vyu0 la0 pf0 148). yajetetyAdO yAgAdiDarmikAdizwasADanatvAdiniScayAdeva yAgAdiDarmikacikIrzotpattyA tatra pravfttiH. evaM ca yAgAdiH kftisADyaH izwasADanam balavadanizWAnanubanDI ca ityAkArako voDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 146). udayanAcAryAMstu AptABiprAyo viDyarTa ityAhuH (ku0 5) (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 60) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 59). tadarTa Aptasya parameSvarasya aBiprAya icCA liNAdinA voDyate. atroktamudayanAcAryEH yastu vede ISvarapraRItatvam nAByupEti taM prati viDireva tAvadgarBaH SrutikumAryAH<BR>;p{0759}<BR>puMyoge mAnam iti (ki0 va0) (mu0) (ma0pra0 4) (ta0 kO0). aTa vA vakricCAvizayatvam. yaTA GawamAnaya ityAdO loqarTo viDiH (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11) (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 101 wI0 pf0 146). atra GawakarmakamadicCAvizayAnayanAnukUlakftimAMstvam ityanvayaboDaH. atredaM boDyam. yajeta svargakAmaH na kalaYja Bakzayet ityAdO yAgaH svargakAma kartavyatvenAptABiprAyavizayaH kalaYjaBakzaRaM kartavyatvenAptABiprAyavizayo na iti vAkyadvayArTaboDaH. yAgAdO cAptABiprAya vizayatvenezwasADanatvAdikamanumAya pravfttiH. kalaYjaBakzaRAdO tadvizayatvABAvenAnizwasADanatvamanumAya nivfttiH iti (ma0pra0 4 pf0 59). BawwamImAMsakAstu viDipreraRA pravartanAdiSabdABiDeyaH pravfttyanukUlavyApAra ityAhuH. tanmate stritTam. gAmAnaya ityAcAryavAkyaSravaRAnantaraM SizyapravfttidarSanAt SabdapravfttO pravartanAjYAnaM hetuH. sA ca pravartanA paceta ityAdilOkikavAkye puruzanizWoBiprAyaviSezaH. yajeta svargakAmaH ityAdivEdikavAkye tu puruzABAvAcCabda nizWEva. na ceSvarakartfkatvaM vedasya. ISvarasyEvAnaByupagamAt. SabdanizWatvAdeva ca SabdaBAvanA ityucyate. sEva viDyarTaH. sa ca liNtvenABiDIyate. arTaBAvanA tu pravfttyAdivyApArarUpA. sA cAKyAtatvenopasTApyate iti. tatroktam aBiDABAvanAmAhuranyAmeva liNAdayaH. arTAtmaBAvanA tvanyA sarvAKyAtasya gocaraH.. (ma0pra0 4 pf0 58) iti. ayamASayaH. svargakAmo yajeta ityAdO liNAdipratyaye aMSadvayamasti liNtvam AKyAtatvaM ca. tatra litvAMSena pravartanAKyaH SabdanizWo vyApAro boDyate. ISvarAnaByupagamAt. ayaM SabdaBAvanA ityucyate. tena vyApAreRa ca pravfAttyAKyo yAgakartfpuruzanizWo vyApAra AKyAtatvAMSena boDyamAna upasTApyate. ayameva arTaBAvanA ityucyate. evaM ca puruzanizWAyAH pravftteranukUlaH pravartanAKyaH SabdanizWo vyApAro viDyarTaH iti (lO0 BA0 pf0 5-10). prABAkarAstu viDyarTaH kAryatvamAtram. tacca kftisADyatvam. taTA hi. yadvizayiRI budDiH pravfttijananImicCAM prasUte sa viDipratyayapratipAdyaH. pravfttijanakecCAjanakajYAnaprakAraH ityarTaH.<BR>;p{0760}<BR>pravfttijananI ca kftisADyatvaprakArakecCA. tajjananI ca kftisADyatvaprakArikA budDiH iti yAvat (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 25). atredamavaDeyam. prABAkaramata izwasADanatvamapi viDyarTo Bavatyeva. ata eva tErnityApUrvaM nizeDApUrvarUpaM paRqApUrvamapi saMDyAmupAsIta na kalaM Bakzayet (smftiH) ityAdiviDinizeDayoH kalpyate (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 89). atredamaDikaM boDyam. prABAkaramate anyaTAKyAtirnAsti iti. evaM ca tanmate kAryatvameva viDyarTaH. ayamASayaH. prABAkaramate kAryatvaviSizwApUrvasya viDyarTatvAdviSezaRAMSaH kAryatvamapi tadarTaH iti (ma0pra0 4 pf0 59). atredaM boDyam. prABAkaramate yAgasyASuvinASitvena svargotpattikAle tasyABAvAttadutpattyarTaM yAgajanyamapUrvaM kalpyate. taTA ca vede kAryatvaviSizwApUrvasaMBavena tatra Saktireva. paraM tu loke paceta ityAdAvapUrve tAtparyAsaBavAt kAryatve lakzaREva. aTa vA lOkikaliNaH kAryatve SaktiH. vede tu svargakAmAnvayAnupapattyA kriyAtiriktakArye SaktiH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 119). BawwAstu sTAyyapUrvakalpanApekzayA yAgasyEva sTAyitvaM kalpanIyam ityAhuH. cikIrzAjanyakftisADyatvaM kAryatvam (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 65). kAryatvaM ca kftisADyatvam. tajjYAnameva pravartakam. tacca jYAnam kftisADya prakArakamityarTaH. tena jYAnena kftisADyatvaprakArikecCA janyate. tayA ca pravfttirjanyate. sA ca pAkaM yAgaM vA kuryAm ityAkArikA cikIrzetyarTaH (nyA0 ma0) (ma0pra0 pf0 59). tatra prABAkaramatAntarvartina evamAhuH. kftisADyatvaprakArakajYAnaM cezwasADanatAliNgakakftisADyatAnumitiH izwasADanatAjYAnakAlIna kftisADyatAjYAnaM vA kAmyasTale pravartakam. nityasTale ca aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta ityAdO ahamidAnIMtanakftisADyasaMDyAvandanakaH brAhmaRatve sati vihitasaMDyAkAlInaSOcAdimattvAt iti SOcAdimattvapratisaMDAnajanyaM kftisADyatAjYAnaM pravartakam iti (ma0pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 59) (si0 ca0). taTA ca aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta ityAdO nityatayA nizPale saMDyopAsanAdA vizwasADanatvasyAyogyatvenAnvayAsaMBavAnezwasADanatvamapi liNarTo pUrva viDiH. nEyAyikAstu nityakarmasTalepi arTa<BR>;p{0761}<BR>vAdAdyupasTApita brahmalokAvApternarakAtyantABAvasyEva vA prAyaScittasaMDyAvandanAdiPalatvasaMBavAdizwasADanatvameva liqarTaH iti prAhuH. tatra smaryate. saMDyAmupAsate ye tu satataM SaMsitavratAH. viDUtapApAste yAnti brahmalokaM sanAtanam.. ityAdi (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 102). taToktaM yAjYavalkyenApi niSAyAM vA divA vApi yadajYAnakftaM Bavet. trEkAlyasaMDyAkaraRAttatsarvaM vipraRaSyati.. (yAjYa0 a0 3 Slo0 308) iti. mitAkzarAyAM yamenApyuktam yadahnAtkurute pApaM karmaRA manasA girA. AsInaH paScimAM saMDyAM prARAyAmErnihanti tat.. iti. SAtAtapenApyuktam anftaM macaganDaM ca divA mETunameva ca. punAti vfzalAnnaM ca saMDyA bahirupAsitA.. (mitAkza0 a0 3 Slo0 308 wI0 pf0 144) iti. 2 prayogaH. 3 nidarSanam. yaTA yatra DUmastatrAgniriti anyaBAve DUmo na Bavati iti ca (praSa0 pf0 44). 4 dEvam. yaTA anukUlatAmupagate hi viDO sakalezwasADanamaTo Bavati ityAdO. 5 brahmadevaH. 6 arTAlaMkAraviSezaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0755" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

