विधेयः
viDeyaH — 1 uddeSye prakAratayA jYAyamAno vilakzaRavizayatAvAn padArTaH. yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO parvate vahnirviDeyaH. yaTA vA pacati ityAdO puruze pAkakftirviDeyA. sA ca vilakzaRavizayatA viDeyatArUpA. viDeyatA ca yaTA vahnimanuminomi ityAdyanuvyavasAyaniyAmakaH pakzatAvacCedakavyAvfto vizayatAviSezaH (ga0 pakza0 pf0 19). kecittu pratyakzAdisADAraRI viSezyatAvacCedakatABinnA muKyaviSezyatAnirUpitaprakAratEva viDeyatA ityAhuH (ga0 pakza0 pf0 24) (Sa0 pra0). SAbdikAstu tadAdiSabdapratipAdyatve satyuddeSyasaMbanDitvenApUrvaboDavizayatvam anuvAdyaBinnanizWA vilakzaRavizayatA vA viDeyatA ityAhuH. atroktam anuvAdyamanuktvA ca na viDeyamudIrayet iti. 2 mImAMsakAstu viDiboDyArTaH. yaTA daDnA juhoti iti guRaviDO homamanUdya daDirUpo guRo<BR>;p{0762}<BR>viDeyaH. atra viDeyatvaM ca ajYAtasyAnuzWeyatvena pratipAdyamAnatvam (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 15). 3 aDIna iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0761" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

