विना
vinA — 1 aBAvaH. yaTA daRqaM trinA na GawaH ityAdO. evam fte antareRa iti nipAtayorapyarTa UhyaH. atra pratiyogitvamanuyogitvaM vA dvitIyArTaH. tasya ca vinArTe aBAvenvayaH. vinAntArTasyABAvasya naYarTe GawAdyaBAve prayojyatAsaMbanDenEvAnvayaH. ata eva rAsaBaM vinA na GawaH ityAdayo na prayogAH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 73). 2 varjanam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0762" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

