विनिगमना
vinigamanA — anyatarapakzapAtinI yuktiH (si0 ca0) (BavA0) (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 4748). yaTA ayameva pakzo grAhyaH pakzAntaraM tu na grAhyam atra kA vinigamanA ityatra. yaTA vA udite juhoti anudite juhoti ityAdivikalpasTale udita eva havanaM kAryam anudite<BR>;p{0763}<BR>tu havanaM na kAryam ityatra vinigamanAyA aBAvaH ityAdO. smftiM pratyanu- 1 BavasyAnuBavatvena kAraRatvaM jYAnatvena vA iti vipratipattO jYAnatvena kAraRatvANgIkAre tasya sAmAnyaDarmatvenAnyaTAsidDatvaM syAt iti vinigamanayA lAGavena ca jYAnatvenEva kAraRatvaM navyEH sADitam (mu0 smftini0 pf0 190) ityAdO ca.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0762" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिमयः
vinimayaH — 1 [ka] tulyadravyadAnena dravyAntaragrahaRam (Sabdaca0). yaTA kAMsyapAtradvayaM datvA tasmAttAmragrahaRaM vinimayaH. [Ka] mUlyAtiriktadravyagrahaRaprayuktasvasvatvaDvaMsa parasvatvAnukUlastyAgaH ityanya AhuH (kA0 vyA0 kA0 4 pf0 6). 2 banDakam iti vyavahAraSAstrajYA AhuH. tacca fRaSoDanArTaM viSvAsahetutayA ArDAkftaH padArTaH (gahARa iti pra0). maDyamatAnuyAyivedAntinaH. 3 kAryam. yaTA tejovArimfdAM yaTA vinimayaH (BAga0 1. 1. 1) ityAdI ityAhuH. 4 anyasminnanyAvaBAso vinimayaH iti mAyAvAdivedAntina AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0763" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनियोगः
viniyogaH — 1 kriyAsu pravartanam. taduktam anenedaM tu kartavyaM viniyogaH prakIrtitaH (vAca0) iti. yaTA imaM me varuRa SruDI havamadyA ca mfqaya. tvAmavasyurAcake (f0 1. 2. 19) iti mantrasya saMskArANgahome viniyogaH. yaTA vA apasarpantu te BUtA ye BUtA Buvi saMsTitAH ityasya samastaBUtoccAwane viniyogaH. 2 anuzWAnakramaviDAnam. yaTA A CandaSca dEvatyaM viniyogastaTEva ca (yogayAjYa 0) ityAdO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0763" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनियोगविधिः
viniyogaviDiH — (viDiH) [] praDAne aNga saMbanDaboDako viDiH. yaTA daGnA juhoti (SatapaTa 0) iti. atra agnihotrahome daDisaMbanDonena voDyate (ma0pra0 4 pf0 62). [Ka] aNgAnAM praDAnEH saha saMbanDasya boDako viDiH. yaTA daDnA juhoti iti. sa hi tftIyayA pratipannANgaBAvasya daGno homasaMbanDaM viDatte daGnA homaM BAvayet iti. guRaviDO ca DAtvarTasya sADyatvenEvAnvayaH. taTA ca DAtvarTasya sADyatvenAnvayavivakzAyAmayaM guRaviDirapi Bavati iti jYeyam. kvacidASrayatvenApi yaTA daBendriyakAmasya juhuyAt iti. atra homASrayadaDikaraRatvenendriyaM<BR>;p{0764}<BR>BAvayet iti vAkyArTaH. tacca daDikaraRatvam kiMnizWam ityAkANkzAyAM saMniDiprAptahoma ASrayatvenAnveti (lO0 BA0 pf016). [ga] aNgapraDAna saMbanDaboDako viDirviniyogaviDiH (mI0 nyA0 pf0 12). viniyogaviDeH sahakAriBUnAni paw pramARAni santi SrutiH liNgam vAkyam prakaraRam sTAnam samAKyA iti (lO0 BA0 pf0 1629). etatsahakftenAnena viDinA aNgatvaM paroddeSapravfttakftisADyatvarUpapArArTyAparaparyAyaM jYApyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0763" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपक्षः
vipakzaH — 1 [ka] niScitasADyABAvavAn. yaTA parvate vahnisADane hfdo vipakzaH (ta0 saM0 2). vipakzatvaM ca sADyABAvaprakArakaneScayaviSezyatvam (nyA0 vo0 2) aTa vA viSezyatAsaMbanDena sADyaBAvaprakArakaniScayavattvam (vAkya 0 2) iti jYeyam. [Ka] vedAntinastu sADyatatsamAnaDarmarahito DarmI ityAhuH (pra0 ca0 pf0 24). 2 pratikUlapakzaH iti vyavahArajYA AhuH. 3 SatruH iti kAvyajYA AhuH (amaraH).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0764" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

