विपर्ययः
viparyayaH — 1 (apramA) [ka] miTyAjYAnAparaparyAyaH ayaTArTaniScayaH (gO0 vf0 4. 1. 3). atra ayaTArTajYAnameva nAsti iti prABAkarAdaya AhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 4). [Ka] vedAntinastu viparItaniScayaH (pra0 pa0 pf0 4). atra viparItatvaM ca purovartinyavidyamAnaprakArakatvam (pra0 pa0 wI0 vedeSatIrTI 0 pf0 10). viparItaniScayaSca pratyakzAnumAnAgamABAseByo jAyate. tatra pratyakzABAsajo yaTA SuktikAyAM idaM rajatam ityAdi. anumAnABAsajo yaTA DUlIpawale DUmaBramAdvahnayaBAvavati vahnayanumitiH. AgamABAsajo yaTA nadItIre paYca PalAni santi iti pratArakavAkyajanyajYAnam ityAhuH (pra0 ca0 pf0 8-9). atra pratyakzABAsavizaye vipratipattiH. (1) pratItaM rajataM deSAntare sadeva iti vESezikAdaya AhuH. (2) jYAnasvarUpameva iti vijYAnavAdina AhuH. (3) tatrEva tAtkAlikamutpannaM sat iti BAskara Aha.<BR>;p{0765}<BR>(4) na sat nAsat na sadasat kiM tu anirvacanIyameva iti mAyAvAdino manyante. (5) SrImadAnandatIrTAcAryAstu asadeva rajataM pratyaBAt ityuttarakAlInAnuBavAt SuktirevAtyantAsadrajatAtmanA drazwurdozatraSAt pratiBAti iti prAhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 4). [ga] pAtaYjalAstu paYcaviDavfttyantargato vfttiviSeza ityAhuH (pAta 0 sU0 pA0 1 sU0 6, 8). 2 saMSayaH. 3 viparItama. yaTA viparyayoBUtsakalaM jalOkasaH (BAga 0 ska0 8 a0 2 Slo0 29) ityAdO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0764" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

