विप्रः
vipraH — 1 vidvAn brAhmaRaH. atroktam janmanA brAhmaRo jYeyaH saMskArErdvija ucyate. vidyayA yAti vipratvaM triBiH Srotriya ucyate.. (prA0vi0) (vA0) iti. yaTA viprAya vedaviduze SrotriyAya kuwumbine. narakottAraRArTAya acyutaH prIyatAmiti.. (vAyanamatraH) ityAdO vipraH. 2 aSvatTavfkzaH (rAjani0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0765" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रकर्षः
viprakarzaH — [ka] saMyuktasaMyogaBUyastvam (dUratvam) (vE0 u0 7. 2. 21). [Ka] bahutarasaMyogAntaritatvam (di0 gu0 pf0 208). yaTA mumbApuryAH puRyaprAmamapekzya JaLakI grAmasya viprakarzaH. ayaM dikkato viprakarzaH iti vijYeyama. viprakarzo dviviDaH dikkftaH kAlakftaSca. viprakarzajYAnaM paratve nimittakAraRaM Bavati. kAlakftaviprakarzaSca tadapekzayA bahutaratapanaparispandAntaritajanmatvam (vE0 u0 7. 2. 21). tadarTaSca tajjanmakzaRavfttiDvaMsapratiyogispandavfttitve sati janmavattvam iti (pa0 mA0). yaTA gOtamarzerudayanAcAryamapekzya gaNgaSopADyAyagadADaraBawwAcAryayorviprakarzaH. SizwaM ca paratvaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0765" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

