विप्रतिपत्तिः
vipratipattiH — 1 [ka] vyAhata mekArTadarSanaM vipratipattiH. idaM ca saMSayaprayojakam. taTA hi atra vyAGAto viroDosahaBAva iti. asyAtmA ityekaM darSanam. nAstyAtmA ityaparam. na ca sadBAvAsadBAvO sahEkatra.<BR>;p{0766}<BR>saMBavataH. na cAnyatarasADako heturupalaByate. tatra tattvAnavaDAraRaM saMSayaH (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 23) iti. [Ka] vedAntinastu virudDArTakavAkyadvayajanyapratItidvayam ityAhuH (pra0 pa0 wI0 vedeSatIrTI 0 pf0 8). [ga] virudDakowidvayopasTApakaH SabdaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 23) (di0 gu0). sa ca virudDArTapratipAdakavAkyadvayAtmakaH parvato vahnimAn na vA iti saMSayApAdakaH. [Ga] virudDArTapratipAdakavAkyadvayam (nIla0 4 pf0 34). yaTA parvato vahnimAn na vA iti vAkyadvayam. taTA hi. vAdinA parvato vahnimAn iti prativAdinA ca parvato vahnayaBAvavAn iti pratijYAte maDyasTasya parvato vahnimAn na vA iti saMSaya utpadyate. atastasya saMSayADAyakatvAttaTAtvam. 2 [ka] viparItA vA kutsitA vA pratipattiH vipratipattiH. vipratipadyamAnaH parAjayaM prApnoti. nigrahasTAnaM Kalu parAjayaprAptiH (vAtsyA0 112. 19). [Ka] virudDA pratipattiH (gO0 vf0 12 19) (di0 gu0). atrodAhriyate parasparaM manuzyARAM svArTe vipratipattizu (smftiH) iti. iyaM tu nigrahasTAnonneyA iti vijYeyam. 3 viroDaH. 4 UhaH iti yAjYikA AhuH (kAtyA0 SrOH).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0765" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रतिषेधः
vipratizeDaH — 1 tulyabalaviroDaH. yaTA pratipeDavipratizeDe pratizeDavaddozaH (gO0 5. 1. 41) ityAdO. atra BAzyam. yoyaM pratizeDepi samAno dozonEkAntikatvamApadyate soyaM pratipeDasya pratizeDepi samAnaH. tatra anityaH SabdaH prayatnAnantarIyakatvAt iti sADanavAdinaH sTApanA praTamaH pakzaH. prayatnakAryAnekatvAtkAryasamaH iti dUzaRavAdinaH pratizeDahetunA dvitIyaH pakzaH. sa ca pratizeDa ityucyate. tasyAsya pratizeDasya pratizeDepi samAno dozaH iti tftIyaH pakzaH vipratizeDa ityucyate. tasmin pratizeDaviprati zeDepi samAno dozonEkAntikatvam caturTaH pakzaH (vAtsyA 0 5. 1. 41). atra vfttiH. SabdaH anityaH prayatnAnantarIyakatvAt iti sTApanAvAdinaH praTamaH pakzaH. prayatnakAryAnekatvAtkAryasamaH iti prativAdino dvitIyaH pakzaH. pratizeDapratizeDepyanEkAntikatvaM tulyam iti vAdinastftIyaH pakzo<BR>;p{0767}<BR>vipratizeDaH. tatrApi taTEvAnEkAntikatvam tatsamAnadozodBAvanaM vA caturTaH pakzaH (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 41) iti. 2 SAbdikAstu dvayoH SAstrayoH kvacillabDAvakASayorekatra prayoge yugapadasaMBavisvakAryasamarpaRam. yaTA vipratizeDe paraM kAryam (pA0 sU0 1142) ityAdO iti vadanti. taTA hi. vfkzeBya ityatra supi ca (pA0 sU0 7. 3. 102) ityanena dIrGaH prAptaH. bahuvacane Jalyet (pA0 sU0 7. 3. 103) ityanena ca etvamapi prAptam. uBayaprAptO paratvAdvipratizeDenEtvameva Bavati (kASikA 1. 4. 2) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0766" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभक्तिः
viBaktiH — 1 viBAgaH. atrodAhriyate aviBaktaM sTAvaraM yatsarvezAmeva.. tadBavet. viBaktaM sTAvaraM grAhyaM nAnyodayEH kaTaMcana.. (yama 0) iti. 2 padavfttiH (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 57). yaTA te viBaktyantAH padam (gO0 2. 2. 57) ityAdO viBaktiSabdArTaH. 3 (pratyayaH) [ka] saMKyAtvAvAntarajAtyavacCinnaSaktimAn yaH pratyayaH sA viBaktiH. yaTA GawostItyatra GawapadottaravartinI su iti viBaktiH. ekatvatvAdyavacCinnaSaktimAnapi tadAdirna pratyayaH iti pratyayaSca tfjAdirna saMKyASaktaH iti ca tadAdeH tfjAdeSca vyudAsaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 6. wI0 pf0 72). [Ka] yaH SabdaH KArTe DarmiRi svaprakftyarTa viDeyakAnvayaboDaM prati samarTaH sa vA viBaktirityucyate. yaTA Gawam Gawa ityAdO. iyaM viBaktirdviviDA sup tiN ceti. atra supA (amA) karmatvaM GawIyam ityAdiriva pacatItyAdO tiNApi kftiH pAkIyA ityAdiruddeSya viDeyaBAvena svArTe prakftyarTasya vIrutpAdyate iti lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. Gawa ityatra praTamApyaBedAdO svArTe prakftyarTasya viDeyaBAvena DiyaM janayatyeva iti lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. lakzaRAntaragrahaRe AvaSyakatvamAha yadyAKyAtamAtrasya tadekavacanasya vA na saMKyASaktatve pramARam tadedaM lakzaRAntaram ityavaDeyam (SaH pra0 Slo0 61 wI. pf0 73). viBaktirdvayI nAmikI AKyAtikI ca. tatra nAmikI sup. AKyAtikI tiN. brAhmaRaH pacatItyudAharaRam. upasarganipAtAstarhi na padasaMjYAH. lakzaRAntaraM<BR>;p{0768}<BR>vAcyamiti. Sizyate ca Kalu nAmikyA viBakteravyayAllopaH tayoH padasaMjYArTamiti (vAtsyA0 2. 2257).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0767" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभजनम्
viBajanam — [ka] sAmAnyaDarmAvAntaraDarmapuraskAreRa DarmipratipAdanam (ga0 2 savya0). [Ka] sAmAnyaDarmasya sAkzAnyUna vfttiyAvadDarmaprakArakajYAnAnukUlo vyApAraH (vAkya 0 1 pf0 2). svasamaBivyAhftapadArTatAvacCedakasAkzAdvyApyaparasparavirudDaDarmaprakArakajYAnAnukUlaSabda- prayogaH ityarTaH. yaTA dravyaM viBajate iti pratijYAya kftaM pfTivyApastejo vAyurAkASam ityAdiviBajanam. [ga] sAmAnyaDarmayutAnAM bahUnAM parasparavirudBUtadvyApyaDarmaprakAreRa pratipAdanama (SrIkfzRaH) (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0768" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

