viBavaH — 1 viButvam (vE0 u0 7. 1. 22). yaTA viBavAnmahAnAkASastaTA cAtmA (vE0 7. 1. 22) ityAdO. 2 rAmAdyavatAro viBavaH iti rAmAnujIyA vadanti (sarva0 pf0 115 rAmA0). 3 saMvatsaraviSezaH iti mOhUrtikA vadanti. 4 mokzaH iti vedAntina AhuH. 5 ESvaryam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0768" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

