viSizwAntarAGawitatvam — [ka] anumitipratibanDakatAyAM yAdfSarUpAvacCinna vizayakatvamavacCedakam (anatiriktavftti) tAdfSaM yat svAvacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakam tadavacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM yat svam tadavacCinnatvam. yaTA hfdo DUmavAnvahnerityAdO vyaBicArasya bADAdirUpaviSizwAntarAGawitatvam. viSizwAntarAGawitatvarUpaviSezaRaprayojanaM ca gAdADarIyadvitIya hetvABAsa sAmAnyalakzaRasya DUmavAnvahneH ityAdisTale prameyatvaviSizwavyaBicArAdO (prameyatvaviSizwaDUmABAvavadvfttivahnO) ativyAptivAraRarUpaM boDyam. svAvacCinnetyatra yadrUpAvacCinne lakzaRaM saMgamanIyam tadeva svapadArTaH. hfdo DUmavAnvahnerityAdO DUmABAvavadvfttivahnitvaM vyaBicAraH. bADastu DUmABAvavadBadaH. taTA cAtra vyaBicAratvAvacCinnAvizayakatvaM bADavizayakapratItO bADatvAvacCinnAvizayakatvaM ca vyaBicAravizayakapratItAvasti iti bADatvaM vyaBicaratvAvacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayAvacCedakam hfdo DUmavAt ityanumitinirUpitapratibanDakatAyAmanatiriktavfttitvarUpAvacCedakatAvacca Bavati tAdfSabADatvAvacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM svaM (vyaBicAratvam) Bavati. vyaBicAratvAvacCinnatvaM tu vyaBicAre vartata iti lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. prameyatvaviSizwavyaBicArAdO tu SudDavyaBicArarUpaviSizwAntaraGawitatvena tAdfSalakzaRABAvAnnAtivyAptiSca (ga0 2 hetvA0 sAmA0 pf0 13). [Ka] kecittu svasamAnADikaraRahetvABAsaviBAjakarUpasamAnADikaraRaM yat svAvacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM tAdfSaM<BR>;p{0783}<BR>rUpam tadavacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM yat svam tadavacCinnatvam ityAhuH (nyA0 20 sAmA0). atra tAdfSaM rUpaM ca viparItavyaBicAratvAdikameva iti boDyam. taTA hi. KaM DUmABAvavadvfttivahnitvatvam. tatsamAnADikaraRaM hetvABAsaviBajakaM rUpaM tu vyaBicAratvaM Bavati. tatsamAnADikaraRaM yadDUmABAvavadvfttivahitvatvAvacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM tAdfSaM rUpaM tu vahninizWaDUmABAvavadvfttitvatvameva Bavati. tadavacCinnAvizayakapratItivizayatAvacCedakaM yatsvaM tu DUmABAvavadvfttitvaviSizwavahnitvatvaM Bavati tadavacCinnatvaM DUmABAvavadvfttivahnisti it