viSezaH — 1 (padArTaH) [ka] anyonyABAvaviroDisAmAnyarahitaH samavetaH padArTaviSezaH (sarva0 pf0 217 OlU0). [Ka] jAtirahitatve sati nityadravyamAtravfttiH. taTA coktam ajAtirekavfttiSca viSeza iti Sizyate (tA0 20 lo0 53) iti. ekadravyaH svaBAvasan (nyA0lI0 pf0 5) iti nyAyalIlAvatIkArAH. sa ca antyo nityadravyasamavetaH. ante avasAne vartata ityantyaH. tadapekzayA viSezo nAstItyarTaH. ekamAtravfttiriti PalitArTaH (mu0 1. 1 pf0 37). kiMca sa viSezaH atyantavyAvfttihetuH (BA0 pa0) (ta0 saM0). taTA hi. GawAdInAM vyaRukaparyantAnAM tattadavayavaBedAtparasparaM BedaH sidDyati. paramARUnAM parasparaM Bedako viSeza eva. sa tu svata eva vyAvfttaH. tena tatra viSezAntarApekzA nAsti iti BAvaH (mu0 1). atra prayogaH etadviSezastadviSezAdBidyate tAdAtmyenEtadviSezAt iti. evam svatonyAvartakatvAnumAnaprayogopi vijYeyaH (si0 ca0 pf0 3). (sUtre coktam anyatrAntyeByo viSezeByaH (vE0 112. 6) iti. ante BavA antyAH. svASrayaviSezatvAdviSezAH. vinASAramBarahite nityezvaRvAkASakAladigAtmamanaHsu pratidravyamekEkaSo vartamAnA atyantavyAvfttabudDihetavaH. yaTAsmadAdInAM gavAdizvaSvAdiByastulyA kftiguRakriyAvayavasaMyoganimittA pratyayavyAvfttirdfzwA. yaTA gOH SuklaH SIGragatiH kakudmAn mahAGawa iti taTAsmadviSizwAnAM yoginAM nityezu tulyAkftiguRakriyezu paramARuzu muktAtmamanaHsu cAnyanimittAsaMBavAt yeByo nimitteByaH<BR>;p{0785}<BR>pratyADAram ayamasmAdvilakzaRaH iti vyAvfttipratyayaH deSakAlaviSizwe ca paramARO sa evAyam iti pratyaBijYAnaM ca Bavati yataH tentyA viSezA iti. ete ca viSezAH nityadravyARAM parasparaBedasADakAH (nIla0 pf0 94). aTAntyaviSezezviva paramARuzu kasmAnna svataH eva vyAvfttipratyayaH pratyaBijYAnaM vA kalpyate iti cet na. tAdAtmyAt. iha tAdAtmyakalpanAnimittapratyayo Bavati. yaTA SvamAMsAdInAM svata evASucitvam tadyogAdanyezAm. taTehApi tAdAtmyAdantyaviSezezu svata eva vyAvfttipratyayaH. tadyogAt paramARvAdizviti (praSasta0 pf0 6465). atyantavyAvfttiheturityasya ayamasmAnyAvfttaH iti vyAvfttibudDimAtra heturityarTaH iti kOmudIkArAH (ta0 kO0). te KalvatyantavyAvfttihetutvAdviSezA eva (praSasta0 pf0 2) iti BAzyam. atra kandalIkAra Aha. KaluSabdo niScaye. nityadravyavfttayo ye viSezAste viSezA eva niScitAH. na tu sAmAnyAnyapi BavantItyarTaH. atyantaM sarvadA vyAvfttereva svASrayasyetarasmAdvyavacCedasyEva hetutvAt kAraRatvAt (nyA0 ka0 pf0 14) iti. [ga] viSezo nAmAnyonyABAvaviroDisAmAnyarahitaH samavetaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 217 O0). viSezapadArTasvIkArasyAvaSyakatvamidAnIM pradarSyate. GawAdInAM sAvayavapadArTAnAM kapAlasamavetatvAdikaM pawAdiBedakamasti. paramARUnAM tu niravayavatvAtparasparaBedakaM na kiMcidasti. atonAyatyA viSeza ASrayitavyaH. aTa vA viSezAnaByupagame samAnajAtiguRakarmavatAM paramARUnAM miTo vyAvfttibudDiH na syAt. tAdfSI budDistu samAnajAtiguRakarmakAH paramARavaH anyonyavyAvartakaDarmasaMbanDinaH vyAvfttajYAnavizayatvAt dravyatvAdvA gavAdivat ityAnumAnikI jYeyA (nyA0 lI0 pf0 53). vyAvfttibudDyaBAvasyezwApattO yoginopi tAdfSaparamARUnAM jYAnasaMkaraH syAt ityatastadvyAvfttibudDyarTaM viSezoNgIkartavyaH (ta0 kO0 pf0 28) (pra0 pra0) iti. sa ca viSezaH SabdasamavAyikAraRatAvacCedakatayApi siDyati (si0 ca0). taTA hyanumAnam SabdasamavAyikAraRatA kiMcidDarmAvacCinnA kAraRatAtvAt daRqanizWaGawakAraRatAvat iti. sa ca Darmo viSeza eva. viSezalakzaRaM 99<BR>;p{0786}<BR>tu sAmAnyaSUnyatve sati sAmAnyaBinnatve ca sati samavetatvam. yadvA nityasamavetavfttijanyasamavetAvfttipadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (ta0 va0). ekamAtrasamavetatve sati sAmAnyaSUnyatvaM vA (pa0 mA0). svato vyAvfttatvaM vA (vAkya 0) (ta0 pra0 1). svato vyAvartakatvaM vA. atra vyAvartakatvaM nAma vyAvfttijanakatvam. vyAvfttiScettaraBedaH tajjYAnaM vA (si0 ca0 1 pf0 3). svato vyAvartakatvaM ca svaBinnaliNgajanyasvaviSezyakasvasamAnajAtIyetara BedAnumitya vizayatvam (di0 1. 1 pf0 37). aTa vA svena rUpeRa BedAnumApakatvam. yaTA ekaparamARO paramARvantaraBedasADane viSezasya tattadvyattitvenEva hetutvena svato vyAvartakatvam. atra tu tattadvyaktitvaM ca tAdAtmyasaMbanDena sEva vyaktiH (rAma0). navyanEyAyikAH BawwakumArilaH prABAkarAH maDvamatAnuyAyivedAntinaSca etAdfSaviSezapadArTaM nANgIcakruH. yaTEva viSezARAM svavfttiDarmaM vinA vyAvfttatvaM taTEva nityadravyARAmapi iti (di0 1 pf0 37) (pra0 pa0 pf0 11) (tA0 20 Slo0 55). 2 viSezakaSabdasya arTavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. yaTA puruzatvavyApyakarAdimAn ityAdO puruzatvAderviSezaH karAdiDarmaH. 3 praBedaSabdavadasyArTAnusaMDeyaH. 4 vyApyaDarmaH (vE0 112. 5). yaTA sattAmapekzya dravyatvam. dravyatvamapekzya ca pfTivItvaM viSezaH (vyApyaDarmaH). 5 tadvfttiDarmaH. yaTA padArTaviSezaH (mU0 ma0 1) ityAdO. atra padArTaviSepaH ityasya padArTavfttiDarmaH ityarTo jYeyaH. sa ca padArTatvavyApyaH. 6 niScAyako sADAraRaDarmaH. yaTA viSezAdarSanaM kowidvayasmaraRaM ca saMSayamAtra hetuH ityAdO sTARutvaniScAyakaM vakrakowarAdimattvam puruzatvaniScAyakaM karAdimattvaM ca viSezaH (si0 ca0 pf0 34). 7 ADeyonirvacanIyaSca kaScidDarmaviSezaH (atiSayaH). yaTA aNkurajananayogya vIjAdO viSezaH iti kecittattvavyavasTApakA AhuH. atredaM vijYeyam. kusUlasTabIjAdiBirnANkurotpattiH. ataH kfzwakzetrAdAvuptavIjAdO salilapavanAdiyogena kaScidviSezovaSyamADeyaH iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0784" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

