viSezaguRatvam — [ka] dravyaviBAjakopADidvayasamAnADikaraRAvfttiguRavfttijAtimattvam (ta0 dI0 4 pf0 39). tadarTaSca pfTivItvajalatvAdyAtmakaM yaddravyaviBAjakopADidvayam pratyekaM tatsamAnADikaraRAH dvitvadvipfTaktvasaMyogAdayaH tadvfttijAtimaguRatvam iti. taTA ca viSezaguRezu lakzaRasamanvayaH kriyate. rUpAdizu caturzu tAdfSalakzaRaGawakajAtim rUpatvAdikAmAdAya sAMsidDikadravatve ca dravatvatvAvAntarajAtim snehAdizu daSasu snehatvAdikAm BAvanAyAM saMskAratvAvAntarajAtiM cAdAya lakzaRasamanvayaH. atra pravadantyaBijYA nizkfzwArTam. yadrUpAvacCinnasamAnADikaraRaM yatkicidravyaviBAjakopADidvayam tadBinnA sTitisTApakavfttiBinnA ca yA jAtiH tadvattve sati guRatvam iti. tena ekatvAdisaMKyAyAm parimARAdO ca nAtivyAptiH (nIla0 gu0 pf0 39) iti. viSezaguRASca zoqaSa rUpam rasaH ganDaH sparSaH sAMsidDikadravatvam snehaH SabdaH budDiH suKam duHKam icCA dvezaH prayatnaH DarmaH aDarmaH BAvanA ceti (BA0 pa0 gu0 lo0 9192). [Ka] BAvanAnyo yo vAyuvfttivfttisparSAvfttiDarmasamavAyI tadanyatve sati gurutvAjaladravatvAnyaguRatvam. atratyapadAnAM prayojanAni kaTyante. jAtyAdAvativyAptivAraRAya gurutvAjaletyAdi viSezyadalam. gurutvanEmittikadravatvayorvAraRAya gurutva ityAdi. sAMsidDikadravatvasaMgrahAya ajala iti. saMyogAdivAraRAya satyantaM dalam. BAvanAyAmavyAptivAraRAyAdyam anyAntaM satyantaGawakasamavAyiviSezaRam. sattAdikamAdAyAsaMBavavAraRAya sparSasaMgrahAya ca sparSAvftti iti (di0 gu0 pf0 193).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0787" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशेषणम्
viSezaRam — 1 viSezaRatAvat. viSezaRatA ca dviviDA. tatra praTamA yaTA GawABAvavadBUtalamityatra GawABAve viSezaRatA. iyaM viSezaRatA ca svarUpasaMbanDarUpaH<BR>;p{0788}<BR>saMnikarzaviSezaH (nIla0 1 pf0 19) (mU0 ma0 1). iyamaBAvapratyakze heturBavati iti Dyeyam. yaTA GawABAvavadBUtalam iti cAkzuzapratyakze hetuBUto BUtAMSe GawABAvasya viSezaRatArUpaH saMnikarzaH. atra aBAvasya svoparaktabudDijanakatvaM yatsvarUpam tadeva viSezaRatvam iti jYeyam (ta0 BA0 pf0 20). sA ca viSezaRatA punaH dviviDA indriyaviSezaRatA indriyasaMnikfzwaviSezaRatA ca. AdyayA SabdABAvo gfhyate. antyayA BUtalAdO GawABAvo gfhyate (nyA0 ma0 1). svarUpasaMbanDAvacCinnADeyatArUpA veyaM viSezaRatA (nIla0 1 pf0 18). yaTA nEyAyikamate viSezaRatayA samavAyasya pratyakzam ityAdO viSezaRatA. vESezikamate tu samavAyo na pratyakza ityanyat. dvitIyA viSezaRatA yaTA nIlo Gawa ityAdO nIlatve viSezaRatA. iyaM viSezaRatA tu prakAratAKyo vizayatAviSezaH. aTa vA tatpadajanyaboDavizayatvena Saktivizayatvam (di0 4). yaTA daRqavAn puruzostItyAdO daRqasya viSezaRatA. atredamaDikaM vijYeyam. viSezaRatAvacCedakaM tu viSezaRe yadviSezaRam tat (mu0). yaTA daRqavAnpuruza ityatra daRqatvaM viSezaRatAvacCedakam iti. atra vyutpattiH viSizyate Bidyate anena (lyuw) iti viSezaRam Bedakam. vyAvartakam prakAro vA viSezaRaM Bavati. tatra pratyAyyavyAvfttyaDikaraRatAvacCedakaM vyAvartakam. samudAyArTastu yadvyAvfttyaDikaraRatAvacCedakaM tadeva tatra viSezaRam iti. vyAvfttiranyonyABAvaH (mu0 ma0 1 pf0832). daRqI puruzaH iti jYAnAnantaraM daRqavatyadaRqavyAvfttiravagamyate iti pratyAyyavyAvfttyaDikaraRatA puruzasya daRqenAvacCidyate iti daRqo viSezaRam. tadAhurAcAryAH sadasadvA samAnADikaraRaM vyavacCedakaM viSezaRam (ci0 1 pf0 834) iti. aTa vA vivakzitAnvayapratiyogitAvacCedakam. yaTA daRqinamAnayetyAdO daRqo viSezaRam. yadanvitatayA jYAta eva viSezye tAtparyavizayetarAnvayaDIH tadvyavacCedakam. viSezyAnvayinA yasyAvaSyamanvayaH tadavacCedakam. yadvyAvartakaM viSezyAnvayinAnvIyate tat. tAtparyavizayAnvayapratiyogI DarmaH. uddeSyAnv