vfttiH — 1 [ka] SAbdaboDa hetupadArTopasTityanukUlaH padapadArTayoH saMbanDaH (ci0 4) (mu0 4 pf0 174). sA ca padavfttiH ityucyate iti vijYeyam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 2). atra vfttitvaM ca SaktilakzaRAnyataratvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 34). pare tu SAbdaboDajanakapadapadArTasaMbanDatvam ityAhuH (la0 ma0 sPowa 0 pf0 13). atredaM boDyam. vfttistAtparyanirvAhikA Bavati. tAtparyaM cAtra triviDam Otsargikam ApavAdikam niyataM ceti. tatrAdyam Sakti kalpayati. yaTA. GawAdipadaprayoktarutsargato GawAdAveva tAtparyamasti iti tasya tatra SaktiH. dvitIyam lakzaRAM kalpayati. yaTA gaNgApadasya muKyArTAnvayabADe tIrAdOH tAtparyagraho Bavati iti tasya tatra lakzaRA. tftIyam nirUQilakzaRAM kalpayati. nirUQalAkzaRikasyAnupapattijYAnamantarApi lakzye tAtparyagrahaniyamAttatra nirUQilakzaRA. yaTA kawaM karotItyAdO kawaSabdasya kawAvayave. kawasya sidDatve karaRaM na saMBavati asidDe ca karmatvaM na itiH anupapattijYAnavirahepi kawAvayavAn kawavattayA karoti iti tato boDAt. aTa vA vahnimAnDUmAdityAdO hetupade tajjYAne nirUQilakzaRA (ma0pra0<BR>;p{0797}<BR>Ka0 4 pf0 4042). SAbdikamate vfttyA saMskAro janyate. saMskArakalpikA ca vfttismftiH SAbdabudDireva vA iti jYeyam (la0 ma0 sPowa0 pf0 2). [Ka] SaktilakzaRAnyatarAtmakaH saMbanDaH (mu0 4) (di0 4 pf0 174) (nyA0 vA0). yaTA Gawapadasya kambugrIvAdimatyarTe vfttiH (SaktiH). [ga] SAbdikAstu SAbdaboDaprayojakastattadarTanirUpitaH SabdaDarmaH ityAhuH (la0 ma0 sPowa 0 pf0 2). nyAyamate vfttirdviviDA saMketaH lakzaRA ceti (ga0 Sakti 0) (tarkA 0 4 pf0 10). prakArAntareRa vfttirdviviDA muKyA gORI ca tatrAdyA SabdaSaktiH. sEva saMketa ityucyate. dvitIyA tu lakzaRA iti. prAcInaSAbdikamate yogAdiBedAt zaqviDA SabdavfttiH. vfttiBedAcca SabdaBedaH. taduktam yOgiko yogarUQaSca SabdaH syAdOpacArikaH. muKyo lAkzaRiko gORaH SabdaH zoQA nigadyate.. (ma0pra0 4 pf0 4142) iti. lakzitalakzaRApi vfttyantaram iti prAno nEyAyikA AhuH. sA ca lakzitalakzaRA jahallakzaREva nAtiriktA vfttiH iti navyA AhuH. vyaYjanAKyaM tftIyamapi vfttyantaramEcCannAlaMkArikAH SAbdikASca. taduktam vAcyorToBiDayA voDyo lakzyo lakzaRayA mataH. vyaNgayo vyaYjanayA tAH syustisraH Sabdasya vfttayaH.. (sA0 da0 pari02 lo0 0 11) iti. tatra vyaNgayorTo yaTA - gacCa gacCasi cetkAnta panTAnaH santu te SuBAH. mamApi janma tatrEva BUyAdyatra gato BavAn.. ityAdO vyaYjanayA vfttyA priyAyA maraRam. atra he priya tava gamanottaraM me prARaviyogo Bavizyati ato na gantavyam ityarTo vyajyate. nEyAyikAstu gacCasi ityukteH mA gAH iti tAtparyamunnIyate saMBAvyate vA na tu mA gAH iti nirRIyate iti kftaM vfttyantareRa ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf017). atra aDikaM tu vyaYjanASabda vyAKyAne dfSyam. gORIM vfttyantaramEcCanmImAMsakAH. yaTA agnirmARavakaH ityAdO mARavakegnisAdfSyaboDAdrORI vfttyantarameva (si0 ca0 4 pf0 31). yaTA vA yajamAnaH prastaraH ityAdO yajamAnaSabdaH svArTanizWayAgasADakatvarUpaguRayogAt<BR>;p{0798}<BR>prastare prayukto yajamAna kAryakAraRatvena prastaramupasTApayati. yaTA vA siMho mARavakaH ityAdO siMhaSabdaH svArTanizwacApalyAdiguRayogAnmARavakaM tena rUpeRopasTApayati. taTA ca tanmate SaktilakzaRAByAmatiriktEtra gORI vfttiH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 41). Sakyasya sAkzAtsaMbanDa eva lakzaRA na tu paraMparAsaMbanDarUpA. tena gaNgAyAM GozaH ityatra tIre Sakyasya pravAhasyeva agnirmARavakaH ityAdO mARavake SakyasyAgneH sAkzAtsaMbanDo na saMBavati iti sAdfSyAtmakasya paraMparAsaMbanDasyAtiriktavfttitvamaNgIkartavyam iti mImAMsakAnAmaBiprAyaH. nEyAyikAstu tanna sahante. Sakyasya sAkzAtsaMbanDasyeva paraMparAsaMbanDasyApi lakzaRAtvasvIkAre kzativirahAdgORyA na vfttyantaratvam. taTA ca agnirmARavakaH ityAda lakzyamARaguRasaMbanDarUpA lakzaREva (vedA0 pa0). tadarTaSca lakzyamARo yo guRaH SucitvAdiH tatsaMbanDarUpA iti. taTA ca agnirmARavakaH ityAdI SakyasyAgneH svanizWaSucitvavattva saMbanDa eva lakzaRA (nIla0 4 pf0 30). vAkyArTaboDane tAtparyAKyAM vfttimaNgI cakruraBihitAnvayavAdinaH tArkikAH. tezAmayamASayaH. aBiDAyA ekEkapadArTaboDena viramAt vAkyArTarUpasya padArTAnvayasya boDikA tAtparyAKyA vfttiraNgIkartavyA. taduktam tAtparyAKyAM vfttimAhuH padArTAnvayaboDane (sA0 da0 u0 2 Slo0 20) iti. 2 saMnikarzaH. 3 jYAnam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 3) 4 ADeyatvam. yaTA BUtalavfttirGawaH ityAdO Gawe BUtalADeyatvam. yaTA vA sidDAntasidDavyAptisvarUpe nirUpaRIye hetumati nizWA vfttiryasya sa taTA virahaH aBAvaH ityAdO vfttiSabdasyArTa ADeyatvam (mu0 2 pf0 140). 5 ADeyatAvAn. yaTA tatra vfttiryaH aBAvaH ityAdO. yaTA vA sapakzastatra vfttitvajYAnAdanumitirBaveta (BA0 pa0 2 Slo. 71) ityAdO vfttiSabdasyArTa ADeyatAvAn. 6 vEyAkaraRAstu nigrahavAkyArTI - BiDAnam parArTABiDAnaM vA vfttiH (mahABA0). yaTA rAjYaH puruza ityatra rAjapuruzaH iti samAso vfttiH. tASca vfttayaH kfttadDitasamAsEkaSeza sanAdyantaDAtavaH paYca ityAhuH. parArTABiDAnamityasyArTastu parasya SabdasyopasarjanArTakasya yatra SabdAntareRa praDAnArTakapadenArTABiDAnaM<BR>;p{0799}<BR>viSezaRatvena grahaRam sA vfttiH. aTa vA parArTasya praDAnArTasyApraDAnapadEryatra svArTaviSezyatvena grahaRaM sA vfttiH. rAjapuruza ityatra puruzapadena vAkyAvasTAyAmanAskanno rAjArTo rAjapadena vA puruzArTa Askandyate. tatsaMvalitaH svArTa upasTApyata iti yAvat (la0 ma0 vfttini0 pf0 8). atredaM vijYeyam. vfttivizayaM samarTaH padaviDiH (pARi0 2. 1. 1) iti sUtram. sAmarTyaM cAtrEkArTIBAvaH. pfTagarTAnAmekArTIBAvaH sAmarTyam. rAjYaH puruzaH iti vAkye pfTagarTAni padAni rAjapuruzaH iti samAse ekArTAni iti BAzyAt. evaM ca yatkicitpada janya pfTagupasTiti vizayArTakatvena lokadfzwAnAM viSizwavizayEkaSaktyEkopasTitijanakatvamekArTIBAvaH iti Palitam (la0 ma0 vfttivicA0 pf0 1) (kASikA 2. 1. 1). 7 sAMKyAstu mahadAdInAmindriyARAM ca vyApAro vfttiH. yaTA aDyabasAyo (budDervfttiH) budDiH (sAM0 sU0 2. 13) ityAdI ityAhuH. tatroktam rUpAdizu paYcAnAmAlocanamAtramizyate vfttiH. vacanAdAnaviharaRotsargAnandASca paYcAnAm.. (sAMKya 0 kA 0 Slo0 28) ityAdi. atra yogaSAstrapravartakaH pataYjaliH sUtrayAmAsa vfttayaH paYcatayyaH klizwA aklizwAH. pramARaviparyayavikalpanidrAsmftayaH (yogasU0 1. 6-7) iti. 8 antaHkaraRapariRAmo vfttiH iti mAyAvAdino vedAntina AhuH. antaHkaraRavftteH svarUpaprayojanAdikaM yaTA. yaTA taqAgodakaM CidrAnnirgatya kulyAtmanA kedArAn praviSya tadvadeva catuzkoRAdyAkAraM Bavati taTA tEjasamantaHkaraRamapi cakzurAdidvArA GawAdivizayadeSaM gatvA GawAdivizayAkAreRa pariRamate. sa eva pariRAmo vfttiH ityucyate. anumityAdisTale tu nAntaHkaraRasya vahnayAdideSagamanam. vahnayAdeScakzurAdyasaMnikarzAt. indriyajanyavfttiScAvaraRaBaNgArTA saMbanDArTA iti matadvEDama (vedA0pa0 pari0 7). 9 sAhityaSAstrajYAstu nAwakAdO racanAviSezo vfttiH. sA ca kESikI sAttvatI BAratI AraBawI ityevaM caturviDA ityAhuH. taduktam SfNgAre kESikI vIre sAttvatyAraBawI punaH. rase rOdre ca vIBatse vfttiH sarvatra BAratI.. catasro vfttayo hyetAH sarvanAwyasya mAtfkAH (sA0 da0 pari0 6 Slo0 122, 123) (pratAparudre0 praka0 2<BR>;p{0800}<BR>pf0 8-9) iti. 10 vyavahAraSAstrajYAstu jIvikA vfttiH ityAhuH. vfttiharaRe nindA dfSyate svadattAM paradattAM vA brahmavftti harettu yaH. sa kftaGna iti jYeyaH PalaM tacCfRu BUmipa.. yAvanto reRavaH siktA viprARAM netravinduBiH. tAvadvarzasahasraM ca GftapAke sa tizWati.. (brahmavE0 pra0 a0 49) ityAdi. 11 sTitiH. 12 vivaraRaM ceti kAvyajYA AhuH. 13 paYcamalalaGUkaraRArTaM mAnAmAnaviroDinonnArjanopAyA vfttayo BEkzyotsfzwayaTAlabDABiDAH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 164 naku0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0796" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तिनियामकसंबन्धः
vfttiniyAmakasaMbanDaH — (saMbanDaH) aviSizwavyAvfttaviSizwaDIniyAmakaH saMbanDaH (ci0 KaRqa 0 1 samavAyavAdaH pf0 652). ADAratvA (DeyatvAnyatarAvacCedakaH iti yAvat. yaTA GawavadBUtalam ityAdo GawaBUtalayoH saMyogo vfttiniyAmakaH. yaTA vA guRakriyAjAtiviSizwabudDO vizayIBUtaH samavAyo vfttiniyAmakaH (ci0 1 pf0 651). vfttiniyAmakasaMbanDASca saMyogasamavAya svarUpakAlikaMdE SikaviSezaRatAdayaH. etadvyatiriktAstu vfttyaniyAmakA boDyAH. te ca gaganAdisaMyogANgulidvayasaMyogakuRqabadarasaMyogavizayatvavizayitvAnuyogitvapratiyogitvanirUpakatva- nirUpyatvatAdAtmyAdayonantA eva. atredaM voDyam. prAcInAH vfttyaniyAmakasaMbanDasyApyaBAvapratiyogitAvacCedakatvaM svIkurvanti. taTA hi. Danena kulamityAdO kule Danasya hetutvam. viprAya gAM dadAtItyAdO gavi dvijasya saMpradAnatvam. vfkzAtparRa patatItyAdO patane vfkzasyApAdAnatvam. vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO DUmena vahnirityAdO vA vahnO DUmasya jYApakatvam. cEtrasya DanamityAdO Dane cEtrasya svAmitvam. BUnale Gawa ityAdO Gawe BUtalasyADikaraRatvam. ityAdipratItyA nirUpakatvasyApi saMbanDasya kvacidvfttiniyAmakatvamAvaSyakam. na hi kulAdinirUpitaM hetutvAdikameva DanAdinizWatvena tAsu BAsate. DanAdinizwahetutvAdeH saMbanDaviSezeRa nirUpakatvAdinA kulAdivfttitAyA apyanuBAvakatvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 93 pf0 121). taTA ca sati naYasamaBivyAhArasTale na Danena kulamityAdo pratiyogya BAvAntrayO tulyayogakzemO iti nyAyena.<BR>;p{0801}<BR>nirUpakatvasaMbanDAvacCinna pratiyogitAkaDananizWahetutvAdyaBAvaH kulAdO pratIyate. viprAya gAM na dadAti ityAdO nirUpakatva saMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogitAkadvijanizWasaMpradAnatvABAvo gavi pratIyate iti. evamagrepyUhyam. navyAstu tanna svIkurvanti. pUrvoktasTalezu janyatvasaMpradeyatvAdikameva tftIyArTaH. taTA ca svarUpasaMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogiko DanajanyatvAdyaBAva eva tatra pratIyate (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 1) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0800" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृथाचेष्टा
vfTAcezwA — svakartavyatAprayojakecCAvizaye svarUpAyogyakarma (mU0 ma01). yaTA vfTAcezwAM na kurvIta ityAdO svargoddeSena kftaM cEtyavandanaM vfTAcezwA. vfdDiH- 1 [ka] kAraRatrato dravyasyAvayavopacayaH. avarData gOriti (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 59). [Ka] avayavopacayaH (di0 1). 2 AkAra EkAra OkAra ete trayo varRA vfdDiH iti SAbdikA vadanti. 3 vyavahArajYAstu uttamarRasya svadattadravyamapekzyADamarRA kAritoDikalABo (vyAja baqi suda) vfdDiH ityAhuH. atroktaM nAradena vfdDiScaturviDA proktA paYcaDAnyEH prakIrtitA. zaqviDAnyEH samAKyAtA tattvatastAM niboData.. kAyikA kAlikA cEtra cakravfdDiratoparA. kAritA saSiKA vfdDirBogalABastaTEva ca.. (vIramitro0 a0 2 fRAdAna0 pf0 294) iti. vArDuzike aSItiBAgo vfdDiH syAt iti puruzArTacintAmaRiH (pf0 28). 4 jananASOcam. vfdDirnAma putrajanmAdinimittopalakzitaH kAlaH (pu0 ci0 pf0 377). 5 Bizajastu OzaDiviSezaH. 6 romaviSezaSca ityAhuH (BAvapra0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0801" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

