वेगः
vegaH — 1 (guRaH saMskAraH) [ka] vegatvajAtimAn (ta0 dI0 gu0) (ta0 kO0). lakzaRaM ca kriyAjanyatve sati kriyAjanakatvam. atra gurutvAdivAraRAya satyantaM dalaM dattam. viBAgAdivAraRAya viSezyadalaM dattam iti jYeyam. aTa vA mUrtamAtravfttitAvacCedakasaMskAraviBAjakopADimattvam (vAkya 0 gu0 pf0 2122) (BA0 pa0) (ta0 BA0). 101<BR>;p{0802}<BR>tIkzRagatijanakaguRatvam iti kaScidAha (la0 0). [Ka] dvitIyapatanAsamavAyikAraRam (si0 ca0 gu0 pf0 35). atra praTamapatanasyAsamavAyikAraRaM tu gurutvameva iti tadAsAya dvitIyapadam. [ga] dvitIyAdikriyA hetuH (pra0 pra0) (ta0 dI0). [Ga] karmajaH saMskAraH. yaTA yazwyagre ca samaM sTito DvajapawaH prAnte ca vegAnilAt (vikramorva0 114) ityAdO vegaH. sa ca vego mUrtamAtravfttiH (pra0 pra0) (BA0 pa0) (ta0 saM0) (ta0 kO0). atra BAzyam vego mUrtimatsu paYcasu dravyezu nimittaviSezApekzAtkarmaRo jAyate. niyata dikakriyAprabanDahetuH sparSavadravyasaMyogaviroDI. kvacit kAraRaguRapUrvaprakrameRotpadyate (praSasta0 2 guRa0 pf0 53) iti. vego dviviDaH karmajaH vegajaSca. tatrAdyaH SarAdO nodanajanitena karmaRA jAyamAno vegaH prasidDaH. tena ca pUrvakarmanASaH. tata uttarakarma. evamapi. vegaM vinA karmaRaH karmapratibanDakatvAt pUrvakarmanASa uttarakarmotpattiSca na syAt (mu0 gu0 pf0 232) iti. vegajo vegastu vegavatkapAlajanyaGawe prasidDaH (BA0 pa0 lo0 159) (mu0) (si0 ca0 gu0 pf0 35) (ta0 va0 pf0 230). mImAMsakAstu nirantaro gatisaMtAna eva vega ityAhuH (pa0 mA0). tanna sahante nEyAyikAH. vegopi guRAntaram na kriyAsaMtatimAtram. mandagatO vegapratItyaBAvAta. kriyAkzaRAnAmASutpAdanimitto vegavyavahAra iti cenna. alAtacakrAdizu kriyAkzaRAnAM nirantarotpAdavyayavatAM pratyekamantarAgrahaRenASUtpAdasya pratyakzeRApratIteH. vegapratyayasya ca BAvAt. vyaktA ca loke kriyAvegayorBedAvagatiH. vegena gacCati iti pratIteH (nyA0 ka0 sADarmya 0 pf0 22) (di0 gu0 pf0 233). 2 SArIrakaSAstrajYA Bizajastu mUtravizWAdiniHsAraRayatnaH ityAhuH. atra prasaNgata udAhriyate svaBAvataH pravfttAnAM malAdInAM jijIvizuH. na vegaM DArayedvIraH kAmAdInAM ca DArayet.. (rAjani0) iti. 3 samUhaH iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0801" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदः
vedaH — 1 (SabdaH) [ka] lOkikavAkyaBinnavAkyam (ku0wI0 5), tacca jYAnasADanaM DarmabrahmapratipAdakaM SAstram mantrabrahmARaBedena dviviDaM ca.<BR>;p{0803}<BR>tacca svataH pramARam. atra sUtram trEvidyavfdDAnAM tu vedAH pramARamiti nizWA (Apasta0 sU0 229. 3. 9) iti. mantrAyurvedaprAmARyavacca tatprAmARyamAptaprAmARyAt (gO0 2. 1. 68) iti ca. KataH prAmARyaM ca pramARAntarAnaDInapramitijanakatvam. vedasya svataH prAmARyavyavasTApanaM tu DarmabrahmamImAMsAdO tatra tatrAcAryEH kftam vistaraBayAttannAtra saMgfhItam. kiM ca tadvedavAkyam anekavidyADarmasTAnam devatiryaNmanuzyavarRASramAdipraviBAgahetuBUtaM ca. yaTA agnimILe purohitam (fgve0) ize tvorje tva (yajurve0) agna AyAhi vItaye (sAmave 0) SaM no devIraBizwaya Apo Bavantu. pItaye (aTarvave0) ityAdi. vedatvaM ca vijAtIyaDarmajanakADyayanapratiyogitvam (ku0 wI0 5). aTa vA SabdatadupajIvipramARAtiriktapramARajanyapramityavizayArTakatve sati SabdajanyavAkyArTajYAnAjanyapramARaSabdatvam (ku0 wI0 5) (ci0 4) (va0 u0 6. 1. 1) (vE0 vi0 6. 1. 1). atra lakzaRadozaM vArayati ISvarapramAyA ajanyatvAt vedArTasyAnumAnavizayatvepyanumAnAdervedopajIvakatayA smftInAM BAratAdiBAgasya ca vedasamAnArTakatvepi SabdajanyaDIjanyatvAt vedAdarTaM pratItyEva tatpraRayanAt (ci0 4). aTa vA fgyajuHsAmATarvAnyatamatvam (vE0 vi0 6. 1. 1). apUrvArTapratipAdakatve sati nityasarvajYapraRItavAkyatvaM vA vedatvaM ca aKaRqopADiH iti prAYca AhuH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 66) [Ka] apOruzeyaM vAkyaM vedaH iti mImAMsakAH pratipedire (lO0 BA0 pf0 13) (sarva0 pf0 270 jEmi0). vedasya nityatvenApOruzeyatvam. tatra pramARaM tu vAcA virUpanityayA iti SrutiH. yo brahmARaM vidaDAti pUrvam yo vE vedASca prahiRoti tasmE (ve0 6. 18) iti ca SrutiH. nAciketamupAKyAnaM mftyuproktaH sanAtanam. anAdiniDanA nityA vAgutsfzwA svayaMBuvA iti smftiH (pra0 ca0 pari0 1 pf041) (mAGa 0 BAzya 0) (SAba0 BA0 111123). apOruzeyatvaM tu pramARAntareRArTamupalaBya viracitaM yat tadBinnatvam iti cintyam. atra SaNkate jEminirAcAryaH vedAMScEke saMnikarzaM puruzAKyAH (jEmi0 a0 1 pA0 1 sU0 27) iti. tadarTastu puruzeRa hi samAKyAyante<BR>;p{0804}<BR>vedAH. kAWakaM kAlApakam pEppalAdakaM mOhulakam (SAba0 BA0 1. 1. 27) iti. aTa vA tattacCAKAkartftvena puruzA AKyAyante kAWakam kOTumam tEttirIyam iti. atra samADatte uktaM tu SabdapUrvatvam. AKyA pravacanAt (jEmi0 1. 1. 2930) iti - tadarTastu vedAnAM prAcInatvam upADyAyapravacanarUpasaMpradAyapravartakatvena samAKyA iti. punaH SaNkate anityadarSanAcca (jEmi0 1. 1. 28) iti. tadarTastu jananamaraRavantaSca vedArTAH SrUyante babaraH prAvAhaRirakAmayata kusuruvinda OddAlakirakAmayata ityevamAdayaH. uddAlakasyApatyaM gamyata OddAlakiH iti (SA0 BA0 1. 1. 28). atra samADatte paraM tu SrutisAmAnyamAtram (jEmi0 1. 1. 31) iti. tadarTastu babaraDvaniyuktapravahaRasvaBAvo vAyureva. na tu pravahaRanAmakaH puruzaH. asidDatvAt (SAba 0 BA0 1. 1. 31) iti. nEyAyikAstu vedasyeSvarakartfkatvaM manyante. tatkartftve pramARamanumAnam. tacca vedaH pOruzeyo vAkyatvAdBAratAdivat iti (ci0 4) (sarva0 pf0 270 jEmi0). asminnanumAne SrUyamARakartfkatvaM smaryamARakartfkatvaM copADimudBAvayanti mImAMsakAdayaH. tanna sahante nEyAyikAH. atratyavizaya starkaSAstrAdO drazwavyaH ityalamatiprasaNgena. atra pOruzeyatvaM ca puruzADInotpattikatvam (vedAntapa0 Agamapari0 pf0 54). varRAnAmanityatvAdeva vedasyApyanityatvam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 13). vedasyeSvarakartfkatve mAnaM ca viDireva tAvadgarBa iva SrutikumAryAH puMyoge mAnam ityAcAryAH prAhuH (ki0 va0 1. 1 pf0 39) (mu0 gu0) (ta0 kO0 4). anye tvAhuH. vedavAkyAnAM budDimatkartfkatve itarabADAt ISvarakartfkatvaM setsyati (ta0 va0) iti. atra sUtrARi budDipUrvA vAkyakftirvede (vE0 6. 1. 1) budDipUrvo dadAtiH (vE0 6. 1. 3) ityAdIni. atrAyaM BAvaH. vedavAkyaracanA vaktfyaTArTavAkyArTajYAnapUrvI vAkyaracanAtvAt nadItIre paYca PalAni santi ityasmadAdivAkyaracanAvat ityanumAnam. na ca asmadAdibudDipUrvakatvenAnyaTAsidDiH. svargakAmo yajeta ityAdAvizwasADanatAyAH kAryatAyA<BR>;p{0805}<BR>vAsmadAdibudDyagocaratvAt. tena svatantrapuruzapUrvakatvaM vede sidDyati (vE0 u0 6. 1. 1) (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 68) iti. kiM ca vedasyAprAmARyaSaNkAnivAraRamapi kftam na karmakartfsADanavEguRyAt (gO0 2. 1. 58) iti. evaM ca paramAptasarvajYeSvarapraRItatvena vedasya prAmARyaM sidDyati iti. [ga] kecidvedAntinastu apOruzeyatve sati samayabalena parokzAnuBavasADanaM vedaH ityAhuH (mADa0 BAzya 0). atra pOruzeyatvaM ca sajAtIyoccAraRAnapekzoccAraRavizayatvam. tAdfSoccAraRajAtIyatvaM vA. taTA ca sargAdyakAle parameSvaraH prARinAM BogaBUtaye lIlAvigrahaM parigfhya pUrvasargasidDavedAnupUrvIsamAnAnupUrvIkaM vedaM viracitavAn na tu tadvijAtIyaM vedam iti na pOruzeyatvaM vedasya. BAratAdInAM tu sajAtIyoccAraRamanapekzyEvoccAraRam iti tezAM pOruzeyatvam (vedAntapa0 Agamapari0 pf055) (maTurAnA0) iti. vedasyeSvarakartfkatve pramARam asya mahato BUtasya niHSvasitametadyadfgvedo yajurvedaH (bf0 2. 4. 10) tasmAdyajYAtsarvahuta fcaH sAmAni jajYire. CandAMsi jajYire tasmAdyajustasmAdajAyata iti ca. idaM sarvamasfjata fco yajUMzi sAmAni iti tepAnAtrayo vedA ajAyanta iti ca. paraM tu fgveda evAgnerajAyata yajurvedo vAyoH sAmaveda AdityAt ityAdiSruteH ISvarasyAmyAdiprerakatvena nirmAtftvaM gamyate. atra pratimanvantaraM cEzA SrutiranyABiDIyate ityAgamopi drazwavyaH (ci0 4). atrAnyetyasya tadBinnA tatsadfSI ityarTaH. tena pUrvamanvantarasTatvaM niziDyate. pratyekaM mantrabrAhmaRavanto vedAScatvAraH fgvedaH yajurvedaH sAmavedaH aTarvavedaSceti. tatra fgvedasya SAkalAdayo daSa BedAH (SAKAH) Bavanti. yajurvedasya carakAdayaH zaqaSItirBedA Bavanti. tatra vAjasaneyAnAM jAbAlAdayaH saptadaSa BedA Bavanti. tEttirIyARAM dviBedA Bavanti OkzyAH KARqikeyASceti. tatra KARqikeyAnAM paYca BedA Bavanti. ApastambI bODAyanI satyAzAQI (hiraRyakeSI) BAradvAjI vADUlI ceti. sAmavedasya kila sahasraM BedA Asan rARAyanIyAH kOTumAH ityAkadayaH (1000). atroktam anaDyAyezvaDIyAnAste SatakratuzaSreRA.<BR>;p{0806}<BR>tu BihatAH pranazwAH (vAca0) iti. aTarvavedasya pEppalAdayo nava BedA Bavanti iti. vedANgAni zaw SikzA kalpaH vyAkaraRam niruktam CandaH jyotizaM ceti (Apasta0 sU0 2. 4. 8. 11). upANgAni tu catvAri purARanyAyamImAMsADarmaSAstrARi iti. yUpalakzaRaCAgalakzaRA diBedenAzwAdaSa pariSizwAni yajuzaH. sarvezAM vedAnAmupavedA Bavanti. tatra fgvedasyAyurveda upavedaH yajurvedasya DanurvedaH sAmavedasya gAnDarvavedaH aTarvavedasya SastraSAstrARi Bavanti iti. aTarvavedasya sTApatyam (arTaSAstram) upavedaH ityapi pAWo granTAntare dfSyate. fgvedasyAtreyaM gotraM vAsudevaM vidurbuDAH. kASyapaM ca yajurvedaM rudradevaM tu taM viduH. sAmavedopi gotreRa BAradvAjaH puraMdaram. aDidevaM vijAnIyAt vEtAnaM tu aTarvaRaH.. iti. SizwaM tu vizRupurARe (aMSa0 3 a0 5 - 6) drazwavyam. atredaM vijYeyam. vedasya CinnamUlagranTatayA ucCinnatvepi avigItaSizwAcArAdeva tadanumAnam. pralaye pUrvasmftyAcArayorucCedAt sargAdO nityasarvajYeSvarapraRItavedamUlatvaM smftyAcArayoH (ci0 4) iti. atra punarapi SrutInAM nityatvasvataHprAmARyeSvaroccaritatvAdO pramARayanti sa paryagAcCukramakAyamavraRam (I0 8). yaTemAM vAcaM kalyARIm (yajuH). yo brahmARaM vidaDAti pUrvam yo vE vedAMSca prahiRoti tasmE. taM ha devamAtmabudDiprakASaM mumukzurvE SaraRamahaM prapadye (ve0 6. 18). ata eva nityatvam (bra0 sU0 1. 3. 29). uktaM tu SabdapUrvatvam (jE0 sU0 1. 1. 29). nijaSaktyaBivyakteH svataH prAmARyam (sAMKyasU0 5. 51). yugAntentahitAn vedAn setihAsAnmaharzayaH. leBire tapasA pUrvamanujYAtAH svayaMBuvA (smftiH). tadvacanAdAnnAyasya prAmARyam (vE0 1. 1. 3) (10. 2. 9) ityAdIni. catvAropi vedAH pratyekaM dviDA mantraH brAhmaRaM ceti. tatra pramARam mantrabrAhmaRayorvedanAmaDeyam (bODA 0 sU0) (Apastamba 0) iti. tatra fgvedasyEtareya brAhmaRam yajurvedasya tEttirIyaSatapaTabrAhmaRe. sAmavedasya gopaTabrAhmaRam. aTarvavedasya tARqya brAhmaRam iti. brAhmaRaM triDA viDivacanam arTavAdavacanam anuvAdavacanaM ceti<BR>;p{0807}<BR>(gO0) (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 62) (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 62). mImAMsakAtu viDimantranAmaDeyanizeDArTavAdaBedAtpaYcaviDo vedaH ityAhuH (lO0 BA0 pf0 12). sAMKyAstvitTaM vadanti. na nityatvaM vedAnAm. kAryatvaSruteH (sAMKya0 sU0 5. 45). sa tapotapyata (tE0 2. 6. 1) tasmAttapaste - pAnAtrayo vedA ajAyanta iti SruteSca. vedanityatAvAkyAni ca sajAtIyAnupUrvI pravAhAnucCedaparARi iti (sAM0 BA0 5. 45 pf0 182). atrAyaM viSezo jYeyaH. ArzaM Cando dEvataM ca viniyogastaTEva ca. veditavyaM prayatnena brAhmaRena viSezataH. aviditvA tu yaH kuryAdyajanADyayanaM japam. homamantarjale dAnaM tasya cAlpaPalaM Bavet.. (yAjYava 0) (vA0) ityAdiH. 2 vizRuH (vizRusaM0). 3 jYAnam. SAstrIyajYAnaM vA. 4 SAstroktaM caritram (medi 0). 5 darBamuzwikftaH padArTaviSezaH. yaTA vedaM kftvA vediM kuryAt (SrutiH) ityAdO. 6 jYApakam. atrArTe vyAkaraRam vedayati vid Ric ac vedaH iti. 7 jYAtA. yaTA vedosi yena tvaM deveByo vedoBavastena mahyaM vedo BUyAH ityAdO (yajuH 0 2. 21). atra karkaBAzyam patnI vedaM pramuYcati vedosi iti. he kuSamuzwinirmita padArTa tvaM vedosi fgAdyAtmakosi. yadvA vettIti vedaH. jYAtAsi. deveByo devAnAM vedoBavo jYApakoBUH iti (vAca0)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0802" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

