वेदान्तः
vedAntaH — vedaSiroBAgo brahmapratipAdaka upanizadrUpo granTaviSezaH. yaTA Etareya brahmavallI nArAyaRa ISa bfhadAraRyaka CAndogya praSna mARqUkya ityAdaya upanizadaH. vedAnta uttaramImAMsA iti vyavahniyate. karmakARqAnantaravicAryatvAt iti jYeyam. atra vyutpattiH vedAnAM fgAdInAm antaScaramaBAgaH<BR>;p{0808}<BR>iti vedAnAmanto nirRayo yatra saH iti vA vedAntaH. atra upanizadarTanirRAyakatvena brahmasUtrARAmapi vedAntatvamupacaryate iti vijYeyam. atredaM boDyam. SrIpUrRa prajYAcAryEH (maDvAcAryEH) viracitAdBAzyAtprAk brahmasUtrARAM vyAKyAtAra ekaviMSatisaMKyakA Asan. te ca BAratI vijayaH 1 saMvidAnandaH 2 brahmaGozaH 3 SatAnandaH 4 udDataH 5 vijayaH 6 rudraBawwaH 7 vAmanaH 8 yAdavaprakASaH 9 rAmAnujaH 10 BartfprapaYcaH 11 draviqaH (SaWakopaH) 12 brahmadattaH 13 BAskaraH 14 piSAcaH 15 vfttikAraH (bODAyanaH) 16 vijayaBawwaH 17 vizRukrAntaH 18 vAdIndraH 19 mADavadAsaH 20 SaMkaraBAratI 21 (maDvavija 0) iti. tataH pUrRaprajYAcAryaH 22 rAGavendrasvAmI 23 vallaBAcArya 24 veti. tatra SaMkaraBAratI rudrasya maRimato vAvatAraH. tasta janma vikramaSAke 845 varze keraladeSe kAlapI (kAlaqI) grAme mAtApitfByAmAryAmbASivaBawwAKyAByAmaBUt. tasya dESikAcAryo govindaBawwaH. paramagururgOqapAdaH. gOqapAdasya tu vakkanAmA bOdDo guruH. SaMkaraBAratyA aDyApako brahmadattaH. mataM tu mAyAvAdaH iti. rAmAnujasya ca SezAvatAratvABimatasya janma SAke 1049 varze coladeSe BUtapuryAM premaDulAKyAyAM (peraMbudUra iti grAme) mAtApitfByAM kAntimatI keSavAKyAByAM samajani. etasyADyApakastu mAtulo yAdavaprakASa eva. mataM viSizwAdvEtam. viSizwAdvEta matapravartakaH kUwasTastu SaWakopAcAryaH iti. vAyoravatArasya maDvAKyapUrRaprajYAcAryasya ca janma SAke 1100 varze karRAwadeSe rajatapIWAKye (uqapI) grAme mAtApitfByAM vedavedImaDyagehAKyAByAM samajani. etasyADyApakocyutaprekzyAcAryaH. mataM tu dvEtavAdaH iti. vallaBAcAryasya kfzRasvarUpatvABimatasya tu janma saMvat 1535 varze AnDradeSe kANkaravAKye grAme mAtApitfByAM yallammAlakzmaRAByAM samaBavat. etasyADyApako nArAyaRaBawwaH. mataM tu SudDAdvEtam iti.