vEdyakam — AyurvedaH. yaTA suSrutacarakAdi vEdyakam. tadutpattyAdikaM yaTA fgyajuHsAmATarvAKyAn dfzwvA vedAn prajApatiH. vicintya tezAmarTaM cEvAyurvedaM cakAra saH. kftvA tu paYcamaM vedaM BAskarAya dadO viBuH. svatantrAM saMhitAM tasmAdBAskaraSca cakAra saH.. BAskaraca svaSizyeBya AyurvedaM svasaMhitAm. pradadO pAWayAmAsa te cakruH saMhitAstataH.. tezAM nAmAni viduzAM tatrARi tatkftAni ca. vyADipraRASabIjAni sADvi matto niSAmaya.. DanvantaridivodAsaH kASIrAjastaTASvinEO. nakulaH sahadevArTI cyavano janako buDaH. jAvAlo jAjaliH pElaH kavayogastya eva ca. ete vedANgavedajYAH poqaSa vyADinASakAH.. (brahmavE0 pu0 a0 16) (vAca0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0809" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

