व्यापारः
vyApAraH — 1 yaM janayitvEva yasya yajjanakatvam satavyApAraH (ta0 pra0 2). yaTA lOkikapratyakze indriyasyendriyArTasaMnikarzapaNkaM vyApAraH. taTA hi saMnikarzaM janayitvEvendriyasya pratyakzajanakatvam iti pratyakze saMnikarza indriyasya vyApAraH. vyApAratvaM ca dravyAnyatve sati BAvatve sati tajjanyatve ca sati tajjanyajanakatvam (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 2) (ta0 dI0) (si0 ca0) (ta0 kO0). karaRajanyatve sati karaRajanyaPalajanakatvam ityarTaH (ma0pra0 1 pf0 5). SivAdityamiSrAstu vyApAratvamaKaRqopADiH ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 2). saMnikarzazakaM ca indriyeRa janyate indriyajanyaM pratyakzaM janayati ca iti vyApAralakzaRAkrAntaM Bavati iti vijYeyam. anumityAdO tu vyAptijYAnasya parAmarSAdivrvyApAraH. yaTA vA kuWAreRa dAru Cinatti ityAdO CidAkaraRaparaSo- da saMyogo vyApAraH (pra0 pra0). taTA hi paraSvAtmakena CidAkaraRena janyaH tenEva janyAyAH PalIBUtAyASCidAtmakakriyAyA janakaSca.<BR>;p{0831}<BR>Bavati iti paraSudArusaMyogo vyApAro Bavati iti. evaM yAgAdervyApAraH adfzwamityAdyUhyam. SizwaM tu karaRaSabde dfSyam. 2 [ka] pravfttivizayaH. yaTA devadatto grAmaM gacCatItyAdO gamaDAtunottaradeSasaMyogAnukUlA yA kriyA boDyate sa vyApAraH. evaM sarvatra SAbdaboDe DAtvarTavyApAra UhyaH. [Ka] SAbdikAstu padAntarasamaBivyAhArAprayojyasADyatvaprakArakABiDAnavizayo vyApAraH iti vadanti. sa ca vyApAraH BAvayiturutpAdanakriyA. taduktaM BartfhariRA vyApAro BAvanA sEvotpAdanA sEva ca kriyA (vAkyapadIye) iti. 3 ADunikavESyAstu arTajanaka udyamo vyApAra ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0830" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापारित्वम्
vyApAritvam — vyApAraviSizwatvam. tacca kvacit janakatAsaMbanDena vyApAraviSizwatvam. yaTA na hi vyApAreRa vyApAriRonyaTAsidDiH (ta0 pra 0 1) ityAdI indriyAdyAtmakasya karaRasya vyApAritvam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0831" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

