व्याप्तत्वम्
vyAptatvam — 1 vyAptiviSizwatvam. yaTA DUmo vahninA vyAptaH ityAdO. yadA vA sADyABAvavyApto heturvirudDaH (ta0saM0) samena yadi no vyAptaH (udayanaH) ityAdO vyAptatvam. 2 pUrRatvam. 3 samAkrAntatvaM ceti vedAntina AhuH. 4 KyAtatvam. 5 sTApitatvaM ceti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0831" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिः
vyAptiH — saMbanDaviSezaH. atra kecidAhuH. kevalAnvayini kevalAnvayiDarmasaMbanDaH. vyatirekiRi sADyavadanyAvfttitvaM vyAptiH. etayoranumitiviSezajanakatvam. anumitimAtre tu pacaDarmatEva prayojikA. na cAtiprasaNgaH. viSezasAmagrIsahitAyA eva sAmAnyasAmagryAH kAryajanakatvam iti niyamAt iti (ci0 205). sa ca sADyasADanasTale [ka] anOpADikaH saMbanDaH. sa cAnumityEOpayikaH sADananizWaH sADyasya saMbanDaH iti vijYeyam. atra anOpADikatvaM tu yAvat svavyaBicArivyaBicArisADya sAmAnADikaraRyam. aTa vA yAvatsvasamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvApratiyogipratiyogikAtyantABAvAsamAnADikaraRasADya sAmAnADikaraRyam<BR>;p{0832}<BR>(vE0 u0 3. 1. 14 pf0 152). atra gaNgeSopADyAyA AhuH etAdfSAtyantABAvAsAmAnADikaraRyaM yasya tasya tadevAnOpADikatvam iti (ci02 pf0 8). [Ka] svABAvikaH sADyahetvoH saMbanDaH (ta0 BA0). [ga] upADiviDuraH saMbanDaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 7 cArvA 0) (tA0 20 Slo0 14). [Ga] yadviSizwasamAnADikaraRA yAvantaH sADyasamAnADikaraRAstadvattvam (nyA0ma0 2 pf0 16). yaTA idaM vAcyaM jYeyatvAt pfTivI itareByo Bidyate ganDavattvAt parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdizu kevalAnvayikevala vyatirekyanvayavyatirekizu trizvapi hetupu tAdfSAH saMbanDAH santIti vyAptisAmAnyasvarUpARi saMgacCante. Bavati ca DUmatvaviSizwasamAnADikaraRA yAvanto DarmAH vahnisamAnADikaraRA iti DUme vahnivyAptiH. na tu vahnO DUmasya. na hi vahnitvaviSizwasamAnADikaraRA yAvanto DUmasamAnADikaraRA Bavanti ayaHpiRqatvasya vahnityaviSizwasamAnADikaraRasya DUmAsamAnADikaraRatvAt. asti cedaM kevalAnvayini. aBiDeyatvaviSizwasamAnADikaraRAnAM yAvatAM jYeyatvasamAnADikaraRatvAt (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 16). anvayavyatirekavyAptisADAraRaM vyAptitvaM tu hetutAvacCedakanizWaprakAratABinnA yAnumitijanakatAvacCedakatAvacCedakI BUtA prakAratA tadvattvam iti. taTA hi kevalAnvayisTale idaM vAcyaM jYeyatvAdityAdO uktalakzaRaGawakatAdfSaprakAratA ca hetuyApakasADya sAmAnADikaraRyanizWA nirUpya nirUpakaBAvApannA prakAratA Bavati. anvayavyatirekisTale vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO tAdfSI prakAratA tu hetuvyApaka sADya sAmAnADikaraRyanizWaprakAratA sADyABAvavyApakIBUtABAvapratiyogitvanizWaprakAratA ca Bavati. kevalavyatirekisTale pfTivI itareByo Bidyate ganDavattvAdityAdO jIvacCarIraM sAtmakaM prARAdimattvAdityAdO cAprasidDasADyakasTalepi tAdfSI prakAratA ca hetuvyApakasADya sAmAnADikaraRyanizWaprakAratA Bavati iti sarvatra vyAptO lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. atra hfdayam. sADyAprasidDAvapi anumiteH pUrva pakzAtirikte yatkiMcidaDikaraRe sADyaniScayABAvepi sAtmakatvAdirUpasADyasya<BR>;p{0833}<BR>KapuzpaSaSaSfNgAdivattucCatvABAvena hetuvyApakasADya sAmAnADikaraRyagrahotpattO vADakABAvaH iti. sA vyAptiH dviviDA anvayavyAptiH vyatirekavyAptiSca. tatrAnvayavyAptirapi dviviDA pUrvapakzavyAptiH sidDAntasidDavyAptiSceti. uBayaviDAnvayavyAptijYAne vyaBicArajYAnABAvaH sahacArajYAnaM ca kAraRam. vyatirekavyAptijYAne tu sADyABAve hetvaBAvasya sAhacaryajYAnaM vyaBicArajYAnABAvaSca kAraRam iti vivekaH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 138). vyAptigrahastu nAnAvyaktisADyahetukasTale vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO sAmAnyalakzaRapratyAsattyA sakalavahniDUmAdivizayako janyate (ci0 2 pf0 17). atrAhuH. vyAptigrAhakaM tu upADyaBAvagrahaRajanita saMskArasaha kftena BUyodarSanajanita saMskArasahakftena sAhacaryagrAhiRA pratyakzeREva vyAptiravaDAryate (ta0 BA0 pf0 10). aTa vA vyaBicArajYAnavirahasahakftaM hetusADyasahacAradarSanaM vyAptigrAhakaM Bavati. vyaBicArajYAnaM ca niSvayaH SaNkA vA. sA ca kvacidupADisaMdehAt kvacidviSezAdarSanasahitasADAraRaDarmadarSanAdutpadyate. tadvirahaSca kvacidvipakzavADakatarkAt kvacit svataH sidDa eva (ci0 2 pf0 1314) (ta0 kO0 2) (ta0 dI0 2). yadvA vyaBicArAgrahaH sahacAragrahaSca vyAptigrahe kAraRam. vyaBicAragrahasya vyAptigrahe pratibanDakatvAttadaBAvaH kAraRam. evam anvayavyatirekAByAM sahacAragrahasyApi hetutA. BUyodarSanaM tu na kAraRam. vyaBicArAsPUrtI sakfddarSanepi kvacidvyAptigrahAt. kvacit vyaBicAraSaNkAviDUnanadvArA BUyodarSanamupayujyate. yatra tu BUyodarSanAdapi SaNkA nApEti tatra vipakzabADakatarkopekzitaH. taTA hi vahnivirahiRyapi DUmaH syAt iti yadyASaNkA Bavati tadA sA vahniDUmayoH kAryakAraRaBAvasya pratisaMDAnAnnivartate. yadyayaM vahnimAnna syAttadA DUmavAnna syAt kAraRaM vinA kAryAnutpatteH (mu0) iti. vedAntinastvatrAhuH. pratyakzaM vyAptigrAhakam. taTA ca sAhacaryagrAhiRaH pratyakzasya BUyodarSanavyaBicArAdarSanopADyaBAvaniScayAH sahakAriRaH. evamanumAnAgamAvapi vyAptigrAhakO. tatrAgamena 105<BR>;p{0834}<BR>vyAptigrahastu brAhmaRo na hantavyaH gOrna padA sprazwavyA iti. atra dfzwAntApekzA nAsti. atredaM boDyam. kAryaM kAraRamAtramanumApayati. kAraRaM tu samagrameva kAryam (pra0 pa0 pf0 1416) iti. tu tatra pUrvapakzIyAnvayavyAptiSca (1) sADyABAvavadavfttitvam. (2) sADyavadBinnasADyABAvavadavfttitvam. (3) sADyavatpratiyogikAnyonyABAvAsAmAnADikaraRyam. (4) sakalasADyABAvavannizWABAvapratiyogitvam. (5) sADyavadanyAvfttitvaM vA (ci0 2 pf0 2). yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO vahneratyantABAvavati vahnimadBinne vA jalAdO DUmo nAsti iti DUmAdO vahnervyAptiH. atra praTamalakzaRasya sADyatAvacCedakasaMbanDAvacCinnasADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnapratiyogitAkapratiyogivyaDikaraRasADyABAvADikaraRanirUpita hetutAvacCedakasaMbanDAvacCinnavfttitvatvAvacCinnapratiyogitAkABAvaH iti samuditArTaH. atra pratiyogivEyaDikaraRyaM ca pratiyogitAvacCedakasaMbanDAvacCinnaprati - yogitAvacCedakAvacCinnavEyaDikaraRyaM vijYeyam (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 14). etAni ca paYca avyaBicaritatvapadapratipAdyAni vyApya lakzaRAni vyAptisvarUpARi ca paYcalakzaRI iti nEyAyikErvyavahriyante. dvitIyalakzaRe sADyavadBinne vartamAnaH yaH sADyABAvaH tadvadavfttitvam iti vigraho jYeyaH. atra lakzaRe karmAdO saMyogAdyaBAvasya Binnatve mAnABAvAt avyAptiH. ato dvitIyalakzaRe asvArasyamAsTAya tftIyalakzaRamuktaM sADyavat iti. atra tftIye lakzaRepi hetoH sADyavatpakza BinnadfzwAntavfttitvenAvyApteScaturTamuktaM sakaleti. sAkalyaM sADyABAvavati sADye ca viSezaRaM boDyam. sADyABAvo vA sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnapratiyogitAko grAhyaH. tena vipakzEkadeSanizWABAvapratiyogini vyaBicAriRi nAtivyAptiH. na vA nAnAvyaktisADyakasadDetAvavyAptiH. caturTalakzaRAnAsTAyAM kAraRaM tu yatrEkavyaktikaM sADyaM vipakzo vA tatra nirDUmatvAdivyApye tattvena sADye nirvahnityAdO cAvyAptiH. tatra hetvaBAvasya vahnayAdeH pratyekaM yAvadvipakzAvfttitvAt. ataH paYcamamuktaM sADyavat iti. (dIDi0<BR>;p{0835}<BR>2 pf0 1112). sADyatAvacCedakasaMbanDAvacCinnaM yatsADyavattvaM tadavacCinnapratiyogitA kasyAnyonyABAvasya svapratiyogitAvacCedakavattvabudDiviroDitAGawaka saMbanDena yadaDikaraRam tannirUpitahetutAvacCedakasaMvanDAvacCinnavfttitA navacCeda kahetutAvacCedakaDarmavattvam iti samuditArTaH (vE0 vi0 3. 1. 14) (mu0 2). (6) sADyAsAmAnADikaraRyAnaDikaraRatvam. tasya nizkfzwArTastu sADyanizWADeyatvAnirUpakADikaraRatvavyApakABAvapratiyogyaDikaraRatAsAmAnyakatvam iti. tena sattAvAn dravyatvAdityAdO na dozaH (dIDi0 2 pf0 13). idaM lakzaRaM siMhalakzaRam ityucyate. (7) sADyavEyaDikaraRyAnaDikaraRatvam (ci0 2 pf0 2). idaM lakzaRaM vyAGralakzaRam ityucyate. etAvanti sapta lakzaRAnyanvayavyatireki kevalavyatirekiRorhetvorlakzaRAni. na kevalAnvayino hetoH. tatra sADyABAvAdyaprasidDeH. agrimalakzaRAni tu kevalAnvayisADAraRAnyapi iti voDyam. (8) yatsamAnADikaraRAH sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinna vyApakatAvacCedakapratiyogitAkA yAtrantaH aBAvAH pratiyogisamAnADikaraRAH tattvam. sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnavyApakatAvacCedikA yA yA pratiyogitA tattadASrayasAmAnADikaraRyaM yatra kvacicAvadaDikaraRAntarBAvena tattvam iti samuditArTaH (ga0 catu0). atra yAvantaH aBAvAH ityanena kevalAnvayini vAcyatvAdO sADye samavAyitayA vAcyatvABAvam vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO tu Gawatvena vahnayaBAvAdikaM vyaDikaraRaDarmAvacCinnABAtramAdAya lakzaRasamanvayaH kartavyaH iti vijYeyam. idaM lakzaRaM ca dIDitikftA svayaM kftam iti praTamaM svalakzaRam ityucyate. etallakzaRamAraBya caturdaSalakzaRAni sOndaqopADyAyABimatavyaDikaraRaDarmAvacCinnABAvABiprAyakARi caturdaSalakzaRIsaMjYakAni ca Bavanti iti boDyam. (9) yatsamAnADikaraRAnAM sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinna vyApakatAvacCedakarUpAvacCinnapratiyogitAkAnAM yAvadaBAvAnAM pratiyogitAvacCedakAvacCinna sAmAnADikaraRyam tattvaM vA. atra kevalAnvayisADyakasTale jYeyatvatvAdinA vAcya<BR>;p{0836}<BR>tvAdInAmaBAvaH sulaBaH (dIDi0 2). vahnimAn DUmAdityAdO tu vahnitvena GawABAvaH sulaBaH iti vijYeyam idamapi ca lakzaRaM dIDitikftA svayaM kftam iti dvitIyaM svalakzaRam ityucyate iti boDyam. cakravartikftaM lakzaRatrayaM cetTam. (10) vyApyavftterhetu samAnADikaraRasya sADyABAvasya pratiyogitAyA anavacCedakaM yat sADyatAvacCedakam tadavacCinnasAmAnADikaraRyam. yAdfSapratiyogitAsaMbanDAvacCinnaprakAratAvacCedakayatkiMcidDarmAvacCinnAnaDikaraRatvaM hetumataH tadanavacCedakAvacCinnasAmAnADikaraRyam iti paryavasitorTaH (ga0 catu0 cakra0). (11) hetusamAnADikaraRasya vyApyavftteraBAvasya pratiyogitAyAH sAmAnADikaraRyenAnavacCedakaM yat sADyatAvacCedakam tadavacCinnasAmAnADikaraRyam. (12) hetusamAnADikaraRasya pratiyogivyaDikaraRasyABAvasya pratiyogitAyAH sAmAnADikaraRyenAnavacCedakaM yat sADyatAvacCedakam tadavacCinna sAmAnADikaraRyaM vA. etAni trIRi lakzaRAni cakravartilakzaRAni ityucyante (ga0 catu0). (13) sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwasADya sAmAnADikaraRyAvacCedakasvasamAnADikaraRasADyABAvatvakatvam. sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwasADya sAmAnADikaraRyAnatiriktavftti yadDarmaviSizwasamAnADikaraRasADyABAvatvam tadDarmavattvam iti samuditorTaH (ga0 catu0 pf0 30). (14) yatsamAnADikaraRasADyABAvapramAyAM sADyavattAjYAnapratibanDakatvaM nAsti tattvam. ete ca dve pragalBalakzaRe ityucyete (ga0 catu0). (15) sADyABAvavati yadvfttO prakftAnumitiviroDitvaM nAsti tattvam. yannizWasADyABAvavadvfttitvatvaviSizwanirUpitavizayitAsAmAnye prakftAnumitipratibanDakatAvacCedakatvABAvaH tattvam iti samuditArTaH (ga0 catu0 pf0 31). idaM ca viSAradalakzaRam ityucyate. aTa miSrakftaM lakzaRatrayaM pradarSyate. (16) yAvantaH sADyABAvAH pratyekaM tattatsajAtIyA ye tattadaDikaraRanirUpitavfttitvABAvAH tadvattvam. svASrayanizWaBedapratiyogitAvacCedakatAvacCedakasADyatAvacCedakAvacCinnavyApakatAvacCedakarUpAvacCinnA<BR>;p{0837}<BR>yAvantyaH pratiyogitAH pratyekaM tattadavacCedakAvacCinnatadASrayanizWapratiyogitAvacCedakatAkaBedADikaraRavfttitvatvavyApa- kapratiyogitAkatatpratiyogitAnirUpakABAvasajAtIyABAvavattvam iti samuditArTaH (ga0 catu0 pf0 42). atra sAjAtyaM ca samAnAs