SabdaH — (guRaH) [ka] SrotragrahaRo yorTaH sa SabdaH. SabdalakzaRaM ca SrotragrAhyaguRaviBAjakaDarmavattvam (vAkya0 4). aTa vA SravaRendriyajanyalOkikapratyakzavizayavfttiguRatvavyApyajAtimattvam. tAdfSI jAtiSca SabdatvarUpA. guRatvavyApyajAtiGawitalakzaRakaraRena aSrutaSabde nAvyAptiH. na vA sattvaguRatvAdikamAdAya guRAntarezvativyAptiSca (vE0 vi0 2. 2. 21). SabdastvAkASamAtravfttiH bAhyEkendriyagrAhyaH dvikzaRAvasTAyI tftIyakzaRe naSyati ca. ata evAnityaH iti nEyAyika<BR>;p{0861}<BR>rAdDAntaH. pfTivyAdizu paYcasu SabdastizWati iti sAMKyA vedAntinacAhuH. svatantrAstu BeryAM SabdaH mfdaNge SabdaH iti vyavahArAtpfTivyAmeva SabdamicCanti (si0 ca0 1 pf0 18). Sabdo na sparSavadviSezaguRaH. pratyakzatve sati akAraRaguRapUrvakatvAt. ayAvaddravyaBAvitvAt. ASrayAdanyatra SrotradeSe upalabDeSca. Sabdo guRo BUtvAkASasyADigame liNgam (praSasta0 pf0 7) (mu0 Ka0 1) iti. SabdombaraguRaH SrotragrAhyaH kzaRikaH kAryakAraRoBayaviroDI saMyogaviBAgaSabdajaH pradeSavfttiH samAnAsamAnajAtIyakAraRakaH (praSasta0 guRani0 pf0 55) iti. kAryakAraRaviroDItyasyArTaSca kAryamuttaraSabdaH. kAraRaM saMyogaviBAgaSabdAH. etaduBayenApyayaM virudDyate iti. [Ka] SrotragrAhyo guRaH. [ga] yenoScAritena sAsnAlANgUlakakudaKuravizARinAM saMpratyayo Bavati sa SabdaH. sa ca Sabdo dviviDaH budDihetukaH abudDihetukaca. tatra abudDihetuko meGAdiSabdaH. budDihetukaSca dviviDaH svABAvikaH kAlpanikaSca. uBayatrApi DvanerupakArakatvAvanyAtmakatA. tatra svABAviko varRaviSezAnaBivyaYjako hasitaruditAdirUpaH prARimAtrasADAraRaH. kAlpanikopi triviDaH vAdyAdiSabdaH gItirUpaH varRAtmakaSca. tatra BerISabdAdirvAdyAdiSabdaH. mADavAdirAgABivyaYjaka nizAdAdisvaraSabdo gItirUpaH. DvaniviSeza sahakftakaRWatAlavAdyaBiGAtajanyaSca varRAtmakaH (SabdArTaratne0) (vAca0). anyatra cetTaM viBAga uktaH. Sabdo dviviDaH DvanyAtmakaH varRAtmakaSca. tatrAdyo BerImfdaNgAdO prasidDaH. dvitIyaH saMskftaBAzAdirUpaH SabdaH. atra BAzyam sa ca dviviDaH varRalakzaRaH avarRalakzaRaSca. tatra akArAdirvarRalakzaRaH. DvanilakzaRaScAvarRalakzaRaH. atra pAWAntaram saMKyAnimittaH avarRalakzaRaH iti (praSasta0 guRa 0 pf0 55). tatra varRalakzaRasyotpattiH. AtmamanasoH saMyogAtsmftyapekzAdvarRoccAraRecCA. tadanantaram prayatnaH. tamapekzamARAdAtmavAyusaMyogAdvAyO karma jAyate. sa ca vAyurUDvaM gacCan kaRWAdInaBihanti. tataH sTAnavAyusaMyogApekzAtsTAnAkASa862<BR>;p{0862}<BR>saMyogAdvarRotpattiH. aTa DvanilakzaRopi (1) BerIdaRqasaMyogAdvegApekzAdDeryAkASasaMyogAdutpadyate. (2) veRuparvaviBAgApekzAdveRvAkASaviBAgAcca. (3) SabdAcca SabdanizpattiH. SabdAtsaMyogaviBAganizpannAdvIcI saMtAnavacCandasaMtAnaH ityevaM saMtAnena SrotrapradeSamAgatasyAntyaSabdasya grahaRam. SrotraSabdayorgamanAgamanABAvAt (saMyogagamanABAvAt) aprAptasya cAnupalabDeH pariSezAtsaMtAna sidDiH (praSasta 0 guRani0 pf0 5556) (vE0 2. 2. 31). atra SAbdikA AhuH. varRAtmakaSca Sabdo vastuta ekopi tattadvarRasaMskArEH pratibimbitatattadrUponantapadarUpatABivApanna iti sarvapadarUpaH sarvArTABiDAnaSaktiH. sA SaktiryogipratyakzagamyA nAsmajjYAnagamyA. yatrEvaM vyavahArAdinA tajjYAnaM tasyEvAsmAkaM boDaH iti maryAdA (la0 ma0 AkA0 pf0 49). atreyaM vyutpattiH. SabdyatenenArTa ityaBiDIyate jYApyate iti (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 3). atra vEyAkaraRA AhuH. paro paSyantI maDyamA vEKarI iti catvAri vAcaH padAni. ekEva nAdAtmikA vANyUlADArAduditA satI parA ityucyate. sEva hfdayABigAminI paSyantI ityucyate. sEva budDiM gatA vivakzAM prAptA maDyamA ityucyate. aTa yadA sEva vakre sTitA tAtyozWAdivyApAreRa bahirnirgacCati tadA vEKarI ityucyate. atra SrutiH guhA trIRi nihitA neNgayanti turIyaM vAco manuzyA vadanti (f0 1. 164. 45) iti. DvanyAtmakavarRAtmaka dviviDAvapi pratyekaM triviDO saMyogajO viBAgajO SabdajO ceti. tatrAdyO BeryAmaBihanyamAnAyAM BerIdaRqasaMyogAdDUnyAtmakaH. vAyukaRWatAlvAdisaMyogAdvarRAtmakaSca. dvitIyO vaMSe pAwyamAne daladvayaviBAgAt cawacawAtmako DvanyAtmakaH ozWadvayaviBAgAdvarRAtmakaSca. tftIyO ca dvitIyaSabdAdicaramaSabdAntO (vE0 2. 2. 31). tatra saMyogaje DvanyAtmake BeryAkASa saMyogosamavAyikAraRam. BerIdaRqasaMyogo nimittakAraRam. samavAyikAraRaM tu sarvatrEvAkASam iti jYeyam. viBAgaje DvanyAtmake tu vaMSadaladvayAkASaviBAgosamavAyikAraRam. vaMSadaladvaya863<BR>;p{0863}<BR>viBAgo nimittakAraRam (ta0 kO0) (vE0 u0 2. 2. 31). SabdajaSabdavizaye tu vIcItaraNganyAyena kadambamukulanyAyena vA ye dvitIyAdayaH SabdAH te SabdajAH. tatrottarottaraSabde pUrvapUrva SabdosamavAyikAraRam. anukUlavAtAdikaM nimittakAraRam (ta0 kO0) iti. varRAtmakaH Sabdo dravyam iti maDyamatAnuyAyina AhuH (pra0 pra0 pf0 11). varRAtmakaH punardviviDaH sArTakaH nirarTakaSca. tatra sArTakaH SabdastriviDaH prakftiH pratyayaH nipAtaSceti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 6). nirarTakastu kacawatapa ityAdiH. punarapi varRAtmako dviviDaH pramARaSabdaH apramARaSabdaSca. pramARaSabda ityasyArTaSca SAbdapramitikaraRajYAnavizayaH Sabda iti (ta 0 pra0 pa0 4 pf0 6) (ta0 kO0) (pra0 pra0). ayamarTaSca SAbdaboDaM prati padajYAnasya karaRatAmate saMgacCate. maRikftastu prayogahetuBUtArTatattvajYAnajanyaH Sabda ityAhuH (ta0 pra0 pa0 4 pf0 5). yaTASrutArTasya SAbdapramitikaraRarUpasyANgIkAre sa cArTaH SAbdaboDaM prati jYAyamAnaM padaM karaRam iti mate saMgacCate iti vijYeyam. pramARaSabdatvaM ca SAbdapramitikaraRatvam (nyA0 ma0 4). idaM lakzaRaM ca jYAyamAnaM padaM karaRam iti matABiprAyeRAsti (ma0pra0 4). aTa prakftavAkyArTavizayakayaTArTaSAbdaboDavizayakatAtparyajanyavAkyam. (vAkya 0 4). pare tu pramopaDAyakaSabdatvam iti vadanti (mU0 ma0 1). tatra pramARaSabda AptopadeSaH. tadarTaSca AptaH yaTA - dfzwasyArTasya ciKyApayizayA prayukta upadezwA. tasya SabdaH (vAtsyA 0 1. 1. 7). aTa vA prayogahetuBUtArTatattvajYAnajanyaH SabdaH (ci0 4). sopi dviviDaH lOkikaH vEdikaSca. tatrAdyo lOkikaH viDinizeDArTavAdaBedena triviDaH. tatra viDiryaTA pAkaM kuryAt ityAdiH. nizeDaSva idamanizwaM na kuryAt ityAdiH. arTavAdastu ayaM brAhmaRaH svamahimnA sarvaM jagatpavitraM karoti ityAdiH svayamUhyaH. nadyAstIre paYca PalAni santi ityAdirUpo vA (pra0 pra0). dvitIyastu vEdikaH paYcaviDaH viDiH mantraH nAmaDeyam nizeDaH arTavAdaSceti. tatra vA<BR>;p{0864}<BR>lOkikaH Sabda Aptokta eva pramARaBUtaH. vEdikastu sarva eva pramARaBUtaH. paramAptena BagavatA praRItatvAt. prakArAntareRApi pramARaSabdo dviviDaH dfzwArTaH adfzwArTaSca. tatrAdyo Gawosti ityAdirUpaH. dvitIyaH svarganarakApUrvAdiSabdaH iti. apramARaSabdastu vahninA siYcet gOraSvaH puruzo hastI ityAdirUpaH iti. atra Sabdo na pramARam. SAbdajYAnaM tu lENgikameva. taTA ca SabdonumAna evAntarBavati itiH vESezikamatam (vE0 9 2 3). vESezikAdInAmASayastu pramARaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare (pf0 554) prakawIkftaH. nEyAyikAstu pfTageva Sabdo mAnam. tatra pramARaM sUtram AptopadeSasAmarTyAcCabdAdarTa- : saMpratyayaH (gO0 2. 1. 52) iti. na tvanumAnaviDayA mAnam. SabdasyArTAvyApyatvAt. na hi yatra Sabdastatra GawAnayanAdirUporTaH iti 1 vyAptiH. SabdasyAkASavfttitvAt. GawAdeSca tadavfttitvAt. (nyA0ma0 4). taTA ca Sabdo hyatiriktaM pramARam. tacca SabdAtpratyemi ityanuvyavasAyagamyajYAnasya pratyakzAnumityAdipratItito vilakzaRatvena tAdfSa jYAnakaraRatvena sidDyati ityAhuH (ta0 dI0). atra Sabdasya sADutvaM ca Saktatvameva. apaBraMSAditaH (gAvyagagaryAdiSabdataH) SaktiBramAcCAbdaboDaH iti nEyAyikamImAMsakAdaya AhuH. vEyAkaraRAstu yaH Sabdo yatrArTe vyAkaraRe vyutpAditaH sa tatra sADuH. apaBraMSAnAmapi Saktatvamastyeva ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 SaktivicA0 pf0 151). atra SabdasyArTaviSezAnvayaboDane sADutvaM ca vyAkaraREkavyaYjikA puRyajanakatAvacCedakajAtiH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 103). Sabdo dravyam iti BawwamImAMsakA AhuH. atrAnumAnaM pramARaM Sabdo dravyam sAkzAdindriyasaMbanDavedyatvAt Gawavat iti. SrotraM dravyagrAhakam niravayavendriyatvAt manovat iti ca. guRavattvAcca Sabdo dravyam. saMKyAdayopi hi SabdaDarmA anuBUyante (nyA0 lI0 gu0 pf0 49). SAbdikAstu SabdamuBayasvarUpamicCanti. tAratvAdayo guRAH SabdanizwAstadASrayatvAcCabdasya dravyatvam AkASarUpadravyASrayatvAdguRatvaM<BR>;p{0865}<BR>ca iti (la0 ma0). tanna sahante vESezikAH. ekadravyatvAnna dravyam (vE0 2. 2. 23) iti. tadarTastu Sabdo na dravyam. ekadravyatvAdekamAtrASritatvAt. na hyekamAtrASritaM kimapi dravyaM prasidDam iti (vE0 vi0 2. 2. 23). Sabdo nityaH iti prABAkarA BawwAcAhuH. etanmate Sabdasya nityatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca Sabdo nityo vyomamAtraguRatvAdvyomaparimARavat iti. aTa vA Sabdo nityaH. adravyadravyatvAt. pratyaBijYAnAcca iti ca (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 124) (nyA0 lI0 gu0 pf0 49). aTa vA Sabdo nityaH niHsparSadravyatvAdAtma-.. vaditi. atrAyamASayaH. soyaM gakAraH iti pratyaBijYAbalAt Sabdasya nityatvam. asyAM pratyaBijYAyAm etatkAlInagakAre pUrvakAlInagakArABedo BAsate. ato nitya iti BAvaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 124). gakAra utpannaH vinazwaSca iti pratyayastu SabdavyaYjakavAyUtpattivizayaka eva iti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31) (vE0 2. 2. 3435). atra SabdavyaYjakavAyurevotpadyate na tu Sabda utpadyate iti BAvaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 124). prayatnena SabdamuccArayataH puMso vAyurnABerutTitaH urasi vistIrRaH kaRWe vivartito mUrDAnamAhatya parAvftto vicarannAnAviDAYCandAnaBivyanakti iti mImAMsakasidDAntaH. nAnAviDAYCabdAn nizpAdayati iti tArkikapAWaH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 64). nEyAyikAstu SabdaH anityaH ityAhuH (vE0 2. 2. 28). ayamASayaH. soyaM gakAraH iti pratyaBijYAyAM pUrvakAlInagakAra sAdfSyamevEtaddvakAre BAsate. yadi prABAkaramatAnuroDyaBedo BAseta tadA soyaM GawaH iti pratyaBijYAyAmapyaBedasyEva tulyanyAyena BAsanasyAvaSyakatayA GawasyApi nityatvApattiH. ataH SabdasyAnityatvameva. SabdasyAnityatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca SabdaH anityaH sAmAnyavattve sati bahirindriyajanya lOkikapratyakzavizayatvAllOkikapratyakzaviSezyatvAdvA Gawavat iti (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 13). taTA ca sUtram AdimattvAdEndriyakatvAtkftakavadupacArAcca (gO0 2. 2. 13) iti. SabdotpattirdviviDA kezAMci109 nyA0 ko<BR>;p{0866}<BR>nEyAyikAnAM mate vIcItaraNganyAyena tadutpattiH. kezAMcinmate tu kadambakorakanyAyena tadutpattiH (BA0 pa0 Slo0 167). tatrAdyA tadutpattiryaTA AdyayA vIcyAnyo mahAnekastaraNgo janyate. tena taraNgeRa ca mahattaraM taraNgAntaram. tadvat AdyaSabdena bahirdaSadigavacCinnonyaSabdastenEva Sabdena janyate tena cAparastavyApakaH SabdaH ityevaM krameRa SrotrotpannaH Sabdo gfhyate. BerIdaRqAdyaBiGAtAttadeSAvacCedenAdyaSabdasyotpattiH. anantaram tadbahirdaSadigavacCedena praTamaSabdAttadvyApako dvitIyaH SabdaH. tatastadbahirdaSadigavacCinnastftIyaH Sabdo dvitIyaSabdAdBavati ityevaM krameRa caturTAdiSabdAnAmapyutpattiryoDyA. dvitIyA tadutpattiryaTA kadambapuzpasya sarvAvayavezu yugapatkorakARAmutpattiH tadvat AdyaSabdAddaSasu dikzu daSa SabdA utpadyante tEvAnye daSa SabdA utpadyante ityevaM sarvAsu dikzUparyupari SabdAnAmutpattiH (mu0 gu0 pf0 236) iti. dvitIyAdiSabdo nEkaH na vA daSadigavacCinnaH. kiM tu daSasu dikzu dvitIyAdyAH SabdA daSa utpadyante ityetanmate viSezaH (vE0 vi0 2. 2. 37). vAyugateH samAnatve praTamaH pakzaH. asamAnatvaM dvitIya iti boDyam. vEyAkaraRAstu varRaH akArAdiH nityaH ityAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31) (ci0 4) (ta0 saM0) (si0 ca0) (ta0 dI0) (nIla0). tanmate varRAnAM nityatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca varRo nityo DvanyanyaSabdatvAt sPowavat (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31) iti. tatra arTaboDakaSabdaM sPowAtmakamicCanti vEyAkaraRAH. taTA ca pacASadvarRAH azwAkzaro mantraH tryakzaro matraH azwAkzarAnuzwup ityAdisaMKyApyupapadyate iti. tanna sahante vESezikAH. paYcASadAdisaMKyAyAH sadBAvaH katvagatvAdijAtita evopapadyate iti na varRAnAM nityatvam iti (vE0 2. 2. 37). Sabdo na pramARam iti sOgatA AhuH (pra0 pra0 4). mImAMsakAstu vEdikaSabdaH pramARam lOkikastvanuvAdakaH ityAhuH (ma0 pra0 4). atra maDtramatAnuyAyivedAntinastu vedAntopayogitvenEtraM SabdaM viBajante. Sabdo dviviDaH pramARaSabdaH apramARaSabdaSca. tatra pramARaSabdo<BR>;p{0867}<BR>nirdozaSabdatvAt AgamaH ityucyate. Agamo dviviDaH apOruzeyaH pOruzeyaSceti. tatrApOruzeya fgAdiH sadAgamaH. pOruzeyo mahABAratAdiH sadAgamaH iti. taduktam Agamo dviviDo jYeyo nityonityastaTEva ca. fgAdyA BArataM cEva paYcarAtramaTAKilam.. mUlarAmAyaRaM cEva purARaM cEtadAtmakam. ye cAnuyAyinastezAM sarve te ca sadAgamAH.. durAgamAstadanye ye tErna jYeyo janArdanaH (pra0 ca0 pari0 1 pf0 41) iti. atra apOruzeyatvAdivicAraRaM tu vedaSabdavyAKyAnAvasare kftam iti tattatra dfSyam. apramARaSabdastu dozavattvAt AgamABAsaH ityucyate. SabdadozAstu aboDakatvam viparItaboDakatvam jYAtajYApakatvam aprayojanavattvam anaBimataprayojanavattvam aSakyasADanapratipAdanam laGUpAye sati gurUpAyopadeSanam ityAdyAH. tatra aboDakatvaM dveDA niraBiDeyatvena anvayABAvena ceti. tatrAdyasyodAharaRam kacawatapAnAM jabagaqadatvAt iti. dvitIyasyodAharaRam gOravaH puruzo hastI kuRqamajAjinaM daSa dAqimAni zaqapUpAH ityAdi. viparItaboDakatvasyodAharaRam vimataM miTyA SUdrARAM vedavidyADikArosti brAhmaRAnAM nAsti ityAdi. jYAtajYApakatvasyodAharaRam purastAdAditya udeti paScAdastameti maDuro guqaH tiktaM nimbaPalam ityAdi. aprayojanavattvasyodAharaRam kAkasya kati vA dantA mezasyARqaM kiyatpalam. kambale kati romARi kA vArtA colamaRqale. ityAdi. anaBimataprayojanavattvasyodAharaRam viraktaM prati vARijyopadeSaH ityAdi. aSakyasADanapratipAdanasyodAharaRam mftamuddiSya mftiharahimamahIDarottarasAnusidDamfta saMjIvanIkaTanAdi. laGUpAye sati gurUpAyopadeSanasyodAharaRam naKena jAyamAnaM kAryaM kuWAreRa kuru iti tfzitaM prati gIrvARataraNgiRItIre kUpaKananopadeSaH ityAdi (pra0 ca0 pari0 1 pf0 36).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0860" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दपुनरुक्तम्
Sabdapunaruktam — (punaruktam nigrahasTAnam) [ka] SabdArTayoH punarvacanaM punaruktamanyatrAnuvAdAt (gO0 5. 2. 14). [Ka] samAnArTakasamAnAnupUrvIkaSabdaprayogaH yaTA Gawo GawaH (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 14) iti.<BR>;p{0868}<BR>yaTA vA nityaH Sabdo nityaH SabdaH iti (vAtsyA0 5. 2. 14). anye tu SabdapunaruktaM dviviDam tasyEva Sabdasya punaraBiDAnam tasyEva Sabdasya paryAyeRABiDAnaM ca ityAhuH (gO0 vf0 5. 2. 15).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0867" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दाध्याहारः
SabdADyAhAraH — (aDyAhAraH) AkANkzitaSabdAnusaMDAnam (nIla0 4 pf0 31). yaTA piDehi ityukta dvAram iti dvitIyAntapadADyAhAraH. atrApyarTADyAhAra eva na tu padADyAhAraH kartavyaH iti prABAkarA AhuH. nEyAyikAstanna sahante. GawamAnaya iti vAkyAdiva GawaH karmatvaM Anayanam kftiH iti vAkyAdapi GawanizWakarmatAnirUpakAnayanAnukUlakftimAn iti viSizwArTavizayakaSAbdaboDotpattyApattivAraRAya vfttyA padaviSezajanyAyA eva padArTopasTiteH SAbdaboDaM prati hetutvasya kalpanIyatayA SabdADyAhAra evAvaSyakaH nArTADyAhAraH (ta0 dI04 pf0 31) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शब्दानुशासनम्
SabdAnuSAsanam — vyAkaraRam. anena hi vEdikAH SabdAH SaM no devIraBizwaya ityAdayaH tadupakAriRo lOkikAH SabdA gOravaH puruzo hastI SakunirityAdayaScAnuSizyante vyutpAdya saMskriyante prakftipratyayaviBAgavattayA boDyante (sarva0 saM0 pf0 288289 pARi0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

