शरीरम्
SarIram — [ka] cezwendriyArTASrayaH SarIram (gO0 1. 1. 11) (ta0 BA0 prameya0 pf0 25) atra vyutpattiH SIryate iti (SUIran). pratikzaRaM kzIyamARaM dehaM SarIram. SarIratvaM tu na jAtiH. pfTivItvAdinA saMkarAt (vE0 vi0 4. 2. 1) (mu0 1 pari0 2). SarIratvaM ca prayatnavadAtmasaMyogAsamavAyikAraRavatkriyAvadantyAvayavitvam. aTa vA<BR>;p{0869}<BR>(vE0 u0 4. 2. 1). aTa vA antyAvayavimAtravftticezwAvadvfttijAtimattvam (vE0 vi0 4. 2. 1) (pa0 mA0). atratyapadprayojanamucyate. hastatvapfTivItvadravyatvasattvAdivAraRAya antyAvayavimAtravftti iti padaM dattam. GawatvAdivAraRAya cezwAvadvftti iti padam. GawaSarIrasaMyogAdivAraRAya jAti iti padam. evaM ca manuzyatvacEtratvAdijAtimAdAya mAnuzAdiSarIre lakzaRasamanvayaH. kalpaBedena nfsiMhaSarIrasya nAnAtvAnnfsiMhatva jAtimAdAya tatra lakzaRasamanvayaH. avacCedakatAsaMbanDena BogASrayatyam (vAkya 0). yadvA cezwAvadantyAvayavItarAvfttijAtimattvam. BogAyatanavfttyantyAvayavimAtravfttijAtimattvaM vA (pa0 mA0). jIvaSarIramAtralakzaRaM tu Atma viSezaguRajanakamanaH saMyogAvacCedakatvam (ta0 BA0). aTa cezwendriyArTAya ityasyArTa ucyate. atra ASrayapadasya pratyekamanvayAccezwASrayatvAdi lakzaRatrayam. indriyASrayatvaM cAvacCedakatAKyasvarUpasaMbanDaviSepeRa. cakzuzmAn devadattoyam ityAdipratIteH. arTASrayatvam ityatrArTaSabdaH suKaduHKAnyataraparaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 11). yadvA SarIrAnuviDAnamindriyASrayatvam. SarIrasyopaGAtAnuviDAnamityarTaH (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 11 pf0 71). [Ka] Atmano BogAyatanam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 9) (ta0 BA0 pf0 25) yadavacCinnAtmani Bogo jAyate tadBogAyatanamityarTaH (ta0 dI 0). hastAdyavayavAnAM SarIratvAnaNgIkAre tvantyAvayavitvaM deyam. taTA coktaM BogAyatanamantyAvayavi SarIram (ta0 kO0) iti. SarIramantyAvayavi cezwABogendriyASrayaH (tA0 ra0 pari0 1 Slo0 28) iti ca. yaTA asmadAdInAM pArTivaSarIram (ta0 saM0). tacca SarIraM na pAYcaBOtikam (jalAdiparamARudvaya saMyogAsamavAyikAraRakam). pfTivItva jalatvAdijAtInAM parasparasAMkaryaprasaNgAt. kiM tu pArTivameva. svABAvikaganDavattvAt. atra sUtram pArTivaM guRAntaropalabDeH (gO0 3. 1. 28) iti. Srutirapi sUryaM te cakzurgacCatAt ityatra mantre pfTivIM (vAkya 0).<BR>;p{0870}<BR>te SarIram iti SrUyate (vAtsyA0 3. 1. 32). mAnuzAdiSarIrezu kledapAkAdInAM jalAdivikArARAmupalabDistu paYcAnAM BUtAnAM parasparamupazwamBakasaMyogAdeva (vE0 4. 2. 2 - 4) (gO0 3. 1. 31) iti. evaM jalIyatEjasavAyavIyaSarIrezvapi vijYeyam. SarIraM dviviDam yonijam ayonijaM ca (vE0 4. 2. 5). SukraSoRitasaMnipAtajanyaM yonijam (praSasta0 pf0 4). ayonijaM ca SukraSoRitasaMnipAtAnapekzam (vE0 u0 4. 2. 5) (praSasta0 pf0 4). yonijamayonijaM ca pArTivaSarIram. taduktaM yogArRave dehaScaturviDo jantorjYeya utpattiBedataH. udBijjaH svedajoRqotTaScaturTaSca jarAyujaH.. udBidya BUmiM nirgacCatrudBijjaH sTAvaraSca yaH. udBijjAH sTAvarA jYeyAstfRagulmAdirUpiRaH.. (vAca0) iti. ApyaM tEjasaM vAyavIyaM cAyonijameva varuRAdityavAyulokezu prasidDaM ca (vE0 u0 4. 2. 11). tatra pramARamanumAnam. tacca jalatvAdyapi sAmAnyaM SarIrasamavAyigam. dravyAramBakanityasTajAtitvAtpfTivItvavat.. (ta0 va0 pramARapari0 pf0 116) iti. tatra yonijaM pArTivaSarIram dviviDam jarAyujam aRqajaM ca. jarAyujaM mAnuzapaSumfgARAm. aRqajaM pakzisarIsfpARAm (praSasta0 pf0 4). kIwamatsyAdayopi sarIsfpavadeva (vE0 u0 4. 2. 5). ayonijaM pArTivaSarIraM ca triviDam svedajam udBijjam adfzwaviSezajanyaM ca. atredaM boDyam. ayonijapArTivaSarIrARAmutpattirDarmaviSezasahiteByoRuBya eva svIkriyate (di0 1) (ta0 kO0). ahaMkAreByaH samaBavadaNgirAH ityanvarTasaMjYAyA Agamepi darSanAt (ta0 va0 pf0 117) iti. tatra svedajaM SarIraM yUkAlikzAdInAm. udBijjaM vfkzatfRagulmAdInAm. adfzwaviSezajanyaM manvAdInAM devarzinAradAdInAM ca (ta0 kO0). yadyapi vfkzAdInAM SarIratvamastyeva. taTApi cezwAvattvamindriyavattvaM ca nodBidAM sPuwataram. ato na SarIravyavahAraH (vE0 u0 4. 2. 5). ataH kecit vfkzAdInAM SarIratvaM necCanti (ta0 va0 pf0 116). aTa vfkzAdInAM SarIratve pramARamanumAnaM pradarSyate. vfkzAdAvapi cezwAstyeva. ADyAtmika<BR>;p{0871}<BR>vAyusaMbanDAt. anyaTA tAdfSavAyusaMbanDAnaNgIkAre BagnakzatasaMrohaRAdikaM na syAt. kiM ca vfkzAda