शाब्दबोधः
SAbdaboDaH — (anuBavaH) padajYAnakaraRakaM jYAnam (mu0 1). tacca vAkyArTajYAnam (ta0 saM0 4). atra vyutpattiH SabdAjjAyamAno boDaH SAbdaboDaH iti. tatra boDe SAbdatvaM ca SabdAtpratyemi ityanuBavasidDo jAtiviSezaH. aTa vA janyapadaDIjanyatvavyaBicAryanuBavatvAvyApakajAtiSUnyatve sati padavizayakatvAvyaBicArijAtiSUnyaDItyam. viprahaSca janyapadaDIjanyatvavyaBicAriRI anuBavatvAvyApikA ca yA jAtiH pratyakzatvAdiH tacCUnyatve ati padavizayakatvAvyaBicAriRI yA jAtiH upamititvam tacCranyaDItvam (ta0 pra0 pari0 4 pf0 3) iti. atra padaprayojanam satyantaM pratyakzAnumitismftInAM vAraRAya. upamitAvativyAptivAraRAya SUnyAntam (nyA0 ma0 pari0 41 pf0 1-2). SAbdaboDalakzaRaM tu SaktilakzaRAnyatarasaMbanDena padajanyapadArTasmftitvAvacCinnakAraRatAnirUpitakAryatvam (vAkya 0 4). SAbdaboDe ca padajYAnaM karaRam. padArTopasTitirvyApAraH. SAbdaboDaH Palam. padajYAnasya ca SaktijYAnam AkANkzAyogyatAsaMniDInAM jYAnaM ca sahakAri iti navyanEyAyikAnAM matam. atra vijYeyam. tasyAM padArTopasTitO vfttitvena vfttijYAnaM sahakAri na tu Saktitvena lakzaRAtvena vA prAtiKikarUpeRa jYAnaM sahakAri iti. prAcAM mataM tu tatra SAbdaboDe jYAyamAnaM padameva 110<BR>;p{0874}<BR>karaRam. na tu padajYAnaM karaRam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 1) (mu0 4 pf0 174) (BA0 pa0) (ta0 kO0) iti. atra navyA AhuH.. 1. jYAyamAnapadasya karaRatvANgIkAre padABAvepi mOniSlokAdinA hastacezwAdinA ca SAbdaboDa utpadyate sa na syAt. atastatra SAbdaboDopapattaye padajYAnameva karaRam na tu jYAyamAnaM padaM karaRam ityavaSyamaNgIkartavyam (mu0 4 pf0 174) iti. vAkyArTajYAnamityasya ekapadArTe- : parapadArTa saMsargavizayakaM jYAnam ityarTaH (vAkya 0 4). yaTA gAmAnaya iti vAkyajanyaH gokarmakAnayanAnukUlakftimAMstvam iti SAbdaboDaH. atreyaM SAbdaboDaprakriyA. praTamaM gavAdipadAnAM gavAdO gavAdirgavAdipadaSakyo lakzyo vA iti saMbanDajYAnam. tataH kAlAntare kenacit gAmAnaya tvam ityukte gavAdipadeByo gavAdInarTAnsmarati. AkANkzAdIYjAnatastadanantaraM gokarmakAnayanAnukUlakftimAMstvam iti SAbdabudDirjAyate (vAkya 0 4) iti. atra padasya padArTasmArakatvaM ca ekasaMbanDijYAnamaparasaMbanDismArakam iti nyAyena voDyam (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 92). yaTA vA cEtrastaRqulaM pacati devadatto grAmaM gacCati ityAditaca SAbdaboDaH. nEyAyikamate kartrAKyAtasTale cEtraH pacatI- : tyAdO pAkAnukUlakftimAMScEtraH iti SAbdaboDaH. karmAKyAtasTale tu cEtreRa pacyate taRqula ityAdO tftIyAyA ADeyatvamarTaH. PalAvacCinnavyApAro DAtvarTaH. AKyAtabalAcca kfterlABaH. taTA ca cEtranizWakftijanyapAkajanyaPalaSAlI taRqulaH ityanvayaboDaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 85). devadatto grAmaM gacCatItyatra dvitIyAyA arTaH karmatvam. DAtorarTo gamanam. janakatvaM saMsargamaryAdayA laByam. lawo vartamAnatvamarTaH. AKyAtasya kftirarTaH. tatsaMbanDaH saMsargamaryAdAlaByaH. ekavacanAdyupasTApitamekatvAdi sarvatra praTamAntapadopasTApitenveti. evaM ca grAmakarmakagamanajanakavartamAna kftimAn ekatvaviSizwo devadattaH ityanvayaboDaH. yatra kartari kfterbADastatrAKyAtasya vyApArAdO lakzaRA. yaTA raTo gacCatItyatra gamanajanakavartamAnavyApAravAn ityarTaH. devadattena<BR>;p{0875}<BR>gamyate grAmaH ityasya devadattavfttikftijanyagamanajanyaPalaSAlI grAmaH ityarTaH. taTA hi vfttitvaM saMsargamaryAdayA laByam. tftIyASca kftirarTaH. 13 janyatvaM saMsargaH. gamanaM DAtvarTaH. janyatvaM saMsargaH. PalaM karmAtmanepadArTaH. SAlitvaM saMsargaH iti. BAvapratyaye tu devadattena supyate ityasya devadattavfttikftijanyaH svApaH ityarTaH. BAvapratyayasTale PalABAvAdAtmanepadArTo na BAsate (tarkA0 4 pf0 11). SAbdaboDo dviviDaH yaTArTaH ayaTArTaSca. tatrAdyaH SAbdapramA. sA ca yaTA nadyAstIre paca PalAni santi ityAdivAkyArTagocarayaTArTajYAnam. atra PalavatpravfttijananayogyatvaM yaTArTatvam iti vijYeyam (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 7). dvitIyaH agninA siYcati ityAdyayogyavAkyajanyaH SAbdaboDaH dviviDopi SAbdaboDaH pratyekaM dviviDaH BedAnvayavizayakaH aBedAnvayavizayakaSca. tatrAdyo rAjYaH puruzaH ityAdivAkyajanyaH. dvitIyo nIlo GawaH ityAdivAkyajanyaH. atra aBedAnvayaboDaM prati samAnaviBaktiliNgavacanakatvaM prayojakam iti sAmAnyaniyamo vijYeyaH. tatra samAnaviBaktikatvaM ca svaprakftikaviBaktisajAtIyaviBaktikatvam virudDaviBaktirAhityaM vA (ga0 vyu0 1). SizwaM tu samAnaviBaktikatvaSabde dfSyam. atra vipratipattiH. sAmAnyataH SAbdaboDaSca DAtvarTa muKya viSezyakaH praTamAntArTa muKyaviSezyako vA iti. tatra DAtvarTamuKyaviSezyaka eva Bavati iti vEyAkaraRA AhuH. tatra pramARaM tu BAvapraDAnamAKyAtam iti yAskamunivacanam. nEyAyikAstu SAbdaboDaH praTamAntArTamuKyaviSezyaka eva jyAyAn iti prAhuH. nEyAyikAnAM mate tu BAvapraDAnamAKyAtam iti niruktasya BAvaH DAtvarTaH praDAnaM viSezyaH yasya AKyAtArTasya iti SAbdikAdisaMmataM bahuvrIhimanAdftya BAvasya praDAnam iti zazWItatpuruza ASrIyate. lAGavAt. tatra DAtvarTamuKyaviSezyakaSAbdaboDANgIkartfbEyAkaraRamate tAdfSaboDopapAdakamuKyodAharaRAni ca cEtreRa supyate paSya mfgo DAvati pacati Bavati SfRu meGo garjati ityAdIni. atra cEtreRa supyate ityAdO cEtrakartfkaH svApaH iti kriyAmuKya<BR>;p{0876}<BR>viSezyakaH sarvatantrasidDo voDaH. paSya mfgo DAvati ityAdO mfgABinna- 1 kartfkaM DAvanaM paSya iti kriyAmuKyaviSezyako boDaH. atra vEyAkaraRAnAmayamASayaH. DAvanakriyAyA eva dfSikriyAyAM karmatayAnvayo vivakzitaH. tasyASca prAtipadikArTatvABAvAnna DAvatipadottaraM dvitIyA. nEyAyikamate tu mfgapadArTasya dfSikriyAyAmanvayena tasya prAtipadikArTatvena ca mfgapadottaraM dvitIyApattiH iti. pacati Bavati ityAdO pAkABinnakartfkaM Bavanam iti kriyAmuKyaviSezyako voDaH. SfRu meGo garjati ityAdO tu meGABinnakartfkaM garjanaM SfRu iti garjanarUpaDAtvarTamuKyaviSezyakaH SAbdaboDo vEyAkaraRAnAM saMmataH. atrAyaM BAvaH. SraDAtvarTaSravaRakriyAyAM SabdarUpasya garjanasyEva yogyatayAnvayaH. na tu nEyAyikamata iva garjana kartfmeGasya karmatAsaMbanDenAnvayaH. ayogyatvAt. iti praTamAntArTamuKya viSezyakaSAbdaboDANgIkartfnEyAyikamate tAdfSaboDopapAdakamuKyodAharaRAni tu Gawo na Bavati pawaH trayaH kAlAH paSya lakzmaRa pampAyAM bakaH paramaDArmikaH. aSvo gacCatyAnaya ityAdIni drazwavyAni. Gawo na Bavati pawaH iti vAkyAt GawaBedavAn pawaH iti praTamAntArTamuKyaviSezyako boDaH. trayaH kAlAH ityatra tritvaviSizwAH kAlAH iti kAlamuKyaviSezyaka eva boDaH. atra nEyAyikAnAmayamASayaH. traya kAlAH ityatra kriyAsamaBivyAhArABAvAnna kriyAmuKyaviSezyako boDaH. kAlatrayasya jIvena jYAtumaSakyatvena jIvena jYAyante ityaDyAhArAsaMBavaH. ISvareRa jYAyante ityaDyAhAre kriyamARe tu mAnABAvaH. astirBavantIparaH - praTama puruzo prayujyamAnopyasti iti mahABAzyokta (2. 3. 2) niyamAnusAreRa santi ityasya tu nADyAhAraH saMBavati. idAnIM trayARAM kAlAnAmavidyamAnatvAt iti. paramaDArmiko vakaH paSya ityAdO paramaDArmikatva viSizwabakaM paSya iti boDaH. atrAyaM BAvaH. paramaDArmikatvaviSizwabakasya vAkyArTatvena padArTatvABAvAtprAtipadikArTatvameva nAsti iti na bakapadottaraM dvitIyApattiH. evameva paSya mfgo DAvati ityAdAvapyupapattirdrazwavyA. pacati Bavati ityAdO tu taTA BAzyaprayogAdeva kriyAmuKya877<BR>;p{0877}<BR>viSezyakaboDaH svIkriyate. na tu ADunikaprayogAttaTAboDosmABiH svIkriyate. aSvo gacCatyAnaya ityAdO ca gamanakartraSvamAnaya iti praTamAntArTa muKya viSezyaka eva SAbdaboDo nEyAyikAnAmaBimataH. atrAyaM BAvaH. SfRu meGo garjati ityAdO vEyAkaraRamate meGakartfkagarjanasya SravaRakriyAyAmanvayopapattAvapi aSvo gacCatyAnaya ityAdO tanmate aSvakartfkagamanasyAnayanakriyAyAmanvayAyogyatayA bADAdanvayAnupapattiH. ataH gamanakartraSvasyEvAnayanakriyAyAmanvayaH svIkAryaH iti labDoyaM praTamAntArTa muKya viSezyakaSAbdaboDo nEyAyikAnAm. kiM ca SfRu meGo garjati nawo gAyati SfRu Gawo naSyati paSya ityAdO SravaRAdikriyAyAM meGAdyanvayAsaMBavepi saviSezaRe hi viDinizeDO sati viSezye bADe viSezaRamanuBavataH iti nyAyena viSezaRezu garjanagAnanASezu SravaRadarSanAnvayasaMBavaH. ata eva SaNKAH SrUyante BeryaH SrUyante iti mahABAzyam aSrUyata pAYcajanyaH iti mAGaprayogaSca (sa0 3 Slo0 21) saMgacCate iti. vEyAkaraRAstvevamatropapatti cakruH aSrUyata pAYcajanyaH vIRA SrUyate puzpARyAGrAyante ityAdI DarmaDarmiRoraBedopacArAcCravaRAdyanvaya upapadyate (mAGa0 wI0 3. 21) ityalaM vistareRa. mImAMsakAstu sarvatrAKyAtArTavyApAramuKya viSezyaka eva SAbdaboDo Bavati ityaNgIcakruH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0873" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

