शालग्रामः
SAlagrAmaH — 1 parvataviSezaH. 2 tatratyo vizRumUrtiviSezaH. 3 gaRqakyA<BR>;p{0878}<BR>nadyA ekadeSasTalaviSezajAto vizRvAdidevacakrayuta SilAviSezaH. yaTA brAhmaRagfhe nityaM pUjanIyAH SrIvAsudevahayagrIva SrIlakzmInfsiMha sItArAmAKyAH SAlagrAmAH. SAlagrAmotpattikArastu kIwayoniM prapadyeTAH iti gaRqakyAH surAn prati SApe tena karmavipAkena jaqA kfzRA nadI Bava iti devAnAM gaRqakIM prati SApe ca jAte vizRunA tatsamADAnAyoktaM yaTA SfRu brahman mahAdeva SfRu deva gajAnana. madguRO brAhmaRO grAhamAtaNgO SApatotra vE.. BavizyatastayormokzaM vadizyAmi kalevaram. SIrRaM Bavizyati yadA tanmedomajjasaMBavAH.. pAzARAntargatAH kIwAH vajrAKyAH praBavizyaTa (brahmavE0 a0 19) ityAdi. vAsudevAdinAmaPalaBedAstu varAhapurARe jYeyAH. atra praSaMsA SAlagrAmaSilAsparSa ye kurvanti dine dine. vAYCanti karasaMsparSa tezAM devAH savAsavAH.. iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0877" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

