शास्त्रम्
SAstram — [ka] pramARAdivAcakasamUhaH vyUhaviSizwaH. yaTA pacADyAyI nyAyadarSanam SAstram (nyA0 vA0 pf0 1-2). atra vyutpattiH Sizyatenena (SAsazwran) iti SAstram. [Ka] jYAnaviSezADAyakagranTaH. yaTA vESezikadarSanam. [ga] fgyajuHsAmATarvA ca BArataM paYcarAtrakam. mUlarAmAyaRaM cEva SAstramityaBiDIyate.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 157 pUrRapra0). [Ga] SAsti ca trAyate ceti SAstram. yacCAsti vaH keSaripUnaSezAn saMtrAyate durgatito BavAcca. tacCAsanAtrARaguRAScca SAstrametahUyaM cAnyamatezu nAsti.. (nAgArjunakftakArikA 5 bOdDadarSane). SAstraM dviviDam sacCAstram asacCAstraM ca. tatra sacCAsraM hitAnuSAsanagranTaH. yaTA fgAdiSAstram. taduktaM skAnde fgyajuHsAmATarvA ca BArataM paYcarAtrakam. mUlarAmAyaRaM cEva<BR>;p{0879}<BR>SAstramityaBiDIyate.. yaTAnukUlametasya tacca SAstraM prakIrtitam. atonyo granTavistAro nEva SAstra kuvartma tat.. (maDvaBAzya 0 1. 1. 3 pf0 15) iti. asacCAstraM tu bOdDacArvAkAdipraRItaSAstram. sAMKyayogAdikaM pASupatAdiSAKaM ca svabudDiracitatvenAsadeveti viBAvanIyam. tadyaToktam ato vedavirudDArTaSAstroktaM karma saMtyajet. svabudDiracitEH SAstrEH pratAryeha ca bAliSAn.. viGnanti Sreyaso mArga lokanASAya kevalam. nindanti devatA vedAMstapo nindanti saddijAn.. tena te nirayaM yAnti sacCAstranizevaRAt. SrutismftisadAcAra vihitaM karma SASvatam.. straM straM DarmaM prayatnena SreyorTIha samAcaret. svabudDiracitEH SAstrErmohayitvA janaM narAH. tena te nirayaM yAnti yugAnAM saptaviMSatim (padmapu0 a0 17) (vAca0) iti. tAmasaSAstrARi ca padmapurARe pArvatIM pratISvareRoktAni yaTA SfRu devi pravakzyAmi tAmasAni yaTAkramam. yezAM SravaRamAtreRa pAtityaM jYAninAmapi.. praTamaM hi.. mayEvoktaM SEvaM pASupatABiDam. macCaktyAveSitErviprEH saMproktAni tataH param.. kaRAdena tu saMproktaM SAstraM vESezikaM mahat. gOtamena taTA nyAyaM sAMKyaM tu kapilena vE.. dvijanmanA jEmininA pUrvaM vedamapArTataH. nirISvareRa vAdena kftaM SAstraM mahattaram.. DizaRena ca saMproktaM cArvAkamatigarhitam. dEtyAnAM nASanArTIya vizRunA budDarUpiRA.. bOdDaSAstra. masatproktaM nagnanIlapawAdikam. mAyAvAdamasacCAstraM pracCannaM bOdDameva ca.. mayEva kaTitaM devi kalO brAhmaRarUpiRA. apArTaM SrutivAkyAnAM darSaya~llokagarhitam.. karmasvarUpatyAjyatvamatra ca pratipAdyate. sarvakarmapariBraMSAnnEzkamrmyaM tatra cocyate.. parAtmajIvayorEkyaM mayAtra pratipAdyate. brahmaRosya paraM rUpaM nirguRaM darSitaM mayA.. sarvasya jagatopyasya nASanATaM kalO yuge. vedArTavanmahASAKaM mAyAvAdamavEdikam.. mayEva kaTitaM devi jagatAM nASakAraRAt (sAMKpravacanaBAzyaprastAvanAyAM DftAni padmapurARavacanAni pf0 6-7) (vAca0)...<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0878" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

