SizwaH — 1 [ka] PalasADanatvAMSe BrAntirahitaH (di0 1 pf0 5). atra SizwatvaM ca kzIRadozapuruzatvam. yaTA manvAdInAM Sizwatvam iti prASna AhuH (nyA0 si0 dI0 pf0 2). [Ka] izwasADanatvAMSe aBrAntaH (mU0 ma0 1). yaTA manvAdiH SizwaH (ma0 vA0 1). [ga] DarmajYAstu svIkftavedapramARaBAvaH. sarve vedAH svasvatAtparyavizayArTe pramARam ityAkArakAnAhAryaniScayavAn ityarTaH. atra bAlakapatitAntyajAdyatiriktaH iti viSezaRamasti (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 106108). [Ga] vedaprAmARyAByupagantftve sati yo yadA<BR>;p{0881}<BR>vedanizidDAkartA sa ityAhuH (ci0 maNga0 1. 106108). yaTA SukoddAlakAdiH SizwaH. atrABiDIyate. na pARipAdacapalo na netracapalo muniH. na ca vAgaNgacapala iti Sizwasya lakzaRam.. (BAra0 ASva0) iti. Darmo nAtigato yEstu vedaH saparibfMhitaH. SizwA brAhmaRAH proktA nityamAtmaguRAnvitAH.. (kUrma0 upa0 1 a0 4) iti. viSezaSabdanizWastu SezaH SizwaH prakIrtyate. manvantarezu ye SizwA iha tizWanti DArmikAH.. manuH saptarzayaScEva lokasaMtAnakAraRAt. tizWantIha ca DarmArTaM tAnSizwAn paricakzate.. tEH SizwEH sTApito DarmaH sTApyate vE yuge yuge.. (matsyapu0 a0 120) iti. [Na] karmajYASca vedoktatattvajYAnena vedavihitakarmakArI (nIla0 pf0 2) (si0 ca0). yaTA janakaSvetaketvAdiH Sizwa ityAhuH. 2 kftaSAsanaH. 3 avaSizwaH padArTaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0880" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टाचारः
