श्राद्धम्
SrAdDam — [ka] adanIyasya tatsTAnIyasya vA dravyasya pretoddeSena SradDayA tyAgaH. atra vyutpattiH SradDayA dIyate yasmAcCrAdDaM tena nigadyate iti. SrAdDaM dviviDam pArvaRam ekoddizwaM ceti. tatra tripuruzoddeSena yatkriyate tatpArvaRam. ekapuruzoddeSena kriyamARamekoddizwam. punaSca SrAdDaM<BR>;p{0891}<BR>triviDam nityam nEmittikam kAmyaM ceti. tatra nityam niyatanimittopADO coditam. yaTA aharaharamAvAsyAzwakAdizu vihitaM SrAdDam. aniyatanimittopADO coditaM nEmittikam. yaTA putrajanmAdizu vihitaM SrAdDam. PalakAmanopADO vihitaM kAmyam. yaTA svargAdikAmanAyAM kfttikAdinakzatrezu vihitaM SrAdDam. punaSca pacaviDam aharahaH SrAdDam pArvaRam vfdDiSrAdDam ekoddizwam sapiRqIkaraRaM ceti (mitA0 a0 1 Slo0 216). [Ka] pitrAdyuddeSyako yAgaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 5). saMboDanapadopanItAn pitrAdIn caturTyantapadenoddiSya putrAdiBirmantradvArA SradDayAnnAdedanaM SrAdDam ityarTaH. atra viBaktiniyamaSca saMkalpAsanayoH zazWI dvitIyAvAhane taTA. annadAne caturTI syAcCezAH saMboDane smftAH.. iti. SrAdDasya yAgatvaM vijYAya SrAdDakAle brAhmaRA imAM smftiM paWanti caturBiSca caturBiSca dvAByAM paYcaBireva ca. hUyate ca punardvAByAM sa me vizRuH prasIdatu.. iti. tadarTastu caturBiH (ASrAvaya ityaDvaryuprayojyEScaturakzarEH) caturBiH (astu SrOzaw ityAgnIDaprayojyEcaturakzarEH) dvAByAm (yaja ityaDvaryuprayojyAByAM dvAByAmakzarAByAm) paYcaBiH (ye yajAmahe iti hotfprayojyEH paYcaBirakzarEH) dvAByAm (vOzaw iti hotfprayojyAByAM dvAByAmakzarAByAm) eBiH saptadaSaBirakzarEryo hUyate havanakarmIkriyate sa vizRuH me mama prasIdatu prasanno Bavatu iti. atra yajuH SrutiH pramARam ASrAvayeti caturakzaramastu SrOzaqiti caturakzaraM yajeti vyakzaraM ye yajAmaha iti paYcAkzaraM vyakzaro vazawkAra eza vE saptadaSaH prajApatiryajYamanvAyatto ya evaM veda prati yajYena tizWati (tEttirIya saMhi0 kARqa0 1 a0 6 anu0 11) iti. SrAdDe brAhmaRasaMKyAniyamo yAjYavalkyenoktaH. yaTA dvO dEve prAkU trayaH pitrye udagekEkameva vA. mAtAmahAnAmapyevaM tatraM vA vESvadeSikam.. (yAjYa0 a0 1 Slo0 228) ityAdi. SrAdDadevASca daSaviDA gaRadevatABedAH. yaToktam vasutyO kratudakzO kAlakAmO DuriH kuruH. purUravA mArdavASca viSvedevAH prakIrtitAH.. (vAca0 pf04925) iti. anyacca kraturdakzo vasuH satyaH kAmaH kAlastaTA DuriH. rocano mAdravAScEva<BR>;p{0892}<BR>taTA cAnyaH purUravAH.. viSvedevA Bavantyete daSa SrAdDezu pUjitAH iti. [ga] SradDA hetukadAnarUpakarmaviSezaH. tadAhApastambaH aTEtanmanuH SrAdDaSabdaM karma provAca (Apasta0 DarmasU0 2. 7. 16. 1 pf0 76). tadarTaSca SrAdDam iti Sabdo vAcako yasya tatkarma (SrAdDavivekaH) iti. pulastyopyAha saMskftaM vyaYjanAdyaM ca payodaDiGftAnvitam. SradDayA dIyate yasmAt tena SrAdDaM nigadyate.. (SrAdDatattva0).. iti. asmiMSca karmaRi yAgAdAvindrAdInAmiva pitrAderdevatAtvam. taduddeSena mantradvArA dravyatyAgAt. taTA ca yAgAdO mantrAhUtA indrAdayaH SaktimAtreRa tatsTale AvirBUtA yajamAnatyaktadravyadarSanena tfpyantastezAmaBIzwaPalaM yaTA sADayanyi taTA SrAdDepi mantrAhUtAH pitrAdayaH samAgatAH putrAdityaktadravyaBogena tfpyanto viSizwaPalapradAH Bavanti ityevaM kalpanIyam iti. atredaM boDyam. devadattAdiSabdasya yaTA na kevalaM dehamAtram na vA jIvamAtramarTaH. kiMtu tattaddehABimAnI jIva evArTaH. taTA pitrAdiSabdasya utpAdakadehABimAnI kevalaM jIvopi nArTaH. kiM tu vasurudrAdityadevADizWitatAdfSajIva evArTaH. taTA coktam vasavaH pitaro jYeyA rudrA jYeyAH pitAmahAH. prapitAmahAScAdityAH SrutirezA sanAtanI.. pretAnuddiSya yatkarma kriyate mAnuzEriha. tfpyanti devatAstena na pretAH pitaraH smftAH.. (SrAdDakalpe devala0) iti. taTA ca yaTA kAcidgarBiRI suhfdA dattaM dohadaM BuYjAnA svayaM tfpyantI svASrayaM garBaM ca tarpayantI dohadadAtAramapyupakaroti taTA vasvAdayopi SrAdDAnnadarSanamAtratfptAH svADizWitapitrAdIn tarpayantaH SrAdDakarturapIzwadAtAro Bavanti iti jYeyam (vAca0). atra CAndogyaSrutiH tadyatpraTamamamftaM : tadvasava upajIvantyagninA muKena na vE devA ananti na pibantyetadevAmftaM dfzwvA tfpyanti (CA0 u0 3. 6. 1) iti. brAhmaRAdisaMpradAnakakriyAyA iva SrAdDakarmaRa eva svajanyapuRyadvArA viSizwaPalajanakatA. tatkarmasAkziRaH parameSvarasyEva tatra kAlAntaraBAvitattatPaladAnAya tatsADanatvam. taTA ca yo yo yAM yAM tanuM BaktaH SradDayArcitumicCati. tasya tasyAcalAM SradDAM tAmeva vidaDAmyaham.. (gItA0 a0 7<BR>;p{0893}<BR>Slo0 21) iti gItAyAmuktam. SrAdDaBedASca viSvAmitrAdyuktAH nityAdayovagantavyAH. yaTA nityaM nEmittikaM kAmyaM vfdDiSrAdDaM sapiRqanam (ekoddizwam). pArvaRaM ceti vijYeyaM gozWayAM SudDyarTamazwamam. karmANgaM navamaM proktaM dEvikaM daSamaM smftam. yAtrAsvekAdaSaM (GftaSrAdDaM) proktaM puzwyarTaM dvAdaSaM (OpacArikam) smftam.. iti. bfhaspatinA tu nityaM nEmittikaM kAmyaM vfdDiSrAdDaM taTEva ca. pArvaRaM ceti manunA SrAdDaM paYcaviDaM smftam.. iti uktam. evaM kUrmapurARepi. matsyapurARe ca nityaM nEmittikaM kAmyaM triviDaM SrAdDamucyate iti. atra dvAdaSaviDAnAM paYcaviDAnAM ca SrAdDAnAM trizvevAntarBAvaH ityaBiprAyaH. SrAdDadeSA yaTA - SuciM deSaM viviktaM ca gomayenopalepayet. dakziRApravaRaM cEva prayatnenopapAdayet.. avakASezu cokzezu nadItIrezu cEva hi. viviktezu ca tuzyanti dattena pitaraH sadA.. (manu03. 206207) iti. cokzAH svaBAvaSucayoraRyAdipradeSAH. SrAdDaninditadeSAnAha vizRuH. na mlecCavizaye SrAdDaM kuryAdgacCeca tatra na. cAturvarRyavyavasTAnaM yasmindeSe na vidyate.. taM mlecCadeSaM jAnIyAdAryAvartamataH param iti. vAyupurARe ca triSaNkorvarjayeddeSaM sarvaM dvAdaSayojanam. uttareRa mahAnadyA dakziRena tu kIkawAt.. deSaKESaNkavo nAma SrAdDakarmaRi garhitaH. pAraskarAH kaliNgASca sinDoruttarameva ca.. pranazwASramaDarmASca deSA varjyAH prayatnataH ityAdi. evaM brahmapurARepi viSezo jYeyaH. pAraskarA deSaviSezAH. kIkawo magaDaH. sinDurnadIviSezaH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0890" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

