zaqahaH — ahorAtrasADya ekaH somayAgo vede ahaH Sabdenocyate. tAdfSAnAM zaRRAmaharviSezARAM gaRaH zaqahaH. paYcaBiH zaqahErmAso Bavati. tatra catvAraH zaqahA aBiplavasaMjYAH. paYcamaH pfzWayasaMjYaH (puru0 pf0 10). zazWI- – 1 (viBaktiH) [ka] yatkicidDAtvarTe svArTAnvayAboDikA sup. yaTA cEtrasyedam ityAdO zazWI. atra saMbanDavivakzAyAM kArakaviBaktyaprasakteH zazWI Seze (pARi0 2. 3. 50) ityanena sUtreRa cEtrasyedam ityAdO zazWI. cEtrasya dravyam ityAdO svatvasya cEtrasya svam Gawasya kAraRam cEtrasya hastaH ityAdO nirUpitatvAvayavatvAdInAM saMbanDatvenEva zazWyarTatA na tu viSizya nirUpitatvatvAvayavatvatvAdinA. SaktyAnantyaprasaNgAt. saMyogAdisaMbanDasattvepi cEtrasya nedaM vAsaH ityAdO svatvAdisaMbanDaviSezaboDatAtparyeRa yatra nan prayujyate tatra viSezarUpeRa zazWyAH lakzaREva. itTameva ca saMbanDatvena karmatvAdivivakzayA mAtuH smftam ityAdO aDIgarTadayeSAM karmaRi (pARi0 2. 3. 52) ityanuSAsanasya niyamaparatayA sArTakyopapAdanaM vfttikftAmupapadyate. evameva nAgnistfpyati kAzwAnAM na puMsAM vAmalocanAH ityAdO karaRatvAdeH saMbanDatvena vivakzAyAM zazWayupapattiH. ata eva ca AmaM SUdrasya pakvAnnaM pakkamucCizwamucyate ityatra pakkam ityatrAnuzajyamAnAyAH zazWyAH saMbanDatvena kartftvamarTaH na tu svattram. SUdrakartfkavfzotsarge caruhomAnupapatteH iti navIna smArtAnAM matamapyupapadyate (ga0 vyu0 kA0 6 pf0 112). [Ka] SAbdikA - dayastu saMbanDamAsAnye svatvAdO vA SaktA sup. yaTA rAjYaH puruzaH cEtrasya Danam ityAdO zazWI iti vadanti. grAmaM gacCati pawaM dadAti ityAdO ca DAtvarTatAvacCedakIBUte saMyogasvatvAdO dvitIyayADeyatvameva boDyate na tu saMbanDasAmAnyaM boDyate iti na tatrAtiprasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 113..<BR>;p{0898}<BR>lo0<BR>0 66 pf0 76) iti. atredaM SAbdikamataM vijYeyam. zazWyarTaH saMbanDatvena tattadrUpeRa ca svasvAmiBAvAdiH saMbanDaH saMbanDatvena kriyAkArakaBAvaSca. ata evAnekasaMbanDasattvepi svatvAdi saMbanDa viSezatAtparyeRa cEtrasya nedaM vAsaH iti prayujyate. ata eva ekaSataM pazWayarTAH iti zazWI sTAneyogA (pARi0 1. 1. 49) iti sUtrasTaM BAzyaM saMgacCate. dvitIyAditaSca kriyAkArakaBAvasya tattadrUpeREva voDaH. taTEvAnuBavAt. mAtuH smarati ityAdO ca tattadrUpeRa voDe dvitIyAdInAM bADikAnAM sattvAtsaMbanDatvenEva boDaH mAtfsaMbanDi smaraRam iti navyA AhuH. prAYcastu atrApi kriyAkArakaBAvamUlakaM viSezaRatvarUpaM vizayatvameva nimittatvameva vA tattvena saMbanDatvena vA vivakzitam. kriyAkArakaBAvasaMbanDaH kAraRam. SezasaMbanDastu PalaBUtaH. yaTA rAjYaH puruza ityatra rAjapuruzO kartfsaMpradAnarUpAvaBUtAm rAjA puruzAya dadAti iti. tanmUlakasvasvAmiBAvapratItO kartrAdiviSezarUpatAnavagamaH ityAhuH (la0 ma0 kAra0 6 pf0 113). atrAyaM vivekaH. zazWI dviviDA kArakazazWI SezazazWI ceti. SabdaSaktiprakASikAkfnmate yayA DAtvarTe prakAratayA kartftvakarmatvAdi boDyate sA kArakazazWI. yayA tu DAtvarTAtirikte svArTaSezaH saMbanDaH voDyate sA SezazazWI. gadADarAdInAM mate tu yayA DAtvarTe svArTakartftvakarmatvAdi saMbanDatvenEva boDyate na tu prakAratayA sA kArakazazWI. yayA tu DAtvarTAtirikte svArTaH saMbanDatvenEva boDyate sA SezazazWI iti cintanIyaH. atredamavaDeyam. kriyAprakArIBUtorTaH kArakam. tatrArTe zazWI kArakazazWI ityucyate. yaTA sA lakzmIrupakurute yayA parezAm. padmasyAnukarotyeza kumArImuKamaRqalaH. guruvipratapasvidurgatAnAM pratikurvIta Bizak svaBezajEH ityAdAvapi mAtuH smarati cOrasya hinasti jalasyopaskurute ityAdAviva kriyAviSezayoge kArakArTEva zazWI. taRqulasya pAcakaH mEtrasya Boktavyam ityAdAvapi zazWI kArakazazwyeva (Sa0 pra0 pf0 78). sA lakzmIrityatra prayogadfzwyA pratyanUpeByaH karoteH karmaRyapi vEkalpikaH zazWIviDirvaktavyaH iti<BR>;p{0899}. vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 67 wI0 pf0 78). guruvipratapasvidurgatAnAmityatra SAbdikAstu vipattO iti aDyAhftanAmArTe zazWayarTAnvayaH iti neyaM kArakazazWI ityAhuH (kA0 vyA0). taRqulasya pAcaka ityatra DAtvarTe pacanAdO kfdyoge kartfkarmaRoH zazWyanuSizweH karmatvakartftvAdikaM kArakameva iti kArakArTEva zazWI iti jYeyam (Sa0 pra0 pf0 78). yadvA atra karmaRi dvitIyA (pARi0 2. 3. 2) kartfkaraRayostftIyA (pARi0 2. 3. 18) ityAByAM sUtrAByAM vihitAByAM dvitIyAtftIyAByAM SaktyA boDite kartftvakarmatve kartfkarmaRoH kfti (pARi0 2. 3. 65 iti sUtreRa vihitA zazWI lakzaRayA boDayati iti jYeyam. lakzaRAbIjaM tu tAdfSayoH kartftvakarmatvayoH saMbanDatvena boDane tAtparyAnupapattireva prakAratayA boDana eva tAtparyAditi hfdayam. atrAyaM viSezonusaMDeyaH kArakaviBaktiBinnaviBaktyarTasya kriyAyAmananvayaH iti niyamo nAsti. taTA hi maRikAramate tasmAjjAnAti ityAdO jYAnAdirUpaDAtvarTe hetu- 1. viBaktyarTasyAnvayaH. tasmAtsTIyate ityAdO ca sarvamata eva DAtvarTasTityAdO hetuviBaktyarTasyAnvayaH. guruvipratapasvidurgatAnAM pratikurvIta Bizak svaBezajEH ityAdO tu zazWyarTasaMbanDamyApi DAtvarTenvayo dfzwaH iti tAdfSaniyamo nAsti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 Ka0 2 pf0 56) iti. guruvipretyatra SAbdikAnuyAyinastu roge iti nAmADyAhftya tadarTe zazWyarTasya saMbanDasyAnvayaH kartavyaH. taTA ca saMbanDasya kArakatvABAvena kriyAyogABAvAnneyaM kArakazazWI ityAhuH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 1). SezazazWItyasyAyamarTaH. SezaH kArakAdavaSizwaH svasvAmiBAvAvayavAvayaviBAvAdiH saMbanDaH kArakAdanyo vA. tatrArTe zazWI SezazazWI ityucyate. yaTA rAjYaH puruzaH rajakasya vastraM dadAti ityAdO zazWI. rAjYa ityatra zazwyA svatvarUpaH saMbanDo boDyate. sa ca na kArakam. na vA tadarTikA zazWyAdiH kArakaviBaktiH iti jYeyam. rajakasyetyatra ca parizkAryatvAdilakzaRaH saMbanDo vastrAdAveva zazWayAnuBAvyate iti SezazazWI iti vijYeyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 67 wI0 pf0 77). 2 mOhUrtikAstu candramasaH zazWakalAyA hrAsavfdDirUpa kriyAtmaka sTitiviSezaH ityAhuH.<BR>;p{0900}<BR>3 pOrARikAstu brahnAkanyA devasenAKyaH skandaBAryAtmako mAtfkAviSezaH ityAhuH. taduktam mAtfkAsu pUjyatamA sA ca<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0897" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

