saMkaraH — 1 [ka] parasparAtyantABAvasamAnADikaraRayorDarmayorekatra samAveSaH (di0 1) (vE0 vi0 1. 2. 3). etatsaMkaralakzaRaM ca parasparAtyantABAvasamAnADikaraRapadArTadvaya sAmAnADikaraRyatvam iti (la0 va0). svasAmAnADikaraRya svABAvasAmAnADikaraRya svasamAnADikaraRABAvapratiyogitva etatritayasaMbanDena yatkiMcijjAtiviSizwatvaM samuditArTaH iti gurucaraRAH (BikuSAstrI goqabole) prAhuH. ayaM saMkaraSca jAtitve bADakaH iti vijYeyam (nIla0). SrIharza kftaKaRqane tvevaM pratipAditam na sAMkaryasya sarvaTA jAtyaBAvakalpakatvam. mAnABAvAt. evaM ca BUtatvamUrtatve pfTivItvaSarIratve ca jAtirUpe eva. kriyAsamavAyikAraRatAvacCedakatayA mUrtatvAdevi BUtAdipadaSakyatAvacCedakatayA BUtatvAderapi<BR>;p{0901}<BR>jAtitvAt (la0 ma0) iti. [Ka] parasparAtyantABAva sAmAnADikaraRye sati jAtyantareRa sAmAnADikaraRyam. yaTA BUtatvasya mUrtatvAdinA saMkaraH (di0 1) (vE0 u0 1. 2. 3). taTA hi manontarBAvenAkASAntarBAvena ca parasparaM svasvAtyantABAvasamAnADikaraRayoBUtatvamUrtasvayoH pfTivyAdicatuzwaye samAveSaH iti BUtatvaM na jAtiH iti vijYeyam. BUtatvABAvavati manasi mUrtatvaM tizWati. yaTA mUrtatvABAvavati cAkASe BUtatvaM tizWati. pfTivyAdiBUtacatuzwaye tu BUtatvaM mUrtatvaM coBe tizWataH iti saMkaro jYeyaH. 2 DarmAntarasya samAveSaH. viBinnaDarmavatopi DaryEkyaM vA. yaTA upaDeyasaMkarepyupADerasaMkaraH ityAdyaBiyuktoktO (ci0 1) (ga0 sAmA0) (BavA0) kAYcanamayahfdo vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO DUmarUpEkahetO bADAtiriktasyASrayAsidDyAderapi samAveSaH saMkaraH. 3 aBedaH (mU0 ma0 prAmARya0 pf0 420). yaTA atiriktavizayatApakze prakAraBedenEkatra vizayatABeda iti lakzaRadvayasamAveSAtpramABramasaMkaraH (ci0 1 prAmA0 pf0 418) ityAdigranTe saMkaraSabdasyArTaH aBedaH. 4 smftiSAstrakftastu ekavarRapuruzAdvivAhitavarRAntarastriyAM jAto jAtiviSezaH. yaTA mUrDAvasiktasUtAdiH ityAhuH. atredaM vijYeyam anulomajAnAmupanayanAdi saMskArArhatvam pratilomajAnAM tu tadanaItvam iti. varRasaMkarajAtiSca anulomajA pratilomajApi nAnAviDA. yaTA viprAnmUrDAvasikto hi kzatriyAyAM viSaH striyAm. jAtombazWastu SUdrAyAM nizAdaH pArzadopi ca.. (garuqapu0 a0 96) ityAdi. brAhmaRAdvESyakanyAyAmambazWo nAma jAyate. nizAdaH SUdrakanyAyAM yaH pAraSava ucyate.. (manu0 a0 10 Slo0 8-41) (yAjYa0 a0 1 Slo0 9192) ityAdi. atredamaDikaM jYeyam. vyaBicAreRa varRAnAmavedyAvedanena ca. svakarmaRAM ca tyAgena jAyante varRasaMkarAH.. (manu0 a0 10 Slo0 24) iti. strIzu duzwAsu vArzReya jAyate varRasaMkaraH (gItA0 a0 1 Slo0 41) iti ca. 5 AlaMkArikAstu alaMkAraviSeza ityAhuH. taduktam aNgANgitvelaMkftInAM tadvadekASrayasTitA. saMdigDatve ca Bavati saMkarastriviDaH punaH.. 903<BR>;p{0902}<BR>(sA0 da0 pari0 10 lo0 99) iti. 6 DarmajYAstu aspfSya- 1 sparSAdirUpaH saMsargaH. yaTA cARqAlAdisaMkara ityAhuH. aTa cARqAlasaMkaraprAyaScittam. tatra cyavanaH cARqAlasaMkarezu BavanadahanaM pUraRaM sarvaBARqaBedanaM dAravARAM takzaRaM SaNKaSuktirajata celAnAmadBiH prakzAlanaM kAMsyatAmrARAmAkaraSudDiH sOvIrapayodaDitatrARAM parityAgaH SezarasayavasadravyarakzaRaM gomUtrayAvakAhAro mAsaM kzapayet bAlavfdDa strIRAmaDa prAyaScittam iti. taTA Apastambopi antyajAtiravijYAto nivasedyasya veSmani. sa vE jYAtvA tu kAle tu kuryAttatra viSoDanam.. cAndrAyaRaM parAkaM vA dvijAtInAM viSoDanam. prAjApatyaM tu SUdrARAM taTA saMsargadUzaRe.. ityAdi. svalpakAlavizaye sumantuH agamyAgamanastrIvaDacARqAlasaMparkezu kfcCratrayam iti. paraMparAsaMsarge tu vfdDaSAtAtapaH aSuci saMspfSedyastu eka eva sa duzyati. tatspfzwonyo na duzyeta sarvadravyezvayaM viDiH.. iti. devalopi saMspfSyASucisaMspfzwaM tftIyaM vApi mAnavaH. hastO pAdO ca prakzAlya toyenAcamya SudDyati.. ityAdi. 7 saMmArjanyAdiBiH kziptaM raja iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0900" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

