saMketaH — 1 (padavfttiH) [] idaM padamamumarTaM boDayatu iti asmAtpadAdayamarTo bodDavyaH iti vecCA (ci0 4) (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 3) (ta0 pra0 4) (nyA0 bo0 4). yaTA Gawapadasya kambugrIvAdimatyarTe saMketaH. idaM padamityAderarTaSca idaM padametadarTavizayakaboDajanakaM Bavatu iti. asmAdityAderarTastu ayamarTa etatpadajanyaboDavizayatAvAn Bavatu (ga0 Sakti0 wI0 pf0 3) iti. saMketagrahastu vyAkaraRavfdDavyavahArAdito Bavati (mu0 Ka0 4) (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 20 pf0 22) (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 20). tatprapaYcastu SaktiSabda vyAKyAne dfSyaH. [Ka] pataYjalistu padapadArTayoritaretarADyA sarUpaH (smftyAtmakaH). yaTA yoyaM SabdaH sorTaH yorTaH sa SabdaH iti saMketaH ityAha. saMketasya ca loke darSanena tAdfSeSvara saMketasyApyanumAnam. ata eva nyAyavAcaspatye uktam sargAdiBuvAM maharzidevatAnAmISvareRa sAkzAdeva kftaH saMketastadvyavahArAccAsmadAdInAmapi sugrahastatsaMketaH iti (la0 ma0). [ga [ga] anye SAbdikAstu arTaboDajanakaH SabdavyApAra ityAhuH. atra mataBedAH saMketaSca jAtyAdicatuzke iti vEyAkaraRA AlaMkArikAScAhuH. taduktam saMketo gfhyate jAtO guRadravyakriyAsu ca (BartfhariH) iti. SabdEreva pratIyante jAtidravyaguRakriyAH. cAturviDyAdamIzAM tu Sabda uktaScaturviDaH.. (kAvyAdarSe) iti. jAtidravyaguRaspandErDarmEH saMketavattayA. jAtiSabdAdiBedena cAturviDyaM pare (SAbdikAH) jaguH.. (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 18 pf0 17) iti. jAtyAkftiviSizwavyaktO iti nEyAyikA AhuH. atrADikaM ca SaktiSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. saMketo dviviDaH ADunikasaMketaH ISvarasaMketaSca. tatrAdyaH pariBAzA ityucyate. dvitIyaH SaktiH ityucyate (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 3) (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 20). taduktaM BartahariRA AjAnikaScADunikaH saMketo dviviDo mataH. nitya<BR>;p{0904}<BR>AjAnikastatra yA Saktiriti gIyate.. kAdAcitkastvADunikaH SAstrakArAdiBiH kftaH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 23 wI0 vf0 26). idaM ca prAcInamatABiprAyeRa. navyamate ca pariBAzApi SaktiH ityucyata iti boDyam. 2 nartakAstu manogataBAvavyaYjanAya kfto hastAdiceMzwAviSeza ityAhuH. 3 sAhityaSAstrajYASca priyasaMgamArTaM vyavasTApitaM guptasTAnam ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=N