संध्या
saMDyA — 1 ekarUpakAlottaraBA vipararUpakAlayoravakASaviSezaH yaTA divArAtrasya maDyavartikAlaH saMDyA Bavati. sa ca kAlaH divASezadaRqasahitarAtripraTamadaRqAtmakaH kAlaH. tayoScaturdaRqAtmakakAlaSca. taTA ca triyAmAM rajanIM prAhustyaktvAdyantacatuzwaye. nAqInAM taduBe saMDye divasAdyantasaMjYite.. iti. yugasya tu pUrvA saMDyA uttaraSca saMDyAMSaH (nanu0 wI0 kullU0 1. 69). taM cAnyarItyApyAhuH pUrvadivasIyarAtriSezadaRqAdiparadinasUryodayaparyantaH sUryAstAtpUrvottaradaRqAtmakaH kAlaH iti. saMDyAdvayakAlastu ahorAtra saMbanDimuhUrtAtmakaH. taTA ca dakza Aha ahorAtrasya yaH saMDiH sUryanakzatravarjitaH. sA ca saMDyA samAKyAtA muniBistattvavAdiBiH.. (puru0 ci0 pf0 458) iti. taTA nakzatradarSanAtsaMDyA sAyaM tatparataH sTitam. tatparA rajanI jYeyA tatra DarmAntrivarjayet.. (puru0 ci0 pf0 46) ityuktam. 2 sAyAhnaH. 3 saMDyAkAlaH upAsyadevatAviSezaH. atrArTe pramARam saMDyAmupAsate ye tu niyataM SaMsitavratAH iti smftiH. 4 saMDyopAsanA. yaTA anarhaH<BR>;p{0913}<BR>karmaRAM vipraH saMDyAhIno yataH smftaH (smftiH) ityAdO saMDyASabdasyArTaH. atra vyAsa Aha upAste saMDivelAyAM niSAyA divasasya ca. tAmeva saMDyAM tasmAttu pravadanti manIziRaH.. iti. saMDyAtrayasADAraRalakzaRamAha yogiyAjYavalkyaH trayARAM cEva devAnAM brahmAdInAM samAgamaH. saMDiH sarvasurARAM ca tena saMDyA prakIrtitA.. iti. etatsaMDyAtrayaM proktaM brAhmaRyaM yadaDizWitam. yasya nAstyAdarastatra na sa brAhmaRa ucyate.. (Candogapa0) (vAca0) iti. saMDyAPalaM pApavyapohaH (manu0 2. 102). 5 vedAntinastu praboDagAQa nidrAvasTayoH saMDiBavaH svapnaH. yaTA saMDye sfzwirAha hi (brahmasU0 3. 2. 1) ityAdO saMDyaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. atrArTe vyutpattiH jAgratsuzuptisaMDO Bavati iti saMDyaH svapnaH (tattvaprakASikA 3. 2. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0912" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

