संप्रदानत्वम्
saMpradAnatvam — (kArakam) [ka] gatyAdiBinne yadDAtUpasTApye yAdfSArTe vigrahasTacaturTyAM yaH svArTo boDayituM Sakyate sa tadDAtUpasTApyatAdfSakriyAyAM saMpradAnatvamucyate. yaTA brAhmaRAya dAnaM Danasya ityAdO brAhmaRasya saMpradAnatyam. grAmAya gataH ityAdO vigrahasTacaturTyAM DAtvarTe boDyamapi karmatvaM na gatyAdiBinne caturTyAM voDayituM Sakyate. vfkzAya secakaH ityAdO gatyAdiBinne caturTyA voDanIyopi saMvarDayituM ityAditumarTo na vigrahasTayA iti na tatra prasaNgaH. saMpradAnaSabdastu svASrayagocaratyAgajanyasvatvasya pratiyoginyeva SaktaH iti svatvapratiyogitvaM saMpradAnatvam ityAdiko na prayogaH. brAhmaRAya dAnamityatra dadAteH svatvajanakastyAgorTaH. tannivizwe ca svatve brAhmaRAdeH pratiyogitvaM nirUpitatvaM vA caturTyAM boDyate iti tadeva tatra saMpradAnatvam. brAhmaRapratiyogikaM brAhmaRanirUpitaM vA yadvanavftti svatvam tajjanakastyAgaH ityevaM tatra pratyayAt. DAtvarTatAvacCeda kI BUta svatvAKyaPalavattayA DanAderdAnakarmatvAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 70 wI0 pf0 8485). [Ka] DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalaBAgitvenoddeSyatvam. yaTA viprAya gAM dadAti ityAdO<BR>;p{0917}<BR>viprasya saMpradAnatvam. atra saMbanDitvena parecCAvizayatvaM caturTyarTaH. sa ca DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalenveti. vfttitvaM dvitIyArTaH. taTA ca viprasaMbanDiparecCAvizayagovfttisvasvatvaDvaMsa parasvatvAnukUlatyAgAnukUlakftimAn ityanvayaDIH. atra cEtrAya yacCati ityAdiprayogavAraRAya para iti padaM dattam (kA0 vyA0 kAra0 4 pf0 8). karmaRA yamaBiprEti sa saMpradAnam (pARi0 1 4 32) iti sUtreRa viprasya saMpradAnasaMjYA. tadarTaSca tatkriyAkaraRIBUtena tatkriyAkarmaRA yamaBiprEti saMbanDumicCati saH PalaBAgitvenoddeSyaH saMpradAnasaMjYakaH iti. atra gORamuKyasADAraRe saMpradAne caturTI Bavati (vAca0). pitfsvargoddeSena kftagodAnAdisTale dAnajanyasvargAtmakaPalaBAgitvena pituruddeSyatvepi pitfsvargAdikasya DAtvarTatAvacCedakatvABAvena na pitrAdeH saMpradAnatvam iti pitre gAM dadAti iti na prayogaH (kA0 vyA0 kAra0 4 pf0 8). [ga] kriyAjanya PalaBAgitayA karturicCAvizayatvam (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 43). brAhmaRAya gAM dadAti ityAdO kriyA ca dAnam. tajjanyaM PalaM tu svatvam. taTA ca dAnasya svatvahetutve pramARam sapta vittAgamA DarmyA dAyo lABaH fyo jayaH. prayogaH karmayogaSca satpratigraha eva ca.. (manu0 a0 10 Slo0 115) ityAdi. pradAnaM svAmyakaraRam iti ca. atrAyamASayaH. brAhmaRAya tyaktAyAM gavi gOriyaM brAhmaRasya na tu mama ityAdiH sArvajanInapratItireva tatra pramARam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 70 wI0 pf0 85) iti. [Ga] DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalASrayatvaBinnaPalasaMbanDaviSizwatayezwatvam. yaTA brAhmaRAya gAM dadAti ityAdO brAhmaRasya saMpradAnatvam. taTA cAtra nirUpitatvena karturicCAvizayatvaM caturTyarTaH. svatvajanakatyAgo dadAtyarTaH. niruktacaturTyarTasya dvitIyAntArTagovfttitvasya ca DAtvarTatAvacCedakasvatvenvayaH. evaM brAhmaRanirUpitatvenecCA vizayagonizWasvatvajanakatyAgakartA iti boDaH. DAtvarTatAvacCedaketyatra saMbanDastAdfSASrayatvaBinnovaSyaM grAhyaH. tena viprAya gAM dadAti ityAdO svasvatvaDvaMsa viSizwAyAH parasvatvajanakecCAyA dADAtvarTatve gorDAtvarTatAvacCedakI BUtaparasvatvAtmakaPalASrayatvenezwatvepi nAtivyAptiH.<BR>;p{0918}<BR>tatrASrayatvaBinno yo DAtvarTatAvacCedakaPalasaMbanDaH sa nirUpakatvam. tAdfSasaMbanDavattvenezwatvaM ca brAhmaRasyEva na tu goH iti (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 4). [Na] SAbdikAstu prakftaDAtvarTe yatkarma tatsaMbanDitvenecCoddeSyattram iti vadanti. saMpradAnaM triviDam prerakam anumantf anirAkartf (udAsInaM) ceti. taduktaM vAkyapadIye anirAkaraRAtkartustyAgANgaM karmaRepsitam. preraRAnumatiByAM ca laBate saMpradAnatAm.. iti. atra prerakatvaM ca prakftaDAtvarTakriyAjanyaPalaBAgitayecCAvizayatve sati kartfsaMbanDityAgAdivizaya kezwasADanatAboDOpayikavyApAravattvam. anumantftvaM ca jAtezwasADanatAvoDe aprAmARyaSaNkayA SiTilasya kartustAdfSaSaNkAviDUnanakzamapramARopanyAsena pravartanam. karmanizWasvatvAdiPalAByupagamamAtrAnukUlavyApAravattvaM vA. anirAkartftvaM ca prakftaDAtvarTakriyAjanyaBAgitayecCAvizayatve sati kartfpravfttinivfttyanyatarAnukUlavyApArABAvavattvam (vE0 sA0 da0). tatrAdyam viprAya (yAcakAya) gAM dadAti ityAdO vipraH. dvitIyam upADyAyAya gAM dadAti ityAdAvupADyAyaH. tftIyaM ca devatA. yaTA sUryAyArGyaM dadAti ityAdO sUryaH (la0 ma0 kA0 4 pf0 101). nAtra sUryaH prArTayate nAnumanyate na nirAkaroti iti sUryasyodAsInatA vijYeyA (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 200). kacit vizayitvam caturTyarTaH. yaTA cEtrAya kupyati kruDyati ityAdO caturTyarTaH saMpradAnatvam. evam pawAya yatate ityAdO uddeSyatvarUpaM saMpradAnatvaM caturTyarTo DAtvarTakftO boDyate. atredaM boDyam mitraM druhyati Sizya mIrzyati putramasUyati ityapi prayogAt drohAdikarmaRaH saMpradAnatvaM vEkalpikamunnIyate iti. kopapUrvakasya drohAdeH druhAdiDAtuvAcyatve tatkarmaRaH saMpradAnatvam. drohAdimAtrasya taTAtve tu karmatvameva iti punaH kOmArA AhuH. atredaM boDyam. sopasargayoH kruDadruhoH karmaRaH karmatEva na tu saMpradAnatA. ata eva SizyasyAmikrodDA mitrasyABidroQA ityAdO kfdyoge karmaRi zazWayeva pramARam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 70 wI0 pf0 87).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0916" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदायः
saMpradAyaH — guruparaMparAgataH sadupadeSaH. yaTA vEzRava saMpradAyAntargato maDvasaMpradAyaH. ISvara eva sarvasaMpradAyapradyotakaH. taTA hi ISvaro BUtAveSanyAyena nirmARakAyamaDizWAya sarvasaMpradAyapradyotakaH (ku0) iti pAtaYjalA AhuH. nanvaSarIrAtkaTaM vedaGawAdiSabdavyavahArasaMpradAyaH. ucyate. sargAdAvadfzwopagfhItaBUtaBedAnmInaSarIrotpattAvadfzwavadAtmasaMyogAdadfzwasahakftaprayatnavadISvarasaMyogAdvA sakalavedArTagocarajYAnAdvivakzAsahitA - nmInakalevarakaRWatAlvA dikriyAjanyasaMyogAdvedotpattiH. evam kulAlAdiSarIrAvacCedenAdfzwasahakfta prayatnavadISvarasaMyogAt tadbudDIcCAsahitacezwotpattO sakalaGawAnukUlavyApArAdDawotpattiH. evam prayojyaprayojakajYAnAya vyApArABimataSarIrAvacCedenApi adfzwasaha kfteSvarajYAnecCAprayatnAdeva vAgvyavahAraH. tatastatsuSIlo bAlo vyutpadyate soyaM BUtAveSanyAyaH (ci0 2 pariSizwe ISvaravAdaH pf0 23) iti. saMpradAyapravartakaBedAstu padmapurARe SrImannArAyaRo brahmA nArado vyAsa eva ca. SrIlamaDvaH padmanABo nfharirmADavastaTA.. akzoBo jayatIrTaSca jYAnasiMDurmahAniDiH. vidyAniDiSca rAjendro jayaDarmamunistaTA.. puruzottamo brahmaRyo vyAsatIrTamunistaTA. SrImallakzmIpatiH SrImAnmADavendrapurI taTA.. saMpradAyavihInA ye matrAste nizPalA matAH. ataH kalO Bavizyanti catvAraH saMpradAyinaH.. SrImaDvarudrasanakA vEzRavAH kzitipAvanAH (padmapu0) (vAca0) iti. tatroktA vEzRavAdisaMpradAyA yaTA SrISiva uvAca. vEKAnasaH sAmavedI SrIrADAvallaBI taTA. gokuleSo maheSAni taTA vfndAvanI Bavet.. paYcarAtraH paYcamaH syAt zazWaH SrIvIravEzRavaH. rAmAnandI havizyASI nimbArkaSca maheSvari.. tato BAgavato devi daSa BedAH prakIrtitAH. SiKI muRqI jawI cEva dvitridaRqI krameRa ca. ekadaRqI maheSAni vIraSEvastaTEva ca. sapta pASupatAH proktA daSaDA vEzRavA matAH.. (SaktisaMga0 ta0) (vAca0) ityAdi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0919" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

