संप्रश्नः
saMpraSnaH — (liqarTaH) saMpraDAraRam (pARi0 sU0 3. 3. 161 kASikA). tacca upasTitakriyayormaDya ekatarakriyADarmikezwasADanatvanirRayecCA. yaTA kiM Bo vedamaDIyIya uta tarkam ityAdO liNarTaH. atra stroddeSyakatvasaMbanDena saMboDyaviSizwA mannizWA ca vedADyayanatarkADyayanAnyataraBAvanA izwasADanatvaprakAraka nirRayecCAvizayaH iti boDaH (vE0 sA0 da0 lakA0 pf0 131).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0920" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रसादः
saMprasAdaH — 1 samyak prasannatA. 2 yogaSAstrajYAstu cittasya nErmalyasaMpAdako yatnaviSeza ityAhuH. 3 vedAntinastu suzuptisTAnam prARaH (SArI0 BA0). 4 pUrRasuKam (maDvaBA0). atrAyaM vivekaH. AUM BUmA saMprasAdAdaDyupadeSAt AUM (brahmasU0 1. 3. 8) ityaDikaraRe sa vA eza etasmin saMprasAde ratvA caritvA dfzwcEva puRyaM ca pApaM ca punaH pratinyAyaM pratiyonyAdravati iti bfhadAraRyake (4. 3. 1517) svapnajAgaritasTAnAByAM saha prayogAt saMprasAdaH suzuptisTAnamucyate iti SaMkaraBAratImatam (SArI0 BA0 wI0 ratnapra0 1138). maDvAcAryamate tu tatra yo BUmA tatsuKam nAlpe suKamasti BUmEva suKam iti CAndogyaSrutO (7. 23) BUmnaH pUrRasuKarUpatvABiDAnAt saMprasAdaH pUrRasuKam (maDvaBA0 wI0 tattvapra0 1. 3. 8) iti. 5 jIvaH. yaTA ya eza saMprasAdosmAcCarIrAtsamutTAya paraM jyotirupasaMpadya svena rUpeRABinizpadyata eza Atmeti hovAca (CAndo0 upa0 8. 3. 4) ityAdO ityAhuH (brahmasU0 BA0 2. 3. 18)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0920" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धः
saMbanDaH — 1 [ka] saMbanDiBinnatve sati saMbanDyASritaH. [Ka] svaBinnasaMbanDyASritaH svaBinnapratiyogikaH padArTaH (si0 ca0 1 pf0 3). yaTA GawaBUtalayoH saMyogaH. yaTA vA pratyakzasTala indriyArTasaMnikarzaH. [ga] saMbadDavyavahArahetuH (si0 ca0). yaTA GawavadBUtalam iti SAbdaboDasTale saMyogaH. saMbanDatvaM ca yatkiMcitpadArTAnuyogikatvaviSezaH (ga0 2 vyApti0 sidDA0). aTa vA sAMsargikavizayatASrayatvam (rAma0 1 pf0 40). saMbanDo dviviDaH 911<BR>;p{0921}<BR>vfttiniyAmakaH vfttyaniyAmakaSceti. tatra vfttiniyAmakaSca saMyogasamavAyaKarUpakAlikAdiBedenAnekaviDaH. vfttyaniyAmakastu vizayavizayiBAvapratiyogyanuyogiBAvADArADeyaBAvasvasvAmiBAvatAdAtmyAdiBedenAnekaviDaH. tatra saMyogasamavAyAveva muKyO. tadBinnA gORAH. vfttiniyAmakastu kadAcidviroDitAniyAmako Bavati. taTA hi. sADyatAvacCedakasaMbanDena sADyavattAbudDiM prati yena saMbanDena sADyABAvaprakArakaniScayaH pratibanDakaH saH. yaTA parvate saMyogena vahnisADane dESikaviSezaRatAsaMbanDaH. ayaM sADyavattAgraha viroDitAniyAmakasaMbanDaH iti jegIyate. aTa vA svIyayAdfSapratiyogitAvacCedakAvacCinna prakAratASAlijYAnaM prati yena saMbanDena svaprakArakaM jYAnaM viroDi saH. yaTA saMyogena GawavattAbudDiviroDitAniyAmako dESikaviSezaRatAsaMbanDaH ityAdirUhyaH. svaprakArakamityatra svaSabdenABAvo grAhyaH. ayaM ca svapratiyogimattAgrahaviroDitAniyAmakasaMbanDaH ityucyate. 2 DarmaSAstrajYAstu gotrajatvAdiH. yaTA yonisaMbanDaH ityAdO saMvanDaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. 3 nItiSAstrajYAstu nfRAM saMsargaH. sa ca triviDaH vidyAjanyaH yonijanyaH prItijanyaSca ityAhuH. atroktam saMvanDastriviDaH puMsAM viprendra jagatItale. vidyAjo yonijaScEva prItijaSca prakIrtitaH.. mEtraM tu prItijaM proktaM sa saMbanDaH sudurlaBaH (brahmavE0 brahmaKa0 a0 10) (vAca0) iti. 4 samfdDiH. 5 hitam ityajaya Aha. 6 samyagbanDaH saMbanDaH iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0920" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धिः
saMbanDiH — saMbanDasya pratiyogyanuyogi ca. yaTA GawavadBUtalam ityAdO saMyogasya GawaH pratiyogI BUtalaM tvanuyogi Bavati (rAma0 1 pf0 39). atra saMbanDitA ca ADArAnADArasaMbanDimAtrasADAraRaH svarUpasaMbanDaviSeza iti vijYeyam (mU0 ma0 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0921" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबोधनम्
saMboDanam — [ka] vakturavyavahitaSabdajanyaboDASrayatvenecCA. yaTA cEtra tvayA BujyatAm ityAdO cEtrapadottaravartipraTamAviBakterarTaH. atra saMboDane ca (pARi0 2. 3. 47) ityanena sUtreRa praTamA saMboDanamevAha. taTA ca praTamArTatAdfSecCAyAH prakftyarTaviSezyatayA BAnam. atredaM 116<BR>;p{0922}<BR>jYeyam saMboDanaviBaktapanta prakftyarTonyatra viSezaRatayA nAnveti (ga0 vyu0 saMbu0 pf0 117118) iti. SAbdikAstu [Ka] kriyAviniyogaPalakABimuKIkaraRam (la0 ma0). [ga] anaBimuKasyABimuKIkaraRaM saMboDanam (kASikA0) ityAhuH. saMboDanapadArTasya kriyAyAmevAnvaya ukto hariRA saMboDanapadaM yaca tatkriyAyA viSezaRam (vAkyapa 0) iti. sTitasyABimuKIBAvamAnaM saMboDanaM viduH. prAptABimuKyaH puruzaH kriyAsu viniyujyate.. (vAkyapa0) iti ca. [Ga] anyatrAsaktasyABimuKIkaraRalakzaRo'BIzwakriyAsu viniyogAya jYApanAdirUpavyApAra viSezaH (vAca0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0921" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबोध्यत्वम्
saMboDyatvam — 1 [ka] kriyAkaraRAya vakraBipretatvam. vaktfnizWa vilakzaRaboDaviSezyatvaM vA. yaTA cEtra vraja ityAdO praTamArTaH. atroktaM hariRA prAptABimuKyaH saMboDyaH kriyAsu viniyujyate (vAkyapa0) iti. atra tAdfSasaMboDyatvavAMScEtronumatavrajanavAn ityAkArako boDaH. [Ka] SAbdikAstu saMboDanavizayatvam ityAhuH (la0 ma0). 2 praSaMsyatvam. yaTA sumitrAmAta nEtatte vicitraM citrayoDinaH ityAdO saMbudDisubarTaH. atra mAtfSabdasya fkArAderakArAdeSaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0922" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभवः
saMBavaH — 1 (anumAnam) [ka] avinABAvavfttyA ca saMbadDayoH samudAyasamudAyinoH samudAyenetarasya grahaRam. tadapyanumAnameva (gO0 vA0 2. 2. 2). atra saMBavaH pramARAntaram iti pOrARikA AhuH. saMBavopyanumAnameva na tu pramARAntaram iti vESezikA nEyAyikASca prAhuH (ta0 va0 pf0 100) (nIla0 pf0 34). atra BAzyam saMBavopyavinABAvitvAt (vyAptimUlakatvAt) anumAnameva (praSasta0 2 pf0 28) iti. [Ka] BUyaH sahacArADInajYAnam. yaTA saMBavati brAhmaRe vidyA saMBavati sahasre Satam (gO0 vf0 2. 2. 1) (ta0 dI0) (ta0 va0 pf0 99) iti. [ga] avinABAvinorTasya sattAgrahaRAdanyasya sattAgrahaRam. yaTA droRasya sattAprahaRAdAQakasya sattAgrahaRam. AQakasya sattAgrahaRAt prasTasya (vAtsyA02. 2. 1) iti.<BR>;p{0923}<BR>KAryAM droRAQaka prasTAdyavagamaH. sa cAnumAnameva. KArItvaM hi droRAdyavinABUtaM pratItaM KAyAM droRAdisattvamavagamayati ityanumAnAntargatatayA pramARAntaratvaM dUzitam. taTA hi KArItvaM KArIparimARam. mahAparimARe svAvAntaraparimARasamAveSonuBavasidDaH. taTA ca KArIparimARaM droRAdiparimARavyApakam iti vyApakasTityA vyApyasTiterAvaSyakatvAdanumAnenEva gatArTatA (tattvakOmudI 0) (vAca0) iti. [Ga] vedAntinastu alpapramAsADanaM bahulajYAnam. yaTA SatamasyAsti iti jYAne paYcASajjYAnam ityAhuH (pra0 ca0 pari0 1 pf0 44). saMBavo dviDA saMBAvanAtmakaH nirRayAtmakaSceti. tatrAdimo na pramARam. aniScAyakatvAt. yaTA brAhmaRezu caturdaSavidyABijYatvaM saMBavati iti. dvitIyastu Sate paYcASat iti (si0 ca0). atra SatavAn ityukte paYcASadvAn iti jYAnaM saMBavati. tasyAnumAnenEva nirvAhAt. Satasya paYcASavyApyatvAt iti BAvaH (nIla0 pf0 34). atrAyaM prayogaH SataM paYcASadvat tadBUwitatvAt (ta0 va0 pf0 100) iti. devadattaH paYcASadvAn SatavattvAt yaTAham iti ca. 2 utpattiH. 3 ADeyasyADAre samAveSanayogyatvarUpo vyApAraH. 4 utkawakowikasaMdehaH (gadA0). 5 saMketaH. 6 apAyaH ityajaya Aha. 7 hetuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0922" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभावना
saMBAvanA — 1 [ka] utkawEkatarakowika saMSayaH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 69) (nIla0 4 pf0 31) (ta0 va0). yaTA gacCa gacCasi cetkAnta panTAnaH santu te SivAH. mamApi janma tatrEva BUyAdyatra gato BavAn.. ityAdO maraRasaMBAvanA (nIla0 4 pf0 30). atra OtkawyaM ca vizayatAviSezaH (nIla0 4 pf0 31) (ga0 satpra 0). [Ka] vEyAkaraRAstu kriyAsu yogyatADyavasAyaH (liNarTaviSezaH) yaTA sarpipopi syAn ityAdO liNAdyarTa ityAhuH. [ga] mADvavedAntinopyAhuH vAhyAlIpradeSezu puruzeRAnena Bavitavyam ityUhAparanAmakasaMBAvanAjYAnam anyatarakowiprApaka prAcuryanimittonyatarakowipraDAnakaH saMSaya eva (pra0 pa0 pf0 5) iti. 2 AlaMkArikASca arTAlaMkAraviSezaH ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0923" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

