संशयः
saMSayaH — 1 [ka] ekasminDarmiRi virudDanAnAkowikaM jYAnam (ta0 saM0). idaM tu boDyam. saMSayaSca pratyakzarUpaH saMnikarzajanyatvAt iti. ata evoktam parokzajYAnamanAhAryaM niScayaSceti sidDAntAt iti. saMSayo nyAyasyANgaM Bavati. yasmAnnAnupalabDe na nirRIte nyAyaH pravartate api tu saMdigDe tu (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 14). atra viSezAdarSanam kowidvayasmaraRam DarmijYAnaM ca saMSayamAtre hetuH iti vijYeyam (si0 ca0) (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 131). saMSayalakzaRaM tu svIyEkakowiprakAratAvacCinnapratibaDyatAnirUpitapratibanDakatAvacCedakI BUtAparakowi prakAratASA lijYAnatvam (di0 gu0). atra saMSayIyavizayatAyAH pratibanDakatAvacCedakatvakaTanaM ca saMSaye viSezyatAdvayam iti pakzABiprAyeReti vijYeyam. saMSaye ca uBayaprakAratAvirUpitA<BR>;p{0928}<BR>viSezyatA ekEva. samuccaye tu viSezyatAdvayam iti saMSayasamuccayayorBeda iti ca vijYeyam. yadvA avacCedyAvacCedakaBAvApannavizayatAvattvam (ga0 satpra0). saMSayIyaviSezyatayoravacCedyAvacCedakaBAvastu samuYcayajYAnavyAvartanAyAvaSyaM svIkartavya iti sUkzmadarSiBirvijYeyam. atra saMSayalakzaRaM ca sUtrakArEruktam samAnAnekaDarmopapattervipratipatterupalabDyanupalavDyavyavasTAtaYca viSezApekzo vimarSaH saMSayaH (gO0 1. 1. 23) (tA0ra0 Slo0 56). tatra (1) samAnaDarmopapatte - viSezApekzo vimarSaH saMSayaH iti. sTARupuruzayoH samAnaM DarmamArohapariRAhO paSyan pUrvadfzwaM ca tayorviSezaM buButsamAnaH kiMsvit ityanyatarannAvaDArayati. tadanavaDAraRaM jYAnaM (vimarSaH) saMSayaH. vastusvarUpAnavaDAraRAtmakaH pratyaya ityarTaH (nyA0 vA0 1 pf0 13). samAnamanayorDarmamupalaBe viSezamanyatarasya nopalaBe ityezA budDirapekzA saMSayasya pravartikA vartate. tena viSezApekzo vimarSaH saMSayaH. (2) anekaDarmopapatteriti. samAnajAtIyamasamAnajAtIyaM cAnekam. tasyAnekasya DarmopapatterviSezasyoBayaTA dfzwatvAt. samAnajAtIyeByosamAnajAtIyeByaScArTA viSizyante. ganDavattvAtpfTivyavAdiByo viSizyate guRakarmaByaSca. asti ca Sabde viBAgajatvaM viSezaH. tasmin dravyaM guRaH karma vA iti saMdehaH. viSezasyoBayaTA dfzwatvAt kiM dravyasya sato guRakarmaByo viSezaH AhosvidguRasya sata iti aTa karmaRaH sata iti viSezApekzA anyatamasya vyavasTApakaM DarmaM nopalaBe iti budDiriti. (3) vipratipatteriti. vyAhatamekArTadarSanaM vipratipattiH. vyAGAto viroDosahaBAva iti. astyAtmetyekaM darSanam. nAstyAtmetyaparam. na ca sadBAvAsadBAvO sahEkatra saMBavataH. na cAnyatarasADako heturupalaByate. tatra tattvAnavaDAraRaM saMSaya iti. (4) upalabDyavyavasTAtaH Kalvapi saccodakamupalaByate taqAgAdizu. marIcizu cAvidyamAnamudakamiti. tataH kvacidupalaByamAne tattvavyavasTApakasya pramARasyAnupalabDeH kiM sadupalaByate aTAsat iti saMSayo Bavati. (5) anupalabDyavyavasTAtaH sacca nopalaByate mUlakIlakodakAdi. asaccAnutpannaM nirudDaM vA. tataH<BR>;p{0929}<BR>kvacidanupalaByamAne saMSayaH. kiM sannopalaByata utAsat iti saMSayo Bavati. viSezApekzA pUrvavat. pUrvaH samAnonekaSca Darmo jYeyasTaH. upalabDyanupalabDI punarjYAtfsTe. etAvatA viSezeRa punarvacanam. samAnaDarmADigamAt samAnaDarmopapatterviSezasmftyapekzo vimarSa iti. sTAnavatAM lakzaRavacanamiti samAnam (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 23). vArtikakftastu samAno hi DarmaH yo vivakzitatajjAtIyavfttitve sati anyajAtIyavfttiH saH. ayaM sADAraRo Darma upalaByamAnaH saMSayahetuH (nyA0 vA0 1. 23 pf0 93) ityAhuH. atrAyaM viSezaH. samAnaDarmavattayA DarmijYAnasyAnvayavyatirekAByAM saMSaya hetutvamavaDAryate (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 34). tadarTaSca tatkowisADAraRaDarmavattayA DarmijYAnasya tatkowisaMSayahetutvamavaDAryate. anvayavyatireketi turagAdO vegena gacCatoneka vfkzendriyasaMnikarzepi yasyEva DarmiRo jYAnaM tatrEva panasatvAdisaMSayaH nAnyatra iti DarminiyamArTam. DarmijYAnasyotkawakowikasaMSayahetutvamiti BAvaH. (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 130131). anekapratyaya hetuDarmonekaDarmaH. yata eva pratyayo Bavati idamekamanekam iti. tatrEkapratyaya heturaBedaH. anekapratyaya hetuDarmo viSezaH. yaTA Sabdasya viBAgajatvam. sAmAnyaviSezasamavAyeByaH Sabdasya sadAdinA viSezeRa nirBaktasya tasmiMstu dravyaM guRaH karma vA iti viBAgajatvAtsaMSaya ityAhuH (nyA0 vA0 1. 23 pf0 95). vipratipattijanyasaMSayasyodAharaRAnantaraM yaTA eko brUte Sabdo nityaH iti. aparaH anityaH iti. tayorvipratipattyA maDyasTasya puMso viSezamapaSyato Bavati saMSayaH kimayaM SabdaH anitya uta. nityaH iti (ta0 BA0 pf0 42). saMSayasya nirRAyakABAvasahakftAH sADAraRaDarmA sADAraRaDarmavipratipattyupalabDyanupalabDayaH paYca kAraRAni iti nyAyaBAzyakfto vAtsyAyanAH pakzilasvAminaH AhuH (ta0 va0 pari0 10). tadyaTA (1) sTARupuruzayoH sADAraRaDarmamUrDvatAdilakzaRaM purovartinyupalaBya sTARupuruzO smftvA viSezajijYAsAyAM sTARusvaniScAyakaM vakrakowarAdikaM puruzatvaniScAyakaM SiraHpARyAdikaM cAnupalaBamAnasya dolAyamAnaM saMSayajYAnamutpadyate kimayaM sTARurvA puruzo vA iti. (2) Sabde 117<BR>;p{0930}<BR>cAkASaviSezaguRatvamasADAraRaDarmamupalaBamAnasya nirRAyakamajAnataH saMSayo Bavati kiM Sabdo nityo na vA iti. (3) indriyezu vESezikasAMKyayorBOtikatvABOtikatvarUpAM vipratipatti paSyato niScAyakaM cApaSyataH saMSayo Bavati kimindriyARi BOtikAni utABOtikAni iti. (4) kUpaKananAnantaraM jalopalabDO satyAM nirRAyakABAve saMSayo Bavati kiM prAk sadevodakaM kUpaKananenABivyaktamupalaByate utAsadevotpannam iti. (5) asmin vawe piSAcorita iti vArtAM Srutavato vawasamIpaM gatasya puruzasya piSAcAnupalabDO nirRAyakABAve saMSayo Bavati kiM vidyamAna eva piSAcontarDAnaSaktyA nopalaByate utAvidyamAna eva iti. atra upalabDyanupalabDyoH sADAraRaDarma evAntarBAvaH. taTA ca trIRyeva kAraRAni iti nyAyavArtikakfta AhuH. asADAraRavipratipattyorapi sADAraRaDarma evAntarBAvaH. ataH sADAraRaDarmeREva sarvatra saMSaya iti vESezikA AhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 3-4) (ta0 va0 pari012 pf0 214215). [Ka] DarmitAvacCedakAvacCedenAnyatara kowyavagAhi jYAnam (ta0 pra0). [ga] virudDa BayAropasAmagrIdvayasamAjAduBayAropa eka eva Bavati saH (ci0 1). DarmijYAnasahitavirudDoBayaviSizwabudDisAmagrIsamAjAdevoBayavizayakAropa eko Bavati sa eva saMSayaH iti samuditArTaH (mU0 ma0 1). [Ga] ekaDarmikavirudDaBAvABAvaprakArakajYAnam (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 23) (mu0 gu0). [Na] ekasminDarmiRi virudDanAnADarmavESizwyajYAnam. yaTA parvato vahnimAn na vA iti jYAnaM saMSayaH. samuditArTaSca ekaDarmAvacCinna viSezyakaBAvABAvaprakArakajYAnam (nyA0 vA0). aTa vA yatkiMcidDarminizWaviSezyatAnirUpitavirudDa nAnADarmanizWaprakAratAnirUpitaprakAritASAlijYAnam (vAkya 0) (la0 va0) iti. [ca] prasidDAnekaviSezayoH (sTARupuruzayoH) sAdfSyamAtradarSanAt uBayaviSezAnusmaraRAn aDarmAcca kiMKit ityuBayAvalambI vimarSaH saMSayaH (praSasta0 guRani0 pf0 39). yaTA dUravartini uccEstare ayaM sTARurvA puruzo vA iti jYAnam (ta0 saM0) (vE0 u0 2. 2. 17) (ta0 kO0). ayaM saMSayA<BR>;p{0931}<BR>kArastu virudDaBAvadvayakowikasaMSayANgIkAreRopapadyate. pare tu sTARutvatadaBAvapuruzatvatadaBAvakowika iti tadvAkyArTa ityAhuH (nIla0). [Ca] anavaDAraRAtmakaM jYAnaM saMSayaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 237 akzapA0). [ja] virudDakowidvayAvagAhijYAnaM saMSayaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 355 pAta0). nyAyavArtikakfnnaye saMSayastriviDaH asati viSezadarSane sADAraRaDarmajYAnajanyaH viSezAdarSane sati asADAraRaDarmajYAnajanyaH viSezAdarSane sati vipratipattijanyaSceti. Adyo yaTA uccEstaratvaM sTARuttrasADAraRaM jYAtvA ayaM sTARurna vA iti saMdigDe. sTARuH puruzo vA iti vA jYAnam. dvitIyo yaTA SabdatvaM nityAnityavyAvfttaM Sabde gfhItvA Sabdo nityo na vA iti saMdigDe. yaTA vA nityAdanityAcca vyAvfttena BUmAtrAsADAraRena ganDavattvena viSezamapaSyato Bavati Buvi nityatvAnityatvasaMSayaH. atra vESezikA AhuH. asADAraRaDarmaH saMSAyako Bavan vyAvfttyEva Bavati. yaTA SabdatvavyAvfttirnitye anitye cAstIti Sabdo nityo na vA iti saMSayaH. vyAvfttiSca sADAraRaDarma eva iti nADikyam. taTA ca sidDAntaH sADAraRaDarmAdekasmAdeva sarvatra saMSayaH iti (ta0 va0 pari0 12 pf0 214215). tftIyo yaTA yatra Sabdena kowidvayopasTitidvArA prAmARyaM svato grAhyaM parato grAhyaM vA iti mAnasaH saMSaya utpadyate (nyA0 vA0) (ta0. BA0 pf0 4142) (ta0 pra0) (gO0 bf0 1. 1. 23) (mu0) (si0 ca0). kaRAdanaye dviviDaH saMSayaH bahirvizayakaH antarvizayakaSca. etanmate dviviDopi saMSayaH sADAraRaDarmavattAjYAnAdeva Bavati nAnyasmAt iti vijYeyam. tatra bahirvizayakopi dviviDaH dfSyamAnaDarmikaH adfSyamAnaDarmikaSca. tatra dfSyamAnaDarmiko yaTA UrDvatvaviSizwasya Dar