ABAvatvena vahnivyApyasya pfTagBAnepi saMSayatvaGawakIBUtasvanizWavahnimatpakzavizayitAyAM vahnivyApyABAvaniScaya pratibaDyatAvacCedakatvavirahAt iti. vizayitAyAM<BR>;p{0933}<BR>svanizWatvaniveSanena avacCedakAvacCedenAnumitO pakzatAvacCedakasAmAnADikaraRyamAtreRa kowidvayAvagAhiniScayasya avacCedakAvacCedena sADyAdimattAniScayapratibaDyatvepi pakzatAtvavAraRam iti. SudDavahnitvAvacCinnasADyakasTale parvato vahnimAn ityAdO vahnayaBAvavAn parvataH ityetAdfSabADapratibaDyasya mahAnasIyavahnimAnna vA pakzaH ityetAdfSasya saMSayasya pakzatAtvavAraRAya sADyavattAniScayapratibaDyatAvacCedakAvacCinnatvaM pratibaDyatAyAM niveSanIyam (ga0 pakza0 pf0 4). pakzatA ceyaM pUrvapakzIyA AcAryamatasidDA ca iti boDyam (vAca0). [Ka] aTa vA svaGawitaDarmAvacCinnapratibanDakatAnirUpitapratibaDyatAvacCedakIBUtA svanirUpakatAvacCedakaDarmAvacCinnanirUpitaviroDavizayatAnirUpitavizayatAnirUpitA prakAritA sAmAnADikaraRyasaMbanDena tadviSizwaprakAritAvajjYAnam. etallakzaRasyAvataraRikA cetTamuktA. vyApyavfttitvaviSizwakowidvayAvagAhijYAnaM saMSayaH iti mate saMSaye samuccayavyAvfttavizayitAM pradarSya ekaDarmikanAnAvirudDakowyavagAhijYAnaM saMSayaH iti mate saMSayatvaM nirvakti aTa vA ityAdinA granTena iti. atra svapadena saMSayavizayEkakowinirUpitA prakAritA grAhyA. [ga] kecittu sADyaniScayasADyABAvaniScayaprativaDyatAvacCedakaviSezyatASAlijYAnaM saMSayaH ityAhuH. ayaM BAvaH. saMSaye ca DarmiRi uBayaprakAratAnirUpitE kavilakzaRa vizayatA samuccayavElakzaRyAyopagamyate iti tAdfSavizayatAyA viBinnarUpeRoBayaniScayapratibaDyatAvacCedakatayA nAsaMBavaH (ga0 pakza0 pf0 4) iti. etaccintyam. cintAvIjaM tu vahnitvavahnayaBAvatvoBayapuraskAreRa vahnayaBAvAvagAhini parvato vahnayAtmakavahnayaBAvavAn iti samuccayetivyAptiH iti. SizwaM tu pakzatASabdavyAKyAne dfSyam.<BR>avidyeti padacCedaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0927" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

