saMsargaH — 1 [ka] saMbanDaH. yaTA pakze sADyasaMsfzwatvajYAnamanumitikAraRam (mu0 2) ityAdO. [Ka] saMsargatAKyavizayatAvAn. yaTA SAbdaboDe cEkapadArTe aparapadArTasya saMsargaH saMsargamaryAdayA BAsate (ga0 vyu0 1) ityAdO GawavadBUtalam iti SAbdaboDIyaH saMyogAKyaH saMsargaH. 2 vyavahAraSAstrajYAstu viBAgAnantaraM yattava mama ca DanaM tadAvayoH iti kftasamayenEkatrAvasTAnarUpo DanasaMbanDaH (saMsfzwiH) saMsargaH ityAhuH. 3 DarmajYAstu pAtakisaMbanDaH ityAhuH. pAta kisaMsargasya pApahetutvamAha manuH brahmahatyA surApAnaM steyaM gurvaNganAgamaH. mahAnti pAtakAnyAhuH saMsargaScApi tEH saha. (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 54) yo yena patitenEzAM saMsarga yAti mAnavaH. na tasyEva vrataM kuryAttatsaMsargaviSudDaye.. (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 181). prAyaScittIyatAM prApya dEvAtpUrvakftena vA.<BR>;p{0935}<BR>na saMsargaM brajetsadBiH prAyaScitte'kfte dvijaH.. (manu0 a0 11 lo0 47) iti. vizRuH yaSca yena pApAtmanA saha saMsfjyeta sa tasyEva prAyaScittaM kuryAt iti. evaM gOtamopi. ke te saMsargaprakArA ityAha turmanubfhaspatI ekaSayyAsanaM patirBARqapakvAnnamiSraRam. yAjanADyApanaM yonistaTA ca sahaBojanam.. navaDA saMkaraH prokto na kartavyoDamEH saha (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 180) iti kUrmapurARe vyAsaH mahApAtakinastvete yaSca tEH saha saMvaset. saMvatsaraM tu patitEH saMsarga kurute tu yaH.. yAnaSayyAsanErnityaM jAnanvE patito Bavet iti. atredaM. boDyam. mahApAtakasaMsargasyEva kalO pApahetutvam nAnyapApisaMsargasya. yaToktaM parASareRa kfte saMBAzaRAtpApaM tretAyAM cEva sparSanAt. dvApare cAnnamAdAya kalO patati karmaRA.. iti. atra sarvasmftiSAstrAkalanAdvayaM brUmaH. kalAvapi mahApAtakisaMsargamyevAnyapApisaMsargasyApi pApahetutvamastyeva. paraMtu tatpApaM svalpameva. tannirRejanAya tadanuguRaM prAyaScittaM kAryameva iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0934" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

