saMsargABAvaH — (aBAvaH) [ka] tAdAtmyAtiriktasaMsargAropajanyapratItivizayABAvaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 56). atrArTe saMsargABAvapadasya vyutpattiH saMsargeRa tAdAtmyAtiriktena saMbanDena avacCinnapratiyogitAkaH aBAvaH iti. maDyamapadalopI samAsaH SAkapArTivavajjYAtavyaH. ayaM BAvaH. DvaMsaprAgaBAvayorapi kiMcitsaMbanDAvacCinna pratiyogitAkatvamasti ityaBiprAyeReyaM vyutpattiH. saMsargABAvasya lakzaRaM ca tAdAtmyasaMbanDAnavacCinnapratiyogitAkA BAvatvam (ga0 2 sidDAnta0). aTa vA anyonyABAvaBinnABAvatvam (mu0 1 pf0 42). anye tu<BR>;p{0936}<BR>saMsargABAvatvaM ca saMsargAropajanyapratItivizayABAvatvameva aKaRqopADi vetyAhuH (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 57). saMsargABAvagrahe pratiyogiyogyatEva tatram. yattu saMsargABAvagrahe pratiyogyaDikaraRoBayayogyatvaM tatram iti kESciduktam. tanna samIcInam. AkASe rUpAtyantABAvapratyakzasya nivfttaH kolAhalaH iti DvaMsapratyakzasya cAnupapattyA tahe aDikaraRayogyatApekzA nAsti (sarva0 pf0 231 OlU0) (vE0 u0 9. 1. 8) (vE0 vi0 92118 pf0 381). ata eva tvaksaMyuktakAlaviSezaRatayA vAyusparSanASapratyakzaM pakzaDaramiSraH svIkftam. [Ka] anyonyABAvaBinnaH aBAvaH (ta0 pra0) (mu0 1 pf042). yaTA nAsti Gawo gehe iti sato Gawasya gehasaMsargapratizeDaH (vE0 9. 1. 10) iti sUtre pratipAdyaH aBAvaH. DvaMsaprAgaBAvayoH kiMcitsaMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogitAkatvAnaNgIkAre tu idaM lakzaRAntaram iti vijYeyam. lakzaRasyAyamarTaH. gehe Gawasya yaH saMsargaH saMyogastasya pratizeDaH. sa ca yadi kadAcidapi na GawastadAtyantABAva eva BavizyataH prAgaBAvaH BUtasya praDvaMsABAvaH iti vESezikA AhuH (vE0 u0 9. 1. 10). aTa vA sataH pUrvaM tatra vartamAnasya GawasyEva gehasaMsargapratizeDaH gehe saMsargABAvaH. tadviSezotyantABAvaH nAsti gehe GawaH iti pratyakzavizayaH iti samuditasUtrArTaH iti nEyAyikA AhuH (vE0 vi0 9. 1. 10 pf0 384). atredaM boDyam. saMsargABAvaSca naYAdinipAtena DAtunA ca boDyate. tatra nipAtena prAtipAdikArTABAvasya boDane anuyogini saptamyapekzA. yaTA gehe Gawo nAsti ityAdO. viBaktyarTasaMsargABAvasya DAtvarTAdO boDane tu nAyaM niyamaH. yaTA gaganaM na paSyat