sattA — 1 (sAmAnyam) dravyaguRakarmasamavetA (sarva0 220 OlU0). iyaM ca vESezikamate parasattA parasAmAnyaM vA ityucyate dravyaguRakarmavfttiSceti boDyam (BA0 pa0). tatra pramARam BAvonuvfttereva hetutvAtsAmAnyameva (bE0 1 2 4) iti. iyaM sattA dravyaM sat guRaH san ityAdyanugatapratItyEva sidDyati. atra sUtram saditi yato dravyaguRakarmasu sA sattA (vE0 112. 7) iti. taTA cAnumAnam sattA na dravyAdyAtmikA vilakzaRabudDivedyatvAt (vE0 u0 7. 2. 27) (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 27) (vE0 112817) iti. iyaM sattA vESezikamata eva prasidDA. navyAstu imAM sattAM na svIcakruH. ayamASayaH. san iti pratItAvizayo BAvatvameva. ata eva sAmAnyAdizvapi sat iti vyavahAraH. na tvatiriktA dravyAditrikavartinI sattAKyA jAtiH iti. tena paramaparaM sAmAnyam paraM sattA iti vESezikaviBAgo niryuktikatvAdanAdeyaH (di0 1 pf0 36) iti. 2 vidyamAnatvam. tacca kAlasaMbanDaH. yaTA Gawo Bavati ityAdO BUDAtvarTaH. yaTA vA BUtale GawasattAdaSAyAm ityAdO sattASabdasyArTaH. mAyAvAdimate sattA triviDA pAramArTikI vyAvahArikI prAtItikI (prAtiBAsikI) ceti (vedA0 sA0). tatra pAramArTikI brahmaRaH sattA. trikAlAbADyatvAt. vyAvahArikI ca GawAdInAM sattA. vyavahArakAle abADyatvAt. sA tu tattvajYAnanASyA. prAtiBAsikI tu SuktO rajatAdeH. aDizWAnajYAnabADyatvAt. pratiBAsakAlamAtra sattvAcca iti. sA cADizWAna sAkzAtkAranASyA. brahmasattayEva sarvezAM sattAvyavahAraH. sadutpannatvAt (vedA0 pa0) iti. 3 AtmaDAraRAnukUlavyApAraH sattA iti SAbdikA<BR>;p{0945}<BR>vadanti. atroktaM BartfhariRA AtmAnamAtmanA viBradastIti vyapadiSyate. antarBAvAcca tenAsO karmaRA na sakarmakaH.. (vAkyapa 0) iti. 4 arTakriyAkAritvam. yaTA yatsat tatkzaRikam ityAdO iti bOdDA AhuH. 5 prAmARikatvam ityanya AhuH. satyaMkAraH: - satyasya kAraH (visAra iti pra0) (mitAkzarA a0 2 lo0 61). satyatvam - yatra drazwA ca dfSyaM ca darSanaM cAvikalpitam. tasyEvArTasya sattyatvamAhutragyantavedinaH.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 309 pARi0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0944" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्यम्
sattyam — 1 pramitivizayaH. yaTA GawapawAdi sarvaM jagat sattyam. yaTA vA vedAntimate BUtapaYcakam. atrArTe vyutpattiH santi pfTivyaptejAMsi sa tyO vAyvAkASO ca iti. taTA ca SrutiH sacca tyacca BUtapaYcakam taM ca sattyamityAcakzate (bfha0 u0 2. 3. 1-3) (tEtti0 u0 2. 6. 1) iti. 2 yaTArTakaTanam. yaTA sattyaM brUyAtpriyaM brUyAnna brUyAtsattyamapriyam (manu0 4. 138) ityAdO sattyaSabdasyArTaH. taduktaM brahmapurARe yaTArTakaTanaM yacca sarvalokasuKapradam. tatsattyamiti vijYeyamasattyaM tadviparyayaH. iti. 3 nAndImuKaSrAdDIyo devatAviSezaH. atroktam izwiSrAdDe kraturdakzaH satyo nAndImuKe vasuH (SrAdData0) iti. 4 kftayugam. atredamaDikaM jYeyam saMDisaMDyaMSAByAM sahitaM sattyayugamAnaM tu dEvamAnena 4800 varzAH manuzyamAnena 1728000 varzAH iti. 5 SapaTaH. SapaTarUpasattyasyApAlane dozo yaTA kftvA SapaTarUpaM yaH satyaM hanti na pAlayan. sa kftaGnaH kAlasUtre vasedeva caturyugam.. (brahmavE0 pu0 pra0 a0 38) iti. 6 yaTArTajYAnam. yaTA sattyarajate idaM rajatam iti jYAnam. atra yATArTyaM ca tadaBAvavati tatprakArakatvABAvaH. tadeva jYAne sattyatvam iti jYeyam. 7 trikAlAbADyam. yaTA sattyaM jYAnamanantaM brahma (tE0 upa0 2. 1) ityAdO paramAtmA sattyaH iti vedAntina AhuH. 8 tapolokAdUrDvasTo lokaviSezaH iti pOrARikA AhuH. atrocyate zaqguRena tapolokAtsattya119<BR>;p{0946}<BR>loko virAjate. apunarmArikA yatra brahmalokABiDaH smftaH.. (vizRupu0 aMSa0 2 a0 7) iti. 9 svIkAraH. atrArTe sattyamityavyayam iti vijYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0945" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्त्वम्
sattvam — 1 sattASabdavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. 2 sAMKyAstu prakASAdisADanaM prakftyavayavaH (prakfteH sattvaguRaH) padArTaH. yaTA sattvAtsaMjAyate jYAnam ityAdO sattvaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. taduktam sattvaM laGu prakASakamizwamupazwamBakaM calaM ca rajaH. guru varaRakameva tamaH pradIpavaccArTato vfttiH.. (sAMKyakA0 13) iti. atra laGutvaM prakASakatvaM ca sattvasya lakzaRam (sAMKyacandri0 13) iti. 3 vEyAkaraRASca dravyam. yaTA sattve niviSatepEti pfTagjAtizu dfSyate. ADeyaScAkriyAjaSca sosattvaprakftirguRaH.. (vyA0 kA 0 vyA0 kA0) sattvapraDAnAni nAmAni (nirukta0) ityAdO sattvaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. sattve niviSata ityasyArTaSca voto guRavacanAt (pARi0 sU0 4. 1. 44) iti sUtre tattvavoDinyAM strIpratyayaprakaraRe drazwavyaH. 4 yogaSAstrajYAstu cittam. yaTA sattve tapyamAne tatsaMkrAntaH puruzopi tapyate (pAta0 BA0) ityAdO sattvaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. 5 prARAH ityOpanizadA AhuH. 6 piSAcAdiH iti mAtrikA AhuH. 7 AyuH iti Bizaja AhuH. 8 vyavasAyaH. 9 balaM ceti kAvyajYA AhuH. 10 svaBAvaH. 11 AtmA. 12 jantuSca ityanye vadanti (Sabda0). 13 jagatkAraRe yeyaM suKAtmakatA tatsattvam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 326 sAM0). 14 arTakriyAkAritvaM sattvam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 50 AI0). 15 triviDaM sattvam paramArTasattvaM brahmaRaH. arTakriyAsAmaDyaM sattvaM mAyopADikamAkASAdeH. avidyopADikaM sattvaM rajatAdeH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 446 SAM0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0946" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सत्प्रतिपक्षः
satpratipakzaH — 1 (hetvABAsaH duzwahetuH) ayaM ca prakaraRasamaH ityucyate (ma0pra02 pf0 27) (ta0 BA0 pf0 49). atra tulyabalayoreva satpratipakzatvam nAtulyabalayoH iti niyamaH. tena ekataratra tarkAdibalasattve tasyEvetarabADakatA iti boDyam. [ka] bADopasTitisamarTaparAmarSakAlInasADyasidDisamarTaparAmarSavizayaH<BR>;p{0947}<BR>(dIDi 02). yaTA parvato vahnimAnDUmAnmahAnasavat parvato vahnayaBAvavAn pAzARamayatvAt kuqyavat (ta0 kO0 2 pf0 14) iti. ayaM ca prAcInamatAnusArI vyAvahArikaH satpratipakza ityucyate. ata eva san vidyamAnaH pratipakzo viroDivyADyAdimattayA parAmfSyamAno hetuH viroDiparAmarSo vA yasya parAmfSyamAnasya hetorasO satpratipakzaH iti vigrahamapi varRayanti. atastadanusAreREva vyavahArOpayikaM lakzaRamAha maRikAraH (dIDi0 2 pf0 208). ata eva ityasyArTastu prakftaparAmarSasya viroDiparAmarSasyAsattvadaSAyAM satpratipakzavyavahAravirahAdeva iti. satpratipakzatvaM ca sADyaviroDyupasTApanasamarTasamAnabalopasTityA pratirudDa kAryakaliNgatvam. balaM ca vyAptipakzaDarmate. aTa vA viroDiboDakAnyagamakatOpayikarUpasaMpattimattayA jYAyamAnena pratirudDa kAryakatvam (ci0 2 pf0 9495). atra upasTitO samAnabalatvaM cAnAptoktatvenAniScitatvam prakftasADyAnumApakabalaSAlitve sati prakftasADyABAvAnumApakabalaSAlihetvantarakatvaM vA iti vijYeyam. sADyaviroDItyAderarTastu sADyasya sADyasidDeH viroDinyAH pakzo na sADyavAn ityAdyupasTiteH yadvA sADyaviroDI sADyavattAjYAnapratibanDakajYAnavizayaH bADaH sADyABAvAdimatpakzAdiH tadupasTitervA jananayogyayA samAnayA balopasTityA taTAviDavyADyAdibudDyA pratirudDaM kAryaM yasya tAdfSaliNgatvam iti. atra samAnabalatvaM cAgfhItAprAmARyaka sADyasidDyOpayikaparAmarSakAlInatvam (dIDi0 2 hetvA0 pf0 208209). nizkfzwArTastu prakftAnumitiviroDyanumitiyogya parAmarSaprayuktAgrimakzaRAvacCinnAnutpAdapratiyogiprakftAnumitijanakatAvacCedakI BUtaparAmarSIyavizayatAviSezaviSizwattram (ga0 vyAvahAri0 satpra0 nira0 pf0 7) iti. atredamavaDeyam. parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdisadDetusTalepi vahnivyApyaDUmavAn vahnayaBAvavyApyapAzARamayatvavAMSca parvataH iti parAmarSadvayasaMvalanadaSAyAM prakftoyaM DUmo hetuH satpratipakzitaH iti vyavahriyata ityanuBavamanurudByedamuktam. etasya dUzakatAvIjaM ca samAnabalaviroDisAmagrIpratibanDena nirRayAjanakatvam. ekatra vyAptiBaNgajYAnadvArA vAsya<BR>;p{0948}<BR>dUzakatvam (ci0 2 pf0 95). etajjYAnaM ca sAkzAdanumitipratibanDakam. vahnivyApyaDUmavAn vahnayaBAvavyApyapAzARamayatvavAMSca parvataH iti dviviDaparAmarSe sati ekasmAdapyanumiterasaMBavAt parasparaM pratibanDAt (ta0 kO0 2 pf0 14) iti. atra ca parasparAnumitipratibanDa eva Palam tadeva dUzakatAvIjam iti boDyam (ma0pra0 2 pf0 27). parasparABAvavyApyavattAjYAnAtparasparAnumitipratibanDaH Palam (mu0 2 pf0 160). atra ca dvayorapi hetvoH parasparasADyABAvasADakatvAt miTaH satpratipakzatvam. ratnakozakArAstu satpratipakzAByAM viroDiparAmarSadvayena pratyekaM svasADyAnumitiH saMSayarUpA janyate. virudDoBayajYAnasAmagryAH saMSayajanakatvAt. saMSayadvArAsya dUzakatvam ityAdduH (ci0 2 pf0 96). etanmate tadvattAbudDO tadaBAvavyApyavattAjYAnasya pratibanDatvaM nAstItyavaDeyam. [Ka] agfhItAprAmARyakasADyavyApyavattvenopasTitikAlInAgfhItAprAmARyakatadaBAva- vyApyavattvenopasTitivizayaH (mu0 2 pf0 160). atratyapadaprayojanamucyate. nityatvavyApyaSabdatvavattAjYAnaSUnya kAlInAnityatvavyApyakftakatvaparAmarSasattvepi satpratipakzavyavahArABAvAt kAlInAntaM tadupasTitiviSezaRam. gfhItAprAmARyakanityatvavyApyavattAjYAnakAlInAnityatvavyApyakftakatvaparAmarSasattvepi tadvyavahArABAvAt agfhItAprAmARyaka iti praTamopasTitiviSezaRam. tAdfSakAlInAnityatvavyApyavattAparAmarSasattvepi tatrAprAmARyagrahakAle taTA vyavahArABAvAt agfhItAprAmARyaka iti dvitIyopasTitiviSezaRam (di0 2 hetvA0 pf0 160). [ga [ga] yasya sADyABAvasADakaM hetvantaram sa satpratipakzaH. yaTA Sabdo nityaH SrAvaRatvAcCabdatvavat SabdaH anityaH kAryatvAtpawavat (ta0 saM0) iti. atrAnumAnadvaye SrAvaRatvaM hetuH satpratipakza iti vijYeyam. etallakzaRArTaM prAca AhuH. yatsaMbanDi yatsADyaM tadaBAvavyApyahetvantarasya jYAnaM pakzesti sa satpratipakzaH iti. prAcAmayamASayaH. prakftasADyavyApyatvena jYAyamAno yaH prakftahetuH tatonyasminhetO sADyABAvavyApyatvajYAnadaSAyAmeva tasya satpratipakzatA iti. etatsUcanAya hetvantara iti.<BR>;p{0949}<BR>navInAH punarevaM varRayanti. yatsaMvanDisADyABAvavyApyahetvantarasya sattvaM pakze sa satpratipakza ityarTaH (nIla0 2 pf0 26) iti. satpratipakzaSabdasya vyutpattyAdikaM pradarSayanti sADyABAvasADaka hetvantaraM pratipakzaH tadvAn satpratipakzaH (ta0 kO0) iti. 2 (hetudozaH) [ka] pakze sADyaDIpratibanDakaparAmarSaH. yaTA jalamuzRaM sparSatvAdityAdO nedamuzRamatejastvAdityAdiH (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 21) (BA0 pa0 Slo0 78). [Ka] sADyABAvavyApyavatpakzaH sADyavadanyatvavyApyavatpakzaH pakzanizWaH sADyABAvavyApyaH pakzanizWaH sADyavadBedavyApyaH (dIDi0) (di02 pf0 160). sADyavadavfttivyApyavatpakzaH pakzanizWaH sADyavadavfttivyApyaH pakzavfttyaBAvapratiyogitvavyApyavatsADyam sADyanizWaH pakzavfttyaBAvapratiyogitvavyApyaSca. yaTA hfdo vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO vahnayaBAvavyApyavadBadAdiH satpratipakzaH (ga0 2). etezAmazwAnAM satpratipakzasvarUpARAmanyatamatvAdinAnugamakaraRAnna satpratipakzaviBAgavyAGAtaH (di0 2 hetvA0 pf0 160) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0946" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

