सदाचारः
sadAcAraH — [ka] manvAdyuktadeSapracalitAcAraH. atra vyutpattivigrahO sADavaH kzIRadozASca sacCabdaH sADuvAcakaH. tezAmAcaraRaM yattu sadAcAra sa ucyate.. iti. manunA cetTamuktam sarasvatIdfzadvatyordevanadyoryadantaram. taM devanirmitaM deSaM brahmAvarta pracakzate.. tasmin deSe ya AcAraH pAraMparyakramAgataH. varRAnAM sAntarAlAnAM sa sadAcAra ucyate.. (manu0 a0 2 Slo0 1718) iti. yaTA vedaH smftiH sadAcAraH svasya ca priyamAtmanaH. etaccaturviDaM prAhuH sAkzAdDarmasya lakzaRam.. (manu0 2. 12) ityAdO sadAcAraSabdasyArTaH. svaDarmatyAge hAniruktA tasmAtsvaDarmaM na hi saMtyajecca na hApayeccApi taTAtmavaMSam. yaH saMtyajeccApi nijaM hi DarmaM tasmE prakupyeta divAkaraSca.. (vAmanapu0 a0 14) iti. [Ka] SizwAcAraH. yaTA ADunikaSizwAnAmAcAraH. taTA ca tattvacintAmaRO smftiH yasmindeSe ya AcAraH pAraMparyakramAgataH. SrutismftyaviroDena sadAcAraH sa ucyate.. (ci0 1 maNgalavA 0 pf0 112) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0949" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सद्धेतुः
sadDetuH — (hetuH) [] paYcarUpopapanno hetuH. paYca rUpARi tu pakzasattvam sapakzasattvam vipakzAsattvam abADitavizayatvam asatpratipakzatvaM ceti. atredaM boDyam paYcarUpopapanna eva hetuH svasADyaM sADayituM kzamate na tvekenApi rUpeRa hInaH (ta0 BA0 pramARani0 pf0 13) iti. [Ka] vyAptyAdiviSizwahetuH (nIla0 2 pf0 24). [ga] pramitavyAptipakzaDarmatAko hetuH. svasADyAnumityOpayikapramAtmakaparAmarSavAn iti yAvat (ga0 satpra0). yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO DUmaH sadDetuH. atrAyamarTaH. parvatatva sAmAnADikaraRyena vahneH sADyatvavivakzAyAmeva DUmaH sadDeturBavati na tu parvatatvAvacCedena vahneH sADyatvavivakzAyAM DUmaH sadDetuH. tatra parvatatvAvacCedena vahneraBAvAt iti. ayaM BAvaH. avacCedakAvacCedena vahneH sADyatve sAmAnADikaraRyena vahnayaBAvasya prasidDatvena tasya ca bADarUpatvAttatratyo heturhetvABAsa eva Bavati. ataH sAmAnADikaraRyenEva vahneH sADyatvaM vivakzaRIyam. taTA ca sati tatra sAmAnADikaraRyena vahnayaBAvasya sattvepi tadvipayakaniScayasya tatratyasADyavattAbudDiM pratyapratibanDakatvena hetvABAsalakzaRAnAkrAntatvAnna tasya bADatvam. avacCedakAvacCedena vahnayaBAvavizayakaniScayasya pratibanDakatvepi tAdfSavahnayaBAvasya cAprasidDatvena tatra na kopi hetvABAsadozaH iti sAmAnADikaraRyena vahnisADyakasTalIyaDUmaH sadDeturBavati iti sUkzmadarSiBiH suDIBirviBAvanIyam (ga0 2 hetvA0 sAmAnyani0). atredaM boDyam. uktAni paYcarUpARi DUmavattvAdAvanvayavyatirekiRyeva hetO vidyante. taTA hi (1) DUmavattvaM pakzasya parvatasya DarmaH. tasya parvate vidyamAnatvAt. (2) evaM sapakze sattvam. sapakze mahAnase. vidyamAnatvAt. (3) evam vipakzAt mahAhfdAt vyAvfttiH. tatra DUmo nAsti iti. (4) evam abADitavizayaM DUmavattvam. taTA hi DUmavattvasya hetorvizayaH sADyo DarmaH. taccAgnimattvam. tatkenApi pramARena na bADitam na KaRqitam ityarTaH. (5) evam asan pratipakzo yasya ityasatpratipakzaM DUmavattvam. taTA hi sADyaviparIta<BR>;p{0951}<BR>sADakaM hetvantaraM pratipakzaH ityucyate. sa ca DUmavattve hetO nAstyeva. anupalamBAt (ta0 BA0 pramARani0 pf0 14) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0950" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

