सन्
san — (DAtvaMSaH pratyayaH) ayaM DAtuprakftikaH pratyayaH. [ka] karturicCA (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11). svasAmAnADikaraRyasvanizWavizayatAnirUpitavizayitvoBayasaMbanDena prakftaDAtvarTapraDAnIBUtavyApAraviSizwecCA ityarTaH. yaTA GawaM cikIrzati ityAdO sanpratyayArTaH. yaTA vA pipaWizati ityAdO sanpratyayArTaH (la0 ma0). atredaM boDyam. sannuttarAKyAtasyASrayatve lakzaRA. savizayakArTaka prakftikAKyAtasya ASrayatve lakzaRAyA GawaM jAnAti ityAdO klfptatvAt (tarkA 0 4 pf0 11) iti. atra sannarTecCAyAM DAtvarTasya karmatva samAnakartfkatva etaduBayasaMbanDena viSezaRatA boDyA (la0 ma0). [Ka] icCA. yaTA pAkaM cikIrzati odanaM buBukzate ityAdO sanpratyayArTaH. atra sanpratyayArTecCAyAM dvitIyAntena laByasya pAkAdiviSezyatAkatvasya svarUpasaMbanDena DAtvarTasya tu kftyAdeH svasADyatvAdiprakArinizWasvasamAnakartfkatvasaMbanDena anvayAt pAkaDarmikA niruktasaMbanDena kftimatI yA icCA tadvAn ityAdirarTaH. atra samAnakartfkatvasya niveSAt anyadIyakftivizayapAkAdAvicCAvati ayaM cikIrzati pipakzati ityAdiko na prayogaH iti cintAmaRikfta AhuH. sOndaqastu prAha. pAkaM cikIrzatItyAdO dvitIyArTasya vizayatvasya. mUlaDAtvarTa evAnvayaH. tadarTasya tu samAnakartfkatvavizayatvAByAM sannarTecCAyAm. taTA ca pAkavizayatAkakftisamAnakartfkatadgocarecCAvAn ityAdirevArTaH. kArakaviBakteH kriyAyAmeva svArTaboDakatvAt. ata eva gfhaM tizWAsati ityAdiko na prayogaH. sTitergfhakarmakatvabADAt. anyaTA gfhaDarmikAM sTitiprakArakecCAM boDayannayameva pramARaM syAt. na tu gfhe tizWAsati ityAdiH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 109 wI0 pf0 170171) iti. [ga] DAtvarTaviSezyakecCA. yaTA pAkaM<BR>;p{0952}<BR>cikIrzati ityAdO kftiviSezyakecCA cikIrzApadArTaH. sA caM pAkakftirBavatu itIcCEva (ga0 vyu0 kA0 2 pf0 59).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0951" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपक्षः
sapakzaH — 1 [ka] niScitasADyaDarmA DarmI (ta0 BA0 pramARani0 pf0 15) (ci0 2 pakza0). [Ka] niScitasADyavAn. yaTA parvate DUmena vahnisADane mahAnasaH sapakzaH (ta0 saM0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 15). tallakzaRaM ca sADyaprakArakaniScayaviSezyatvam (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 17). aTa vA viSezyatAsaMbanDena sADyaprakArakaniScayavattvam (vAkya0 2 pf0 16). [ga] vedAntinastu sADyasamAnaDarmavAn DarmI sapakza ityAhuH (0 ca0 pf0 23). kAvyajYAstu 2 samAnapakzaH. 3 pakzasahitaScetyAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0952" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपिण्डता
sapiRqatA — [ka] dAyA SOcAdigrahaRaprayojako jYAtiDarmaviSezaH. atra vyutpattiH. samAna ekaH piRqaH piRqadAnakriyA mUlapuruzaSarIraM vA yasya sa sapiRqaH. tasya BAvaH sapiRqatA (Darmasi0 pari0 3 pUrvA 0 pf0 50) iti. taTA hi putrasya pitfSarIrAvayavAnvayena pitrA saha sApiRqyam. evam pitAmahAdiBirapi pitfdvAreRa tacCarIrAnvayAtsApiRqyam. evam mAtfSarIrAvayavAnvayena mAtrA. taTA mAtAmahAdiBirapi mAtfdvAreRa. taTA mAtfzvasfmAtulAdiBirapi. ekaSarIrAvayavA - nvayAt. taTA pitfvyapitfzvastrAdiBirapi. taTA patyA saha patnyA ekaSarIrAramBakatayA. evam BrAtfBAryARAmapi parasparamekaSarIrArabDEH sahEkaSarIrAramBakatvena (mitAkza0 a0 1 Slo0 52) iti. [Ka] sAkzAtparaMparayA vEkadehAraByadehatva SrAdDadeyEkapiRqAnvayayogyatva etadanyataravattvam. yaTA putrAdInAM mAtulAdInAM ca sapiRqatA. taTA ca sApiRqyaM dviviDam. tatrEkam ekaSarIrAvayavAnvayena sApiRqyam. idaM ca putrAdimAtfsaMtAna BrAtfpitfvyAdiputrAntezu saMBavati. nirvApyapiRqAnvayena sApiRqyaM ca dvitIyam. nirvApyapiRqAnvayaH SrAdDIyAnnapiRqasaMbanDaH ityarTaH. idaM tu putrAdiBrAtfBAryAparyantezveva saMBavati. na tu mAtfsaMtAnaBrAtfpitfvyAdiputrAdizu (mitA0 1. 52. tatroktam<BR>;p{0953}<BR>lepaBAjaScaturTAdyAH pitrAdyAH piRqaBAginaH. piRqadaH saptamastvezAM sApiRqyaM sAptapOruzam.. (matsyapu0) iti. tatra SarIrAvayavAnvayasApiRqyam ASOca vivAha dAyagrahaRa etezu trizvapyupayujyate iti hemAdrimADava vijYAneSvarasmfticandrikAkAramitra miSrakamalAkarAdInAM matam. atroktam vaDvA varasya vA tAtaH kUwasTAdyadi saptamaH. paYcamI cettayormAtA tatsApiRqyaM nivartate.. iti DarmasinDO DftaM vAkyam. paYcamAtsaptamAdUrDvaM mAtftaH pitftastaTA (yAjYava0 1153) iti. taTA ca pitrA - dayaH zaw sapiRqAH putrAdayaSca zaw AtmA ca saptamaH (mitA0 1. 53) iti. kAmaDenuhAralatAkalpatarupArijAtakArAdInAM tanmatAnusArijImUtavAhanasya ca mataM tu sapiRqatA hi vizayaBedena triviDA ASOcopayoginI vivAhopayoginI dAyagrahaRopayoginI ca. taTA ca SarIrAnvayasApiRqyamASOce vivAhe copayujyate. nirvApyapiRqAnvayasApiRqyaM tu dAyagrahaRe upayujyate iti. yaTodAhftaM (Su0 ta0) raGunandanena lepaBAjaScaturTAdyAH pitrAdyAH piRqaBAginaH. piRqadaH saptamastvezAM sApiRqyaM sAptapOruzam.. (matsyapu0) iti. hAralatAyAM kUrmapurARaM ca sapiRqatA tu puruze saptame vinivartate. samAnodakaBAvastu janmanAnoravedane.. pitA pitAmahaScEva taTEva prapitAmahaH. lepaBAjaScaturTAdyAH sApiRqyaM sAptapOruzam.. iti. BrAtrAdInAmapi sApiRqyamuktaM bODAyanena prapitAmahaH pitAmahaH pitA svayam sodaryaBrAtaraH savarRAyAH putraH pOtraH prapOtro vA etAnaviBaktadAyAdAn sapiRqAnAcakzate. viBaktadAyAdAn sakulyAnAcakzate asatsvaNgajezu tadnAmI hyarTo Bavati iti. kiMca strIRAmapi BartfsApiRqyena sApiRqyam. anUQAyAH kanyAyAstu tripOruzaM sApiRqyam. taTA ca gotrEkye sati piRqalepayordAtftvaBoktftvAnyataravattvamASOcasApiRqyam. sAkzAtparaMparayA vA saptamaparyantadehasaMbanDavattvaM vivAhasApiRqyam. tripuruzaparyantaM deyapiRqadAtftvaBoktftvAnyataravattvaM dAyagrahaRe sApiRqyam iti vaNgadeSIyAnAM jImUtavAhanAdInAM mataM boDyam (vAca0). aDikaM tu tattadDarmaSAstragranTezvanvezaRIyam ityalaM vistareRa. 120<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0952" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

