सप्तभङ्गिनयः
saptaBaNginayaH — syAdasti syAnnAsti syAdasti ca nAsti ca syAdavaktavyaH syAdasti cAvaktavyaH syAnnAsti cAvaktavyaH syAdasti ca nAsti cAvaktavyaH iti nyAyaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 82 AI0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0954" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तमी
saptamI — (viBaktiH) aDikaraRatAyAmADeyatve vA SaktA sup (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 66 wI0 pf0 76). yaTA gehe pacati ityAdO gehapadottaravartinI saptamI. atra ADeyatvaM saptamyarTaH. tasya ca kriyAyAmanvayaH. Buvi gacCati ityAdO tu kartfGawitaparaMparAsaMbanDAvacCinnADAratvameva saptamyarTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 116). gehe pacatItyatra saptamItvaM ca pacaDAtvarTatAvacCedakarUpAvacCinnaDarmikasvArTADeyatvaboDAnukUlasupsajAtIyatvam. cEtraDarmikasvArTADikaraRatvAnvayaboDakasupsamAnAnupUrvIkatvaM vA ityapi vadanti. grAmamaDyAste ityAdI aDikaraRatvaM boDayantyapi dvitIyAdiH na tatra SaktA. grAmAya gacCati ityAdO karmatvAdizveva caturTyAdiH SaktA iti dvitIyAcaturTyAdInAM nirAsaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 66 wI0 pf0 76). aTa saptamyarTaH ucyate. 1 nyAyamate ADAratvam ADeyatvaM vA saptamyarTaH. taccAKaRqopADiH iti prAYca AhuH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 86). navyAstu svarUpasaMbanDaviSeza eva tat ityAhuH. atra vipratipattiH sapramyarTa ADAratvaM vA ADeyatvaM vA iti. tatra aDikaraRatvamAtraM saptamyarTaH. taTA ca BUtalanizWADikaraRatAnirUpako GawaH ityAkArako boDaH. tatra nizWatvam nirUpakatvaM ca saMsargamaryAdayA BAsate iti prAno nEyAyikA AhuH. navyanEyAyikAstu prAgBiruktaM yuktaM na. taTANgIkAre tu nirUpakatvasaMbanDasya vfttyaniyAmakatvena pratiyogitAnavacCedakatvAt BUtale na GawaH ityAdO namarTAnvayAsaMBavaH. ataH tatrADeyatvamAtraM saptamyarTaH. taTA ca BUtalanirUpitADeyatvASrayo GawaH ityanvayaboDaH svIkAryaH. tatra nirUpitatvama ASrayatvaM ca saMsargaH. itTaM ca BUtale na GawaH ityAdO ASrayatAsaMbanDAvacCinnADeyatApratiyogikaH<BR>;p{0955}<BR>aBAvaH naYA boDyate iti sarva susTam iti prAhuH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 11). ADAratvaM ca kartfkarmadvArA boDyam. tatra kArakatvanirvAhArTaM parasparAsaMbanDasyApi kriyAnvayitvarUpakArakatvaGawakatAvaSyakI. yaTA BUtale Gawosti ityAdO BUtalapadottarasaptamyarTaH. atra BUtalavfttiGawo vartamAnasattASrayaH iti boDaH. nansamaBivyAhAre tu tAdfSasaptamyarTABAvo GawAMSe BAsate iti nEyAyikAnAM matam (vE0 sA0 da0 subarTa0 pf0 87). vEyAkaraRamate tu ASrayaH (aDikaraRam) saptamyarTaH. kartfkarmadvArA DAtvarTASrayaH ityarTaH. yaTA BUtale Gawosti gehe taRqulaM pacati ityAdO BUtalAdipadottarasaptamyarTaH. atra saptamyaDikaraRe ca (pARi0 2. 3. 36) iti sUtram. tadarTaSca SAbdikamate kartfkarmAnyataradvArA kriyASrayoDikaraRam tatra saptamI iti. gehe cEtra odanaM pacati sTAlyAmodanaM pacati ityAdO gehasya kartfdvArA sTAlyASca karmadvArA kriyASrayatvAdaDikaraRatvam. taTA ca kriyArahitaM vAkyamapramARam iti paraMparayA kriyASrayAtmakADikaraRasyEva saptamyarTatvam. itTaM ca yatra na kriyASravaRam gehe Gawa ityAdO tatra kArakatvanirvAhAya kriyADyAhAra AvaSyakaH. evaM ca gehe GawaH ityAdO kriyApadAvyAhAreREvADikaraRatvaboDaH iti. tArkikamate tu yatrADikaraRatvamADeyatvAdi vA saptamyA boDyate tadvAcakapadAtsaptamI iti sUtrArTaH. taTA ca aDikaraRatvamAtram ADeyatvamAtraM vA saptamyarTaH. sa ca yatra kriyAyAmanveti tatra kArakatvavyavahAraH. BUtale GawaH ityakriyavAkyAdapi SAbdaboDasyAnuBavasidDatvAt. tadvadeva gehe GawaH ityAdAvapi kriyApadaM vinApi gehADeyatvavAn GawaH iti boDo nAnupapanna iti atratyA saptamI na kArakaviBaktiH api tu kArakArTAnyEva (kA0 vyA0 pf0 11) iti. atra pramARam saptamyaDikaraRe ca (pARi0 2. 3. 36) ityatra cakAreRAkArakADAravAcinopi saptamI viDIyata iti. ata eva sADyavadBinne yaH sADyABAvaH (dIDi0 vyAptini0) iti saptamItatpuruzeRa vyAKyAnaM saMgacCate (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 116). aDikaraRaM ca triviDam OpaSlezikam vEzayikam aBivyApakaM ceti. tatrAdyasyodAharaRaM<BR>;p{0956}<BR>. kawe Sete gurO vasati ityAdi. dvitIsyodAhAraRaM mokze icCAstIti. tftIyasyodAharaRaM tu tilezu tElam iti. atrAdyaM sAmIpyasaMbanDanibanDanam. ADeyavyApyatAvacCedakayatkiMcidavayavakam iti yAvat. dvitIyaM vizayatAsaMbanDanirUpakam. tftIyamADeyavyApyatAvacCedakayAvadavayavakam. kawe Sete ityatra paramparayA kawABinnASrayakaH SayanAnukUlo vyApAraH iti boDaH. evamanyatrApyUhyam (vE0 sA0 da0 subarTa0 pf0 86). 2 kvacit nirUpakatvam nirUpyatvaM vA saptamyarTaH. yaTA BUtale vartate GawaH ityAdO BUtalapadottaravartisaptamyA arTaH. yaTA vA iti hetustadudBave (kAvyapra 0 1) ityAdI hetutAyAm udBavapadArTotpattinirUpitatvaM saptamyA boDyate. 3 kvacit avacCedyatAviSezaH. yaTA vIRAyAM SabdaH karRe SabdaH vfkzAgre kapisaMyogaH ityAdO saptamyarTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 116). 4 nimittatvam. yaTA carmaRi dvIpinaM hanti maSakanivfttO DUmaM karoti ityAdO saptamyarTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 11). atra carmoddeSyakadvIpikarma kahananakartA iti boDaH. aDikaM tu nimittatvaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam. 5 utpattiH. yaTA Saradi puzpyanti saptacCadAH ityAdO saptamyarTaH. atra SaradutpattikapuzpASrayAH saptacCadAH iti vAkyArTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 12). 6 samAnADikaraRatvam. tacca dviviDam kvacit kAlikam kvacittu dESikam. tatrAdyaM samAnakAlInatvAdikam. yaTA gozu duhyamAnAsu gataH ityAdO (kA0 vyA0 pf0 12). yaTA vA Gane varzati cOra AgataH ityAdO saptamyarTaH (ma0 pra0 pf0 6-7). atra vfzwisamAnakAlInAgamanASrayaScOraH iti boDaH (ma0pra0 pf0 7). atrArTe yasya ca BAvena BAvalakzaRam (pARi0 2. 3. 37) ityanena sUtreRa saptamyanuSizyate. sUtrArTastu yasya DarmeRa DarmAntaraM niruktasvasAmAnADikaraRyena pratipAdyate tatra saptamI iti (kA0 vyA0 pf0 12). yadviSezaRakfdantArTaviSezaRatApannakriyayA kriyAntarasya lakzaRaM vyAvartanaM tadvAcakapadAtsaptamI iti vA. atredamaDikaM vijYeyam. vartamAnArTakakftsamaBivyAhArasTale gozu duhyamAnAsu gata ityAdO samAnakAlInatvam. gozu dogDavyAsu gata ityAdiBavizyadarTakakftsTale<BR>;p{0957}<BR>prAkkAlInatvam. gozu dugDAsu gata ityAdAvatItArTakakftsTala uttarakAlInatvaM saMbanDatayA BAsata iti. evam pATasi pIte tfzA SAmyati ityAdAvatItArTaka kftsamaBivyAhArAtkAryakAraRaBAvopi saMbanDatayA BAsata ityAdikamUhanIyam. atra saptamyarTe samAnakAlInatve goviSezaRakarmatAviSezaRasya godohanasyAnvayaH. itTaM ca tAdfSagodohanasamAnakAlInAtItagamanAnukUlakftimAn ityarTaH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 12). aTa vA samaBivyAhftadohanAdikriyEva saptamyarTaH. tasyASca samAnakAlInatvAdikaM kriyAntare saMbanDaH iti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 117). dvitIyaM tu dESikasAmAnADikaraRyam. yaTA idaM dravyaM guRakarmAnyatve sati sattvAt (ga0 avayave) ityAdO satisaptamyarTaH. atra sati ityanantaraM sataH ityaDyAhAryam. anyaTA lakzaRIyakriyAyA aBAvenoktasUtrAvizayatayA saptamyanupapatteH. taTA ca tatra asDAtorarTa ADAratA. guRAnyatvAdyADAratAyASca sattADAratAyAM tadvannizWatvaM saMbanDatayA BAsata iti cintAmaRikAroktasAmAnADikaraRyalABa nirvAhaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 7 pf0 117). taTA cAtra guRakarmAnyatvasamAnADikaraRasattvAt iti SAbdaboDaH. evaM dravyakarmAnyatve sati sAmAnyavAn guRaH ityAdAvapi boDyam (ma0pra0 pf0 6-7).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0954" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

