समयः
samayaH — 1 [ka] asya SabdasyedamarTajAtamaBiDeyam ityaBiDAnABiDeyaniyamaniyogaH (SaktiH). tasminnupayukte SabdAdarTasaMpratyayo Bavati (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 55). [Ka] ISvarasaMketaH. asmAcCabdAdayamarTo bodDavyaH ityAkAraH. yaTA sAmayikaH SabdAdarTapratyayaH (vE07. 2. 20) ityAdO samayaSabdasyArTaH. yaH Sabdo yasminnarTe BagavatA saMketitaH sa tamarTaM pratipAdayati. taTA ca SabdArTayorISvarecCEva saMbanDaH. sa eva samayaH. tadaDInaH SabdAdarTapratyayaH (vE0 u0 7. 2. 20). mammawaBawwastu nABiDA samayABAvAt (kAvyapra 0 2. 22) ityAdigranTenABiDAsamayayorBedamurarIcakAra. atra nEyAyikEH sADyasamo doza udBAvyate. mImAMsakamate tu nAyaM dozaH. aBiDAsamayayostErBedANgIkArAt iti vijYeyam. samayaSca jAtimAtre. vyakterAkzepata evopasTiteH. ititOtAtikA AhuH. jAtO vyaktO coBayatra SaktiH. kiM tu jAtyaMSe jYAtA vyaktyaMSe svarUpasatI prayojikA iti prABAkarA AhuH. samayaH Saktireva. vyaktyAkftijAtayaH padArTAH iti vfdDA AhuH (vE0 u0 7. 2. 20<BR>;p{0959}<BR>pf0 341) (vE0 vi0) (BavA0). anyatsarvaM Sakti saMketa ityetacCandavyAKyAne drazwavyam. 2 niyamabanDaH. 3 SAstram. 4 kAlaH. 5 sidDAntaH. 6 SapaTaH. 7 AcAraH. 8 aNgIkAraH. 9 kriyAkArakaH. 10 nirdeSaH. 11 BAzA (medi 0). 12 saMpat. 13 kAlavijYAnam (Sabdaca 0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0958" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थः
samarTaH — 1 yatkiMcidarTakArI. yatkicitkArya prayojakaH iti yAvat. 2 SAbdikAstu saMgatArTaH. sa ca anvayAnvayiBAvApannorTaH ityAhuH. 3 SaktaH. 4 hitaSca iti kAvyajYA AhuH (amaraH 3. 3. 86). samarTatvaM ca sAmarTyam. tacca sAmarTyaSabde dfSyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0959" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

