समर्थना
samarTanA — 1 (loqarTaH) parASakyaDarmikasvaSakyatvADyavasAyaH. yaTA parvatamapyutpAwayAni samudramapi SozayARi ityAdO loqarTaH. taTA ca svetarASakyaM yat parvatotpAwanam tadDarmikasvaSakyatvADyavasAyavAn ityevaM tatrAnvayaboDaH. aTa vA parvatamapyutpAwayAni samudramapi SozayARi ityAdO nipAtasyEvAperDAtvarTAnvitaM parASakyatvamarTaH. tiNastu svaSakyatA - DyavasAyamAtram. aDyavasAyovaDAraRam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 100 wI0 pf0 145146). 2 idamitTameva iti niScaya hetUpanyAsena niScAyakavyApAraviSezaH iti kecidAhuH. 3 yuktAyuktatvena parIkzaRam (amaraH 2 kzatriyava0 Slo0 25 wI0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0959" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवहितत्वम्
samavahitatvam — ekakAlInatvam (mU0ma0 1). yaTA GawasamavahitaH pawaH ityAdO samavahitatvaSabdArTaH. 2 sahavfttitvam. yaTA maRyAdisamavahitena vahninA dAho na janyate (ta0 dI0) ityAdO samavahitatvaSabdasyArTaH. 3 samyagavaDAnayuktatvam iti sAhityaSAstrajYA AhuH. - 1 (padArTaH) idamiti yataH kAryakAraRayoH sa samavAyaH (vE0 772. 26). tadarTaSca kAryakAraRayoravayavAvayavinoryataH saMbanDAt ihedam iti pratyayaH sa samavAyaH. (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 26). ayutasidDAnAmADAryAMDAraBUtAnAM yaH saMbanDaH ihapratyayahetuH sa samavAyaH<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0959" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायः
samavAyaH — (praSasta 0 1 pf0 25) iti. sa ca ayutasidDayoH saMbanDaH (ta0 BA0 1). sa ca yaTA avayavAvayavinoH guRaguRinoH kriyAkriyAvatoH jAtivyaktyoH viSezanityadravyayoSca saMbanDaH (ta0 saM0) (pa0 mA0 pf0 38). yaTA GawakapAlayoH saMbanDaH samavAyaH. evamanyatrApyUhyam. taduktam GawAdInAM kapAlAdO dravyezu guRakarmaRoH. tezu jAteSca saMbanDaH samavAyaH prakIrtitaH.. (BA0 pa0 Slo0 11) iti. atra BAzyam. ayutasidDAnAmADAryAMDAraBUtAnAM yaH saMbanDaH ihapratyayahetuH sa samavAyaH. dravyaguRakarmasAmAnyaviSezARAM kAryakAraRaBUtAnAm akAryakAraRaBUtAnAM vA ayutasidDAnAmADAryADAraBAvenAvasTitAnAm idam iti budDiryato Bavati yataScAsarvagatAnAmaDigatAnyatvAnAmavizvagBAvenAvasTitAnAm sa samavAyAKyaH saMbanDaH. kaTam. yaTA iha kuRqe daDi iti pratyayaH saMbanDe sati dfzwaH. taTA iha tantuzu pawaH iha vIraRezu kawaH iha dravye ca dravyaguRakarmARi iha dravyaguRakarmasu sattA iha dravye dravyatvam iha guRe guRatvam iha karmaRi karmatvam iha nityadravyezvantyA viSezAH iti ihapratyayadarSanAt astyezAM saMbanDaH iti vijYAyate. na cAsO saMyogaH. saMbanDinAmayutasidDatvAt. anyatarakarmAdinimittasyABAvAt. viBAgAntatvAdarSanAt. aDikaraRADikartavyayoreva ca BAvAditi. BAvavallakzaRaBedAt BAvavatsarvatrEkaH samavAyaH. sa ca dravyAdiByaH padArTAntaram. sa ca pramARataH kAraRAnupalabDernityaH. tasmAtsvAtma vfttiH. ata eva cAtIndriyaH. sattAdInAmiva pratyakzezu vfttyaBAvAt. svAtmagata saMvedanABAvAcca. tasmAt ihabudDyanumeyaH samavAyaH (praSa0 pf0 67). samavAyasattve pramARaM tu anumAnam. tacca jAtyAdigocaro viSizwavyavahAraH saMbanDaniyataH. BAvamAtravizayAbADitaviSizwavyavahAratvAt. saGawaM BUtalam iti vyavahAravat (nyA0 lI0 pf0 54) iti. Gawe GawatvaM rUpaM ca samavetam tantuzu pawaH samavetaH iha karma samavetam ityanugatasamavAyAkArapratItyA tatsidDiH nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 9). vastutastu svASrayasamavetatva saMbanDenAvayavanIlAderavayavinIlAdO hetutvAtkAraRatAvacCedaka saMbanDaGawakatayA samavAya.<BR>;p{0961}<BR>sidDiH. anyaTA svASrayavfttitvasaMbanDena hetutve nIlakapAlasaMyuktaSuklakapAlAdAvapi nIlotpattyApatteH (ma0pra0 1 pf0 12). atra samavAyasaMbanDena pawatvAvacCinnaM prati tAdAtmyasaMbanDena tantutvena hetutvAtkAryatAvacCedakasaMbanDaviDayA samavAyasidDiH (di0 1 pf0 39). yutasidDayoH saMyoga ivAyutasidDayoH samavAya AvaSyakaH ityapi boDyam (ta0 kO0). samavAyatvaM ca nityasaMbanDatvam (ta0 saM0) (mu0). atra saMyogAdivAraRAya nityatvam. gaganAdivAraRAya saMbanDaH iti. saMbanDatvaM cAtra KarUpatvAnavacCinna sAMsargika vizayatASrayatvam. tena gaganAdInAM svarUpatvena saMbanDatvepi na kzatiH. saMyogasamavAyAnyataratvaM vA saMvanDatvam (pa0 mA0 pf0 38). aTa vA samavAyatvaM saMbanDapratiyogyanuyogiBinnatve sati saMbanDatvam. tena pratiyogyanuyogitvAtmakasvarUpasaMbanDe nAtivyAptiH (rAma0 1 pf0 39) (tA0ra0 Slo0 54). iha gavi gotvam ityAdipratyayavizayasaMbanDatvam samavAyatvam (pa0 mA0 pf0 38). samavAyastu samavAyarahitaH saMbanDaH (sarva 0 saM0 pf0 217 O0). sarvatra samavAyastveka eva nityaSca iti nyAyavESezikasidDAntaH. atra ekatvaM ca svASrayAnyonyABAvAsamAnADikaraRapadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (pra0 ca0). atrEkatvasADane pramARaBUtaM sUtraM ca tattvaM BAvena (vE0 7. 2. 28) iti. nityatve ityamanumAnam. sa cAyaM samavAyaH nityaH. akAraRakatvAt. BAvAnAM hi samavAyikAraRAdutpattiniyamaH. tadanurudDe ca nimittAsamavAyinI iti. taTA ca samavAyasya samavAyikAraRakalpane anavasTAdidozaprasaNgaH iti samavAyasya nityatvam (vE0 u0 7. 2. 26 pf0 350). atredaM boDyam. nEyAyikAnAM mate samavAyatvaM na jAtiH. tadvADakasyAsaMbanDasya sattvAt. yadyapi samavAyatvajAtibADako vyaktyaBeda eva taTApi prABAkarAdimate utpAdavinASaSIlA bahavaH samavAyAH. tanmate asaMbanDa eva jAtibADakaH iti jYeyam (vE0 u0 1. 1. 3). samavAyo nAnA anityaSca iti prABAkarA navyA cAhuH. pratyakzaH samavAyaH iti nEyAyikA AhuH. samavAyasya pratyakzatvasADakAnumAnaM ca samavAyo lOkikapratyakzavizayaH 121<BR>;p{0962}<BR>yogyapratiyogikatve sati viSezaRatayA yogyavfttitvAt BUtalAdivfttiGawAtyantABAvAdivat ityAdi (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 28). etanmate ca samavAya pratyakzaM prati indriyasaMbadDa viSezaRatAsaMnikarzo hetuH iti kAryakAraRaBAvo jYeyaH (mu0) (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 28). iha kapAle GawasamavAyaH iti pratyakzaM viSezaRatAsaMnikarzeREva Bavati (pra0 pra0) ((ta0 kO0) iti. samavAyotIndriyaH anumeya eva iti vESezikA AhuH. vESezikamate samavAyasyAtIndriyatve pramARamanumAnam. tacca samavAyotIndriyaH. cetanAnyatve sati asamavetaBAvatvAnmanovat AkASAdivadvA (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 28) (vE0 u0 7. 2. 28) iti. samavAyo na pratyakzaH. saMbanDapratyakze yAvadASrayapratyakzasya hetutvAt. kaTamanyaTA GawAkASasaMyogo na pratyakzaH. na ca samavAyasya sarve ASrayAH pratyakzAH. paramARvAderayogyatvAt (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 7 iti. anumAnaM tu guRakriyAdiviSizwabudDirviSezya viSezaRa saMbanDavizayA viSizwabudDitvAt daRqI puruzaH iti viSizwabudDivat (mu0 1 pf0 39) iti. idamanumAnaM samavAyasadBAve pramARaM Bavati (vE0 vi0 7. 2. 26) (mu0 1 pf0 39). sarvatra svarUpasyEva saMbanDatvopapattO samavAyo na padArTAntaram iti BawwA vedAntinaH sAMKyASca manyante (tA0 20 Slo0 54) (vE0 u0 772. 28) (vE0 vi0 4. 2. 11) (di0 1) (si0 ca0) (rAma 0 1 pf0 122). tatra mADvAnAmayamASayaH. guRAdInAM guRyAdiBiH dravyAdiBiH aBedena samavAyABAvAt. AtmanastadDarmARAM ca sAkzivizayatvena manovizayatvABAvAt. varRAtmakaSabdasyAdravyatvenAkASaviSezaguRatvABAvAt (pra0 pa0 pf011 iti. guRakarmasAmAnyAdiBirdravyasya BedABedO. tatra yAvaddravyaBAvinA guRakarmasAmAnyAdinA dravyasyAtyantABed eva. ayAvaddravyaBAvinA tu BedaH (pra0 ca0 pari0 2 pf0 52) iti. 2 samavAyo nAma samUhaH. 3 melanaM ca. yaTA senAyAM samavetAH (amaraH 2. 8. 61) ityAdO iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0960" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायिकारणम्
samavAyikAraRam — (kAraRam) [ka] yatsamavetaM kAryamutpadyate tat. yaTA tantavaH pawasya pawaSca svagatarUpAdeH samavAyikAraRam (ta0 saM0). yatsamavetamityasyArTaSca yasminsamavAyena saMbadDaM sat kAryamutpadyate tat (nyA0 bo0). yadvA yadDarmAvacCinnaM yadDarmAvacCinne samavAyenotpadyate tadDarmAvacCinnaM prati tadDarmAvacCinnaM samavAyikAraRam (nIla0 1 pf0 17) iti. taTA hi tantuzu samavAyena saMbadDaM sat pawAtmakaM kAryamutpadyate. ataH tantuH pawasya samavAyikAraRaM Bavati (nyA0 bo0 1 pf0 9) iti. samavAyikAraRatvaM ca samavAyasaMbanDena kAryADikaraRatvam (la0va0) (vAkya 0 1 pf0 10). aTa vA samavAyasaMbanDAvacCinnakAryatAnirUpitatAdAtmyasaMbanDAvacCinnakAraRatvam. taTA hi. samavAyasaMbanDena GawADikaraRe kapAlAdO kapAlAdestAdAtmyasaMbanDenEva sattvAt samavAyena GawaM prati tAdAtmyena kapAlaM kAraRam iti kAryakAraRaBAvaH iti. samavAyasaMbanDAvacCinnaGawatvAvacCinna kAryatAnirUpitatAdAtmyasaMbanDAvacCinnakAraRatAyAH kapAlAdO sattvAllakzaRasamanvayaH (nyA0 bo0 1 pf0 9). atra niyamaH samavAyikAraRatvaM dravyamAtravftti iti (BA0 pa0 Slo0 23) (vE0 10. 2. 1). atrAhurapare dravyasya samavAyikAraRatvepi nimittakAraRatvamapyasti. taTA hi pawaM prati tantUnAM samavAyikAraRatvepi turItantusaMyogadvArA nimittakAraRatvamapi tezAM vidyate turIvat (ta0 va0 2. 33) (vE0 u0 10. 2. 2) iti. [Ka] svasamavetakAryotpAdakam. tacca dravyameva Bavati. [ga] upAdAnakAraRam iti sAMKyamAyAvAdivedAntipraBftaya AhuH. asminmate upAdAnatvaM ca pariRAmitvam iti jYeyam. upAdAnaM nimittaM ca iti dviviDameva kAraRam iti ca jYeyam (pra0 ca0 pf0 13).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0963" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

