समाख्या
samAKyA — 1 anvarTA saMjYA. yaTA ayonijezu SarIrezu manumarIcidurvAsaHsaMjYA (vE0 u0 4. 2. 8) (vE0 vi0 4. 28). 2 mImAMsakAstu yOgikaH SabdaH. atroktam sTAnaM kramo yogabalaM samAKyA (SAstradIpikA) iti. sA ca samAKyA dviviDA vEdikI lOkikI ceti. tatrAdyA yaTA hotfcamasaH hAriyojanaH ityAdiH. atra hotfcamasa ityanayA vEdikasamAKyayA hotuScamasaBakzaRANgatvaM boDyate (lO0 BA0 viDini0 pf0 28). atra camasasTasomaBakzaRe SrutiH havirDAne carmannaDi grAvaBiraBizutyAhavanIye hutvA pratyaYcaH paretya sadasi Bakzayanti (tEttirIya saMhitA 6. 2. 11) iti. hAriyojanaSabdArTastu harirasi hAriyojanaH ityanena mantreRa gfhyamARo graho hAriyojanaH (lO0 BA0 viDini0 wI0 pf0 28). lOkikI samAKyA tu yAjYikEH parikalpitA. (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 28). sA yaTA ADvaryavam ityAdiH. ADvaryavaM kARqam ityarTaH. anayA lOkikasamAKyayA puroDvaryurvirAjati ityAdinA yajurvedena vihitAnAM padArTAnAmaNgatvamaDvaryorboDyate (lO0 BA0 wI0 pf0 28) ityAhuH. 3 kIrtiH iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0964" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

