samADiH — 1 samADAnam. 2 yogaSAstrajYAstu cittasyABimatavizaya-. nizWatvam (gO0 vf0 4. 2. 36). ekAgratayA manasaH sTApanarUpo DyeyamAtrasPuraRarUpaH DyAnavijYezaH ityAhuH. atra sUtram tadevArTamAtra. nirBAsaM svarUpaSUnyamiva samADiH (pAta0 pA0 3 sU0 3) iti. tasyEva kalpanAhInaM svarUpagrahaRaM hi yat. manasA DyAnanizpAdyaM samADiH soBiDIyate. (vAca0) iti purARamapi. samADirnAma BAvanA. sA ca BAvyasya vizayAntaraparihAreRa cetasi punaH punarniveSanam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 356 pAta0). samADiH samatAvasTA jIvAtmaparamAtmanoH. brahmaRyeva sTitiryA sA samADiH pratyagAtmanaH.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 347 pAta0). AlaMkArikAstu 3 arTAlaMkAraviSezaH. tatroktam samADiH sukare kArye dEvAdvastvantarAgamAt (sA0 da0 pari0 10 Slo0 86) iti. 4 kAvyaguRaviSezaH samADiH. tatroktam SlezaH prasAdaH samatA mADuryaM sukumAratA. arTavyaktirudAratvamojaHkAntisamADayaH.. iti vEdarBamArgasya prARA daSa guRAH smftAH (kAvyAda0) iti. tasyOjasyantarBAvo yaTA SlezaH samADirOdAryaM prasAda iti vE punaH. guRASciraMtanEruktA ojasyantarBavanti te.. (sA0 da0 pari08 Slo0 9) iti. atredaM jYeyam. samADirArohAvarohakramarUpaH. Aroha utkarzaH. avarohopakarzaH. tayoH kramo vErasyAnAvaho vinyAsaH. yaTA caYcadBujaH (veRIsaM0) ityAdi. atra pAdatraye krameRa banDasya gAQatA. caturTapAde tvapakarzaH. tasyApi ca tIvraprayatnoccAryatayOjasvitA (sA0 da0 pari0 8 Slo0 9-10 wI0) iti. 5 samADiH mAnasI vyaTA iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0965" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानः
samAnaH — 1 (vAyuH) [ka] AhArezu pAkArTaM vahneH samAnayanAtsamAnaH (di0 112). [Ka] BuktapariRAmAya jaWarAnalasya samunnayanAtsamAnaH. sa ca prARAntargato vAyuH (si0 ca0). 2 ekaH. yaTA samAnatantrasidDaH paratantrAsidDaH pratitantrasidDAntaH (gO0 1. 1. 29) ityAdO yaTA vA yatsamAnADikaraRa (ci0 2 vyApti 0) ityAdO samAnaSabdasyArTaH. 3 tulyaH. yaTA siMhasamAnaguRayogAnmARavakaH siMhaH ityAdO samAnaSabdastulyArTakaH. 4 sADuH ityanye vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0966" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानधर्मः
samAnaDarmaH — [ka] virudDakowidvayasADAraRaDarmaH (gO0 vf0 1. 1. 23). yaTA sTARupuruzayoH samAno Darma ArohapariRAho (vAtsyA0 1. 1. 23). tAdfSaDarmajYAnaM ca sTARurvA puruzo vA ityAkArakasaMSaye prayojakam iti vijYeyam. [Ka] kowidvayasahacaritaDarmaH (di0 gu0). yaTA raNgaM rajataM na vA iti saMSaye hetuBUtaH raNgarajatayoH sAmAnyaDarmaScAkacikyaSuBratvAdiH. [ga] sADarmyam (mu0 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0966" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानपदत्वम्
