समानप्रकारकत्वम्
samAnaprakArakatvam — 1 svasmin (yatkiMcijjYAnAdO) yadDarmAvacCinnaviSezyatAnirUpitayadDarmAvacCinnaprakAratAkatvam tatonyatra (jYAnAdO) tAdfSaviSezyatA nirUpitatAdfSaprakAratAkatvam. yaTA saMSayaniScayayoH. 2 pratibaDyapratibanDakaBAvasTale pratibaDyajYAne yadDarmAvacCinna viSezyatAnirUpitayadDarmAvacCinnaprakAra tAkatvam pratibanDakajYAne ca tadDarmAvacCinnaviSezyatAnirUpitatadDarmAtiriktaDarmAnavacCinnapratiyogitAkA BAvatvAvacCinnaprakAratAnirUpakatvam. yaTA navyamate parvato vahnyaBAvavAn iti niScayasyApi parvato mahAnasIyavahnimAn iti budDisamAnaprakArakatvam. atredamavaDeyam. tadaBAvavattAniScayanizWAyAM tadvattAbudDipratibanDakatAyAM samAnaprakArakatvaM tatram iti navyAnAM sidDAntaH. prAcAM sidDAntastu tatra samAnavizayakatvameva tantram iti. atredaM tattvam. viSezatadvattAbudDiM prati sAmAnyatadaBAvavattA niScayasyApi pratibanDakatvam iti sarvAnuBavamanuruDyedamuktam iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0966" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानवित्तिवेद्यत्वम्
samAnavittivedyatvam — tulyavittivedyatvam (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 21).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0967" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानविभक्तिकत्वम्
samAnaviBaktikatvam — [ka] svaprakftikaviBaktisajAtIyaviBaktikatvam. yaTA nIlo GawaH ityAdO nIlapadaGawapadayoH samAnaviBaktikatvam. idaM ca aBedAnvayavizayakaSAbdaboDe prayojakaM Bavati. atredamaDikaM boDyam. samAnaviBaktikatvavat samAnavacanakatvamapyaBedAnvayaboDe tatram iti niyamaH. tatra vyavasTA. yatra viSezyavAcakapadottaraviBaktitAtparyavizayasaMKyAvirudDasaMKyAyA avivakzitatvam tatra viSezyaviSezaRapadayoH samAnaliNgavacanakatvaniyamaH iti. tena purUravomArdravasO viSvedevAH trayaH samuditA hetuH pitaro devatAH jAtyAkftivyaktayaH padArTAH pratyakzAnumAnopamAnaSabdAH pramARAni ityAdizu viBinnaliNgavacanakasTalezvaBedAnvayaboDa upapadyate (vyu0 kA0 1 pf0 1-3) iti. atra viBaktO tAdfSaviBaktisAjAtyaM ca viBaktiviBAjakapraTamAtvAdinAvagantavyam. tena vedAH pramARam SataM brAhmaRAH ityAdO samAnaviBaktikatvaM saMpadyate (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 1 pf0 1). [Ka] kecittu virudDaviBaktyanavarudDatvam. yaTA nIlamutpalam nIlotpalam ityAdO samAnaviBaktikatvam (ma0pra0 4 pf0 48). [ga] virudDaviBaktirAhityam. tacca stokaM pacati ityAdO viBaktiSUnyaBAgepyasti iti jYeyam (ta0 pra0 4 pf0 4647). [Ga] viSezaRapadasya viSezyapadAprakftikaviBaktyaprakftitvam. yaTA nIlaGawamAnaya nIlaM GawamAnaya ityAdO samAnaviBaktikatvam ityAhuH (ga0 vyu0 1 pf0 3.). idaM ca virudDaviBaktirAhityarUpA samAsavyAsasADAraRAkANkzA ityucyate. tattu vEyAkaraRaKa sUcimAnaya ityAdO na prApnoti iti cintyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0967" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानविषयकत्वम्
samAnavizayakatvam — tulyarUpaviSezyaviSezaRatASAlitvam tadvizayavizayakatvaM vA. yaTA parvato vahnimAn parvato mahAnasIyavahnimAMSca iti niScayayoH samAnavizayakatvam. kvacit aBAvapratiyogitAvacCedakatayA grAhyavfttiDarmAvagAhitvam (ga0 bADa0). yaTA parvato mahAnasIyavahnaTaBAvavAn iti niScayasyA piparvato vahnimAn iti budDisamAnavizayakatvam.<BR>;p{0968}<BR>atredamavaDeyam. tadaBAvavattAniSvayasya tadvattAbudDipratibanDakatAyAM samAnavizayakatvaM tatram iti prAcInAnAM sidDAntaH iti. idaM ca boDyam. sAmAnyatadvattAbudDiM prati viSezatadaBAvavattAniScayasyApi samAnavizayakatvena pratibanDakatvaM prAcInAnAmaBimatam. ataH parvato mahAnasIyavahnayaBAvavAn iti niScayasya parvato vahnimAn iti budDiM prati pratibanDakatvaM saMgacCate iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0967" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाकारकत्वम्
samAnAkArakatvam — [ka] svasminyAdfSI tadvadviSezyakatvAvacCinnatatprakAritA tAdfSatadvadviSezyakatvAvacCinnatatprakAritASAlitvam (ku0 3). yaTA parvato vahnimAn iti niScayasya parvato vahnimAn na vA iti saMSayasamAnAkArakatvam (ga0 hetvA0 la0 2 pf0 11). idaM ca saMSaye vizayatAdvayam iti pakzABiprAyakam iti tu sUkzmataraM viBAvanIyaM vidvadBiH. [Ka] svasminyAdfSanirUpyanirUpakaBAvApannavizayatAkatvam tAdfSanirUpyanirUpakaBAvApannavizayatAkatvam ityasmadgurucaraRAH prAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0968" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाधिकरणत्वम्
samAnADikaraRatvam — 1 ekADikaraRavfttikatvam. yaTA hetusamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvApratiyogisADya sAmAnADikaraRyaM vyAptiH iti vyAptisvarUpaniruktO parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO lakzaRaGawakIBUtaDUmaGawAtyantABAvayoH samAnADikaraRatvam. atra samAnam ekam aDikaraRam ASrayaH yayoH tayorBAvaH iti vyutpattirdrazwavyA. 2 kowidvayasahacaritatvam. yaTA DUmaDUmABAvasamAnADikaraRo vahniH (ga0 savyaBi0) ityAdO samAnADikaraRatvaSabdArTaH. 3 SAbdikAstu viBinnaviBaktirAhitye sati aBedenEkArTaboDajanakatvam (vftti 0). yaTA nIlo GawaH paramarAjyam mahAnavamI ityAdO nIlapadAdiGawapadAdyorekaDarmiboDakapadatvarUpaM samAnADikaraRatvam ityAhuH. atrodAharanti lawaH SatfSAnacAvapraTamAsamAnADikaraRe (pARi0 3. 2. 124) ityatra pacantaM devadattaM paSya pacamAnaM devadattaM paSya iti. tatpuruzaH samAnADikaraRaH karmaDArayaH (pARi0 1. 2. 42) ityatra paramarAjyam mahAnavamI iti ca (kASikA0). SizwaM tu sAmAnADikaraRyaSabdavyAKyAne dfSyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0968" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तपुनरात्तत्वम्
samAptapunarAttatvam — [ka] kriyAnvayena SAntAkANkzasya viSezyavAcakapadasya viSezaRAntarAnvayArTaM punaranusaMDAnam. niyatAkANkzArahitAnvayaboDottaraM viSezyavAcakapadasya punaranusaMDAnam iti samuditArTaH (rAma0 1 pf0 2). atra vyutpattiH samApte vAkyasamAptO punarAttatA grahaRam iti. taca samAptapunarAttatvam viSezyavAcakapadanizWaH kAvyadozaH utTApyAkANkzAsTala eva pravartate na tUtTitAkANkzasTala iti boDyam (di0 maNgala0). yaTA udayati candraH kumudabanDuH ityAdO samAptapunarAttatvaM dozaH. tadudAhftaM candrAloke samAptapunarAttaM syAdeza pIyUzaBAjanam. netrAnandI tuzArAMSurudetyambuDibAnDavaH.. iti. [Ka] kecittu nirAkANkzaboDajanakavAkyottaratvaviSizwatadvAkyaGawakI BUtapadArTAnvitaviSezaRaboDakapadavattvam iti vadanti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0969" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तिः
samAptiH — 1 avasAnam. tacca tattadvastukAlacaramasaMbanDaH. yaTA samApte yajYakarmaRi ityAdO. samAptistu yasminnanuzWite saMpUrRamidaM karma iti pramA. sA ca granTAdO caramavAkyaliKane yAgAdO caramAhutO pawAdAvantyatantusaMyoge grAmagamanAdO grAmacaraRacaramasaMyoge pramA. evaM tatra tatrohanIyA (vE0 u0 1. 1. 1 pf0 5). 2 caramavarRaH (ta0 pra0 1). yatra granTasamAptiH. 3 caramavarRajanyaM tadvitIyakzaRotpannaM tatsajAtIyaM varRAntaram. kecittu 4 ArabDakarmajanyaScaramavarRaparyanta varRasamUharUpagranTAdiH ityAhuH. 5 caramavarRaDvaMsaH (ta0 pra0 1) (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 23). caramakftiDvaMsaH. yaTA granTasamAptiH svotpattikzaRaDvaMsaH svasya samAptiH (ma0 pra0). AdyA pravfttirAramBaH iti jEminIyAramBalakzaRAnusArAdidaM lakzaRam. tasya caramakftiDvaMsasya ca svapratiyogivizayatvena granTanizWatvaM boDyam (ma0pra0). 6 caramavarRajanyam ArabDakarmacaramavarRASe lOkikapratyakzAtmakam AnupUrvIviSezaviSizwatAvadvarRavizayakasamUhAlambanAnusaMDAnaM samAptiH ityanya AhuH (mU0 ma0 1 pf0 24). 7 jYAnaviSeza eva samAptiH ityapara AhuH (ma0 vA0 pf0 5). 8 paricCedaH. 9 vaDaH. 10 samADAnam (viSvaH). 11 samarTanam (medi 0). 12 prAptiH (Sabdaca 0) (vAca0). 122<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0969" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासः
samAsaH — 1 saMkzepaH. yaTA vizRunAsya samastasya samAsavyAsayogataH (tattvasaM 0 8. 5) ityAdO samAsaSabdasyArTaH saMkzepaH (pra0 ca0 pf0 54). 2 samarTanam (medi 0). 3 samAhAraH. 4 samAso nAma DarmamAtrABiDAnam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 171 naku0). 5 [ka] anekezAM padAnAmekapadIBavanam. samAsapadaM dviviDam yogarUQam yOgikaM ceti. tatrAdyam paNkajakfzRasarpADarmAdipadam. dvitIyaM tu karmaDArayAdiH saptaviDaH samAsaH. atra samAsatvaM cAKaRqopADiH saMketaviSezeRa samAsapadavattvaM vA (ma0pra0 4 pf0 43). [Ka] yAdfSamahAvAkyottaraH tvatalAdiH svArTasya yAdfSArTAvacCinnavizayatASAliboDe hetuH tAdfSaM tadvAkyaM taTAviDArTe samAsaH. idaM ca yOgikasamAsasya lakzaRam na tu yogarUQasamAsasya iti vijYeyam. atra vAkyasya mahattvaM ca prakftyarTamAtrAvacCinnapratyayArTasyAnvayavoDaM pratyayogyatvaM vAcyam. tena upakumBAdO nAvyAptiH. na vA nIlaGawatvatvam ityAdO nIlaGawatvAdiBAgetiprasaNgaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 31 wI0 pf0 38). sa cAyaM samAsaH saptaviDaH karmaDArayaH dviguH tatpuruzaH avyayIBAvaH bahuvrIhiH dvandvaH upapadasaMjYakaSceti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 32 wI0 pf0 39). kevalasamAsaH ityapi kecidAhuH. samAsaScaturviDaH avyayIBAvaH tatpuruzaH dvandvaH bahuvrIhiSca iti kecicCAvdikA AhuH. tatra pUrvapadArTapraDAnovyayIBAvaH uttarapadArTapraDAnastatpuruzaH uBayapadArTapraDAno dvandvaH anyapadArTapraDAno bahuvrIhiH ityAdilakzaRamapi prAyikam. unmattagaNgam sUpaprati ityAdyavyayIBAve arDapippalI pUrvakAyaH ityAditatpuruze dvitrAH ityAdibahuvrIhO kuSapalASam ityAdidvandve ca parasparavyaBicArAt parasparamavyADyativyAGyoH sattvAt ityalam. prAcInavEyAkaraRoktaviBAgasya prAyikatvamAha. samAsastu caturTeti prAyovAdastaTAparaH. yoyaM pUrvapadArTAdiprADAnyavizayaH sa ca.. BOtapUrvyAt sopi reKAgavayAdivadAsTitaH iti. atrocyate kavinA sopahAsam dvandvo dvigurapi cAhaM mahe satatamavyayIBAvaH. tatpuruza karmaDAraya yena sadA syAM bahuvrIhiH.. (udBawaH) iti. atra prAcInA vAgBawAdayaH paYcaviDAn BedAnAdAya yezAM.<BR>;p{0971}<BR>samAsAnAM paYcaviDattraM vadanti te ca samAsA api pUrvoktasaptaviDAntargatA eva Bavanti. taTA hi. (1) kaScitsamAsaH pUrvapadArTa DarmikAnvayaboDajanakatayA pUrvapadapraDAna ucyate. yaTA prAptajAyA arDapippalI pUrvakAyaH ityAdikastatpuruzaH. yaTA vA udakumBAdyavyayIBAvaH puruzasiMhAdikarmaDArayaSca. (2) kaScinmaDyamapadArTa DarmikaDIjanakatayEva maDyamapadapraDAnaH. yaTA pawAnaDikaraRapratiyogitAnavacCedaka- ityAdikastatpuruzaH. pawasya nADikaraRam ityAdivigrahe maDyamapadArTasyEva viSezyatvAt. (3) kaSvidantyapadArTa DarmikaDIhetutvAdantyapadapraDAnaH. yaTA.. rAjapuruzAdikastatpuruzaH. nIlotpalAdikaH karmaDArayaH dvigArgyAdyavyayIBAvaSca. (4) kaScitsarva padArTaDarmika budDihetutvAt sarvapadapraDAnaH. yaTA itaretaradvandvaH dvandvamAtraM vA. (5) kaScitsvAGawakAnyapadArTaDarmikajYAnajanakatvAdanyapadArTapraDAnaH. yaTA bahuvrIhiH KaleyavAdyavyayIBAvaSca iti. nityAnityaBedenApi samAsasya dvEviDyaM jayAdityAdiBiruktam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 33 wI0 pf0 3940). tatrAvigrahaH asvapadavigraho vA nityasamAsaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 42). [ga] vEyAkaraRAstu vyAdipadAnAmekapadatAsaMpAdakaH padasADutArTakaH saMskAraviSezaH. yaTA rAjapuruza ityAdO. atra sUtram samarTaH padaviDiH (pARi0 2. 1. 1) iti. atra sAmarTyaM dviviDam vyapekzAvattvam ekArTIBAvaSca. tatra (1) svArTaparyavasAyipadAnAmAkANkzAdivaSAdyaH parasparaM saMbanDaH sA vyapekzA. parasparanirUpyanirUpakaBAvApannavizayatAprayojakatve sati ekArTopasTityajanakatvam. rAjYaH puruzaH ityAdO vAkye satyAmAkANkzAyAm yo yo yasmin saMnihito yogyaSca sa tena tena saMbaDyate. yaTA rAjYaH puruzoSvaSca rAjYo devadattasya ca puruzaH fdDasya rAjYoSvo DanaM ca ityAdi. vfttO tu nEvam. vfttInAmekArTIBAvAt. (2) ekArTIBAvastu viSezyaviSezaRaBAvAvagAhyekopasTitijanakatvam. taTA ca rAjAdiSabdena viSizwEkArTaboDakatayA na tadekadeSe fdDAderanvayaH. puruzAMSe viSezaRatayopasTitasya nASvAdisaMbanDitA rAjAdInAm. janitAnvayAcca nirAkANkzatayA na devadattAdeH svAmitayA puruzAdAvanvayaH<BR>;p{0972}<BR>iti drazwavyam. devadattasya gurukulam ityAdO devadattAdestu praDAnIBUtakulAdinEvAnvayaH. saMbanDastUpasTitagurudvAraka eva zazwyarTaH. aTa vA saMbanDiSabdArTasya padArTEkadeSatvepi Bavatyeva tatra saMbanDapratiyoginonvayaH. taduktaM BartfhariRA saMbanDiSabdaH sApekzo nityaM sarvaH samasyate. vAkyavatsA vyapekzApi vfttAvapi na hIyate.. (vAkyapa 0) iti. vArtikakAramatamapi Bartfharimata tulyameva. prAcInAnAM tu virudDA gATA sApekze pratyayo na syAtsamAso vA kaTaMcana. sApekzaM tadvijAnIyAdasamastaviSezaRam.. iti. sa ca samAsaH zaqviDaH supAM supA tiNA nAmnA DAtunATa tiNAM tiNA. subanteneti ca jYeyaH samAsaH zaqviDo buDEH.. (vE0 sA0 samA0 kAri0 28) iti. tatra supAM supA samAso yaTA rAjapuruzaH ityAdiH. supAM tiNA yaTA paryaBUzat ityAdiH. ayaM samAsaH saha supA (pARi0 2. 1. 4) ityatra yogaviBAgena BAzye vyutpAditaH spazwaH SabdakOstuBAdO. supAM nAmnA yaTA kumBakAraH ityAdiH. supAM DAtunA yaTA kawaprUH AyatastUH ityAdiH. tiNAM tiNA yaTA pibataKAdatA pacataBfjjatA ityAdiH. tiNAM subantena yaTA jahistambaH ityAdiH ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0970" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहारः
samAhAraH — 1 sAhityam. tacca [ka] tulyavadekakriyAnvayitvarUpam (nyA0 ma0). yaTA mArdaNgikavERavikaM vAdaya ityAdO samAhAraH. tulyavat samaBAvenetyarTaH. idaM ca patnIyajamAnayorekayAgAnvayinorativyAptivAraRAya. taTA ca patnyA anumatidvArA yajamAnasya ca sAkzAdeva yAgAnvayitvam na tulyavat iti nAtivyAptiH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 46). taTA ca kriyAyAH viDeyaBUtAyAH ekarUpastulyaH saMbanDaH samAhAraH iti samuditArTaH. yaTA kezAMcinmate pARipAdaM vAdaya ityatra vAdanakriyAyAM tulyavadeva pARipAdayoranvayaH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 50). [Ka] apekzAbudDiviSezavizayatvam (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 13). [ga] budDiviSezaviSezyatvam. yaTA pARipAdam ityAdO samAhAradvandve samAhAraH 1 [(Sa0 pra0 Slo0 48 wI0 pf0 61). 2 samuccayaH. anudBUtA- . vayavaviSezaH samUhaH iti vEyAkaraRA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0972" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहारद्वन्द्वः
samAhAradvandvaH — (dvandvasamAsaH) [ka] ekavacanAnyasuvAkANkzAvihInaH samAsaH. yaTA pARipAdam hastyaSvam iti samAhAradvandvaH. atra eke prAco nEyAyikAH AhuH. pARipadaM pARipratiyogikamityarTaM pAdapadaM ca pAdasamAhAraM lakzayati. na pARipAdasamAhAre SaktiH iti. SAbdikAstu samAhAre SaktiH ityAhuH. taTA ca samAhAre dvandve dvitvatritvAdinEva samUhasya boDAtsamUhatvameva pravfttinimittam iti vijYeyam. anye prAYco nEyAyikAstu uttarapade pARipAdasAhitye lakzaRA. pARi iti padAntaraM tu tAdfSalakzaRAyA nirUQatvasaMpAdakam. taTAviDasAhityasya ca svASrayanizWatvAdisaMvanDenEva dvitIyAdyarTakarmatvAdO sAkANkzatvAt pARipAdaM vAdaya ityAdernA yogyatvam ityAhuH (Sa0 pra0 lo0 48 wI0 pf0 61) (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 13). navyAstu cUqAmaRiBawwAcAryAdayaH pARipAdaM vAdaya ityatra pARipAdamAtrapratIte (samAhArApratIteH) na samAhAre lakzaRA na vA SaktiH. itaretarasamAhArasaMjYA ca nadI vfdDi ityAdivatpAriBAzikEna. taTA ca samAhAra ekavadBAvena na dvivacanApattiH iti prAhuH (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 13) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 46). pARi. pAdam hastyaSvam ityAdito hi karacaraRAdInAM bahUnAmapyavagatAvekavacanameva pramARam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 49 wI0 pf0 66). dvandvaSca prARitUryasenANgAnAm (pARi0 2. 4. 2) iti sUtraM pramARamatra drazwavyam. [Ka] samUhArTako dvandvasaMjYakaH samAsaH iti SAbdikA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0973" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

