सर्वम्
sarvam — yitAvacCedakAvacCinnavyApyaparyAptikaDarmAvacCinnam. yaTA sarve GawA rUpavantaH ityAdO sarvapadArTaH (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 96). sarvapadapravfttinimittaM ca uddeSyatAvacCedakavyApaka viDeyavyApyaparyAptiko DarmaH. taTAviDaSca DarmaH sarve GawA rUpavantaH ityAdO GawanizWayAvattvameva. tasya vyAsajyavfttitayA tatparyApterGawatvavyApakatvAt rUpAdivyApyatvAt. SabdAdGawatvAdivyApake rUpAdivyApyatvalABe tayorapi vyApyavyApakaBAvorTAllaByata iti. kvacit aSezatvAdi kvacit yAvattvavadanekatvaM ca pravfttinimittam (ga0 Sakti0 pf0 93). atra ca sarvaSabdaH svasamamivyAhftapadArTatAvacCedakavyApakatvaM tAdfSapadArTAntare boDayati iti niyamaH. evaM ca sarve GawA rUpavantaH iti vAkyAt GawatvavyApakaM rUpavattvam iti SAbdaboDo janyata iti boDyam (di0 4 pf0 179). atra anvayitvaM coddeSyaviDeyaBAvaviSezyaviSezaRaBAvasADAraRam (ga0 123<BR>;p{0978}<BR>vyu0 pf0 96). [Ka] prAYcastu vyApakatvAvacCinnamityAhuH - (di0 1 pf0 179). atredamavaDeyam. yogasidDyaDikaraRe hi yaH putrakAmo yaH paSukAmaH (SrutiH) ityAdinA yajYakratUnupakramya ekasmE vA kAmAyAnye yajYakratava Ahriyante sarveByo darSapUrRamAsO ityAmnAtam. tatra sarveByo darSapUrRamAsO (kartavyO) ityAdO sarvAntargataGawoddeSena darSapUrRamAsAdyasaMBavena sarvaSabdasya saMkocaH prakftanirapekzaputrAditattatPalaparatvarUpaH kAryaH iti. [ga] budDivizayo yAvattvAvacCinnaH samUhaH sarvapadArTaH iti SAbdikA vadanti. [Ga] saMpUrRam sakalaM ca iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 2 vedAntinastu vizRuH ityAhuH. tatroktam asataSca sataScEva sarvasya praBavApyayO. sarvasya sarvadA jYAnAtsarvametaM pracakzate.. (vizRupu0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0977" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सविकल्पकम्
savikalpakam — (pratyakzam) [ka] viSizwagrahaRam. [Ka] vESizwyAvagAhi saprakArakaM vA jYAnam (nyA0 ma0 pf0 4) (ta0 saM0). yaTA qitToyam brAhmaRoyam SyAmoyam pAcakoyam iti pratyakzajYAnam (ta0 saM0). atra vESizwyAvagAhi ityasya nAmajAtyAdiviSezaRaviSezyasaMbanDAvagAhi jYAnamityarTaH (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 18) (ta0 kO0). saprakArakamityasya kiMcinnizWaprakAratASAli jYAnam ityarTaH (ta0 pra0 1). savikalpakamityatra vikalpaH prakAratA. taTA ca tallakzaRaM prakAratAnirUpakajYAnatvam iti. ayaM BAvaH. vizayatAyA jYAnanirUpitatvAjjYAnasya ca vizayatAnirUpakatvena prakAratAnirUpakajYAnatvaM tallakzaRam. evam viSezyatAnirUpakajYAnatvam saMsargatAnirUpakajYAnatvam ityapi lakzaRAni saMBavanti. nirvikalpake tu atiriktA turIyA vizayatA svIkriyate. triviDavizayatAmaDya ekApi tatra nAsti (nyA0 bo0 1 pf0 11) (vAkya 0 1 pf0 12) (nIla0 1 pf0 18). [ga] mADvavedAntinastu viSizwAkAragocaraM pratyakzam. tadazwaviDam tatra (1) dravyavikalpako yaTA daRqI iti. (1) guRavikalpako yaTA SuklaH iti. (3) kriyAvikalpako yaTA gacCati.<BR>;p{0979}<BR>iti. (4) jAtivikalpako yaTA gOH iti. (5) viSezavikalpako yaTA viSizwaH paramARuH iti. (6) samavAyavikalpako yaTA pawasamavAyinastantavaH iti. (7) nAmavikalpako yaTA devadattaH iti. (8) aBAvavikalpako yaTA GawABAvavadBUtalam iti ityAhuH (pra0 (pa0 pf0 11) [Ga] mAyAvAdivedAntinastu jYAtfjYeyaBedAdisahitaM jYAnaM savikalpakam ityAhuH. [Na] yogaSAstrajYAstu saMprajYAtAKyaH samADiviSeza ityAhuH. atra sOgatAH kIrtidiNgAgAdayo nAstikAstu savikalpakaM na pratyakzam na ca pramARam. tasya GawatvAdirUpAlIkoparaktatvAdvanDyAputrajYAnavat. nirvikalpakaM tu svalakzaRavastU paraktatvAtsyAdeva pratyakzam pramARaM ca ityAhuH (vE0 u0 8. 1. 2) (si0 ca0 1 pf0 22). tezAM sOgatAnAmayamASayaH. savikalpakaM hi na pramARam. taTA hi. aBilApasaMsargayogyapratiBAsaM hi tat. na hyaBilApena nAmnA nAma saMBavatyarTasya saMbanDaH. yena GawaH iti pawaH iti vA nAmAnuraYjitaH pratyayaH syAt. na ca jAtyAdi paramArTasat. yena tadvESizwyaM vizayezu indriyeRa gfhyeta. na ca sataH svalakzaRasyAsatA saMbanDaH saMBavati. na cAsadindriyagocaraH. tasmAt indriyeRAlocanaM janyate. AlocanamahimnA ca savikalpakamutpadyamAnaM tatrArTe pravartayat pratyakzam iti pramARam iti cocyate (vE0 u0 8. 1. 2 pf0 583) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0978" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

