सव्यभिचारः
savyaBicAraH — (hetvABAsaH duzwahetuH) anEkAntikaH savyaBicAraH (gO0 2. 2. 5). atra vyutpattiH vyaBicAreRa sahitaH savyaBicAraH iti. sADAraRasTale vyaBicAraSca hetunizWasADyABAvavadvfttitvAdirUpaH<BR>;p{0980}<BR>(vAkya0 2 pf0 16). sADyatAvacCedakanizWa hetusamAnADikaraRABAvapratiyogitAvacCedakatvAdirUpo vA (ga0 2 hetvA0 sA0). asADAraRasTale sADyavyApakIBUtABAvapratiyogitvam. anupasaMhArisTale tu atyantABAvApratiyogisADyakatvAdi vyaBicAraH iti. savyaBicAratvaM ca sADAraRa asADAraRa anupasaMhAri etadanyatamatvam (mu0 2 pf0 159) (nIla0 2 pf0 25) (nyA0 bo0 2 pf0 17). vyaBicAra ekatrAvyavasTA. saha vyaBicAreRa vartata iti savyaBicAraH. nidarSanam nityaH SabdaH asparSatvAt. sparSavAn kumBaH anityo dfzwaH. na ca taTA sparSavAn SabdaH. tasmAdasparSatvAnnityaH Sabda iti. dfzwAnte sparSavattvamanityatvaM ca Darmo na sADyasADanaBUtO dfSyete. sparSavAMScARurnityaSceti. AtmAdO ca dfzwAnte udAharaRasADarmyAtsADyasADanaM hetuH iti. asparSatvAditi heturnityatvaM vyaBicarati asparSA budDiranityA ceti. evaM dviviDepi dfzwAnte vyaBicArAt sADyasADanaBAvo nAstIti lakzaRA - BAvAdaheturiti (gO0 vAtsyA0 1. 2. 5). savyaBicArapadaM sADAraRamAtre prayuYjatIdAnIMtanAH (dIDi0 savya 0). SizwaM viBAgAdikaM tu anEkAntikaSabda vyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditam iti viramyate. savyaBicAratvaM ca hetudozaH. tacca sADyasaMdehajanako Bayako wyupasTApakatAvacCedakarUpavattvam. atrAyamarTaH. uBayakowI sADyatadaBAvO. tadupasTApakatAvacCedakaM ca rUpaM sADAraRatvAditritayam. tajjYAne sati pakzaH sADyavAnna vA iti saMSaya udeti iti. aTa vA yaTAkaTaMcit kowidvayopasTitiH (sADyatadaBAva etadvayopasTitiH) smftyanuBavasADAraRI saMdehajananI. niyAmakaM tu sADAraRyAdiviSizwaDarmavattAjYAnam. ata eva DArAvAhI saMdehaH iti mate DarmitAvacCedakaviSizwe DarmiRi yadrUpaviSizwa (DarmavattA) jYAnaM sADyasaMdehajanakam tadrUpavattvam. paryavasitArTastu tadDarmaparyAptaDarmitAvacCedakatAkayatkicitsaMSayanirUpitAyAM janakatAyAmavacCedakIBUtA yA tadDarmanizWaDarmitAvacCedakatAnirUpakaprakAratA tannirUpitAvacCedakatAparyAptyaDikaraRa