सह
saha — (avyayam) 1 [ka] sAhityam. tacca svAnvayitattatkartftvAdikArakAvacCinnAyAH samAnakartfkAyAH samaBivyAhftakriyAyAH samAnakAlInatvam. yaTA putreRa sahAgataH sUpena sArDaM BuktaH cakreRa sAkaM daRqena janitaH putreRa samaM mitrAya dAnam ityAdO sahAdyavyayArTaH sAhityam. putreRetyatra sahArTEkadeSe kartftvAdikArake svaprakftyarTasyAGeyatvaM tftIyayA boDyate. tena putravfttikartftAkagatikAlInagati kartftAvAn ityAkAro boDaH. sUpenetyatra sUpanizWakarmatAkaBojanakAlInaBojanakarmatAvAn odanaH iti boDaH. cakreRetyatra cakranizwakaraRatAkotpattikAlInadaRqanizwakaraRatAkotpattimAn GawaH iti boDaH. putreRa samamityatra putrasaMpradAnatAkadAnakAlInaM mitrasaMpradAnatAkaM dAnam ityAkAro boDaH. atredaM vijYeyam. pawaH pawatvena saha BAsate ityAdO pawatvanizWavizayatAyAH samAnakAlInatvamiva samAnapratiyogikatvamapi sahaSabdArToNgIkartavyaH. viBinnajYAnIyavizayatAyAM tAdfSAprayogAt (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 94 wI0 pf0 120) iti. idaM ca voDyam. tulyavadekakriyAnvayitvaM sAhityam iti pravAdasyApi ekakArakAnvayitvena tulyayorekajAtIyakriyayoranvayitvaM samAnakAlInatvam ityatra tAtparyam (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 94 wI0 pf0 119). BAramanudvahantaM putramanUdvahantyAmapi gardaByAM ekenApi suputreRa siMhI svapiti nirBayam. sahEva daSaBiH putrErBAraM vahati gardaBI.. ityAdO saha vartamAnA ityaDyAhArAt vartamAnatvakriyAmAdAyEva sAhityaboDaH iti vadanti (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3<BR>;p{0983}<BR>pf0 91) (la0 ma0). aTa vA sAhityaM sahaBAvaH. sa ca sAmAnADikaraRyam. yaTA patnyA sahAgnimAdaDyAt Gawena saha pawavadgfham ityAdO sahaSabdArTaH. atra patnIkartfkasyAnyADAnasyAlOkikatvena tatsamAnakAlInatvasya prApayitumaSakyatvAt sAmAnADikaraRyarUpasahaBAvamAtraM sahaSabdArTaH svIkftaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 94 wI0 pf0 121). [Ka] samaBivyAhftapadopasTApya kriyAkAlaH. tasya kriyAnvayini nAmArTa evAnvayaH. tAdfSakAlaviSizwa nAmArTe kriyAnvaye ca kriyAyAmapi tAdfSakAlAvacCinnatvaM BAsate. uddeSyatAvacCedakAvacCedena viDeyAnvayasya vyutpattisidDatvAt. ataH kriyAdvayasamAnakAlInatvalABaH (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 3 pf0 90) iti. evam AlApAdgAtrasaMsparSAnniSvAsAtsahaBojanAt (smftiH) ityatra ekapatiH sahaSabdArTaH. kvacicca yAjanaM yonisaMbanDaM svADyAyasahaBojanam. sadyaH patati kurvARaH patitena na saMSayaH.. (smftiH) ityAdO ekadEkapAtraBojanAdyapi sahArTo jYeyaH. atreyaM vyavasTA. sahaSabdArTastatkriyAkAlaH. sa ca kvacit tatkriyAnvayipraTamAntapadArTenveti. kvacicca samaBivyAhftakriyAyAm. yaTA saputra AgacCati ityasya putreRa sahAgacCati yaH iti vigrahAt praTamAntAnyapadArTa eva putrAgamanakAlAnvayaH na tu kriyAyAm. putreRa saha nAgacCati ityAdO ca kriyAyAmeva tAdfSasahArTAnvayaH iti putrAgamanakAlInAgamanakartftvAdyaBAvaH praTamAntArTe pratIyata iti. BAramanudvahantaM putramanUdvahantyAmapi gardaByAM sahEva daSaBiH putrErBAraM vahati gardaBI ityAdO saha vartamAnA ityaDyAhArAdvartamAnatvakriyAmAdAyEva sAhityaboDa iti vadanti (ga0 vyu0 kAra0 3 pf0 91). [ga] kacicca kriyAsamAnakAlInakriyA. yaTA putrEH sahAgataH pittA ityAdO sahaSabdArTaH. atra kriyAyAH kartftvAdisaMbanDena puruzAdAnvayaH. tAdfSasaMbanDena tadviSizwe ca AgataH AgacCati ityAdipadopasTApyAgamanakartftvAdInAmanvaye na vyutpattiviroDaH. viDeyasyoddeSyatAvacCedakaprakArABedavirahAt iti. atra gORakriyAnvayini tftIyA sahArTayoge sahayuktepraDAne (pARi0 2. 3. 19) ityanena. sAhityapratiyogivAcakapadAt tftIyA<BR>;p{0984}<BR>iti PalitArTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 3 pf0 89). ayamarTaH. putreRa sahAgataH pitA ityAdO pituH kriyAsaMvanDaH sAkzAcCabdenocyate putrasya tu pratIyamAnaH iti putrasyAprADAnyam iti vEyAkaraRA AhuH (kASikA 2. 3. 19). [Ga] tatkriyAkAlInatvam. yaTA SizyeRa sahAgato guruH ityAdO. atra kartftvaM tftIyArTaH. tasya sahaSabdArTEkadeSakriyAyAmanvayaH. sahaSabdArTasya tAdfSakAlInatvasya ca DAtvarTenvayaH. itTaM ca. SizyakartfkAgamanakAlInAgamanakartA guruH iti boDaH (ma0pra0 pf0 6). [Na] samaBivyAhftapadopasTApyo yatkiMcidDarmaH. yaTA SizyeRa saha gururbrAhmaRaH putreRa saha pitA sundaraH ityAdO sahaSabdasyArTaH. atra sahaSabdArTo brAhmaRyasOndaryAdi. tasya samAnakAlInatvasaMbanDena brAhmaRasundarAdipadArTEkadeSenvayaH. pare tu sahArTaH sAhityam ekaDarmAnvayitvarUpam. tftIyArTo vfttitvam saMKyAmAtraM vA. taTA ca SizyasAhityavAn gururbrAhmaRaH ityAdiboDaH ityAhuH (kAvyA0 pf0 8). 2 SAbdikAstu saha vidyamAnatvam. yaTA sahEva daSaBiH putrErBAraM vahati gardaBI ityAdO sahaSabdArTa ityAhuH (la0 ma0). 3 sAkalyam. 4 sAdfSyam. 5 yOgapadyam. 6 samfdDiH. 7 saMbanDaH (medi0 8 sAmarTyam (SabdamA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0982" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

