सांसिद्धिकम्
sAMsidDikam — (dravatvam) svaBAvanirvfttam. nimittAntarAjanyamityarTaH. yaTA jalanizWaM dravatvaM sAMsidDikam. himAdInAM GanIBAvaH kAraRaviSezeRa. dravIBAvastu sAMsidDikaH. GftAdInAM tu GanIBAvaH sAMsidDikaH. dravIBAvastu nEmittikaH iti tayorviSezaH. SizwaM tu dravatvaSabdavyAKyAnAdO dfSyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0987" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साकाङ्क्षत्वम्
sAkANkzatvam — 1 anyonyavizayAkANkzAjanakatvam (ta0 BA0 4 pf0 18). yaTA gAmAnaya ityAdO gavAnayanayoH sAkANkzatvam. niyatasAkANkzodAharaRaM<BR>;p{0988}<BR>tu cEtrasya gurukulam mEtrasya dAsaBAryA (mahABAzye 2. 1. 1) ityAdi. idaM ca SAbdapramitO prayojakam. ata eva gOraSvaH puruzo hastI iti Gawo GawaH iti ca nirAkANkzavAkyAnna SAbdapramitiH iti vijYeyam. atra padAni sAkANkzARi arTAH sAkANkzA vA iti praSne uttaramAha. arTAstAvat svapadaSrotari anyonyavizayAkANkzA janakatvena sAkANkzAH ityucyante. taNkAreRa tatpratipAdakAni padAnyapi sAkANkzARi ityucyante. yadvA padAnyeva svArTa pratipAdyArTAntaravizayAkANkzAjanakAni ityupacArAt sAkANkzARi (ta0 BA0 pf0 18) iti. 2 sABilAzatvaM sAkANkzatvam iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0987" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साकारत्वम्
sAkAratvam — 1 DarmASrayatvam. (mU0 ma0 1). yaTA ayaM GawaH iti jYAnasya GawatvASrayatvam. svanizWaprakAratA nirUpitaprakAritAsaMbanDena yatkiMcidDarmaviSizwatvam ityarTaH. 2 mADvAH pOrARikASca mUrtiviSizwatvam. yaTA paramAtmanaH sAkAratvam ityAhuH. ayaM BAvaH. maDvamate paramAtmanoprAkftajYAnAnandAdiguRarUpaSarIrasvIkAreRa sAkAratvaM saMgacCate. pOrARikamate tu apAYcaBOtikecCAsvIkfta lIlAvigrahavattvena tasya sAkAratvamupapadyate iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साक्षात्
sAkzAt — 1 pratyakzam. yaTA sAkzAddfzwo mayA hariH ityAdO. kecittu lOkikapratyakzam ityAhuH. 2 [ka] mAyAvAdivedAntinastu avyavahitam (bfha0 upa0 SAMkaraBA0 3. 4. 1). tacca sadrUpaM cEtanyaM ityAhuH. yaTA yatsAkzAdaparokzAdbrahma (bfha0 upa0 3. 4. 1) iti SrutO sAkzAt ityasyArTaH. [Ka] paraMparAsaMbanDarAhityam. yaTA dravyatvasAkzAdvyApyA jAtiH pfTivItvam ityAdO sAkzAt SabdArTaH. atra sAkzAdvyApyatvaM ca tadvyApyAvyApyatve sati tadvyApyatvaM boDyam. yaTA ca sAkzAnmAtA sAkzAdBaginI ityAdO sAkzAt SabdArTaH. 3 tulyam. yaTA sAkzAllakzmIriyaM vaDUH ityAdO sAkzAtSabdArTaH iti kAvyajYA AhuH (amara0 3. 3. 242).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साक्षात्कारः
sAkzAtkAraH — [ka] pratyakzAtmakaM jYAnam (nyA0 ma0 1 pf0 3).<BR>;p{0989}<BR>yaTA sAkzAtkAre suKAdInAM karaRaM mana ucyate (BA0 pa0 Slo0 86) ityAdO sAkzAtkAraSabdasyArTaH. atra sAkzAtkAratvaM ca sAkzAtkaromi ityanugatapratItisAkziko jAtiviSezaH (nyA0 ma0 1). [Ka] lOkikasaMnikarzajanyaM pratyakzaM sAkzAtkAra iti kecidAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0988" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

