साक्षात्संबन्धः
sAkzAtsaMbanDaH — pAramparyarahitaH saMbanDaH. yaTA Bawwamate Sabdo dravyam sAkzAtsaMbanDenendriyagrAhyatvAt Gawavat (nyA0 ma0 nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 31 ityatra sAkzAtsaMbanDaSabdasyArTaH. atra sAkzAttvaM ca itarapadArTAMpratiyogikatve satyuddizwapadArTapratiyogitvam iti. sAkzAtsaMbanDaSca saMyoga samavAya etadanyataraH (ta0 pra0 Ka0 4 pf0 126). evamanyopi cintyaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0989" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साक्षी
sAkzI — 1 bodDftve sati akartA. yaTA kalahe pravftte kaScanAnyaH puruzaH sAkzI. mAyAvAdivedAntimate upADyupahitaM kevalaM cEtanyaM sAkzi. yaTA sAkzI cetAH kevalo nirguRaSca (SrutiH) ityAdO jIveSvarO sAkziRO iti. tanmate jIvasAkzISvarasAkzidvEviDyena pratyakzajYAnadvEviDyam. tatra jIvasAkzi cAntaHkaraRopahitaM cEtanyam. tacca jIvaBedena nAnA. ISvarasAkzi tu mAyopahitaM cEtanyam. taccEkam. tadupADiBUtamAyAyA ekatvAt iti. jIveSvarayorantaHkaraRamAyArUpatadupADyorjaqatvepi tattadupADivftticEtanyasyEva avaBAsakatvAtsAkzitvamupapadyate (vedA0 pari0 1 pf0 18). mADvamate tu svarUpendriyaM sAkzi na tu manaH. atra sAkzilakzaRaM tu AtmasvarUpajYAnAdivyaYjakatvameva iti spazwam. atroktam pratyakzaM saptaviDam sAkzizaqindriyaBedAt. tatra svarUpendriyaM sAkzItyucyate. tasya vizayA AtmasvarUpatadDarmajYAnasuKAdayaH BAvarUpAvidyA manastamaSca jYAnasuKAdyAH kAlo vyAkftAkASaSvetyAdyAH. sa ca svarUpajYAnAdikaM vyanakti (pra0 ca0 pf0 15)<BR>;p{0990}<BR>(iti. sAMKyamate tu budDeH sAkzI puruzaH. atra sUtram sAkzAtsaMbanDAta sAkzitvam (sAMKya0 a0 1 sU0 161). atrArTe pARinisUtram sAkzAddrazwari saMjYAyAm (pARi0 5. 2. 91) iti. atrAyaM vivekaH. suzuptyAdyavasTAtrayasAkzitvaM tu sAMKyamate budDinizWasuzuptyAditrayadrazwftvamAtraM. puruze (sAMKya0 a0 1 sU0 148) (sAMKya0 BA0 1. 161). mAyAvAdimate tu tAdfSabudDivfttInAM prakASanam (vedA0 pa0) iti. taduktam jAgrat svapnaH suzuptaM ca guRato budDivfttayaH. tAsAM vilakzaRo jIvaH sAkzitvena vyavasTitaH.. (sAMKya0 BA0 a0 1 sU0 148). maDvamatAnuyAyinastu svaprakASAtma svarUpAnuBavaH sAkzI ityAhuH (vAdAvalI pf0 22). vyavahAraSAstrajYAstu vivAdavizayapramAtA sAkzI. tatsvarUpamuktaM manunA samakzadarSanAtsAkzyaM SravaRAcEva sidDyati (manu0 a0 8 Slo0 74) iti. sAkziprayojanamuktaM nAradena saMdigDezu tu kAryezu dvayorvivadamAnayoH. dfzwaSrutAnuBUtatvAtsAkziByo vyaktidarSanam.. (vIramitro0 a0 2 pf0 142). gOtamenApyuktam vipratipattO sAkzinimittA vyavasTA iti. sa ca sAkzI dviviDaH kftaH akftaSca. tatrAdyaH sAkzitvenArTipratyarTiByAM nirUpitaH. dvitIyastu tAByAmanirUpitaH. punaSca kftasya liKitasmAritayadfcCABijYagUQottarasAkziBedena paYcaviDatvam. akftasya ca grAmAdiBedena zaqviDatvam. evaM cEkAdaSaviDAH sAkziRaH ityAhuH. taTA coktaM nAradena grAmaSca prAqvivAkaSca rAjA ca vyavahAriRAm. kAryezvaDikfto yaH syAdarTinA prahitaSca yaH.. kulyAH kulavivAdezu vijYeyAstepi sAkziRaH (vIramitro0 a0 2 pf0 144) iti. atrADikaM tu nAradoktaM vIramitrodayAdO drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0989" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सादृश्यम्
sAdfSyam — [ka] asADAraRAnya tadgatabahuDarmavattvam (ci0 3 pf0 3-4). yaTA candravanmuKam GawasadfSaH pawaH ityAdO muKAdAvAhlAdakatvAdinA candrAdisAdfSyam (mu0 1) (ci0 3 pf0 4). taduktam sAmAnyAnyeva BUyAMsi guRA - (tulyA) - vayavakarmaRAm. BinnapraDAnasAmAnya-.<BR>;p{0991}<BR>vyaktaM sAdfSyamizyate. (ci0 Ka0 3 pf0 2) iti. atra vipratipattiH sAdfSyaM ca saptapadArTAtiriktaM vA na vA iti. tatra sAdfSyaM saptapadArTAtiriktam iti mImAMsakAdaya AhuH. tat tadatiriktaH padArTo na Bavati iti nEyAyikAH prAhuH (ci0 Ka0 3). tatra mImAMsakamate sAdfSyasyAtiriktatve pramARaM ca sAdfSyaM na zaqBAvezvantarBavati. vyatirekitve sati sAmAnyetaravfttitve ca sati sAmAnyavfttitvAt aBAvavat iti. sAdfSyamaBAvepi nAntarBavati BAvatvena pratIyamAnattrAt ityanumAnam. tena sAdfSyaM kfptasaptapadArTAtiriktaM sidDyati iti. atra padaprayojanam. sAmAnyatve vyaBicAravAraRAya sAmAnyetaravfttitva iti padam. prameyatve vyaBicAravAraRAya vyatirekitva iti padam. BAvatve ca dravyAdizawvAnyatamatvarUpe hetumati sADyasya sattvAnna vyaBicAraH iti. sAdfSyasya sAmAnyavfttitve pramARaM tu yaTA gotvaM nityam taTASvatvamapi nityam iti sAdfSyapratItiH. taTA ca sAdfSyasya dravyAdyantarBUtatve bADakamapi yadi sAdfSyaM dravyAdAvantarBUtaM tadA dravyAdeH sAmAnyAvfttitvena yaTA gotvaM nityam taTASvatvam ityabADitapratItirna syAt (di0 1 pf0 24) iti. navyA api sAdfSyamatiriktameva. na ca atiriktatve padArTaviBAgavyAGAtaH iti vAcyam. tasya padArTaviBAgasya sAkzAtparaMparayA vA tattvajYAnopayogipadArTamAtra nirUpaRaparatvAt. evam aDikaraRatvam vizayatvam pratiyogitvam ityAdikamapyatiriktaH padArTaH ityAhuH (di0 1 pf0 2428). [Ka] tadBinnatve sati tadgataBUyoDarmavattvam. tacca svarUpasaMbanDa viSezaH (ta0 va0). taTA ca sAdfSyaM nAtiriktamiti BAvaH. tadBinnatve satItyasyArTastu tadgataBUyoDarmasadfSaDarmavattvam. tena candravanmuKam ityAdO AhlAdajanakatvarUpasAdfSyaGawakajanakatAyA janakaBedena BinnatayA candragatAhlAdajanakatvasya candramAtravfttitayA muKe tadaBAvepi na kzatiH. atra candravanmuKam ityAdO Darme DarmasAdfSyaM ca janakatAtvAdinA vijYeyam. sa ca Darmonugata eva iti. avaSizwaM tu tulyatvaSabdArTe saMpAditaM tatra drazwavyam. aTa vA tatra sADAraRyena vidyamAnA ye BUyAMso DarmAH tadvattvam iti. atra sAdfSyanirUpake tivyAptivAraRAya<BR>;p{0992}<BR>tadBinnatve sati iti viSezaRaM dattam. anuyogitAsaMbanDavivakzaRe tadviSezaRaM na deyameva (di0 1 pf0 27) iti. atrAyaM BAvaH. anuyogitAsaMbanDena tadgataBUyoDarmavattvam ityeva tatsAdfSyam. tadgataDarmarUpasaMbanDe tadanuyogikatvAnaByupagamenEva sAdfSyapratiyoginyativyAptivAraRasaMBavAt tadBinnatve sati iti viSezaRamanarTakameva (rAma 0 1 pf0 27) iti. atredaM boDyam. sAdfSyavAcakAstu ivAdinipAtAH sadfSAdinAmAni ca santi. tatra ivAdiBirnipAtEH sAdfSyasyABiDAne pratiyogyanuyogivAcakapadayoH samAnaviBaktikatvamapekzitam. yaTA gOriva gavayaH candramiva muKaM paSyati ityAdi. tulyasAdfSyAKyasaMbanDe cEkasya pratiyogitA anyasyAnuyogitA. tatra pratiyogina upamAnatvam anuyogina upameyatvam iti. upamAnopameyaBAvasya dvayoH saMBavepi prasidDasyEvopamAnatA. tannirRayAdikaM tu kavikalpalatAyAM dfSyam. sadfSAdinAmnA tulopanAtiriktena sAdfSyasyABiDAne tu pratiyogipade tftIyA zazWI ca syAt. yaTA pitrA piturvA sadfSaH putraH iti. tulopamAByAM yoge tu zazWI Seze iti sUtreRa zazWyeva syAt. yaTA tulA devadattasya nAsti upamA kfzRasya nAsti iti. pitrA piturvetyatra zazWIvikalpaviDAyakaM sUtraM tu tulyArTEratulopamAByAM tftIyAnyatarasyAm (pARi0 2. 3. 72) iti. sADAraRAsADAraRavirudDaDarmaBedena sAdfSyaM triviDam (la0 ma0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0990" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साधकम्
sADakam — 1 (hetuH) sADyajYApakam. yaTA parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO parvate vahneH sADako DUmaH. 2 sADanakartA. yaTA sADakatamaM karaRam (pARi0 1. 4. 42) ityAdO kArakaviSezaH. 3 sidDikArakaH. yaTA mantrAdisidDikArakaH SizwaH (ta). 4 jyotiHSAstrajYAstu janmatArAvaDikAni pazWapaYcadaSacaturviMSanakzatrARi ityAhuH. atroktam janmasaMpadvipatkzemaM pratyariH sADako vaDaH. mitraM paramamitra ca janmakzaguRayetriDA.. (jyo0 ta0) iti..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0992" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

