साधर्म्यम्
sADarmyam — [ka] samAnaDarmaH. yaTA kamalamiva sundaraM muKam ityAdO sOndaryaM muKakamalayoH sADarmyam. yaTA vA zaRRAM padArTAnAM sADarmyavEDarmyatattvajYAnaM niHSreyasahetuH (praSasta 0) ityAdO sADarmyaSabdArTaH (nyA0 kanda0 pf0 6). [Ka] anugato DarmaH (vE0 u0 1. 1. 4). samAno DarmaH iti PalitArTaH (mu0 1 pf0 45. yaTA astitvam jYeyatvam prameyatvam aBiDeyatvaM ca dravyAdInAM saptAnAM padArTAnAM sADarmyaM Bavati. atra jYeyatvABiDeyatvAdiSabdAnAmISvarIyajYAnavizayatvABiDAvizayatvAdirUporTaH kevalAnvayitvopapattyarTaM svIkartavyaH. Bavati ca tadeva saptapadArTAnAM lakzaRama (mu0 1 pf0 45). vastutaH vizayatvameva saptapadArTAnAM lakzaRam. tena ISvarAnaNgIkartfmatepi jIvajYAnavizayatAdikamAdAya lakzaRasamanvayaH ityavaDeyam. yaTA vA kAraRatvaM<BR>;p{0995}<BR>pArimARqalyaBinnAnAM padArTAnAM sADarmyaM Bavati. kAryatvAnityatve kAraRavatAmeva sADarmye BavataH. ASritatvaM nityadravyaBinnAnAM padArTAnAM sADamyaM Bavati. atra ASritatvaM ca sarvADAratAniyAmakasaMbanDAnyasaMbanDena vfttimattvam. tena kAle nAtivyAptiH (la0va0). nirguRatvaM kriyASUnyatvaM ca guRAdipaNkasya. nirguRatvamityasya guRavadavfttiDarmavattvam ityarTaH. atredamaDikaM boDyam. guRAdizawkasya saMKyAM vinApi DIviSezavizayatvamAdAyEkatvAdipratItestadvyavahArasya copapattiH kartavyA iti (ta0 va0). guRADikaraRAvfttiguRAvfttiDarmavattvaM karmapraBftInAM paYcAnAm. sAmAnyaSUnyatvaM sAmAnyAdInAM caturRAm. tadarTaSca samavAyasaMbanDAvacCinnapratiyogitAkajAtisAmAnyABAvavattvam. sattvASrayAvfttijAtyavfttiDarmavattvaM viSezAditrayARAm. pratiyogitvAnuyogitvAnyatarasaMbanDAvacCinnasamavAya nizWAvacCedakatAkaBedavattvaM samavAyABAvayoH. BAvatvaM dravyAdizawkasya. atra BAvatvaM ca samavAya sAmAnADikaraRya etadanyatarasaMbanDena sattAvattvam (di0 111 aBAvani0 pf0 41) (la0va0). anekatve sati BAvatvam samavAyitvaM ca dravyAdipaYcakasya. anekatve satItyasya anekaBAvavfttipadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam iti PalitorTaH (mu0 1 pf0 46). samavAyitvamityasyArTaSca samavAyasaMbanDena saMbanDitvam. tena sAmAnyAdO nAvyAptiH (mu0 1 pf0 46). aTa vA samavetavfttipadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (la0 va0 pf0 3). samavetasamavetatvaM dravyAdicatuzwayasya. tacca samavetasamavetavfttipadArTaviBAjakopADimattvam (la0 va0) (di0 gu0 1 pf0 46). samavAyena sattAvattvam kAraRatvaM ca dravyAditrayasya. atra BAzyam. dravyAdInAM trayARAmapi sattAsaMbanDaH sAmAnyaviSezavattvam svasamavAyaH arTaSabdABiDeyatvam DarmADarmakartftvaM ca (praSasta 0 pf0 3) iti. nityAnityoBayavfttisattABinnajAtimattvam karmAvfttijAtimattvaM vA dravyaguRayoH. asamavAyikAraRatvaM guRakarmaRoH. samavAyikAraRatvaM dravyasya. tatra dravyatvam guRavattvaM ca pfTivyAdInAM navAnAM<BR>;p{0996}<BR>dravyARAm. guRASrayavfttisattABinnajAtimattvam ityarTaH (la0va0) (ta0 dI 0 1 pf0 5). guRasamAnADikaraRamanovfttiDarmavattvaM[^1] kzityA-AtmamanaH saMyogASrayAvftti dravyaviBAjakaDarmavattvaM kzityAdisaptAnAm. jagadADAratvaBUtatvAnyataravattvaM kzityAdInAM zaRRAm. pfTivyAdInAM paYcAnAM BUtatvam indriyaprakftitvaM ca. pfTivyAdicaturRAM dravyAramBakatvam sparSavattvaM ca. dravyAramBakatvaM ca dravyasamavAyikAraRavfttidravyatvavyApyajAtimattvam. tena na dravyAnAramBakaGawAdAvavyAptiH (mu0 1 pf0 59). rUpavattvam dravatvavattvam pratyakzavizayatvaM ca pfTivyAditrayasya. gurutvavattvam rasavattvaM ca pfTivIjalayoH. nEmittikadravatvavattvaM pfTivItejasoH. ganDASrayAvfttidravyaviBAjakaDarmavattvaM jalAdyazwadravyARAm. rasAsamAnADikaraRadravyaviBAjakaDarmavattvaM tejaHpraBftisaptadravyARAm. rUpAsamAnADikaraRadravya viBAjakaDarmavattvaM vAyvAdInAM zaRRAm. sparSavadavfttidravyaviBAjakaDarmavattvamAkASAdInAM paYcAnAm. BUtAvfttidravya viBAjakaDarmavattvaM kAlAdInAM caturRAm. kAlopADyasamAnADikaraRaSabdavadavfttidravyaviBAjakopADimattvaM digAtmamanasAm. svasamavAyikAraRatvasvakaraRendriyatvAnyatarasaMbanDena suKapratyakzavattvamAtmamanasoH. pfTivyudakajvalanapavanajIvAtmamanasAmanekatvAparajAtimattve. AkASakAladigAtmanAM sarvagatatvam (viButvam) paramamahattvam sarvasaMyogisamAnadeSatvaM ca. pfTivyudakajIvAtmanAM caturdaSaguRavattvam. dikkAlayoH paYcaguRavattvam. sarvotpattimatAM nimittakAraRatvam. viSezaguRavattvaM BUtAnAm AtmanAM ca. paratvam aparatvam mUrtatvam karmavattvam vegavattvaM ca pfTivyAdicatuzwayasya manasaSca. avyApyavfttiviSezaguRavattvam kzaRikaviSezaguRavattvaM ca AkASajIvaparamAtmanAm sADarmyaM Bavati (praSasta 0 1. 1 pf0 2) (BA0 pa0) (mu0 1) (si0 ca0) iti. kzaRikaviSezaguRavattvaM ca catuHkzaRavfttijanyAvfttijAtimadviSezaguRavattvam (mu0 1 pf0 61). taTA hi. catuHkzaRavfttIni yAni janyAni GawA-<BR>;p{0997}<BR>dIni tadavfttiryA jAtiH jYAnatvAdiH tadvAn viSezaguRaH jYAnAdiH tadvattvasyAtmAdO sattvAllakzaRasamanvayaH (di0 11 pf0 61). atredaM boDyam. yadyAkASajIvAtmanoreva sADarmyamucyate tadAsminparizkAre janya iti padaM na deyam. dvezatvAdikaM DarmamAdAya tatra lakzaRasamanvayaH kartavyaH (mu0 1. 1 pf0 61). evamanyezAmapi tattatsADamyaM svayamUhyam. (kira0 111 pf0 39). taTA hi. rUpAdInAM guRAnAM sarvezAM guRatvABisaMbanDaH guRAdInAM dravyASritatvam samavAyikAraRatvAnASrayatvaM ca sADarmyam ityAdi (praSasta0 pf0 11).<BR>avfttIti padacCedaH..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0994" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

