sADarmyasamaH — (jAtiH) [ka] sADarmyeRopasaMhAre tadDarmaviparyayopapatteH sADarmyasamaH (gO0 5. 1. 2). tadarTaSca upasaMhAre sADyasyopasaMharaRe vAdinA kfte tadDarmasya sADyarUpaDarmasya yo viparyayo vyatirekaH tasya sADarmyeRa kevalena vyAtyanapekzeRa yadupapAdanam tato hetoH sADarmyasama ucyate (gO0 vf0 5. 112) iti. sADarmyamAtraM gamakatOpayikam ityaBimAnAt satpratipakzadeSanABAsoyam. vArtikakftastu ayamanEkAntikadeSanABAsaH ityaNgIcakruH (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 2). atra BAzyam. sADarmyeRopasaMhAre sADyaDarmaviparyayopapatteH sADarmyeREva pratyavasTAnamaviSizyamARaM sTApanAhetutaH sADarmyasamaH pratizeDaH. nidarSanam kriyAvAnAtmA. dravyasya kriyAhetuguRayogAt. dravyaM lozwaH kriyAhetuguRayuktaH kriyAvAn. taTA cAtmA. tasmAtkriyAvAn iti. evamupasaMhfte paraH sADarmyeREva pratyavatizWate. nizkriya AtmA. viBuno dravyasya nizkriyatvAt. viBu cAkASaM nizkriyaM ca. taTA cAtmA. tasmAnnizkriyaH iti. na cAsti viSezahetuH kriyAvatsADarmyAt kriyAvatA Bavitavyam na punarakriyasADarmyAnnizkriyeRa iti. viSezahetvaBAvAt sADarmyasamaH pratizeDo Bavati (vAtsyA0 5. 1. 2). [Ka] vAdinAnvayena vyatirekeRa vA sADye sADite prativAdinaH sADarmyamAtrapravfttahetunA tadaBAvApAdanam. yaTA SabdaH anityaH kftakatvAdGawavat vyatirekeRa vA vyomavat ityupasaMhfte nEtadevam yadyanityaGawasADarmyAnnityAkASavEDarmyAdvA anityaH syAt<BR>;p{0998}<BR>nityAkASasADarmyAdamUrtatvAnnityaH syAt. viSezo vA vaktavyaH (gO0 vf0 5. 1. 2) iti. [ga] sADarmyeRa sTApanAhetudUzakamuttaram. yaTA AtmA sakriyaH kriyA hetuguRavattvAllozwavat iti sTApanAyAmuttaram. yadi sakriyasADarmyAtsakriyastadA viButvarUpAnnizkriyasADarmyAnnizkriya eva kiM na syAt. na cAtra kiMcidvinigamakamasti iti. kriyA hetuguRaScAtra kriyAjanakavAyusaMyogAdireva iti boDyam (nIla0 1 pf0 43).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0997" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

