साधारणत्वम्
sADAraRatvam — (hetvABAsaH hetudozaH) [ka] pakzAditrayavfttitvam.. atra pakzAditrayaM ca pakzaH sapakzaH vipakzaSca. tezu vartamAnatvam iti viSizwasyArTaH. yaTA parvato vahnimAn prameyatvAt ityAdO prameyatvasya sADAraRatvam. atra prameyatvAtmaka hetoH pakze parvate sapakze mahAnase vipakze mahAhadAdO ca vartamAnatvAtsADAraRatvam iti boDyam. [Ka] vipakzavfttitvam (ci0 2 savya0 pf0 87). atra vipakzaH sADyABAvavAn iti navyamatam. vipakzaH niScitasADyABAvavAn iti prAcInamatam iti vijYeyam (dIDi0 2 savya0 pf0 193). [ga] sADyAtyantABAvavadgAmitvam<BR>;p{1000}<BR>(ci0 bADa0) (nyA0 bo0). [Ga] sADyavadanyavfttitvam ityAdi. yaTA DUmavAnvahneH ityatra DUmavadanyasmin taptAyaHpiRqe vahneH sattvAdvahneH sADAraRatvam (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 20). etallakzaRadvayena pradarSitaM sADAraRatvaMH pUrvapakzIyam. tacca vyaBicAra iti vyavahniyate (dIDi0 2 bADa0 pf0 224). [Na] sADyAsamAnADikaraRasvasamAnADikaraRatvam. yaTA DUmavAnvahneH ityatra vahneH sADAraRatvam. Bavati hi DUmAsamAnADikaraRaM yat DUmavadanyatvam tatsamAnADikaraRo vahniH (nyA0 ma0 2 0 20) iti. sADyatAvacCedake hetusamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvapratiyogitAvacCedakatvam (ga0 sAmA0) (nIla0) iti tattAtparyam. yaTA parvato vahnimAnprameyatvAt ityAdO prameyatvasya sADAraRatvam. idaM ca sidDAntasidDaM sADAraRatvam iti boDyam. aBiDeyatvaM prameyatvasyaM vyaBicAri ityAkAraka BramAtmakavyaBicAragrahasya vyApakasAmAnADikaraRyagrahaviroDitayA tadviroDitvAnyaTAnupapattyedaM lakzataM svIkAryam. tena tatra prameyatvABAvAprasidDyA pUrvapakzIyavyaBicAragrahAsaMBavepi na kzatiH (ga0 2 sAmA0 la0 1 pf0 5-6).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=0999" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

