sAma — 1 vedaviSezaH. gItirUpA mantrAH sAmAni (jE0 nyA0 a0 2 pA0 1 aDi0 12). yaTA agna AyAhi vItaye ityAdiH. 2 sAmavedoktAmfcamaDikftya geyo gAnaviSezaH. yaTA ama AyAhi<BR>;p{1006}<BR>vItaye gfRAno havyadAtaye. ni hotA satsi barhizi ityasyA fco gAnaM ca ognA i AyAhI 3 vIitoyA 2 i toyA 2 i gfRAno havyadAto 2 i toyA 2 i nA ihotAsA 23 tsA 2 i vA 234 OhovA hI 234 pI iti (Canda ArcikaH 1. 1. 1. 1). atra pramARam fcyaDyUQaH sAma gIyate (CAndo0 u0 1. 6. 1). tasmAtisfBiH stuvanti tisfBirudrAyanti tisfBirhi sAma saMmitam (Etare0 brA0 3. 23). ityAdi. 3 nItiSAstrajYAstu rAjYa upAyaviSeza ityAhuH. idaM sAma dviviDam taTyam ataTyaM ca. tatra taTyena sAnA sADujanaH sADyaH. ataTyaM tu sAmAsADuzu prayoktavyam (matsyapu0 a0 221) iti. aDikaM tu SukranItipariSizwAdO vijYeyam. 4 SatruvaSIkaraRopAyaH iti mAtrikA AhuH. 5 paSubanDanarajjuH. 6 priyavAkyAdinA sAntvanaM ca iti kAvyajYA AhuH (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामग्री
sAmagrI — kAryA yogavyavacCinnaH kAraRasamudAyaH. yaTA pratyakzasya sAmagrI indriyasaMnikarzAdiH. anumiteH sAmagrI vyAptijYAnaparAmarSAdiH. yaTA vA GawAdikAryasya sAmagrI kulAladaRqacakrAdiH. pawAdikAryasya ca kuvindatantuturIya saMyogAdiH. atredaM vijYeyam. samAne vizaye pratyakzAnumitisAmagryormaDye pratyakzasAmagrI pravalA. Binnavizaye tu anumitisAmagrI prabalA. samAnavizaye pratyakza SAbdasAmagryormaDye pratyakzasAmagrI prabalA. Binnavizaye tu SAbdasAmagrI prabalA. samAnavizaye anumitiSAbdasAmagryormaDye SAbdasAmagrI prabalA. Binnavizaye tu anumitisAmagrI prabalA. mAnasalOkikapratyakzasAmagryormaDye lOkikapratyakza sAmagrI prabalA. mAnasasAmagrI tu sarvApekzayA durbalA. paraM tu yadA PalavizayiRIcCAsti tadA tatratyA durbalApi sAmagrI prabalA Bavati iti vijYeyam (ta0 pra0 4). samAne vizaye pratyakzAnumitisAmagryormaDye pratyakzasamagrI prabalA yaTA yatra parvatAdO vahnayAdipratyakzajanikAyAScakzuH saMnikarzAdiGawita sAmagryAH tatrEva vahnayanumitijanikAyAH parAmarSAdiGawitasAmagryASca yugapatsattve prabalena durbalasya bADaH iti nyAyena pUrvoktapratyakzasAmagryA<BR>;p{1007}<BR>parvatAdO vahnipratyakzamevotpadyate na tvanumitiH ityanuBavasidDaH sidDAntaH. Binne vizaye tu pratyakzAnumitisAmagryormaDyenumitisAmagrI prabalA yaTA BUtalAdO GawAdipratyakzajanikAyAH GawacakzuHsaMyogAdirUpAyAH parvatAdO tu vahnayAdyanumitijanikAyA vyAptijYAnAdiGawitAyASca sAmagryA yugapatsattvenumitisAmagryAH prAbalyena tayA parvatAdO vahnayAdyanumitirevotpadyate na tu GawavadBUtalAdipratyakzam iti. evamagrepyUhyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1006" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामयिकः
sAmayikaH — samayaH kAlaH niyamo vA. tatra BavaH ucito vA (Wan) sAmayikaH. taTA ca nijaDarmAviroDena yastu sAmayiko Bavet iti smftyA niyamabadDaH ityarTaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1007" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामयिकाभावः
sAmayikABAvaH — atyantABAvaH (ta0 dI0 4). tadarTaSca sAmayikaH samayaviSeze pratiyogivirahasamaye pratIyamAnaH aBAvotyantABAvaH sAmayikABAvaH (nIla0 pf0 41) iti. kecittu utpAdavinASaSAlI atyantABAvAdatiriktoyamaBAvaH ityAhuH (vE0 vi0 9. 1. 5). atredamAkUtam. yatra BUtale pUrvaM GawAdikaM sTitamaTApasAritaM tatrAyaM caturTaH saMsargABAvaH pratIyate nAtyantABAvaH (vE0 vi0 9. 1. 5) iti. ayamaBiprAyaH. sAmayikABAvasyAtyantABAvasvarUpatvANgIkAretyantABAvasya nityatvena BUtalAdO Gawasattvepi tadapasAraRadaSAyAmiva tadatyantABAvabudDyApattiH. taTAviDAtyantABAvasyApratIyamAnatvAttu tadtiriktoyamaBAvoNgIkAryaH. BUtalAdO GawasattvadaSAyAM na tadaBAvavattAbudDiH. anyadA tu jAyate. ataH sAmayikABAvotirikta evANgIkartavyaH (nIla0 pf0 41) iti. tanna sahante nEyAyikAH. taTA hi. yatra tu BUtalAdO GawAdikamapasAritaM punarAnItaM ca tatra GawAnayanAnantaramapi atyantABAvasya nityatvepi ca GawakAlasya saMbanDAGawakatvAt saMbanDABAvAt GawakAle na GawAtyantABAvabudDiH (di0 1 pf0 43). taTA ca kAlaviSezaviSizwasvarUpasya saMsargatvopagamAdeva Gawavati Gawo nAsti iti pratItyaBAvopapattO caturTasaMsargABAve mAnABAvaH (di0 1 pf0 43) iti. GawAdyanaDikaraRakAlAvacCinnaBUtalAdereva<BR>;p{1008}<BR>GawABAvAdeH saMsargatayA GawakAle ca tacCUnyakAlaviSizwaBUtalAdirUpasaMsargasyABAvena tadA na tadatyantABAvabudDiH (nIla0) iti. GawABAvavati GawAnayanetyantABAvasyAnyatra gamanABAvepyapratIteH GawApasaraRe sati tu pratIteSca BUtale GawasaMyogaprAgaBAvaDvaMsayorGawABAvapratIterniyAmakatvaM kalpyate. Gawavati tatsaMyogaprAgaBAvaDvaMsayorasattvAdatyantABAvasyApratItiH GawApasaraRe ca saMyogaDvaMsasattvAt pratItiH (ta0 dI0 pf0 41) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1007" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामर्थ्यम्
sAmarTyam — 1 yatkiMcitkAryajananayogyatvam (dIDi0 2 pf0 209). tacca yaTA sADyaviroDyupasTApanasamarTasamAnabalopasTityA pratirudDa kAryakaliNgatvam (ci0 2 pf0 94) ityAdO granTe samarTaSabdArTaGawakam viroDiparAmarSasya viroDyanumitijananayogyatvarUpaM sAmarTyam. 2 kvacit AkANkzAyogyatAdimattvam (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 52). yaTA AptopadeSasAmarTyAt 0 (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 52) iti. 3 samAsAGawakapadanirAkANkzatve sati parasparasamAsaGawakapada sAkANkzatvam (kfzRaM0). yaTA rAjapuruzaH ityAdO rAjapadapuruzapadayoH sAmarTyam. etacca sAmarTya dviviDam vyapekzArUpam ekArTIBAvaSceti. ayaM ca SAbdikaviBAgaH iti boDyam. tatra vyapekzA ca svArTaparyavasAyinAM padAnAmAkANkzAdivaSAtparasparaM saMbanDavattve satyekopasTityajanakatvam iti. ekArTIBAvaSca viSezaRaviSezyaBAvAvagAhyekopasTitijanakatvam iti. SizwaM tu samAsaSabda vyAKyAne dfSyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1008" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामानाधिकरण्यम्
sAmAnADikaraRyam — 1 [ka] tadaDikaraRavfttitvam. yaTA vahniDUmayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam. idaM sAmAnADikaraRyaM dviviDam dESikam kAlikaM ceti. tatra dESikaM sAmAnADikaraRyaM yaTA vahniDUmayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam. kAlikaM sAmAnADikaraRyaM yaTA ekakAlAvacCedena vartamAnayoH viBinnadeSADikaraRakayorapi GawapawayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam iti vijYeyama. atredaM prasaNgato vijYeyam. anumiteH sAmAnADikaraRyamAtrAvagAhitvaM ca pakzatAvacCedakAvacCinnoddeSyatAnirUpita SudDasADyatAvacCedakasaMvanDAvacCinna<BR>;p{1009}<BR>sADyatAvacCedakAvacCinna viDeyatAkatvam. yaTA parvato vahnimAn ityAkArakAnumiteH vahniparvatatvayoH sAmAnADikaraRyamAtravivakzAyAm tayoravacCedyAvacCedakaBAvAvivakzAyAm sAmAnADikaraRyamAtrAvagAhitvam. prAYcastu pakzatAvacCedakAkrAntayatkiMcidvyaktivizayakatvaM sAmAnADikaraRyamAtrAvagAhitvam ityAhuH (ga0 2 pakza0 pf0 20). [Ka] tadvadanuyogikapratiyogitvam. pratiyogitAsaMbanDena tadvadanuyogikavattvam ityarTaH (ga0 2 vyApti0 sidDA0). yaTA dravyatvapfTivItvayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam. taTA hi dravyatvavAn GawaH. tadanuyogikaH Gawe pfTivItvasya samavAyAKyaH saMbanDaH. tatpratiyogitvaM pfTivItvesti iti. [ga] svAvacCedakIBUto yaH kAlastadavacCinnA yA svaviSizwanirUpitA yatkiMcidvyaktinizWADeyatA sA. yaTA yadA sizADayizA nAsIt sidDiScAsIttadA sidDisizADayizAvirahayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam. idaM ca ekakzaRAvacCinna sAmAnADikaraRyam ityucyate. 2 [ka] aBedAnvayaboDakatvam. yaTA nIlo GawaH ityAdO nIlapadaGawapadayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam. [Ka] SAbdikAstu padayorekABiDAyitvam [ga] samAnaviBaktikatvaM vA. yaTA nIlo GawaH ityAdO nIlapadaGawapadayoH sAmAnADikaraRyam ityAhuH (vE0 sA0 da0). [Ga] prakAradvaya viSizwEkavastuvoDakatvam. prakAradvayaviSizwEkavastuparatvAtsAmAnADikaraRyasya (sarva0 saM0 pf0 101 rAmAnu0). (sAmAnyam - 1 (padArTaH) [ka] yA samAnAM budDiM prasUte BinnezvaDikaraRezu yayA bahUnItaretarato na vyAvartante yorTonekatra pratyayAnuvfttinimittam tatsAmAnyam (vAtsyA0 2. 2. 68) (praSasta 0 1 pf0 2) (ta0 BA0). atra vyutpattiH samAnAnAM BAvonAgantuko nityo DarmaH sAmAnyam (pa0 mA0) iti. tacca dravyaguRakarmavftti nityaM ceti boDyam. [Ka] nityatve sati svASrayAnyonyABAvasamAnADikaraRam. [ga] nityatve satyanekasamavetam. [Ga] sAmAnyaM nityamekaM syAdanekasamavAyi ca (tA0 ra0 Slo0 53) iti. [Na] anugato DarmaH. 127<BR>;p{1010}<BR>[ca] sAmAnyaM tu praDvaMsapratiyogitvarahitamanekasamavetam (sarva0 saM0 pf0 216 O0). sAmAnyaM dviviDam param aparaM ceti. atra sUtram sAmAnyaM viSeza iti budDyapekzam (vE0 1. 2. 3) iti. tadarTaSca sAmAnyaM parasAmAnyam viSezoparasAmAnyam iti dvayaM budDyapekzam. budDirapekzA lakzaRaM yasya tat. taTA ca sAmAnyaM dviviDam param aparaM ca. tatra parasAmAnyaM sattA. dravyatvAdikamaparasAmAnyam. tatra sAmAnyaviSezayoH parAparayorlakzaRaM budDireva. anuvfttatvabudDiH sAmAnyasya vyAvfttatvabudDirviSezasya lakzaRam. anuvfttatvamaDikadeSavfttitvam. vyAvfttatvamalpa deSavfttitvam (vE0 vi0 112. 3 pf0 5152). taTA ca BAzyam dviviDaM sAmAnyaM param aparaM ca. svavizaya sarvagatam aBedAtmakam anekavftti ekadvibahuzvAtmasvarUpAnuvfttipratyayakAraRam. svarUpABedenADArezu prabanDena vartamAnam anuvfttibudDikAraRamityarTaH. kaTam. pratipiRqaM sAmAnyApekzaprabanDajYAnotpattAvaByAsapratyayajanitAtsaMskArAdatItajYAnaprabanDapratyayAvekzaRAdyatsamanugatamasti tatsAmAnyama iti. tatra sattA paraM sAmAnyamanuvfttipratyayakAraRameva. yaTA parasparaviSizwezu carmavastrakambalAdizvekasmAnnIlIdravyABisaMbanDAt nIlam nIlam iti pratyayAnuvfttiH taTA parasparaviSizwezu dravyaguRakarmasvaviSizwA sat sat iti pratyayAnuvfttiH. sA cArTAntarAdBavitumarhatIti yattadarTAntaraM sA sattA iti sidDA sattA. sattAsaMbanDAt sat iti pratyayAnuvfttiH. tasmAtsattA sAmAnyameva. aparaM dravyatvaguRatvakarmatvAdi. taccAnuvfttivyAvfttipratyayahetutvAt sAmAnyaM viSezaSca Bavati. tatra dravyatvaM parasparaviSizwezu pfTivyAdizvanuvfttipratyaya hetutvAt sAmAnyam guRakarmaByo vyAvfttipratyayahetutvAdviSezaH. taTA guRatvaM parasparaviSizwezu rUpAdizvanuvfttipratyaya hetutvAt sAmAnyam dravyakarmaByo vyAvfttipratyaya hetutvAdviSezaH. taTA karmatvaM parasparaviSizwezUtkzepaRAdizvanuvfttipratyayahetutvAt sAmAnyam dravyaguReByo vyAvfttihetutvAdviSezaH. evam pfTivItvarUpatvotkzepaRatvagotvapawatvAdInAM prARyaprARigatAnAmanuvfttivyAvfttipratyayahetutvAt sAmAnyaviSezaBAvaH sidDaH. tAni dravyatvAdIni praBUtavizayatvAt prADAnyenasattAyA<BR>;p{1011}<BR>sAmAnyAni svASrayaviSezakatvAdBaktyA viSezAKyAni iti lakzaRaBedAdezAM dravyaguRakarmaByaH padArTAntaratvaM ca sidDam (praSasta0 sAmAnyani 0 pf0 6364). tatra paraM sattA. mahAvizayatvAt. aparaM dravyatvaguRatvakarmatvAdi. alpavizayatvAt. tacca vyAvftterapi hetutvAt sAmAnyaM sat viSezAKyAmapi laBate (mu0 1) (ta0 saM0) iti boDyam. paratvaM cAtra vyApakatvam. tacca aDikadeSavfttitvam. tacca svasamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvApratiyogitvam (la0 va0 pf0 38). aTa vA svarUpataH sarvadeSasaMbadDatvam (vE0 u0 1. 2. 3). atredaM boDyam. dravyAditritayavfttitvenetarasAmAnyApekzayADikadeSavfttitvAt paratvaM jYeyam (ta0 kO0). sA cAnuvfttereva hetutvAtsAmAnyameva (praSasta 0 pf0 2). atredamaDikaM vijYeyam sattAguRatve ca sarvendriyagrAhye samavAyoBAvaSca (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 13 pf0 76) iti. navyAH punarimAM sattAM nANgIkurvanti. aparatvaM cAtra nyUnadeSavfttitvam. tacca svasamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvapratiyogitvam (la0va0). dravyatvAdInAM sattApekzayApadeSavfttitvAdaparatvaM boDyam. atra sUtram dravyatvaM guRatvaM karmatvaM ca sAmAnyAni viSezASca (vE0 1. 2. 5) iti. taTA ca dravyatvAdInAM sattApekzayAtpadeSavfttitvAdaparatvam pfTivItvAdyapekzayADikadeSavfttitvAtparatvam. evaM ca paratvamaparatvaM ca tezAM vijYeyam (mu0 1. 1). 2 yatkiMcidaDikaraRavfttipadArTamAtram. yaTA sAmAnyalakzaRaH saMnikarzaH ityAdO sAmAnyaSabdArTaH. atrArTe vyutpattiH samAnAnAM BAvaH sAmAnyam (mu0 1 pf0 129) iti. idaM sAmAnyaM dviviDam aKaRqam saKaRqaM ceti. tatra aKaRqam sAkzAtsaMbadDaM sAmAnyam jAtiH ityucyate. yaTA sattAdravyatvakarmatvAdi. saKaRqaM tu paraMparayA saMbadDaM sAmAnyam upADiH ityucyate. yaTA prameyatvajYeyatvAdi daRqitvakuRqalitvAdi ca. ayaM ca upADiH padArTamAtravfttiH (pra0 pra0) (dIDi0 2 pf0 81). idamatrAkUtam. pramAtvameva hi paraMparA saMbanDena (svASrayavizayatva saMbanDena) GawAdinizWaM prameyatvarUpam iti pramAtvAnnAtiriktaM prameyatvam. evam daRqatvameva paraMparAsaMbanDena (svASrayadaRqa saMyogasaMbanDena).<BR>;p{1012}<BR>puruzAdinizWaM daRqitvarUpam iti daRqitvAdi daRqatvAnnAtiriktam (ta0 kO0 pf0 20) iti. idaM sAmAnyaM kvacinnityaM DUmatvAdi kvaciccAnityaM GawAdi (mu0 1 pf0 129) iti. 3 sADAraRo vyApako vA DarmaH. yaTA dravyasAmAnyalakzaRam hetvABAsasAmAnyaniruktiH ityAdO sAmAnyaSabdArTaH. 4 sarvaSabdavadasyArTonusaMDeyaH. yaTA pratiyogitAsAmAnye yatsaMbanDAvacCinnatva yadDarmAvacCinnatva etaduBayABAvaH (dIDi0) (mu0 2 vyAptini0) ityAdO sAmAnyaSabdasyArTaH. taTA ca pratiyogitAsAmAnye ityasya sarvAsu pratiyogitAsu ityarTaH. 5 sAhityaSAstrajYAstu sAdfSyaprayojako DarmaH. yaTA muKaM padmamiva sundaram ityAdO sOndaryAdiH sADAraRaDarmaH sAmAnyam ityAhuH. 6 mImAMsakAca aDikavizayakam. yaTA brAhmaRAya daDi dIyatAm kORqinyAya takram ityAdO daDidAnamaDikabrAhmaRavizayakatvena sAmAnyam ityAhuH. atredamaDikaM vijYeyam. sAmAnyaSAstraM ca viSezaSAstreRa bADyate. yaTA mA hiMsyAtsarvA BUtAni iti hiMsAnizeDaH sarvavipayaH. vAyavya SvatamAlaBet ityAdi hiMsASAstraM viSezaH. tena sAmAnyaSAstraM vEDetaravizaya eva prasarati iti. atra bADyabADakaBAvastu samAna eva vizaye na tu Binne vizaye pravartate iti niyamo drazwavyaH. 7 7 AlaMkArikAstu alaMkAraviSeza ityAhuH. taduktam sAmAnyaM prakftasyAnyatAdAtmyaM sadfSErguREH (sA0 da0 pari0 10 lo0 90) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1008" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामान्यगुणत्वम्
sAmAnyaguRatvam — [ka] rUpasparSAnyatve sati dravyaviBAjakopADivyApyatAvacCedakasaMyogaviBAgavegadravatvAvfttijAtiSUnyaguRatvam (di0 gu0 pf0 193) (la0 va0). yaTA saMKyAdInAM guRAnAM sAmAnyaguRatvam. dravyaviBAjakatAvacCedakaM pfTivItvAdi. tadvyApyatAvacCedakaM ca ganDatvAdi. tacCUnyatvasya saMKyAdO sattvAlakzaRasamanvayaH. atratyapadaprayojanaM kaTyate. jalIyaSuklarUpe vAyoranuzRASItasparSe ca pfTivyAdiSuklarUpasparSavyAvfttajAtiviSeze mAnABAvAt SuklarUpAnuzRASItasparSayorativyAptivAraRAya satyantaM dulaM dattam. SabdaviSezajanakatAvacCedakajAtyavacCinna<BR>;p{1013}<BR>kaWinAvayavadvayaviBAge tejovegAtiSayetyantAgnisaMyoganASyatAvacCedakavEjAtyAvacCinnaGftAdivfttidravatve cAvyAptivAraRAya avftti ityantaM jAtiviSezaRam. karmAdAvativyAptivAraRAya viSezyadalaM dattam. pfTivItvAdivyApyatAvacCedakatattatsaMKyAtvAdiSUnyatvasya tattatsaMKyAyAmaBAvAdavyAptiH. tadvAraRAya jAtipadaM dattam (di0 gu0 pf0 193) iti. [Ka] yadrUpAvacCinnasamAnADikaraRaM yatkiMcidravya viBAjakopADidvayaM Bavati tadBinnA sTitisTApakavfttiBinnA ca yA jAtistAdfSajAtimadBinnaguRatvam (nIla0 gu0 pf0 39). taTA hi. yadrUpam saMKyAtvasaMyogatva viBAgatvAdi. tadavacCinnaH saMKyAsaMyogaviBAgAdiH. tatsamAnADikaraRaM yatkiMcid dravyaviBAjakopADidvayam pfTivItva jalatvAdi Bavati tadBinnA (saMKyAtvasaMyogatvAdiBinnA) yA jAtiH rUpatvAdiH jYAnatvAdiSca tadvadBinnaguRatvaM saMKyAdO vartate iti lakzaRasamanvayo boDyaH. sAmAnyaguRAScEkAdaSa saMKyA parimARam pfTaktvam saMyogaH viBAgaH paratvam aparatvam gurutvam nEmittikadravatvam vegaH sTitisTApakaSceti (mu0 gu0 pf0 192193). atra kezAMcinmate sTitisTApakasya pfTivyAdidravyacatuzwayavfttitvANgIkArAt tanmatABiprAyeRa sTitisTApakasya sAmAnyaguRezvantarBAvaH kftaH. tasya pfTivImAtravfttitvANgIkAre viSezaguRatvameva iti vijYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1012" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सामान्यच्छलम्
sAmAnyacCalam — (Calam) [ka] saMBavatorTasyAtisAmAnyayogAdasaMBUtArTakalpanA sAmAnyacCalam (gO0 sU0 112. 13). atra vyutpattiH sAmAnyanimittaM CalaM sAmAnyacCalam iti. yadvivakzitamarTamApnoti cAtyeti ca tadatisAmAnyam. yaTA brAhmaRatvaM vidyAcaraRasaMpadaM kvacidApnoti kacidatyeti. aho KalvasO brAhmaRo vidyAcaraRasaMpannaH ityukte kaScidAha. saMBavati hi brAhmaRe vidyAcaraRasaMpat iti. asya vacanasya viGAtorTa- . vikalpopapattyA asaMBUtArTakalpanayA kriyate yadi brAhmaRe vidyAcaraRasaMpatsaMBavati vrAtyepi saMBavet vrAtyopi brAhmaRaH sopyastu vidyAcaraRasaMpannaH (vAtsyA0 1. 2. 13) iti. [Ka] sAmAnyaviSizwasaMBavadarTABiprAyeRoktasyAtisAmAnyayogAdasaMBavadarTakatvakalpanayA<BR>;p{1014}<BR>dUzaRABiDAnam. yaTA brAhmaRoyaM vidyAcaraRasaMpannaH ityukte brAhmaRatvena vidyAcaraRasaMpadaM sADayati iti kalpayitvA paro vadati kuto brAhmaRatvena vidyAcaraRasaMpat bAlye vyaBicArAt (gO0 vf0 1. 2. 13) iti. taduktam sAmAnyacCalametatsyAdatisAmAnyayogataH. tAtparyavEparItyena kalpitArTasya bADanam.. (tA0 0 1 0 96) iti. atra sAmAnyaviSizwaH saMBavadarTaSca etadbrAhmaRaH. atisAmAnyaM tu brAhmaRatvasAmAnyam iti jYeyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1013" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

