सामान्यलक्षणः
sAmAnyalakzaRaH — (alOkikaH saMnikarzaH) alOkikapratyakzaviSeze kAraRaM saMnikarzaviSezaH. sa ca 1 [ka] indriyasaMbadDaviSezyakajYAnaprakArIBUtaM sAmAnyam. yaTA GawatvaDUmatvAdi. atrArTe sAmAnyaM lakzaRaM svarUpaM yasya iti vyutpattyA sAmAnyameva pratyAsattiH (dIDi0 2 pf0 80) (mu0 1 pf0 127). atredaM vijYeyam. sAmAnyaM jYAyamAnameva svASrayARAM saMnikarzaH. jYAyamAnaGawatvasaMnikarzeRa GawAH ityAkArakaM sakalaGawAnAM pratyakzaM janyate (ta0 kO0) iti. taTA yatrendriyasaMyukto DUmAdiH tadviSezyakaM DUmaH iti jYAnaM jAtam. tatra jYAne DUmatvaM prakAraH. tatra DUmatvena saMnikarzeRa DUmavizayakaM jYAnaM jAyate (mu0 1 pf0. DUmAH ityevaMrUpaM sakala127) (dIDi0 2<BR>;p{1015}<BR>pf0 81) iti. ayaM saMnikarzaSca atItAnAgatAnAmindriyAsaMnikfzwAnAM sAmAnyASrayARAM sarvezAM vyaktInAmalOkikaM pratyakzaM janayati iti boDyam. sAmAnyalakzaRAyAH pratyAsattyAH sAmAnyaprakArakajYAnajanakatvaniyamAt (dIDi0 2). mImAMsakA mAyAvAdivedAntinaSca sAmAnyalakzaRaM saMnikarzaM nANgIcakruH (ma0pra0 4 pf0 39). tatra sahante nEyAyikAH. yadi sAmAnyalakzaRA pratyAsattirnAsti tadA anukUlatarkAdikaM vinA DUmAdO vyaBicArasaMSayo na syAt. prasidDaDUme vahnisaMbanDAvagamAt kAlAntarIyadeSAntarIyaDUmasya mAnABAvenAjYAnAt. sAmAnyena tu sakalaDUmopasTitO DUmAntare viSezAdarSanena saMSayo yujyate (ci0 2 pf0 1819). ataH sAmAnyalakzaRAvaSyakI iti. atra sAmAnyaM ca saKaRqAKaRqaBedena dveDA. saKaRqe cAKaRqameva paraMparayA saMbadDaM pratyAsattiH. yena saMbanDena cendriyasaMbadDe sAmAnyaM jYAyate tena saMvanDenADikaraRAnAM pratyAsattiH (dIDi0 2 pf0 81). atra indriyasaMbadDa ityuktyA indriyasaMbanDasya saMyogAderindriyapratiyogikatvAt tadGawitasyendriyasaMyuktaviSezyakajYAnaprakArIBUtaDUmatvAdeH pratyAsattitvaM janyatvaGawitavyApAratvaM ca nirvahati iti vijYeyam (di0 1 pf0 127). atra bahirindriyasya saMbanDaSca lOkiko grAhyaH. tena etAdfSasaMbanDaGawitaM sAmAnyaM bahirindriyapratyakzasTale hyupayujyate (mu01 pf0 129) (si0 ca0). jYAnasya tadindriyajanyatvaM ca niyAmakam. evaM ca aRutvena yatkicidaRUpasTitAvapi sakalARugocaro mAnaso boDaH iti vadanti. dIDitikftA tu svamate sAmAnyalakzaRAyAH pratyAsattitvaM nirAkftam iti vijYeyam. [Ka] jYAnaprakArIBUtaM sAmAnyam. yaTA GawatvaparamARutvAdi. atra aRutvena yatkiMcidaRUpasTitAvapi sakalARugocaro mAnaso boDo Bavati iti BAvaH. idaM mAnasapratyakzasTale hyupayujyate (mu0) (si0 ca0). 2 sAmAnyavizayakaM jYAnam.. yaTA GawatvajYAnam (mu0 1 pf0 130) (si0 ca0). taTA hi ayaM GawaH iti GawatvavizayalOkikapratyakzeRa sarve GawAH iti sakalaGawavizayakAlOkikapratyakzaM jAyate (si0 ca0) iti. sAmAnya vizayakaM<BR>;p{1016}<BR>jYAnamityasyArTaSca indriyasaMbadDaviSezyakaM sAmAnyaprakArakaM jYAnam iti. atrArTe vyutpattiH sAmAnyaM lakzaRaM nirUpakaM vizayaH yasya tat (mu0 1 pf0 130) (dIDi0 2 pf0 80) iti. idAnIM sAmAnyalakzaRajYAnalakzaRayoH saMnikarzayorBeda ucyate. tatra sAmAnyalakzaRasaMnikarzaH sAmAnyASraya sakalavyaktivizayakaM jYAnaM janayati. jYAnalakzaRasaMnikarzastu yasya sAmAnyasya jYAnaM saMnikarzaH asti tasyEva jYAnaM janayati (BA0 pa0) (mu0) iti. aTa kAraRatAvacCedakaBedena kAryatAvacCedakaBedena ca tayorBeda ucyate. tatra sAmAnyalakzaRAyAH kAryakAraRaBAvaSca tattatsaMbanDAvacCinna GawatvAdiprakAritASAlijYAnatvena svarUpatastatsaMbanDAvacCinna GawatvAdiprakAritAkatattatsaMbanDAvacCinnaGawatvAdyASrayatASAlimuKya viSezyakapratyakzatvena iti. jYAnalakzaRAyAH kAraRatAvacCedakaM tu sAmAnyataH saMsargAvacCinnaGawatvAdivizayatASAlijYAnatvam. GawatvAdiprakArakajYAnAdiva GawatvAdivizayaka (GawatvAdi viSezyaka)- jYAnAdapi GawatvAdiprakArakopanItaBAnodayAt. kecittu jYAnalakzaRAyAH saprakArakaGawatvAdijYAnatvaM kAraRatAvacCedakam ityAhuH. BAzAparicCedakArAdayastu saMsargAvacCinnatadvizayatASAlijYAnatvena kAraRatA yogajaDarmAjanyasAmAnyalakzaRApratyAsattyajanyatadvizayakapratyakzatvena kAryatA ityAhuH. atra tadvizayitA cAlOkikI grAhyA. tena tallOkikapratyakze na vyaBicAraH (ma0 ma0 2 pf0 271).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1014" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

