सिद्धसाधनम्
sidDasADanam — (dozaH) 1 pramARAntareRAvagatArTasADanam anumAnam. yaTA parvate vahniniScayAnantaramapi punastatsADanAya vihitaM parvato vahnimAn DUmAt ityanumAnam. atra na hi kariRi dfzwe cItkAreRa tamanumimatenumAtAraH ityanuBavo drazwavyaH (tattvacintAmaRO vAcaspatimiSraH). atra sizADayizAyA asattve iti granTa Ado pUraRIyaH. sizADayizAyAH sattve tu anumiterudayena tadA sidDasADanasya na dozatvam (pakzatAviGawakatvam) ityavaDeyam. atra pratyakzakalitamapyarTamanumAnena buButsante tarkarasikAH ityanuBavo drazwavyaH (cintAmaRO vAcaspatimiSraH). 2 sADyapakzatAvacCedakayorEkye sidDasADanam. yaTA parvataH parvatatvavAn DUmAt ityAdO sidDasADanam. atra pUrvaM pakzatAvacCedakaparvatatvaviSizwapakzajYAnenEva sADyasidDayupapattO punastatsADanaM sidDasADanam iti BAvaH. kecittu pakzatAvacCedakaBede na sidDasADanaM dozaH. yaTA nitye vANmanase ityatra. yaTA vA GawatvAvacCedenetaraBedasya sidDatvepi dravyatvAvacCedenetaraBedasADane na sidDasADanam ityAhuH. sidDasADanaM ca hetvABAso nigrahasTAnaM veti mataBedaH. tatra sidDasADanaM pakzatAviGawakatvenASrayAsidDentarBavati iti prAYcaH jarannEyAyikAH AhuH. tanmate pakzatAyAH sADyasaMSayarUpatayA tadviGawakatvaM sADyaniScayasyAkzatam. taTA ca saMdigDasADyavataH pakzasyABAvAdASrayAsidDiH iti BAvaH (nIla0 2) (pra0 ca0 pf0 31). navyAstu sizADayizitapakzaviGawanadvArA sidDasADanaM dUzaRam na svataH. satyapi sidDasADane (sADyaniScaye) sizADavizayAnumityudayAnna sidDasADanaM hetvABAsAntaram. kiMtu nigrahasTAnAntaram ityAhuH (ci0 2) (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 21) (ma0pra0 2 pf0 28) (ta0 dI0 2 pf0 27) (si0 ca0). navyAnAmayamASayaH. sizADayizAvirahaviSizwasidDyaBAvasyEva sidDAnta sidDapakzatAtvasvIkArAt satyAmapi sidDO (sADyaniScaye) sizADayizAdaSAyAM cAnumityudayena sidDeranumitipratibanDakatvABAvAnna vyApakatvaGawitahetvABAsalakzaRAkrAntatvaM sidDivizayasya sADyavatpakzasya iti na sidDasADanasya hetvABAsatvaM (duzwahetutvam) saMBavati (nIla0 2 pf0 27) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://