suKam — 1 (guRaH) [ka] DarmamAtrAsADAraRakAraRakaguRaH (siM0 ca0 gaRani0 pf0 35) (ta0 kO0). suKaM tu jagatAmeva kAmyaM DarmeRa janyate. taTA ca Darmatvena suKatvena kAryakAraRaBAvaH (BA0 pa0 gu0 Slo0 146). ayaM ca DarmasuKayoH sAmAnya kAryakAraRaBAvaH prAcAM matenoktaH. navInamate tu nityaM vijYAnamAnandaM brahma iti SrutyA Bagavati nityasuKa sidDO Darmasya kAryatAvacCedakaM janyasuKatvam suKatvAvAntarajAtirvA iti boDyam (di0 gu0 pf0 220). suKasya lakzaRaM tu suKyaham ityAdyanuvyavasAyagamyasuKatvaM jAtiviSezaH (ta0 dI0). yadvA kAmyaBAvatvam. aTa vA itarecCAnaDInecCAvizayatve sati BAvatvam (nyA0 bo0). duHKABAvasya kAmyatvepi svataH puruzArTatvepi ca tasya BAvattrABAvAnnAtivyAptiH. [Ka] itarecCAnaDInecCA vizayI BUto guRaH. suKecCA suKatvaprakArakajYAnenEva janyate. nezwasADanatvajYAnenApi. taTA ca upAyecCAyA izwasADanatvavizayakajYAnenApi janyatvena tAdfSajYAnajanyopAyecCAvizayatvepi itarecCAnaDIne cCAvizayatvABAvena nopAyetivyAptiH. ata eva suKAnantaramizwAntarasyABAvAt suKasya svataH puruzArTatvamupapadyate (mu0 gu0 pf0 221) iti. atra mataBedaH. suKaM cAtmaDarmaH iti nEyAyikA AhuH. tacca cittaDarmaH<BR>;p{1024}<BR>iti sAMKyA AhuH. atra sAMKyAnAM mAyAvAdinAM cAyamASayaH suKaM cittaDarmopyaDyastatayA pratibimbarUpeRa vAtmani vartata iti. atredaM vijYeyam. kaRAda maharziSca kaRWataH suKaduHKayoH izwAnizwakAraRaviSezAdviroDAcca miTaH suKaduHKayorarTAntaraBAvaH (vE0 10. 1. 1) ityanena kAraRaBedAt BinnapadArTatvamuktavAn. taTA cAyamarTaH. duHKABinnaM suKaM na Bavati. taTA ca suKaM duHKamiSritatvena duHKABinnamasti iti pratyayastu Brama eva iti. kAryaBedenApi suKasya duHKAdBedamAhuH. anugrahABizvaNganayanaprasAdAdi suKasya kAryam iti praSastapAdAcAryAdayaH (vE0 u0 10. 1. 1 pf0 417). atra BAzyam. anugrahalakzaRaM suKam. svargAdyaBipretavizayasAMniDye sati izwopalabDIndriyArTasaMnikarzAdDarmAdyapekzAdAtmamanasoH saMyogAdyadyadanugrahABizvaNganayanAdiprasAdajanakamutpadyate tatsuKam. tadidamatItezu vizayezu srakcandanAdizu smftijam. anAgatezu saMkalpajam. yattu viduzAmasatsu vizayAnusmaraRecCAsaMkalpezvAvirBavati tat vidyASamasaMtozaDarmaviSezanimittam (praSasta0 2 pf0 32) iti. [ga] anityecCAnaDInecCAvizayaH (pra0 pra0). [Ga] suKatvasAmAnyavat. idaM ca jIve - SvarasuKasADAraRalakzaRam iti vijYeyam. [Na] nirupADyanukUlavedyam. atra anukUlamicCAvizayaH upADiH prayojakaH ityarTaH (pa0 ca0 pf0 30). [ca] sarvAtmanAmanukUlavedanIyam (ta0 BA0) (ta0 saM0). atrAnukUlatvaM cezwatvam (si0 ca0). taTA ca. yadanuBavAya cittamanukUlaM Bavati tat ityarTaH iti kacidAha. tanna. icCAvizayatvena jYAnavizayaH iti tu vayaM brUmaH. 2 kacit duHKABAvaH. yaTA BAravAhakasya BArApagame duHKABAvaH. ayamASayaH. BAravAhakasya BArApagame suKI saMvfttoham iti pratyayasya duHKABAvavizayakatvenopagamAt duHKABAve suKatvamupacaryate iti. dfzwaSca duHKABAvepi suKaSabdaprayogo bahuDA loke. yaTA jvarAdyapagame lOkikA vyAcakzARA Bavanti suKinaH saMvfttAH smaH iti (nyA0 vA0 1. 1. 22 pf0 90) (mu0 1 Atmani0 pf0 103). aDikaM SizwaM tu duHKaSabda.<BR>;p{1025}<BR>vyAKyAnAvasare saMpAditameva iti. 3 budDisattvasya pariRAmaviSezaH iti sAMKyA AhuH. 4 nidrA iti kecidAhuH. 5 svargaH iti mImAMsakA AhuH. 6 suKakaram. 7 suKI ca iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 8 vfdDinAmOzaDiviSezaH iti Bizaja AhuH. 9 varuRapurI iti pOrARikA AhuH. nyAyamate suKaM caturviDam vEzayikam ABimAnikam mAnoraTikam A- ByAsikaM ceti. tatra AdyaM vizayasAkzAtkArajanyam. dvitIyaM rAjyADipatyapARqityagarvAdijanyam. tftIyaM vizayaDyAnajanyam. turIyaM ca sUryanamaskArAyAsAdijanyaM lAGavarUpam (si0 ca0) iti. mImAMsakamate ca suKaM dviviDam sAMsArikam pAramArTikaM ca. tatrAdyam prayatnotpAdyaM sADanADInaM suKam. dvitIyaM tu svargaH iti. vedAntimate ca suKaM dviviDam nityam janyaM ca. tatra vizayasaMparkAdvEzayikaM suKaM janyam. brahmasvarUpaM suKaM tu nityam iti. tadetadvedAntimAyAvAdimatam muktivAde maRikftA nirAkftam. tatra na ca nityasuKABivyaktirmuktiH ityupakramyoktam svaprakASasuKAtmakabrahmaRo nityatve muktasaMsAriRoraviSezaprasaNgaH. puruzaprayatnaM vinA tasya sattvAt. apuruzArTatvAcca. avidyAnivfttiH prayatnasADyA iti cet. avid