surA — pEzwyAKyo madyaviSezaH. yaTA na surAM pivet (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 93) ityAdO surASabdasyArTaH. atredaM boDyam. yadyapi surASabdavAcyAH gOqI mADvI pEzwI iti tisraH taTApi surASabdo pezwImAtre muKyaH. gOqImADvyorgORaH. taToktaM BavizyapurARe surA ca pEzwrI<BR>;p{1027}<BR>muKyoktA na tasyAstvitare same (manu0 wI0 kullU0 a0 11 Slo0 90) iti. pEzwI taRqulapizwasADyA annavikAraH (mitA0). tadanyanmadyam. atra trEvarRikAnAmutpattipraBfti pEwIpratizeDaH. brAhmaRasya tu madyamAtra nizeDopyutpattipraBftyeva. rAjanyavESyayostu na kadAcidapi gOqyAdimadyapratizeDaH. SUdrasya tu surApratizeDaH. nApi madyamAtrapratizeDaH (mitAkza0 a0 3 Slo0 253 pf0 81) (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 93 kullUka 0). kAmataH sakftsurApAnepi prAyaScittaM tu surAM pItvA dvijo mohAt (rAgamUQatayA) agnivarRAM surAM pivet. tayA sa kAye nirdagDe mucyate kilbizAttataH.. (manu0 a0 11 lo0 90) iti. akAmataH jalAdibudDyA surApAne tu dvAdaSavArzikaM brahmahatyAvratAcaraRam. CardanAnantaraM tu trEvarzikaM piRyAkAdiBakzaRaM prAyaScittam. kevalatAlumAtrasurAsaMyoge tu varzaparyantaM sakftpiRyAkAdiBakzaRaM prAyaScittaM boDyam iti. matyA madyapAne gOqImALyorajYAnataH pAne ca kfcCrAtikfcCrasahitaH punaH saMskAraH. akAmato muKyasurApAne tu varzaparyantaM pratirAtraM sakft piRyAkAdiBakzaRam taptakfcCrapUrvakaM punarupanayanAdi ca jYeyam (yAjYa0 a0 3 0 253255) (manu0 a0 11 Slo0 92).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णम्
suvarRam — 1 (AkarajaM tejaH) pArTivaBAgasaMyukto dravadravyaviSezaH. yaTA suvarRANgulIyakam ityAdO suvarRaSabdArTaH. suvarRasya tEjasatvaM yaTA pItimagurutvASrayasyAtyantAgnisaMyogepi pUrvarUpAparAvfttidarSanAt pUrvarUpaparAvfttipratibanDakaM vijAtIyaM dravadravyaM kalpyate. taTA hyanumAnam agnisaMyogipItimagurutvASrayaH vijAtIyarUpapratibanDakadravadravyasaMyuktaH atyantAgnisaMyoge satyapi pUrvarUpavijAtIyarUpAnaDikaraRapArTivatvAt jalamaDyasTapItapawavat (mu0 1 tejo0 pf0 81) iti. atroktam pItimA ca gurutvaM ca dAhe yasya ca raktatA. tasya lokaprasidDasya svarRatvaM kena vAryate.. anucCinnadravatvaM tu vastu yatviha BAsate. suvarRavyavahAroyaM tatraSAstre pravartate.. vastuBede prasidDepi SabdasAmyaM pravartate. rasaH<BR>;p{1028}<BR>svaBAvamaDuro DvaniSca maDuro yaTA.. BUsaMsargavaSAccAsya rUpaM nEva pratIyate. sPawikasya japAyogAdyaTA rUpaM na BAsate.. (nyA0 lI0 tejoni0 pf0 9) iti. aTa suvarRasya tEjasatve prakArAntareRAnumAnamucyate. suvarRa tEjasam asati pratibanDaketyantAnalasaMyogepi anucCidyamAnadravatvAt yannEvaM tannEvaM yaTA pfTivI (mu0 tejoni0 pf0 81) iti. agnO suvarRamakzIRam (yAjYa0 2. 178) iti smfteragnisaMyogepi tasya nocCedaH. atredaM vijYeyam. atyantAnalasaMyoge sati pArTive GftAdO dravatvanASadarSanena jalamaDyasTaGftAdO dravatvanASAdarSanena asati pratibanDake pArTivadravatvanASAtyantAgnisaMyogayoH kAryakAraRaBAvAvaDAraRAt suvarRasyAtyantAnalasaMyoge satyanucCidyamAnadravatvADikaraRatvena pArTivatvAnupapattiH. tasmAt pItadravyadravatvanASapratibanDakatayA dravadravyAntarasidDO nEmittikadravatvADikaraRatayA jalatvAnupapatteH rUpavattayA vAyvAdizvanantarBAvAt tEjasatvasidDiH. tasyozRasparSaBAsvararUpayorupazwamBakapArTivarUpasparSAByAM pratibanDAdanupalabDiH. tasmAt suvarRaM tEjasam iti sidDam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 8- 9). Agamopi agnerapatyaM praTamaM hiraRyam (di0 1 pf0 81) iti. brAhmaRasvAmikasuvarRacOrye mahApAtakam. tatsaMgrahastu pAtakaSabdavyAKyAne (pf0 498) dfSyaH. evam hiraRya rOpya ityAdayaH SabdA vyAKyeyAH. 2 karzaparimARam. yaTA prAyaScittapratyAmnAyAdO suvarRaSabdArTaH karzaparimARam. 3 Danam. 4 DattUram ityAdi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1027" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुप्तिः
suzuptiH — [ka] pradeSaviSezAvasTitamanaH saMyogaH (nIla0 gu0 pf0 38). sa ca pradeSaH purItadAtmakaH. [Ka] nidrAnAqyavacCinnAtmamanoyogaH (kfzRaM 0). [ga] purItatA manasaH saMyogaH. yaTA puruzaH suptaH svapnayA carati. tO ha suptaM puruzamAjagmatuH (kOzIta 0 4. 1519) ityAdO svapDAtvarTaH svApaH. sa eva suzuptiH. suzupterutpattimAhurnavyAH. praTamam suzuDyanukUlamanaH kriyayA purItadvyatiriktAtmapradeSAnmanaso viBAgaH. tatastatsaMyoganASaH. tataH purItadAtmakottaradeSena<BR>;p{1029}<BR>manasaH saMyoga utpadyate. sEva suzuptiH (di0 1 3 pf0 115) iti. atredaM boDyam. suzuptO na kiMcidapi jYAnamutpadyate. suzuptikAle purItati tvagindriyABAvena tatra sTitamanasastvaksaMyogAsaMBavAt. purItadBinnadeSAvacCinnamanaHsaMyogasya (tvaNmanaH saMyogasya) jYAnasAmAnyaM prati kAraRatvAt (rAma 0 1 pf0 114115) iti. purItat atra ityAKyo nAqIviSezaH iti jYeyam (amaraH 2. 6. 66). atra SrutiH. aTa yadA supto Bavati tadA na kasyacana (na kaMcana) veda. hitA nAma nAqyo dvAsaptatisahasrARi hfdayAtpurItatamaBipratizWante. tABiH pratyavasfzya purItati Sete (SatapaTatrA 0 14 bfha0 2. 1. 19). yatrEtatpuruzaH suptaH svapnaM (svapnasfzwaM Palam) na kaMcana paSyati (kOzIta0 upa0 3. 3). tadyatrEtatsuptaH samastaH saMprasannaH svapnaM na vijAnAti (CAndo0 u0 8. 6. 3) ityAdiH. mAyAvAdivedAntinastu [Ga] jYAnaSUnyo jIvasyAvasTAviSeza ityAhuH. atra SrutiH yatra supto na kaMcana kAmaM kAmayate na kaMcana svapnaM paSyati tat suptamiti (bfha0 u0 4. 3. 19) iti. atredaM vijYeyam. sAMKyamate suzupyavasTA ca dviviDA. arDalayasamagralayaBedAt. tatrArDalaye vizayAkArA vfttirna Bavati. kiM tu svagatasuKaduHKamohAkArEva budDivfttirBavati. samagralaye tu budDervfttisAmAnyABAvo maraRAdAviva Bavati (sAMKya0 BA0 a0 1 sU0 148). kiM ca mAyAvAdimate samagralaye jIvaH paramAtmanEkyamApnoti (SArI0 BA0 1. 1. 9). tatra SrutiH yatrEtatpuruzaH svapiti nAma satA sOmya tadA saMpanno Bavati. svamapIto Bavati. tasmAdena svapitItyAcakzate (CAndo0 6. 8. 1) iti. maDvamate tu tadyaTA priyayA striyA saMparizvakto na bAhyaM kiMcana veda nAntaram evamevAyaM puruzaH prAjYenAtmanA saMparizvakto na bAhyaM kiMcana veda nAntaram (bfha0 upa0 6. 3. 21) iti SrutyA jIvaH suzuptyavasTAyAM paramAtmana AliNganamAtraM prApnoti iti pratipAdyate ityalaM vistareRa. [Na] praboDasahakAryaBAvena kleSasyAnaBivyaktiH iti yogina AhuH (sarva0 pf0 359 pAtaYjala0). [ca] nidrA iti kAvyajYA AhuH (amaraH 1. 7. 36)..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1028" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्तवाकः
