सूक्ष्मम्
sUkzmam — 1 atyalpaH padArTaH. yaTA aRuparimARuyutaH paramARvAdiH. yaTA vA aDyAtmapadArTaH sUkzmaSarIram. yaTA vA kezAMcidvedAntinAM mate apaYcIkftAni pfTivyAdIni paYca mahABUtAni sUkzmARi tannirmitaM SarIraM sUkzmaSarIram. taduktam paYcaprARamanobudDidaSendriyasamanvitam. apaYcIkftaBUtotTaM sUkzmANgaM BogasADanam.. iti. idaM ca lokAntaragAmi BogopaBogasamarTaM liNgaSarIram ityucyate. sAMKyAstu mahadahaMkArEkAdaSendriyapaYcatanmAtrARAM samudAyaH sUkzmaSarIram. SAntaGoramUQErindriyEranvitatvAt viSezaH iti pratipedire (sAMKya0 kO0 kAri0 40). atroktam sUkzmAstezAM niyatA mAtApitfjA nivartante (sAMKya0 kA0 lo0 39) iti. sUkzmAH sUkzmadehAH. te ca anumitAH. paraloke karmaPalaBogaH sUkzmadehaM vinA anupapanno BogatvAt sTUladehArabDakfzyAdijanitasya satyasya svadehenEva Bogavat iti. svadehArabDakarmAdiPalaM yat tat svadehenEva Bogyam netareRa. anyaTA kftahAnAkftAByAgamaprasaNgaH ityAdistarkastatrAnusaMDeyaH. 2 arTAlaMkAraviSezaH. taduktam saMlakzitastu sUkzmorTa AkAreReNgitena vA. kayApi sUcyate BaNgayA yatra sUkzmaM taducyate.. (sAhi0 pari0 10 Slo0 91). 3 katakavfkzaH iti Bizaja AhuH. 4 kEtavam iti kAvyajYA AhuH. 5 sUkzmaM saMpUrRazaqguRaM vAsudevAKyaM paraM brahma (sarva0 pf0 119 rAmA0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1030" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रम्
sUtram — 1 SAstrIyabahvarTapratipAdaka saMkziptavAkyaviSezaH. SAstrIyasUtrARi zaqviDAni brahmamImAMsAsUtram DarmamImAMsAsUtram nyAyasUtram vESezikasUtram sAMKyasUtram yogasUtraM ceti. atra vedAntinaH sUtralakzaRamAhuH. alpAkzaramasaMdigDaM sAravadviSvatomuKam. astoBamanavadyaM ca sUtraM sUtravido viduH.. (maDvaBA0 1. 11 prastAva0 pf0 3) iti.<BR>;p{1031}<BR>SAbdikAstu sUtralakzaRamAhuH saMjYA ca pariBAzA ca viDirniyama eva ca. atideSoDikAraSca zaqviDaM sUtralakzaRam.. iti. pARinyAdipraRItAni vyAkaraRasUtrARi tu vedANgAnyeva. na tu SAstrIya sUtrazaNkAntarBUtAni. evam ASvalAyanApastambAdimaharzipraRItAni Darmagfhya SrOtasUtrARi bahUni santi. 2 nAwakajYAstu nAwakopakaraRaM prastAvaH. yaTA sUtraDAraH ityAdO sUtraSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. 3 tantuH iti kAvyajYA AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1030" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

