सृष्टिः
sfzwiH — 1 utpattyanukUlavyApAraviSezaH. yaTA sasarja BagavAnAdO trIn guRAn prakfteH paraH. mahattattvaM tato vizRuH sfzwavAn brahmaRastanum.. mahattattvAdahaMkAraM sasarja Sivavigraham. devAn dehAn manaH KAni KaM ca sa triviDAttataH.. AkASAdasfjadvAyuM vAyostejo vyajIjanat. tejasaH salilaM tasmAt pfTivImasfjadviBuH.. tataH kUwasTamasfjadviDiM brahmARqavigraham. tasmiMstu BagavAn BUyo BuvanAni caturdaSa.. (maRimaYjarI sa0 1 0 2-5) ityAdO sfjDAtvarTaH sfzwiH. sa ca vyApAro jagadutpattAvISvarecCArUpaH. GawAdyutpattO tu kulAlAdInAM karmAdiH. atra tadEkzata bahu syAM prajAyeya (CAndo0 u0 6 2 3) tatsfzwvA tadevAnuprAviSat (tEtti0 u0 2. 6. 1) ityAdiSrutayonusaMGeyAH. manurAha tataH svayaMBUrBagavAnavyakto vyaYjayannidam. mahABUtAdi vftOjAH prAdurAsIttamonudaH.. soBiDyAya SarIrAtsvAtsisfkzurviviDAH prajAH. apa eva sasarjAdO tAsu bIjamavAsfjat.. (manu0 a0 1 Slo0 6-8) ityAdi. pOrARikA navaviDaM sargaM jaguH sargo navaviDastasya prAkfto vEkftastu yaH. kAladravyaguRErasya triviDaH pratisaMkramaH.. (BAga0 ska0 3 a0 10) ityAdi. matsyapurARe ca matsya uvAca tapaScacAra praTamamamarARAM pitAmahaH. AvirBUtAstato vedAH sANgopANgapadakramAH.. purARaM sarvaSAstrARAM praTamaM brahmaRA smftam. nityaM SabdamayaM<BR>;p{1032}<BR>puRyaM Satakowipravistaram. anantaraM ca vakreByo vedAstasya viniHsftAH. mImAMsA nyAyavidyASca pramARAzwakasaMyutAH. ityAdi sfzwiprakAraH savistaro drazwavyaH. idAnIM sfzwikramaH kaTyate. prARinAM BogaBUtaye parameSvarasya sisfkzA jAyate. sargAdO BagavAnISvaraH prayojyaprayojakavfdDaSarIradvayaM parigfhya taTA vyavaharati. tatastavyavahArAdvAlaH pUrvavatsaMketaM gfhRAti (nyA0 ma0 4 pf0 5). tato labDavfttikAdfzwaviSizwAtmasaMyogAt doDUyamAnezu pavanaparamARuzu praTamataH karmotpattiH. tato dvayoH pavanaparamARvoH saMyogaH. tato vyaRukotpattiH. tatastrizu vyaRukezu karmotpattiH. tatastezAM saMyogaH. tataKyaRukotpattiH. evaM caturaRukAdyutpattikrameRa mahAvAyurutpadya vihAyasi doDUyamAnastizWati. tatastasminvAyO jalaparamARuByo vyaRukAdikrameRa mahAjalarASirutpannaH poplUyamAnaH tizWati. tatastasminmahodaDO pfTivIparamARuto vyaRukAdikrameRa mahApfTivyutpadya saMhatAvatizWate. tataH tasminneva jale tEjaseBya utpanno mahAtejorASirdedIpyamAnastizWati iti. tatra tejaH paramARusahitapfTivIparamARuBirISvarABiDyAnAdaRqamutpadyate tasminbrahmotpadyate (ta0 va 0 125127) (si0 ca0) iti. aTa prakArAntareRa sfzwiviDirucyate. KaRqapralayAnantaram prARinAM BogaBUtaye parameSvarasya sisfkzAnantaraM sarvAtmagatavfttilabDAdfzwApekzeByastatsaMyogeByaH pavanaparamARuzu karmotpattO tezAM parasparasaMyogeByo vyaRukAdikrameRa mahAvAyuH samutpanno naBasi doDUyamAnastizWati. tadanantaraM tasminneva vAyAvApyeByaH paramARuByastenEva krameRa mahAn salilaniDirutpannaH poplUyamAnastizWati. tadanantaraM tasminneva salilaniDO pArTiveByaH paramARuByo dvyaRukAdikrameRa samutpannA mahApfTivI saMhatA GanIBUtAvatizWate. tadanantaraM tasminneva mahodaDO tEjaseByaH paramARuByo vyaRukAdikrameRa samutpanno mahAMstejorASirdedIpyamAnastizWati. evaM samutpannezu caturzu mahABUtezu parameSvarasyABiDyAnamAtrAt (icCAmAtrAt na tu vyApArAntarAta) tEjaseByoRuByaH pArTivAdiparamARusahiteByo mahadaRqamAraByate. tasmiMScaturvadanaM sakalalokapitAmahaM brahmARaM sakalaBuvanasahitamutpAdya.<BR>;p{1033}<BR>prajAsarge niyuNkte. sa ca maheSvareRa niyukto brahmAtiSayajYAnavErAgyESvaryasaMpannaH sarvaprARinAM karmavipAkaM viditvA karmAnurUpajYAnavErAgyaBogAyuzaH sutAn prajApatInmAnasAnmanUn devarzipitfgaRAn muKabAhUrupAdataScaturo varRAnanyAni coccAvacAni BUtAni sfzwvA ASayA (vAsanA) nurUpErDarmajYAnavErAgyESvaryEH saMyojayati (praSasta0 1 pf0 6) (pa0 mA0 pf0 126127). atra kAlani0 pf0 93) (ta0 va0 pari0 5 SrutiH brAhmaRosya muKamAsIt vAhU rAjanyaH kftaH. UrU tadasya yadvESyaH padByAM SUdro ajAyata (fgve0 pu0 sU0) iti. atredaM boDyam. ezA hyAdisfzwiyonijEva. tatroccA DarmaviSezasahakfteByo RuByovacA cADarmaviSezasahakfteByo jAyate. brahmA ayonijotiSayitaDarmaviSeza sahakfteByoRuByo jAyate ISvarABiDyAnamAtrAt (praSasta0 wippa0 pf0 19) iti. mahApralayAnantaraM tu na tAdfSI sfzwiH syAt. sarvamuktO sarvotpattinimittasyAdfzwasyApAyAt. sarvaBopavfttO (muktO) prayojanABAvAcca. na hi vIjaprayojanAByAM vinA kAryotpattiH (pa0 mA0 kAlanirU0 pf0 93) (ta0 va0 pari0 5 pf0 125127) iti. atredaM cintyam. kecit vedAntinaH jalotpatteH pUrvameva teja utpadyate ityAcakzate (ta0 va0). atra vayaM brUmaH. yadAcakzate tattu yuktameva. jvalane sati jalasya nASaH iti BAzyAdO pralayaprakrame pratipAdanAt. ataH tejaH sfzwyanantarameva jalasfzwiryuktA. anyaTA tejonASAnantarameva jalanASaH iti pratipAdyeta. paraM tu taTA na pratipAdyate iti jalasfzweH pUrvameva tejaH sfzwiryuktA iti. taTA ca SrutiH tasmAdvA etasmAdAtmana AkASaH saMBUtaH AkASAdvAyuH. vAyoragniH. agnerApaH. adByaH pfTivI. pfTivyA ozaDayaH. ozaDIByonnam. annAtpuruzaH (tEttirIya upa0 2. 1) iti. atredaM vijYeyam. praTamato jagadutpattO paramARvAdayovayavAH samavAyikAraRam. paramARudvayasaMyogAdikamasamavAyikAraRam. ISvaratajjYAnecCAkftikAlakarmAdfzwAdi nimittakAraRam iti vESezikamatam (si0 ca0) iti. evamanyatrApi BAvakAryotpattO kAraRatrayamUhyam. 2 nAmarUpaviBAgaviBaktasTUlacidacidvastuSarIraM brahma kAryAvasTam. brahmaRastaTAviDasTUlaBAvaSca 130.<BR>;p{1034}<BR>sfzwirityaBiDIyate (sarva0 saM0 pf0 109 rAmAnu0). 3 sfzwiSabdo (petA mantrA yAsAmizwakAnAmupaDAne vidyante tA izwakAH sfzwaya ucyante. yaTA sfzwIrupadaDAti (jE0 nyA0 a0 1 pA0 4 aDi0 17).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1031" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

