स्तुतिः
stutiH — 1 [ka] guRavattayA KyApanam (ci0 1 pf0 102). yaTA nirviGnasamAptikAmo devatAstutimAcaret ityAdO granTe stutiSabdArTaH (ci0 maNga0 1 pf0 100) (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 1). utkarzavattayA jYAnAnukUlaH SabdaH ityarTaH. tena vyApArAntare tAdfSi nAtiprasaNgaH<BR>;p{1035}<BR>. atra jYAnapadena AropitajYAnaM gfhyate. tena tAdfSi svarUpAKyAne nAtivyAptiH. BagavatstutyAdizu tatprayogo BAktaH (mU0 ma0 maNga0 1 pf0 103104). [Ka] sarvotkfzwaguRavattApratipAdakaSabdaH (ma0 vA0 pf0 10). [ga] AropyamARaguRakaTanam iti prAmARikA AhuH. [Ga] jYAnaviSepopaDAyakaH SabdaH iti navyA AhuH (mU0 ma0 maNga 0 1 104). 2 [ka] viDeH PalavAdalakzaRA yA praSaMsA sA stutiH. saMpratyayArTaM stUyamAnaM SraddaDIta iti. pravartikA ca. PalaSravaRAtpravartate (vAtsyA0 2. 1. 64). [Ka] sAkzAdviDyarTasya praSaMsArTakaM vAkyam. yaTA sarvajitA vE devAH sarvamajayan iti viDeH sarvasyAtyE sarvasya jityE sarvamevEtenApnoti sarvaM jayati ityevamAdi vAkyaM stutiH (gO0 vf0 2. 1. 64). yaTA vA aharahaH saMDyAmupAsIta iti viDeH saMDyAmupAsate ye tu satataM saMSitavratAH. viDUtapApAste yAnti brahmalokamanAmayam.. ityAdyarTavAdavAkyaM stutiH. [ga] viDeyastAvakaM vAkyam. yaTA vAyavya SvetamAlaBeta BUtikAmaH iti viDeH vAyurve kzepizWA devatA vAyumeva svena BAgaDeyenopaDAvati sa evEnaM BUtiM gamayati (tEttirIyasaMhitA 2. 1. 1) (ma0pra0 4 pf0 64) iti. idaM vAkyaM hi vAyUddeSyakaH SvetapaSukaraRako yAgaH praSastaH iti prASastyaboDanena viDyarTaM stOti. taTA ca viDyuddeSenEkavAkyatvAdarTavAdaH pramARam (SAba0 BA0 122. 7). [Ga] guRakaTanaparamekaM vAkyam (jE0 nyA0 a0 9 pA0 2 aDi0 3). 3 stotram. tacca guRakarmAdiBiH praSaMsanam. yaTA yo devadattaScaturvedABijYaH ityukte sarve janAH stutimavagacCanti. guRinamupasarjanIkftya tannizWAnAM guRAnAM prADAnyena kaTanam ityarTaH (fgvedaBAzye sAyaRaH). stotraM caturviDam dravyastotraM karmastotraM viDistotraM taTEva ca. taTEvABijanastotraM stotrametacaturviDam.. (matsyapu0 a0 123) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1034" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh