sparSaH — 1 (guRaH) [ka] tvagindriyamAtragrahaRo yorTaH sa sparSaH (vE0 u0 3. 1. 1) (praSa0 pf0 12). sa tu bAhyEkendriyagrAhyaH pfTivIjalatejovAyuvfttiH. atra vivekaH kaWinasukumAraspaSa pfTivyA eva (BA0 pa0) iti. tatra vAyugatasparSastu bahuviDaH. taTA coktam vAyavyaSca guRaH sparSaH sparSaSca bahuDA smftaH. uzRaH SItaH suKo duHKaH snigDo viSad eva ca.. taTA Karo mfdU rUkzo laGurgurutaropi ca. (BAra0 SA0 a0 181) iti. kaWinasyApyupalakzaRamidam. yaToktam vAyoScApi guRaH sparSaH sparSaSca bahuDA smftaH. rUkzaH SItastaTEvozRaH snigDaSva viSadaH KaraH.. kaWinaScikkaRaH SlakzRaH picCalo dAruRo mfduH. evaM dvAdaSavistAro vAyavyo 131<BR>;p{1042}<BR>guRa eva ca.. (BAra0 ASva0 a0 50) iti. tvagindriyamAtragrahaRo yorTa ityatra arTaSabdena DarmI BAvaBUta ucyate. tena sparSatvAdO sparSAdyaBAve ca nAtivyAptiH. taTA ca tvagindriyagrAhyaguRavfttiguRatvAvAntarajAtimattvam iti paryavasitorTaH. tena nAtIndriyasparSAdyanupagrahaH (vE0 u0 3. 1. 1). atredaM boDyam. sparSaH dravyapratyakze tvaksahakArI rUpAnuviDAyI ca (vE0 u0 3. 1. 1) (ta0 saM0) (praSasta 0 pf0 12). tadarTastu rUpasamAnADikaraRAtyantABAvApratiyogI iti. rUpavati sparSo niyamena vartate iti sugamorTaH. [Ka] tvagindriyamAtragrAhyo guRaH (ta0 saM0 1). atra sparSatvetivyAptivAraRAya guRapadam. saMyogAdAvativyAptivAraRAya mAtrapadam (ta0 dI0 1 pf0 13) iti. [ga] tvaNmAtragrAhyajAtimAn (ta0 kO0 1). sA ca jAtiH sparSatvam. yaTA tvacA GawaM spfSati ityAdO spfSDAtvarTaH sparSaH. nyAyavESezikamate sparSastriviDaH SItaH uzRaH anuzRASItaSceti. tatra SIto jale vartate. uzRastejasi. anuzRASItaH pfTivIvAyvovartate. tatra nityAyAmanityAyAM ceti dviviDAyAmapi pfTivyAM sparSaH anityaH pAkajaSca. jalatejovAyuzu ca dravyezvapAkajaH nityagato nityaH anityagataH anityaSceti (praSasta0 pf0 14) (vE0 u0 7. 1. 6) (ta0 saM0). citrasparSastu rUpasTalIyayuktayA (pf0 690) svIkaraRIya eva (vE0 vi0 7. 1. 6 pf0 292) iti. kecittu kaWinAdiH sparSaH saMyogaviSeza eva nAtiriktaH iti manyante. bOdDAstu nAmarUpendriyARAM miTaH saMyogaH sparSaH ityAhuH. 2 vedAntinastu saMbanDaH (saMnikarzaH) (gItA maDvaBA0). yaTA mAtrAsparSAstu kOnteya SItozRasuKaduHKadAH (gItA0 2. 14) ityAdO sparSaSabdasyArTa ityaNgIcakruH. 3 vEyAkaraRAstu kAdayo mAvasAnAH (25) varRyavarRAH ityAhuH. 4 kAvyajYAstu grahaRam. 5 dAnam. 6 yudDaM ca ityAhuH. 7 rogaH iti Bizaja AhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1041" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

