स्फोटः
sPowaH — varRAtirikto varRABivyaNgayorTapratyAyako nityaH SabdaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 300 pARi0) (tarkapra0 Ka0 pf0 126). atra vyutpattiH sPuwyate vyajyate varREH iti sPowaH iti sPuwatyarTosmAt iti sPowaH iti ca yOgikaSabdABiDeyatvaM SabdabrahmaRaH sUcayati (vE0 sA0 pf0 212). sPowatvaM ca sPuwatyaBivyaktI BavatyarTosmAt anena vA iti vyutpattyA arTaprakASakatvam. prakASaSca jYAnam. taTA ca arTanizWavizayatAprayojakaSaktimattvaM paryavasyati. varRasyEva tattvAByupagame varRasPowaH padAdInAM tattvAByupagame tu padAdisPowaH iti vyavahAraH (vE0 sA0 da0 pf0 212). sPowasyAvaSyakatvamAha. padAnAM varRasamUharUpARAmASuvinASitayEkakzaRAvasTAyitvABAvAdapratyakzatvaM tAvannirUQam. taTA ca padApratyakze padArTasmfteH SAbdaboDa hetoH asaMBavaH syAt. ataH sPowaH kaScanANgIkartavyaH yatorTapratyayaH iti. aTa vA varRAnAM pratyuccAraRamanyaTA pratIyamAnatayA anityatvena ASuvinASinAM ca tezAM melanAsaMBavena tatsamudAyasyApi saMbanDitvABAvena pratyekaM varRezu vfttO vyaBicAreRa ca pUrvapUrvavarRAnuBavajanyasaMskArabIjavatyantyavarRa janita paripAkaSAlini hfdaye Jawiti<BR>;p{1044}<BR>samudIyamAnasya sPowarUpasyEva nityatayA tatrEva nityasaMbanDasya yogyatayA vfttimattvamucitam iti. taTA ca yogasUtraBAzyakfvyAsa Aha tadetezAmarTasaMketenAvacCinnAnAmupasaMhftaDvanikramARAM ya eko budDinirBAsastatpadaM vAcakaM vAcyasya saMketyate tadekaM padamekabudDivizaya ekaprayatnAkziptamaBAgamakramavarRaM vOdDamantyavarRapratyayopasTApitaM pratIyate iti. sPowaSca pUrvapUrvavarRAnuBavasahitacaramavarRAnuBavavyaNgaTaH. atra sPowasyABivyaktO prAkfto DvaniH kAraRam. ciraciratarasTitO tu prAkftaDvanijAtavEkftaDvaniH kAraRam iti viveko jYeyaH (la0 ma0 1). sa ca SAbdikamataprasidDaH. atra mahABAzyam aTa gOrityatra kaH SabdaH. yenoccAritena sAsnAlANgUlakakudaKuravizARAnAM saMpratyayo Bavati sa Sabda ucyate iti. taTA ca BAgavate (12. 6. 40) sPowaSravaRasyAtma liNgatvamuktam SfRoti ya imaM sPowaM supte Srotre ca SUnyadfk. yena vAgvyajyate yasya vyaktirAkASa AtmanaH.. (maYjUzAyAm) iti. nEyAyikamate tu sPowo nANgIkr