स्मृतिः
smftiH — 1 (budDiH) saMskAramAtrajanyaM jYAnam (ta0 saM0). pratyakzabudDiniroDe tadanusaMDAnavizayaH smftiH (nyA0 vA0) iti vArtike uktam. yaTA mAtuH smarati ityAdO smfDAtvarTaH. saMskAramAtrajanyam ityasya cakzurAdyajanyatve sati saMskArajanyam ityarTaH. mAtrapadopAdAnena pratyaBijYAyAM nAtivyAptiH. pratyaBijYAyAScakzurjanyatvAt (nIla0 1 pf014) iti. atra prAno nEyAyikAH smftilakzaRe na mAtrapadamAvaSyakam. na ca soyaM devadattaH iti pratyaBijYAyAmativyAptiH iti vAcyam. tatra saMskArajanitatattAsmftireva hetuH. na tu saMskAropi ityativyAptivirahAt ityAhuH (ta0 kO0 1 pf0 6). maDvAcAryAnuyAyinastu smftiH manojanyA na tu saMskArajanyA. saMskArastu manasastadarTasaMnikarzarUpa eva. yaTA yogIndriyARAM yogajo Darma ityAhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 9). smftiSca vESezikanaye budDyantargata vidyApraBedaH (praSasta0 pf0 25). liNgadarSanecCAnusmaraRAdyapekzAdAtmamanasoH saMyogaviSezAt pawwaByAsAdarapratyayajanitAcca saMskArAt dfzwaSrutAnuBUtezvarTezu viSezAnusmaraRecCAdvezahetuH tadatItavizayA smftiH (praSasta0 2 pf0 32) iti atra pAWAntaram viSezAnuvyavasAyecCAnusmaraRadvezahetuH (praSasta0<BR>;p{1046}<BR>pf0 4950) iti. atra sUtram AtmamanasoH saMyogaviSezAt (praRiDAnAdisaMniDAnAdasamavAyikAraRAt) saMskArAcca smftiH (vE09. 2. 6) iti. atra smftO saMyogaviSezosamavAyikAraRam. saMskAro nimittakAraRam. AtmA samavAyikAraRam iti vijYeyam (vE0 u0 9. 1. 6). atredaM boDyam.. BAvanAKyaH saMskAronuBavena janyate smftiM janayati ca iti. saMskArastadbudDa eva smftiM janayati. udboDakASca saMskArasya sadfSadarSanAdayaH (ta0 BA0 pf0 37). taTA coktam sadfSAdfzwacintAdyAH smftibIjasya voDakAH iti. gOtamasUtre (3. 2. 42) ca te pradarSitAH. atra kaScidAha smftijananAya saMskAroddIpanamudboDaH (vAca0) iti. atra mataBedaH. smftiM saMskAraM ca prati anuBavasyAnuBavatvenEva janakatvam iti prAcAM matam. navInAnAM mate tu anuBavasya jYAnatvena janakatvam (nIla0 gu0 pf0 38) iti. prAcAmayamaBiprAyaH tattadvizayakasmftiM tAdfSasaMskAraM ca prati tattadvizayakAnuBavatvenEva hetutA. na tu tattadvizayakajYAnatvena. anuBavatvasyApi jAtitvena jYAnatvApekzayA gOravABAvAt. na ca vinigamanAvirahaH iti SaNkayam. vyApyaDarmapuraskAreRa kAraRatvasaMBave vyApakaDarmasyAnyaTAsidDinirUpakatvAt iti. navyAnAM punarayamASayaH. tattadvizayakasmftiM tAdfSasaMskAraM ca prati tattadvizayakajYAnatvenEva hetutA. na tvanuBavatvena. saMskArasya PalanASyatayA praTamasmaraRenEvAnuBavajanyasaMskArasya nASena sakfdanuBUtasya smaraRottaramasmaraRaprasaNgAt (nIla0 mu0 pf0 3839) iti. smftirdviviDA yaTArTA ayaTArTA ceti. tatra AdyA pramAjanyA. dvitIyA apramAjanyA (ta0 saM0). jAgare taduBayaM saMBavati. svapne tu sarvameva jYAnaM smaraRam ayaTArTaM ca (ta0 BA0) iti. dvayorlakzaRe ca saMskAra saMbanDAvacCinnAnuBavapramABramanizWajanakatAnirUpitajanyate boDye (vAkya0 gu0 pf0 21). atra vedAntina AhuH smftirapi (pramAjanyApi) pramARameva (pramA) (pra0 pa0 pf0 4) iti. ayaM BAvaH smfteH pramArUpatvena pramAkaraRatvarUpapramARalakzaRAkrAntatvAdanuBavasyApi pratyakzAdicatuzwayasyeva pramARAntaratvamizwameva<BR>;p{1047}<BR>iti. 2 yogaSAstrajYAstu anuBavaprAptipUrvA vfttiH ityAhuH. atra sUtram anuBUtavizayAsaMpramozaH smftiH (pAta 0 pA0 1 sU011). sarvAH smftayaH pramARaviparyayavikalpanidrAsmftInAmanuBavAt praBavanti (Bojavftti 0) (BA0). 2 DarmajYAstu DarmaSAstram. atrArTe smftiSabdasya vyutpattiH smaryate vedaDarmonena (karaRe ktin) iti. tacca vedArTAnuBavajanyaM vedArTAnuvAdakaM Darme ca pramARaM munipraRItaM vAkyarUpam. yaTA manusmftiyAjYavalkyasmftyAdirityAhuH. taduktaM manunA vedoKilo DarmamUlaM smftiSIle ca tadvidAm (manu0 a0 2 Slo0 6) (gO0 1. 1) iti. atroktam Srutistu vedo vijYeyo DarmaSAstraM tu vE smftiH (manu0 a0 2 Slo0 10) iti. iyaM smftirapi sAttvikarAjasatAmasaBedena triviDA. tatra sAttvikyo yaTA vAsizWaM cEva hArItaM vyAsaM pArASaraM taTA. BAradvAjaM kASyapaM ca sAttvikyo muktidAH SuBAH.. (padmapu0 utta0 a0 43) iti. rAjasyastAmasyastu tatrEvAnvezaRIyAH. vistaraBayAdatra na saMgfhItAH..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" ta