syAdvAdaH — (vAdaH) yatra vAde digambarAH jEnAH sarvatra saptaBaNgInayAKyaM nyAyamavatArayanti saH. syAdvAdaH sarvaTEkAntatyAgAtkivfttacidviDeH.<BR>;p{1048}<BR>saptaBaNgInayApekzo heyAdeyaviSezakft.. (sarva0 saM0 pf0 84 AI0). saptaBaNgInayastu (1) syAdasti (2) syAnnAsti (3) syAdasti ca nAsti ca (4) syAdavaktavyaH (5) syAdasti cAvaktavyaH (6) syAnnAsti cAvaktavyaH (7) syAdasti ca nAsti cAvaktavyaH iti. atra syAcCabdaH KaltrayaM nipAtastiNantapratirUpakonekAntadyotakaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 84 AI0). syAt ityavyayam tiNantapratirUpakam kaTaMcidarTakam. syAdasti kaTaMcidasti ityarTaH. evamagrepi (SArI0 BA0 wI0 2. 2. 33 pf0 34). yaTA GawaH svasvarUpeRAsti pawasvarUpeRa nAsti ityAdi. evam ekatvanityatvAdizvapImameva saptaBaNgInayaM yojayanti (SArIra0 BA0 2. 2. 33). ayaM BAvaH. GawAderhi sarvAtmanA sadekarUpatve prApyAtmanApyastyeva saH iti tatprAptaye yatno na syAt. ato GawatvAdirUpeRa kaTaMcidasti prAptatvAdirUpeRa kaTaMcinnAsti ityevamanekarUpatvaM vastumAtrasyAsTeyam (SA0 BA0 wI0 ra0 pra0 2. 2. 33) iti. evam ekatvamanekatvaM ceti dvayamAdAya (1) syAdekaH (2) syAdanekaH (3) syAdekonekaSca (4) syAdavaktavyaH (5) syAdekovaktavyaH (6) syAdanekovaktavyaH (7) syAdekonekaScAvaktavyaSca iti. taTA syAnnityaH syAdanityaH ityAdyUhyam (SArI0 BA0 wI0 ratnapra0 2. 2. 33).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1047" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

