स्वत्वम्
svatvam — [ka] yaTezwaviniyogayogyatvam iti prAca AhuH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 6) (ta0 dI0). yaTA cEtrasya Danam ityAdO Dane cEtranirUpitaM svatvam. tatrAyamarTaH. yaTezwaviniyogayogyatvaM SAstrAnizidDaviniyogopAyaH krayapratigrahAdistadvizayatvam. tacca na bahirindriyavedyam. pratigrahAdermAnasajYAna viSezarUpasya bahirindriyAyogyatvAt (kA0 vyA0 pf0 6) iti. atra vipratipattiH svatvaM lOkikam alOkikaM vA iti. tatra svatvamalOkikam SAstrEkasamaDigamyam iti pUrvapakzaH jImUtavAhanAdInAm. tacca lOkikameva lokaprasidDameva iti sidDAntaH vijYAneSvaramitramiSrAdInAm iti mitAkzarAvIramitrodayAdO sidDAntitam. tacca svatvaM janmanEvotpadyata iti mitAkzarAkArAdayaH vijYAneSvarapraBftayaH AhuH. tacca viBAgena pitrAdimaraRAdinEva votpadyata iti vaNgadeSIyAH 132<BR>;p{1050}<BR>jImUtavAhanapraBftayaH AhuH. tatrApi samudAyadravye svatvam iti mitAkzarAkfdAdaya AhuH. pradeSaBede iti vaNgadeSIya AhuH (vIramitro0 a0 2 pf0 521550). atrADikaM ca vIramitrodayajImUtavAhanAdO dfSyam. [Ka] dravyARAM yaTezwakrayavikrayAdikriyAsu viniyojako DarmaviSezaH. sa cAtiriktaH padArTaH na tu yaTezwaviniyogayogyatvarUpaH iti navyAH dIDitikArAdayaH AhuH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 6). tadarTaSca dAnAdinASyaH pratigrahajanyaH saptapadArTAtiriktaH kaScanAnirvAcyaH padArTaH (la0 ma0) iti. tatrAyamASayaH. pratigrahAdinASottaramapi svatvavyavahArAt dAnAditaH svatvaM naSyati pratigrahAditaSca svatvamutpadyate. ata eva nibanDAdO BAvinyapi svatvam. anyaTA pratimAsaM prativarza vA deyatvena pratiSrutasya DAnyAdirUpasya BAvitvena tatra svatvotpattyanupapatteH (lIlAvatIrahasye cUqAmaRiH) (SrIkfzRatarkAlaMkAraH). atastAdfSapratyayavyavahAraprAmARyAnuroDena svatvamatiriktaH padArTaH. tacca svatvaM dAnAdito naSyati pratigrahAditaSca jAyate. tacca bahirindriyayogyam. svaM paSyAmi iti pratIteH. vastutaH svatvasyAnumitireva na tu sAkzAtkAraH (kA0 vyA0 pf0 6) (nIla0) iti. atredaM boDyam. sapta vittAgamA Darmya dAyo lABaH krayo jayaH. prayogaH karmayogaSca satpratigraha eva ca (manu0 10. 115) iti. svatvotpattO sADAraRopAyAstu gOtamenoktAH svAmI rikTakrayasaMviBAgaparigrahADigamezu iti. asADAraRopAyAstu brAhmaRasyADikaM labDam kzatriyasya vijitam nirvizwaM vESyaSUdrayoH (mitA0 a0 2 dAyaBA0) iti. kecittu jImUtavAhanAdayaH pratigraho na svatvajanakaH. api tu yaTezwaviniyogArhatAprayojakaH. taTA ca utpannamapi svatvaM saMpradAnavyApAreRa mamedam iti jYAnena (svIkAreRa) yaTezwavyavahArAhaM 1) kriyate ityAhuH (vIramitro0 a0 2 pf0 542).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1049" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वधर्मः
svaDarmaH — 1 yatkiMcidvyaktivfttipadArTamAtram. yaTA GawavfttirDarmo GawatvAdiH. 2 DarmajYAstu svAnurUpo vedAdyuktaH avigItaH AcArAdiDarmaH. yaTA SreyAn svaDarmo viguRaH paraDarmAtsvanuzWitAt. svaDarme niDanaM SreyaH.<BR>;p{1051}<BR>paraDarmo BayAvahaH.. (gItA a0 3 Slo0 35) ityAdO svaDarmaSabdasyArTa ityAhuH. taduktam yo yasya vihito DarmaH sa tajjAteH prakIrtitaH. tasmAtsvaDarmaM kuryAcca dvijo nityamanApadi.. (vAcaspatye narasiMhapurARam) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1050" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वधा
svaDA — 1 [ka] pitruddeSya katyAgaH. yaTA pitfByaH svaDetyAdO svaDASabdasyArTaH. vedAde SitoccAraRakartftvo palakzitapuruzIyatyAgaH iti PalitorTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4 pf0 100). atra nipAtasvaDAyoge tyAgoddeSyavAcakapadAt namaH svastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca (pARi0 2. 3. 16) ityanena sUtreRa caturTI. [Ka] pitfdevoddeSena havizastyAgaH. yaTA idamannaM pitre svaDA ityAdO svaDASabdArTaH. atra svaDASabdArTatyAgasya vizayatayAnnAdAvanvayaH. tasya svaDASabdasya nipAtatvena tadarTasya BedenAnvayasya vyutpattisidDatvAt. taTA ca pitruddeSyakatyAgavizaya idamannam iti boDaH. [ga] svasvakaraRako havistyAgaH. yaTA idaM pitre svaDA ityAdO svaDASabdasyArTaH. atra pitruddeSyakasya svaDApadakaraRakasya havistyAgasya karmedam ityAkArako boDaH (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 94 wI0 pf0 126). 2 pOrARikAH karmajYASca mAtfkAviSezaH. yaTA namaH svaDAyE svAhAyE (pitfgATA) ityAdO svaDASabdasyArTa ityAhuH. iyaM ca dakzakanyA. brahmaRo mAnasI kanyA ca pitfpatnI. atrADikaM tu brahmavEvarte drazwavyam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1051" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वप्नः
svapnaH — pradeSaviSezAvasTitamanaH saMyogaH (nIla0 gu0 pf0 38) meDyAmanaH saMyogo vA. yaTA na kaMcana svapnaM paSyati (bfha0 u0 4. 3. 19) ityAdO svapraSabdArTaH. yaTA vA svaprajYAnaM mAnasaviparyayaH ityAdO granTe svapnaSabdArTaH. atra pradeSaviSezastu purItadbahirdeSayoH saMDiH. nirindriyAtmapradeSo vA cintyaH. svamajYAnam - (budDipraBedaH avidyA) [ka] jAgradavasTAyAM bAhyavastvanuBavajanyamayaTArTaM smaraRam. tacca nirAkArameva (ta0 BA0 prameyani0 pf0 40). svapne ca sarvameva jYAnaM smaraRam ayaTArTam. dozavaSena<BR>;p{1052}<BR>tat iti sTAne idam ityudayAt. sarvaM jYAnaM nirAkArameva na tu jYAnaM tattadvizayAkAram. sAkArajYAnavAdanirAkaraRAn (ta0 BA0 prameyani0 pf0 40). taTA svapnaH (vE0 927) iti sUtre cetTamuktam. smftO yaTA saMskAraH kAraRaM taTA KapnasaMjYakamAnasajYAnepi ityAha taTA iti. taTA AtmamanaHsaMyogaviSezAt pUrvAnuBavajanitasaMskArAcca svapno mAnasajYAnaviSezo BavatIti. atra saMyoge viSezo meDyAmanaH saMyogAtmakadozaviSizwatvam. ata eva tadAnIM Brama eva Bavati. pUrvAnuBavaScEhiko janmAntarIyo vA (vE0 vi0 9. 2. 7 pf0 409). atredaM boDyam. svamajYAnaM purItadbahirdeSayoH saMDO manasi sTite adfzwaviSezeRa cintAviSezeRa DAtudozeRa vA janyate. tacca mAnasaviparyayentarBavati (si0 ca0 gu0 pf0 34) (ta0 dI0 gu0 pf0 38). svapnajYAnamanuBUtapadArTasmaraRasaMskArakaPapittAdiDAtuSuBASuBAdfzwErjanyate. tacca bADitArTavizayakam (nIla0 gu0 pf0 38) ityanyatroktam. tatra svapnajYAne asamavAyikAraRaM svapnaH. DAtvadfzwAdikaM nimittakAraRam. AtmA samavAyikAraRam iti jYeyam. svapnasya smftirUpatvamuktaM praSastadevAcAryEH atItajYAnapratyavekzaRAtsmftireva iti. uktaM ca vfttikArEH. anuBUtavastusPuraRArTatayA na smaraRAdarTAntaraM svapnajYAnam (vE0 u09. 2. 8 pf0 411) iti. tena yattu nIlakaRWyAM smftirUpatvaM svapnajYAnasya KaRqitam tadBAzyAditAtparyAnAkalanAdeva iti mama BAti. [Ka] nidrAduzwAntaHkaraRajaM jYAnam. [ga] mAnasaviparyayaH (ta0 dI0 gu0 pf0 38) (si0 ca0). [Ga] miTyApratyayapravAhaH (nyA0 lI0 gu0 pf0 31). [Na] sidDABiBUtajYAnam (nyA0 lI0 gu0 (nyA0 pf0 59). [ca] uparatendriyagrAmasya pralInamanaskasyendriyadvAreRa yadanuBavanaM mAnasaM tat. svamajYAnamityamutpadyate. yadA budDipUrvAdAtmanaHSarIrArabDavyApArAdahani KinnAnAM prARinAM niSi viSrAntyarTamAhArapariRAmArTaM vA adfzwakArita prayatnApekzAtmAntaHkaraRasaMbanDajanya kriyAprabanDAdatItamantarhfdaye nirindriyAtmapradeSe niScalaM manastizWati tadA pralInamanaska ityAKyAyate. pralIne ca tasminnuparatendriyagrAmo Bavati.<BR>;p{1053}<BR>tasyAmavasTAyAM prabanDena prARApAnasaMtAnapravfttAvAtmamanaHsaMyogaviSezAtsvApAKyAt saMskArAccendriyadvAreRevAsatsvapi vizayezu pratyakzAkAraM jYAnamutpadyate (praSasta0 gu0 pf0 25). atra ca mAnasaM jYAnaM jYAnalakzaRarUpAlOkikasaMnikarzAdBavati smaraRaM ca saMskArAt iti viSezaH (vE0vi09. 2. 7). tacca svapnajYAnaM triviDam (1) kiMcit saMskArapAwavAt (2) kiMcit DAtUnAM vAtapittaSlezmaRAM dozAt (3) kiMcit DarmADarmarUpAdfzwaviSezAccotpadyate. tatrAdyaM (1) yaTA kAmI krudDo vA yadA yamarTamAdftaScintayansvapiti tadA sEva cintAsaMtatiH pratyakzAkArA saMjAyate (praSasta0 2 pf0 25). yaTA vA purARAdiSravaRajanitasaMskAravaSAjjAyate karRArjunIyaM yudDamidam ityAkAram. dvitIyaM (2) yaTA vAtadozAdAkASagamanavasunDarAparyawana vyAGrAdiBayapalAyanAdIni paSyati. pittopacayadozamahinA vahnipraveSavahnijvAlAliNganakanakaparvata vidyullatAvisPuraRadigdAhAdikaM paSyati. SlezmadozaprAbalyAttu samudrasaMtaraRanadImajjanaDArAsAravarzaRarajataparvatAdi paSyati. tftIyaM (3) yaTA tajjanmAnuBUtezu janmAntarAnuBUtezu vA sidDopaplutAntaHkaraRasya yajjYAnamutpadyate tatra SuBAvedakaM DarmAt gajArohaRaparvatArohaRacCatralABa pAyasaBakzaRarAja saMdarSanAdivizayakam. aDarmAttu tElAByaYjanAnDakUpapatanowrArohaRapaNkamajjanasvavivAhadarSanAdivizayakaM svapnajYAnamutpadyate (vE0 u0 9. 2. 7) iti. sAMKyA mAyAvAdivedAntinaSca saMskAramAtrajanyaH svapnAvasTASabdavAcyo budDervizayAkAraH pariRAmaH svapnaH ityAhuH. svapnasTapadArTavizaye satyatvamiDyAtvAByAM vipratipattiH. tatra svapnadfzwapadArTasya miDyAtvam iti mAyAvAdivedAntinoNgIcakruH. SrutiSca sa yatra prasvapiti ityupakramya na tatra raTA na raTayogA na panTAno Bavanti aTa raTAnTayogAn paTaH sfjate (bfha0 upa0 6. 3. 910) iti. sUtraM ca mAyAmAtraM tu kAtsUryenAnaBivyaktasvarUpatvAt (brahmasU0 a0 3 pA0 2 sU0 3) iti. taTA sUcakaSca hi SruterAcakzate ca tadvidaH (brahmasU0 a0 3 pA0 2 sU0 4) iti. sUcakaSca hi svapno Bavati BavizyatoH sADvasADunoH. taTA hi SrUyate<BR>;p{1054}<BR>yadA karmasu kAmyezu striya svapneBipaSyati. samfdDi tatra jAnIyAttasmisvapnanidarSane (CAndo0 5. 2. 9) iti. taTA puruzaM kfzRaM kfzRadantaM paSyati sa enaM hanti iti. Acakzate ca svapnADyAyavidaH kuYjarArohaRAdIni svapne DanyAni KarayAnAdInyaDanyAni (SArI0 BA0 3. 2. 4) iti. atra SuBASuBasUcakatvaM svapraBedasya matsyapurARAdO (a0 242 savistaramuktam tattatra drazwavyam. dvEtavAdinaH SrI pUrRaprajYAcAryastu svapnasfzwapadArTAnAM satyatvameva. taTA hi svapnepi gajAdidarSanaM yaTArTameva. mAnasavAsanAjanyatvAdgajAdInAm. tezu yadvAhyatvajYAnaM tadviparyaya eva iti prAhuH (pra0 pa0 pf0 5). ayaM BAvaH. ISvaronAdimanogatAMSca saMskArAnupAdAnIkftya svecCAmAtreRa pradarSayati padArTAn. atra SrutiH ya eza suptezu jAgarti kAmaM kAmaM puruzo nirnimARaH iti vijYeyA. na tatra raTA na raTayogAH (bfha0 u0 6. 3. 10) ityAdO tu ISvaraM vinA iti pUrayitvA anvayo yojyaH (maDvaBAzya0 3. 2. 1 - 3) iti. purARe coktam manogatAMSca saMskArAnsvecCayA parameSvaraH. pradarSayati jIvAya sa svapna iti gIyate.. yadanyaTAtvajAgrattvaM sA BrAntistatra tatkftA. anaBivyaktarUpatvAnnAnyasADanajaM Bavet.. (maDvaBAzye brahmARqapu0 3. 2. 3) iti. atra gajAdirUpakAryasyopAdAnaM vAsanA ISvaraH kartA adfzwAdikaM nimittam iti drazwavyam (pra0 pa0 wI0 vedeSa0 pf0 14). svaprAntikam - (budDipraBedaH avidyA) 1 tatkAlotpannAnuBavajanitasaMskArajanyaM jYAnam. tadarTastu svapnAntikaM svapnasyAnte Bavam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1051" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वप्नज्ञानम्
svapnajYAnam — nuBavajasaMskArajam iti yAvat. idaM jYAnaM svapnAvasTAjAtAnuBavajanitasaMskAreRa jAyate. kiMtu smftyAtmakam na mAnasam iti viSezaH (vE0 vi0 9. 2. 8). taTA ca svapnAntikasvapnajYAnayoretAvAn viSezaH. svaprajYAnaM pUrvAnuBavajanitAtsaMskArAdutpadyate. svapnAntikaM tu tatkAlotpannAnuBavaja nitasaMskArAdeva. taduktaM praSastadevAcAryEH atItajYAnapratyavekzaRAt smftireva (vE0 u0 9. 2. 8) iti. atra sUtram<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1054" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वप्नान्तिकम्
svapnAntikam — (vE0 912. 8) iti. tadarTaSca svapnajYAnaM yaTAtmamanaHsaMyogaviSezasaMskAroBayajanyam<BR>;p{1055}<BR>taTA svapnAntikAKyaM jYAnamapi (vE0 vi0 9. 2. 8) iti. svapnAntikaM yadyapyuparatendriyagrAmasya Bavati taTA - pyatItajYAnaprabanDasya pratyavekzaRAtsmftireveti (praSasta0 gu0 pf0 25). 2 kecittu svapnamaDye pramABUtaM yajjYAnam tat svapnAntikam. yaTA SayyAyAM SayAnosmi ityAdi ityAhuH (vE0 u0 9. 2. 8).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1054" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वभावः
svaBAvaH — hetvantarAnapekzo vastuDarmaviSezaH. yaTA svaBAvo duratikramaH agniruzRo jalaM SItaM SItasparSastaTAnilaH. kenedaM citritaM tasmAtsvaBAvAttadvyavasTitiH.. (sarva0 pf0 13 cArvA0) ityAdO svaBAvaSabdasyArTaH. tatra prARisvaBAvastu dviviDaH nisargaH svarUpaM ceti. taduktam bahirhetvenapekzI tu svaBAvoTa prakIrtitaH. nisargaSca svaBAvaSca ityeza Bavati dviDA.. nisargaH sudfQAByAsajanyaH saMskAra ucyate. ajanyastu svataH sidDaH svarUpo BAva ucyate.. (ujjavaladatta 0) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

