स्वरः
svaraH — 1 udAttAnudAttasvaritarUpo varRoccAraRayatnaviSezaH. 2 vyaYjanavarRaBinnA akArAdayo varRAH iti SAbdikA AhuH. ezAmacAmudAttAdisvaravattvAt svarapadABiDeyatA. atra SikzA udAttaScAnudAttaSca svaritaSca svarAstrayaH. hrasvo dIrGaH pluta iti kAlato niyamA aci..<BR>;p{1056}<BR>iti. 3 tAtrikAstu prARAdivAyorvyApAra viSeza ityAhuH. 4 Bizajastu prakupitavAyorvyApAraviSeza ityAhuH (suSrute). 5 gAyakAstu nizAdAdayastanrIkaRWotTA gAnajaDvanaya ityAhuH. te ca svarAH sapta zaqu fzaBagAnDArO maDyamaH paYcamastaTA. DEvataSca nizAdaSca svarAH sapta prakIrtitAH.. (BarataH) (amaraH 1. 7. 1) iti. tatra nizAdAdisvarARAM prARiviSezasvaratulyatA nAradoktA yaTA pahuM rOti mayUro hi vfzo nardati carzaBam. ajA virOti gAnDAraM krOlo nardati maDyamam.. puzpasADAraRe kAle kokilo rOti paYcamam. aSvaSca DEvataM rOti nizAdaM rOti kuYjaraH.. iti (amara0 wI0). svarARAmutpattisTAnAdikaM ca BarataSAstrAdO vijYeyam. 6 kecicCakunajYAstu izwAnizwaPalasUcako. nAsikAnirgato vAyorvyApAraviSeza ityAhuH. 7 maDvAcAryAMstu svaratestu svaraH vizRuH ityAhuH (tEtti0 SikzA0 maDvaBA0 pf0 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वरसः
svarasaH — 1 vivAdaSUnyattram. yaTA Gawatvena Gawo nAsti iti pratyayasya vivAdaSUnyatvam (ga0 caturda0 KaRqana0 pf0 72). atra ca vivAdavizayastu Gawatvena pawo nAsti ityAkArako vyaDikaraRaDarmAvacCinna pratiyogitAkABAvavizayakaH pratyayaH iti boDyam (vyaDi0 aBA0 KaRqana0). 2 svABiprAyaH. yaTA vAkyAdO racanABaNgI viSezarUpaH. 3 Bizajastu kvATaH ityAhuH. atroktaM vEdyake sadyaH kzuRRAdArdradravyAdvastrayatrAdipIqanAt. yo rasastvaBiniryAti svarasaH sa prakIrtitaH.. (vAca0) iti. 4 anye tu SilApizwakalkaviSeza ityAhuH (Sabdara 0) (vAca0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वरुः
