स्वरूपयोग्यत्वम्
svarUpayogyatvam — (janakatvAdikam) tadavacCedakaDarmavattvam. yaTA araRyasTasyApi daRqasya GawaM prati janakatvaM svarUpayogyattram (si0 ca0 1 pf0 20). atra ca araRyasTadaRqasyApi GawakAraRatAyAmavacCedakIBUtadaRqatvavattvAtsvarUpayogyatvarUpaM janakatvaM yujyata iti boDyam. yaTA vA paramARuvfttirUpAdeScakzuravizayatvepi cakzurvizayatvasvarUpayogyatvam. tadarTastu cakzurjanyajYAnavizayatvAvacCedakI BUtaDarmavattvam iti. sa ca Darmotra rUpatvam. tacca paramARuvfttAvapi rUpAdO vartata iti sarvaM susTam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

