स्वरूपसंबन्धः
svarUpasaMbanDaH — saMbanDAntareRa viSizwapratItijananAyogyatvam (ci0 1). yaTA BUtale Gawo nAsti ityAdO GawABAvAderBUtalena saMbanDaH. sa dviviDaH kevalasvarUpaH viSezaRatA ceti. tatrAdyo BAvABAvAnyatarapratiyogikaH. yaTA ADeyatvapratiyogitvAdInAM saMbanDaH. dvitIyastriviDaH dESikaviSezaRatA dikftaviSezaRatA kAlikaviSezaRatA ceti. tatrAdyaScABAvamAtrapratiyogikaH. yaTA BUtalAdinA GawABAvAdInAM saMbanDaH. dvitIyatftIyO tu dikkAlAnuyogikO janyamAtrapratiyogikO ca. yaTA ganDaGawAdInAM saMbanDO dikkAlAByAm iti. imAveva sarvAMDAratAprayojakasaMbanDa iti jegIyete (ta0 dI0 1 kAlani0 pf0 10). atrAhuH. svarUpasaMbanDa ityasya anuyogipratiyogyanyatarasvarUpaH saMbanDaviSezaH ityarTaH. yadvA svarUpasaMbanDo DarmidvayAtmakaH. aTa vA zawpadArTAtiriktaH BAvarUpaH padArTaviSezaH svarUpasaMbanDaH iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वरूपासिद्धः
svarUpAsidDaH — (hetvABAsaH) [ka] yo heturASraye nAvagamyate saH. yaTA sAmAnyamanityaM kftakatvAt ityAdO kftakatvaM svarUpAsidDam. atra kftakatvaM heturASraye sAmAnye nAsti (ta0 BA0 he0 pf0 45). yaTA vA Sabdo guRaScAkzuzattrAt ityAdO cAkzuzatvaM svarUpAsidDam. atra cAkzuzatvaM Sabde pakze nAsti Sabdasya SrAvaRatvAt iti cAkzuzatvaM svarUpAsidDaM Bavati iti jYeyam (ta0 saM0). ayameva hetuH SudDAsidDaH 133<BR>;p{1058}<BR>bahu - ityucyate (si0 ca0 2 0 28). svarUpAsidDaSca SudDAsidDaBAgAsidDaviSezaRAsidDaviSezyAsidDAsamarTaviSezaRAsamarTaviSezyaBedena viDaH (ta0 BA0 pf0 45) (ta0 saM0 2) (si0 ca0 2). svarUpAsidDaScAyamasidDapraBedaH. lakzaRaM tu vakzyamARA svarUpAsidDireva. sA ca hetunizWapakzAvfttitvAdiH svarUpAsidDiSabde dfSyA (si0 ca0). svarUpAsidDaScAyaM kvacit saMdehasizADayizayoraBAvAt sidDasADane antarBavati (vE0 u0 3. 1. 15 pf0 156). [Ka] yo hetuH pakze na vartate sa svarUpAsidDaH. yaTA taptAyaH piRqo vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO DUmo hetuH svarUpAsidDaH. yaTA vA SaSAdiraSvo vizARitvAt ityAdO vizARitvaM hetuH svarUpAsidDaH (pra0 pra0). atra sUtram yasmAdvizARI tasmAdaSvaH (vE0 3. 1. 16) iti. [ga] pakzanizwABAvapratiyogI hetuH. yaTA hfdo dravyaM DUmAt ityAdO DUmaH svarUpAsidDaH (ta0 kO0 2). atra pakze hfde vartamAnaH DUmasyABAvaH tasya pratiyogI DUmo Bavati iti hfdo dravyaM DUmAt ityAdO DUmo hetuH svarUpAsidDaH. svarUpAsidDatvajYAnaM parAmarSapratibanDakam. hfde DUmo nAsti iti jYAne sati dravyatvavyApyaDUmavAn hfdaH iti parAmarSAsaMBavAt. etasya parAmarSasya hfde DUmasaMbanDAvagAhitvAt (ta0 kO0 2) iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1057" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वरूपासिद्धिः
svarUpAsidDiH — (hetudozaH) pakze vyApyatvABimatasyABAvaH. yaTA GawaH pfTivI pawatvAt ityatra GawarUpapakze hetvaBAvaH (nyA0 ma0 2). yaTA vA hfdo dravyaM DUmAt ityAdO hfdanizWo DUmABAvaH svarUpAsidDiH (mu0 2) (gO0 vf0 11218) gO0 vf0 11228) (vE0 vi0 3. 1. 15) (nyA0 bo0) (nyA0 ma0 2 pf0 21). svarUpAsidDiSceyamasidDipraBedaH. BAgAsidDiratrEvAntarBavati (ta0 BA0). atra ca hetvaBAvavatpakzaH hetumadanyaH pakzaH pakzAvfttirhetuH pakze hetvaBAvaH pakzanizWaM hetvaBAvavattvam pakzanizWaM hetumadanyatvam hetunizWaM pakzAvfttitvam hetunizWa pakzavfttitvavadanyatvam hetumannizWaM pakzAnyatvAdikam hetunizWaM pakzanizWABAvapratiyogitvam viSizwahetO pakzAderviSezyABAvavattvAdikam pakzAderhetvasamAnADikaraRaDarmavattvam ityAdayaH svarUpAsidDivyaktayo bADavadUhyAH.<BR>;p{1059}<BR>etAsAM viBAjakaM tu prakftapakzaprakftasADanagrahAviroDino jYAnasya vizayatayA taduBayavESizwyagraha viroDitAvacCedakaM rUpam (dIDi0 2 pf0 217) iti. atredaM vijYeyam svarUpAsidDerhetavaH paYca tarkAH. teca AtmASrayaH anyonyASrayaH saMSayaH cakrakASrayaH anavasTA ceti (tA0 ra0 Slo0 90).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वर्गः
svargaH — 1 [ka] suKaviSezaH (mu0 gu0). yaTA yAgAtsvargo Bavati ityAdO svargaSabdasyArTaH. yaTA vA yajYErizwvA svargatiM prArTayante ityAdO svarUSabdasyArTaH. idaM ca icCAmAtrasADanasADyaM suKam iti vadanti. atrAmnAyate yanna duHKena saMBinnaM na ca grastamanantaram. aBilAzopanItaM ca tatsuKaM svaHpadAspadam.. (SrutiH) iti. atra duHKAsaMBinnatvaM ca svAvacCedakaSarIrAnavacCinnatvam. tena duHKasamAnakAlIne suKe nAtivyAptiH. [Ka] aDarmAnArabDadehAvacCedyasuKam (pa0 ca0). 2 pOrARikAstu devAnAmAvAsasTAnaM lokaviSezaH. taduktaM mahABArate uparizwAcca svarloko yoyaM svariti saMjYitaH. UrDvagaH satpaTaH SaSvaddevayAnacaro mune.. nAtaptatapasaH puMso nAmahAyajYayAjinaH. nAnftA nAstikAScEva tatra gacCanti mudgala.. DarmAtmAno jitAtmAnaH SAntA dAntA vimatsarAH. dAnaDarmaratA lokAH SUrAYcAhavalakzaRAH. tatra gacCanti ityAdi. tatra guRapraSaMsA na Soko na jarA tatra nAyAsaparidevane. IdfSaH sa mune lokaH svakarmaPalahetukaH. na vartayantyAhutiBistenApyamftaBojanAH. taTA divyaSarIrAste na ca vigrahamUrtayaH.. ityAdiH. tatra dozAstu kftasya karmaRastatra Bujyate yatPalaM divi. na cAnyatkriyate karma mUlacCedena Bujyate.. sotra dozo mama matastasyAnte patanaM ca yat (BAra0 va0 a0 260) ityAdayaH. ayaM ca lokaH BUrlokaH BuvarlokaH svarlokaH maharlokaH janalokaH tapolokaH satyalokaYca ityetezu BUrAdizu saptasu lokezUrDvasTastftIya ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वस्ति
svasti — 1 ASIH. yaTA svasti Bavate ityAdO svastyarTaH. atra caturTyarTaH saMbanDaH. tasya svastyarTahitentrayaH. evaM ca BavadIya hitavizayiRI<BR>;p{1060}<BR>madIyecCA iti boDaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4). atra ASISca parahitavizayakecCA na tu svahitavizayakecCA vijYeyA. atra vyAkaraRam asti (su as ktic) iti viBaktipratirUpakamavyayam. svastiSabdayoge kzemAdisaMbanDini caturTI Bavati. 2 kalyARam (kuSalam). yaTA svastyastu mahyam ityAdO svastiSabdasyArTaH (ga0 vyu0 kA 0 4). yaTA vA svastyastu prajAByaH ityAdO svastiSabdasyArTaH. atrAdye caturTyarTaH saMbanDaH. tasya ca kalyARenvayaH (ga0 vyu0 kA0 4). SAbdaboDastu pUrvavajjYeyaH. svastyastu prajABya ityatra prajAnizWaM kuSalam ityarTaH. svastiSabdasya kuSalavAcitvAt. kuSalasyASaMsAsTale tu svastyastu prajAByaH itivat svastyastu prajAnAm ityapi pramARam. ASAsyErDana kuSalAyuzyArTeryoge caturTI vA iti BAgurismfteH ityapi vadanti (Sa0 pra0 Slo0 94 wI0 pf0 126). 3 puRyam. 4 svIkArasUcanam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

