svADyAyaH — 1 aDyayanam (amaraH 2. 7. 47). yaTA svADyAyo japa ityukto vedADyayanakarmaRi (smftiH) ityAdO svADyAyaSabdasyArTaH.<BR>;p{1061}<BR>2 aDyayanakarma AmnAyAdi. yaTA svADyAyoDyetavyaH (SrutiH) ityAdO svADyAyaSabdasyArTaH. 3 arTAnusaMDAnapUrvakamantrajapAdiH iti nAradapaYcarAtravid AhuH. taduktam svADyAyo nAma arTAnusaMDAnapUrvako mantrajapo vEzRavasUktastotrapAWo nAmasaMkIrtanaM tattvapratipAdakaSAstrAByAsaSca (sarva0 saM0 pf0 117 rAmAnu0) iti. 4 praRavagAyatrIpraBftInAmaDyayanaM svADyAyaH (sarva0 saM0 pf0 367 pAta0).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1060" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

