svArasikalakzaRA — (lakzaRA) aDunAtanatAtparyavizayIBUtArTanizWA lakzaRA. yaTA vawe gAvaH Serate ityAdO vawapadasya vawasamIpe lakzaRA. gaNgAyAM GozaH ityAdO Gozapadasya matsyAdO yA lakzaRA sA svArasikI. atra vyutpattiH svasya vaktuH rasaH icCA tadaDInA lakzaRA iti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1061" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=nybj" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वार्थम्
svArTam — 1 (anumAnam) [ka] nyAyAprayojyAnumAnam (nyA0 bo02 pf0 15). atrArTe svArTaSabdasya vyutpattirarTaSca svasyArTaH prayojanaM sADyasaMSayanivfttirUpam yasmAt iti vyutpattyA svIyasaMSayanivfttiprayojanakamanumAnam (nIla0 2 pf0 20) iti. tacca jYAnAtmakam (nyA0 bi0 pari0 2 wI0 pf0 21). vyAptipakzaDarmatAsaMvedanam (nyA0lI0 pf0 59) ityanyatroktam. [Ka] yattu svayameva mahAnasAdO viSizwena pratyakzeRa DUmAyorvyAptiM gfhItvA parvate DUmaM paSyanvahnimanuminoti tatsvArTAnumAnam (ta0 BA0 pf0 11). taccArTajYAnarUpam na tu parArTAnumAnavacCabdarUpam<BR>;p{1062}<BR>. atra BAzyam. anumAnam dviviDam dfzwaM sAmAnyatodfzwaM ca. tatra dfzwam prasidDasADyayoratyantajAtyaBedenumAnam. yaTA gavyetra sAsnAmAtramupalaBya deSAntare sAsnAmAtradarSanAdgOriti pratipattirBavati. prasidDasADyayoratyantajAtiBede liNgAnumeyaDarmasAmAnyAnuvfttitonumAnaM sAmAnyatodfzwam. yaTA karzakavaRigrAjaputrARAM pravftteH sAPalyamupalaBya varRASramiRAmapi dfzwaM prayojanamuddiSya pravartamAnAnAM PalAnumAnamiti. tatra liNgadarSanaM pramARam. pramitiragnijYAnam. aTa vAgnijYAnameva pramARam. pramitiragnO guRadozamADyasTyadarSanam. tatsvaniScitArTamanumAnam (praSasta0 2 gu0 pf0 45) iti. svArTAnumAnasya prayojanaM tu svasyEvAnumiti (ta0 saM0). taTA hi kaScitpuruzaH svayameva BUyodarSanena yatra DUmastatrAgBiH iti mahAnasAdO vyAptiM gfhItvA parvatasamIpaM gatastadgate cAgnO saMdihAnaH parvate vartinImavicCinnamUlAma BraMlihAM DUmaleKAM paSyan DUmadarSanAdudbudDasaMskAro vyAptiM smarati yatra DUmastatrAgniH iti. tadanantaraM vahnivyApyaDUmavAnayaM parvataH iti jYAnamutpadyate. ayameva liNgaparAmarSaH ityucyate. tasmAt parvato vahnimAn iti svasya jYAnamanumitirutpadyate tadetatsvArTAnumAnam (ta0 saM0) (ta0 BA0 pf0 11). 2 svaprayojanam. yaTA manIziRaH svArTamuddiSya prayatante ityAdO svArTaSabdasyArTaH. 3 svABiDeyaH. yaTA svArTakaH svArTaboDakft ityAdO svArTaSabdasyArTaH (Sabda0 ca0). vyavahAraSAstrajYAstu svasvatvakaM DanaM svArTam ityAhuH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=NYBJ&page=1061" target="_blank">PD