02 pf0 22). hetutvaM ca anumitikAraRIBUtaliNgaparAmarSaprayojakaSAbdajYAnajanakasADyAvizayakaSAbdaDIjanakahetuviBaktimacCandatvam. hetutvapratipAdakaviBaktimanyAyAvayavatvaM vA. udAharaRaprayojakajijYAsAjanakaSAbdajYAnajanakanyAyAvayavatvaM vA. atrAyaM BAvaH kvacijjijYAsAnutpAdepi tadyogyatAsattvAnnAvyAptiH. anuktodAharaRasTalepi tAdfSayogyatAsattvAt nyAyAvayava iti padam (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 174). sADyAvizayakajYAnajanakahetupaYcamyantAnumitiparaSabdatvaM vA. atra ayaM na daRqAt daRqasaMyogAjanyadravyatvAt ityAdO pratijYAnigamanayovariRAya sADyA vizaya ityAdi. upanayaviSezavAraRAya hetupaYcamyanta iti padam (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 174). yadvA pratijYAvAkyaDIjanyakAraRAkANkzAnivartakajYAnajanaka hetuviBaktimadvAkyatvam paYcamyantalAkzaRikapadavadanumitiparavAkyatvaM vA. tadarTaSca prakftapakzAnvitasvArTaboDakapadopasTApitaprakftasADyAnvitasvArTaboDakapaYcamyantalAkzaRika padavadavayavatvam<BR>;p{1072}<BR>(dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 176) iti. anye tu anumitihetujYAnakaraRaDUmavattvAt iti SabdajanyajYAnavfttipratijYAdijanyajYAnAvfttijAtiyogijYAnajanakavAkyatvam ityAhuH (ci0 ava0 250 7879). taTAnyatrAnyadapyuktam. prakftapakzAnvitasvArTaboDakapadopasTApitArTAnvitasvArTaboDakanyAyAvayavatvam. atra nigamanavAraRAya upasTApita ityantaM dattam (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 177). svArTaviSizwavESizwyaboDajanakanyAyAvayavatvaM vA. taTA hi ekavAkyatayA hetvarTaviSizwasADyasya vESizwyaM BAsate na punaravayavAntarArTaviSizwasya kasyacit (dIDi0 2 avaya 0 pf0 177) iti. viSizwavESizwyaboDajanakasvArTopasTitijanakanyAyAvayavatvaM vA. viSizwaboDajanakasvArTaviSizwaboDajana kanyAyAvayavatvaM vA (dIDi0 2 avaya0 pf0 177). prakftapakzatAvacCedakA - vacCinnAnvitasvArTaboDajanaka hetu viBaktiGawitatve sati prakftahetutAvacCedakAvacCinnahetuviSizwahetutvavizayitAbahi BUtavizayitASUnyaboDajanakavAkyatvaM vA. atra vizayitAyAM tAdfSavizayitAbahirBUtattraM ca tAdfSavizayitASAliniScayatvasamaniyata pratibanDakatAnavacCedakatvam (ga0 ava0 pratijYAgra0 pf0 42) (hetupranTe0 pf0 50). tadyaTA etadBUmAt iti Sabdavfttyavaya