hetvABAsaH — 1 (hetordozaH) [ka] yasya hi jYAnamanumitipratibanDakam saH (ci0 2 bADa0 pf0 116). atra hetoH hetO vA ABAsaH iti vyutpattyA hetvABAsapadasya hetudozaH ityarTaH. hetvABAsatvaM ca anumitikAraRIBUtABAvapratiyogi (anumitipratibanDaka) yaTArTajYAnavizayatvam. anumitipratibanDakI BUtayaTArTajYAnavizayatvam iti samuditArTaH (ta0 dI0 2). yadvizayakatvena (liNga)jYAnasya anumitiviroDitvaM tattvamiti vA. atredamaDikaM vijYeyam. gadADaryAM dvitIyahetvABAsalakzaRe hfdo vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO prameyatvaviSizwabADasya (prameyatvaviSizwavahnayaBAvavadBadasya) dozatvAnaNgIkArAdalakzyatayA tatrAtivyAptivAraRAya lakzaRaGawakayatpadArTe viSizwAntarAGawitatvaviSezaRam. tatrEva vahnaTaBAvavajjalAdimadvfttijalavadDadAdAvativyAptivAraRAya yatpadArTe viSizwadvayA GawitatvaviSezaRaM ca dattam. tatrEva jAtitvena hfdatvAvagAhijAtimAnvahnayaBAvavAn ityapratibanDakajYAnamAdAyAsaMBavavAraRAya lakzaRaGawakajYAnapadArTe avyApakavizayitASUnyatvaviSezaRamapi dattaM gadADaraBawwAcAryEH iti. idaM ca boDyam. atrAnumitipadamajahatsvArTa lakzaRayA anumititatkaraRAnyataraparam. sADyavyApyahetumAn pakzaH sADyavAn ityAkArAnumitiparaM vA. tena ekatra hetO vyaBicArAdigrahepyanyasya parAmarSAdanumityanutpAdena vyaBicArAt vyAptyAdijYAnenAnyaTAsidDatvAcca vyaBicArAdigrahABAvasyAnumityajanakatvepi na kzatiH (vyaBicArAdO nAvyAptiH) (dIDi0 2 hetvA0 pf0 178). aTa vA jYAyamAnaM sadyadanumitipratibanDakam tattvam (ci0 2 sAmA0 pf0 83) (mu0 2). atra vadanti. yadvizayakaniScayasya viroDivizayitAnyAyakASaH.<BR>;p{1075}<BR>prayuktastaduttaramanumitAvanAhArTamAnasajYAne vA pakzatAvacCedakaviSizwapakze sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwasADyavESizwyAvagAhitvasya sADyatAvacCedakaviSizwasADyanirUpitavyAptiviSizwahetutAvacCedakaviSizwahetumattvAvagAhitvasya ca dvayorvyatirekaH (aBAvaH) tattvam iti. idaM ca sidDAntasidDaM hetudozalakzaRam iti manyante nEyAyikAH. taTA ca lakzaRasamanvayaH. hfdo vahnimAn DUmAt ityAdO vahnaTaBAvaviSizwahfdatvAvacCinnavizayakaniScayAnantaram hfdo vahnimAn vahnivyApyaDUmavAMSca ityAkArakAnumiteH kadA